export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"modelcraft","name":"ModelCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.9","summary":"Isigaba sokuprinta nesi-slicer sethu nokuthumela nge-USB, Klipper, OctoPrint nePrusaLink, ukusika ngeresini nezengezo zamafayela, ukugeleza kwezinto, izengezo zomugqa wefektri nedijithali, ukugoba kwe-NURBS, ukujiyisa nokulinganisa ukuskena, i-AR endaweni nezindlela eziyishumi zomnsalo.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["okusha","izinto ezintsha","amanothi okukhishwa","changelog","0.9","isigaba sokuprinta","ukuprinta nge-3D","thumela kumshini wokuprinta","slicer","cadcraft basic","gcode","usb","klipper","moonraker","octoprint","prusalink","kiri moto","prusaslicer","orcaslicer","bambu","iresini","ukuprinta ngeresini","goo","sl1","ctb","anycubic","ukuhlola ukuvezwa","ukugeleza kwezinto","ikhophi yedijithali","factory floor","plc","conveyor","nurbs","ukugoba","ukujiyisa","ukulinganisa ukuskena","ar","endaweni","izindlela zomnsalo","izinhlelo zokulinganisa","izinguqulo","ukusetha","uhlu","indawo","0.8","0.8.1","inguqulo","izinto ezintsha","render engine","usd","gltf","unreal","nurbs","izindawo","loft","sweep","continuity","g0","g1","g2","zebra","step","iges","ingxoxo","isimo","isikhathi sosuku","isizini","umsizi","impahla esitholwe esithombeni","isithombe","isithombe sesikeshi","hlobisa","hlobisa igumbi","ukusika okuthambekile","ukuhlukanisa","ukuhlola ukuprinta","izinkinga","iphrophathi","izibani","izilimi","amadivayisi okufaka","imigqa yethuluzi","dwg","live"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"ukuprinta-nge-3d","text":"Ukuprinta nge-3D","level":3},{"id":"ukugeleza-kwezinto-ikhophi-yedijithali-nengxenye-yefektri","text":"Ukugeleza kwezinto, Ikhophi yedijithali nengxenye yefektri","level":3},{"id":"izindawo-amamodeli-nokudweba","text":"Izindawo, amamodeli nokudweba","level":3},{"id":"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo","text":"Kuzo zonke izinhlelo","level":2},{"id":"okulungisiwe","text":"Okulungisiwe","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo-eqinisekisiwe","text":"Imikhawulo eqinisekisiwe","level":2},{"id":"ngaphambilini-0-8-no-0-8-1","text":"Ngaphambilini: 0.8 no-0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"okusha-2","text":"Okusha","level":3},{"id":"okulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1","text":"Okulungisiwe ku-0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"akukakahleleki-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akukakahleleki kule nguqulo","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshe ku-ModelCraft 0.9, uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.8.1. Manje i-ModelCraft ifinyelela umshini wokuprinta nefilogo lefektri: ungabeka izinto ebhedini lokuprinta uzithumele ngaphandle kokukhipha, usike ifilamenti noma iresini, futhi uhlele umugqa wokuphatha izinto. Lokhu yi-CadCraft Studio 0.9 nezinhlelo zayo eziyisishiyagalombili; izici eziningi ezintsha ezilandelayo ziyizengezo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuprinta-nge-3d\"\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba sokuprinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba sokuprinta\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi. Engeza izinto ezisemtapweni ebhedini lomshini wokuprinta, uzihlele, ubheke izendlalelo ezisikiwe bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela kumshini wokuprinta\u003C/span\u003E, ngaphandle kokukhipha i-STL. Ingxenye yezengezo ye-3D Print, evulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi ingasuswa njengazo zonke ezinye izengezo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-stage\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-stage\"\u003EBeka izinto ebhedini lokuprinta uzithumele kumshini wokuprinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-slicer yethu yefilamenti.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft basic (ifakiwe, eyashesha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E iyi-slicer kuhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESlicer\u003C/strong\u003E lekhadi: izindonga, izikhumba, ukugcwaliswa, izisekelo nomphetho wokuqala, kumsebenzi ongemuva ukuze ikhasi lihlale lisebenza. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBona izendlalelo\u003C/span\u003E nesilayidi se-\u003Cstrong\u003EUngqimba\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa izendlalelo ngaphambi kokuthumela. Amaphrofayili omshini wokuprinta afana ne-Ender-3 nesitayela se-Prusa MK4 aqukethe i-G-code yawo yokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthumela.\u003C/strong\u003E Nge-USB (i-Chrome noma i-Edge kwikhompyuta, ikhasi livulekile), noma ku-Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint noma PrusaLink kunethiwekhi yakho. Akukho okuxhumayo noma okuthunyelwayo ngaphandle kokuchofoza, futhi ukuthumela kubuza kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEzinye i-slicer.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Kiri:Moto, i-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer ziyizengezo zazo, zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo; zengeze kusuka ekhadini noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E. I-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer zisebenzisa ikhophi yakho efakiwe ye-CadCraft Studio. Ingxenye yezengezo yomshini we-Bambu Lab isika nge-OrcaSlicer yakho namaphrofayili ayo e-P2S futhi idinga i-Studio ekhompyutheni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuprinta ngeresini.\u003C/strong\u003E Izengezo zeresini (zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo) zenza izithombe zezendlalelo zesikrini somshini wakho wokuprinta, nezimbobo zokuphuma komoya nezimbobo ezingaphansi, i-raft nezisekelo, ukubuka kwezendlalelo, nesikhathi, iresini nezindleko. Izengezo zefomethi yefayela zibhala i-Elegoo GOO, i-SL1, i-Chitubox (CBDDLP ne-CTB 2 kuya ku-5) ne-Anycubic (PWMX ne-PWS). Ukuhlolwa kokuvezwa kweresini kwenza ilebhu lokuvezwa okuyisihlanu. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/resin-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/resin-printing\"\u003ESika ukuze uprinte ngomshini weresini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkushintshiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E, amathuluzi okuprinta nokuhlukanisa ukuze uprinte asebenza njengakwi-0.8. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukugeleza-kwezinto-ikhophi-yedijithali-nengxenye-yefektri\"\u003EUkugeleza kwezinto, Ikhophi yedijithali nengxenye yefektri\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zintathu ziyizengezo, zivaliwe kuze kube yilapho uzivula ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ngalinye linosizo lwalo lwalo lapho livulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugeleza kwezinto.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli ebizwa ngokuthi Ukugeleza kwezinto ihlela izinsimbi, izikhungo, izibambi nemizila ye-AGV kumbono we-3D, iqhuba ukulingisa okuqalwe ngembewu, iyidlalise kabusha, futhi ibonise ukuphuma, izikhathi zokulinda nemigqa, nemiphumela iyagcinwa njenge-CSV. Ama-oda angavela kufayela le-CSV. Amaseli ezandla angahlolwa futhi akhishwe. Ukuxhumana kwe-PLC kunemodi ethambile nemodi yangempela ku-Modbus TCP, esebenza kuphela ku-CadCraft Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhophi yedijithali.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifunda ukuhlelwa kokugeleza kwezinto iphinde iqhube i-PLC ethambile kuso, ingaphoqa izinkinga, kunemivivinyo yesitoko, ukuqhathaniswa kokuhlelwa nohlu lwezinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIflowa lefektri.\u003C/strong\u003E Iguqula izikhungo ibe yimishini namaseli, iyifunda ibukeka ngokuqondile noma isuka kwisimuleli, futhi igcina uhlu lomsebenzi kanye ne-OEE elula. Ifunda kuphela: le nguqulo ayikwazi ukubhala emshinini noma ku-PLC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izindawo-amamodeli-nokudweba\"\u003EIzindawo, amamodeli nokudweba\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugoba, ukujiyisa nokusebenza kwe-boolean ku-NURBS.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkalo\u003C/span\u003E inezinto ezithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugoba phakathi kwezinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugoba imiphetho eminingi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujiyisa kube yivolumu eqinile\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-Union, Subtract ne-Intersect, ngayinye inokuphambuka okulinganisiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EIzindawo ezikhululekile (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa izindawo nokuskena.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha imeshi eskenwe usebenzise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa izindawo nokuskena\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFakela izindawo esiqinileni\u003C/span\u003E. Kuwukulinganisa kokuqala, hhayi iphakheji ephelele yokuhlehlisa ukwakheka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxhumana okuphilayo nomklami we-.3dm.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngalunye, kusuka ku-Rhino 8 noma ku-Grasshopper, futhi kudinga i-CadCraft Studio kwikhompyuta efanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EGcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBona imodeli endaweni.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBona endaweni (AR, ifoni)\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E isebenza kufoni ye-Android ene-Chrome. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/ar-on-site\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/ar-on-site\"\u003EBona imodeli endaweni ngefoni ye-Android (AR)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela zomnsalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu oluwehlayo i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindlela zomnsalo\u003C/span\u003E linikeza izindlela eziyishumi zokudweba umnsalo, kuhlanganise ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3-Point\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala, Isikhungo, Ukuphela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi amaningi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izisindo (kg, lb, t, ton) nezinga lokushisa (degrees C, F, K kanye ne-R) ziyaqondwa lapho uthayipha amanani anamayunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo\"\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathiphu okuma.\u003C/strong\u003E Umbhalo ovela uma uhlehlela ezinkinobho nezinhlamvu ezinqunyiwe ungumbhalo weBootstrap tooltip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhadi lethiphu lokuqala elivalekayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhadi lethiphu endaweni yokudweba engenalutho linekhamera encane yokuvala. Lihlala livaliwe, futhi i-command palette ingalibonisa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yamathebhu eskrolwayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Umugqa wamathebhu ephaneli okungafanele usuke uskrola esikhundleni sokunqunywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzihloko zamathebhu.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma kuvulekile idokhumenti, ithebhu yesiphequluli iqala ngegama ledokhumenti, bese kufika ModelCraft kanye ne-CadCraft. Ichashazi lisuka phambili uma idokhumenti ingalondolozwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › Isakhiwo sibamba izakhiwo kuhlu oluwehlayo, nenketho yokusebenzisa isakhiwo kulolu hlelo kuphela kanye nenkinobho yokusetha kabusha isakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwezilimi kuzilungiselelo lulandela amafayela ezilimi aqukethwe yisakhiwo. Ezinye izilimi ngaphandle kwesiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuphilayo nelabhulali.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Live TeamWork ikhombisa izikhasimende eziphilayo namagama, nelabhulali yamaqoqo inikeza ikhasi ngalinye iqoqo lokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulungisiwe\"\u003EOkulungisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDlala\u003C/span\u003E iguqukela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E uma i-animation idlalwa, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyadlala iphinde imise uma i-timeline ivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkwenziwa okungasemaphethelweni kubuyela ku-WebGL uma ikhadi lezithombe lingakwazi ukuqala i-path tracer. Ibhokisi lokubuka okuphilayo lingasabonisa iphutha; lokhu akuhlolwanga kumshini we-Windows nalowo mshayeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodi yangempela ye-Material flow iyaxhuma futhi emva kokuthi uxhumo luphele ngezimpendulo zesimo se-PLC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo-eqinisekisiwe\"\u003EImikhawulo eqinisekisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuprintiwe emshinini wokuprinta wangempela: hhayi ifilamenti, hhayi iresini, hhayi nge-Bambu Connect. Amafayela eresini afundwe kuphela ngabafundi bakwa-CadCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-digital twin ne-Factory floor zihlolwe ngezimuleli nemiphumela eyaziwayo kuphela, kungekho PLC, umugqa noma iprothokholi yangempela. Ziyizisizo zokuhlola, hhayi ukuqinisekiswa kokuphepha. Ifiziksi ihlanganisa amabhokisi kuphela, kuze kube imithwalo eyisishiyagalombili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUxhumo lwe-Rhino ne-Grasshopper alikaze lusebenze ezinhlelweni zangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzilimi ezingeyisiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphambilini-0-8-no-0-8-1\"\u003ENgaphambilini: 0.8 no-0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshe ku-ModelCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) no-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.7. Ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E ingathumela isimo kwenye inhlelo, iphaneli ye-Surfaces yenza izindawo ezibushelelezi ezikhululekile, futhi umsizi oxhumile angasetha isimo sonke ngomusho owodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okusha-2\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkurenda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhetha kwe-Engine.\u003C/strong\u003E I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E inohlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngine\u003C/strong\u003E phezu kwe-Mode. Izinjini zethu ezimbili, i-Fast ne-Path tracer, zizo ezizenzakalelayo futhi zisebenza noma kuphi. Ezinye izinketho zigcina isimo njengephakheji (imodeli njengefayela le-USD, kanye nefayela lezilungiselelo elinamanani afanele ezimpahla, izibani ezivuliwe, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuvezwa kanye nekhamera) ukuze uyithathe kwenye inhlelo. Isithombe esidwetshwe yinye inhlelo sitshela ukuthi yiyiphi inhlelo nenguqulo yayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engines\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engines\"\u003EKhetha ukuthi iyiphi inhlelo ezodweba isithombe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVula kwenye inhlelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwe-Engine lungagcina isimo njengefayela le-USD, efayeleni le-glTF (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E) noma ifoda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (\u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E), kusiphequluli nakwi-CadCraft Studio. Ku-Studio ingaphinde iqale i-usdview noma uhlelo lwekhompyutha ukuze ivule lelo fayela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isimo kwenye inhlelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela kwi-game engine kusuka ku-Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Studio ibhala isimo kwiphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine ihlale isalingana ngesikhathi sokuthumela ngakunye, ngohlangothi lwesisodwa kuphela. Ukuhlela kwakho kuhlala kulayili ongakaze ubhalwe yi-CadCraft. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EThumela isimo ku-game engine\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinjini ezivela ezengezweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Isengezo singangeza injini kuhlu. Eyabhalwe nge-JavaScript idweba esiphequluleni nasku-Studio; eyodwa esebenzisa uhlelo idinga ukuvuma kwakho ku-Studio. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EEngeza injini yokurenda ngesengezo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChaza isimo.\u003C/strong\u003E Tshela umsizi oxhumile ukuthi &quot;intambama, imvula encane, izihlahla zasekwindla, abantu esikhumulweni&quot; futhi i-ModelCraft iyasetha ngesinyathelo esisodwa: ilanga lihamba ngosuku nangesikhathi ukuze izithunzi zilandele, isibhakabhaka siyashintsha, izindawo ezimanzi ziyavela, nezihlahla nabantu bamiswa njengezinto zangempela ku-tags ongazifihla, ongazihambisa noma ongazisusa. Isikhathi sosuku, usuku noma isizini, nesimo sezulu (esicacile, esimpunga, inkungu, imvula encane, imvula, isiphepho) nakho kusebenza ngokwako, futhi isicelo sakamuva siguqula isimo esifanayo. Inkungu ibonakala esithombeni esiphezulu ekhadini lezithombe; ezinye izinjini zibonisa isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya nezindawo ezimanzi. Imvula ayidwetshwa njengemigqa eyehlayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto kusuka esithombeni esisodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Nika i-ModelCraft isithombe sendawo (udonga, ifloro, ilitshe) yona ihlanganisa into ethile: ukukhanya kwesithombe kuyalingana, imiphetho yenziwa ukuthi ihlangane, kanye nemephu yombala, imephu ye-roughness nemephu ye-normal kuyaphenywa esithombeni. Kuwukusebenza kwesithombe kuphela esithombeni sakho, ngaphandle kwemodeli efundisiwe. I-roughness iyisilinganiso. Isithombe esihlanzekile, esisikwele nesiqondile sinikeza ithayili elihle kakhulu; iphethini enamandla njengezitini ingabonisa isithunzi esithambile lapho kuhlanganiswe khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo ezikhululekile.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkalo\u003C/span\u003E yenza amajika e-NURBS nezindawo ezingakanqunywa: amajika adlula emaphointini, loft, ruled, extrude, revolve, ama-sweep phezu kwerelo elingalinye noma amabili, izindawo kunethiwekhi yamajika, ama-patch kusuka emiphethweni emine, match nokuxuba. Yonke imphetho ehlanganyelwe ilinganiswa njenge-G0, G1 noma G2 (igebe, i-engeli, ukushintsha kokugoba) ezindaweni ezingokoqobo, futhi imphetho embi kunalokho owacela ivela ephaneli ye-Problems ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch\u003C/strong\u003E fix. Imigqa ye-Zebra nemibala yokugoba kudwetshwa kusuka ezindaweni ezingokoqobo. Amafayela e-STEP ne-IGES ayaphuma futhi ayangena. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EIzindawo ezikhululekile (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo nezigumbi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsithombe sesikeshi sibe ngumhlaba.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa isithombe sesikeshi…\u003C/span\u003E iguqula isithombe sefoni sesikeshi sesandla ibe yimiphetho emhlabeni ngesilinganiso osisho: iqembu elilodwa, nethegi yombala ngamunye wepeni. Iphepha litholakala futhi liqondiswe ku-khompyutha yakho, futhi akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EModela endaweni yesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlobisa igumbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha ifloro bese usebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlobisa igumbi…\u003C/span\u003E. Impahla yekamelo lokulala, yendawo yokuhlala, yokudlela, yekhishi, yasendlini yokugezela noma yehhovisi ibekwa ngemithetho, eceleni kwezindonga negxile kude nemnyango nezifasteli, iqembu elilodwa ongalisusa ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Kuwukuhlelwa okuzenzakalelayo okuhlolwa nawe, hhayi ukuklama. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/starter\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/starter\"\u003EIlabhulali yokuqala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusika okuthambekile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuhlukanisa ukuze uprinte kungathambekisa ukusika kwayo kuze kube ngamadigri angu-60, okunika izingxenye indawo eningi yokunamathisela. Izixhumanisi zimi zibe ngqo ngokusika. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-split\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-split\"\u003EHlukanisa imodeli ukuze uprinte\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlola kokuprinta kuPhakathi Kwezinkinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Okutholakele ekuhlolweni kokuprinta nge-3D kuvela ephaneli ye-Problems namamaki emodelini, futhi i-Repair iyawalungisa kusuka lapho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003EIzisekelo, ubukhulu bodonga, ukugcwaliswa nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Usizo nezinhlelo kutholakala ngezilimi ezingama-54. Ezilishumi ziyizintsha: isiLithuanian, isiLatvian, isiBosnian, isiMarathi, isiTelugu, isiAlbanian, isiAfrikaans, isiFilipino, isiSwahili kanye nesiUzbek. Izilimi ezingeyisiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini kuze kube yilapho umuntu owazi lo lwimi ezifundile, futhi izihloko zosizo zisengaba yisiNgisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadivayisi okufaka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipadi lokuthinta, ipeni, imawuseni ye-3D, ukhonkolo wegeyimu nezilawuli ze-MIDI zingasebenza nezinhlelo, zonke noma eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yethuluzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › Imigqa yethuluzi isetha i-Wrap (njengangaphambili), imigqa emi-2 noma umugqa oyodwa. Ibha engafanele iskrola ngokuhlangothi esikhundleni sokuthatha isikhala kudwetshwe. I-Wrap ihlala iyinkambiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkholomu yephrophathi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinkambu zezibani ze-ModelCraft zisebenzisa igridi ejwayelekile: izigaba ezingavulwa nokuwa, amakholomu okubhalwa nevelu, kanye ne-Compact density. Ukubalwa okubhaliwe njengo \u003Ccode\u003E2*450\u003C/code\u003E kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli ye-Problems (inkinobho yesexwayiso ebha yohlelo) ihlanganyelwa yizinhlelo zonke. Ku-ModelCraft iqukethe ukuhlola kokuprinta nezexwayiso zokuqhubeka kwendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuphilayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Iseshini ye-Live TeamWork ikhombisa ukuthi ubani usiphi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/work-live\"\u003EModela ndawonye nge-Live TeamWork\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzengezo.\u003C/strong\u003E Izengezo zingangeza izinjini zokurenda, njengalokhu okungenhla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma i-AI yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuxhumana kwezivumelwano zamathuluzi kanye nokuhlolwa kwezinhlelo ezingu-8 kuyadlula, kunamathuluzi angu-454 ngokubonke. Ukuxhuma ngokuchofoza kanye nakwi-Studio, ikhonektha esingiwe yabasizi besiphequluli, ukhiye wakho ngaphakathi kwe-Studio kanye nephakheji eshicilelwe akukaqinisekiswa. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI yazo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003ESebenzisa i-ModelCraft nabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1\"\u003EOkulungisiwe ku-0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba se-DWG classes.\u003C/strong\u003E Isigaba sezigaba zefayela le-DWG sifundwe njengohlobo olungalungile, okungaphula ifayela lapho lingeniswa. Manje sifundwa ngendlela efanele, ku-ModelCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ezifunda i-DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhulethi ngokuma.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuphakama kwegridi okungasetshenziswa kuya endaweni yokudweba, nesakhiwo sephepha siqala ku-760 pixels ububanzi noma ngaphansi kwalokho. Isitayela se-ModelCraft nasso sinalolu shintsho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlimi ku-Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E I-CadCraft Studio namaphakheji anokushicilelwa angashintsha ulimi aphinde ahambe; ngaphambili kwakuyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu akuvivinywanga kuzo zonke izinkundla kodwa sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akukakahleleki-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkukakahleleki kule nguqulo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkusayinwanga ngekhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Windows ingabonisa i-SmartScreen: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi oluningiwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka noma kunjalo\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Mac, cofa ngesokudla bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E. Izakhiwo zesitolo zimisiwe, futhi isakhiwo se-iPad ne-iPhone asizange sakhiwe kabusha ngo-0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkudweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo ngaphandle kwesengezo sesinjini sokurenda, amakhamera epanorama noma we-stereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inhlelo, kanye nepulaki evula isiteji se-Unreal azikakho. Amafayela ayabhalwa; ipulaki akikhishwanga futhi aykaze isebenze ku-Unreal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindawo ezikhululekile: i-G3 nelebhu A akulinganiswa noma kuqinisekiswe, nokusika kanye nezinto eziqinile kuzofika kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithombe zezinhlelo zangaphandle azifani ngokuphelele pixel nge-pixel nezethu: kuhambisana kuphela ikhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulungiswa kwe-0.8.1 kokushintsha ulimi ku-Studio akuvivinywanga kuzo zonke izinkundla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kusencwadini \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E. Ngokukhishwa okwedlule, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EOkusha ku-0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshe ku-ModelCraft 0.9, uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.8.1. Manje i-ModelCraft ifinyelela umshini wokuprinta nefilogo lefektri: ungabeka izinto ebhedini lokuprinta uzithumele ngaphandle kokukhipha, usike ifilamenti noma iresini, futhi uhlele umugqa wokuphatha izinto. Lokhu yi-CadCraft Studio 0.9 nezinhlelo zayo eziyisishiyagalombili; izici eziningi ezintsha ezilandelayo ziyizengezo. Okusha Ukuprinta nge-3D Isigaba sokuprinta. Chofoza Isigaba sokuprinta kwithuluzi. Engeza izinto ezisemtapweni ebhedini lomshini wokuprinta, uzihlele, ubheke izendlalelo ezisikiwe bese ucindezela Thumela kumshini wokuprinta, ngaphandle kokukhipha i-STL. Ingxenye yezengezo ye-3D Print, evulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi ingasuswa njengazo zonke ezinye izengezo. Bona Beka izinto ebhedini lokuprinta uzithumele kumshini wokuprinta. I-slicer yethu yefilamenti. CadCraft basic (ifakiwe, eyashesha kakhulu) iyi-slicer kuhlu lwe-Slicer lekhadi: izindonga, izikhumba, ukugcwaliswa, izisekelo nomphetho wokuqala, kumsebenzi ongemuva ukuze ikhasi lihlale lisebenza. I-Bona izendlalelo nesilayidi se-Ungqimba ikhombisa izendlalelo ngaphambi kokuthumela. Amaphrofayili omshini wokuprinta afana ne-Ender-3 nesitayela se-Prusa MK4 aqukethe i-G-code yawo yokuqala. Ukuthumela. Nge-USB (i-Chrome noma i-Edge kwikhompyuta, ikhasi livulekile), noma ku-Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint noma PrusaLink kunethiwekhi yakho. Akukho okuxhumayo noma okuthunyelwayo ngaphandle kokuchofoza, futhi ukuthumela kubuza kuqala. Ezinye i-slicer. I-Kiri:Moto, i-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer ziyizengezo zazo, zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo; zengeze kusuka ekhadini noma ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. I-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer zisebenzisa ikhophi yakho efakiwe ye-CadCraft Studio. Ingxenye yezengezo yomshini we-Bambu Lab isika nge-OrcaSlicer yakho namaphrofayili ayo e-P2S futhi idinga i-Studio ekhompyutheni. Ukuprinta ngeresini. Izengezo zeresini (zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo) zenza izithombe zezendlalelo zesikrini somshini wakho wokuprinta, nezimbobo zokuphuma komoya nezimbobo ezingaphansi, i-raft nezisekelo, ukubuka kwezendlalelo, nesikhathi, iresini nezindleko. Izengezo zefomethi yefayela zibhala i-Elegoo GOO, i-SL1, i-Chitubox (CBDDLP ne-CTB 2 kuya ku-5) ne-Anycubic (PWMX ne-PWS). Ukuhlolwa kokuvezwa kweresini kwenza ilebhu lokuvezwa okuyisihlanu. Bona Sika ukuze uprinte ngomshini weresini. Akushintshiwe. Ku-Khipha › Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…, amathuluzi okuprinta nokuhlukanisa ukuze uprinte asebenza njengakwi-0.8. Bona Lungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D. Ukugeleza kwezinto, Ikhophi yedijithali nengxenye yefektri Lezi zintathu ziyizengezo, zivaliwe kuze kube yilapho uzivula ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe, futhi ngalinye linosizo lwalo lwalo lapho livulekile. Ukugeleza kwezinto. Iphaneli ebizwa ngokuthi Ukugeleza kwezinto ihlela izinsimbi, izikhungo, izibambi nemizila ye-AGV kumbono we-3D, iqhuba ukulingisa okuqalwe ngembewu, iyidlalise kabusha, futhi ibonise ukuphuma, izikhathi zokulinda nemigqa, nemiphumela iyagcinwa njenge-CSV. Ama-oda angavela kufayela le-CSV. Amaseli ezandla angahlolwa futhi akhishwe. Ukuxhumana kwe-PLC kunemodi ethambile nemodi yangempela ku-Modbus TCP, esebenza kuphela ku-CadCraft Studio. Ikhophi yedijithali. Ifunda ukuhlelwa kokugeleza kwezinto iphinde iqhube i-PLC ethambile kuso, ingaphoqa izinkinga, kunemivivinyo yesitoko, ukuqhathaniswa kokuhlelwa nohlu lwezinto. Iflowa lefektri. Iguqula izikhungo ibe yimishini namaseli, iyifunda ibukeka ngokuqondile noma isuka kwisimuleli, futhi igcina uhlu lomsebenzi kanye ne-OEE elula. Ifunda kuphela: le nguqulo ayikwazi ukubhala emshinini noma ku-PLC. Izindawo, amamodeli nokudweba Ukugoba, ukujiyisa nokusebenza kwe-boolean ku-NURBS. Iphaneli ye-Izinkalo inezinto ezithi Ukugoba phakathi kwezinhlangothi, Ukugoba imiphetho eminingi, Ukujiyisa kube yivolumu eqinile kanye ne-Union, Subtract ne-Intersect, ngayinye inokuphambuka okulinganisiwe. Bona Izindawo ezikhululekile (NURBS). Linganisa izindawo nokuskena. Khetha imeshi eskenwe usebenzise Linganisa izindawo nokuskena eqenjini le-Scan, bese Fakela izindawo esiqinileni. Kuwukulinganisa kokuqala, hhayi iphakheji ephelele yokuhlehlisa ukwakheka. Ukuxhumana okuphilayo nomklami we-.3dm. Ngalunye, kusuka ku-Rhino 8 noma ku-Grasshopper, futhi kudinga i-CadCraft Studio kwikhompyuta efanayo. Bona Gcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila. Bona imodeli endaweni. Bona endaweni (AR, ifoni) kumenyu ye-Ukubuka isebenza kufoni ye-Android ene-Chrome. Bona Bona imodeli endaweni ngefoni ye-Android (AR). Izindlela zomnsalo. Uhlu oluwehlayo i-Izindlela zomnsalo linikeza izindlela eziyishumi zokudweba umnsalo, kuhlanganise ne-3-Point ne-Qala, Isikhungo, Ukuphela. Amayunithi amaningi. Izisindo (kg, lb, t, ton) nezinga lokushisa (degrees C, F, K kanye ne-R) ziyaqondwa lapho uthayipha amanani anamayunithi. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Amathiphu okuma. Umbhalo ovela uma uhlehlela ezinkinobho nezinhlamvu ezinqunyiwe ungumbhalo weBootstrap tooltip. Ikhadi lethiphu lokuqala elivalekayo. Ikhadi lethiphu endaweni yokudweba engenalutho linekhamera encane yokuvala. Lihlala livaliwe, futhi i-command palette ingalibonisa futhi. Imigqa yamathebhu eskrolwayo. Umugqa wamathebhu ephaneli okungafanele usuke uskrola esikhundleni sokunqunywa. Izihloko zamathebhu. Uma kuvulekile idokhumenti, ithebhu yesiphequluli iqala ngegama ledokhumenti, bese kufika ModelCraft kanye ne-CadCraft. Ichashazi lisuka phambili uma idokhumenti ingalondolozwanga. Isakhiwo. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Isakhiwo sibamba izakhiwo kuhlu oluwehlayo, nenketho yokusebenzisa isakhiwo kulolu hlelo kuphela kanye nenkinobho yokusetha kabusha isakhiwo. Izilimi. Uhlu lwezilimi kuzilungiselelo lulandela amafayela ezilimi aqukethwe yisakhiwo. Ezinye izilimi ngaphandle kwesiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini. Okuphilayo nelabhulali. I-Live TeamWork ikhombisa izikhasimende eziphilayo namagama, nelabhulali yamaqoqo inikeza ikhasi ngalinye iqoqo lokuzenzakalelayo. Okulungisiwe Dlala iguqukela ku-Misa uma i-animation idlalwa, futhi Space iyadlala iphinde imise uma i-timeline ivulekile. Okwenziwa okungasemaphethelweni kubuyela ku-WebGL uma ikhadi lezithombe lingakwazi ukuqala i-path tracer. Ibhokisi lokubuka okuphilayo lingasabonisa iphutha; lokhu akuhlolwanga kumshini we-Windows nalowo mshayeli. Imodi yangempela ye-Material flow iyaxhuma futhi emva kokuthi uxhumo luphele ngezimpendulo zesimo se-PLC. Imikhawulo eqinisekisiwe Akukho okuprintiwe emshinini wokuprinta wangempela: hhayi ifilamenti, hhayi iresini, hhayi nge-Bambu Connect. Amafayela eresini afundwe kuphela ngabafundi bakwa-CadCraft. I-digital twin ne-Factory floor zihlolwe ngezimuleli nemiphumela eyaziwayo kuphela, kungekho PLC, umugqa noma iprothokholi yangempela. Ziyizisizo zokuhlola, hhayi ukuqinisekiswa kokuphepha. Ifiziksi ihlanganisa amabhokisi kuphela, kuze kube imithwalo eyisishiyagalombili. Uxhumo lwe-Rhino ne-Grasshopper alikaze lusebenze ezinhlelweni zangempela. Izilimi ezingeyisiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini. Ngaphambilini: 0.8 no-0.8.1 Lokhu yikho okushintshe ku-ModelCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) no-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.7. Ingxoxo ye-Renda isithombe… ingathumela isimo kwenye inhlelo, iphaneli ye-Surfaces yenza izindawo ezibushelelezi ezikhululekile, futhi umsizi oxhumile angasetha isimo sonke ngomusho owodwa. Okusha Ukurenda Ukukhetha kwe-Engine. I-Renda isithombe… inohlu lwe-Engine phezu kwe-Mode. Izinjini zethu ezimbili, i-Fast ne-Path tracer, zizo ezizenzakalelayo futhi zisebenza noma kuphi. Ezinye izinketho zigcina isimo njengephakheji (imodeli njengefayela le-USD, kanye nefayela lezilungiselelo elinamanani afanele ezimpahla, izibani ezivuliwe, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuvezwa kanye nekhamera) ukuze uyithathe kwenye inhlelo. Isithombe esidwetshwe yinye inhlelo sitshela ukuthi yiyiphi inhlelo nenguqulo yayo. Bona Khetha ukuthi iyiphi inhlelo ezodweba isithombe. Vula kwenye inhlelo. Uhlu lwe-Engine lungagcina isimo njengefayela le-USD, efayeleni le-glTF (.glb) noma ifoda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip), kusiphequluli nakwi-CadCraft Studio. Ku-Studio ingaphinde iqale i-usdview noma uhlelo lwekhompyutha ukuze ivule lelo fayela. Bona Vula isimo kwenye inhlelo. Thumela kwi-game engine kusuka ku-Studio. I-Studio ibhala isimo kwiphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine ihlale isalingana ngesikhathi sokuthumela ngakunye, ngohlangothi lwesisodwa kuphela. Ukuhlela kwakho kuhlala kulayili ongakaze ubhalwe yi-CadCraft. Bona Thumela isimo ku-game engine. Izinjini ezivela ezengezweni. Isengezo singangeza injini kuhlu. Eyabhalwe nge-JavaScript idweba esiphequluleni nasku-Studio; eyodwa esebenzisa uhlelo idinga ukuvuma kwakho ku-Studio. Bona Dweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo kanye Engeza injini yokurenda ngesengezo. Chaza isimo. Tshela umsizi oxhumile ukuthi \"intambama, imvula encane, izihlahla zasekwindla, abantu esikhumulweni\" futhi i-ModelCraft iyasetha ngesinyathelo esisodwa: ilanga lihamba ngosuku nangesikhathi ukuze izithunzi zilandele, isibhakabhaka siyashintsha, izindawo ezimanzi ziyavela, nezihlahla nabantu bamiswa njengezinto zangempela ku-tags ongazifihla, ongazihambisa noma ongazisusa. Isikhathi sosuku, usuku noma isizini, nesimo sezulu (esicacile, esimpunga, inkungu, imvula encane, imvula, isiphepho) nakho kusebenza ngokwako, futhi isicelo sakamuva siguqula isimo esifanayo. Inkungu ibonakala esithombeni esiphezulu ekhadini lezithombe; ezinye izinjini zibonisa isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya nezindawo ezimanzi. Imvula ayidwetshwa njengemigqa eyehlayo. Izinto Izinto kusuka esithombeni esisodwa. Nika i-ModelCraft isithombe sendawo (udonga, ifloro, ilitshe) yona ihlanganisa into ethile: ukukhanya kwesithombe kuyalingana, imiphetho yenziwa ukuthi ihlangane, kanye nemephu yombala, imephu ye-roughness nemephu ye-normal kuyaphenywa esithombeni. Kuwukusebenza kwesithombe kuphela esithombeni sakho, ngaphandle kwemodeli efundisiwe. I-roughness iyisilinganiso. Isithombe esihlanzekile, esisikwele nesiqondile sinikeza ithayili elihle kakhulu; iphethini enamandla njengezitini ingabonisa isithunzi esithambile lapho kuhlanganiswe khona. Izindawo Izindawo ezikhululekile. Iphaneli ye-Izinkalo yenza amajika e-NURBS nezindawo ezingakanqunywa: amajika adlula emaphointini, loft, ruled, extrude, revolve, ama-sweep phezu kwerelo elingalinye noma amabili, izindawo kunethiwekhi yamajika, ama-patch kusuka emiphethweni emine, match nokuxuba. Yonke imphetho ehlanganyelwe ilinganiswa njenge-G0, G1 noma G2 (igebe, i-engeli, ukushintsha kokugoba) ezindaweni ezingokoqobo, futhi imphetho embi kunalokho owacela ivela ephaneli ye-Problems ne-Match fix. Imigqa ye-Zebra nemibala yokugoba kudwetshwa kusuka ezindaweni ezingokoqobo. Amafayela e-STEP ne-IGES ayaphuma futhi ayangena. Bona Izindawo ezikhululekile (NURBS). Indawo nezigumbi Isithombe sesikeshi sibe ngumhlaba. Ifayela › Ngenisa isithombe sesikeshi… iguqula isithombe sefoni sesikeshi sesandla ibe yimiphetho emhlabeni ngesilinganiso osisho: iqembu elilodwa, nethegi yombala ngamunye wepeni. Iphepha litholakala futhi liqondiswe ku-khompyutha yakho, futhi akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi. Bona Modela endaweni yesakhiwo. Hlobisa igumbi. Khetha ifloro bese usebenzisa Lungisa › Hlobisa igumbi…. Impahla yekamelo lokulala, yendawo yokuhlala, yokudlela, yekhishi, yasendlini yokugezela noma yehhovisi ibekwa ngemithetho, eceleni kwezindonga negxile kude nemnyango nezifasteli, iqembu elilodwa ongalisusa ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Kuwukuhlelwa okuzenzakalelayo okuhlolwa nawe, hhayi ukuklama. Bona Ilabhulali yokuqala. Ukuprinta nge-3D Ukusika okuthambekile. Ukuhlukanisa ukuze uprinte kungathambekisa ukusika kwayo kuze kube ngamadigri angu-60, okunika izingxenye indawo eningi yokunamathisela. Izixhumanisi zimi zibe ngqo ngokusika. Bona Hlukanisa imodeli ukuze uprinte. Ukuhlola kokuprinta kuPhakathi Kwezinkinga. Okutholakele ekuhlolweni kokuprinta nge-3D kuvela ephaneli ye-Problems namamaki emodelini, futhi i-Repair iyawalungisa kusuka lapho. Bona Izisekelo, ubukhulu bodonga, ukugcwaliswa nokulungisa. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Izilimi. Usizo nezinhlelo kutholakala ngezilimi ezingama-54. Ezilishumi ziyizintsha: isiLithuanian, isiLatvian, isiBosnian, isiMarathi, isiTelugu, isiAlbanian, isiAfrikaans, isiFilipino, isiSwahili kanye nesiUzbek. Izilimi ezingeyisiNgisi ziyizinguqulo zomshini kuze kube yilapho umuntu owazi lo lwimi ezifundile, futhi izihloko zosizo zisengaba yisiNgisi. Amadivayisi okufaka. Ipadi lokuthinta, ipeni, imawuseni ye-3D, ukhonkolo wegeyimu nezilawuli ze-MIDI zingasebenza nezinhlelo, zonke noma eyodwa. Imigqa yethuluzi. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigqa yethuluzi isetha i-Wrap (njengangaphambili), imigqa emi-2 noma umugqa oyodwa. Ibha engafanele iskrola ngokuhlangothi esikhundleni sokuthatha isikhala kudwetshwe. I-Wrap ihlala iyinkambiso. Ikholomu yephrophathi. Izinkambu zezibani ze-ModelCraft zisebenzisa igridi ejwayelekile: izigaba ezingavulwa nokuwa, amakholomu okubhalwa nevelu, kanye ne-Compact density. Ukubalwa okubhaliwe njengo 2*450 kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza. Izinkinga. Iphaneli ye-Problems (inkinobho yesexwayiso ebha yohlelo) ihlanganyelwa yizinhlelo zonke. Ku-ModelCraft iqukethe ukuhlola kokuprinta nezexwayiso zokuqhubeka kwendawo. Okuphilayo. Iseshini ye-Live TeamWork ikhombisa ukuthi ubani usiphi. Bona Modela ndawonye nge-Live TeamWork. Izengezo. Izengezo zingangeza izinjini zokurenda, njengalokhu okungenhla. Xhuma i-AI yakho. Ukuxhumana kwezivumelwano zamathuluzi kanye nokuhlolwa kwezinhlelo ezingu-8 kuyadlula, kunamathuluzi angu-454 ngokubonke. Ukuxhuma ngokuchofoza kanye nakwi-Studio, ikhonektha esingiwe yabasizi besiphequluli, ukhiye wakho ngaphakathi kwe-Studio kanye nephakheji eshicilelwe akukaqinisekiswa. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI yazo. Bona Sebenzisa i-ModelCraft nabasizi be-AI. Okulungisiwe ku-0.8.1 Isigaba se-DWG classes. Isigaba sezigaba zefayela le-DWG sifundwe njengohlobo olungalungile, okungaphula ifayela lapho lingeniswa. Manje sifundwa ngendlela efanele, ku-ModelCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ezifunda i-DWG. Amathebhulethi ngokuma. Ukuphakama kwegridi okungasetshenziswa kuya endaweni yokudweba, nesakhiwo sephepha siqala ku-760 pixels ububanzi noma ngaphansi kwalokho. Isitayela se-ModelCraft nasso sinalolu shintsho. Ulimi ku-Studio. I-CadCraft Studio namaphakheji anokushicilelwa angashintsha ulimi aphinde ahambe; ngaphambili kwakuyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu akuvivinywanga kuzo zonke izinkundla kodwa sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi. Akukakahleleki kule nguqulo Akusayinwanga ngekhodi. I-Windows ingabonisa i-SmartScreen: khetha Ulwazi oluningiwe, bese Qhubeka noma kunjalo. Ku-Mac, cofa ngesokudla bese ukhetha Vula. Izakhiwo zesitolo zimisiwe, futhi isakhiwo se-iPad ne-iPhone asizange sakhiwe kabusha ngo-0.8.1. Ukudweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo ngaphandle kwesengezo sesinjini sokurenda, amakhamera epanorama noma we-stereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inhlelo, kanye nepulaki evula isiteji se-Unreal azikakho. Amafayela ayabhalwa; ipulaki akikhishwanga futhi aykaze isebenze ku-Unreal. Izindawo ezikhululekile: i-G3 nelebhu A akulinganiswa noma kuqinisekiswe, nokusika kanye nezinto eziqinile kuzofika kamuva. Izithombe zezinhlelo zangaphandle azifani ngokuphelele pixel nge-pixel nezethu: kuhambisana kuphela ikhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa. Ukulungiswa kwe-0.8.1 kokushintsha ulimi ku-Studio akuvivinywanga kuzo zonke izinkundla. Konke okunye kusencwadini Akukakhiwa. Ngokukhishwa okwedlule, bona Okusha ku-0.7.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.7 (kwangaphambili)","summary":"Ama-mesh anezinguquli, ukubumba, ama-UV namajika, ukulandelela indlela ku-graphics card nendawo yokurenda, ukubuka okuphilayo kwesikhathi sangempela nama-panorama, izinto zama-node, indawo ye-Animate enamathambo nefiziksi, amafayela e-USD, FBX, STEP nele-.3dm, namathuluzi okuprinta anesitayela sabaqalayo.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["okusha 0.7","inguqulo yangaphambili","amanothi okukhishwa","izinguquko","changelog","0.7","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","mesh","ama-mesh","indawo ye-mesh","izinguquli","indawo yokuhlukaniswa","ugoqo","uv","vula isikhumba","imiphetho","amajika","izinto zamajika","nurbs","bezier","ukubumba","remesh","retopology","hlukanisa","isibalo","ukulandelela indlela","webgpu","indawo yokurenda","uhlu lokurenda","mp4","exr","ukuhlanza isithombe","isibhakabhaka sefiziksi","hdri","ies","ukujula kwenkundla","ukuxuba izibani","umsi","caustics","ukubuka okuphilayo","isikhathi sangempela","hamba","ama-panorama","ukuthengisa","ukushadisa","ama-node","izinto ze-node","ithala lezinto","materialx","ama-decal","ukupeyinta ukuthungwa","ukubhaka","animate","graph editor","clips","izikhiye zesimo","ama-driver","ama-armature","amathambo","skinning","ik","ama-constraint","fiziksi","usd","usdz","gltf","fbx","step","3dm","alembic","ply","acis","amasolidi 3d","ama-supports","ukujula kodonga","gobhoza","lungisa","oqalayo","abasizi","umshini wakho","amayunithi","isiPutukezi"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"ama-mesh","text":"Ama-mesh","level":3},{"id":"ukudweba","text":"Ukudweba","level":3},{"id":"ukurenda","text":"Ukurenda","level":3},{"id":"ukubuka-okuphilayo-nokwethulwa","text":"Ukubuka okuphilayo nokwethulwa","level":3},{"id":"izinto","text":"Izinto","level":3},{"id":"ukunyakaza","text":"Ukunyakaza","level":3},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":3},{"id":"ukuprinta-nge-3d","text":"Ukuprinta nge-3D","level":3},{"id":"abasizi-nomshini-wakho","text":"Abasizi nomshini wakho","level":3},{"id":"okulungisiwe","text":"Okulungisiwe","level":2},{"id":"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo","text":"Kuzo zonke izinhlelo","level":2},{"id":"akukatholakali-kule-nguqulo-okwamanje","text":"Akukatholakali kule nguqulo okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuguquke ku-ModelCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.6. Manje i-ModelCraft imodela ama-mesh kanye nejiyomethri ngokusunduza/ukuhudula, irenda ku-graphics card, futhi inendawo yomsebenzi ngayinye: yikhethe ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele kwe-toolbar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ama-mesh\"\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-mesh.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha iqembu noma ingxenye bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula ibe yimesh\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E: iba yi-mesh, enezinhlangothi zanoma yisiphi isibalo samakhona ezingathwala ama-texture coordinates, ama-normal, imibala nezisindo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula ibe yijiyometri\u003C/span\u003E iyiguqula ibuyele. Ukuhlehlisa ku-mesh kugcina lokho kuphela okushintshwe yisinyathelo ngasinye. Ifayela eliqukethe i-mesh lidinga i-ModelCraft 0.7 ukuze livulwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo ye-Mesh.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza kabili i-mesh, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImesh\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E, ukuhlela amaphoyinti, imiphetho nobuso: amaloop namawindi, ukuhlelwa ngokulinganayo, ukukhishwa, ukungena, ukuchamfer, ukusika i-loop, ukusika ngommese, ukuhlukanisa, ukujikeleza, ukuhlanganisa, ukuhlanganisa okukhethiwe, ukugcwalisa, ukugcwalisa igridi, ukuxhuma nokudonsa, nezilungiselelo zokugcina ezishintshwa ngemva kwalokho ku-panel. Qala ngendiza, ikhyubhu, ibhola, i-torus nokunye. Izinkinobho zokusunduza/ukuhudula nezinkinobho zomklami zombili ziyasebenza. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EHlela i-mesh ku-Mesh workspace\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquli.\u003C/strong\u003E Bonisa, i-array, indawo yokuhlukaniswa, i-bevel, qinisa, i-boolean, ukuthuthela, ukuwelda, ukuncishisa, bushelelezi, i-lattice, ukuphindisa ijika nokuncinza kwenza kube nokubukeka okuhlukile kwemesh ngaphandle kokuyiguqula. Zibeke ngaphezulu komunye, uvule noma uvale ngalinye ngombono nasezithombeni zokurenda, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E enye uma uyifuna ngokuphelele. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EIzinguquli ku-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukaniswa nama-crease.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgoqo\u003C/span\u003E ku-Mesh workspace igcina imiphetho ekhethiwe ibukhali ngaphansi kwendawo yokuhlukaniswa. Ukurenda kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunalawo view, futhi kumesh omkhulu i-view ikhombisa izinga elingaphansi futhi iyakusho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers#subdivision-surface\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\" data-hash=\"subdivision-surface\"\u003EIndawo yokuhlukaniswa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto zamajika.\u003C/strong\u003E Amajika e-Bézier, NURBS namajika amasegimenti aqondile akha ithubhu, ibhande, ukuncipha noma ipuleti eligcwele, nombhalo njengejika. Hlela amaphoyinti awo ku-workspace ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbe yimesh\u003C/span\u003E lapho ukwakheka sekulungile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003EIzinto zamajika\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo ye-UV.\u003C/strong\u003E Maka imiphetho (noma vumela i-ModelCraft ibamake emiphethweni ebukhali), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula isikhumba\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPakisha\u003C/span\u003E, noma phrojekthela ngebhokisi, isilinda, ibhola noma ngombono. I-UV editor ecaleni kwe-3D view ihambisa, ijikisa futhi ishintshe usayizi wezingcezu, futhi ichekha nemibala yokwelula ikhombisa umphumela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/uv\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/uv\"\u003EHlela ama-UV e-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubumba.\u003C/strong\u003E Indawo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubumba\u003C/span\u003E inama-brush okudweba, okubumba, okushelelezayo, okubamba, okuphefumulisayo, ugoqo, ukucindezela, ukulinganisa nemaski, nokubonisa ngaphesheya kwe-X, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E engeza amatriyangili lapho ubumba khona. Uxinzelelo lwepeni luqondisa usayizi namandla webrashi. Isiteleka ngasinye sisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003EBumba i-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakha kabusha nokuhlelwa kabusha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha imesh kabusha\u003C/span\u003E yenza i-mesh yonke kabusha ibe ngama-triangle alinganayo, ivale izimbobo futhi ihlanganise izingcezu ezigqumayo. Ukwakha i-mesh ehlanzekile phezu kwemesh enemininingwane, yikhethe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlelwa kabusha kwe-topology\u003C/span\u003E: amaphoyinti oyinyakazisayo afika phezu kwawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#remesh\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"remesh\"\u003EYakha kabusha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukudweba\"\u003EUkudweba\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlukanisa umphetho noma ijika.\u003C/strong\u003E Ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E limaka izikhala njengoba uhamba emphethweni bese lihlukanisa ngokuchofoza noma ngenombolo othayiphile; ngomphetho, ijika noma isiyingi okukhethiwe, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa…\u003C/span\u003E icela inombolo, ethabuletheni. I-arc noma isiyingi kuhlukaniswa ngama-engeli alinganayo ejika langempela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003EHlukanisa umphetho noma ijika zibe yizingxenye ezilinganayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibalo ku-value box.\u003C/strong\u003E Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;+3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E noma yiliphi ubude, no-\u003Ccode\u003E90/2\u003C/code\u003E ngama-engeli. Isibalo esingenakwenzeka sithi yini engalungile nokuthi kuphi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box#calculations\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\" data-hash=\"calculations\"\u003EIzibalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukurenda\"\u003EUkurenda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulandelela indlela ku-graphics card.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa i-path tracer yayo ye-CadCraft ku-graphics card lapho isiphequluli sine-WebGPU; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi yiyiphi injini esenze kona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E ugcina isithombe, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka\u003C/span\u003E iqhubeka kusuka lapho. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe silandelelwa nge-WebGL, njengakuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkurenda ku-view.\u003C/strong\u003E Indawo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E ilandelela i-view uqobo futhi iqale kabusha lapho uyizungeza noma uyihlela: renda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza ukuze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGxilisa\u003C/span\u003E, setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E. Idinga i-WebGPU. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#render-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"render-in-the-view\"\u003EUkurenda ku-view\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto, izibani nezibhakabhaka.\u003C/strong\u003E Izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu zikhanyisa wonke ubuso nge-OpenPBR material model (ama-coat, ubunwebu, amafilimu amancane, ingilazi enemibala, ukukhanya). Nge-WebGPU kukhona nesibhakabhaka sefiziksi ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmusi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E, namaprofayili wezibani e-IES wabakhiqizi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\"\u003EIzibhakabhaka namaprofayili wokukhanya\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhamera njengeyesithombe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuchayeka kusuka ku-f-stop, ishutha ne-ISO kuzo zonke izindlela; nge-WebGPU futhi ukujula kwenkundla, ukubona okubili, ukulinganisa kwemibala, ama-panorama angu-360° (nasesiteleo) nama-cube maps. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-camera\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-camera\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQeda isithombe ngemva kokurenda.\u003C/strong\u003E Yinika izinga (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEjwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E, ukuqhathanisa, ukukhanya, ukukhanya okuqhakazayo, i-vignette, ithebula lemibala \u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E), xuba isibhakabhaka, ilanga nelungu ngalinye lezibani, bese ubheka izinto zokurenda ngayinye, konke ngaphandle kokurenda futhi. Ukuqhuqha okusele kuhlanzwa ngomhlanzi wesithombe kukhompyutha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#finish-the-picture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"finish-the-picture\"\u003EQeda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#mix-the-lights-after-the-render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"mix-the-lights-after-the-render\"\u003EXuba izibani ngemva kokurenda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela ezengeziwe zokugcina irenda.\u003C/strong\u003E I-PNG engu-16-bit, i-EXR enezingqimba eziningi enazo zonke izinto zokurenda nelungu lezibani, nefayela lokurenda (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccrender\u003C/code\u003E) elivulwa futhi nokuxuba kwalo nokuqeda kwalo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003EGcina isithombe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsi, intuthu namaca.\u003C/strong\u003E Umsi nokufiphala okukhanyiswa yilanga nezibani, nemisebe yokukhanya; ikholomu eyodwa yentuthu noma ifu elilodwa; ama-caustic ngaphansi kwengilazi nezibuko; isampula elizenzakalelayo elimisa ama-pixel asehlanzekile. Kukhadi lezithombe kuphela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#fog-smoke-noise-and-caustics\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"fog-smoke-noise-and-caustics\"\u003EUmsi, intuthu, ukuqhuqha namaca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lokurenda ne-MP4.\u003C/strong\u003E Engeza izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu namagalelo wonke wokunyakaza kuka-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/span\u003E; ziyarenda ngayinye ngemva kwenye futhi uhlu lusinda ukuvalwa kwekhasi. Idinga i-WebGPU. Amavidiyo angagcinwa njenge-MP4 lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation#render-the-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\" data-hash=\"render-the-video\"\u003ERenda ividiyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukubuka-okuphilayo-nokwethulwa\"\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo nokwethulwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela ecaleni kombono, ilandela ukuhlela ngakunye nekhamera: izithunzi zelanga, izinto, izibani nokukhanya okubuyela emadongeni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamba\u003C/span\u003E kuyo, donsa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInyanga\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhambise ilanga, noma uyihambise ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindi entsha\u003C/span\u003E. Isebenzisa i-WebGPU lapho isiphequluli sinayo, uma kungenjalo i-WebGL 2. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlakaza.\u003C/strong\u003E Hlakaza utshani, izimbali, amatshe, izihlahla nabantu ezindaweni noma ngebhulashi, kusuka kwezinto eziyisikhombisa ezintsha nakwelinye ithala; amasethi alondolozwa efayeleni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\"\u003EHlakaza izitshalo, amatshe nabantu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYabelana.\u003C/strong\u003E I-panorama ye-360°, uhambo lwe-panorama onemicibisho phakathi kwezindawo, isibukeli esimi sodwa (ikhasi elilodwa lewebhu elivulwa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi lingalayishi lutho kusuka ku-inthanethi) nevidiyo yendlela yekhamera, konke ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#share-panoramas-tours-a-viewer-a-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"share-panoramas-tours-a-viewer-a-video\"\u003EYabelana\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-VR ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ku-VR\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa imodeli ngezinto zayo, isibhakabhaka, isithunzi selanga, izibani, izinto ezihlakazekile nokukhanya okubuyayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/vr-review#what-it-looks-like\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/vr-review\" data-hash=\"what-it-looks-like\"\u003EKubukeka kanjani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izinto\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezenziwe ngama-node.\u003C/strong\u003E Indawo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkushadisa\u003C/span\u003E yakha izinto zefayela njengamagrafu ama-node: izithombe, umsindo namachekha, amaseli eVoronoi, amagagasi, izitsha, amathayili, izinkuni, imabula, amagradient, ukungcola nokuguguka kwemiphetho, ukusebenza kwemibala, izibalo, amamephu okubumba nawokujwayelekile, ibe yi-OpenPBR material model egcwele. Ukubuka kubonisa ushintsho ngalunye ngesikhathi esifanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003EYenza izinto ngama-node\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthala lezinto nezethi zakho zokuthungwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipaneli ye-Shading ibala izinto zethala: amasethi okuthungwa angu-16 e-CC0, ngalinye linekhredithi. Chofoza okukodwa ukuze uyisebenzise, noma uyidonse ebusweni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithombe noma i-zip…\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfolda…\u003C/span\u003E yenza impahla kumamephu akho, ithole ngamagama amafayela awo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materials-from-the-library\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materials-from-the-library\"\u003EIzinto ezivela ethaleni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterialX ngaphakathi nangaphandle.\u003C/strong\u003E Khipha impahla njenge-MaterialX (OpenPBR Surface noma Standard Surface, izithungo njenge-PNG), futhi ungenise amafayela e-MaterialX nezithombe zawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materialx\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-decal nokupeyinta ukuthungwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Beka isithombe ebusweni njenge-decal nempahla yayo, bese upeyinta isithombe sempahla ngebhulashi elizungezayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#decals\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"decals\"\u003EAma-decal\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#paint-on-the-texture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"paint-on-the-texture\"\u003EPeyinta ukuthungwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubhaka ukuthungwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Bhaka ukuvinjelwa kokukhanya okuzungezile, ugoqo, ukukhanya nezinormali zento eyinemininingwane ibe yizithombe ezihambisana ne-UV ye-mesh, ngamaprosesa ekhompyutha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#bake-textures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"bake-textures\"\u003EBhaka ukuthungwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukunyakaza\"\u003EUkunyakaza\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo ye-Animate.\u003C/strong\u003E Bamba indawo, ukujikeleza nosayizi wento, ukukhanya, ukusakazeka nombala kwelungu ngalinye lezibani, nenguqulo yelensi, ngqo kupanele. Isikhathi sinebuka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmajika\u003C/span\u003E (izibambi ze-Bézier, okuphindwayo) nebuka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaklipu\u003C/span\u003E ogcina izikhiye njengezenzo ukuze uzibeke futhi uzixube; izikhiye ezingaphezu kwesisodwa zingahanjiswa, zelulwe, zikopishwe futhi zinamathiselwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003EYenza noma yiyiphi impahla ibe yanyakazayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhiye zesimo nama-driver.\u003C/strong\u003E Imesh iba nezinye izimo zayo, exutshwe ngamaslayida angabanjwa, noma ibekwe ezinanini ezinye ngesisho esincane. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#shape-keys-morphs\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"shape-keys-morphs\"\u003EIzikhiye zesimo\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#drivers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"drivers\"\u003EAma-driver\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-armature.\u003C/strong\u003E Faka amathambo ku-mesh, vumela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzisindo ezizenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E zabelane ngamaphoyinti phakathi kwawo noma upeyinte izisindo, bese umisa futhi ubambe amathambo; ukuqoshwa kwemigqa noma kwe-dual quaternion. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#armatures-bones-that-bend-a-mesh\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"armatures-bones-that-bend-a-mesh\"\u003EAma-armature\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIK nama-constraint.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukufinyelela (IK) nomgoqo, bheka, kopisha ukuguqulwa, imikhawulo, ingane yomzila nokulandela umzila, kumathambo nezinto. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#ik-and-constraints\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"ik-and-constraints\"\u003EIK nama-constraint\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFiziksi.\u003C/strong\u003E Amaqembu nezingxenye ziyawela, ziyasikwa futhi ziyashaya njengamabhokisi noma amabhola, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBhaka fiziksi\u003C/span\u003E igcina umphumela njengezikhiye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#physics-drop-stack-and-collide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"physics-drop-stack-and-collide\"\u003EFiziksi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUSD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) igcina imodeli njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, nefayela le-USD eyigcine i-ModelCraft livula futhi lingaphuli lutho. I-USD evela kwezinye izinhlelo ivula noma iyangeniswa njengama-mesh, amaqembu, izingxenye, izibani nezikhamera. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ibhala futhi \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EGcina, vula nekhiphe i-USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF, ephelele.\u003C/strong\u003E Amafayela e-glTF angena njengama-mesh ahlelekayo nama-normal, ama-UV, imibala yamaphoyinti nezithungo, ama-node njengamaqembu, izibani njengezibani nezikhamera njengemiboniso, kubandakanya namafayela e-Draco nemeshopt; i-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E ivulwa uma yehliswa ndawonye namafayela ayo. Ukukhipha kubhala ama-mesh, izithungo, izibani nezikhamera. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#gltf-glb-gltf\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"gltf-glb-gltf\"\u003EglTF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungenisiwe kwe-FBX, PLY, STL ne-Alembic.\u003C/strong\u003E I-FBX 2011 nezinhlobo ezintsha (ama-mesh, amasethi e-UV, izinto, izithungo ezifakiwe, izibani, izikhamera), i-PLY ne-STL ngemibala yazo, nama-cache e-Alembic ngesampula lawo lokuqala. I-OBJ ingena ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E nezithombe zayo uma uzidonsa ndawonye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkukhishwayo okwengeziwe.\u003C/strong\u003E I-PLY ngemibala, i-STL ngemibala yobuso obupeyintiwe, ne-OBJ nezithungo zayo njengefayela le-zip. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-STEP.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E ifunda izingxenye nezinhlanganisela ze-STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) njengama-mesh avaliwe ngosayizi wazo wangempela, yonke ingxenye lapho ifayela liyibeka khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#step-step-stp\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"step-step-stp\"\u003ESTEP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-.3dm.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E ifunda amamodeli e-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E: ama-mesh, ama-polysurface nokukhishwa (kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe efayeleni, noma yenziwe ama-tessellate yi-ModelCraft), amajika njengemiphetho, amabhulokhi njengezingxenye namashidi njengamathegi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolidi e-3D kusuka ku-DWG ne-DXF.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukungenisa umdwebo manje kuletha namasolidi wawo e-3D, izifunda nemizimba, ngalinye njengeqembu layo, ezivaliwe njengamasolidi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan#what-comes-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\" data-hash=\"what-comes-in\"\u003EModel esitebeleni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuprinta-nge-3d\"\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi okuprinta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi okuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E unesikhombisi se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kangaphambili kwezisekelo\u003C/span\u003E (ukuphuphuma, amakholomu noma izisekelo zesihlahla, cishe ukuthi kuzosetshenziswa kangakanani ukuthambo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula kodonga\u003C/span\u003E (izindonga ezincane kakhulu ukuthi zingaprintwa, ezibhalwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/span\u003E (izindonga zobukhulu obunikezwayo, namakhomba okukhipha amanzi) no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E (zonke izilungiso zibhalwe; izingxenye ezigqumayo zihlanganisa kuphela uma uzicela). I-Gobhoza nakho i-Lungisa zinikeza iqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezilingene ziyizinhlangothi ezingasile, noma imesh uma umphumela ungavaleki noma unezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu; umugqa wesimo uthi yiyiphi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003EIzisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela sabaqalayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOqalayo\u003C/span\u003E: izinkinobho ezinkulu zokuwisa izimo nemingxumo, ukuhambisa, ukuhlanganisa nokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/span\u003E ukuze izimbobo zisikwe, bese uhlola imodeli ukuze iprintwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EIsitayela sabaQalayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"abasizi-nomshini-wakho\"\u003EAbasizi nomshini wakho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbasizi abengeziwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Umsizi manje angabhala izinto nezinto ezingaphezulu, sunduza/hudula, peyinta, enze amaqembu, engeze futhi akhombise imiboniso, engeze ama-mesh, ahlele izitaki zezinguquli, akhiphe i-USD, arenda isithombe futhi agcwalise uhlu lokurenda. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003ESebenzisa i-ModelCraft nabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmshini wakho.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkurenda\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmshini wakho\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ukubonakala, amaprosesa nememori esiphequluli esivumela i-app ukuthi isebenzise, nezinga elisetha lapho ukubuka okuphilayo kuqala khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003EUmshini wakho urenda ngani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulungisiwe\"\u003EOkulungisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlangana\u003C/span\u003E bekungabuyisa iqembu elingavaliwe, nganoma yisiphi usayizi. Manje ziyavala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E bekungasebenzi ngaphandle kokukhethwa, nakuba ikhetha izingxenye zayo ezimbili ngokulandelana ngemva kokuyikhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphakathi kwe-animation timeline, okhiye abathayiphiwe babengaqondi lapho, kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lapho yizinto zesikhathi ezizihlehlisayo/ziphindayo zona; ezinye izinkinobho ze-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ziyafinyelela ku-app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo\"\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E unohlu olulodwa ngalinye lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, nosayizi abanikezwa yizichazo zamayunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi nawo ahamba ezinhlwini zamayunithi, bese uwamaka ngenkanyezi ukuze umsebenzi omusha uqale kuwo. Ifayela lihlala linayo iyunithi yalo. Ku-ModelCraft uhlu lwamayunithi ecaleni kwe-value box lulandela iswitshi (iyunithi yemodeli ihlala ikhona), inkanyezi isetha iyunithi yemodeli emisha (uma i-ModelCraft inayo leyo yunithi), futhi ubude obuthayiphwe ngophawu lanoma yiyiphi iyunithi lufundwa ngaleyo yunithi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EAmayunithi, amanani athayiphwayo nezinhlu zamayunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubonakala okuminyene nezinhlaka ezizicashele.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E kulungisa okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nama-fonti abuyisa izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Ibha yesihloko ngasinye sepaneli iyincane: yidonse ukuze uyifake noma uyiphume, uyilahle ebhalweni lenye ipaneli ukuze wabelane ngerimu njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze iphume ngaphandle kohlangothi, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisa emaphethelweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxoxo ziyanyakaza.\u003C/strong\u003E Donsa ingxoxo ngebha yayo yesihloko ukuze ihambe ngaphandle komdwebo; ibuyela lapho wayishiya khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze ibuyele maphakathi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlanza umdwebo, hlela isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, ubale i-takeoff, zama ukuhluka kwengxenye…), ngayinye namathuluzi ayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye iyaphinda ihlolwe yizivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIzindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003Eisha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlimi\u003C/span\u003E. Yona, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E manje sekunawo wonke amagama ezinhlelweni, njengemisebenzi engakabuyekezwa yisikhulumi sendabuko. Amasihloko osizo asolwimini lwesiNgisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E ichaza ukuthi ukubuyekeza kwehlulekile kungani (akukho ifayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isignesha embi) esikhundleni sokuthi &quot;Kwenziwe&quot;, futhi ayiphindi ibuyise ikhadi lakho elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E ayilivalile size kube nokukhishwa okusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukatholakali-kule-nguqulo-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukatholakali kule nguqulo okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 ayisayinwanga ngekhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusayina nephakheji ye-Microsoft Store kudlulele ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eseceleni kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa umfakeli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi olwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhuba noma kunjalo\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngokwesokudla ku-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi akukakabi ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwama-engeli nokuthambeka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E luyagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elilufundayo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkurenda ku-graphics card (WebGPU) kuhlolwe lapha nge-software stand-in kuphela, akukahlolwa ku-graphics card yangempela, ngakho renda okuncane kukhompyutha yakho kuqala. Okufanayo kubukeka okuphilayo, nevR isahlolwe nge-emulator ye-headset kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphandle kwe-WebGPU akukho indawo yokurenda noma uhlu lokurenda, futhi izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu azinayo ukujula kwenkundla, isibhakabhaka sefiziksi, isithombe sesibhakabhaka, umsi, intuthu, ama-caustic noma ukuxuba izibani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E ayikadwetshi izinto ezihlakazekile okwamanje; zibonakala ku-live view, kuma-panorama, kubukeli nasevidiyweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzibani zinyakaza ku-view, kodwa ividiyo eyenziwe isebenzisa izibani njengoba zinjalo lapho iqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-bone nokunyakaza akufundwa noma kubhalwa kumafayela e-glTF, FBX noma USD okwamanje (amamodeli anesikhumba angena esimweni sokuphumula, nezisindo zawo), futhi izinto ze-glTF ne-FBX ngaphezu kombala oyisisekelo noma ithekisha azigcinwa okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImibala ye-STEP namagama ezingxenye zokuhlanganisa akufundwa okwamanje. Ukungenisa kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E kuhlolwe ngamafayela abhalwe ngethuluzi lefomethi, akukahlolwa ngamafayela avela ohlelweni lokumodela uqobo; izinto ze-SubD, umbhalo nezilinganiso azifakiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthala lezitshalo elivela ku-CivilCraft likhona ku-ModelCraft, kodwa ukubeka izitshalo kuwo akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkupeyinta ukuthungwa ebusweni bokusunduza/ukuhudula kuphindwa ngethayili yempahla; ukuze upeyinte ubuso obubodwa kuphela, guqula libe yi-mesh bese uyivula isikhumba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kusechazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu kuguquke ku-ModelCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa no-0.6. Manje i-ModelCraft imodela ama-mesh kanye nejiyomethri ngokusunduza/ukuhudula, irenda ku-graphics card, futhi inendawo yomsebenzi ngayinye: yikhethe ohlwini lwe-Indawo yokusebenza ngakwesobunxele kwe-toolbar. Okusha Ama-mesh Ama-mesh. Khetha iqembu noma ingxenye bese uchofoza Guqula ibe yimesh ku-Ulwazi lwento: iba yi-mesh, enezinhlangothi zanoma yisiphi isibalo samakhona ezingathwala ama-texture coordinates, ama-normal, imibala nezisindo. Guqula ibe yijiyometri iyiguqula ibuyele. Ukuhlehlisa ku-mesh kugcina lokho kuphela okushintshwe yisinyathelo ngasinye. Ifayela eliqukethe i-mesh lidinga i-ModelCraft 0.7 ukuze livulwe. Bona Ama-mesh. Indawo ye-Mesh. Chofoza kabili i-mesh, noma khetha Imesh ohlwini lwe-Indawo yokusebenza, ukuhlela amaphoyinti, imiphetho nobuso: amaloop namawindi, ukuhlelwa ngokulinganayo, ukukhishwa, ukungena, ukuchamfer, ukusika i-loop, ukusika ngommese, ukuhlukanisa, ukujikeleza, ukuhlanganisa, ukuhlanganisa okukhethiwe, ukugcwalisa, ukugcwalisa igridi, ukuxhuma nokudonsa, nezilungiselelo zokugcina ezishintshwa ngemva kwalokho ku-panel. Qala ngendiza, ikhyubhu, ibhola, i-torus nokunye. Izinkinobho zokusunduza/ukuhudula nezinkinobho zomklami zombili ziyasebenza. Bona Hlela i-mesh ku-Mesh workspace. Izinguquli. Bonisa, i-array, indawo yokuhlukaniswa, i-bevel, qinisa, i-boolean, ukuthuthela, ukuwelda, ukuncishisa, bushelelezi, i-lattice, ukuphindisa ijika nokuncinza kwenza kube nokubukeka okuhlukile kwemesh ngaphandle kokuyiguqula. Zibeke ngaphezulu komunye, uvule noma uvale ngalinye ngombono nasezithombeni zokurenda, bese Sebenzisa enye uma uyifuna ngokuphelele. Bona Izinguquli ku-mesh. Ukuhlukaniswa nama-crease. Ugoqo ku-Mesh workspace igcina imiphetho ekhethiwe ibukhali ngaphansi kwendawo yokuhlukaniswa. Ukurenda kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunalawo view, futhi kumesh omkhulu i-view ikhombisa izinga elingaphansi futhi iyakusho. Bona Indawo yokuhlukaniswa. Izinto zamajika. Amajika e-Bézier, NURBS namajika amasegimenti aqondile akha ithubhu, ibhande, ukuncipha noma ipuleti eligcwele, nombhalo njengejika. Hlela amaphoyinti awo ku-workspace ye-Ijika; Ibe yimesh lapho ukwakheka sekulungile. Bona Izinto zamajika. Indawo ye-UV. Maka imiphetho (noma vumela i-ModelCraft ibamake emiphethweni ebukhali), Vula isikhumba ne-Pakisha, noma phrojekthela ngebhokisi, isilinda, ibhola noma ngombono. I-UV editor ecaleni kwe-3D view ihambisa, ijikisa futhi ishintshe usayizi wezingcezu, futhi ichekha nemibala yokwelula ikhombisa umphumela. Bona Hlela ama-UV e-mesh. Ukubumba. Indawo ye-Ukubumba inama-brush okudweba, okubumba, okushelelezayo, okubamba, okuphefumulisayo, ugoqo, ukucindezela, ukulinganisa nemaski, nokubonisa ngaphesheya kwe-X, ne-Imininingwane engeza amatriyangili lapho ubumba khona. Uxinzelelo lwepeni luqondisa usayizi namandla webrashi. Isiteleka ngasinye sisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona Bumba i-mesh. Ukwakha kabusha nokuhlelwa kabusha. Yakha imesh kabusha yenza i-mesh yonke kabusha ibe ngama-triangle alinganayo, ivale izimbobo futhi ihlanganise izingcezu ezigqumayo. Ukwakha i-mesh ehlanzekile phezu kwemesh enemininingwane, yikhethe ngaphansi kwe-Ukuhlelwa kabusha kwe-topology: amaphoyinti oyinyakazisayo afika phezu kwawo. Bona Yakha kabusha. Ukudweba Hlukanisa umphetho noma ijika. Ithuluzi le-Hlukanisa limaka izikhala njengoba uhamba emphethweni bese lihlukanisa ngokuchofoza noma ngenombolo othayiphile; ngomphetho, ijika noma isiyingi okukhethiwe, thayipha /5; Ulwazi lwento › Hlukanisa… icela inombolo, ethabuletheni. I-arc noma isiyingi kuhlukaniswa ngama-engeli alinganayo ejika langempela. Bona Hlukanisa umphetho noma ijika zibe yizingxenye ezilinganayo. Izibalo ku-value box. Thayipha 2.5/3, 12'6\"+3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 noma 2*450mm noma yiliphi ubude, no-90/2 ngama-engeli. Isibalo esingenakwenzeka sithi yini engalungile nokuthi kuphi. Bona Izibalo. Ukurenda Ukulandelela indlela ku-graphics card. Renda isithombe… › Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) isebenzisa i-path tracer yayo ye-CadCraft ku-graphics card lapho isiphequluli sine-WebGPU; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi yiyiphi injini esenze kona. Misa ugcina isithombe, bese Qhubeka iqhubeka kusuka lapho. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe silandelelwa nge-WebGL, njengakuqala. Bona Ikhwalithi ephezulu. Ukurenda ku-view. Indawo ye-Renda ilandelela i-view uqobo futhi iqale kabusha lapho uyizungeza noma uyihlela: renda Indawo, chofoza ukuze Gxilisa, setha Imininingwane. Idinga i-WebGPU. Bona Ukurenda ku-view. Izinto, izibani nezibhakabhaka. Izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu zikhanyisa wonke ubuso nge-OpenPBR material model (ama-coat, ubunwebu, amafilimu amancane, ingilazi enemibala, ukukhanya). Nge-WebGPU kukhona nesibhakabhaka sefiziksi ne-Umusi, Isithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI), namaprofayili wezibani e-IES wabakhiqizi. Bona Izibhakabhaka namaprofayili wokukhanya. Ikhamera njengeyesithombe. Ukuchayeka kusuka ku-f-stop, ishutha ne-ISO kuzo zonke izindlela; nge-WebGPU futhi ukujula kwenkundla, ukubona okubili, ukulinganisa kwemibala, ama-panorama angu-360° (nasesiteleo) nama-cube maps. Bona Ikhamera. Qeda isithombe ngemva kokurenda. Yinika izinga (ACES filmic, AgX, Filmic noma Ejwayelekile, ukuqhathanisa, ukukhanya, ukukhanya okuqhakazayo, i-vignette, ithebula lemibala .cube), xuba isibhakabhaka, ilanga nelungu ngalinye lezibani, bese ubheka izinto zokurenda ngayinye, konke ngaphandle kokurenda futhi. Ukuqhuqha okusele kuhlanzwa ngomhlanzi wesithombe kukhompyutha yakho. Bona Qeda isithombe no Xuba izibani ngemva kokurenda. Izindlela ezengeziwe zokugcina irenda. I-PNG engu-16-bit, i-EXR enezingqimba eziningi enazo zonke izinto zokurenda nelungu lezibani, nefayela lokurenda (.ccrender) elivulwa futhi nokuxuba kwalo nokuqeda kwalo. Bona Gcina isithombe. Umsi, intuthu namaca. Umsi nokufiphala okukhanyiswa yilanga nezibani, nemisebe yokukhanya; ikholomu eyodwa yentuthu noma ifu elilodwa; ama-caustic ngaphansi kwengilazi nezibuko; isampula elizenzakalelayo elimisa ama-pixel asehlanzekile. Kukhadi lezithombe kuphela. Bona Umsi, intuthu, ukuqhuqha namaca. Uhlu lokurenda ne-MP4. Engeza izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu namagalelo wonke wokunyakaza kuka-Uhlu lokurenda; ziyarenda ngayinye ngemva kwenye futhi uhlu lusinda ukuvalwa kwekhasi. Idinga i-WebGPU. Amavidiyo angagcinwa njenge-MP4 lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona. Bona Uhlu lokurenda no Renda ividiyo. Ukubuka okuphilayo nokwethulwa Ukubuka okuphilayo. Khipha › Ukubuka okuphilayo ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela ecaleni kombono, ilandela ukuhlela ngakunye nekhamera: izithunzi zelanga, izinto, izibani nokukhanya okubuyela emadongeni. Hamba kuyo, donsa Isikhathi no-Inyanga ukuze uhambise ilanga, noma uyihambise ku-Windi entsha. Isebenzisa i-WebGPU lapho isiphequluli sinayo, uma kungenjalo i-WebGL 2. Bona Ukubuka okuphilayo. Ukuhlakaza. Hlakaza utshani, izimbali, amatshe, izihlahla nabantu ezindaweni noma ngebhulashi, kusuka kwezinto eziyisikhombisa ezintsha nakwelinye ithala; amasethi alondolozwa efayeleni. Bona Hlakaza izitshalo, amatshe nabantu. Yabelana. I-panorama ye-360°, uhambo lwe-panorama onemicibisho phakathi kwezindawo, isibukeli esimi sodwa (ikhasi elilodwa lewebhu elivulwa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi lingalayishi lutho kusuka ku-inthanethi) nevidiyo yendlela yekhamera, konke ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela. Bona Yabelana. I-VR ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela. Hlola ku-VR ibonisa imodeli ngezinto zayo, isibhakabhaka, isithunzi selanga, izibani, izinto ezihlakazekile nokukhanya okubuyayo. Bona Kubukeka kanjani. Izinto Izinto ezenziwe ngama-node. Indawo ye-Ukushadisa yakha izinto zefayela njengamagrafu ama-node: izithombe, umsindo namachekha, amaseli eVoronoi, amagagasi, izitsha, amathayili, izinkuni, imabula, amagradient, ukungcola nokuguguka kwemiphetho, ukusebenza kwemibala, izibalo, amamephu okubumba nawokujwayelekile, ibe yi-OpenPBR material model egcwele. Ukubuka kubonisa ushintsho ngalunye ngesikhathi esifanayo. Bona Yenza izinto ngama-node. Ithala lezinto nezethi zakho zokuthungwa. Ipaneli ye-Shading ibala izinto zethala: amasethi okuthungwa angu-16 e-CC0, ngalinye linekhredithi. Chofoza okukodwa ukuze uyisebenzise, noma uyidonse ebusweni. Izithombe noma i-zip… noma Ifolda… yenza impahla kumamephu akho, ithole ngamagama amafayela awo. Bona Izinto ezivela ethaleni. MaterialX ngaphakathi nangaphandle. Khipha impahla njenge-MaterialX (OpenPBR Surface noma Standard Surface, izithungo njenge-PNG), futhi ungenise amafayela e-MaterialX nezithombe zawo. Bona MaterialX. Ama-decal nokupeyinta ukuthungwa. Beka isithombe ebusweni njenge-decal nempahla yayo, bese upeyinta isithombe sempahla ngebhulashi elizungezayo. Bona Ama-decal no Peyinta ukuthungwa. Ukubhaka ukuthungwa. Bhaka ukuvinjelwa kokukhanya okuzungezile, ugoqo, ukukhanya nezinormali zento eyinemininingwane ibe yizithombe ezihambisana ne-UV ye-mesh, ngamaprosesa ekhompyutha. Bona Bhaka ukuthungwa. Ukunyakaza Indawo ye-Animate. Bamba indawo, ukujikeleza nosayizi wento, ukukhanya, ukusakazeka nombala kwelungu ngalinye lezibani, nenguqulo yelensi, ngqo kupanele. Isikhathi sinebuka Amajika (izibambi ze-Bézier, okuphindwayo) nebuka Amaklipu ogcina izikhiye njengezenzo ukuze uzibeke futhi uzixube; izikhiye ezingaphezu kwesisodwa zingahanjiswa, zelulwe, zikopishwe futhi zinamathiselwe. Bona Yenza noma yiyiphi impahla ibe yanyakazayo. Izikhiye zesimo nama-driver. Imesh iba nezinye izimo zayo, exutshwe ngamaslayida angabanjwa, noma ibekwe ezinanini ezinye ngesisho esincane. Bona Izikhiye zesimo no Ama-driver. Ama-armature. Faka amathambo ku-mesh, vumela Izisindo ezizenzakalelayo zabelane ngamaphoyinti phakathi kwawo noma upeyinte izisindo, bese umisa futhi ubambe amathambo; ukuqoshwa kwemigqa noma kwe-dual quaternion. Bona Ama-armature. IK nama-constraint. Ukufinyelela (IK) nomgoqo, bheka, kopisha ukuguqulwa, imikhawulo, ingane yomzila nokulandela umzila, kumathambo nezinto. Bona IK nama-constraint. Fiziksi. Amaqembu nezingxenye ziyawela, ziyasikwa futhi ziyashaya njengamabhokisi noma amabhola, futhi Bhaka fiziksi igcina umphumela njengezikhiye. Bona Fiziksi. Amafayela USD. Londoloza njenge (Ctrl+Shift+S) igcina imodeli njenge-.usda, .usdc noma .usdz, nefayela le-USD eyigcine i-ModelCraft livula futhi lingaphuli lutho. I-USD evela kwezinye izinhlelo ivula noma iyangeniswa njengama-mesh, amaqembu, izingxenye, izibani nezikhamera. Londoloza ibhala futhi .modelcraft. Bona Gcina, vula nekhiphe i-USD. glTF, ephelele. Amafayela e-glTF angena njengama-mesh ahlelekayo nama-normal, ama-UV, imibala yamaphoyinti nezithungo, ama-node njengamaqembu, izibani njengezibani nezikhamera njengemiboniso, kubandakanya namafayela e-Draco nemeshopt; i-.gltf ivulwa uma yehliswa ndawonye namafayela ayo. Ukukhipha kubhala ama-mesh, izithungo, izibani nezikhamera. Bona glTF. Okungenisiwe kwe-FBX, PLY, STL ne-Alembic. I-FBX 2011 nezinhlobo ezintsha (ama-mesh, amasethi e-UV, izinto, izithungo ezifakiwe, izibani, izikhamera), i-PLY ne-STL ngemibala yazo, nama-cache e-Alembic ngesampula lawo lokuqala. I-OBJ ingena ne-.mtl nezithombe zayo uma uzidonsa ndawonye. Bona Amafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe. Okukhishwayo okwengeziwe. I-PLY ngemibala, i-STL ngemibala yobuso obupeyintiwe, ne-OBJ nezithungo zayo njengefayela le-zip. Bona Amafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe. Amafayela e-STEP. Ngenisa ifunda izingxenye nezinhlanganisela ze-STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) njengama-mesh avaliwe ngosayizi wazo wangempela, yonke ingxenye lapho ifayela liyibeka khona. Bona STEP. Amafayela e-.3dm. Ngenisa ifunda amamodeli e-.3dm: ama-mesh, ama-polysurface nokukhishwa (kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe efayeleni, noma yenziwe ama-tessellate yi-ModelCraft), amajika njengemiphetho, amabhulokhi njengezingxenye namashidi njengamathegi. Bona Ngenisa imodeli ye-.3dm. Amasolidi e-3D kusuka ku-DWG ne-DXF. Ukungenisa umdwebo manje kuletha namasolidi wawo e-3D, izifunda nemizimba, ngalinye njengeqembu layo, ezivaliwe njengamasolidi. Bona Model esitebeleni. Ukuprinta nge-3D Amathuluzi okuprinta. Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)… › Amathuluzi okuprinta unesikhombisi se-Ukubuka kangaphambili kwezisekelo (ukuphuphuma, amakholomu noma izisekelo zesihlahla, cishe ukuthi kuzosetshenziswa kangakanani ukuthambo), Ukujula kodonga (izindonga ezincane kakhulu ukuthi zingaprintwa, ezibhalwe nge-Bonisa), Gobhoza (izindonga zobukhulu obunikezwayo, namakhomba okukhipha amanzi) no-Lungisa (zonke izilungiso zibhalwe; izingxenye ezigqumayo zihlanganisa kuphela uma uzicela). I-Gobhoza nakho i-Lungisa zinikeza iqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezilingene ziyizinhlangothi ezingasile, noma imesh uma umphumela ungavaleki noma unezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu; umugqa wesimo uthi yiyiphi. Bona Izisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa. Isitayela sabaqalayo. Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse › Oqalayo: izinkinobho ezinkulu zokuwisa izimo nemingxumo, ukuhambisa, ukuhlanganisa nokuthi Iqembu ukuze izimbobo zisikwe, bese uhlola imodeli ukuze iprintwe. Bona Isitayela sabaQalayo. Abasizi nomshini wakho Abasizi abengeziwe. Umsizi manje angabhala izinto nezinto ezingaphezulu, sunduza/hudula, peyinta, enze amaqembu, engeze futhi akhombise imiboniso, engeze ama-mesh, ahlele izitaki zezinguquli, akhiphe i-USD, arenda isithombe futhi agcwalise uhlu lokurenda. Bona Sebenzisa i-ModelCraft nabasizi be-AI. Umshini wakho. Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Ukurenda › Umshini wakho ibonisa ukubonakala, amaprosesa nememori esiphequluli esivumela i-app ukuthi isebenzise, nezinga elisetha lapho ukubuka okuphilayo kuqala khona. Bona Umshini wakho urenda ngani. Okulungisiwe Izinto eziqinile › Hlanganisa, Susa no-Ukuhlangana bekungabuyisa iqembu elingavaliwe, nganoma yisiphi usayizi. Manje ziyavala. Izinto eziqinile › Susa bekungasebenzi ngaphandle kokukhethwa, nakuba ikhetha izingxenye zayo ezimbili ngokulandelana ngemva kokuyikhetha. Ngaphakathi kwe-animation timeline, okhiye abathayiphiwe babengaqondi lapho, kanye no-Ctrl+S. Ctrl+Z no-Ctrl+Y lapho yizinto zesikhathi ezizihlehlisayo/ziphindayo zona; ezinye izinkinobho ze-Ctrl ziyafinyelela ku-app. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Amayunithi. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Amayunithi unohlu olulodwa ngalinye lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, nosayizi abanikezwa yizichazo zamayunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi nawo ahamba ezinhlwini zamayunithi, bese uwamaka ngenkanyezi ukuze umsebenzi omusha uqale kuwo. Ifayela lihlala linayo iyunithi yalo. Ku-ModelCraft uhlu lwamayunithi ecaleni kwe-value box lulandela iswitshi (iyunithi yemodeli ihlala ikhona), inkanyezi isetha iyunithi yemodeli emisha (uma i-ModelCraft inayo leyo yunithi), futhi ubude obuthayiphwe ngophawu lanoma yiyiphi iyunithi lufundwa ngaleyo yunithi. Bona Amayunithi, amanani athayiphwayo nezinhlu zamayunithi. Ukubonakala okuminyene nezinhlaka ezizicashele. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo › Okuhlangene kulungisa okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nama-fonti abuyisa izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Ibha yesihloko ngasinye sepaneli iyincane: yidonse ukuze uyifake noma uyiphume, uyilahle ebhalweni lenye ipaneli ukuze wabelane ngerimu njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze iphume ngaphandle kohlangothi, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisa emaphethelweni. Bona Hlela amaphaneli. Izingxoxo ziyanyakaza. Donsa ingxoxo ngebha yayo yesihloko ukuze ihambe ngaphandle komdwebo; ibuyela lapho wayishiya khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze ibuyele maphakathi. Bona Hambisa ingxoxo. Izindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI. Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlanza umdwebo, hlela isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, ubale i-takeoff, zama ukuhluka kwengxenye…), ngayinye namathuluzi ayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye iyaphinda ihlolwe yizivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bona Izindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI. Izilimi. Português (Portugal)isha ku-Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ulimi. Yona, Português (Brasil), Español (México) no-Bahasa Indonesia manje sekunawo wonke amagama ezinhlelweni, njengemisebenzi engakabuyekezwa yisikhulumi sendabuko. Amasihloko osizo asolwimini lwesiNgisi. CadCraft Studio ichaza ukuthi ukubuyekeza kwehlulekile kungani (akukho ifayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isignesha embi) esikhundleni sokuthi \"Kwenziwe\", futhi ayiphindi ibuyise ikhadi lakho elithi Okusha ayilivalile size kube nokukhishwa okusha. Akukatholakali kule nguqulo okwamanje 0.7 ayisayinwanga ngekhodi. Ukusayina nephakheji ye-Microsoft Store kudlulele ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eseceleni kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa umfakeli, khetha Ulwazi olwengeziwe, bese Qhuba noma kunjalo. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngokwesokudla ku-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha Vula. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi akukakabi ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone. Uhlu lwama-engeli nokuthambeka ku-Amayunithi luyagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elilufundayo okwamanje. Ukurenda ku-graphics card (WebGPU) kuhlolwe lapha nge-software stand-in kuphela, akukahlolwa ku-graphics card yangempela, ngakho renda okuncane kukhompyutha yakho kuqala. Okufanayo kubukeka okuphilayo, nevR isahlolwe nge-emulator ye-headset kuphela. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU akukho indawo yokurenda noma uhlu lokurenda, futhi izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu azinayo ukujula kwenkundla, isibhakabhaka sefiziksi, isithombe sesibhakabhaka, umsi, intuthu, ama-caustic noma ukuxuba izibani. Renda isithombe… ayikadwetshi izinto ezihlakazekile okwamanje; zibonakala ku-live view, kuma-panorama, kubukeli nasevidiyweni. Izibani zinyakaza ku-view, kodwa ividiyo eyenziwe isebenzisa izibani njengoba zinjalo lapho iqala. Ama-bone nokunyakaza akufundwa noma kubhalwa kumafayela e-glTF, FBX noma USD okwamanje (amamodeli anesikhumba angena esimweni sokuphumula, nezisindo zawo), futhi izinto ze-glTF ne-FBX ngaphezu kombala oyisisekelo noma ithekisha azigcinwa okwamanje. Imibala ye-STEP namagama ezingxenye zokuhlanganisa akufundwa okwamanje. Ukungenisa kwe-.3dm kuhlolwe ngamafayela abhalwe ngethuluzi lefomethi, akukahlolwa ngamafayela avela ohlelweni lokumodela uqobo; izinto ze-SubD, umbhalo nezilinganiso azifakiwe. Ithala lezitshalo elivela ku-CivilCraft likhona ku-ModelCraft, kodwa ukubeka izitshalo kuwo akukakwakhiwa. Ukupeyinta ukuthungwa ebusweni bokusunduza/ukuhudula kuphindwa ngethayili yempahla; ukuze upeyinte ubuso obubodwa kuphela, guqula libe yi-mesh bese uyivula isikhumba. Konke okunye kusechazwe ku-Akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qala ukusebenzisa i-ModelCraft","summary":"Ukuthi yini i-ModelCraft ngayo, indlela yokuyivula, nebhokisi lakho lokuqala kusuka kwerektangili kuya kumodeli elondoloziwe.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["qala","okokuqala","imodeli yokuqala","qalisa","isifundo","isingeniso","ibhokisi","ukwakheka","3d","sunduza hudula","ukuqala okusheshayo","eqondisiwe","iqondo","oqalayo","okusha ku-3d"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-i-modelcraft","text":"Vula i-ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"hlola-amayunithi-kuqala","text":"Hlola amayunithi kuqala","level":2},{"id":"vumela-i-modelcraft-ikuqondise-kumodeli-yakho-yokuqala","text":"Vumela i-ModelCraft ikuqondise kumodeli yakho yokuqala","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ibhokisi-lakho-lokuqala","text":"Dweba ibhokisi lakho lokuqala","level":2},{"id":"bheka-indawo","text":"Bheka indawo","level":2},{"id":"hlehlisa","text":"Hlehlisa","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-imodeli-yakho","text":"Londoloza imodeli yakho","level":2},{"id":"thola-usizo","text":"Thola usizo","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft iyi-3D modeler yokuklama kokuqala: izifundo zokwakheka, ukuhlelwa kwamakamelo, izimo ezilula zezakhiwo nezithunzi ezikhishwa yizo. Udweba izimo ezisicaba, uzikhuphule zibe yizinto eziqinile, bese uqhubeka usebenza kuzo ngokudweba ebusweni bazo. Isebenza kusisiphequluli sakho sewebhu, futhi amamodeli akho ahlala esikhompyutheni yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usuvele wasebenzisa i-SketchUp, okuningi ozaziyo kuyasebenza: amanhlamvu afanayo amathuluzi, push/pull, ibhokisi lezilinganiso ezinembile, amaqembu nezakhi. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/coming-from\"\u003EAbavela kwabanye abamodeli\u003C/a\u003E bachaza okuhlukile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-i-modelcraft\"\u003EVula i-ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-ModelCraft kuguqulo yamanje ye-Chrome, Edge, Firefox noma Safari. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EIzisiphequluli nezikhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda ukubuka kwe-3D kuvele: indawo ekhanyayo (noma emnyama) maphakathi nesikrini, nekhadi elithi &quot;Qala ukumodela&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikrini sinebha yamathuluzi phezulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele, ukubuka kwe-3D phakathi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, nebha yesimo ngaphansi enebhokisi lezilinganiso namayunithi. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/workspace\"\u003EIsikrini se-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E sichaza ingxenye ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft idinga i-WebGL, isici sokudweba nge-3D sesiphequluli sakho. Uma maphakathi esikrini kuhlala kungenalutho futhi amathuluzi engasebenzi, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#the-3d-view-is-blank\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"the-3d-view-is-blank\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-amayunithi-kuqala\"\u003EHlola amayunithi kuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka ekhoneni elingakwesokudla elingezansi. Ukhethi wamayunithi ukhombisa ukuthi amabanga alinganiswa ngani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli entsha iqala ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003Eamafidi nezintshi\u003C/strong\u003E uma isiphequluli sakho sisetelwe ku-United States (futhi nase-Liberia nase-Myanmar), futhi ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitha\u003C/strong\u003E kwezinye zonke izindawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha, khetha enye iyunithi kukhethi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eft nama-in\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ein\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Em\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ecm\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emm\u003C/span\u003E. Imodeli ngokwayo ayishintshi usayizi; kushintsha kuphela indlela okuboniswa ngayo amabanga nendlela izinombolo ezingenayo iyunithi ezifundwa ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInombolo oyithayipha ngaphandle kweyunithi isebenzisa iyunithi yemodeli. Kumodeli yamafidi nezintshi, inombolo engenayo iyunithi iyizintshi, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E isho amafidi angu-10.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vumela-i-modelcraft-ikuqondise-kumodeli-yakho-yokuqala\"\u003EVumela i-ModelCraft ikuqondise kumodeli yakho yokuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUqala ku-3D? Ekhadini elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala ukumodela\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli yokuqala eqondisiwe\u003C/span\u003E (itholakala futhi kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E). Ikhadi elincane likuhambisa ngezinyathelo ezine, kusukela kwerektangili esicaba kuya kumodeli elungele iprinta ye-3D:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba unxande phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMkhuphule ube yibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza ibhokisi libe into eyodwa (iqembu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D, bese ulanda ifayela le-3MF noma le-STL.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhadi liyawubheka imodeli, hhayi izinkinobho: liyaqhubeka isinyathelo sesiphelile, noma yikuphi okwenze ngakho, futhi liyabuyela emuva isinyathelo uma uhlehlisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ithuluzi\u003C/span\u003E likhetha ithuluzi kuwe. Vala noma nini ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ibhokisi-lakho-lokuqala\"\u003EDweba ibhokisi lakho lokuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E lebha yamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kanye esedwaleni eseduze nephakathi lokubuka. Leyo yisikhonkwane sokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi kude. Unxande uyalandela, nebhokisi lezilinganiso (elibhalwe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E) liveza usayizi walo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha usayizi bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003E16&#039;,12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E ngamafidi nezintshi. Akudingeki uchofoze ebhokisini kuqala; ukuthayipha inombolo kuyithumela lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthola unxande osicaba phansi. Ungubuso: indawo enemiphetho ezungezile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza unxande, hambisa isikhombi phezulu, bese uchofoza futhi. Noma chofoza unxande bese uthayipha ubude, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnxande uba yibhokisi elinophezulu, ingaphansi, nezinhlangothi ezine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ubuyele kuKhetha, bese uchofoza phezulu kwebhokisi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla lubonisa indawo yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngadonsa esikhundleni sokuchofoza kabili: cindezela endaweni yokuqala, donsa, bese ukhulula endaweni yesibili. Zombili izindlela zisebenza kuwo wonke amathuluzi okudweba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-indawo\"\u003EBheka indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZungeza:\u003C/strong\u003E donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi (ivili), noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese udonsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShelelisa:\u003C/strong\u003E donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma ngenkinobho ephakathi ngenkathi ubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESondeza:\u003C/strong\u003E sebenzisa ivili. Lisondeza kulokho okungaphansi kwesikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBona konke:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza konke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad noma kuskrini sokuthinta izinyathelo ziyahluka. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EZungeza, shelelisa nesondeza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlehlisa\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuhlehlisa no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuphinda wenze, noma sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E kubha yamathuluzi. I-ModelCraft ikhumbula izinyathelo ezingu-200 zokugcina ngenkathi imodeli ivuliwe. Umlando awulondolozwa kwifayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-imodeli-yakho\"\u003ELondoloza imodeli yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiphequluli silanda ifayela elibizwa ngegama lemodeli yakho, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Ibha yesimo ikhomba lapho lifike khona: &quot;Ifayela Untitled.modelcraft lilondoloziwe kuzilandiwe zakho.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza kuwukulanda.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukulondoloza ngakunye kwenza ikhophi entsha kufolda yakho yokulanda; ayibhali phezu kwefayela owalivulayo. Ukuze ugcine ifolda yephrojekthi ihleleke, hambisa noma uqamba kabusha ifayela lapho ngokwakho. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\"\u003EVula, londoloza, ngenisa nekhiphe\u003C/a\u003E ichaza ngokwengeziwe ukuthi kungani nokuthi yini enye oyenzayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayilondolozi ngokuzenzakalelayo. Uma uvala ithebhu nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyabuza kuqala (&quot;Shiya lesi sayithi?&quot;). Khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-usizo\"\u003EThola usizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lohlelo ukuze uvule lo sizo ecaleni kwemodeli. Lusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumana. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphakathi koSizo, ukuze uvale. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/help\" data-topic=\"basics/help\"\u003EUkusebenzisa lo sizo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003EDweba ubuso ngemigqa, amanxande namasekeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\"\u003EPhusha nedonsa ubuso ube izinto eziqinile\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EThayipha izilinganiso ezinembile ebhokisini lezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EWonke amakhiye nezenzo ze-mouse\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-ModelCraft iyi-3D modeler yokuklama kokuqala: izifundo zokwakheka, ukuhlelwa kwamakamelo, izimo ezilula zezakhiwo nezithunzi ezikhishwa yizo. Udweba izimo ezisicaba, uzikhuphule zibe yizinto eziqinile, bese uqhubeka usebenza kuzo ngokudweba ebusweni bazo. Isebenza kusisiphequluli sakho sewebhu, futhi amamodeli akho ahlala esikhompyutheni yakho. Uma usuvele wasebenzisa i-SketchUp, okuningi ozaziyo kuyasebenza: amanhlamvu afanayo amathuluzi, push/pull, ibhokisi lezilinganiso ezinembile, amaqembu nezakhi. Abavela kwabanye abamodeli bachaza okuhlukile. Vula i-ModelCraft Vula i-ModelCraft kuguqulo yamanje ye-Chrome, Edge, Firefox noma Safari. Bona Izisiphequluli nezikhompyutha. Linda ukubuka kwe-3D kuvele: indawo ekhanyayo (noma emnyama) maphakathi nesikrini, nekhadi elithi \"Qala ukumodela\". Isikrini sinebha yamathuluzi phezulu, Uhlu lwezinto kanye Izakhi ngakwesobunxele, ukubuka kwe-3D phakathi, Ulwazi lwento, Isitayela kanye Imiboniso ngakwesokudla, nebha yesimo ngaphansi enebhokisi lezilinganiso namayunithi. Isikrini se-ModelCraft sichaza ingxenye ngayinye. I-ModelCraft idinga i-WebGL, isici sokudweba nge-3D sesiphequluli sakho. Uma maphakathi esikrini kuhlala kungenalutho futhi amathuluzi engasebenzi, bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Hlola amayunithi kuqala Bheka ekhoneni elingakwesokudla elingezansi. Ukhethi wamayunithi ukhombisa ukuthi amabanga alinganiswa ngani. Imodeli entsha iqala ngo-amafidi nezintshi uma isiphequluli sakho sisetelwe ku-United States (futhi nase-Liberia nase-Myanmar), futhi ngo-millimitha kwezinye zonke izindawo. Ukushintsha, khetha enye iyunithi kukhethi: ft nama-in, in, m, cm noma mm. Imodeli ngokwayo ayishintshi usayizi; kushintsha kuphela indlela okuboniswa ngayo amabanga nendlela izinombolo ezingenayo iyunithi ezifundwa ngayo. Inombolo oyithayipha ngaphandle kweyunithi isebenzisa iyunithi yemodeli. Kumodeli yamafidi nezintshi, inombolo engenayo iyunithi iyizintshi, ngakho 120 isho amafidi angu-10. Vumela i-ModelCraft ikuqondise kumodeli yakho yokuqala Uqala ku-3D? Ekhadini elithi Qala ukumodela, chofoza Imodeli yokuqala eqondisiwe (itholakala futhi kumenyu Ukubuka). Ikhadi elincane likuhambisa ngezinyathelo ezine, kusukela kwerektangili esicaba kuya kumodeli elungele iprinta ye-3D: Dweba unxande phansi. Mkhuphule ube yibhokisi. Yenza ibhokisi libe into eyodwa (iqembu). Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D, bese ulanda ifayela le-3MF noma le-STL. Ikhadi liyawubheka imodeli, hhayi izinkinobho: liyaqhubeka isinyathelo sesiphelile, noma yikuphi okwenze ngakho, futhi liyabuyela emuva isinyathelo uma uhlehlisa. Khetha ithuluzi likhetha ithuluzi kuwe. Vala noma nini ngo-×. Dweba ibhokisi lakho lokuqala Cindezela R ngethuluzi Unxande, noma chofoza Unxande eqenjini Dweba lebha yamathuluzi. Chofoza kanye esedwaleni eseduze nephakathi lokubuka. Leyo yisikhonkwane sokuqala. Hambisa isikhombi kude. Unxande uyalandela, nebhokisi lezilinganiso (elibhalwe Izilinganiso) liveza usayizi walo. Thayipha usayizi bese ucindezela Enter: isibonelo 4m,3m, noma 16',12' ngamafidi nezintshi. Akudingeki uchofoze ebhokisini kuqala; ukuthayipha inombolo kuyithumela lapho. Uthola unxande osicaba phansi. Ungubuso: indawo enemiphetho ezungezile. Cindezela P ngo-Sunduza/hudula. Chofoza unxande, hambisa isikhombi phezulu, bese uchofoza futhi. Noma chofoza unxande bese uthayipha ubude, njengo 3m noma 10', bese ucindezela Enter. Unxande uba yibhokisi elinophezulu, ingaphansi, nezinhlangothi ezine. Cindezela Space ubuyele kuKhetha, bese uchofoza phezulu kwebhokisi. Ulwazi lwento ngakwesokudla lubonisa indawo yalo. Ungadonsa esikhundleni sokuchofoza kabili: cindezela endaweni yokuqala, donsa, bese ukhulula endaweni yesibili. Zombili izindlela zisebenza kuwo wonke amathuluzi okudweba. Bheka indawo Zungeza: donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi (ivili), noma cindezela O bese udonsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele. Shelelisa: donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma ngenkinobho ephakathi ngenkathi ubamba Shift. Sondeza: sebenzisa ivili. Lisondeza kulokho okungaphansi kwesikhombi. Bona konke: cindezela Shift+Z, noma chofoza Sondeza konke. Ku-trackpad noma kuskrini sokuthinta izinyathelo ziyahluka. Bona Zungeza, shelelisa nesondeza. Hlehlisa Cindezela Ctrl+Z ukuhlehlisa no-Ctrl+Y ukuphinda wenze, noma sebenzisa Hlehlisa no-Phinda wenze kubha yamathuluzi. I-ModelCraft ikhumbula izinyathelo ezingu-200 zokugcina ngenkathi imodeli ivuliwe. Umlando awulondolozwa kwifayela. Londoloza imodeli yakho Chofoza Londoloza eqenjini Ifayela, noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Isiphequluli silanda ifayela elibizwa ngegama lemodeli yakho, njengo Untitled.modelcraft. Ibha yesimo ikhomba lapho lifike khona: \"Ifayela Untitled.modelcraft lilondoloziwe kuzilandiwe zakho.\" Ukulondoloza kuwukulanda. Ukulondoloza ngakunye kwenza ikhophi entsha kufolda yakho yokulanda; ayibhali phezu kwefayela owalivulayo. Ukuze ugcine ifolda yephrojekthi ihleleke, hambisa noma uqamba kabusha ifayela lapho ngokwakho. Vula, londoloza, ngenisa nekhiphe ichaza ngokwengeziwe ukuthi kungani nokuthi yini enye oyenzayo. I-ModelCraft ayilondolozi ngokuzenzakalelayo. Uma uvala ithebhu nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyabuza kuqala (\"Shiya lesi sayithi?\"). Khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza. Thola usizo Cindezela F1 noma chofoza Usizo ebhalweni lohlelo ukuze uvule lo sizo ecaleni kwemodeli. Lusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumana. Cindezela F1 futhi, noma Esc ngaphakathi koSizo, ukuze uvale. Bona Ukusebenzisa lo sizo. Okulandelayo Dweba ubuso ngemigqa, amanxande namasekeli Phusha nedonsa ubuso ube izinto eziqinile Thayipha izilinganiso ezinembile ebhokisini lezilinganiso Wonke amakhiye nezenzo ze-mouse","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"beginner","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Isitayela Oqalayo","summary":"Izinkinobho ezimbalwa ezinkulu zokuqala ukumodela nge-3D: beka izimo, yenza izimbobo, hambisa nelinganise, yenza iqembu ukuze izimbobo zisike, bese uhlola umphumela ukuze uprinte nge-3D.","section":"start","order":12,"keywords":["oqalayo","abaqalayo","lula","kulula","imodeli yokuqala","izingane","isikole","izimo","ibhokisi","isilinda","ibhola","ikhoni","uphahla","umgodi","imigodi","sika","susa","linganisa","iqembu","yehlisa emhlabathini","isitayela semenyu","ibhande"],"headings":[{"id":"yakha-ngezimo","text":"Yakha ngezimo","level":2},{"id":"yenza-izimbobo","text":"Yenza izimbobo","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-izinto","text":"Linganisa izinto","level":2},{"id":"hlola-ukuprinta","text":"Hlola ukuprinta","level":2},{"id":"amanye-amathebhu","text":"Amanye amathebhu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUsaqala ku-3D? Isitayela se-\u003Cstrong\u003EOqalayo\u003C/strong\u003E sibeka izinkinobho ezimbalwa ezinkulu ethebhini lokuqala, ukuze wakhe izinto ngezimo nezimbobo ngaphambi kokuthi ufunde ukudweba ubuso nokubusunda phezulu. Khetha kwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOqalayo\u003C/span\u003E. Ezinye izitayela zonke zihlala njengoba zinjalo; shintsha ubuyele kwenye noma nini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yakha-ngezimo\"\u003EYakha ngezimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isimo ethebhini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhola\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhoni\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUphahla\u003C/span\u003E. Ngayinye ilingana no-20 mm ngobubanzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho okufanele khona: phansi, noma ebusweni besinye isimo (sime kuso). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isimo ukuze usikhethe, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E sona. Thayipha usayizi uma uhambisa noma ushintsha usayizi ukuze ube nokunemba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-izimbobo\"\u003EYenza izimbobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmgodi uwukuthi isimo esisika izimo ezihlanganiswe nasona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmgodi webhokisi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmgodi ojikelezayo\u003C/span\u003E (zimpunga), noma khetha noma yisiphi isimo bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ibe umgodi\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza iqinile\u003C/span\u003E iguqula umgodi ube isimo futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka umgodi lapho okufanele usike khona: ngaphakathi kwesimo, noma ngokungaphelele kuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izimo nemigodi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza yengeza enye), bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/span\u003E. Imigodi iyasikwa, umphumela ube yingxenye eyodwa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uyihlukanisa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungekho mgodi okukhethiwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/span\u003E yenza iqembu elijwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-izinto\"\u003ELinganisa izinto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izimo ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, bese usebenzisa izinkinobho zokulinganisa: imitshazo yazo ibhalwe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa kwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa amaphakathi (abomvu)\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa kwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, okufanayo ngoluhlaza (ngaphambili, phakathi, ngasemuva) nangoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (phansi, phakathi, phezulu). Zilinganiswa ngaphandle kwayo yonke into ekhethiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYehlisa emhlabathini\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela isimo ngasinye esikhethiwe phansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-ukuprinta\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D…\u003C/span\u003E ethebhini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza\u003C/span\u003E ihlola imodeli bese iyilanda ukuze uyiprinte. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003EIzixhasi, ukuqina kwendonga, ukugodla nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanye-amathebhu\"\u003EAmanye amathebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E inekhamera: zungeza, shelelisa, sondeza, sondeza konke, nezibuko ezijwayelekile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanye amathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E inawo wonke amanye amathuluzi e-ModelCraft, amancane. Kulesi sitayela \u003Cstrong\u003Einkinobho yesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E iyazungeza, \u003Cstrong\u003Einkinobho ephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E iyashelelisa, ivili liyasondeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUfuna ukuthi i-ModelCraft ikuqondise ekudwebeni ingxenye yakho yokuqala? Sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/getting-started#let-modelcraft-guide-your-first-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/getting-started\" data-hash=\"let-modelcraft-guide-your-first-model\"\u003Eimodeli yokuqala eqondisiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EAmaqembu nezakhi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Usaqala ku-3D? Isitayela se-Oqalayo sibeka izinkinobho ezimbalwa ezinkulu ethebhini lokuqala, ukuze wakhe izinto ngezimo nezimbobo ngaphambi kokuthi ufunde ukudweba ubuso nokubusunda phezulu. Khetha kwi-Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,) › ModelCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse › Oqalayo. Ezinye izitayela zonke zihlala njengoba zinjalo; shintsha ubuyele kwenye noma nini. Yakha ngezimo Chofoza isimo ethebhini Yenza: Ibhokisi, Isilinda, Ibhola, Ikhoni noma Uphahla. Ngayinye ilingana no-20 mm ngobubanzi. Chofoza lapho okufanele khona: phansi, noma ebusweni besinye isimo (sime kuso). Esc iyayeka. Chofoza isimo ukuze usikhethe, bese Hambisa, Jikisa noma Shintsha usayizi sona. Thayipha usayizi uma uhambisa noma ushintsha usayizi ukuze ube nokunemba. Yenza izimbobo Umgodi uwukuthi isimo esisika izimo ezihlanganiswe nasona. Beka Umgodi webhokisi noma Umgodi ojikelezayo (zimpunga), noma khetha noma yisiphi isimo bese uchofoza Yenza ibe umgodi. Yenza iqinile iguqula umgodi ube isimo futhi. Beka umgodi lapho okufanele usike khona: ngaphakathi kwesimo, noma ngokungaphelele kuso. Khetha izimo nemigodi (Shift+chofoza yengeza enye), bese uchofoza Iqembu. Imigodi iyasikwa, umphumela ube yingxenye eyodwa. Ctrl+Z uyihlukanisa futhi. Uma kungekho mgodi okukhethiwe, Iqembu yenza iqembu elijwayelekile. Linganisa izinto Khetha izimo ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, bese usebenzisa izinkinobho zokulinganisa: imitshazo yazo ibhalwe Linganisa kwesobunxele / Linganisa amaphakathi (abomvu) / Linganisa kwesokudla, okufanayo ngoluhlaza (ngaphambili, phakathi, ngasemuva) nangoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (phansi, phakathi, phezulu). Zilinganiswa ngaphandle kwayo yonke into ekhethiwe. Yehlisa emhlabathini ibuyisela isimo ngasinye esikhethiwe phansi. Hlola ukuprinta Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D… ethebhini Yenza ihlola imodeli bese iyilanda ukuze uyiprinte. Bona Lungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D kanye Izixhasi, ukuqina kwendonga, ukugodla nokulungisa. Amanye amathebhu Ukubuka inekhamera: zungeza, shelelisa, sondeza, sondeza konke, nezibuko ezijwayelekile. Amanye amathuluzi inawo wonke amanye amathuluzi e-ModelCraft, amancane. Kulesi sitayela inkinobho yesokudla iyazungeza, inkinobho ephakathi iyashelelisa, ivili liyasondeza. Ufuna ukuthi i-ModelCraft ikuqondise ekudwebeni ingxenye yakho yokuqala? Sebenzisa imodeli yokuqala eqondisiwe. Okuhlobene: Imenyu, okhiye nemouse · Amaqembu nezakhi","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Isikrini se-ModelCraft","summary":"Uhambo lwebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli ngakwesobunxele nangakwesokudla, ukubuka kwe-3D nebha yesimo, ngamagama abo esikrinini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["isikrini","isakhiwo","ibha yamathuluzi","amaphaneli","uhlu lwezinto","ulwazi lwento","isitayela","imiboniso","ibha yesimo","ibhokisi lezilinganiso","amayunithi","ukusebenzisana","uhambo"],"headings":[{"id":"ibha-yohlelo","text":"Ibha yohlelo","level":2},{"id":"ibha-yamathuluzi","text":"Ibha yamathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-kwe-3d","text":"Ukubuka kwe-3D","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-angakwesobunxele","text":"Amaphaneli angakwesobunxele","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-angakwesokudla","text":"Amaphaneli angakwesokudla","level":2},{"id":"ibha-yesimo","text":"Ibha yesimo","level":2},{"id":"esikrinini-esincane","text":"Esikrinini esincane","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKusuka phezulu kuya phansi: ibha yohlelo, ibha yamathuluzi, izinsika ezintathu (amaphaneli angakwesobunxele, ukubuka kwe-3D, amaphaneli angakwesokudla) nebha yesimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yohlelo\"\u003EIbha yohlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha ecwebile ngaphezulu kakhulu iyeyazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft. Inegama lohlelo nenguqulo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMayelana ne-ModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, inkinobho yemodi yesikrini kanye noshintshi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphepha\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphepha\u003C/span\u003E yitimu ekhanyayo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E eyimnyama. Ukubuka kwe-3D kushintsha imibala yakho ukuze kufane; imodeli yakho ayishintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yemodi yesikrini (ifunda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikrini esigcwele\u003C/span\u003E ekuqaleni) ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zijikeleza phakathi kwemodi ezintathu: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, nesikrini esigcwele namabha afihliwe. Uma amabha efihliwe, bheka emphethweni ophezulu wesikrini (noma uthinte kuwo) ukuze uwabuyisele. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iphuma kwisikrini esigcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isebenzisa inkinobho Control kuwo wonke amakhompyutha, nase-Mac. Ku-iPhone, lapho izisiphequluli zingenayo isikrini esigcwele, inkinobho ifihla futhi ibonise amabha kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yamathuluzi\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yamathuluzi ihlukaniswe ngamaqembu anamagama. Phakamisa inkinobho ukuze ubone igama layo nokhiye bayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgakwesobunxele kwayo, uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E lushintsha ukuthi ibha yamathuluzi nephaneli yesokudla yenzelwe ukwenzani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E (ukumodela ngokusunduza/hudula, uhambo oluphansi), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImesh\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003Ehlela i-mesh\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Eizinto zamajika\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUV\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/uv\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/uv\"\u003Ehlela ama-UV\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubumba\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003Ebumba\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkushadisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003Eizinto ezenziwe ngamanodi\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza i-animation\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003Eyenza i-animation\u003C/a\u003E) kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#render-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"render-in-the-view\"\u003Erenda ekubukeni\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu yamafomethi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuqula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthephu\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELungisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu: sika, kopisha, namathisela, namathisela endaweni efanayo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, phindeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, susa, khetha konke, khetha lutho, nesitayela sokhiye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhamera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZungeza\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShelelisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza konke\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkhiye abakhonjiswa ngukhiye wokusunduza/hudula; uma imodi ye-Modeler ikhethiwe kwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E, ama-tooltip akhombisa lawo makhiye. Ithuluzi osebenzisa lona libonakala licindezelwe. Esikrinini esincane ibha yamathuluzi iyashelelisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E inawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgasemuva\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E, ngayinye ilingene kumodeli, kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka ngokujula\u003C/span\u003E, okushintsha phakathi kokubuka ngokujula nokubuka okufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kwe-3d\"\u003EUkubuka kwe-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaphakathi esikrini. Imigqa ebomvu, eluhlaza nebhlu iyizinsika: ebomvu neluhlaza zilele phansi, obhlu uyaphezulu, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eenyakatho iyinsika eluhlaza\u003C/strong\u003E. Lapho zihlangana kungumsuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uqala, ikhadi elithi &quot;Qala ukumodela&quot; libhala ezinye izinkinobho zokuqala. Liyanyamalala uma ukhetha ithuluzi lokudweba noma uchofoza ekubukeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi ithuluzi lisebenza, ukubuka kukhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eizimpawu zokubamba\u003C/strong\u003E: izimo ezincane ezinemibala lapho isikhombi sibamba khona (isiyingi esiluhlaza esiphethweni, isiyingi esiluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka esiphakathi, isikwele esibomvu emphethweni, idayimani eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ebusweni). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003EUkubamba nokubambelela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezikhethiwe ziba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Ubuso obubukwa emuva bubonakala luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka oluyimpunga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvula iqembu ukuze uhlele, konke okungaphandle kwalo kuyanyamalala, nezinsika zihamba ziye ezinsikeni zeqembu lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma imodeli inemiboniso, umugqa wamathebhu emiboniso uvela phezulu kwesikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa ifayela uliphonsele noma yikuphi kukubuka ukuze uliyivule noma uliyisise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-angakwesobunxele\"\u003EAmaphaneli angakwesobunxele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E lubhala amaqembu nezakhi kumodeli, zihlelwe ngendlela ezihlelwe ngayo kumodeli. Isakhi esisetshenziswe ngaphezu kwesisodwa sikhombisa izikhathi eziningi, njengo &quot;Iwindi (4)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza igama ukuze ulikhethe. Chofoza kabili ukuze uvule ukuhlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThola ngegama\u003C/strong\u003E (kubonakala uma kunamaqembu amabili noma ngaphezulu) ibonisa kuphela imigqa elingana negama, namaqembu ahlala kuwo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIhlo ekugcineni kwemugqa lifihla noma libonise leqembu noma leskhakhi. Ukuze ukwenze ngale ndlela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E. Isithonjana sethegi sisho ukuthi sifihlwe yithegi yaso \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Eithegi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQamba kabusha ngaphakathi:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza umugqa, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, uthayiphe, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina igama elidala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa umugqa\u003C/strong\u003E uwuphonsele ephakathi komugqa weqembu elinye ukuze uwungenise kulo, phezulu noma phansi komphetho womugqa ukuze uwubeke ngaphambi noma ngemva kwaleso mugqa, noma ekhanda le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uwuhambise ezingeni eliphezulu. Uhlala lapho ekhona kumodeli, futhi ugcina umbala wawo, ithegi negama. Iqembu alikwazi ukungena kuyo ngokwalo. Ukuhamba ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components#rearrange-in-the-outliner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\" data-hash=\"rearrange-in-the-outliner\"\u003EHlela kabusha ku-Outliner\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, umugqa othi &quot;Ukuhlela: Imodeli › …&quot; uyavela, nenkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala iqembu\u003C/span\u003E iyavela. Ivala zonke izingqimba ezivuliwe ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E libhala zonke izichazo zezakhi ezikhona nokuthi zibekwe kangaki (&quot;3×&quot;), nenkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka\u003C/span\u003E engeza enye ikhophi lapho ochofoza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-angakwesokudla\"\u003EAmaphaneli angakwesokudla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E lichaza okukhethiwe. Ikhanda lalo liyashintsha liveze ukuthi yini:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhanda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhombisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli (akukho okukhethiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso, imiphetho, amaqembu, izakhi nokuthi zingaki ezibekiwe, izihloko, usayizi jikelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa zonke izihloko\u003C/span\u003E (uma kunezihloko)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo, inani lemigodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ubuso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawekho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqembu noma Isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama (thayipha ukuze uqamba kabusha), ukuthi zibekwe kangaki, uma kuyisisombululo esivaliwe, ivolumu, usayizi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ibe yodwa\u003C/span\u003E (isakhi esibekwe kaningi), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E (iqembu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo yesikhombi noma umugqa wesihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawekho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto eziningi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso, imiphetho, amaqembu nezihloko, indawo yonke yobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza isakhi (G)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza iqembu (Shift+G)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E sibeka indlela imodeli edwetshwe ngayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOshadiwe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa ofihliwe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E, kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithunzi zelanga\u003C/span\u003E nosuku, isikhathi nendawo yelanga. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\"\u003EIzitayela nezithunzi zelanga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E igcina amabuko ebonakala: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza umboniso\u003C/span\u003E, uhlu lwemiboniso, kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwangaphambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDlala\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003ELondoloza ukubuka njengemiboniso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yesimo\"\u003EIbha yesimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi, kusuka ngakwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthiphu\u003C/strong\u003E: okufunwa yithuluzi elilandelayo, noma okubanjwa yisikhombi (&quot;Endpoint&quot; = &quot;Ekugcineni&quot;, &quot;On red axis&quot; = &quot;Kusinsika ebomvu&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImilayezo\u003C/strong\u003E: okwenzeke ngokushesha (&quot;Kuhlehliswe ukusunduza/hudula.&quot;, &quot;Kungenisiwe site.dxf: imiphetho engu-1697 phansi, kweqembu.&quot;) noma ukuthi kungani okuthile kungasebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lezilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E: ilebula layo lishintsha ngethuluzi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E). Libonisa usayizi ophilayo lapho usebenza, futhi lamukela lokho othayipha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EThayipha izilinganiso ezinembile ebhokisini lezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela sokhiye\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinobho: Sunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinobho: Modeler\u003C/span\u003E zishintsha izinkinobho zekhibhodi nezinkinobho ze-mouse ngesikhathi esisodwa (kufana nakwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShayisana\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ukubambelela kumaphoyinti, emiphetheni nasezinsikeni, nezinto eziqinile ezima lapho zithintana. Egwaziwe = kuvaliwe. Chofoza ukuze ushintshe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamayunithi\u003C/strong\u003E: iyunithi amabanga aboniswa ngayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/getting-started#check-the-units-first\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/getting-started\" data-hash=\"check-the-units-first\"\u003EQala: hlola amayunithi kuqala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikrinini-esincane\"\u003EEsikrinini esincane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwamapikseli angu-760 ububanzi (ifoni, noma iwindi elincane), ukubuka kwe-3D kuthatha isikrini sonke. Ibha yamathuluzi ingumugqa oyodwa oshelelisayo, namaphaneli avulwa njengamashidi kusuka ebhalweni elisezansi lesikrini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kusuka phezulu kuya phansi: ibha yohlelo, ibha yamathuluzi, izinsika ezintathu (amaphaneli angakwesobunxele, ukubuka kwe-3D, amaphaneli angakwesokudla) nebha yesimo. Ibha yohlelo Ibha ecwebile ngaphezulu kakhulu iyeyazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft. Inegama lohlelo nenguqulo, Mayelana ne-ModelCraft, inkinobho yemodi yesikrini kanye noshintshi Iphepha / Imodeli. Iphepha yitimu ekhanyayo, Imodeli eyimnyama. Ukubuka kwe-3D kushintsha imibala yakho ukuze kufane; imodeli yakho ayishintshi. Inkinobho yemodi yesikrini (ifunda Isikrini esigcwele ekuqaleni) ne-Ctrl+Shift+F zijikeleza phakathi kwemodi ezintathu: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, nesikrini esigcwele namabha afihliwe. Uma amabha efihliwe, bheka emphethweni ophezulu wesikrini (noma uthinte kuwo) ukuze uwabuyisele. Esc iphuma kwisikrini esigcwele. Ctrl+Shift+F isebenzisa inkinobho Control kuwo wonke amakhompyutha, nase-Mac. Ku-iPhone, lapho izisiphequluli zingenayo isikrini esigcwele, inkinobho ifihla futhi ibonise amabha kuphela. Ibha yamathuluzi Ibha yamathuluzi ihlukaniswe ngamaqembu anamagama. Phakamisa inkinobho ukuze ubone igama layo nokhiye bayo. Ngakwesobunxele kwayo, uhlu lwe-Indawo yokusebenza lushintsha ukuthi ibha yamathuluzi nephaneli yesokudla yenzelwe ukwenzani: Imodeli (ukumodela ngokusunduza/hudula, uhambo oluphansi), Imesh (hlela i-mesh), Ijika (izinto zamajika), UV (hlela ama-UV), Ukubumba (bumba), Ukushadisa (izinto ezenziwe ngamanodi), Yenza i-animation (yenza i-animation) kanye Renda (renda ekubukeni). Iqembu Izinkinobho Ifayela Okusha, Vula, Londoloza, Ngenisa, Khipha (imenyu yamafomethi) Dweba Umugqa (L), Unxande (R), Indilinga (C), Ipholigoni (N) Guqula Khetha (Space), Sunduza/hudula (P), Hambisa (M), Jikisa (Q), Shintsha usayizi (S), Isifafazi (E), Ithephu (T) Lungisa Isakhi (G), Iqembu (Shift+G), Chitha Hlela Hlehlisa (Ctrl+Z), Phinda wenze (Ctrl+Y), Kopisha (Ctrl+C), Namathisela (Ctrl+V), Okwengeziwe (imenyu: sika, kopisha, namathisela, namathisela endaweni efanayo Ctrl+Shift+V, phindeza Ctrl+D, susa, khetha konke, khetha lutho, nesitayela sokhiye) Ikhamera Zungeza (O), Shelelisa (H), Sondeza (Z), Sondeza konke (Shift+Z), Ukubuka (imenyu) Okhiye abakhonjiswa ngukhiye wokusunduza/hudula; uma imodi ye-Modeler ikhethiwe kwi-Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft, ama-tooltip akhombisa lawo makhiye. Ithuluzi osebenzisa lona libonakala licindezelwe. Esikrinini esincane ibha yamathuluzi iyashelelisa. Imenyu Ukubuka inawo Iso, Phezulu, Phambili, Ngakwesokudla, Ngasemuva, Ngakwesobunxele no-Phansi, ngayinye ilingene kumodeli, kanye no-Ukubuka ngokujula, okushintsha phakathi kokubuka ngokujula nokubuka okufanayo. Ukubuka kwe-3D Maphakathi esikrini. Imigqa ebomvu, eluhlaza nebhlu iyizinsika: ebomvu neluhlaza zilele phansi, obhlu uyaphezulu, futhi enyakatho iyinsika eluhlaza. Lapho zihlangana kungumsuka. Uma uqala, ikhadi elithi \"Qala ukumodela\" libhala ezinye izinkinobho zokuqala. Liyanyamalala uma ukhetha ithuluzi lokudweba noma uchofoza ekubukeni. Ngenkathi ithuluzi lisebenza, ukubuka kukhombisa izimpawu zokubamba: izimo ezincane ezinemibala lapho isikhombi sibamba khona (isiyingi esiluhlaza esiphethweni, isiyingi esiluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka esiphakathi, isikwele esibomvu emphethweni, idayimani eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ebusweni). Bona Ukubamba nokubambelela. Izinto ezikhethiwe ziba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Ubuso obubukwa emuva bubonakala luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka oluyimpunga. Uma uvula iqembu ukuze uhlele, konke okungaphandle kwalo kuyanyamalala, nezinsika zihamba ziye ezinsikeni zeqembu lalo. Uma imodeli inemiboniso, umugqa wamathebhu emiboniso uvela phezulu kwesikrini. Donsa ifayela uliphonsele noma yikuphi kukubuka ukuze uliyivule noma uliyisise. Amaphaneli angakwesobunxele Uhlu lwezinto lubhala amaqembu nezakhi kumodeli, zihlelwe ngendlela ezihlelwe ngayo kumodeli. Isakhi esisetshenziswe ngaphezu kwesisodwa sikhombisa izikhathi eziningi, njengo \"Iwindi (4)\". Chofoza igama ukuze ulikhethe. Chofoza kabili ukuze uvule ukuhlela. Thola ngegama (kubonakala uma kunamaqembu amabili noma ngaphezulu) ibonisa kuphela imigqa elingana negama, namaqembu ahlala kuwo. Esc iyasusa. Ihlo ekugcineni kwemugqa lifihla noma libonise leqembu noma leskhakhi. Ukuze ukwenze ngale ndlela: Hlela › Okwengeziwe › Fihla. Isithonjana sethegi sisho ukuthi sifihlwe yithegi yaso ithegi. Qamba kabusha ngaphakathi: chofoza umugqa, bese ucindezela F2, uthayiphe, bese ucindezela Enter (Esc igcina igama elidala). Donsa umugqa uwuphonsele ephakathi komugqa weqembu elinye ukuze uwungenise kulo, phezulu noma phansi komphetho womugqa ukuze uwubeke ngaphambi noma ngemva kwaleso mugqa, noma ekhanda le-Uhlu lwezinto ukuze uwuhambise ezingeni eliphezulu. Uhlala lapho ekhona kumodeli, futhi ugcina umbala wawo, ithegi negama. Iqembu alikwazi ukungena kuyo ngokwalo. Ukuhamba ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona Hlela kabusha ku-Outliner. Uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, umugqa othi \"Ukuhlela: Imodeli › …\" uyavela, nenkinobho Vala iqembu iyavela. Ivala zonke izingqimba ezivuliwe ngesikhathi esisodwa. Izakhi libhala zonke izichazo zezakhi ezikhona nokuthi zibekwe kangaki (\"3×\"), nenkinobho Beka engeza enye ikhophi lapho ochofoza khona. Amaphaneli angakwesokudla Ulwazi lwento lichaza okukhethiwe. Ikhanda lalo liyashintsha liveze ukuthi yini: Ikhanda Ikhombisa Izinkinobho Imodeli (akukho okukhethiwe) Ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu, izakhi nokuthi zingaki ezibekiwe, izihloko, usayizi jikelele Susa zonke izihloko (uma kunezihloko) Ubuso Indawo, inani lemigodi Phendula ubuso Umphetho Ubude awekho Iqembu noma Isakhi Igama (thayipha ukuze uqamba kabusha), ukuthi zibekwe kangaki, uma kuyisisombululo esivaliwe, ivolumu, usayizi Hlela, Chitha, Yenza ibe yodwa (isakhi esibekwe kaningi), Yenza ingxenye (iqembu) Indawo yesikhombi noma umugqa wesihloko awekho Susa Izinto eziningi Ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu nezihloko, indawo yonke yobuso Yenza isakhi (G), Yenza iqembu (Shift+G) Isitayela sibeka indlela imodeli edwetshwe ngayo: Ubuso (Oshadiwe, Umugqa ofihliwe, Uhlaka lwewaya, X-ray), Bonisa imiphetho, kanye no-Izithunzi zelanga nosuku, isikhathi nendawo yelanga. Bona Izitayela nezithunzi zelanga. Imiboniso igcina amabuko ebonakala: Engeza umboniso, uhlu lwemiboniso, kanye no-Okwangaphambili, Dlala no-Okulandelayo. Bona Londoloza ukubuka njengemiboniso. Ibha yesimo Ngaphansi, kusuka ngakwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla: Ithiphu: okufunwa yithuluzi elilandelayo, noma okubanjwa yisikhombi (\"Endpoint\" = \"Ekugcineni\", \"On red axis\" = \"Kusinsika ebomvu\"). Imilayezo: okwenzeke ngokushesha (\"Kuhlehliswe ukusunduza/hudula.\", \"Kungenisiwe site.dxf: imiphetho engu-1697 phansi, kweqembu.\") noma ukuthi kungani okuthile kungasebenzi. Ibhokisi lezilinganiso: ilebula layo lishintsha ngethuluzi (Ubude, Izilinganiso, Umsakazo, Izinhlangothi, Ibanga, I-engeli, Shintsha usayizi noma Phambanisa). Libonisa usayizi ophilayo lapho usebenza, futhi lamukela lokho othayipha. Bona Thayipha izilinganiso ezinembile ebhokisini lezilinganiso. Isitayela sokhiye: Izinkinobho: Sunduza/hudula noma Izinkinobho: Modeler zishintsha izinkinobho zekhibhodi nezinkinobho ze-mouse ngesikhathi esisodwa (kufana nakwi-Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft). Bambelela no-Shayisana: ukubambelela kumaphoyinti, emiphetheni nasezinsikeni, nezinto eziqinile ezima lapho zithintana. Egwaziwe = kuvaliwe. Chofoza ukuze ushintshe. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft. Ibhokisi lamayunithi: iyunithi amabanga aboniswa ngayo. Bona Qala: hlola amayunithi kuqala. Esikrinini esincane Ngaphansi kwamapikseli angu-760 ububanzi (ifoni, noma iwindi elincane), ukubuka kwe-3D kuthatha isikrini sonke. Ibha yamathuluzi ingumugqa oyodwa oshelelisayo, namaphaneli avulwa njengamashidi kusuka ebhalweni elisezansi lesikrini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Vula, londoloza, ngenisa nokukhipha","summary":"Ifayela le-ModelCraft, okungakuletha nokuthumela ngaphandle, lapho amafayela aya khona, nokushintsha ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi nasezi-bhrawuza ezihlukene.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["vula","londoloza","ngenisa","khipha","ifayela","3dm","skp","buyisela","ukulondoloza okuzenzakalelayo","okuvulwe kamuva","desktop","vula ku-3D","ukudlulisa","landa","modelcraft file","dae","collada","obj","gltf","glb","stl","step","stp","ifc","dwg","dxf","amafomethi","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","londoloza njenge"],"headings":[{"id":"amafomethi-ngokushesha","text":"Amafomethi ngokushesha","level":2},{"id":"ifayela-le-modelcraft","text":"Ifayela le-ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"vula-imodeli","text":"Vula imodeli","level":3},{"id":"londoloza-imodeli","text":"Londoloza imodeli","level":3},{"id":"qala-imodeli-entsha","text":"Qala imodeli entsha","level":3},{"id":"uma-ibhrawuza-livala-ngaphambi-kokulondoloza","text":"Uma ibhrawuza livala ngaphambi kokulondoloza","level":3},{"id":"ku-cadcraft-vula-ku-modelcraft","text":"Ku-CadCraft: Vula ku-ModelCraft","level":3},{"id":"ngenisa","text":"Ngenisa","level":2},{"id":"khipha","text":"Khipha","level":2},{"id":"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"uhlelo-lwe-desktop","text":"Uhlelo lwe-desktop","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ifunda futhi ibhalele amafayela kukhompyutha yakho. Akukho okulayishwayo: ifayela olivulayo lifundwa ngaphakathi kwebhrawuza yakho, nefayela olilondoloza liba yisidingiliyo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho ahamba khona\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafomethi-ngokushesha\"\u003EAmafomethi ngokushesha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomethi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVula\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini eyenzelwe yona\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft (\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lakho lokusebenza. Ligcina yonke into.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlelo zokurenda nokuhlanganisa izindawo. I-USD yeModelCraft igcina yonke into. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003ELondoloza, vula nokukhipha i-USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuletha amamodeli avela ku-SketchUp. Igcina amaqembu, izingxenye, imibala, izinhlaka zobuso, amathegi nemiphetho ethambile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-SKP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECollada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwabelana ngamamodeli nabanye abenzi bama-3D. Igcina amaqembu, izingxenye nemibala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ (\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlelo zokurenda nokubonakalisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EglTF (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibukisi zewebhu, izinjini zemidlalo, i-AR.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL (\u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D (ngamamillimitha).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPLY (\u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-mesh anemibala: ukuskena, ukuprinta ngemibala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFBX (\u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamodeli avela ezinhlelweni zopopayi nemidlalo (FBX 2011 nangaphezulu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlembic (\u003Ccode\u003E.abc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-geometry cache, ekusampula kwawo kokuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP (\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezivela ezinhlelweni zokwakha izingxenye nakubahlinzeki, njengama-mesh avaliwe ngosayizi wawo wangempela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamodeli e-NURBS: ama-polysurface, ama-mesh, amajika, amabhulokhi namazinga, njengama-mesh, imiphetho, izingxenye namathegi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF (\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D, ngemibala (ngamamillimitha). Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC (\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlelo ze-BIM, ne-BimCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG (\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpulani yesayithi noma yesitezi ukuze wakhe kuyo; nokuthumela imodeli enhlelweni ye-CAD.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF (\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo, kunoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-CAD.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela ngokuningiwe\u003C/a\u003E ichaza ngokucacile ukuthi yiyiphi into ngayinye igcina futhi iyishiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela-le-modelcraft\"\u003EIfayela le-ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E ligcina imodeli yonke: ijiyometri, amaqembu, izingxenye, imihlahlandlela, izigcawu, izinyunithi, nekhamera nesitayela owayesebenzisa ngesikhathi olondoloza. Aligcini umlando wokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"vula-imodeli\"\u003EVula imodeli\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ku-qembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma imodeli esikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolwanga, ModelCraft iyabuza: &quot;Le modeli inezinguquko ezingalondolwanga. Londoloza ikhophi kuqala?&quot; Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ikhophi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELahla izinguquko\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ivula ngezinyunithi ayalondolozwa ngazo, nekhamera ayalondolozwa ngayo. Ungaphinda uwehlise ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E ku-3D view, noma uchofoze elinye ohlwini lwamafayela amuva ekhadini lokuqala (amabhrawuza angavula kabusha ifayela, nohlelo lwe-desktop).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-desktop app, ukuchofoza kabili ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E kulivula ku-ModelCraft, njengoba \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen with\u003C/strong\u003E kwenza kwifayela le-Collada, OBJ, glTF, DWG noma DXF (lingeniswa kumodeli entsha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"londoloza-imodeli\"\u003ELondoloza imodeli\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibhrawuza lilanda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, lapho igama liyifayela owayivula khona, noma &quot;Untitled&quot; kumodeli entsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-desktop app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ifayela owayivulile endaweni yalo. Imodeli entsha ibuza ukuthi ilondolozwe kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) silondoloza ikhophi njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E noma njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E; lapho ibhrawuza likwazi, liyacela igama nendawo. Uma lingakwazi, qamba kabusha ifayela elilandiwe: ukulondoloza okulandelayo ngemva kokuvula ifayela eliqanjwe kabusha kusebenzisa igama elisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza ngakunye kuyisidingiliyo esisha. Kuya ngezilungiselelo zebhrawuza, kungena ngqo efolda yokulanda noma kubuze lapho kulondolozwa khona. Uma ifayela ngalelo gama selikhona lapho, amabhrawuza amaningi engeza inombolo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (1).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ukhethe ifolda njalo, vula izilungiselelo zebhrawuza, sesha &quot;downloads&quot; bese uvula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ukhethe ifolda njalo, vula \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ngaphansi kwe-&quot;Downloads&quot; khetha &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lapho kulanda khona, vula \u003Cstrong\u003ESafari\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E, bese usetha &quot;File download location&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qala-imodeli-entsha\"\u003EQala imodeli entsha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondolwanga, ModelCraft iyabuza kuqala. Imodeli entsha iqala ingenalutho, ngeyunithi yendawo yakho (ama-feet namainchi e-United States, amamillimitha kwenye indawo), ingenamasiteji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"uma-ibhrawuza-livala-ngaphambi-kokulondoloza\"\u003EUma ibhrawuza livala ngaphambi kokulondoloza\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft igcina ikhophi yomsebenzi ongalondolwanga ebhrawuzeni yakho imizuzwana embalwa ngemva kwawo wonke ushintsho. Ikhophi ibhalwa ngemuva, ngakho imodeli enkulu ayikubambezeli lapho igcinwa. Uma ithebhu noma ibhrawuza livala ngaphambi kokulondoloza, ngesikhathi uvula i-ModelCraft ngokulandelayo, ibuza ukuthi &quot;Buyisela umsebenzi wakho?&quot;. Ukubuyisela kuvula imodeli njengoba yayinjalo, ingakalondolwa kufayela: yilondoloze ukuze uyigcine. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EBuyisela umsebenzi wakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ku-cadcraft-vula-ku-modelcraft\"\u003EKu-CadCraft: Vula ku-ModelCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E kunikeza ukudweba okuvuliwe ku-ModelCraft ithebhu entsha, njenge-DWG. Ifika njengendlela ongayingenisa ngayo i-DWG: imigqa emhlabathini, kweqembu, ilungele ukumodela kuyo. Akukho okulayishwayo; ifayela ludlula ngesitoreji sebhrawuza yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa kwengeza ifayela kumodeli oyivulile; akulibhalisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E ku-qembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma wehlise ifayela ku-3D view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-SketchUp, Collada, OBJ, glTF, FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic, STEP, \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E, USD, DWG noma DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lifika njengeqembu elilodwa, likhethiwe, nombono usondela ukuze ulibonise. Ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi yini efikile, futhi ibale noma yini engenganginiswanga, njengo &quot;Akungeniswanga: 2 texture&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze usebenze ngejiyometri yalo ngqo, chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uhlele ngaphakathi kwalo, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkufanele ukwazi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi nesiqondiso esiphezulu:\u003C/strong\u003E Amafayela e-Collada atshela iyunithi nokuthi yiphi i-axis ephezulu, futhi ModelCraft iyaguqula. I-glTF ihlala ngamamitha. Amafayela e-OBJ awanayo iyunithi: ModelCraft iwafunda njengamamitha, ne-Y ephezulu. Uma i-OBJ ifika ingu-1000 kabili inkulu noma incane kakhulu, sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E ngesilinganiso njengo \u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG ne-DXF\u003C/strong\u003E ziza njengemigqa (imiphetho) emhlabathini, hhayi njengobuso. Uma idrowing ingatsheli iyunithi yayo, kuvela ingxoxo enesihloko esithi &quot;Izinyunithi zomdwebo&quot; ibuze ukuthi yunithi eyodwa yomdwebo iyini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EYakha ngaphezu kwepulani yesayithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImikhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela angaphezu kuka-300 MB awenqatshelwa ukungeniswa, nalawo angaphezu kuka-200 MB ukuvulwa. Amafayela anamaphoyinti noma ubuso obungaphezu kwezigidi ezi-2 awenqatshelwa njengakakhulu kakhulu. I-OBJ engaphezu kuka-64 MB iyenqatshelwa ngaphambi kokuthi ifundwe. Amafayela okubhala (Collada, OBJ, ASCII STL, USD text) afundwa ngezingxenye, cishe ngu-4 MB ngayinye, ngakho akukho sigaba esisodwa esibamba ifayela lonke; i-OBJ engu-16 MB yasebenzisa cishe ama-0.5 GB enkumbulo ivula ngesikhathi sokuhlolwa kwethu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E ku-qembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifomethi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ (.obj)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL yokuprinta (.stl, amamillimitha)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPLY ngemibala (.ply)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG ye-CAD (.dwg, 2004)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF ye-CAD (.dxf, R12)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhrawuza lilanda ifayela, liqanjwe njengemodeli. Yonke imodeli iyakhishwa, hhayi ukukhethwa kuphela. Amafayela e-glTF, Collada ne-OBJ abhalwa ngemuva, ngakho ModelCraft iqhubeka isebenza kuyilapho imodeli enkulu ikhishwa; ukulanda kuqala lapho ifayela selilungile. Imodeli engenalutho ayikhishwa: &quot;Imodeli ayinalutho: qala udwebe okuthile.&quot; Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003EKhipha imodeli ngezinye izinhlelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke ku-ModelCraft kusebenza ekhompyutheni yakho, ngakho ukumodela, ukuvula, ukulondoloza, ukungenisa nokukhipha kusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka uma uhlelo selulayishiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuvula i-ModelCraft ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, yilondoloze ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi uma usuxhumekile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lohlelo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho ibala likhuphuka (&quot;Saving 40 of 212&quot;) ngesikhathi ilondoloza. ModelCraft ilondoloza amafayela ayo (kuhlanganise nomfundi wayo we-DWG), lesi siqondiso nelabhulali ye-3D, ngakho kungathatha isikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho inkinobho ifunda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, ModelCraft ivula kulelo kheli ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokungenisa kwe-DWG kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi nakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E kamuva ukuze uthole \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E. Uma inkinobho ifunda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E, amafayela athile awalandwanga: hlola ukuxhumeka bese uchofoza ukuze uzame futhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E isho ukuthi le windi yebhrawuza ayikwazi ukugcina ikhophi (amawindi azimele namakhompyutha alawulwayo athile). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugcina ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Imodeli ngayinye ihlala lapho olilondoloza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwuxhumekile. Ungaqhubeka umodela nokulondoloza. Ngaphandle kokuthi ibha yohlelo ibonise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, ungalayishi kabusha le thebhu uze uxhumeke futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlelo-lwe-desktop\"\u003EUhlelo lwe-desktop\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsebenzisa ModelCraft ku-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwe-desktop olunawo wonke ama-app ayisishiyagalombili. Amafayela avulwa futhi alondolozwe lapho okhetha khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:web\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EIn the browser\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft isebenza ebhrawuzeni ku-Mac, Windows nase-Linux, nasku-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwe-desktop olunawo wonke ama-app ayisishiyagalombili kufakwa kunye, kusuka ku-getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"ModelCraft ifunda futhi ibhalele amafayela kukhompyutha yakho. Akukho okulayishwayo: ifayela olivulayo lifundwa ngaphakathi kwebhrawuza yakho, nefayela olilondoloza liba yisidingiliyo. Bona Lapho amafayela akho ahamba khona. Amafomethi ngokushesha Ifomethi Vula Ngenisa Khipha Yini eyenzelwe yona ModelCraft (.modelcraft) yebo cha Londoloza Ifayela lakho lokusebenza. Ligcina yonke into. USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz) yebo yebo Londoloza njenge, Khipha Izinhlelo zokurenda nokuhlanganisa izindawo. I-USD yeModelCraft igcina yonke into. Bona Londoloza, vula nokukhipha i-USD. SketchUp (.skp) cha yebo cha Ukuletha amamodeli avela ku-SketchUp. Igcina amaqembu, izingxenye, imibala, izinhlaka zobuso, amathegi nemiphetho ethambile. Bona Ngenisa imodeli ye-SKP. Collada (.dae) cha yebo yebo Ukwabelana ngamamodeli nabanye abenzi bama-3D. Igcina amaqembu, izingxenye nemibala. OBJ (.obj) cha yebo yebo Izinhlelo zokurenda nokubonakalisa. glTF (.glb, .gltf) cha yebo .glb kuphela Izibukisi zewebhu, izinjini zemidlalo, i-AR. STL (.stl) cha yebo yebo Ukuprinta nge-3D (ngamamillimitha). PLY (.ply) cha yebo yebo Ama-mesh anemibala: ukuskena, ukuprinta ngemibala. FBX (.fbx) cha yebo cha Amamodeli avela ezinhlelweni zopopayi nemidlalo (FBX 2011 nangaphezulu). Alembic (.abc) cha yebo cha Ama-geometry cache, ekusampula kwawo kokuqala. STEP (.step, .stp) cha yebo cha Izingxenye ezivela ezinhlelweni zokwakha izingxenye nakubahlinzeki, njengama-mesh avaliwe ngosayizi wawo wangempela. Bona Amafomethi amafayela. .3dm cha yebo cha Amamodeli e-NURBS: ama-polysurface, ama-mesh, amajika, amabhulokhi namazinga, njengama-mesh, imiphetho, izingxenye namathegi. Bona Ngenisa imodeli ye-.3dm. 3MF (.3mf) cha cha yebo Ukuprinta nge-3D, ngemibala (ngamamillimitha). Ku-Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…: bona Lungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D. IFC (.ifc) cha cha yebo Izinhlelo ze-BIM, ne-BimCraft. DWG (.dwg) cha yebo yebo Ipulani yesayithi noma yesitezi ukuze wakhe kuyo; nokuthumela imodeli enhlelweni ye-CAD. DXF (.dxf) cha yebo yebo Okufanayo, kunoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-CAD. Amafomethi amafayela ngokuningiwe ichaza ngokucacile ukuthi yiyiphi into ngayinye igcina futhi iyishiya. Ifayela le-ModelCraft Ifayela le-.modelcraft ligcina imodeli yonke: ijiyometri, amaqembu, izingxenye, imihlahlandlela, izigcawu, izinyunithi, nekhamera nesitayela owayesebenzisa ngesikhathi olondoloza. Aligcini umlando wokuhlehlisa. Vula imodeli Chofoza Vula ku-qembu Ifayela, noma cindezela Ctrl+O. Uma imodeli esikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolwanga, ModelCraft iyabuza: \"Le modeli inezinguquko ezingalondolwanga. Londoloza ikhophi kuqala?\" Khetha Londoloza ikhophi, Lahla izinguquko noma Khansela. Khetha ifayela le-.modelcraft. Imodeli ivula ngezinyunithi ayalondolozwa ngazo, nekhamera ayalondolozwa ngayo. Ungaphinda uwehlise ifayela le-.modelcraft ku-3D view, noma uchofoze elinye ohlwini lwamafayela amuva ekhadini lokuqala (amabhrawuza angavula kabusha ifayela, nohlelo lwe-desktop). Ku-desktop app, ukuchofoza kabili ifayela le-.modelcraft kulivula ku-ModelCraft, njengoba Open with kwenza kwifayela le-Collada, OBJ, glTF, DWG noma DXF (lingeniswa kumodeli entsha). Londoloza imodeli Chofoza Londoloza noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Ibhrawuza lilanda \u003Cname\u003E.modelcraft, lapho igama liyifayela owayivula khona, noma \"Untitled\" kumodeli entsha. Ku-desktop app, Londoloza ibhala ifayela owayivulile endaweni yalo. Imodeli entsha ibuza ukuthi ilondolozwe kuphi. Londoloza njenge (Ctrl+Shift+S) silondoloza ikhophi njengefayela le-.modelcraft noma njenge-USD; lapho ibhrawuza likwazi, liyacela igama nendawo. Uma lingakwazi, qamba kabusha ifayela elilandiwe: ukulondoloza okulandelayo ngemva kokuvula ifayela eliqanjwe kabusha kusebenzisa igama elisha. Ukulondoloza ngakunye kuyisidingiliyo esisha. Kuya ngezilungiselelo zebhrawuza, kungena ngqo efolda yokulanda noma kubuze lapho kulondolozwa khona. Uma ifayela ngalelo gama selikhona lapho, amabhrawuza amaningi engeza inombolo, njengo Untitled (1).modelcraft. Ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo, vula izilungiselelo zebhrawuza, sesha \"downloads\" bese uvula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\". Ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo, vula Settings, bese General, bese ngaphansi kwe-\"Downloads\" khetha \"Always ask you where to save files\". Ukuze ushintshe lapho kulanda khona, vula Safari, bese Settings, bese General, bese usetha \"File download location\". Qala imodeli entsha Chofoza Okusha. Uma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondolwanga, ModelCraft iyabuza kuqala. Imodeli entsha iqala ingenalutho, ngeyunithi yendawo yakho (ama-feet namainchi e-United States, amamillimitha kwenye indawo), ingenamasiteji. Uma ibhrawuza livala ngaphambi kokulondoloza ModelCraft igcina ikhophi yomsebenzi ongalondolwanga ebhrawuzeni yakho imizuzwana embalwa ngemva kwawo wonke ushintsho. Ikhophi ibhalwa ngemuva, ngakho imodeli enkulu ayikubambezeli lapho igcinwa. Uma ithebhu noma ibhrawuza livala ngaphambi kokulondoloza, ngesikhathi uvula i-ModelCraft ngokulandelayo, ibuza ukuthi \"Buyisela umsebenzi wakho?\". Ukubuyisela kuvula imodeli njengoba yayinjalo, ingakalondolwa kufayela: yilondoloze ukuze uyigcine. Bona Buyisela umsebenzi wakho. Ku-CadCraft: Vula ku-ModelCraft Kuhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft, Ukubuka, bese Okwengeziwe, bese Open in ModelCraft kunikeza ukudweba okuvuliwe ku-ModelCraft ithebhu entsha, njenge-DWG. Ifika njengendlela ongayingenisa ngayo i-DWG: imigqa emhlabathini, kweqembu, ilungele ukumodela kuyo. Akukho okulayishwayo; ifayela ludlula ngesitoreji sebhrawuza yakho. Ngenisa Ukungenisa kwengeza ifayela kumodeli oyivulile; akulibhalisi. Chofoza Ngenisa ku-qembu Ifayela, noma wehlise ifayela ku-3D view. Khetha ifayela le-SketchUp, Collada, OBJ, glTF, FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic, STEP, .3dm, USD, DWG noma DXF. Ifayela lifika njengeqembu elilodwa, likhethiwe, nombono usondela ukuze ulibonise. Ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi yini efikile, futhi ibale noma yini engenganginiswanga, njengo \"Akungeniswanga: 2 texture\". Ukuze usebenze ngejiyometri yalo ngqo, chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uhlele ngaphakathi kwalo, noma chofoza Chitha. Okufanele ukwazi: Usayizi nesiqondiso esiphezulu: Amafayela e-Collada atshela iyunithi nokuthi yiphi i-axis ephezulu, futhi ModelCraft iyaguqula. I-glTF ihlala ngamamitha. Amafayela e-OBJ awanayo iyunithi: ModelCraft iwafunda njengamamitha, ne-Y ephezulu. Uma i-OBJ ifika ingu-1000 kabili inkulu noma incane kakhulu, sebenzisa Shintsha usayizi ngesilinganiso njengo 0.001 noma 1000. DWG ne-DXF ziza njengemigqa (imiphetho) emhlabathini, hhayi njengobuso. Uma idrowing ingatsheli iyunithi yayo, kuvela ingxoxo enesihloko esithi \"Izinyunithi zomdwebo\" ibuze ukuthi yunithi eyodwa yomdwebo iyini. Bona Yakha ngaphezu kwepulani yesayithi. Imikhawulo: amafayela angaphezu kuka-300 MB awenqatshelwa ukungeniswa, nalawo angaphezu kuka-200 MB ukuvulwa. Amafayela anamaphoyinti noma ubuso obungaphezu kwezigidi ezi-2 awenqatshelwa njengakakhulu kakhulu. I-OBJ engaphezu kuka-64 MB iyenqatshelwa ngaphambi kokuthi ifundwe. Amafayela okubhala (Collada, OBJ, ASCII STL, USD text) afundwa ngezingxenye, cishe ngu-4 MB ngayinye, ngakho akukho sigaba esisodwa esibamba ifayela lonke; i-OBJ engu-16 MB yasebenzisa cishe ama-0.5 GB enkumbulo ivula ngesikhathi sokuhlolwa kwethu. Khipha Chofoza Khipha ku-qembu Ifayela. Khetha ifomethi: glTF binary (.glb), Collada (.dae), OBJ (.obj), STL yokuprinta (.stl, amamillimitha), PLY ngemibala (.ply), USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…, IFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc), DWG ye-CAD (.dwg, 2004) noma DXF ye-CAD (.dxf, R12). Ibhrawuza lilanda ifayela, liqanjwe njengemodeli. Yonke imodeli iyakhishwa, hhayi ukukhethwa kuphela. Amafayela e-glTF, Collada ne-OBJ abhalwa ngemuva, ngakho ModelCraft iqhubeka isebenza kuyilapho imodeli enkulu ikhishwa; ukulanda kuqala lapho ifayela selilungile. Imodeli engenalutho ayikhishwa: \"Imodeli ayinalutho: qala udwebe okuthile.\" Bona Khipha imodeli ngezinye izinhlelo. Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi Konke ku-ModelCraft kusebenza ekhompyutheni yakho, ngakho ukumodela, ukuvula, ukulondoloza, ukungenisa nokukhipha kusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka uma uhlelo selulayishiwe. Ukuvula i-ModelCraft ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, yilondoloze ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi uma usuxhumekile: Chofoza Save for offline ebhareni lohlelo phezulu. Inkinobho ibala likhuphuka (\"Saving 40 of 212\") ngesikhathi ilondoloza. ModelCraft ilondoloza amafayela ayo (kuhlanganise nomfundi wayo we-DWG), lesi siqondiso nelabhulali ye-3D, ngakho kungathatha isikhathi. Lapho inkinobho ifunda Offline ready, ModelCraft ivula kulelo kheli ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokungenisa kwe-DWG kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi nakho. Chofoza Offline ready kamuva ukuze uthole Save again (get the newest version) noma Remove the offline copy. Uma inkinobho ifunda Could not save, amafayela athile awalandwanga: hlola ukuxhumeka bese uchofoza ukuze uzame futhi. Offline not available isho ukuthi le windi yebhrawuza ayikwazi ukugcina ikhophi (amawindi azimele namakhompyutha alawulwayo athile). Bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukugcina ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Imodeli ngayinye ihlala lapho olilondoloza khona. Awuxhumekile. Ungaqhubeka umodela nokulondoloza. Ngaphandle kokuthi ibha yohlelo ibonise Offline ready, ungalayishi kabusha le thebhu uze uxhumeke futhi. Uhlelo lwe-desktop Usebenzisa ModelCraft ku-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwe-desktop olunawo wonke ama-app ayisishiyagalombili. Amafayela avulwa futhi alondolozwe lapho okhetha khona. ModelCraft isebenza ebhrawuzeni ku-Mac, Windows nase-Linux, nasku-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwe-desktop olunawo wonke ama-app ayisishiyagalombili kufakwa kunye, kusuka ku-getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"orbit-pan-zoom","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Zungeza, shelelisa nesondeza","summary":"Zungeza imodeli ngembewu, ipharadi, isikrini sokuthinta noma ikhibhodi, bese ufika kumibono evamile.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["zungeza","shelelisa","sondeza","ukucindezela isikhathi eside","iminwe emithathu","iminwe emibili","thepha","zula","ikhamera","ukubuka","jikisa ukubuka","ipharadi","ukuthinta","phinda","inkinobho ephakathi","sondeza izinto","ukubuka okuphelele","ukubuka ngokujula","ukubuka okuqondile","phezulu","iso"],"headings":[{"id":"ngembewu-enenkinobho-ezintathu","text":"Ngembewu enenkinobho ezintathu","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kwenkinobho-ephakathi","text":"Ngaphandle kwenkinobho ephakathi","level":2},{"id":"ku-trackpad","text":"Ku-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"esikrinini-sokuthinta","text":"Esikrinini sokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"imibono-evamile","text":"Imibono evamile","level":2},{"id":"ukubona-ngokujula-nokuprojekthwa-okulinganayo","text":"Ukubona ngokujula nokuprojekthwa okulinganayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUngahambisa ikhamera noma nini, ngisho nasesikhathini sokudweba umugqa noma ukusunduza uhlangothi: ithuluzi lilinda lapho lalifike khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngembewu-enenkinobho-ezintathu\"\u003ENgembewu enenkinobho ezintathu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (cindezela isondo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi. Ukucindezela noma ukukhulula \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi sokuhudula kushintsha phakathi kokuzungeza nokushelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula isondo. Lisondeza ngokuya ebusweni obungaphansi kwesikhombi, noma endaweni ephansi kwaso ngokujula kwesikhungo sokubuka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona imodeli yonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZungeza ijikeleza ukubuka ngokuzungeze ingxenye yemodeli ephansi kwesikhombi, ngakho leyo ndawo ihlala indawo yayo kuyilapho konke kujikeleza kuyo. Endaweni engenalutho ijikeleza ngokuzungeze isikhungo sokubuka. Shelelisa igcina iphoyinti obamba kulo ngaphansi kwesikhombi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzungeze njalo isikhungo sokubuka, noma wenze ukuzungeza nokushelelisa kusheshe noma kuhambe kancane, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOrbit and pan\u003C/strong\u003E. Izinga lisebenza ku-mouse, ku-trackpad, ekuthintweni nakumakhiyi omcibisholo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla ngaphandle kokuhudula akwenzi lutho; i-ModelCraft ayinayo imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kwenkinobho-ephakathi\"\u003ENgaphandle kwenkinobho ephakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa amathuluzi ekhamera kubha yamathuluzi, noma ikhibhodi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit\u003C/span\u003E) bese uhudula ngenkinobho yesobunxele ukuze uzungeze. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi sokuhudula ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan\u003C/span\u003E) bese uhudula ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E) bese uhudula phezulu ukuze usondele, uhudule phansi ukuze wehlise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela ukhiye welithuluzi ofuna elilandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi ekhamera athatha indawo yethuluzi osebenzisa lona. Ukuze ubuke ngaphakathi phakathi kokusebenza ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa yilo, sebenzisa ikhibhodi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye bomcibisholo bazungeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokhiye bomcibisholo kushelelisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithuluzi lokudweba lisesiphakathini sokusebenza (ngemva kochofozo lwalo lokuqala), okhiye bomcibisholo bakhiya izinqondo esikhundleni sokuzungeza. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference#lock-a-direction\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\" data-hash=\"lock-a-direction\"\u003EUkukhomba nokubamba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-trackpad\"\u003EKu-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela elula: vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, bese usetha i-Scrolling ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E (noma uyishiye ku-&quot;Work it out&quot;). Bese uswayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukuzungeza, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uswayiphe ukushelelisa, bese uphinda ngeminwe ukusondeza — azikho izinkinobho zekhamera. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\"\u003Eizilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-Scrolling isethelwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza:\u003C/strong\u003E skrola ngeminwe emibili, noma phinda ngeminwe. Kokubili kusondeza ngokuya esikhombini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushelelisa:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela ngeminwe emibili (ukuchofoza kwesibili) bese ugcina iminwe iphansi ngesikhathi uhudula. Vula &quot;Secondary click&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuzungeza:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula ngomunwe owodwa, noma sebenzisa okhiye bomcibisholo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi uchofoza kungenzeka kungabalwa njengochofozo lwesokudla ku-ModelCraft, kuye ngesiphequluli: kungasebenza njengochofozo olubanjwe ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sebenzisa ukucindezela ngeminwe emibili ukushelelisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza:\u003C/strong\u003E skrola ngeminwe emibili. Ukuphinda ngeminwe nakho kuyasondeza lapho idrayivu ye-touchpad iyithumela njengokuskrola nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushelelisa:\u003C/strong\u003E hudula ngenkinobho yesokudla (kuma-touchpad amaningi, cindezela ikhona eliphansi kwesokudla bese uhudula), noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuzungeza:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula, noma sebenzisa okhiye bomcibisholo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgembewu, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza; akushelelisi. Lokho kuphambene nakwamanye amakhasi ewebhu, futhi yindlela imbewu yesikrolo esiziphatha ngayo kuma-3D modeler amaningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhetha ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ku-ModelCraft. Ukubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokuhudula akushelelisi, njengakwamanye ama-app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikrinini-sokuthinta\"\u003EEsikrinini sokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmunwe owodwa\u003C/strong\u003E usebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje: \u003Cstrong\u003Ethepha\u003C/strong\u003E ukuchofoza, \u003Cstrong\u003Ecindezela bese uhudula\u003C/strong\u003E ukudweba noma ukuhudula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho umunwe wethuluzi lokudweba uphansi, i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eloupe\u003C/strong\u003E phezu kwawo ibonisa okungaphansi kwawo, ukuze ubone iphoyinti lokuphela, iphakathi noma umphetho okubambisa kuwo ngaphambi kokuphakamisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMamisa\u003C/strong\u003E isikhashana isigamu sesekhondi ukuqeda lokho ithuluzi elikwenzayo, njengalokho ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenza: ijika, uchungechunge lomugqa. Uma kungekho lutho olwenzekayo, ukumisa bese uhudula lo munwe ofanayo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuzungeza\u003C/strong\u003E kuze kuphakanyiswe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIminwe emibili\u003C/strong\u003E ehudulwa ndawonye \u003Cstrong\u003Eishelelisa\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003Ephinda\u003C/strong\u003E ukusondeza. Zombili zisebenza ngokunyakaza kunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIminwe emithathu\u003C/strong\u003E ehudulwa ndawonye \u003Cstrong\u003Eizungeza\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuzishintsha (iminwe emibili izungeze, emithathu ishelelise), vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, Touch screen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubeka umunwe wesibili phansi \u003Cstrong\u003Ekukhansela\u003C/strong\u003E lokho umunwe wokuqala owenzayo (umugqa wesikwele osuqalile, ukusunduza okuqhubekayo). Phakamisa iminwe bese uqala futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbha encane ngaphansi kwembono inoku-\u003Cstrong\u003EDone\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cstrong\u003ECancel\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo\u003C/strong\u003E, lapho kungekho ikhibhodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubamba nokukhetha kufika kude kancane kunenkinobho, nezinkinobho zikhulu, ngakho umunwe ungazifinyelela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikrinini sokuthinta, umunwe owodwa usebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje (thepha ukuchofoza, mamisa ukuqeda, noma mamisa bese uhudula ukuzungeza), iminwe emibili ishelelisa iphinde isondeze, iminwe emithathu izungeza, nebha encane inikeza Done, Cancel ne-Undo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imibono-evamile\"\u003EImibono evamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwesokudla kwebha yamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBottom\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kuphendukela kuleyo ndlela futhi kulingane nemodeli yonke. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E ibheka enyakatho, ngomugqa oluhlaza; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E ibheka ngqo phansi nenyakatho iphezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-view cube ekhoneni eliphezulu lesokudla lokubuka yenza okufanayo ngochofozo olulodwa, kanye nemiphetho namakhona, impompo yenkomfa yokuphendula imodeli, nenkinobho yasekhaya. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/view-cube\"\u003EI-view cube\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubona-ngokujula-nokuprojekthwa-okulinganayo\"\u003EUkubona ngokujula nokuprojekthwa okulinganayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E. Uphawu lokuhlola lusho ukuthi ukubona ngokujula kuvulekile. Lapho kuvaliwe, ukubuka kuba ukuprojekthwa okulinganayo (orthographic): imigqa elinganayo kwimodeli ihlala ilinganayo esikrinini, okuyilokho ofuna ngezinhlangothi ezivela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Perspective.&quot; noma &quot;Parallel projection.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigameko ngasinye sikhumbula ukuthi sasinokubuka ngokujula yini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EGcina izibuko njengezigameko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ungahambisa ikhamera noma nini, ngisho nasesikhathini sokudweba umugqa noma ukusunduza uhlangothi: ithuluzi lilinda lapho lalifike khona. Ngembewu enenkinobho ezintathu Ukwenza Yenza lokhu Zungeza Hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (cindezela isondo) Shelelisa Hudula ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma bamba Shift bese uhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi. Ukucindezela noma ukukhulula Shift ngesikhathi sokuhudula kushintsha phakathi kokuzungeza nokushelelisa Sondeza Phendula isondo. Lisondeza ngokuya ebusweni obungaphansi kwesikhombi, noma endaweni ephansi kwaso ngokujula kwesikhungo sokubuka Bona imodeli yonke Shift+Z noma Extents Zungeza ijikeleza ukubuka ngokuzungeze ingxenye yemodeli ephansi kwesikhombi, ngakho leyo ndawo ihlala indawo yayo kuyilapho konke kujikeleza kuyo. Endaweni engenalutho ijikeleza ngokuzungeze isikhungo sokubuka. Shelelisa igcina iphoyinti obamba kulo ngaphansi kwesikhombi. Ukuze uzungeze njalo isikhungo sokubuka, noma wenze ukuzungeza nokushelelisa kusheshe noma kuhambe kancane, vula Settings (Ctrl+,), ithebhu ye-ModelCraft, Orbit and pan. Izinga lisebenza ku-mouse, ku-trackpad, ekuthintweni nakumakhiyi omcibisholo. Ukuchofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla ngaphandle kokuhudula akwenzi lutho; i-ModelCraft ayinayo imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla. Ngaphandle kwenkinobho ephakathi Sebenzisa amathuluzi ekhamera kubha yamathuluzi, noma ikhibhodi: Cindezela O (noma chofoza Orbit) bese uhudula ngenkinobho yesobunxele ukuze uzungeze. Bamba Shift ngesikhathi sokuhudula ukuze ushelelise. Cindezela H (noma chofoza Pan) bese uhudula ukuze ushelelise. Cindezela Z (noma chofoza Zoom) bese uhudula phezulu ukuze usondele, uhudule phansi ukuze wehlise. Cindezela Space ukubuyela ku-Select, noma cindezela ukhiye welithuluzi ofuna elilandelayo. Amathuluzi ekhamera athatha indawo yethuluzi osebenzisa lona. Ukuze ubuke ngaphakathi phakathi kokusebenza ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa yilo, sebenzisa ikhibhodi: Okhiye bomcibisholo bazungeza. Shift nokhiye bomcibisholo kushelelisa. Uma ithuluzi lokudweba lisesiphakathini sokusebenza (ngemva kochofozo lwalo lokuqala), okhiye bomcibisholo bakhiya izinqondo esikhundleni sokuzungeza. Bona Ukukhomba nokubamba. Ku-trackpad Indlela elula: vula Settings (Ctrl+,), ithebhu ye-ModelCraft, bese usetha i-Scrolling ibe Trackpad (noma uyishiye ku-\"Work it out\"). Bese uswayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukuzungeza, bamba Shift uswayiphe ukushelelisa, bese uphinda ngeminwe ukusondeza — azikho izinkinobho zekhamera. Bona izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft. Uma i-Scrolling isethelwe ku-Mouse wheel: Ukusondeza: skrola ngeminwe emibili, noma phinda ngeminwe. Kokubili kusondeza ngokuya esikhombini. Ukushelelisa: cindezela ngeminwe emibili (ukuchofoza kwesibili) bese ugcina iminwe iphansi ngesikhathi uhudula. Vula \"Secondary click\" ku-System Settings, bese ku-Trackpad, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukuzungeza: cindezela O bese uhudula ngomunwe owodwa, noma sebenzisa okhiye bomcibisholo. Ukubamba Ctrl ngesikhathi uchofoza kungenzeka kungabalwa njengochofozo lwesokudla ku-ModelCraft, kuye ngesiphequluli: kungasebenza njengochofozo olubanjwe ne-Ctrl. Sebenzisa ukucindezela ngeminwe emibili ukushelelisa. Ukusondeza: skrola ngeminwe emibili. Ukuphinda ngeminwe nakho kuyasondeza lapho idrayivu ye-touchpad iyithumela njengokuskrola nge-Ctrl. Ukushelelisa: hudula ngenkinobho yesokudla (kuma-touchpad amaningi, cindezela ikhona eliphansi kwesokudla bese uhudula), noma cindezela H bese uhudula. Ukuzungeza: cindezela O bese uhudula, noma sebenzisa okhiye bomcibisholo. Ngembewu, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza; akushelelisi. Lokho kuphambene nakwamanye amakhasi ewebhu, futhi yindlela imbewu yesikrolo esiziphatha ngayo kuma-3D modeler amaningi. Space ikhetha ithuluzi le-Select ku-ModelCraft. Ukubamba Space nokuhudula akushelelisi, njengakwamanye ama-app. Esikrinini sokuthinta Umunwe owodwa usebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje: thepha ukuchofoza, cindezela bese uhudula ukudweba noma ukuhudula. Lapho umunwe wethuluzi lokudweba uphansi, i-loupe phezu kwawo ibonisa okungaphansi kwawo, ukuze ubone iphoyinti lokuphela, iphakathi noma umphetho okubambisa kuwo ngaphambi kokuphakamisa. Mamisa isikhashana isigamu sesekhondi ukuqeda lokho ithuluzi elikwenzayo, njengalokho ukucindezela Enter kwenza: ijika, uchungechunge lomugqa. Uma kungekho lutho olwenzekayo, ukumisa bese uhudula lo munwe ofanayo kuzungeza kuze kuphakanyiswe. Iminwe emibili ehudulwa ndawonye ishelelisa; phinda ukusondeza. Zombili zisebenza ngokunyakaza kunye. Iminwe emithathu ehudulwa ndawonye izungeza. Ukuzishintsha (iminwe emibili izungeze, emithathu ishelelise), vula Settings, ithebhu ye-ModelCraft, Touch screen. Ukubeka umunwe wesibili phansi kukhansela lokho umunwe wokuqala owenzayo (umugqa wesikwele osuqalile, ukusunduza okuqhubekayo). Phakamisa iminwe bese uqala futhi. Ibha encane ngaphansi kwembono inoku-Done (Enter), Cancel (Esc) ne-Undo, lapho kungekho ikhibhodi. Ukubamba nokukhetha kufika kude kancane kunenkinobho, nezinkinobho zikhulu, ngakho umunwe ungazifinyelela. Esikrinini sokuthinta, umunwe owodwa usebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje (thepha ukuchofoza, mamisa ukuqeda, noma mamisa bese uhudula ukuzungeza), iminwe emibili ishelelisa iphinde isondeze, iminwe emithathu izungeza, nebha encane inikeza Done, Cancel ne-Undo. Imibono evamile Chofoza Views ekugcineni kwesokudla kwebha yamathuluzi. Khetha Iso, Top, Front, Right, Back, Left noma Bottom. Ukubuka kuphendukela kuleyo ndlela futhi kulingane nemodeli yonke. Front ibheka enyakatho, ngomugqa oluhlaza; Top ibheka ngqo phansi nenyakatho iphezulu. I-view cube ekhoneni eliphezulu lesokudla lokubuka yenza okufanayo ngochofozo olulodwa, kanye nemiphetho namakhona, impompo yenkomfa yokuphendula imodeli, nenkinobho yasekhaya. Bona I-view cube. Ukubona ngokujula nokuprojekthwa okulinganayo Khetha Views, bese Perspective. Uphawu lokuhlola lusho ukuthi ukubona ngokujula kuvulekile. Lapho kuvaliwe, ukubuka kuba ukuprojekthwa okulinganayo (orthographic): imigqa elinganayo kwimodeli ihlala ilinganayo esikrinini, okuyilokho ofuna ngezinhlangothi ezivela ku-Front noma Right. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Perspective.\" noma \"Parallel projection.\" Isigameko ngasinye sikhumbula ukuthi sasinokubuka ngokujula yini. Bona Gcina izibuko njengezigameko.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"view-cube","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ikhyubhu lokubuka","summary":"Chofoza uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona yekhyubhu ekhoneni le-view ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, yidonse ukuze uyizungeze, phendula indilinga yekhampasi, ujikeleze ukubuka okubheke phambili, bese ubuyela ekhaya.","section":"tasks","order":11,"keywords":["ikhyubhu lokubuka","view cube","viewcube","ikhyubhu","ikhampasi","isever","indawo yekhaya","ukubuka okujwayelekile","phezulu","phambili","ngakwesokudla","iso","ikhona","umphetho","zungeza","phendula ukubuka","isithonjana se-axis","isikhombi sekhona","ukuzulazula"],"headings":[{"id":"bheka-kusuka-kohlangothi-komphetho-noma-ikhona","text":"Bheka kusuka kohlangothi, komphetho noma ikhona","level":2},{"id":"zungeza-ngokudonsa-ikhyubhu","text":"Zungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu","level":2},{"id":"indilinga-yekhampasi","text":"Indilinga yekhampasi","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-okubheke-phambili-utolo","text":"Ukubuka okubheke phambili: utolo","level":2},{"id":"ekhaya","text":"Ekhaya","level":2},{"id":"ngekhibhodi","text":"Ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"ucezu-lwe-axis-noma-akukho","text":"Ucezu lwe-axis noma akukho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka lihlala ekhoneni elingaphezulu kwesokudla se-3D view. Liphendukela nombono, ngakho ilokhu likhombisa ukuthi ubheka kuphi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E iphezulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E ibheka eningizimu (ubheka enyakatho, ngomugqa oluhlaza lapho uyibheka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E ibheka empumalanga (i-axis ebomvu). Ihlala ibonakala ngokukhanya kuze kube yilapho uyibheka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-kusuka-kohlangothi-komphetho-noma-ikhona\"\u003EBheka kusuka kohlangothi, komphetho noma ikhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka ikhyubhu. Ingxenye ephansi kwe-pointer iyakhanya: uhlangothi oluphakathi, umphetho (ukhanya kokubili izinhlangothi ezihlanganyelwa yiwo) noma ikhona (kuzo zonke izinhlangothi ezintathu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza. Ukubuka kuyaphenduka kusukela lapho, kugcina iphakathi nezoom efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKukhona izindawo ezingu-26 okufanele uzichofoze: izinhlangothi ezi-6 (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgasemuva\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E), imiphetho eyi-12 nezikhona ezi-8. Ikhona inikeza ukubuka okujwayelekile okungxenye yezintathu; umphetho ubukeka uphakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E kufana ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar, ngaphandle kokusondeza ukuze kugcwale. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E isasondeza imodeli yonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zungeza-ngokudonsa-ikhyubhu\"\u003EZungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ikhyubhu ukuze uphendule ukubuka, njengokuzungeza ku-view uqobo. Ukudonsa akuthathwa njengokuchofoza, ngakho ungayibamba noma kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indilinga-yekhampasi\"\u003EIndilinga yekhampasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndilinga engaphansi kwekhyubhu iphethe N, E, S no-W.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa indilinga\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uphendule imodeli ezungeze eceleni eliqondile, njengoba ime esitezeni esijikelezayo. Indilinga ilandela i-pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza uhlamvu\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubuke kuleyo nhlangothi, ugcine ukuthi ubheka kanjani phansi. Ekubukeni okuvela phezulu ngqo, uhlamvu ochofoza kulo luya ezansi kwesikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-okubheke-phambili-utolo\"\u003EUkubuka okubheke phambili: utolo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ubheka ngqo esihlangothini, utolo olumbalwa luvela ezungeze ikhyubhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinxantathu ezine \u003Cstrong\u003Ezilethe\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso baleso sicelo phambili: unxantathu ongaphezulu kwekhyubhu ukhombisa ubuso obabusendaweni ephezulu, njalo njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinkomba ezimbili \u003Cstrong\u003Eezigobile\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphezulu kwesokudla zijikisa isithombe ngengxenye yesine yokujikeleza ngakwesokudla noma ngakwesobunxele, ingazishintshi ukuthi ubheka ubuso bani. Zisebenzise ukuze ujikise ipulani ukuze udonga olude lugijime lunqamule isikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ekhaya\"\u003EEkhaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho yendlu engaphezulu kwesobunxele sekhyubhu ibuyela ekubukeni okungxenye yezintathu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E bese igcwalisa imodeli yonke. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza okufanayo lapho ikhyubhu inokugxila kwekhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngekhibhodi\"\u003ENgekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuya kukhyubhu, bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhetha uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona ezungeze ikhyubhu, ngezinyathelo zengxenye yesi-8 sokujikeleza (abafundi besikrini batshela ukuthi yiliphi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhetha okuphakeme noma okuphansi, kuze kufike ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E noma kuze kufike ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebuka kusuka kolukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift →\"\u003E⇧→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ejikisa ukubuka ngengxenye yesine yokujikeleza ngendiza eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukubuka kwekhaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ephuma ekhyubhini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkhiye acindezelwe ekhyubhini bahlala nekhyubhu: abaqali amathuluzi e-ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ucezu-lwe-axis-noma-akukho\"\u003EUcezu lwe-axis noma akukho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, bese ubeka \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhombi sekhona\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithonjana se-axis\u003C/span\u003E (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngaphansi kwesobunxele: X obomvu, Y oluhlaza, Z oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukho\u003C/span\u003E. Lesi siphequluli sikhumbula ukukhetha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#corner-indicator\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"corner-indicator\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayinayo ukujikeleza okuphambili (roll): ngaphandle kokubuka okuqondile phansi nokuqondile phezulu, phezulu esikrinini kuhlala kuphezulu kumodeli. Ikhyubhu nezinkomba ezigobile zingajikisa ipulani; azikwazi ukuwisa ukubuka okuhlangothini ngaseceleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ikhyubhu lokubuka lihlala ekhoneni elingaphezulu kwesokudla se-3D view. Liphendukela nombono, ngakho ilokhu likhombisa ukuthi ubheka kuphi: Phezulu iphezulu, Phambili ibheka eningizimu (ubheka enyakatho, ngomugqa oluhlaza lapho uyibheka), Ngakwesokudla ibheka empumalanga (i-axis ebomvu). Ihlala ibonakala ngokukhanya kuze kube yilapho uyibheka. Bheka kusuka kohlangothi, komphetho noma ikhona Bheka ikhyubhu. Ingxenye ephansi kwe-pointer iyakhanya: uhlangothi oluphakathi, umphetho (ukhanya kokubili izinhlangothi ezihlanganyelwa yiwo) noma ikhona (kuzo zonke izinhlangothi ezintathu). Chofoza. Ukubuka kuyaphenduka kusukela lapho, kugcina iphakathi nezoom efanayo. Kukhona izindawo ezingu-26 okufanele uzichofoze: izinhlangothi ezi-6 (Phezulu, Phansi, Phambili, Ngasemuva, Ngakwesobunxele, Ngakwesokudla), imiphetho eyi-12 nezikhona ezi-8. Ikhona inikeza ukubuka okujwayelekile okungxenye yezintathu; umphetho ubukeka uphakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili. Ukuchofoza Phambili kufana ne-Ukubuka, Phambili ku-toolbar, ngaphandle kokusondeza ukuze kugcwale. Ukubuka isasondeza imodeli yonke. Zungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu Donsa ikhyubhu ukuze uphendule ukubuka, njengokuzungeza ku-view uqobo. Ukudonsa akuthathwa njengokuchofoza, ngakho ungayibamba noma kuphi. Indilinga yekhampasi Indilinga engaphansi kwekhyubhu iphethe N, E, S no-W. Donsa indilinga ukuze uphendule imodeli ezungeze eceleni eliqondile, njengoba ime esitezeni esijikelezayo. Indilinga ilandela i-pointer. Chofoza uhlamvu ukuze ubuke kuleyo nhlangothi, ugcine ukuthi ubheka kanjani phansi. Ekubukeni okuvela phezulu ngqo, uhlamvu ochofoza kulo luya ezansi kwesikrini. Ukubuka okubheke phambili: utolo Uma ubheka ngqo esihlangothini, utolo olumbalwa luvela ezungeze ikhyubhu: Izinxantathu ezine zilethe ubuso baleso sicelo phambili: unxantathu ongaphezulu kwekhyubhu ukhombisa ubuso obabusendaweni ephezulu, njalo njalo. Izinkomba ezimbili ezigobile ngaphezulu kwesokudla zijikisa isithombe ngengxenye yesine yokujikeleza ngakwesokudla noma ngakwesobunxele, ingazishintshi ukuthi ubheka ubuso bani. Zisebenzise ukuze ujikise ipulani ukuze udonga olude lugijime lunqamule isikrini. Ekhaya Inkinobho yendlu engaphezulu kwesobunxele sekhyubhu ibuyela ekubukeni okungxenye yezintathu Iso bese igcwalisa imodeli yonke. Home yenza okufanayo lapho ikhyubhu inokugxila kwekhibhodi. Ngekhibhodi Tab ukuya kukhyubhu, bese: Ukhiye Kwenza ← / → khetha uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona ezungeze ikhyubhu, ngezinyathelo zengxenye yesi-8 sokujikeleza (abafundi besikrini batshela ukuthi yiliphi) ↑ / ↓ khetha okuphakeme noma okuphansi, kuze kufike ku-Phezulu noma kuze kufike ku-Phansi Enter noma Space buka kusuka kolukhethiwe Shift+← / Shift+→ jikisa ukubuka ngengxenye yesine yokujikeleza ngendiza eqondile Home ukubuka kwekhaya Esc phuma ekhyubhini Okhiye acindezelwe ekhyubhini bahlala nekhyubhu: abaqali amathuluzi e-ModelCraft. Ucezu lwe-axis noma akukho Vula Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,), ithebhu ye-ModelCraft, bese ubeka Isikhombi sekhona ku-Ikhyubhu lokubuka (okokuqala), Isithonjana se-axis (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngaphansi kwesobunxele: X obomvu, Y oluhlaza, Z oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma Akukho. Lesi siphequluli sikhumbula ukukhetha. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft. I-ModelCraft ayinayo ukujikeleza okuphambili (roll): ngaphandle kokubuka okuqondile phansi nokuqondile phezulu, phezulu esikrinini kuhlala kuphezulu kumodeli. Ikhyubhu nezinkomba ezigobile zingajikisa ipulani; azikwazi ukuwisa ukubuka okuhlangothini ngaseceleni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"draw-faces","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dweba ubuso ngemigqa, ngounxande, ngezindilinga nangomnsalo","summary":"Yenza ubuso obusicaba phansi noma ebusweni obunye, buhlukaniswe ngemigqa, futhi udwebe izindilinga namapholigoni ngenani lezinhlangothi ofuna lona.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["dweba","umugqa","unxande","indilinga","ipholigoni","phambanisa","inset","ifreyimu","umbheda","umbhalo wangaphandle","umnsalo","ijika","ispline","bushelezi","intambo","indlela","ubuso","hlukanisa","izinhlangothi","izigaba","ukuhlaziywa","ipensela"],"headings":[{"id":"dweba-unxande","text":"Dweba unxande","level":2},{"id":"dweba-indilinga-noma-ipholigoni","text":"Dweba indilinga noma ipholigoni","level":2},{"id":"dweba-umnsalo","text":"Dweba umnsalo","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ijika-elibushelezi","text":"Dweba ijika elibushelezi","level":2},{"id":"phambanisa-umbheda-ngaphakathi-noma-ngaphandle-kobuso","text":"Phambanisa: umbheda ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle kobuso","level":2},{"id":"umnsalo-izindilinga-namapholigoni-ngamajika","text":"Umnsalo, izindilinga namapholigoni ngamajika","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ngemigqa","text":"Dweba ngemigqa","level":2},{"id":"lapho-umugqa-uya-khona-uma-ungathintani-nanoma-yini","text":"Lapho umugqa uya khona uma ungathintani nanoma yini","level":3},{"id":"hlukanisa-ubuso","text":"Hlukanisa ubuso","level":2},{"id":"ubuso-obubheke-ngendlela-engafanele","text":"Ubuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele","level":2},{"id":"okubonayo-lapho-udweba","text":"Okubonayo lapho udweba","level":2},{"id":"uma-isimo-singekho-lapho-ulindele-khona","text":"Uma isimo singekho lapho ulindele khona","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKonke ku-ModelCraft kuqala njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eface\u003C/strong\u003E esicaba: indawo evalwe imiphetho. Ungadweba ubuso ngqo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E, noma wenze umbhalo womphetho ngamunye ngesikhathi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E. Ubuso yilokho \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\"\u003ECindezela/donsa\u003C/a\u003E okuguqulwa kube yizinto eziqinile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-unxande\"\u003EDweba unxande\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona lokuqala: phansi, noma kunoma yiluphi ubuso bomodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombisi. Unxande uhlala phansi (noma ebusweni obuqale kulo), futhi ibhokisi lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E) likhombisa ububanzi nokujula kwawo. Ithiphu lithi &quot;Isikwele&quot; uma izinhlangothi zilingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze udwebe endizeni enye, nikeza kuyo: ubuso okudlula kulo ikhona lokuqala lwenza unxande ebusweni boba, futhi ukubamba indawo engaphandle kwendiza (iphoyinti, umphetho, i-axis eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) kumisa unxande ngakho kokubili amakhona. Buyela ekubambeni indiza yokuqala bese ulala phansi futhi. Ukuze ugcine indiza eyodwa, cindezela ukhiye wompengo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina unxande ulingene (indiza eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E indiza ebomvu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E indiza eluhlaza. Cindezela ukhiye ofanayo futhi ukuze uvule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona elingaphambili, noma thayipha izilinganiso ezimbili ezihlukaniswe ikhoma bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E4000,3000\u003C/code\u003E kumodeli yamamillimitha, noma \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;,10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ngamafidi namayintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuvela ubuso obunemiphetho emine ezungezile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilinganiso othayipha ziya ohlangothini obekhomba kulo: uma isikhombisi sisecaleni lesobunxele lekhona lokuqala ngesikhathi uthayipha, unxande ukhula ngakwesobunxele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhoma lihlukanisa izilinganiso ezimbili, ngakho alikwazi ukuba uphawu lwamadesimali. Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, hhayi \u003Ccode\u003E2,5m\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-indilinga-noma-ipholigoni\"\u003EDweba indilinga noma ipholigoni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole indilinga noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ipholigoni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ushintshe inani lezinhlangothi, lithayiphe ngaphambi kokuchofoza: \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E nje) bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Indilinga iqala ngezinhlangothi ezingu-24 nepholigoni ngezingu-6. Ithiphu likhombisa inani lamanje, futhi i-ModelCraft iligcina endilingeni elandelayo kuze kube yilapho ushintsha inani noma ushintsha amathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isikhungo, phansi noma ebusweni. Ukuze uligxilise ebusweni, nikeza ephakathi kobuso (&quot;Isikhungo sobuso&quot;) noma ephakathi komphetho wabo (&quot;Iphakathi&quot;) ngesikhombisi siphakathi kalobo buso: indilinga idwetshwa kuleso buso, ngisho nasekugcineni okuncane kwebhokisi elide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuze usethe umsakazo, noma uwuthayiphe (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E kubhokisi lenani) bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndilinga iyipholigoni enezinhlangothi eziningi. Uma udonsa indilinga phezulu nge-Cindezela/donsa, izinhlangothi zayo ziyathambiswa ukuze isilinda sibonakale njengobuso obubodwa obushelezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-umnsalo\"\u003EDweba umnsalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho umnsalo uqala khona, bese lapho uphela khona (noma thayipha ubude phakathi kwawo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombisi ukuze umnsalo ukhuphuke ngaphandle, bese uchofoza. Ithiphu lithi &quot;Isigamu sendilinga&quot; uma ukukhuphuka kuyisigamu sebanga phakathi kweziphetho. Noma thayipha ukuthi iphakathi limi kanjani: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze udwebe umnsalo ozungeze iphoyinti, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo osuka embindeni\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza isikhungo, bese lapho umnsalo uqala khona (noma thayipha umsakazo), bese lapho uphela khona (noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E). Ubamba ngezinyathelo ze-15°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmnsalo oqalwe ebusweni udwetshwa kuleso buso; kungenjalo uhlala phansi, noma uma izinhlangothi zawo zimi ngobude obuhlukile umi uqondile. Umnsalo unezigaba eziyi-12; thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E ngesikhathi udweba ukuze uthole ezinye. Umnsalo nawo uvala ubuso njengemigqa: umnsalo ophambi kwekhona lesikwele uyihlukanisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ijika-elibushelezi\"\u003EDweba ijika elibushelezi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E udweba umugqa obushelezi odlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti ochofoza: intambo, indlela yerelingi, umphetho wensimu. Ingashiya phansi: amaphoyinti abamba emakhoneni, emiphethweni nasezindaweni zobuso noma yikuphi, nezinkinobho zompengo zikhiya okubomvu, okuluhlaza noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti ijika elidlula kuwo. Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;0,0,1&gt;\u003C/code\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole iphoyinti elingu-1 ngaphezulu kwelokugcina, \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthole indawo enembile, noma ubude ukuze uthole iphoyinti elikude kangaka ngasesikhombisini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze kabili ukuze uqede. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuze uvale ijika. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ususa iphoyinti lokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIjika likhethwa njengento eyodwa. Ukuzeulishintshe, likhethe bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela amaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E: amaphoyinti abonakala njengamasikwele. Chofoza eyodwa, bese uchofoza lapho ifuna khona (noma thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ubuyisela iphoyinti, futhi aphelise ukuhlela. Ijika elivaliwe elisicaba lenza ubuso; ijika elibumba ubuso alisakwazi ukuhlelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phambanisa-umbheda-ngaphakathi-noma-ngaphandle-kobuso\"\u003EPhambanisa: umbheda ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle kobuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha umbhalo wobuso ngobude obuthile ngaphakathi kwawo (noma ngaphandle), kuma-ifreyimu, emibhedeni, emibhedeni yewindi noma kwingilazi yesikrini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso, noma khetha ubuso kuqala bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombisi ngaphakathi kobuso ukuze uthole umbhalo wangaphakathi, noma ngaphandle kwawo ukuze uthole owangaphandle. Umugqa omusha uyalandela, futhi ithiphu lisho ukuthi kukhashana kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso uhlukaniseka ibe ezimbili: ubuso bangaphakathi nefreyimu eliwuzungezile (noma indandatho entsha ngaphandle). Cindezela/donsa noma yiliphi kulezi ngqo: ngesikrini, dweba ibhokisi, uyicindezele ibe ubukhulu balo, uphambanise ubuso bangaphambili ngama-30 mm ngaphakathi bese ucindezela ubuso bangaphakathi kancane ukuze kube ingilazi. Izimbobo ebusweni nazo ziyaphambanisa, futhi umnsalo noma indilinga ihlala ijika elilodwa (elincane noma elikhulu).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza kabili\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uphambanise ngebanga lokugcina futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha ichungechunge lemiphetho exhunyiwe endizeni eyodwa (isibonelo imigqa emibili ye-L), cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hambela ohlangothini ofuna lona bese uthayipha ibanga: kudwetshwa ikhophi elilingene, namakhona ahlanganiswe ngombandela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ibangaliphezu kwalokho ubuso obuvumayo, i-ModelCraft iyasho lokho futhi ayidwetshi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umnsalo-izindilinga-namapholigoni-ngamajika\"\u003EUmnsalo, izindilinga namapholigoni ngamajika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza noma yiliphi isegimenti lomnsalo, indilinga noma ipholigoni bese ijika lonke liyakhethwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E bese likhombisa umsakazo waso, izigaba zawo, i-engeli (kumanmsalo) nobude bawo. Thayipha umsakazo omusha lapho ukuze uwulungise ngokuzungeza esikhungweni sawo; ubuso obudwetshwe endizeni yawo buyalandela. Uma ubuso bejika sebucindezelwe noma sebudonswe, umsakazo wabo uhlala njengoba unjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ngemigqa\"\u003EDweba ngemigqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho uphela khona, noma thayipha ubude bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ubude othayiphayo buya ohlangothini okhombisa kulo isikhombisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhubeka uchofoza. Ukuchofoza ngayinye kuqala umugqa olandelayo kusukela ekugcineni komugqa wangaphambilini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala umbhalo wangaphandle ngokuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi. Lapho imigqa ivala ilupu elisicaba, igcwala ngobuso bese ithuluzi limisa ukuxhumanisa. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise noma nini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa ilandela izinqondo ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezibhakabhaka uma useduze kwazo; umugqa uphenduka leyo mbala bese ithiphu lithi &quot;Kwi-axis ebomvu&quot;. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003EUkuqagela nokubamba\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole ukuthi ungakhiya kanjani inqondo nokubamba amaphoyinti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lapho-umugqa-uya-khona-uma-ungathintani-nanoma-yini\"\u003ELapho umugqa uya khona uma ungathintani nanoma yini\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa oqala ebusweni uhlala endizeni yalobo buso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa oqala phansi, noma endaweni engenalutho, uhlala ulingana nephoyinti lokuqala. Uma ubheka imodeli ngaphambili, kunalokho uya endizeni eqondile ebheke kuwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze udwebe umugqa uye endaweni enembile, thayipha iphoyinti: \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E ephoyintini emodelini, noma \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthole ukuphambuka kusukela ekuqaleni. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EThayipha izilinganiso ezinembile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlukanisa-ubuso\"\u003EHlukanisa ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba umugqa ngaphesheya kobuso, ukusuka emphethweni uye kwelinye (noma emphethweni uye kwelinye ngemigqa eminye). Ubuso buhlukaniseka ube ezimbili. Ngayinye igcina uhlangothi lwayo nombala wayo. Okufanayo kusebenza nounxande noma indilinga edwetshwe ebusweni: isimo sibe ubuso bayo ngaphakathi kobukhulu, obuthi manje bube nembobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYile ndlela okwakha ngayo amagumbi ebhuleki lesitezi, iwindi edongeni, noma isinyathelo esitendeni: dweba umbhalo ebusweni, bese ucindezela noma udonse ubuso obusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso-obubheke-ngendlela-engafanele\"\u003EUbuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso ngabunye bunengaphambili nangemuva. Ingemuva libonakala luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu. Ubuso obudwetshwe phansi buhlala buqonde phezulu; ubuso obudwetshwe ebusweni obunye buqonde ngendlela efanayo nalobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ubuso bukhombisa ingemuva lapho ulindele ingaphambili, likhethe bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ubuso\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonayo-lapho-udweba\"\u003EOkubonayo lapho udweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUphawu olunemibala lapho isikhombisi sibamba khona, negama lalo kuthiphu ngakwesobunxele esiphansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubuka kuqala komugqa noma isimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbukhulu bangempela kubhokisi lenani. Ungathayipha phezu kwawo noma nini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-isimo-singekho-lapho-ulindele-khona\"\u003EUma isimo singekho lapho ulindele khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsikrinini sokuthinta, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#a-shape-starts-in-the-wrong-place-on-a-touch-screen\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"a-shape-starts-in-the-wrong-place-on-a-touch-screen\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umugqa ubambe okuthile okude ngemuva, zungeza kancane: amaphoyinti afihlwe ngemuva kobuso awambeki ngakho, kodwa amaphoyinti asemphethweni walo ayambeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uhlehlise isimo sokugcina; ukuhlehlisa kukodwa kususa umugqa owodwa noma isimo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Konke ku-ModelCraft kuqala njenge-face esicaba: indawo evalwe imiphetho. Ungadweba ubuso ngqo nge-Unxande, Indilinga noma Ipholigoni, noma wenze umbhalo womphetho ngamunye ngesikhathi nge-Umugqa. Ubuso yilokho Cindezela/donsa okuguqulwa kube yizinto eziqinile. Dweba unxande Cindezela R. Chofoza ikhona lokuqala: phansi, noma kunoma yiluphi ubuso bomodeli. Hambisa isikhombisi. Unxande uhlala phansi (noma ebusweni obuqale kulo), futhi ibhokisi lenani (Izilinganiso) likhombisa ububanzi nokujula kwawo. Ithiphu lithi \"Isikwele\" uma izinhlangothi zilingana. Ukuze udwebe endizeni enye, nikeza kuyo: ubuso okudlula kulo ikhona lokuqala lwenza unxande ebusweni boba, futhi ukubamba indawo engaphandle kwendiza (iphoyinti, umphetho, i-axis eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) kumisa unxande ngakho kokubili amakhona. Buyela ekubambeni indiza yokuqala bese ulala phansi futhi. Ukuze ugcine indiza eyodwa, cindezela ukhiye wompengo: ↑ igcina unxande ulingene (indiza eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka), → indiza ebomvu, ← indiza eluhlaza. Cindezela ukhiye ofanayo futhi ukuze uvule. Chofoza ikhona elingaphambili, noma thayipha izilinganiso ezimbili ezihlukaniswe ikhoma bese ucindezela Enter: 4m,3m, 4000,3000 kumodeli yamamillimitha, noma 12',10'6\" ngamafidi namayintshi. Kuvela ubuso obunemiphetho emine ezungezile. Izilinganiso othayipha ziya ohlangothini obekhomba kulo: uma isikhombisi sisecaleni lesobunxele lekhona lokuqala ngesikhathi uthayipha, unxande ukhula ngakwesobunxele. Ikhoma lihlukanisa izilinganiso ezimbili, ngakho alikwazi ukuba uphawu lwamadesimali. Thayipha 2.5m,3m, hhayi 2,5m. Dweba indilinga noma ipholigoni Cindezela C ukuze uthole indilinga noma N ukuze uthole ipholigoni. Ukuze ushintshe inani lezinhlangothi, lithayiphe ngaphambi kokuchofoza: 12s (noma 12 nje) bese Enter. Indilinga iqala ngezinhlangothi ezingu-24 nepholigoni ngezingu-6. Ithiphu likhombisa inani lamanje, futhi i-ModelCraft iligcina endilingeni elandelayo kuze kube yilapho ushintsha inani noma ushintsha amathuluzi. Chofoza isikhungo, phansi noma ebusweni. Ukuze uligxilise ebusweni, nikeza ephakathi kobuso (\"Isikhungo sobuso\") noma ephakathi komphetho wabo (\"Iphakathi\") ngesikhombisi siphakathi kalobo buso: indilinga idwetshwa kuleso buso, ngisho nasekugcineni okuncane kwebhokisi elide. Chofoza ukuze usethe umsakazo, noma uwuthayiphe (Umsakazo kubhokisi lenani) bese ucindezela Enter. Indilinga iyipholigoni enezinhlangothi eziningi. Uma udonsa indilinga phezulu nge-Cindezela/donsa, izinhlangothi zayo ziyathambiswa ukuze isilinda sibonakale njengobuso obubodwa obushelezi. Dweba umnsalo Cindezela A (Umnsalo). Chofoza lapho umnsalo uqala khona, bese lapho uphela khona (noma thayipha ubude phakathi kwawo). Hambisa isikhombisi ukuze umnsalo ukhuphuke ngaphandle, bese uchofoza. Ithiphu lithi \"Isigamu sendilinga\" uma ukukhuphuka kuyisigamu sebanga phakathi kweziphetho. Noma thayipha ukuthi iphakathi limi kanjani: 2 bese Enter. Ukuze udwebe umnsalo ozungeze iphoyinti, sebenzisa Umnsalo osuka embindeni: chofoza isikhungo, bese lapho umnsalo uqala khona (noma thayipha umsakazo), bese lapho uphela khona (noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri, njengo 90). Ubamba ngezinyathelo ze-15°. Umnsalo oqalwe ebusweni udwetshwa kuleso buso; kungenjalo uhlala phansi, noma uma izinhlangothi zawo zimi ngobude obuhlukile umi uqondile. Umnsalo unezigaba eziyi-12; thayipha 24s ngesikhathi udweba ukuze uthole ezinye. Umnsalo nawo uvala ubuso njengemigqa: umnsalo ophambi kwekhona lesikwele uyihlukanisa. Dweba ijika elibushelezi Ijika udweba umugqa obushelezi odlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti ochofoza: intambo, indlela yerelingi, umphetho wensimu. Ingashiya phansi: amaphoyinti abamba emakhoneni, emiphethweni nasezindaweni zobuso noma yikuphi, nezinkinobho zompengo zikhiya okubomvu, okuluhlaza noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka njenge-Umugqa. Chofoza Ijika eqenjini le-Dweba. Chofoza amaphoyinti ijika elidlula kuwo. Thayipha \u003C0,0,1\u003E bese Enter ukuze uthole iphoyinti elingu-1 ngaphezulu kwelokugcina, [x,y,z] ukuze uthole indawo enembile, noma ubude ukuze uthole iphoyinti elikude kangaka ngasesikhombisini. Cindezela Enter noma uchofoze kabili ukuze uqede. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuze uvale ijika. Backspace ususa iphoyinti lokugcina. Ijika likhethwa njengento eyodwa. Ukuzeulishintshe, likhethe bese uchofoza Hlela amaphoyinti ku-Ulwazi lwento: amaphoyinti abonakala njengamasikwele. Chofoza eyodwa, bese uchofoza lapho ifuna khona (noma thayipha \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E). Esc ubuyisela iphoyinti, futhi aphelise ukuhlela. Ijika elivaliwe elisicaba lenza ubuso; ijika elibumba ubuso alisakwazi ukuhlelwa. Phambanisa: umbheda ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle kobuso Phambanisa ikopisha umbhalo wobuso ngobude obuthile ngaphakathi kwawo (noma ngaphandle), kuma-ifreyimu, emibhedeni, emibhedeni yewindi noma kwingilazi yesikrini. Cindezela F bese uchofoza ubuso, noma khetha ubuso kuqala bese ucindezela F. Hambisa isikhombisi ngaphakathi kobuso ukuze uthole umbhalo wangaphakathi, noma ngaphandle kwawo ukuze uthole owangaphandle. Umugqa omusha uyalandela, futhi ithiphu lisho ukuthi kukhashana kangakanani. Chofoza, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter. Ubuso uhlukaniseka ibe ezimbili: ubuso bangaphakathi nefreyimu eliwuzungezile (noma indandatho entsha ngaphandle). Cindezela/donsa noma yiliphi kulezi ngqo: ngesikrini, dweba ibhokisi, uyicindezele ibe ubukhulu balo, uphambanise ubuso bangaphambili ngama-30 mm ngaphakathi bese ucindezela ubuso bangaphakathi kancane ukuze kube ingilazi. Izimbobo ebusweni nazo ziyaphambanisa, futhi umnsalo noma indilinga ihlala ijika elilodwa (elincane noma elikhulu). Chofoza kabili ubuso nge-Phambanisa ukuze uphambanise ngebanga lokugcina futhi. Imiphetho: khetha ichungechunge lemiphetho exhunyiwe endizeni eyodwa (isibonelo imigqa emibili ye-L), cindezela F, hambela ohlangothini ofuna lona bese uthayipha ibanga: kudwetshwa ikhophi elilingene, namakhona ahlanganiswe ngombandela. Uma ibangaliphezu kwalokho ubuso obuvumayo, i-ModelCraft iyasho lokho futhi ayidwetshi lutho. Umnsalo, izindilinga namapholigoni ngamajika Chofoza noma yiliphi isegimenti lomnsalo, indilinga noma ipholigoni bese ijika lonke liyakhethwa. Ulwazi lwento bese likhombisa umsakazo waso, izigaba zawo, i-engeli (kumanmsalo) nobude bawo. Thayipha umsakazo omusha lapho ukuze uwulungise ngokuzungeza esikhungweni sawo; ubuso obudwetshwe endizeni yawo buyalandela. Uma ubuso bejika sebucindezelwe noma sebudonswe, umsakazo wabo uhlala njengoba unjalo. Dweba ngemigqa Cindezela L. Chofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona. Chofoza lapho uphela khona, noma thayipha ubude bese ucindezela Enter. Ubude othayiphayo buya ohlangothini okhombisa kulo isikhombisi. Qhubeka uchofoza. Ukuchofoza ngayinye kuqala umugqa olandelayo kusukela ekugcineni komugqa wangaphambilini. Vala umbhalo wangaphandle ngokuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi. Lapho imigqa ivala ilupu elisicaba, igcwala ngobuso bese ithuluzi limisa ukuxhumanisa. Cindezela Esc ukuze umise noma nini. Imigqa ilandela izinqondo ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezibhakabhaka uma useduze kwazo; umugqa uphenduka leyo mbala bese ithiphu lithi \"Kwi-axis ebomvu\". Bheka Ukuqagela nokubamba ukuze uthole ukuthi ungakhiya kanjani inqondo nokubamba amaphoyinti. Lapho umugqa uya khona uma ungathintani nanoma yini Umugqa oqala ebusweni uhlala endizeni yalobo buso. Umugqa oqala phansi, noma endaweni engenalutho, uhlala ulingana nephoyinti lokuqala. Uma ubheka imodeli ngaphambili, kunalokho uya endizeni eqondile ebheke kuwe. Ukuze udwebe umugqa uye endaweni enembile, thayipha iphoyinti: [x,y,z] ephoyintini emodelini, noma \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ukuze uthole ukuphambuka kusukela ekuqaleni. Bheka Thayipha izilinganiso ezinembile. Hlukanisa ubuso Dweba umugqa ngaphesheya kobuso, ukusuka emphethweni uye kwelinye (noma emphethweni uye kwelinye ngemigqa eminye). Ubuso buhlukaniseka ube ezimbili. Ngayinye igcina uhlangothi lwayo nombala wayo. Okufanayo kusebenza nounxande noma indilinga edwetshwe ebusweni: isimo sibe ubuso bayo ngaphakathi kobukhulu, obuthi manje bube nembobo. Yile ndlela okwakha ngayo amagumbi ebhuleki lesitezi, iwindi edongeni, noma isinyathelo esitendeni: dweba umbhalo ebusweni, bese ucindezela noma udonse ubuso obusha. Ubuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele Ubuso ngabunye bunengaphambili nangemuva. Ingemuva libonakala luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu. Ubuso obudwetshwe phansi buhlala buqonde phezulu; ubuso obudwetshwe ebusweni obunye buqonde ngendlela efanayo nalobo. Uma ubuso bukhombisa ingemuva lapho ulindele ingaphambili, likhethe bese uchofoza Phendula ubuso ku-Ulwazi lwento. Okubonayo lapho udweba Uphawu olunemibala lapho isikhombisi sibamba khona, negama lalo kuthiphu ngakwesobunxele esiphansi. Ukubuka kuqala komugqa noma isimo. Ubukhulu bangempela kubhokisi lenani. Ungathayipha phezu kwawo noma nini. Uma isimo singekho lapho ulindele khona Esikrinini sokuthinta, bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Uma umugqa ubambe okuthile okude ngemuva, zungeza kancane: amaphoyinti afihlwe ngemuva kobuso awambeki ngakho, kodwa amaphoyinti asemphethweni walo ayambeka. Cindezela Ctrl+Z ukuze uhlehlise isimo sokugcina; ukuhlehlisa kukodwa kususa umugqa owodwa noma isimo esisodwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"push-pull","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sunduza nokudonsa izindawo zibe izinto eziqinile","summary":"Guqula indawo ibe yibhokisi, yenze isakhiwo sibe phezulu noma sibe phansi, engeza ibhe noma isikhala, futhi uphinde ibanga ngokuchofoza kabili.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["sunduza donsa","khipha","ukuphakama","isolid","ibhokisi","ubunzima","phezulu","isikhala","phuma","phinda","chofoza kabili","ivolumu","izinga","ohlangothini lwendawo","ukulingana","ukuphakama okufanayo"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-i-solid-kusuka-endaweni","text":"Yenza i-solid kusuka endaweni","level":2},{"id":"donsa-kuze-kufike-ebude-bento-esele","text":"Donsa kuze kufike ebude bento esele","level":2},{"id":"yenza-ibhokisi-libe-phezulu-noma-libe-phansi","text":"Yenza ibhokisi libe phezulu noma libe phansi","level":2},{"id":"engeza-ibhe-noma-isikhala","text":"Engeza ibhe noma isikhala","level":2},{"id":"cindezela-uphume-ngapha","text":"Cindezela uphume ngapha","level":2},{"id":"thayipha-ibanga","text":"Thayipha ibanga","level":2},{"id":"phinda-ibanga-lokugcina","text":"Phinda ibanga lokugcina","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ihambisa indawo ngokuqondile kwayo: phezulu nphansi kwesitezi, ngaphakathi nangaphandle kodonga. Lokho okwenzekayo kuncike endaweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-i-solid-kusuka-endaweni\"\u003EYenza i-solid kusuka endaweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba indawo, isibonelo unxantathu wesikwele phansi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003EDweba izindawo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlanganisa indawo. Iyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza indawo, bese uhambisa isikhombi. Indawo iyaphakama (noma icwile) futhi izinhlangothi zikhula emaphethelweni ayo. Ibhokisi lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E) nethiphu zikhombisa ibanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuqeda, noma uthayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700\u003C/code\u003E kumodeli yemilimitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EManje unesolid evaliwe. Yikhethe yonke bese uyiqembisa (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EAmaqembu namakhompoyinti\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E bese ikhombisa &quot;Solid: Yes&quot; nevolumu yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo eyodwa ingahamba noma yiluphi uhlangothi: yidonse phezulu ukuze ibe yisisindo ngaphezu komhlaba, yicindezele phansi ukuze ibe umgodi noma isisekelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikhundleni sokuchofoza kabili, cindezela indawo, hudula, bese ukhipha. Esikrinini esithintekayo lokho yindlela ejwayelekile: cindezela, hudula, phakamisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"donsa-kuze-kufike-ebude-bento-esele\"\u003EDonsa kuze kufike ebude bento esele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho usadonsa, hlanganisa ikhona, umaphethelo, isiphakathi, umphetho noma umugqa wesiqondisi wenye ingxenye yemodeli. Indawo ilingana nalelo phuzu, futhi umaka uyaliboniswa. Sebenzisa lokho ukwenza amabhlogo amabili abe ubude obufanayo, noma ukuma kumugqa wesiqondisi owubekile nge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Etape measure\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngahlanganisa futhi indawo ehambisanayo nendawo oyihambisayo, njengophezulu bebhokisi elinye noma ophezulu bebhokisi empini ekuma phezu kwalo. Ithiphu ithi &quot;On face&quot;, bese indawo oyisunduzayo iphela ilingana nayo. Isibonelo, cindezela indawo engaphakathi yepayipi phansi kuze kulingane nebhokisi elingaphansi kwepayipi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo ethambekele endaweni oyisunduzayo ayisethi ulingano. Ibanga lilandela isikhombi. Lokho kuyenzeka nakwindawo emuva kwendawo oyisunduzayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho indawo esundulwayo iphela ilingana nezindawo ezizungezile futhi, izinhlangothi zayo ziyanyamalala. Azikho izinhlangothi zobude obungu-zero ezishiyekile, futhi isakhiwo owasidweba sihlala endaweni, ngakho ungayisunduza futhi kamuva. Ukuze ibuye ibe yindawo eyodwa, susa imiphetho yesakhiwo ngesi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E: izindawo ezimbili ziyahlangana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ibhokisi-libe-phezulu-noma-libe-phansi\"\u003EYenza ibhokisi libe phezulu noma libe phansi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESunduza/hudula phezulu kwebhokisi. Ngoba izinhlangothi sezikhuphuka ngqo kusuka kulo, phezulu kuyanyakazela nje: ibhokisi liba phezulu noma liba phansi, futhi azikho imiphetho emisha edalwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucindezela phezulu kuze kufike phansi kuqothule ibhokisi. I-ModelCraft iyayeka ebudeni obungu-zero; ayiyiguquli ngaphakathi ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkufanayo kunoma iyiphi indawo ezinhlangothi zayo zonke zihamba ngasendleleni yayo, njengesiphetho sodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ibhe-noma-isikhala\"\u003EEngeza ibhe noma isikhala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba unxantathu ohlangothini lwebhokisi (uqale endaweni; uhlala ndizeni yendawo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese udonsa unxantathu omusha \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphandle\u003C/strong\u003E. Wengeza impahla: ibhe, isimini, isimbozo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma uyicindezele \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E. Inquma isikhala: iphothi, isikhala esincane, indawo yokungena esilethwe ngemuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho izinhlangothi zengxenye entsha zihlanganisa nezindawo ezikhona, ziyahlangana zibe indawo eyodwa, ngakho awuthole imigqa elahlekile odongeni oluncane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cindezela-uphume-ngapha\"\u003ECindezela uphume ngapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkucindezela indawo ngaphakathi kwesolid kuyama endaweni yokuqala ngemuva kwayo. Lapho ifinyelela leyo ndawo, iqeqesha ivulo. Yiyo indlela yokwenza amawindi namasuku odongeni olunobukhulu. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/openings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/openings\"\u003ESika ivulo odongeni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thayipha-ibanga\"\u003EThayipha ibanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuchofoza indawo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbanga elithayiphiwe lihamba ngendlela oyihambayo. Uma ungakahambi, lihamba ngasembhoksini yendawo (ngaphandle kwesolid, phezulu ngaphansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha inombolo engemihle, njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E-500\u003C/code\u003E, ukuya ngendlela ephambene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ushintsha umqondo wakho ngaphambi kokuchofoza, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Indawo ibuyela endaweni yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda-ibanga-lokugcina\"\u003EPhinda ibanga lokugcina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokusunduza/hudula kanye, chofoza kabili enye indawo ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E isakhethiwe. Ihamba ibanga elifanayo. Yiyo indlela esheshayo yokunika izindonga noma izitezi eziningi ukuthi zibe nobukhulu noma ubude obufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ikhumbula ibanga kuze kushintshe ithuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESunduza/hudula isebenza endaweni eyodwa ngesikhathi. Uma uchofoza into engeyona indawo, ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Push/pull works on a face. Click a face.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze usunduze/hudule indawo ngaphakathi kweqembu noma kukhomponenti, vula kuqala (chofoza kabili kuyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlangana\u003C/strong\u003E evuliwe, ukusunduza okuhlangana nesolid esinye kuyama lapho kuthinta khona, futhi ithiphu ithi yini ethintwayo (igama lento, noma &quot;loose geometry in this group&quot;) futhi ikhanyisa izindawo ezihlangene nazo. Umgodi osunduza ngaphakathi kwesolid yawo (isibonelo indawo ehlukile esunduzwa phansi) uyingxenye yaleyo solid futhi awuyeki ngezindonga zawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzolid ezimbili ezisunduzwa ngaphakathi kwenye azisiki noma zihlanganise: izindawo zazo ziyadlula nje. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Sunduza/hudula (P) ihambisa indawo ngokuqondile kwayo: phezulu nphansi kwesitezi, ngaphakathi nangaphandle kodonga. Lokho okwenzekayo kuncike endaweni. Yenza i-solid kusuka endaweni Dweba indawo, isibonelo unxantathu wesikwele phansi (Dweba izindawo). Cindezela P. Hlanganisa indawo. Iyakhanya. Chofoza indawo, bese uhambisa isikhombi. Indawo iyaphakama (noma icwile) futhi izinhlangothi zikhula emaphethelweni ayo. Ibhokisi lenani (Ibanga) nethiphu zikhombisa ibanga. Chofoza ukuqeda, noma uthayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter: 3m, 10', 2700 kumodeli yemilimitha. Manje unesolid evaliwe. Yikhethe yonke bese uyiqembisa (bona Amaqembu namakhompoyinti): Ulwazi lwento bese ikhombisa \"Solid: Yes\" nevolumu yayo. Indawo eyodwa ingahamba noma yiluphi uhlangothi: yidonse phezulu ukuze ibe yisisindo ngaphezu komhlaba, yicindezele phansi ukuze ibe umgodi noma isisekelo. Esikhundleni sokuchofoza kabili, cindezela indawo, hudula, bese ukhipha. Esikrinini esithintekayo lokho yindlela ejwayelekile: cindezela, hudula, phakamisa. Donsa kuze kufike ebude bento esele Lapho usadonsa, hlanganisa ikhona, umaphethelo, isiphakathi, umphetho noma umugqa wesiqondisi wenye ingxenye yemodeli. Indawo ilingana nalelo phuzu, futhi umaka uyaliboniswa. Sebenzisa lokho ukwenza amabhlogo amabili abe ubude obufanayo, noma ukuma kumugqa wesiqondisi owubekile nge-tape measure. Ungahlanganisa futhi indawo ehambisanayo nendawo oyihambisayo, njengophezulu bebhokisi elinye noma ophezulu bebhokisi empini ekuma phezu kwalo. Ithiphu ithi \"On face\", bese indawo oyisunduzayo iphela ilingana nayo. Isibonelo, cindezela indawo engaphakathi yepayipi phansi kuze kulingane nebhokisi elingaphansi kwepayipi. Indawo ethambekele endaweni oyisunduzayo ayisethi ulingano. Ibanga lilandela isikhombi. Lokho kuyenzeka nakwindawo emuva kwendawo oyisunduzayo. Lapho indawo esundulwayo iphela ilingana nezindawo ezizungezile futhi, izinhlangothi zayo ziyanyamalala. Azikho izinhlangothi zobude obungu-zero ezishiyekile, futhi isakhiwo owasidweba sihlala endaweni, ngakho ungayisunduza futhi kamuva. Ukuze ibuye ibe yindawo eyodwa, susa imiphetho yesakhiwo ngesi-Isifafazi: izindawo ezimbili ziyahlangana. Yenza ibhokisi libe phezulu noma libe phansi Sunduza/hudula phezulu kwebhokisi. Ngoba izinhlangothi sezikhuphuka ngqo kusuka kulo, phezulu kuyanyakazela nje: ibhokisi liba phezulu noma liba phansi, futhi azikho imiphetho emisha edalwayo. Ukucindezela phezulu kuze kufike phansi kuqothule ibhokisi. I-ModelCraft iyayeka ebudeni obungu-zero; ayiyiguquli ngaphakathi ngaphandle. Okufanayo kunoma iyiphi indawo ezinhlangothi zayo zonke zihamba ngasendleleni yayo, njengesiphetho sodonga. Engeza ibhe noma isikhala Dweba unxantathu ohlangothini lwebhokisi (uqale endaweni; uhlala ndizeni yendawo). Cindezela P bese udonsa unxantathu omusha ngaphandle. Wengeza impahla: ibhe, isimini, isimbozo. Noma uyicindezele ngaphakathi. Inquma isikhala: iphothi, isikhala esincane, indawo yokungena esilethwe ngemuva. Lapho izinhlangothi zengxenye entsha zihlanganisa nezindawo ezikhona, ziyahlangana zibe indawo eyodwa, ngakho awuthole imigqa elahlekile odongeni oluncane. Cindezela uphume ngapha Ukucindezela indawo ngaphakathi kwesolid kuyama endaweni yokuqala ngemuva kwayo. Lapho ifinyelela leyo ndawo, iqeqesha ivulo. Yiyo indlela yokwenza amawindi namasuku odongeni olunobukhulu. Bona Sika ivulo odongeni. Thayipha ibanga Ngemva kokuchofoza indawo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter. Ibanga elithayiphiwe lihamba ngendlela oyihambayo. Uma ungakahambi, lihamba ngasembhoksini yendawo (ngaphandle kwesolid, phezulu ngaphansi). Thayipha inombolo engemihle, njengo--500, ukuya ngendlela ephambene. Uma ushintsha umqondo wakho ngaphambi kokuchofoza, cindezela Esc. Indawo ibuyela endaweni yayo. Phinda ibanga lokugcina Ngemva kokusunduza/hudula kanye, chofoza kabili enye indawo ngo-Sunduza/hudula isakhethiwe. Ihamba ibanga elifanayo. Yiyo indlela esheshayo yokunika izindonga noma izitezi eziningi ukuthi zibe nobukhulu noma ubude obufanayo. I-ModelCraft ikhumbula ibanga kuze kushintshe ithuluzi. Okufanele wazi Sunduza/hudula isebenza endaweni eyodwa ngesikhathi. Uma uchofoza into engeyona indawo, ibha yesimo ithi \"Push/pull works on a face. Click a face.\" Ukuze usunduze/hudule indawo ngaphakathi kweqembu noma kukhomponenti, vula kuqala (chofoza kabili kuyo). Ngo-Hlangana evuliwe, ukusunduza okuhlangana nesolid esinye kuyama lapho kuthinta khona, futhi ithiphu ithi yini ethintwayo (igama lento, noma \"loose geometry in this group\") futhi ikhanyisa izindawo ezihlangene nazo. Umgodi osunduza ngaphakathi kwesolid yawo (isibonelo indawo ehlukile esunduzwa phansi) uyingxenye yaleyo solid futhi awuyeki ngezindonga zawo. Izolid ezimbili ezisunduzwa ngaphakathi kwenye azisiki noma zihlanganise: izindawo zazo ziyadlula nje. Bona Akukakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"divide","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlukanisa umphetho noma ijika zibe izingxenye ezilinganayo","summary":"Hlukanisa umugqa ube izingxenye ezilinganayo, noma unikeze umnsalo noma indilinga inani elisha lezigaba, ngethuluzi le-Hlukanisa.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["hlukanisa","hlukanisa umphetho","izingxenye ezilinganayo","izigaba ezilinganayo","hlukanisa imiphetho","izigaba","ukuhlukanisa","izigaba zomnsalo","izigaba zendilinga","amaphoyinti ngomugqa"],"headings":[{"id":"hlukanisa-umphetho","text":"Hlukanisa umphetho","level":2},{"id":"hlukanisa-umnsalo-noma-indilinga","text":"Hlukanisa umnsalo noma indilinga","level":2},{"id":"ngokhiye-bomhleli","text":"Ngokhiye bomhleli","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E unqamula umphetho ube yizingxenye ezilinganayo, kunekhona endaweni ngayinye yokusika. Sebenzisa amakhona ukuze uwabambe, uqale imigqa kuwo, noma ukusunduza nokudonsa izingxenye zobuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlukanisa-umphetho\"\u003EHlukanisa umphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E kumbhalo wamathuluzi, noma khetha umphetho bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa…\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza umphetho. Amamaki akhombisa lapho izinqamuko zizoba khona: phakathi komphetho kuba izingxenye ezimbili; sondela ekugcineni ukuze uthole izingxenye eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuze uwuhlukanise ube izingxenye ezikhonjisiwe. Noma thayipha inani, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E5s\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E), bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: liyahlukana masinyane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye zishiywe zikhethiwe, futhi kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ubuso umphetho ohlobene nawo bugcina isimo sawo futhi buthola amakhona amasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlukanisa-umnsalo-noma-indilinga\"\u003EHlukanisa umnsalo noma indilinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENikeza noma yiliphi isegimenti lomnsalo noma lendilinga: iyahlukana njengento eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmnsalo noma indilinga engenakho amakhona okusetshenziswa yinto enye, elele phansi ebusweni bayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyadwetshwa kabusha ngalezo zigaba\u003C/strong\u003E kumnsalo wangempela. Izinhlangothi zayo zihlala lapho zazikhona, futhi isahlala ijika elilodwa, ngakho usakwazi ukuyikhetha ngokuchofoza kanye bese ushintsha umsakazo wayo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E. Indilinga enezinhlangothi ezingu-24 ehlukaniswe ibe ezingu-8 iba yi-oktagoni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yiliphi elinye ijika — umphetho wesilinda esidonsiwe, ijika elidwetshwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E, umnsalo onemigqa exhunywe emakhoneni ayo — lithola amakhona amasha ngobude obulinganayo kulo, futhi akukho okunyakazayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngokhiye-bomhleli\"\u003ENgokhiye bomhleli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lifana nakukhiye bomhleli (Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Okhiye, noma isitayela semenyu yomhleli), lapho likutholakala emenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImesh\u003C/span\u003E njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani athayiphiwe ahamba kusukela ku-2 kuya ku-1000; ukunyakaza kwesikhombisi kunikeza kuya ku-100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIjika elidwetshwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E ligcina amaphoyinti alo: ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela amaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E, liyadwetshwa kabusha kuwo, bese amakhona amasha anyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003EDweba ubuso ngemigqa, ngounxande, ngezindilinga nangomnsalo\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EThayipha izilinganiso ezinembile kubhokisi lenani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Hlukanisa unqamula umphetho ube yizingxenye ezilinganayo, kunekhona endaweni ngayinye yokusika. Sebenzisa amakhona ukuze uwabambe, uqale imigqa kuwo, noma ukusunduza nokudonsa izingxenye zobuso. Hlukanisa umphetho Chofoza Hlukanisa kumbhalo wamathuluzi, noma khetha umphetho bese uchofoza Hlukanisa… ku-Ulwazi lwento. Nikeza umphetho. Amamaki akhombisa lapho izinqamuko zizoba khona: phakathi komphetho kuba izingxenye ezimbili; sondela ekugcineni ukuze uthole izingxenye eziningi. Chofoza ukuze uwuhlukanise ube izingxenye ezikhonjisiwe. Noma thayipha inani, njengo 5 (noma 5s, noma /5), bese ucindezela Enter: liyahlukana masinyane. Izingxenye zishiywe zikhethiwe, futhi kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ubuso umphetho ohlobene nawo bugcina isimo sawo futhi buthola amakhona amasha. Hlukanisa umnsalo noma indilinga Nikeza noma yiliphi isegimenti lomnsalo noma lendilinga: iyahlukana njengento eyodwa. Umnsalo noma indilinga engenakho amakhona okusetshenziswa yinto enye, elele phansi ebusweni bayo, iyadwetshwa kabusha ngalezo zigaba kumnsalo wangempela. Izinhlangothi zayo zihlala lapho zazikhona, futhi isahlala ijika elilodwa, ngakho usakwazi ukuyikhetha ngokuchofoza kanye bese ushintsha umsakazo wayo ku-Ulwazi lwento. Indilinga enezinhlangothi ezingu-24 ehlukaniswe ibe ezingu-8 iba yi-oktagoni. Noma yiliphi elinye ijika — umphetho wesilinda esidonsiwe, ijika elidwetshwe nge-Ijika, umnsalo onemigqa exhunywe emakhoneni ayo — lithola amakhona amasha ngobude obulinganayo kulo, futhi akukho okunyakazayo. Ngokhiye bomhleli Ithuluzi lifana nakukhiye bomhleli (Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Okhiye, noma isitayela semenyu yomhleli), lapho likutholakala emenyu ye-Imesh njenge-Hlukanisa imiphetho. Okufanele ukwazi Amanani athayiphiwe ahamba kusukela ku-2 kuya ku-1000; ukunyakaza kwesikhombisi kunikeza kuya ku-100. Ijika elidwetshwe nge-Ijika ligcina amaphoyinti alo: ngemva kwe-Hlela amaphoyinti, liyadwetshwa kabusha kuwo, bese amakhona amasha anyamalala. Bheka futhi Dweba ubuso ngemigqa, ngounxande, ngezindilinga nangomnsalo kanye Thayipha izilinganiso ezinembile kubhokisi lenani.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"scale-factors","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Shintsha usayizi ngezici nesilinganiso sokuncipha","summary":"Shintsha usayizi wokukhethiwe ngesici ngasinye seshoni ezungeze indawo oyikhethile, noma yenza ipethini libe likhulu ngephesenti okuzoncipha ngalo ingxenye elahlwayo.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["shintsha usayizi","okungalingani","isici","iphesenti","elula","ukuncipha","ukuncipha kwensimbi","ipethini","ifawundri","isilinganiso","shintsha usayizi"],"headings":[{"id":"isilinganiso-sokuncipha","text":"Isilinganiso sokuncipha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi Lokushintsha usayizi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) lishintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo noma lidonse ipheni ukuze lelule kwezinye noma ezimbili izindlela. \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha usayizi ngezici…\u003C/strong\u003E (imenyu yamathuluzi, noma eqenjini Lokuguqula) luhlobo lokubhala: inombolo ngayinye yama-eksisi amathathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izimaphethelo, ubuso, amaqembu noma ikhomponenti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi ngezici…\u003C/span\u003E. Bhala isici sobomvu, sobuluhlaza nesobuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Isici singaba \u003Ccode\u003E1.015\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E101.5%\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E+1.5%\u003C/code\u003E (ne-\u003Ccode\u003E-2%\u003C/code\u003E ukuze sincipha). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkufanayo kuzo zonke tharu eziksisi\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha okokuqala kokubili okusalayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzohlala kukhona: maphakathi okukhethiwe, ikhona lalo elisezansi, maphakathi aphansi, noma imvelaphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwezinkambu ukhombisa usayizi manje nangemva kwalokho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E iyakwenza ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-eksisi ayawo eqembu ovulile (lemodeli, ezingeni eliphezulu). Iqembu noma ikhomponenti ejikelezayo iphuma ibhengile uma izici zayo zihlukile; shintsha usayizi weqembu eliyibambile kunalokho. Okuqukethwe yikhomponenti akuthintwa, ngakho amakhophi ayo amanye ahlala njengoba anjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isilinganiso-sokuncipha\"\u003EIsilinganiso sokuncipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye yokuphonsa iyancipha lapho ipholile, ngakho ipethini yenziwa likhulu. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EShrinkage allowance\u003C/strong\u003E bhala iphesenti ngalinye ngama-eksisi (ifawundri noma umenzi wepethini uyakunika lona ngensimbi yakho; 1.5 % ngaphansi kuyisibonelo nje) bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse as the factors\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphesenti uqobo\u003C/strong\u003E lenza isici sibe ngu-1 kanye nephesenti: 1.5 % inikeza 1.015, lokho isikali sokuncipha esikumaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKwanele ngokunembile\u003C/strong\u003E lenza isici sibe ngu-1 ohlukaniswa nango-1 uthathe iphesenti: 1.5 % inikeza 1.0152, ngakho ukuphonswa kuphuma ngosayizi wengxenye lapho sesincipha kangaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphesenti akho okugcina ayakhunjulwa kulesi siphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphesenti linguwe wena: i-ModelCraft ayazi lutho ngensimbi yakho, isikhunta noma inqubo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ithuluzi Lokushintsha usayizi (S) lishintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo noma lidonse ipheni ukuze lelule kwezinye noma ezimbili izindlela. Shintsha usayizi ngezici… (imenyu yamathuluzi, noma eqenjini Lokuguqula) luhlobo lokubhala: inombolo ngayinye yama-eksisi amathathu. Khetha izimaphethelo, ubuso, amaqembu noma ikhomponenti. Vula Shintsha usayizi ngezici…. Bhala isici sobomvu, sobuluhlaza nesobuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Isici singaba 1.015, 101.5% noma +1.5% (ne--2% ukuze sincipha). Okufanayo kuzo zonke tharu eziksisi ikopisha okokuqala kokubili okusalayo. Khetha okuzohlala kukhona: maphakathi okukhethiwe, ikhona lalo elisezansi, maphakathi aphansi, noma imvelaphi. Umugqa ongaphansi kwezinkambu ukhombisa usayizi manje nangemva kwalokho. Shintsha usayizi iyakwenza ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ama-eksisi ayawo eqembu ovulile (lemodeli, ezingeni eliphezulu). Iqembu noma ikhomponenti ejikelezayo iphuma ibhengile uma izici zayo zihlukile; shintsha usayizi weqembu eliyibambile kunalokho. Okuqukethwe yikhomponenti akuthintwa, ngakho amakhophi ayo amanye ahlala njengoba anjalo. Isilinganiso sokuncipha Ingxenye yokuphonsa iyancipha lapho ipholile, ngakho ipethini yenziwa likhulu. Ngaphansi kwe-Shrinkage allowance bhala iphesenti ngalinye ngama-eksisi (ifawundri noma umenzi wepethini uyakunika lona ngensimbi yakho; 1.5 % ngaphansi kuyisibonelo nje) bese ucindezela Use as the factors. Iphesenti uqobo lenza isici sibe ngu-1 kanye nephesenti: 1.5 % inikeza 1.015, lokho isikali sokuncipha esikumaka. Kwanele ngokunembile lenza isici sibe ngu-1 ohlukaniswa nango-1 uthathe iphesenti: 1.5 % inikeza 1.0152, ngakho ukuphonswa kuphuma ngosayizi wengxenye lapho sesincipha kangaka. Amaphesenti akho okugcina ayakhunjulwa kulesi siphequluli. Iphesenti linguwe wena: i-ModelCraft ayazi lutho ngensimbi yakho, isikhunta noma inqubo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"follow-me","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ngilandele: hambisa ubuso ngendlela","summary":"Yenza amapayipi, izintambo, izibambisi zezandla, imibumbo namakhonkco ngokuhambisa ubuso ngemiphetho, imisongo noma ijika.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ngilandele","hambisa","indlela","ipayipi","intambo","ithubhu","isibambisi sezandla","umbumbo","igatha","indandatho","torus","ilathe","khipha ngokuhamba"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-intambo","text":"Yenza intambo","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kokukhetha-indlela-kuqala","text":"Ngaphandle kokukhetha indlela kuqala","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgilandele\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa ubuso ngendlela futhi yakhe into eqinile edlula kuyo. Ubuso ugcina isimo sawo futhi uhlala uqondile endleleni, futhi emakhoneni endlela izingxenye zihlangana ngombandela ohlanzekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-intambo\"\u003EYenza intambo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba indlela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E odlula kumaphoyinti intambo edlula kuwo (ingakhuphuka iphinde yehle), noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E exhunyiwe ekugcineni nekugcineni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEkuqaleni kwendlela, dweba isigaba sentambo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E encane ephesheya kwendlela. Qala indilinga kuphuzu lokugcina lendlela bese uyiphendulela ukuze ibheke endleleni; noma yidwetshe ebusweni obuwela indlela lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha indlela (ukuchofoza kanye kukhetha ijika lonke noma umnsalo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza kwengeza imiphetho eminingi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgilandele\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza indilinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthubhu iyinto eqinile evaliwe, enezinhlangothi ezibushelezi (ezithambile).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kokukhetha-indlela-kuqala\"\u003ENgaphandle kokukhetha indlela kuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgilandele\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza ubuso, bese uchofoza noma yiliphi umphetho wendlela. Indlela iyichungechunge lemiphetho edlula kuleyo mphetho, kuze kube lapho imiphetho emithathu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela ezivaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E (indilinga, ijika elivaliwe, umbhalo wounxande) zenza indandatho: ubuso buyasetshenziswa, indandatho izivala yona. Dweba indilinga phansi njengendlela nendilinga encane emi ephesheya kwayo ukuze uthole idonathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphandle kwendlela:\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso akudingeki uthinte indlela. Iphrofayili edwetshwe eceleni kwendlela ihamba eceleni kwayo, njengombumbo ngaphezulu kodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela akufanele ihlukane\u003C/strong\u003E, kufanele ibe yichungechunge elilodwa elixhunyiwe. I-ModelCraft iyasho uma kungenjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso oluncamele indlela\u003C/strong\u003E (endizeni efanayo nomphetho wokuqala wendlela) alukwazi ukuhanjiswa: luphendule ukuze luwele indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ngilandele ihambisa ubuso ngendlela futhi yakhe into eqinile edlula kuyo. Ubuso ugcina isimo sawo futhi uhlala uqondile endleleni, futhi emakhoneni endlela izingxenye zihlangana ngombandela ohlanzekile. Yenza intambo Dweba indlela: Ijika odlula kumaphoyinti intambo edlula kuwo (ingakhuphuka iphinde yehle), noma Umugqa ne-Umnsalo exhunyiwe ekugcineni nekugcineni. Ekuqaleni kwendlela, dweba isigaba sentambo: Indilinga encane ephesheya kwendlela. Qala indilinga kuphuzu lokugcina lendlela bese uyiphendulela ukuze ibheke endleleni; noma yidwetshe ebusweni obuwela indlela lapho. Khetha indlela (ukuchofoza kanye kukhetha ijika lonke noma umnsalo; Ctrl+chofoza kwengeza imiphetho eminingi). Chofoza Ngilandele eqenjini le-Guqula, bese uchofoza indilinga. Ithubhu iyinto eqinile evaliwe, enezinhlangothi ezibushelezi (ezithambile). Ngaphandle kokukhetha indlela kuqala Chofoza Ngilandele, chofoza ubuso, bese uchofoza noma yiliphi umphetho wendlela. Indlela iyichungechunge lemiphetho edlula kuleyo mphetho, kuze kube lapho imiphetho emithathu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana khona. Okufanele ukwazi Izindlela ezivaliwe (indilinga, ijika elivaliwe, umbhalo wounxande) zenza indandatho: ubuso buyasetshenziswa, indandatho izivala yona. Dweba indilinga phansi njengendlela nendilinga encane emi ephesheya kwayo ukuze uthole idonathi. Ngaphandle kwendlela: ubuso akudingeki uthinte indlela. Iphrofayili edwetshwe eceleni kwendlela ihamba eceleni kwayo, njengombumbo ngaphezulu kodonga. Indlela akufanele ihlukane, kufanele ibe yichungechunge elilodwa elixhunyiwe. I-ModelCraft iyasho uma kungenjalo. Ubuso oluncamele indlela (endizeni efanayo nomphetho wokuqala wendlela) alukwazi ukuhanjiswa: luphendule ukuze luwele indlela. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"text3d","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Umbhalo we-3D","summary":"Engeza umbhalo emodelini njengobuso, osicaba noma oqinile, ume phezu noma yiliphi ubuso: uphawu, inombolo yendlu, igama emnyango.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["umbhalo we-3d","umbhalo","izinhlamvu","ukubhala","uphawu","ukusayina","inombolo yendlu","ilebula","ukubhala ngokujula","ifonti","amagama"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-umbhalo","text":"Engeza umbhalo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbhalo we-3D\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E wenza izinhlamvu zibe ngobuso, ongazipenda, ungazisunduza/uhudule noma uzinqume zingene esimweni esiqinile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-umbhalo\"\u003EEngeza umbhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbhalo we-3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha umbhalo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kubhokisi ukuze uthole umugqa wesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama kwezinhlamvu\u003C/span\u003E (ukuphakama kwesinhlamvu esinkulu, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E30cm\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E yenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinhlamvu ezicaba\u003C/strong\u003E: ubuso ebhekisa phezu kwalokho okubabeka kukho, ezilungele ukupenda noma ukusunduza/ukuhudula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkujula okufana no \u003Ccode\u003E5cm\u003C/code\u003E yenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinhlamvu eziqinile\u003C/strong\u003E, izinqamu ezivaliwe ongazisebenzisa nezinsizakalo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Ezezinto eziqinile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza lapho umbhalo okuya khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEbusweni, umbhalo ulala phezu kwalobo buso, ufundeka usuka kwesokunxele uye kwesokudla: odongeni umi uqondile; emhlabeni noma etafuleni ulala usicaba ngomugqa obomvu. Kude nanoma yiluphi ubuso ulala emhlabeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbhalo uyisakhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eesiqanjwe ngawo\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho wonke amakhophi ashintsha uma uhlela esinye, futhi sibonakala ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze sibekwe futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlamvu ziyifonti yeModelCraft yomugqa-owodwa, ezinikezwe ububanzi: zicacile futhi zifundeka, azikho ukukhetha kohlobo lwefonti okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlamvu, izinombolo nezimpawu ezivamile (kuhlanganise nezinhlamvu ezinamakhamba) zidwetshwa; uhlamvu lefonti lingenayo lubonakala njengebhokisi elincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ushintshe amagama, susa umbhalo bese uwungeza futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubhale izinhlamvu ebusweni, yenza izinhlamvu eziqinile, uzibeke zingene ingxenye ngaphakathi kweqembu eliqinile, bese \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Euzikhipha\u003C/a\u003E kulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Umbhalo we-3D kweqembu Dweba wenza izinhlamvu zibe ngobuso, ongazipenda, ungazisunduza/uhudule noma uzinqume zingene esimweni esiqinile. Engeza umbhalo Chofoza Umbhalo we-3D. Thayipha umbhalo. Cindezela Enter kubhokisi ukuze uthole umugqa wesibili. Setha Ukuphakama kwezinhlamvu (ukuphakama kwesinhlamvu esinkulu, njengo 30cm noma 1') kanye Ukujula: 0 yenza izinhlamvu ezicaba: ubuso ebhekisa phezu kwalokho okubabeka kukho, ezilungele ukupenda noma ukusunduza/ukuhudula. Ukujula okufana no 5cm yenza izinhlamvu eziqinile, izinqamu ezivaliwe ongazisebenzisa nezinsizakalo zezinto eziqinile. Chofoza Beka, bese uchofoza lapho umbhalo okuya khona. Ebusweni, umbhalo ulala phezu kwalobo buso, ufundeka usuka kwesokunxele uye kwesokudla: odongeni umi uqondile; emhlabeni noma etafuleni ulala usicaba ngomugqa obomvu. Kude nanoma yiluphi ubuso ulala emhlabeni. Umbhalo uyisakhi esiqanjwe ngawo, ngakho wonke amakhophi ashintsha uma uhlela esinye, futhi sibonakala ohlwini Izakhi ukuze sibekwe futhi. Okufanele ukwazi Izinhlamvu ziyifonti yeModelCraft yomugqa-owodwa, ezinikezwe ububanzi: zicacile futhi zifundeka, azikho ukukhetha kohlobo lwefonti okwamanje. Izinhlamvu, izinombolo nezimpawu ezivamile (kuhlanganise nezinhlamvu ezinamakhamba) zidwetshwa; uhlamvu lefonti lingenayo lubonakala njengebhokisi elincane. Ukuze ushintshe amagama, susa umbhalo bese uwungeza futhi. Ukuze ubhale izinhlamvu ebusweni, yenza izinhlamvu eziqinile, uzibeke zingene ingxenye ngaphakathi kweqembu eliqinile, bese uzikhipha kulo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"starter","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Umtapo wokuqala","summary":"Cishe izinto ezingamashumi amathathu ezilungele ukubekwa emodelini: iminyango namawindi, izinsiza, ikhishi nendlu yokugezela, amakholomu nezitebhisi, izihlahla, abantu nemoto.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["hlobisa","hlobisa igumbi","uhlelo lwezinsiza","igumbi lokulala","igumbi lokuhlala","ikhishi","indlu yokugezela","ihhovisi","ukurenda","umtapo","okuqala","okuzungezile","izihlahla","abantu","izimoto","izitshalo","isihlahlana","ugebe","izakhi","izinsiza","umnyango","iwindi","isihlalo","itafula","isofa","ibhedi","ikhabethe","ifriji","ishawa","isitebhisi","insika","ibhimu","isihlahla","umuntu","imoto","indawo yokupaka"],"headings":[{"id":"beka-into","text":"Beka into","level":2},{"id":"yini-okukuyo","text":"Yini okukuyo","level":2},{"id":"hlobisa-igumbi-lokurenda","text":"Hlobisa igumbi lokurenda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo wokuqala\u003C/span\u003E inikeza izinto zansuku zonke ngosayizi wangempela, ukuze imodeli ifundeke ngokushesha: umnyango ukukhombisa usayizi wegumbi, imoto endleleni, abantu nezihlahla eduze kwesakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-into\"\u003EBeka into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo wokuqala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into, njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsihlalo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho iyokuya khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhansi, etafuleni noma emhlabathini, imi phezu kwayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/strong\u003E yakhiwe ukuze ingene ezindongeni: chofoza udonga bese zimi kulo, zibheke ngaphandle. (Zihlala phezu kobuso bodonga; azisiki ukuvulwa. Ukuze wenze enye, dweba unxande odongeni lapho kuzofakwa iwindi bese uyisunduza ngaphakathi.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto ngayinye ingu-\u003Cstrong\u003Eisakhi\u003C/strong\u003E: ukukhetha into efanayo futhi kubeka ikhophi enye, futhi zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha uma uhlela eyodwa. Iphinde ibonakale ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka\u003C/span\u003E ukuze wengeze eminingi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-okukuyo\"\u003EYini okukuyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmnyango, umnyango owabelana ngobubili, iwindi, iwindi elibanzi, umnyango wegalaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItafula lokudlela, itafula elijikelezayo, isihlalo, isihlalo sebha, isofa, isihlalo esinezingalo, ibhedi ebanzi nencane, idesiki, ishelefu yezincwadi, ikhabethe lezingubo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhishi nendlu yokugezela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhabethe elisezansi nelisezulwini, ikhawunta yekhishi, ifriji, isitofu, iyunithi yesinki, ithoyilethi, ibhavu, ishawa, isinki lokugeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsitebhisi esiqondile (ama-riser angu-15 ayi-18 cm), insika eyindilinga nesikwele, ibhimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo nabantu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsihlahla, isihlahlana, umuntu (1.75 m), imoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuzungezile: izihlahla, abantu nezimoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzihlahla ezikhahlayo (4, 6 no-10 m), isihlahla sekhoniferi, isihlahla esinde, izihlahlana ezindilinga nezincane, ugebe, isitshalo esisesitsheni, abantu abamile nabahambayo, ingane, imoto yesedan neye-SUV: izimo ezinamanani ngemibala yazo, za \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eimifanekiso enikezwe\u003C/a\u003E nemipulani yezayithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZimo elula, zakhiwe ngezinto eziqinile ongazipenda, ongazishintshela usayizi, ongazenza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Eeziyingqayizivele\u003C/a\u003E futhi ongazishintsha. Ikhabethe lodonga liphakama ngo-1.45 m ngaphezulu kwalapho uchofoza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuzungezile kudwetshwe yi-CadCraft futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa noma yini (CC0); izihlahla, abantu nezimoto ezifanayo zitholakala ku-umtapo we-Library wa-BimCraft ne-CadCraft. Amawindi emoto apenteka ngempahla ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi enemibala\u003C/span\u003E, ngakho avumela ukubona ngaphakathi ezithombeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlobisa-igumbi-lokurenda\"\u003EHlobisa igumbi lokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ifloor yegumbi (ubuso obubodwa obubheka phezulu, kumodeli noma ngaphakathi kweqembu) bese usebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E › Hlobisa igumbi…\u003C/strong\u003E (inkinobho \u003Cstrong\u003EHlobisa\u003C/strong\u003E). Khetha ukuthi igumbi ngani — igumbi lokulala, igumbi lokuhlala, igumbi lokudlela, ikhishi, indlu yokugezela noma ihhovisi — noma vumela kuqagele ngosayizi. Izinsiza zokuqala zimi ngokumelene nezindonga kusuka kudonga elide kakhulu kuzungeze, akukho okuhlanganayo, futhi ukugoqeka kwanoma yimuphi umnyango wokuqala obekwe ezindongeni zegumbi (nobubanzi bamawindi ayo, phambi kwezinto ezinde) kuhlala kukhululekile. Yisakhiwo sokuzenzakalela ngemithetho ongayihlola, hhayi idizayini: igumbi elifanayo lihlala linesakhiwo esifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kungena \u003Cstrong\u003Eeqenjini elilodwa\u003C/strong\u003E ngethegi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/strong\u003E, njengesinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa: Hlehlisa, susa iqembu noma fihla ithegi ukuze ukususe. Into engalingani ibizwa kumugqa wesimo futhi ibhalwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E njengesaziso. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlobisa igumbi\u003C/strong\u003E ye-BimCraft isebenzisa imithetho efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-Umtapo wokuqala inikeza izinto zansuku zonke ngosayizi wangempela, ukuze imodeli ifundeke ngokushesha: umnyango ukukhombisa usayizi wegumbi, imoto endleleni, abantu nezihlahla eduze kwesakhiwo. Beka into Ohlwini Izakhi ngakwesobunxele, chofoza Umtapo wokuqala. Khetha into, njengo-Isihlalo. Chofoza lapho iyokuya khona. Phansi, etafuleni noma emhlabathini, imi phezu kwayo. Iminyango namawindi yakhiwe ukuze ingene ezindongeni: chofoza udonga bese zimi kulo, zibheke ngaphandle. (Zihlala phezu kobuso bodonga; azisiki ukuvulwa. Ukuze wenze enye, dweba unxande odongeni lapho kuzofakwa iwindi bese uyisunduza ngaphakathi.) Into ngayinye ingu-isakhi: ukukhetha into efanayo futhi kubeka ikhophi enye, futhi zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha uma uhlela eyodwa. Iphinde ibonakale ohlwini lwe-Izakhi, ne-Beka ukuze wengeze eminingi. Yini okukuyo Iqembu Izinto Iminyango namawindi Umnyango, umnyango owabelana ngobubili, iwindi, iwindi elibanzi, umnyango wegalaji Izinsiza Itafula lokudlela, itafula elijikelezayo, isihlalo, isihlalo sebha, isofa, isihlalo esinezingalo, ibhedi ebanzi nencane, idesiki, ishelefu yezincwadi, ikhabethe lezingubo Ikhishi nendlu yokugezela Ikhabethe elisezansi nelisezulwini, ikhawunta yekhishi, ifriji, isitofu, iyunithi yesinki, ithoyilethi, ibhavu, ishawa, isinki lokugeza Isakhiwo Isitebhisi esiqondile (ama-riser angu-15 ayi-18 cm), insika eyindilinga nesikwele, ibhimu Indawo nabantu Isihlahla, isihlahlana, umuntu (1.75 m), imoto Okuzungezile: izihlahla, abantu nezimoto Izihlahla ezikhahlayo (4, 6 no-10 m), isihlahla sekhoniferi, isihlahla esinde, izihlahlana ezindilinga nezincane, ugebe, isitshalo esisesitsheni, abantu abamile nabahambayo, ingane, imoto yesedan neye-SUV: izimo ezinamanani ngemibala yazo, za imifanekiso enikezwe nemipulani yezayithi Zimo elula, zakhiwe ngezinto eziqinile ongazipenda, ongazishintshela usayizi, ongazenza eziyingqayizivele futhi ongazishintsha. Ikhabethe lodonga liphakama ngo-1.45 m ngaphezulu kwalapho uchofoza khona. Okuzungezile kudwetshwe yi-CadCraft futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa noma yini (CC0); izihlahla, abantu nezimoto ezifanayo zitholakala ku-umtapo we-Library wa-BimCraft ne-CadCraft. Amawindi emoto apenteka ngempahla ethi Ingilazi enemibala, ngakho avumela ukubona ngaphakathi ezithombeni. Hlobisa igumbi lokurenda Khetha ifloor yegumbi (ubuso obubodwa obubheka phezulu, kumodeli noma ngaphakathi kweqembu) bese usebenzisa Lungisa › Hlobisa igumbi… (inkinobho Hlobisa). Khetha ukuthi igumbi ngani — igumbi lokulala, igumbi lokuhlala, igumbi lokudlela, ikhishi, indlu yokugezela noma ihhovisi — noma vumela kuqagele ngosayizi. Izinsiza zokuqala zimi ngokumelene nezindonga kusuka kudonga elide kakhulu kuzungeze, akukho okuhlanganayo, futhi ukugoqeka kwanoma yimuphi umnyango wokuqala obekwe ezindongeni zegumbi (nobubanzi bamawindi ayo, phambi kwezinto ezinde) kuhlala kukhululekile. Yisakhiwo sokuzenzakalela ngemithetho ongayihlola, hhayi idizayini: igumbi elifanayo lihlala linesakhiwo esifanayo. Konke kungena eqenjini elilodwa ngethegi Izinsiza, njengesinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa: Hlehlisa, susa iqembu noma fihla ithegi ukuze ukususe. Into engalingani ibizwa kumugqa wesimo futhi ibhalwa ku-Izinkinga njengesaziso. I-Hlobisa igumbi ye-BimCraft isebenzisa imithetho efanayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"openings","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sika ukuvulwa ngodonga","summary":"Dweba iwindi noma umnyango odongeni olunobukhulu bese uluphusha, ukuze udonga luthole imbobo yangempela.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["iwindi","umnyango","ukuvulwa","imbobo","udonga","sika","phusha ngaphakathi","ivoyidi","ubukhulu","uhlangothi lwesakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-udonga-lokuzilolonga","text":"Yenza udonga lokuzilolonga","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ukuvulwa","text":"Dweba ukuvulwa","level":2},{"id":"phusha-kwedlula","text":"Phusha kwedlula","level":2},{"id":"umnyango","text":"Umnyango","level":2},{"id":"amawindi-amaningiosayizi-ofanayo","text":"Amawindi amaningiosayizi ofanayo","level":2},{"id":"uma-kungasikanga","text":"Uma kungasikanga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkuvula kudinga udonga oluneziqu ezimbili: ibhokisi, noma udonga owenze ngokuhudula isikhangu esincane nesinde siphakame. Uhlangothi olulodwa oluma lodwa alunalutho okuphusha kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-udonga-lokuzilolonga\"\u003EYenza udonga lokuzilolonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza ikhona phansi bese uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E6m,0.3m\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E20&#039;,12&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza isikhangu bese uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E), bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsunodonga olunobukhulu be-300 mm (12 in).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ukuvulwa\"\u003EDweba ukuvulwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZungeza ukuze ubone uhlangothi olude lodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi phezu kobuso bodonga, bese uchofoza lapho ikhona lephansi lewindi liyofika khona. Ithiphu ithi &quot;On face&quot; (Ebusweni).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ububanzi nobude bewindi, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E1.2m,1.5m\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E4&#039;,5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E), bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIwindi liyinhlangothi yalo ngaphakathi kobuso bodonga, obusanembobo ezungeze lo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ulibeke ibanga elinembile kusuka ekhoneni nasephansi, sebenzisa kuqala \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Eimihlahlandlela\u003C/a\u003E: ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E, hudula imigqa yomhlahlandlela kusuka ezingxenyeni eziphansi nasemaphethelweni odonga, bese uqala isikwele lapho imihlahlandlela ihlangana khona (ithiphu ithi &quot;On guide&quot; (Emhlahlandlelweni)).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phusha-kwedlula\"\u003EPhusha kwedlula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso bewindi bese uluphusha lungene kudonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa uze uyime ebusweni obungemuva, bese uchofoza. Noma thayipha ubukhulu bodonga, \u003Ccode\u003E300\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E), bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft iyayima ebusweni obungemuva ibe yiyo ivulekile: udonga manje lunembobo eqondile, nezinhlangothi ezine ezingaphansi (izinhlangothi, ikhanda nesibe) ezilimbozayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E isabiza udonga ngokuthi yi-solid evaliwe uma lihlanganisiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uphusha ngaphansi kobukhulu obugcwele, uthola isigxobo esingeyona imbobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umnyango\"\u003EUmnyango\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba isikwele uqale emphethweni ophansi wobuso bodonga (ithiphu ithi &quot;On edge&quot; (Emphethweni) noma &quot;Endpoint&quot; (Ephuzini lokugcina)), ukuze ukuvulwa kufinyelele phansi. Uphushe ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amawindi-amaningiosayizi-ofanayo\"\u003EAmawindi amaningiosayizi ofanayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza ukuvulwa kokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkulandelayo, dweba izikwele, bese ucindezela kabili ngayinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E: ukucindezela kabili kuphinda ibanga lokugcina. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull#repeat-the-last-distance\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\" data-hash=\"repeat-the-last-distance\"\u003EPhusha nokudonsa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kungasikanga\"\u003EUma kungasikanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikwele kumele sidweywe \u003Cstrong\u003Ephezu\u003C/strong\u003E kobuso bodonga. Uma sidwetshwe emoyeni phambi kwalo, singesiyo ingxenye yalo: hlehlisa bese usidweba kabusha, uqale ebusweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphusha kuyama ebusweni bokuqala obusemuva kokuvulwa. Uma kukhona okunye okuvimbelayo ngaphakathi kodonga (ubuso bangaphakathi obusele kudwetshwe ngaphambili), kuyoma lapho; susa imiphetho yalobo buso bese uzama futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIjiyomethri eseqenjini elihlukile ayisikwa. Vula iqembu elibamba udonga bese udweba ukuvulwa phakathi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ukuvula kudinga udonga oluneziqu ezimbili: ibhokisi, noma udonga owenze ngokuhudula isikhangu esincane nesinde siphakame. Uhlangothi olulodwa oluma lodwa alunalutho okuphusha kulo. Yenza udonga lokuzilolonga Cindezela R, chofoza ikhona phansi bese uthayipha 6m,0.3m (noma 20',12\"), bese Enter. Cindezela P, chofoza isikhangu bese uthayipha 3m (noma 10'), bese Enter. Usunodonga olunobukhulu be-300 mm (12 in). Dweba ukuvulwa Zungeza ukuze ubone uhlangothi olude lodonga. Cindezela R. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kobuso bodonga, bese uchofoza lapho ikhona lephansi lewindi liyofika khona. Ithiphu ithi \"On face\" (Ebusweni). Thayipha ububanzi nobude bewindi, njengo 1.2m,1.5m (noma 4',5'), bese ucindezela Enter. Iwindi liyinhlangothi yalo ngaphakathi kobuso bodonga, obusanembobo ezungeze lo. Ukuze ulibeke ibanga elinembile kusuka ekhoneni nasephansi, sebenzisa kuqala imihlahlandlela: ngo-Tape, hudula imigqa yomhlahlandlela kusuka ezingxenyeni eziphansi nasemaphethelweni odonga, bese uqala isikwele lapho imihlahlandlela ihlangana khona (ithiphu ithi \"On guide\" (Emhlahlandlelweni)). Phusha kwedlula Cindezela P. Chofoza ubuso bewindi bese uluphusha lungene kudonga. Hambisa uze uyime ebusweni obungemuva, bese uchofoza. Noma thayipha ubukhulu bodonga, 300 (noma 12), bese Enter. I-ModelCraft iyayima ebusweni obungemuva ibe yiyo ivulekile: udonga manje lunembobo eqondile, nezinhlangothi ezine ezingaphansi (izinhlangothi, ikhanda nesibe) ezilimbozayo. Entity info isabiza udonga ngokuthi yi-solid evaliwe uma lihlanganisiwe. Uma uphusha ngaphansi kobukhulu obugcwele, uthola isigxobo esingeyona imbobo. Umnyango Dweba isikwele uqale emphethweni ophansi wobuso bodonga (ithiphu ithi \"On edge\" (Emphethweni) noma \"Endpoint\" (Ephuzini lokugcina)), ukuze ukuvulwa kufinyelele phansi. Uphushe ngendlela efanayo. Amawindi amaningiosayizi ofanayo Yenza ukuvulwa kokuqala. Okulandelayo, dweba izikwele, bese ucindezela kabili ngayinye nge-Push/pull: ukucindezela kabili kuphinda ibanga lokugcina. Bona Phusha nokudonsa. Uma kungasikanga Isikwele kumele sidweywe phezu kobuso bodonga. Uma sidwetshwe emoyeni phambi kwalo, singesiyo ingxenye yalo: hlehlisa bese usidweba kabusha, uqale ebusweni. Ukuphusha kuyama ebusweni bokuqala obusemuva kokuvulwa. Uma kukhona okunye okuvimbelayo ngaphakathi kodonga (ubuso bangaphakathi obusele kudwetshwe ngaphambili), kuyoma lapho; susa imiphetho yalobo buso bese uzama futhi. Ijiyomethri eseqenjini elihlukile ayisikwa. Vula iqembu elibamba udonga bese udweba ukuvulwa phakathi kwalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"stretch","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izakhi ezelula","summary":"Yenza ikhophi eyodwa yesakhi ibe nobubanzi obukhulu, ukujula okukhulu noma ukuphakama okukhulu, ngenkathi izingxenye zaso zigcina usayizi wazo: itafula elide elinezinyawo ezifanayo, ishelufu lezincwadi elide elinamashelufu ahlukaniswe kabanzi, uhlaka lwerayili olunezinsika ezibuyelwayo.","section":"tasks","order":41,"keywords":["isakhi esiguquguqukayo","elula","shintsha usayizi wesakhi","ngemingcele","amagama osayizi","phinda","uhlu","izinyawo","amashelufu","irayili","imithetho","izinto ezishintshayo"],"headings":[{"id":"eneka-ikhophi","text":"Eneka ikhophi","level":2},{"id":"imithetho","text":"Imithetho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha usayizi wesakhi kwenza yonke into kuso ibe mkhulu, nezinyawo nezinti zerayili nazo. \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStretch this copy…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E ishintsha ububanzi, ukujula noma ukuphakama kwesakhi, ingxenye ngayinye ilandela umthetho: isiphezu setafula siyakhula, izinyawo zaso zigcine ubukhulu bazo zihlale ezinhlangothini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kusebenza ezakhini ezenziwe ngezingxenye, okusho amaqembu noma izakhi ezingaphakathi kwesakhi, njengakho konke okusemtapweni wokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eneka-ikhophi\"\u003EEneka ikhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneka le kopi…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi (obomvu)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula (oluhlaza)\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama (obuluhlaza)\u003C/span\u003E amanani amasha, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYile kopi kuphela eshintsha: iba yisakhi sayo, esikhumbula umsuka wayo. Yelula futhi noma nini, bese ibalwa kabusha kusuka emsukeni wayo, ngakho akukho okushintsha ngokungahleliwe. Amanye amakhophi womsuka ahlala njengoba ayenjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imithetho\"\u003EImithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula isakhi (chofoza kabili kuso) bese ukhetha enye yezingxenye zaso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELapho ikhomponenti inekwa\u003C/span\u003E, nomthetho ogijima ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza nobuluhlaza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmthetho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIngxenye yenza ini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElula\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhula nesakhi; amabanga ayo ezinhlangothini zombili ayagcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphezu setafula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlala esiqalweni\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlala esiphethweni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina usayizi wayo nebanga layo kuleyo nhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinyawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ngokulinganayo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina usayizi wayo; isiphakathi sayo sihamba ngokulinganayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashelufu, isibambo sesivalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa ngokulinganayo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo nosayizi wayo kokubili kuyalinganiswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinyathelo zesitebhisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhophi ayo, njalo ngezikhathi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjalo\u003C/span\u003E), kusuka lapho iqala kuya ohlangothini olukude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsika zerayili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala) kuyakunquma bese kubonisa ukuthi yimuphi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElula\u003C/span\u003E uma ingxenye ihlanganisa isakhi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ngokulinganayo\u003C/span\u003E uma ihlezi cishe phakathi, kungenjalo ihlala ohlangothini oluseduze kakhulu kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo zezingxenye ziyabelwana, ngakho ikhophi eyelulwe ilula. Ukuhlela ingxenye kushintsha kuwo wonke amakhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi eyelulwe ayilandeli izinguquko ezizayo emithethweni noma ekwakhiweni komsuka: yelula futhi ukuze uzithathe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obudwetshwe ngokukhululekile esakheni (hhayi engxenyeni) bugcina usayizi wabo; yenza babe yingxenye ukuze balandele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImithetho nokuthi yiluphi ikhophi eyelulwa kuwo kulondolozwa efayeleni le-ModelCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ukushintsha usayizi wesakhi kwenza yonke into kuso ibe mkhulu, nezinyawo nezinti zerayili nazo. Stretch this copy… ishintsha ububanzi, ukujula noma ukuphakama kwesakhi, ingxenye ngayinye ilandela umthetho: isiphezu setafula siyakhula, izinyawo zaso zigcine ubukhulu bazo zihlale ezinhlangothini. Lokhu kusebenza ezakhini ezenziwe ngezingxenye, okusho amaqembu noma izakhi ezingaphakathi kwesakhi, njengakho konke okusemtapweni wokuqala. Eneka ikhophi Khetha isakhi. Ku-Ulwazi lwento, chofoza Eneka le kopi…. Thayipha Ububanzi (obomvu), Ukujula (oluhlaza) kanye Ukuphakama (obuluhlaza) amanani amasha, bese uchofoza Elula. Yile kopi kuphela eshintsha: iba yisakhi sayo, esikhumbula umsuka wayo. Yelula futhi noma nini, bese ibalwa kabusha kusuka emsukeni wayo, ngakho akukho okushintsha ngokungahleliwe. Amanye amakhophi womsuka ahlala njengoba ayenjalo. Imithetho Vula isakhi (chofoza kabili kuso) bese ukhetha enye yezingxenye zaso. Ulwazi lwento ibonisa Lapho ikhomponenti inekwa, nomthetho ogijima ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza nobuluhlaza: Umthetho Ingxenye yenza ini Isibonelo Elula Ikhula nesakhi; amabanga ayo ezinhlangothini zombili ayagcina Isiphezu setafula Hlala esiqalweni / Hlala esiphethweni Igcina usayizi wayo nebanga layo kuleyo nhlangothi Izinyawo Hambisa ngokulinganayo Igcina usayizi wayo; isiphakathi sayo sihamba ngokulinganayo Amashelufu, isibambo sesivalo Linganisa ngokulinganayo Indawo nosayizi wayo kokubili kuyalinganiswa Izinyathelo zesitebhisi Phinda Amakhophi ayo, njalo ngezikhathi (Njalo), kusuka lapho iqala kuya ohlangothini olukude Izinsika zerayili Okuzenzakalelayo (okokuqala) kuyakunquma bese kubonisa ukuthi yimuphi: Elula uma ingxenye ihlanganisa isakhi, Hambisa ngokulinganayo uma ihlezi cishe phakathi, kungenjalo ihlala ohlangothini oluseduze kakhulu kulo. Okufanele ukwazi Izakhiwo zezingxenye ziyabelwana, ngakho ikhophi eyelulwe ilula. Ukuhlela ingxenye kushintsha kuwo wonke amakhophi. Ikhophi eyelulwe ayilandeli izinguquko ezizayo emithethweni noma ekwakhiweni komsuka: yelula futhi ukuze uzithathe. Ubuso obudwetshwe ngokukhululekile esakheni (hhayi engxenyeni) bugcina usayizi wabo; yenza babe yingxenye ukuze balandele. Imithetho nokuthi yiluphi ikhophi eyelulwa kuwo kulondolozwa efayeleni le-ModelCraft.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"select","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Khetha izinto","summary":"Chofoza, chofoza kabili nochofoza kathathu, hudula ibhokisi lewindi noma lokudlula, engeza nokususa ngamakhiye okuguqula, bese ususa.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["khetha","ukukhetha","iwindi","ukudlula","engeza ekukhetheni","khipha ekukhetheni","khetha konke","chofoza kathathu","chofoza kabili","susa","sula"],"headings":[{"id":"chofoza","text":"Chofoza","level":2},{"id":"hudula-ibhokisi","text":"Hudula ibhokisi","level":2},{"id":"engeza-nokususa","text":"Engeza nokususa","level":2},{"id":"sula-ukukhetha","text":"Sula ukukhetha","level":2},{"id":"susa-okukhethiwe","text":"Susa okukhethiwe","level":2},{"id":"khetha-ngaphakathi-kweqembu","text":"Khetha ngaphakathi kweqembu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ngulo thuluzi ModelCraft aqala ngalo, futhi ngulo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E akubuyisela kuwo. Izinto ezikhethiwe ziba bluu, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla litshela ukuthi yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chofoza\"\u003EChofoza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ubuso noma umphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELobo buso noma lo mphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza iqembu noma isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELonke iqembu noma isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili ubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso nemiphetho yalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili umphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELo mphetho nobuso obuseceleni bawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili iqembu noma isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiyavula ukuze lihlelwe (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EAmaqembu nezakhi\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kathathu ubuso noma umphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke okuxhumene nakho: lonke into\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza indawo engenalutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho lutho (kususa ukukhetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili indawo engenalutho uma uhlela iqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvala iqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphetho ilula ukuyithinta kunobuso: uma iphoyinti liseduze nomphetho ngamapikseli ambalwa, ukuchofoza kukhetha umphetho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hudula-ibhokisi\"\u003EHudula ibhokisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E udweba ibhokisi eliqinile: ukukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eiwindi\u003C/strong\u003E. Kukhethwa kuphela izinto ezisebhokisini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka kwesokudla kuya kwesobunxele\u003C/strong\u003E udweba ibhokisi elinamachashaza: ukukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eukudlula\u003C/strong\u003E. Noma yini ethintwa yibhokisi iyakhethwa, futhi ubuso buyakhethwa uma ibhokisi lisebuso ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu noma isakhi sibalwa njengento eyodwa: iwindi kumele libambe konke, kanti ukudlula kudinga ukuthinta kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-nokususa\"\u003EEngeza nokususa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBamba ukhiye uma uchofoza noma uhudula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyaguqula: yengeza okungakhethiwe, isuse okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyengeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ndawonye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhetha yonke into emodelini (noma yonke into eqenjini oliyahlela), cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sula-ukukhetha\"\u003ESula ukukhetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E njengethuluzi), noma chofoza indawo engenalutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-okukhethiwe\"\u003ESusa okukhethiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu nemihlahlandlela okukhethiwe kuyasuswa ngesinyathelo esisodwa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyabuyisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkususa umphetho kususa ubuso obudinga wona, ngaphandle uma lowo mphetho wawuhlukanisa ubuso ababili ophaneni olufanayo: khona lobo buso ababili buba bubodwa. Ukususa ubuso kushiya imiphetho yalo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/erase\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/erase\"\u003EUkusula nokuhlanza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-ngaphakathi-kweqembu\"\u003EKhetha ngaphakathi kweqembu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza iqembu kukhetha lonke iqembu. Ukuze ukhethe ubuso ngaphakathi kwalo, chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uvule, bese uchofoza. Lapho iqembu livulekile, ukuchofoza kufinyelela kuphela okungaphakathi kwalo; konke okunye kuyafiphala. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kungakhethiwe lutho, noma chofoza kabili indawo engenalutho, ukuze uvale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele ikhetha amaqembu nezakhi ngegama, okusiza lapho zifihlwe ngemuva kwezinye izinto.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Khetha (Space) ngulo thuluzi ModelCraft aqala ngalo, futhi ngulo Esc akubuyisela kuwo. Izinto ezikhethiwe ziba bluu, futhi Ulwazi lwento ngakwesokudla litshela ukuthi yini. Chofoza Yenza lokhu Ikhetha Chofoza ubuso noma umphetho Lobo buso noma lo mphetho Chofoza iqembu noma isakhi Lonke iqembu noma isakhi Chofoza kabili ubuso Ubuso nemiphetho yalo Chofoza kabili umphetho Lo mphetho nobuso obuseceleni bawo Chofoza kabili iqembu noma isakhi Liyavula ukuze lihlelwe (bona Amaqembu nezakhi) Chofoza kathathu ubuso noma umphetho Konke okuxhumene nakho: lonke into Chofoza indawo engenalutho Akukho lutho (kususa ukukhetha) Chofoza kabili indawo engenalutho uma uhlela iqembu Ivala iqembu Imiphetho ilula ukuyithinta kunobuso: uma iphoyinti liseduze nomphetho ngamapikseli ambalwa, ukuchofoza kukhetha umphetho. Hudula ibhokisi Kusuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla udweba ibhokisi eliqinile: ukukhetha iwindi. Kukhethwa kuphela izinto ezisebhokisini. Kusuka kwesokudla kuya kwesobunxele udweba ibhokisi elinamachashaza: ukukhetha ukudlula. Noma yini ethintwa yibhokisi iyakhethwa, futhi ubuso buyakhethwa uma ibhokisi lisebuso ngokuphelele. Iqembu noma isakhi sibalwa njengento eyodwa: iwindi kumele libambe konke, kanti ukudlula kudinga ukuthinta kuphela. Engeza nokususa Bamba ukhiye uma uchofoza noma uhudula: Ukhiye Umphumela Shift Iyaguqula: yengeza okungakhethiwe, isuse okukhethiwe Ctrl Iyengeza Shift kanye Ctrl ndawonye Iyasusa Ukukhetha yonke into emodelini (noma yonke into eqenjini oliyahlela), cindezela Ctrl+A. Sula ukukhetha Cindezela Esc (ngo-Khetha njengethuluzi), noma chofoza indawo engenalutho. Susa okukhethiwe Cindezela Delete noma Backspace. Ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu nemihlahlandlela okukhethiwe kuyasuswa ngesinyathelo esisodwa; Ctrl+Z iyabuyisa. Ukususa umphetho kususa ubuso obudinga wona, ngaphandle uma lowo mphetho wawuhlukanisa ubuso ababili ophaneni olufanayo: khona lobo buso ababili buba bubodwa. Ukususa ubuso kushiya imiphetho yalo. Bona Ukusula nokuhlanza. Khetha ngaphakathi kweqembu Ukuchofoza iqembu kukhetha lonke iqembu. Ukuze ukhethe ubuso ngaphakathi kwalo, chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uvule, bese uchofoza. Lapho iqembu livulekile, ukuchofoza kufinyelela kuphela okungaphakathi kwalo; konke okunye kuyafiphala. Cindezela Esc kungakhethiwe lutho, noma chofoza kabili indawo engenalutho, ukuze uvale. I-Uhlu lwezinto ngakwesobunxele ikhetha amaqembu nezakhi ngegama, okusiza lapho zifihlwe ngemuva kwezinye izinto.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"paint","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Penda ngemibala nangezinto zokwakha","summary":"Nika ubuso, amaqembu nezingxenye umbala oqinile noma into yokwakha efana nebhulikhi, isiding, ishingles noma iwudi, bese ugcina lokho lapho uthumela ngaphandle.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["penda","umbala","colour","color","impahla yokwakha","izinto zokwakha","ukuthungwa","bhulikhi","siding","ishingles","uphahla","iwudi","itshe","ithayili","ukhonkolo","stucco","utshani","itshe elincane","ingilazi","insimbi","isitsha sepeyinti","gcwalisa","isampula","ukhetho lombala","okuzenzakalelayo","glb","obj","mtl","collada"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-umbala","text":"Khetha umbala","level":2},{"id":"penda","text":"Penda","level":2},{"id":"penda-ngempahla-yokwakha","text":"Penda ngempahla yokwakha","level":2},{"id":"izingxenye-nemibala","text":"Izingxenye nemibala","level":2},{"id":"imibala-emafayelini","text":"Imibala emafayelini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImibala isiza ukuhlukanisa izingxenye zemodeli, kanti \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinto zokwakha\u003C/strong\u003E (ibhulikhi, isiding, uphahla, iwudi, itshe, ithayili, ukhonkolo, stucco, utshani, ingilazi, insimbi) zenza imodeli ibonakale njengento eyakhiwe ngayo. Zombili zipenda ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-umbala\"\u003EKhetha umbala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmabala\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla sibonisa umugqa wemibala eqinile, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E (leyo echazwe umugqa oqondile: akukho mbala) kanye nesampula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E yanoma yimuphi omunye umbala. Chofoza enye ukuze uyenze umbala wamanje. Ithuluzi le-Paint liqala ngawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"penda\"\u003EPenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E), noma, ngaphandle kokuthi kukhethwe okuthile, chofoza umbala. (Uma kukhethiwe okuthile, ukuchofoza umbala kupenda okukhethiwe ngokushesha.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso ukuze ububenze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iqembu noma isakhi ukuze upende leyo kopi: ubuso bayo obungenawo umbala wabo bathatha lo mbala. Ubuso obupendwe ngaphakathi kwayo bugcina umbala wabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze upende izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, zikhethe kuqala bese uchofoza umbala, noma chofoza noma yiziphi zazo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBamba\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBese uchofoza ubuso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini ependa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELobo buso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonke ubuso obuxhumene nalo obunombala ofanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonke ubuso balo mbala weqembu osebenza kulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho: uthatha lowo mbala esikhundleni salokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubuyisele ubuso ekungabi nalo mbala, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"penda-ngempahla-yokwakha\"\u003EPenda ngempahla yokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmabala\u003C/span\u003E, sidwesa ilabhulali yezinto zokwakha ngohlobo: ibhulikhi nebhulokhi, isiding, uphahla, iwudi, itshe, ithayili, ukhonkolo, stucco, umhlaba, ingilazi nensimbi. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kwesampula ukuze ubone igama layo. Chofoza eyodwa, bese upenda ngayo njengombala: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza ubuso, amaqembu noma izingxenye; noma khetha kuqala bese uchofoza impahla yokwakha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitayeleni se-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkushadiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso bubonisa ukuthungwa kwempahla. \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa ofihliwe\u003C/strong\u003E, i-wireframe ne-x-ray zibonisa umbala wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthungwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuhamba ngokuqondile kuwo wonke ubuso\u003C/strong\u003E nama-\u003Cstrong\u003Ephezulu\u003C/strong\u003E kwawo: imigqa yebhulikhi ihlala iqondile kuwo wonke amadonga, izinsimbi zophahla zehla ngokuthambeka kophahla, nezinplanga zesisekelo zilandela i-axis ebomvu. Zinosayizi wangempela (ibhulikhi cishe ingu-215 mm ubude), ngakho zibukeka zilungile noma yikuphi okuhlukile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eumfanekiso owenziwe\u003C/a\u003E izinto zokwakha zigcina ukuthungwa kwazo, ukuqina kwazo, futhi, ngengilazi nensimbi, nokukhanya kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoza nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E nakho kuthatha impahla yobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthungwa kudwetshwa yi-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ngakho kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa kunoma yini (CC0).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izingxenye-nemibala\"\u003EIzingxenye nemibala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbala opendwe ebusweni \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E kwesingxenye ukhombisa kuyo yonke ikhophi, ngoba amakhophi ahlanganyela inkcazo eyodwa. Umbala opendwe \u003Cstrong\u003Eekhophini\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphandle (ngesikhathi isingxenye sivaliwe) ungowalelo khophi kuphela, ngakho amakhophi amabili engxenye eyodwa angaba nemibala ehlukene. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa umbala wobuso, weqembu noma wesingxenye okukhethiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imibala-emafayelini\"\u003EImibala emafayelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela le-ModelCraft ligcina yonke imibala nazo zonke izinto zokwakha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzinye izifomethi zithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eumbala wempahla\u003C/strong\u003E (ukubukeka kwayo ekude) esikhundleni sokuthungwa: glTF, Collada, OBJ, DWG, DXF nokuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D. Ku-glTF, Collada ne-OBJ impahla igcina igama layo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EMaterial_brick-red\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/strong\u003E: umbala ngamunye uba yimpahla. Ingxenye ebonakala ngemibala ehlukene ibhalwa kanye ngombala ngamunye. I-glTF ibhala futhi izithombe ezilayishiwe njengokuthungwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E: ukukhipha kulanda amafayela amabili, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E enemibala. Zigcine ku-folda eyodwa. Uma kukhona ukuthungwa okulayishiwe, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E nezithombe ziza njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E owodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E igcina imibala ngqo; \u003Cstrong\u003EDXF\u003C/strong\u003E isebenzisa eyona eseduze kakhulu kwemibala eyi-255 ejwayelekile ye-CAD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EPLY\u003C/strong\u003E zithwele imibala: i-STL ngesivumelwano se-VisCAM / SolidView (izinhlelo ezingayifundi ziyinaki), i-PLY njengombala kuyo iphoyinti ngalinye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela ngokuningiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze umodele iskrini, penda uhlaka ngomnyama wamalahle nengilazi ngombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ngemva kokuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003Euphambanise\u003C/a\u003E ubuso bangaphambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Imibala isiza ukuhlukanisa izingxenye zemodeli, kanti izinto zokwakha (ibhulikhi, isiding, uphahla, iwudi, itshe, ithayili, ukhonkolo, stucco, utshani, ingilazi, insimbi) zenza imodeli ibonakale njengento eyakhiwe ngayo. Zombili zipenda ngendlela efanayo. Khetha umbala Isigaba Amabala ngakwesokudla sibonisa umugqa wemibala eqinile, Okuzenzakalelayo (leyo echazwe umugqa oqondile: akukho mbala) kanye nesampula + yanoma yimuphi omunye umbala. Chofoza enye ukuze uyenze umbala wamanje. Ithuluzi le-Paint liqala ngawo. Penda Cindezela B (Penda), noma, ngaphandle kokuthi kukhethwe okuthile, chofoza umbala. (Uma kukhethiwe okuthile, ukuchofoza umbala kupenda okukhethiwe ngokushesha.) Chofoza ubuso ukuze ububenze. Chofoza iqembu noma isakhi ukuze upende leyo kopi: ubuso bayo obungenawo umbala wabo bathatha lo mbala. Ubuso obupendwe ngaphakathi kwayo bugcina umbala wabo. Ukuze upende izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, zikhethe kuqala bese uchofoza umbala, noma chofoza noma yiziphi zazo nge-Penda. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bamba Bese uchofoza ubuso Yini ependa — Lobo buso Ctrl Bonke ubuso obuxhumene nalo obunombala ofanayo Shift Bonke ubuso balo mbala weqembu osebenza kulo Alt Akukho: uthatha lowo mbala esikhundleni salokho Ukuze ubuyisele ubuso ekungabi nalo mbala, khetha Okuzenzakalelayo bese uchofoza kuwo. Penda ngempahla yokwakha Isigaba Impahla yokwakha, ngaphansi kwe-Amabala, sidwesa ilabhulali yezinto zokwakha ngohlobo: ibhulikhi nebhulokhi, isiding, uphahla, iwudi, itshe, ithayili, ukhonkolo, stucco, umhlaba, ingilazi nensimbi. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kwesampula ukuze ubone igama layo. Chofoza eyodwa, bese upenda ngayo njengombala: B, chofoza ubuso, amaqembu noma izingxenye; noma khetha kuqala bese uchofoza impahla yokwakha. Esitayeleni se-Okushadiwe ubuso bubonisa ukuthungwa kwempahla. Umugqa ofihliwe, i-wireframe ne-x-ray zibonisa umbala wayo. Ukuthungwa kuhamba ngokuqondile kuwo wonke ubuso nama-phezulu kwawo: imigqa yebhulikhi ihlala iqondile kuwo wonke amadonga, izinsimbi zophahla zehla ngokuthambeka kophahla, nezinplanga zesisekelo zilandela i-axis ebomvu. Zinosayizi wangempela (ibhulikhi cishe ingu-215 mm ubude), ngakho zibukeka zilungile noma yikuphi okuhlukile. Ku-umfanekiso owenziwe izinto zokwakha zigcina ukuthungwa kwazo, ukuqina kwazo, futhi, ngengilazi nensimbi, nokukhanya kwazo. Ukucindezela Alt uchofoza nge-Penda nakho kuthatha impahla yobuso. Ukuthungwa kudwetshwa yi-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ngakho kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa kunoma yini (CC0). Izingxenye nemibala Umbala opendwe ebusweni ngaphakathi kwesingxenye ukhombisa kuyo yonke ikhophi, ngoba amakhophi ahlanganyela inkcazo eyodwa. Umbala opendwe ekhophini ngaphandle (ngesikhathi isingxenye sivaliwe) ungowalelo khophi kuphela, ngakho amakhophi amabili engxenye eyodwa angaba nemibala ehlukene. Ulwazi lwento ibonisa umbala wobuso, weqembu noma wesingxenye okukhethiwe. Imibala emafayelini Ifayela le-ModelCraft ligcina yonke imibala nazo zonke izinto zokwakha. Ezinye izifomethi zithola umbala wempahla (ukubukeka kwayo ekude) esikhundleni sokuthungwa: glTF, Collada, OBJ, DWG, DXF nokuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D. Ku-glTF, Collada ne-OBJ impahla igcina igama layo, njengo Material_brick-red. glTF (.glb) ne-Collada (.dae): umbala ngamunye uba yimpahla. Ingxenye ebonakala ngemibala ehlukene ibhalwa kanye ngombala ngamunye. I-glTF ibhala futhi izithombe ezilayishiwe njengokuthungwa. OBJ: ukukhipha kulanda amafayela amabili, i-.obj ne-.mtl enemibala. Zigcine ku-folda eyodwa. Uma kukhona ukuthungwa okulayishiwe, i-.obj, i-.mtl nezithombe ziza njengo-.zip owodwa. DWG igcina imibala ngqo; DXF isebenzisa eyona eseduze kakhulu kwemibala eyi-255 ejwayelekile ye-CAD. STL ne-PLY zithwele imibala: i-STL ngesivumelwano se-VisCAM / SolidView (izinhlelo ezingayifundi ziyinaki), i-PLY njengombala kuyo iphoyinti ngalinye. Bona Amafomethi amafayela ngokuningiwe. Ukuze umodele iskrini, penda uhlaka ngomnyama wamalahle nengilazi ngombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ngemva kokuthi uphambanise ubuso bangaphambili.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"solids","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amathuluzi ezinto eziqinile: hlanganisa, susa, hlangana","summary":"Hlanganisa amaqembu nezakhi ezivaliwe zibe eyodwa, sike enye ngaphakathi kwenye, noma gcina okwabelwana ngakho kuphela.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["isolidi","izinto eziqinile","isihloli sesolidi","akuyona isolidi","lungisa isolidi","imbobo","umphetho ophambukayo","ngaphakathi ngaphandle","union","hlanganisa","join","combine","merge","susa","subtract","umehluko","sika","hlangana","intersect","intersection","boolean","igobolondo langaphandle"],"headings":[{"id":"lapho-okuthile-kungeyona-isolidi","text":"Lapho okuthile kungeyona isolidi","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa","text":"Hlanganisa","level":2},{"id":"susa","text":"Susa","level":2},{"id":"hlangana","text":"Hlangana","level":2},{"id":"izinto-ozodinga-ukuzazi","text":"Izinto ozodinga ukuzazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi esolidi ahlanganisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinto eziqinile\u003C/strong\u003E: amaqembu nezakhi ezinobuso obuvala ivolumu, nemiphetho ngayinye ihlanganisa ubuso ababili ngokuphelele. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E lusho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYebo\u003C/span\u003E kwesisodwa, futhi likhombisa ivolumu yaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZiseMenyuni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-okuthile-kungeyona-isolidi\"\u003ELapho okuthile kungeyona isolidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha iqembu noma isakhi. Uma kungeyona isolidi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E lusho ukuthi kungani, isibonelo &quot;Akuyona isolidi: imiphetho engu-4 ibhalwe imbobo · 1 umphetho ophambukayo&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ibhalwe imbobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona ubuso obusweleyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ehlanganiswe ubuso abathathu noma ngaphezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso ohlukanisa ingaphakathi, noma izimo ezimbili zithinta ngomphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso ngaphakathi kwesimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdonga oshiyiwe ngaphakathi kwevolumu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ephambukayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa engavali buso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso oluphenduke ngaphakathi ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso bangaphambili bungena ngaphakathi, bumelene nabomakhelwane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa izinkinga\u003C/span\u003E iyayivula ngalezo miphetho nobuso bukhethiwe, ukuze ubone. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E ilungisa amacala alula ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: isusa imiphetho ephambukayo nobuso ngaphakathi kwesimo, iphendulela ubuso endleleni elifanele, futhi ivala izimbobo ezinomphetho oyisicaba. Noma yini engalungiseleki ngokuphepha (imbobo engeyona eyisicaba, umphetho ohlanganiswe ubuso abaningi) iyishiya kuwe, futhi ithi yini esele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinto eziqinile ezimbili noma ngaphezulu (chofoza eyodwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ezinye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZiba yisolidi eyodwa, eqenjini elilodwa. Lapho zazihlanganile, ubuso obungaphakathi buyanyamalala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa\"\u003ESusa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isolidi okufanele ithathwe (\u003Cstrong\u003Eumsiki\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isolidi okufanele isikwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokho okusele kwesolidi yesibili kuyahlala; umsiki uyasetshenziswa. Isibonelo, ukwenza imbobo ebhlokini, dweba inkonjana iyidlule kuyo, yenze ibe iqembu, bese ususa inkonjana ebhlokini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlangana\"\u003EHlangana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinto eziqinile ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlangana\u003C/span\u003E. Kugcinwa kuphela ingxenye abayabelana ngayo bonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-ozodinga-ukuzazi\"\u003EIzinto ozodinga ukuzazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmphumela uyiqembu elisha. Ugcina igama, umbala nethegi yesolidi yokuqala (ngoSusa: eyodwa osike kuyo). Imibala epenteke ebusweni bawo ayigcinwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlangothi eziqondile zomphumela ziba ubuso obubodwa. Izinhlangothi ezigoqekile zivela njengezinhlangothi ezinqunyiwe ezadwetshwa ngazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma iqembu noma isakhi kungeyona isolidi, ithuluzi lisho ukuthi yiliphi futhi aliguquli lutho. Bheka ubuso obusweleyo noma ubuso ophambukayo ngaphakathi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, amathuluzi asebenza kumaqembu nakwezakhi kulelo qembu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthuluzi ngalinye liyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusebenzisa okokuqala ithuluzi lesolidi, injini yalo (manifold-3d) iyalayishwa, okungathatha isikhashana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Amathuluzi esolidi ahlanganisa izinto eziqinile: amaqembu nezakhi ezinobuso obuvala ivolumu, nemiphetho ngayinye ihlanganisa ubuso ababili ngokuphelele. Ulwazi lwento lusho Solid: Yebo kwesisodwa, futhi likhombisa ivolumu yaso. ZiseMenyuni Izinto eziqinile eqenjini le-Lungisa. Lapho okuthile kungeyona isolidi Khetha iqembu noma isakhi. Uma kungeyona isolidi, Ulwazi lwento lusho ukuthi kungani, isibonelo \"Akuyona isolidi: imiphetho engu-4 ibhalwe imbobo · 1 umphetho ophambukayo\". Inkinga Okusho Imiphetho ibhalwe imbobo Kukhona ubuso obusweleyo Imiphetho ehlanganiswe ubuso abathathu noma ngaphezulu Ubuso ohlukanisa ingaphakathi, noma izimo ezimbili zithinta ngomphetho Ubuso ngaphakathi kwesimo Udonga oshiyiwe ngaphakathi kwevolumu Imiphetho ephambukayo Imigqa engavali buso Ubuso oluphenduke ngaphakathi ngaphandle Ubuso bangaphambili bungena ngaphakathi, bumelene nabomakhelwane Bonisa izinkinga iyayivula ngalezo miphetho nobuso bukhethiwe, ukuze ubone. Lungisa ilungisa amacala alula ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: isusa imiphetho ephambukayo nobuso ngaphakathi kwesimo, iphendulela ubuso endleleni elifanele, futhi ivala izimbobo ezinomphetho oyisicaba. Noma yini engalungiseleki ngokuphepha (imbobo engeyona eyisicaba, umphetho ohlanganiswe ubuso abaningi) iyishiya kuwe, futhi ithi yini esele. Hlanganisa Khetha izinto eziqinile ezimbili noma ngaphezulu (chofoza eyodwa, Ctrl+chofoza ezinye). Izinto eziqinile › Hlanganisa. Ziba yisolidi eyodwa, eqenjini elilodwa. Lapho zazihlanganile, ubuso obungaphakathi buyanyamalala. Susa Izinto eziqinile › Susa. Chofoza isolidi okufanele ithathwe (umsiki). Chofoza isolidi okufanele isikwe. Lokho okusele kwesolidi yesibili kuyahlala; umsiki uyasetshenziswa. Isibonelo, ukwenza imbobo ebhlokini, dweba inkonjana iyidlule kuyo, yenze ibe iqembu, bese ususa inkonjana ebhlokini. Hlangana Khetha izinto eziqinile ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, bese Izinto eziqinile › Ukuhlangana. Kugcinwa kuphela ingxenye abayabelana ngayo bonke. Izinto ozodinga ukuzazi Umphumela uyiqembu elisha. Ugcina igama, umbala nethegi yesolidi yokuqala (ngoSusa: eyodwa osike kuyo). Imibala epenteke ebusweni bawo ayigcinwa. Izinhlangothi eziqondile zomphumela ziba ubuso obubodwa. Izinhlangothi ezigoqekile zivela njengezinhlangothi ezinqunyiwe ezadwetshwa ngazo. Uma iqembu noma isakhi kungeyona isolidi, ithuluzi lisho ukuthi yiliphi futhi aliguquli lutho. Bheka ubuso obusweleyo noma ubuso ophambukayo ngaphakathi kwalo. Ngaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, amathuluzi asebenza kumaqembu nakwezakhi kulelo qembu. Ithuluzi ngalinye liyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Ukusebenzisa okokuqala ithuluzi lesolidi, injini yalo (manifold-3d) iyalayishwa, okungathatha isikhashana.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"hide-isolate","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Fihla, hlukanisa futhi veza","summary":"Susa izinto endleleni ukuze usebenze phakathi kwazo, noma ubonise kuphela lokho osebenza ngakho; izinto ezifihliwe zihlala zifihliwe efayelini.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["fihla","veza","veza konke","hlukanisa","fihla abanye","bonisa","ifihliwe","ukubona kwendawo","ukubonakala","endleleni"],"headings":[{"id":"fihla","text":"Fihla","level":2},{"id":"hlukanisa","text":"Hlukanisa","level":2},{"id":"veza-konke","text":"Veza konke","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkufihla kususa izinto endleleni ngaphandle kokuzisula. Isikhwama, umphetho, iqembu noma isakhi esifihliwe asidweshwa, futhi awukwazi ukusibamba, ukusichofoza noma ukusikhetha, ngakho ungasebenza kulokho okungemuva noma okungaphakathi kwezinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fihla\"\u003EFihla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okufanele kufihlwe: izinhlangothi, imiphetho, amaqembu noma izakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibonelo, ukuze usebenze esikhaleni esincane phakathi kwamaqembu amabili amile eduze kwawo, khetha eleqembu elingaphambili bese uliphilisa: ukuchofoza nokubamba sekufika kuhlangothi olungemuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlukanisa\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha okufuna ukukugcina kubonakala, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsolate (hide the rest)\u003C/span\u003E. Konke okunye emodelini kuyafiphala — noma, uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, konke okunye kuleyo qembu. Uhlangothi olukhethiwe lugcina imiphetho yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"veza-konke\"\u003EVeza konke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa konke futhi, kuwo wonke amaqembu. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ithi izinto eziningi ezifihliwe lapho kungakhethiwe lutho, ngenkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E nayo lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa amaqembu nezakhi ezifihliwe ngohlamvu olunamathe, nehlo elicutshiwe; chofoza eliso ukuze uboniselwe okunye futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgokhiye bemodeler, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyafihla, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlukanisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option H\"\u003E⌥H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaveza konke. (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha isitayela sokhiye.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkufihliwe kugcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft, futhi kuyabuya kufihliwe uma uyilivula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe zisekhona emodelini: ukuthumela kuhlanganisa nazo, nevolumu nosayizi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ziyazibandakanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufihla, ukuhlukanisa noma ukuveza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokulanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ukufihla kususa izinto endleleni ngaphandle kokuzisula. Isikhwama, umphetho, iqembu noma isakhi esifihliwe asidweshwa, futhi awukwazi ukusibamba, ukusichofoza noma ukusikhetha, ngakho ungasebenza kulokho okungemuva noma okungaphakathi kwezinto. Fihla Khetha okufanele kufihlwe: izinhlangothi, imiphetho, amaqembu noma izakhi. Edit › More › Hide. Isibonelo, ukuze usebenze esikhaleni esincane phakathi kwamaqembu amabili amile eduze kwawo, khetha eleqembu elingaphambili bese uliphilisa: ukuchofoza nokubamba sekufika kuhlangothi olungemuva. Hlukanisa Khetha okufuna ukukugcina kubonakala, bese Edit › More › Isolate (hide the rest). Konke okunye emodelini kuyafiphala — noma, uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, konke okunye kuleyo qembu. Uhlangothi olukhethiwe lugcina imiphetho yalo. Veza konke Edit › More › Unhide all ibonisa konke futhi, kuwo wonke amaqembu. I-Entity info ithi izinto eziningi ezifihliwe lapho kungakhethiwe lutho, ngenkinobho ethi Unhide all nayo lapho. I-Outliner ibonisa amaqembu nezakhi ezifihliwe ngohlamvu olunamathe, nehlo elicutshiwe; chofoza eliso ukuze uboniselwe okunye futhi. Ngokhiye bemodeler, H iyafihla, Shift+H iyahlukanisa, Alt+H iyaveza konke. (Settings › ModelCraft ikhetha isitayela sokhiye.) Okufanele ukwazi Okufihliwe kugcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft, futhi kuyabuya kufihliwe uma uyilivula. Izinto ezifihliwe zisekhona emodelini: ukuthumela kuhlanganisa nazo, nevolumu nosayizi ku-Entity info ziyazibandakanya. Ukufihla, ukuhlukanisa noma ukuveza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokulanda.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tags","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amathegi: bonisa nufihle amaqoqo ezinto","summary":"Nikeza amaqembu nezakhi ithegi, njengo **Impahla**, **Izindonga** noma **Isayithi**, bese ufihla noma ubonise konke okunalelo thegi ngesikhathi esisodwa.","section":"tasks","order":48,"keywords":["amathegi","ithegi","izingqimba","ungqimba","bonisa","fihla","ukubonakala","hlela","impahla","izindonga","akunathegi","qamba kabusha ithegi","susa ithegi"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-ithegi","text":"Yenza ithegi","level":2},{"id":"thega-amaqembu-nezakhi","text":"Thega amaqembu nezakhi","level":2},{"id":"fihla-nobonise","text":"Fihla nobonise","level":2},{"id":"susa-ithegi","text":"Susa ithegi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthegi yigama onikeza amaqembu nezakhi, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIsayithi\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze ukwazi ukufihla noma ukubonisa konke okunalelo thegi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Amathegi yilokho amakhompyutha wokuklama abiza ngokuthi izingqimba. Ukufihla into eyodwa ngesikhathi, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa nobonise\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ithegi\"\u003EYenza ithegi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ithegi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha igama lalo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uqambe kabusha ithegi, chofoza igama laleli ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha elisha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Amathegi amabili awakwazi ukwabelana ngegama elifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thega-amaqembu-nezakhi\"\u003EThega amaqembu nezakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu elilodwa noma ngaphezulu, noma izakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, khetha ithegi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThega\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthegi elisha…\u003C/span\u003E lenza elisha bese lithega okukhethiwe ngalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkunathegi\u003C/span\u003E isusa ithegi. Inombolo eduze kwethegi ngalinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ukuthi mangaki amaqembu nezakhi analo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThega amaqembu nezakhi, hhayi ubuso nemiphetho ekhululekile: dweba izinto ozifuna ukuzithega njengamaqembu kuqala (khetha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fihla-nobonise\"\u003EFihla nobonise\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza iso eliseduze kwethegi. Konke okunalelo thegi kuyanyamalala ebusweni, noma kukuphi kumodeli (nangaphakathi kwamanye amaqembu), nokuchofoza nokubambelela kudlula kukho. Chofoza iso futhi ukuze ulibonise. Izinto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkunathegi\u003C/span\u003E zihlale zibonakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu othegi lalo ulifihlile, iqembu liyavaleka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-ithegi\"\u003ESusa ithegi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza inkwali yokususa eseduze kwalo. Okwakunalelo thegi kuba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkunathegi\u003C/span\u003E, futhi kuyabonakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathegi, amagama awo nokuthi yiwaphi afihliwe alondolozwa efayeleni le-ModelCraft. Ukukopisha iqembu elinethegi kwenye imodeli kuletha nethegi yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufihla nokubonisa ithegi, nazo zonke ezinye izinguquko zamathegi, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthumela kuhlanganisa konke, namathegi afihliwe, njengalokho okwenzeka ezintweni ezifihliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingqimba ze-DWG ne-DXF amapulani wesayithi azingeni njengamathegi okwamanje: umdwebo wonke ufika njengeqembu elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ithegi yigama onikeza amaqembu nezakhi, njengo Impahla, Izindonga noma Isayithi, ukuze ukwazi ukufihla noma ukubonisa konke okunalelo thegi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Amathegi yilokho amakhompyutha wokuklama abiza ngokuthi izingqimba. Ukufihla into eyodwa ngesikhathi, bheka Fihla, hlukanisa nobonise. Yenza ithegi Ku-Amathegi ngakwesokudla, chofoza Engeza ithegi. Thayipha igama lalo bese ucindezela Enter. Ukuze uqambe kabusha ithegi, chofoza igama laleli ku-Amathegi, thayipha elisha bese ucindezela Enter. Amathegi amabili awakwazi ukwabelana ngegama elifanayo. Thega amaqembu nezakhi Khetha iqembu elilodwa noma ngaphezulu, noma izakhi. Ku-Ulwazi lwento, khetha ithegi ku-Thega. Ithegi elisha… lenza elisha bese lithega okukhethiwe ngalo. Akunathegi isusa ithegi. Inombolo eduze kwethegi ngalinye ku-Amathegi ibonisa ukuthi mangaki amaqembu nezakhi analo. Thega amaqembu nezakhi, hhayi ubuso nemiphetho ekhululekile: dweba izinto ozifuna ukuzithega njengamaqembu kuqala (khetha, Shift+G). Fihla nobonise Chofoza iso eliseduze kwethegi. Konke okunalelo thegi kuyanyamalala ebusweni, noma kukuphi kumodeli (nangaphakathi kwamanye amaqembu), nokuchofoza nokubambelela kudlula kukho. Chofoza iso futhi ukuze ulibonise. Izinto Akunathegi zihlale zibonakala. Uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu othegi lalo ulifihlile, iqembu liyavaleka. Susa ithegi Chofoza inkwali yokususa eseduze kwalo. Okwakunalelo thegi kuba Akunathegi, futhi kuyabonakala. Okufanele ukwazi Amathegi, amagama awo nokuthi yiwaphi afihliwe alondolozwa efayeleni le-ModelCraft. Ukukopisha iqembu elinethegi kwenye imodeli kuletha nethegi yalo. Ukufihla nokubonisa ithegi, nazo zonke ezinye izinguquko zamathegi, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukuthumela kuhlanganisa konke, namathegi afihliwe, njengalokho okwenzeka ezintweni ezifihliwe. Izingqimba ze-DWG ne-DXF amapulani wesayithi azingeni njengamathegi okwamanje: umdwebo wonke ufika njengeqembu elilodwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sections","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amapulani esigaba: sika imodeli","summary":"Beka ipulani lesigaba ukubona ngaphakathi kwemodeli, uyidonse ngaphakathi, uyiphendulele noma uvale ukusika.","section":"tasks","order":49,"keywords":["isigaba","ipulani lesigaba","ukusika isigaba","ukusika","ukusikwa","clip","ngaphakathi","uhlelo lwendlu","ukuhlukanisa","isigaba esinqunyiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"beka-elilodwa","text":"Beka elilodwa","level":2},{"id":"yidonse-uyiphendulele-uyicime","text":"Yidonse, uyiphendulele, uyicime","level":2},{"id":"bonisa-noma-fihla","text":"Bonisa noma fihla","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIpulani lesigaba lisika imodeli ivuleke, ukuze ubone futhi usebenze ngaphakathi kwayo: uhlelo lwendlu, ingaphakathi likabhodwe. Imodeli ayishintshwa; ukusika kuwumbono kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-elilodwa\"\u003EBeka elilodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECamera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso. Ipulani libekwa phezu kwalobo buso, ngamacembu amane aphethe kuwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza kude nanoma yibuphi ubuso ukuze uthole ipulani esikwele endleleni obheka kuyo kakhulu. Cindezela inkinobho yomcibisholo kuqala ukuze umise ngesikwele kubomvu (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), koluhlaza (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) noma koluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlangothi ogxilwe yimicibisholo lusikwa \u003Cstrong\u003Elususwe\u003C/strong\u003E. Ipulani ebekwe ebusweni ayisiki lutho okwamanje: liyidonse ngaphakathi kwemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yidonse-uyiphendulele-uyicime\"\u003EYidonse, uyiphendulele, uyicime\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza umugqa wepulani ukuze uyikhethe. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong its arrows\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa lapho ihlala khona. Bhala ibanga elisha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyidonsela ngaphakathi kwemodeli; ukubhala \u003Ccode\u003E-1m\u003C/code\u003E kuphlanyelwe ebusweni bangaphambili kuyihambisela ngaphakathi kwemodeli ngu-1 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E ijikisa imicibisholo, ukuze olunye uhlangothi lusikwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActive (cuts the model)\u003C/span\u003E: ipulani eyodwa isika ngesikhathi. Tika ibhokisi lenye ipulani, noma beka enye, bese leyo isika esikhundleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYiqamba kabusha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E; uyisule ngokucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ipulani idlula isolidi evaliwe, ukusika kugcwaliswa ngombala omnyama. Ijiyomethri engavaliwe (ubuso obubodwa, ibhokisi elivulekile) iyasikwa kodwa ayigcwaliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bonisa-noma-fihla\"\u003EBonisa noma fihla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow section planes\u003C/span\u003E ifihla imigqa yamapulani nemicibisholo (ukusika kuhlala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow section cuts\u003C/span\u003E icisha ukusika futhi ibonise imodeli yonke, ngaphandle kokususa amapulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003EUmbono wokwethula\u003C/a\u003E nawo ufihla imigqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELokho okusikwe kususwa ekuchofoleni noma ekuboneni, ngakho ungadweba phezu kwalokho ukusika kukubonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmapulani esigaba, eyodwa esebenzayo nezinkinobho ezimbili zigcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft. Ushintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthunyelwa kuhlala kuqukethe imodeli yonke: isigaba ngumbono, hhayi ukuhlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ipulani lesigaba lisika imodeli ivuleke, ukuze ubone futhi usebenze ngaphakathi kwayo: uhlelo lwendlu, ingaphakathi likabhodwe. Imodeli ayishintshwa; ukusika kuwumbono kuphela. Beka elilodwa Chofoza Section eqenjini le-Camera. Chofoza ubuso. Ipulani libekwa phezu kwalobo buso, ngamacembu amane aphethe kuwe. Chofoza kude nanoma yibuphi ubuso ukuze uthole ipulani esikwele endleleni obheka kuyo kakhulu. Cindezela inkinobho yomcibisholo kuqala ukuze umise ngesikwele kubomvu (→), koluhlaza (←) noma koluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (↑). Uhlangothi ogxilwe yimicibisholo lusikwa lususwe. Ipulani ebekwe ebusweni ayisiki lutho okwamanje: liyidonse ngaphakathi kwemodeli. Yidonse, uyiphendulele, uyicime Chofoza umugqa wepulani ukuze uyikhethe. Ku-Entity info: Along its arrows ibonisa lapho ihlala khona. Bhala ibanga elisha bese ucindezela Enter ukuyidonsela ngaphakathi kwemodeli; ukubhala -1m kuphlanyelwe ebusweni bangaphambili kuyihambisela ngaphakathi kwemodeli ngu-1 m. Reverse ijikisa imicibisholo, ukuze olunye uhlangothi lusikwe. Active (cuts the model): ipulani eyodwa isika ngesikhathi. Tika ibhokisi lenye ipulani, noma beka enye, bese leyo isika esikhundleni. Yiqamba kabusha ku-Name; uyisule ngokucindezela Delete noma nge-Eraser. Lapho ipulani idlula isolidi evaliwe, ukusika kugcwaliswa ngombala omnyama. Ijiyomethri engavaliwe (ubuso obubodwa, ibhokisi elivulekile) iyasikwa kodwa ayigcwaliswa. Bonisa noma fihla Ku-Views: Show section planes ifihla imigqa yamapulani nemicibisholo (ukusika kuhlala). Show section cuts icisha ukusika futhi ibonise imodeli yonke, ngaphandle kokususa amapulani. Umbono wokwethula nawo ufihla imigqa. Okufanele wazi Lokho okusikwe kususwa ekuchofoleni noma ekuboneni, ngakho ungadweba phezu kwalokho ukusika kukubonisa. Amapulani esigaba, eyodwa esebenzayo nezinkinobho ezimbili zigcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft. Ushintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukuthunyelwa kuhlala kuqukethe imodeli yonke: isigaba ngumbono, hhayi ukuhlela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"move-copy","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hambisa, kopisha bese wenza izinhlu","summary":"Hambisa izinto ngokuchofoza noma ngebanga elinembile, zikopishe ngokhiye wokuguqula, bese wenza umugqa wamakhophi alinganiselwe ngokulinganayo.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["hambisa","kopisha","phinda","inhlu","umugqa","ukusabalala","hlukanisa","offset","elula","amakholomu","phinda","amakhophi amaningi"],"headings":[{"id":"hambisa-into","text":"Hambisa into","level":2},{"id":"ukuhambisa-ingxenye-yesakhiwo-kuyisoleka","text":"Ukuhambisa ingxenye yesakhiwo kuyisoleka","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-into","text":"Kopisha into","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-sika-namathisela-bese-uphinda","text":"Kopisha, sika, namathisela bese uphinda","level":2},{"id":"umugqa-wamakhophi","text":"Umugqa wamakhophi","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-amakholomu-njalo-nge-6-meter","text":"Isibonelo: amakholomu njalo nge-6 meter","level":3},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ihambisa noma yini okhethiwe isuka endaweni eyodwa iyiyo enye. Ukubamba ukhiye wokuguqula kwenza kube ikhophi, futhi ngemva kokukopisha ungathayipha ukuthi ufuna amanye amaningi kangakanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-into\"\u003EHambisa into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuthile ofuna ukukuhambisa (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/select\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/select\"\u003EKhetha izinto\u003C/a\u003E). Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E uthatha into ochofoza kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa. Khetha into ebalulekile, njengekhona: leliphoyinti liyofika ngqo lapho uchofoza khona okulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi. Okukhethiwe kuyalandela. Kubamba amaphoyinti, imiphetho nezinqondo ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezizuri njengoba umugqa wenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho iphoyinti liyofika, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthiphu yebha yesimo ibuyela ku-&quot;Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa…&quot; ukuze kube yokuhambisa okulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbanga elithayipha liya endleleni okhomba ngayo. Ungathayipha futhi ukushintshwa okunembile, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;2m,0,0&gt;\u003C/code\u003E (2 m ngomugqa obomvu), noma indawo engenzeka ngokunembile yephoyinti oliyikhethile, \u003Ccode\u003E[0,0,0]\u003C/code\u003E (i-origin). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EThayipha izilinganiso ezinembile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhambisa ngomugqa owodwa kuphela, cindezela inkinobho yomcibisholo ngemva kochofozo lokuqala: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhiya kubomvu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuluhlaza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Cindezela umcibisholo ofanayo ukuze uvule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhambisa-ingxenye-yesakhiwo-kuyisoleka\"\u003EUkuhambisa ingxenye yesakhiwo kuyisoleka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungahlanganisiwe kuyaxhunyiwe. Uma ukhetha uhlangothi olulodwa noma imiphetho embalwa uyihambise, izinhlangothi ezixhunyiwe kuyo ziyasoleka ukuze zilandele. Hambisa uhlangothi oluphezulu bhokisi ngasohlangothini, bhokisi liyakhengama; hambisa omunye umphetho wophahla, uphahla luyashintsha ukuthambeka. Izinhlangothi ezingasasali zigoqeke zibe izinxantathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uhambise into yonke ngaphandle kokuyisoleka, yikhethe yonke kuqala (chofoza kathathu), noma kangcono, yenze iqembu noma ikhomponenti (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EAmaqembu nezikhomponenti\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-into\"\u003EKopisha into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuthile ofuna ukukopisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa. Ku-Mac, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zenza okufanayo. Ithiphu ithi &quot;Ctrl ihambisa kunalokho&quot;, okusho ukuthi uyakopisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaphinda ucindezele bese ukhulula \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngemva kochofozo lokuqala ukushintsha phakathi kokuhambisa nokukopisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho ikhophi iyofika, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkokuqala kuhlala lapho kwakukhona, futhi ikhophi iyakhethwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-sika-namathisela-bese-uphinda\"\u003EKopisha, sika, namathisela bese uphinda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikopisha okukhethiwe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikusika (ikopisha, bese iyasusa), futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E nazo ziyizinkinobho kweqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lamathuluzi, kanti \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E eseduze kwazo inokusika, namathisela endaweni efanayo nokuphinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inamathisela: umumo wekhophi uyalandela isikhombi, uhamba njengamanye amathuluzi, futhi ukuchofoza kuyawubeka ngophansi kwawo okungcono kakhulu lapho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhansela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inamathisela endaweni efanayo, lapho ikhophi yavela khona: kuwusizo ukuthutha okuthile kuqembu elivuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-style ye-Modeler) iphinda: ikhophi iyenziwa futhi ihamba nesikhombi ngokushesha; chofoza ukuyibeka, thayipha ibanga, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyishiya. Ngemva kwalokho, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E ukuthola amanye amakhophi ngokulandelana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu elinamathiselwe liba iqembu elisha. Ikhomponenti enamathiselwe iwukubekwa okunye kwale khomponenti, ngakho ukuhlela eyodwa kushintsha zonke. Amakhophi nawo angamathiselwa kwenye ithebhu ye-ModelCraft kulesi sisekeli (lapho angena njengezincazelo ezintsha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umugqa-wamakhophi\"\u003EUmugqa wamakhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva nje kokukopisha, ngenkathi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E isasethuluzi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E) bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuthola amakhophi amathathu ngokulandelana, ngalinye ebangeni elifanayo nekhophi lokuqala. Uthola amakhophi amathathu amasha ngaphandle kokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuhlukanisa: amakhophi amathathu asakazeka ngokulinganayo kusuka kokuqala kuya endaweni lapho ubeke khona ikhophi yokuqala, eyokugcina ilapho. Sebenzisa lokhu ukugcwalisa ibanga: beka ikhophi eyodwa ekugcineni elikude, bese uhlukanisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThayipha inombolo ehlukile ngemva kwalokho: \u003Ccode\u003E5x\u003C/code\u003E ishintsha umugqa we-\u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E. Ithiphu iyakukhumbuza: &quot;Kukopishiwe. Thayipha 3x ukuthola amakhophi amaningi ngokulandelana, noma /3 ukuhlukanisa ibanga.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isibonelo-amakholomu-njalo-nge-6-meter\"\u003EIsibonelo: amakholomu njalo nge-6 meter\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza ikholomu bese uyenza ikhomponenti (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ukuze wonke amakhophi ashintshe ndawonye kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza ikhona lesisekelo sekholomu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ngomugqa obomvu bese uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E6m\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E4x\u003C/code\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Uzoba namakholomu amahlanu, ayi-6 m ngokuhlukana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphambi kochofozo lwesibili ukukhansela; konke kubuyela lapho kwakukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E isebenza ngaphakathi eqenjini oliliguqulayo. Ukuze uhambise iqembu lonke, liyeke kuqala bese ulikhetha kusuka ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cstrong\u003ECollide\u003C/strong\u003E ivulekile (ngaphansi kwesokudla, nakuma-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#solids-stop-where-they-touch\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"solids-stop-where-they-touch\"\u003EModelCraft settings\u003C/a\u003E), ukuhamba kuyayeka lapho okukhethiwe kuthinta esinye isolid kunokudlula kuso. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollide\u003C/span\u003E ukuyivala ukuhamba okufanele kudlule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubeka ikhophi ngaphakathi kwenye iqembu: yikopishe, vula elinye iqembu, bese unamathisela (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina endaweni efanayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Move (M) ihambisa noma yini okhethiwe isuka endaweni eyodwa iyiyo enye. Ukubamba ukhiye wokuguqula kwenza kube ikhophi, futhi ngemva kokukopisha ungathayipha ukuthi ufuna amanye amaningi kangakanani. Hambisa into Khetha okuthile ofuna ukukuhambisa (bona Khetha izinto). Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Move uthatha into ochofoza kuyo. Cindezela M. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa. Khetha into ebalulekile, njengekhona: leliphoyinti liyofika ngqo lapho uchofoza khona okulandelayo. Hambisa isikhombi. Okukhethiwe kuyalandela. Kubamba amaphoyinti, imiphetho nezinqondo ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezizuri njengoba umugqa wenza. Chofoza lapho iphoyinti liyofika, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter. Ithiphu yebha yesimo ibuyela ku-\"Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa…\" ukuze kube yokuhambisa okulandelayo. Ibanga elithayipha liya endleleni okhomba ngayo. Ungathayipha futhi ukushintshwa okunembile, \u003C2m,0,0\u003E (2 m ngomugqa obomvu), noma indawo engenzeka ngokunembile yephoyinti oliyikhethile, [0,0,0] (i-origin). Bona Thayipha izilinganiso ezinembile. Ukuhambisa ngomugqa owodwa kuphela, cindezela inkinobho yomcibisholo ngemva kochofozo lokuqala: → ikhiya kubomvu, ← kuluhlaza, ↑ kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Cindezela umcibisholo ofanayo ukuze uvule. Ukuhambisa ingxenye yesakhiwo kuyisoleka Okungahlanganisiwe kuyaxhunyiwe. Uma ukhetha uhlangothi olulodwa noma imiphetho embalwa uyihambise, izinhlangothi ezixhunyiwe kuyo ziyasoleka ukuze zilandele. Hambisa uhlangothi oluphezulu bhokisi ngasohlangothini, bhokisi liyakhengama; hambisa omunye umphetho wophahla, uphahla luyashintsha ukuthambeka. Izinhlangothi ezingasasali zigoqeke zibe izinxantathu. Ukuze uhambise into yonke ngaphandle kokuyisoleka, yikhethe yonke kuqala (chofoza kathathu), noma kangcono, yenze iqembu noma ikhomponenti (bona Amaqembu nezikhomponenti). Kopisha into Khetha okuthile ofuna ukukopisha. Cindezela M. Bamba Ctrl (noma Alt) bese uchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala lokuhambisa. Ku-Mac, Ctrl noma Alt zenza okufanayo. Ithiphu ithi \"Ctrl ihambisa kunalokho\", okusho ukuthi uyakopisha. Ungaphinda ucindezele bese ukhulula Ctrl noma Alt ngemva kochofozo lokuqala ukushintsha phakathi kokuhambisa nokukopisha. Chofoza lapho ikhophi iyofika, noma thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter. Okokuqala kuhlala lapho kwakukhona, futhi ikhophi iyakhethwa. Kopisha, sika, namathisela bese uphinda Ctrl+C ikopisha okukhethiwe, Ctrl+X ikusika (ikopisha, bese iyasusa), futhi Copy no Paste nazo ziyizinkinobho kweqembu Edit ebhalweni lamathuluzi, kanti More eseduze kwazo inokusika, namathisela endaweni efanayo nokuphinda. Ctrl+V inamathisela: umumo wekhophi uyalandela isikhombi, uhamba njengamanye amathuluzi, futhi ukuchofoza kuyawubeka ngophansi kwawo okungcono kakhulu lapho. Esc iyakhansela. Ctrl+Shift+V inamathisela endaweni efanayo, lapho ikhophi yavela khona: kuwusizo ukuthutha okuthile kuqembu elivuliwe. Ctrl+D (Shift+D ku-style ye-Modeler) iphinda: ikhophi iyenziwa futhi ihamba nesikhombi ngokushesha; chofoza ukuyibeka, thayipha ibanga, noma cindezela Esc ukuyishiya. Ngemva kwalokho, thayipha 3x ukuthola amanye amakhophi ngokulandelana. Iqembu elinamathiselwe liba iqembu elisha. Ikhomponenti enamathiselwe iwukubekwa okunye kwale khomponenti, ngakho ukuhlela eyodwa kushintsha zonke. Amakhophi nawo angamathiselwa kwenye ithebhu ye-ModelCraft kulesi sisekeli (lapho angena njengezincazelo ezintsha). Umugqa wamakhophi Ngemva nje kokukopisha, ngenkathi Move isasethuluzi: Thayipha 3x (noma *3) bese ucindezela Enter ukuthola amakhophi amathathu ngokulandelana, ngalinye ebangeni elifanayo nekhophi lokuqala. Uthola amakhophi amathathu amasha ngaphandle kokuqala. Thayipha /3 bese ucindezela Enter ukuhlukanisa: amakhophi amathathu asakazeka ngokulinganayo kusuka kokuqala kuya endaweni lapho ubeke khona ikhophi yokuqala, eyokugcina ilapho. Sebenzisa lokhu ukugcwalisa ibanga: beka ikhophi eyodwa ekugcineni elikude, bese uhlukanisa. Thayipha inombolo ehlukile ngemva kwalokho: 5x ishintsha umugqa we-3x. Ithiphu iyakukhumbuza: \"Kukopishiwe. Thayipha 3x ukuthola amakhophi amaningi ngokulandelana, noma /3 ukuhlukanisa ibanga.\" Isibonelo: amakholomu njalo nge-6 meter Yenza ikholomu bese uyenza ikhomponenti (G), ukuze wonke amakhophi ashintshe ndawonye kamuva. Cindezela M, bamba Ctrl bese uchofoza ikhona lesisekelo sekholomu. Hambisa ngomugqa obomvu bese uthayipha 6m, bese Enter. Thayipha 4x bese Enter. Uzoba namakholomu amahlanu, ayi-6 m ngokuhlukana. Okufanele ukwazi Cindezela Esc ngaphambi kochofozo lwesibili ukukhansela; konke kubuyela lapho kwakukhona. Move isebenza ngaphakathi eqenjini oliliguqulayo. Ukuze uhambise iqembu lonke, liyeke kuqala bese ulikhetha kusuka ngaphandle. Uma Collide ivulekile (ngaphansi kwesokudla, nakuma-ModelCraft settings), ukuhamba kuyayeka lapho okukhethiwe kuthinta esinye isolid kunokudlula kuso. Chofoza Collide ukuyivala ukuhamba okufanele kudlule. Ukubeka ikhophi ngaphakathi kwenye iqembu: yikopishe, vula elinye iqembu, bese unamathisela (Ctrl+Shift+V igcina endaweni efanayo).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"soften","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thambisa nokushelezisa imiphetho","summary":"Fihla imiphetho phakathi kobuso obuhlangana ngengeli encane, ukuze izimo ezigoqekile zibonakale njengobuso obubodwa obushelelezi, kuModelCraft nasemafayelini athunyelwayo.","section":"tasks","order":52,"keywords":["thambisa","shelezisa","imiphetho ethambile","ukushadisa okushelelezi","fihla imiphetho","izigaba","ezinezigaba","izinormal","qinisa","engeli"],"headings":[{"id":"thambisa-ngengeli","text":"Thambisa ngengeli","level":2},{"id":"izinto-ozodinga-ukuzazi","text":"Izinto ozodinga ukuzazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIshepu egoqekile ku-ModelCraft yakhiwe ngobuso oluyisicaba. \u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho ethambile\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwalobo buso ayidwetshwa, futhi ubuso abahlanganisayo bushadiswa njengobuso obubodwa obushelelezi, ngakho isilinda esinezinhlangothi ezingu-24 sibonakala sijikeleziwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho udonsa isiyingi ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E, izinhlangothi zaso ziyathanjiswa ngokwazo. Kwezinye izimo, thambisa ngengeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thambisa-ngengeli\"\u003EThambisa ngengeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzothanjiswa: ubuso nemiphetho, noma iqembu noma isakhi (yonke imiphetho yaso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, bhala engeli ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThambisa kuze kube\u003C/span\u003E, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThambisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke imiphetho ekukhethweni okuthi izinhlangothi zayo zigoqe ngalelo ngeli noma ngaphansi kwalo iba ethambile; imiphetho enokugoqeka okubukhali iba iqinile. Ipulazi elinezinhlangothi eziyi-12 izinhlangothi zalo zigoqeka ngama-30°, nemiphetho yalo engaphezulu nengaphansi ngama-90°, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E31\u003C/code\u003E ithambisa izinhlangothi kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQinisa konke\u003C/span\u003E yenza yonke imiphetho ekukhethweni ibe iqinile futhi. Ngayinye iyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-ozodinga-ukuzazi\"\u003EIzinto ozodinga ukuzazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuthanjiswa kuphela imiphetho ehlangana phakathi kobuso obubili ngqo. Imiphetho ekhululekile ihlala njengoba ilunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushadisa okushelezi kwenzeka phakathi kwemiphetho ethambile kuphela: ubuso ongenayo imiphetho ethambile ushadiswa ngokuqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho ethambile igcinwa kwifayela le-ModelCraft. Ukuthunyelwa kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E kuthwala ukushadiswa okushelezi (i-normal ngekhona ngalinye), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zibonise indawo efanayo. I-Collada ne-STL zithumela ubuso oluyisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho ethambile ifihlekile kuzo zonke izitayela zobuso, nakwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E nakwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuze uyibone, khetha isakhiwo bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQinisa konke\u003C/span\u003E; ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela ukuthambisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ishepu egoqekile ku-ModelCraft yakhiwe ngobuso oluyisicaba. Imiphetho ethambile phakathi kwalobo buso ayidwetshwa, futhi ubuso abahlanganisayo bushadiswa njengobuso obubodwa obushelelezi, ngakho isilinda esinezinhlangothi ezingu-24 sibonakala sijikeleziwe. Lapho udonsa isiyingi ngo-Sunduza/hudula, izinhlangothi zaso ziyathanjiswa ngokwazo. Kwezinye izimo, thambisa ngengeli. Thambisa ngengeli Khetha okuzothanjiswa: ubuso nemiphetho, noma iqembu noma isakhi (yonke imiphetho yaso). Ku-Ulwazi lwento, bhala engeli ku-Thambisa kuze kube, njengo 20, bese uchofoza Thambisa. Yonke imiphetho ekukhethweni okuthi izinhlangothi zayo zigoqe ngalelo ngeli noma ngaphansi kwalo iba ethambile; imiphetho enokugoqeka okubukhali iba iqinile. Ipulazi elinezinhlangothi eziyi-12 izinhlangothi zalo zigoqeka ngama-30°, nemiphetho yalo engaphezulu nengaphansi ngama-90°, ngakho 31 ithambisa izinhlangothi kuphela. Qinisa konke yenza yonke imiphetho ekukhethweni ibe iqinile futhi. Ngayinye iyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Izinto ozodinga ukuzazi Kuthanjiswa kuphela imiphetho ehlangana phakathi kobuso obubili ngqo. Imiphetho ekhululekile ihlala njengoba ilunjalo. Ukushadisa okushelezi kwenzeka phakathi kwemiphetho ethambile kuphela: ubuso ongenayo imiphetho ethambile ushadiswa ngokuqondile. Imiphetho ethambile igcinwa kwifayela le-ModelCraft. Ukuthunyelwa kwe-glTF (.glb) ne-OBJ kuthwala ukushadiswa okushelezi (i-normal ngekhona ngalinye), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zibonise indawo efanayo. I-Collada ne-STL zithumela ubuso oluyisicaba. Imiphetho ethambile ifihlekile kuzo zonke izitayela zobuso, nakwi-X-ray nakwi-Uhlaka lwewaya. Ukuze uyibone, khetha isakhiwo bese uchofoza Qinisa konke; ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela ukuthambisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"intersect","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlanganisa izinhlangothi","summary":"Dweba imigqa lapho izinhlangothi zisikana khona, ukuze ukwazi ukuphusha, ukususa noma ukupenda izingxenye.","section":"tasks","order":53,"keywords":["hlanganisa","hlanganisa izinhlangothi","hlanganisa nemodeli","hlanganisa nokukhethiwe","sika","ukuvulwa","imbobo","hlanganisa","imigqa lapho izinhlangothi zidlula khona","i-boolean"],"headings":[{"id":"hlanganisa-nemodeli","text":"Hlanganisa nemodeli","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-nokukhethiwe","text":"Hlanganisa nokukhethiwe","level":2},{"id":"lapho-imigqa-iya-khona","text":"Lapho imigqa iya khona","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELapho ishape eyodwa idlula kwelinye, i-ModelCraft ayidwebi umugqa lapho izinhlangothi zabo zihlangana: zihlangana nje. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/strong\u003E idweba leyo migqa, njengemiphetho, ukuze izinhlangothi zihlukaniswe khona. Bese ungaphusha/hudula, usule noma upende izingxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izimiyalo zisesikhundleni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-nemodeli\"\u003EHlanganisa nemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsika okukhethiwe ngokumelene \u003Cstrong\u003Enazo zonke izinhlangothi ezisesikrinini\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibonelo, umthambo (iqembu) udlula odongeni (elinye iqembu), futhi ufuna ukuvula udonga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili udonga ukuze uvule, bese ukhetha zonke izinhlangothi zalo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control A\"\u003E⌃A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntersect with model\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wembonakalo yomthambo udweba kuzo zombili izinhlangothi zodonga, njengezinhlangothi ezintsha ezimbili. Phusha enye yazo idlule odongeni ukuze wenze ukuvuleka, bese uvala udonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-nokukhethiwe\"\u003EHlanganisa nokukhethiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsika izinhlangothi, amaqembu nezakhi ezikhethiwe \u003Cstrong\u003Engokumelene nazo zodwa\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha okungenani ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-imigqa-iya-khona\"\u003ELapho imigqa iya khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa ihlale idwetshwa \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi kwesimo esivulekile\u003C/strong\u003E: emodelini uma kungavulwa iqembu, noma eqenjini ohlela kulo. Amaqembu nezakhi ezingavulwanga azishintshi. Ngakho ukusika izinhlangothi zeqembu, vula kuqala, njengesibonelo esingenhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlangothi ezilele endizeni efanayo azihlanganiswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa evala ilupu ohlangothini yenza uhlangothi olusha, njengoba imigqa edweshiwe yenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlanganisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokulanda. Uma akukho okusikayo, akukho okushintshayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgezimo ezivaliwe, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Eamathuluzi amandla\u003C/a\u003E (Union, Subtract) yenza umsebenzi wonke ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lapho ishape eyodwa idlula kwelinye, i-ModelCraft ayidwebi umugqa lapho izinhlangothi zabo zihlangana: zihlangana nje. I-Hlanganisa idweba leyo migqa, njengemiphetho, ukuze izinhlangothi zihlukaniswe khona. Bese ungaphusha/hudula, usule noma upende izingxenye. Zombili izimiyalo zisesikhundleni se-Edit › More. Hlanganisa nemodeli Isika okukhethiwe ngokumelene nazo zonke izinhlangothi ezisesikrinini. Isibonelo, umthambo (iqembu) udlula odongeni (elinye iqembu), futhi ufuna ukuvula udonga: Chofoza kabili udonga ukuze uvule, bese ukhetha zonke izinhlangothi zalo (Ctrl+A). Edit › More › Intersect with model. Umugqa wembonakalo yomthambo udweba kuzo zombili izinhlangothi zodonga, njengezinhlangothi ezintsha ezimbili. Phusha enye yazo idlule odongeni ukuze wenze ukuvuleka, bese uvala udonga. Hlanganisa nokukhethiwe Isika izinhlangothi, amaqembu nezakhi ezikhethiwe ngokumelene nazo zodwa. Khetha okungenani ezimbili. Lapho imigqa iya khona Imigqa ihlale idwetshwa ngaphakathi kwesimo esivulekile: emodelini uma kungavulwa iqembu, noma eqenjini ohlela kulo. Amaqembu nezakhi ezingavulwanga azishintshi. Ngakho ukusika izinhlangothi zeqembu, vula kuqala, njengesibonelo esingenhla. Okufanele ukwazi Izinhlangothi ezilele endizeni efanayo azihlanganiswa. Imigqa evala ilupu ohlangothini yenza uhlangothi olusha, njengoba imigqa edweshiwe yenza. Ukuhlanganisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokulanda. Uma akukho okusikayo, akukho okushintshayo. Ngezimo ezivaliwe, amathuluzi amandla (Union, Subtract) yenza umsebenzi wonke ngesinyathelo esisodwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"axes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hambisa futhi ujikise ama-akisi wokudweba","summary":"Jikisa ama-akisi abomvu, aluhlaza nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ukuze afane nesakhiwo esingekho esiqondile kuwo, noma uwalinganise nobuso, ukuze ukudweba nokubhala kulandele kona.","section":"tasks","order":54,"keywords":["ama-akisi","ama-akisi wokudweba","origin","linganisa ama-akisi","jikisa ama-akisi","phendula ama-akisi","jikisa ama-akisi","isakhiwo esiphambeke","esiphambekile","ucs","uhlelo lokuxhumanisa"],"headings":[{"id":"beka-ama-akisi","text":"Beka ama-akisi","level":2},{"id":"lingana-ama-akisi-nobuso","text":"Lingana ama-akisi nobuso","level":2},{"id":"setha-kabusha-ama-akisi","text":"Setha kabusha ama-akisi","level":2},{"id":"okunye-okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okunye okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAma-akisi abomvu, aluhlaza nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka aqondisa konke okudwebayo: izinhlangothi zamanxande ziyalingana nawo, imigqa iyakhiya kuwo, futhi umhlaba uyindiza ebomvu-eluhlaza. Uma isakhiwo sihlezi ngesihloko (isakhiwo sesayithi esingeqondile kwenyakatho, ingxenye ejikelwe nge-30°), hambisa ama-akisi kuso, ukuze ukudweba kulandele izindonga zaso. Imodeli ngokwayo ayinyakazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke imiyalo emithathu itholakala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-ama-akisi\"\u003EBeka ama-akisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace axes\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho i-origin iyohlala khona, njengekhona lesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti elisemgqeni wama-akisi abomvu amasha, njengokuya phambili kodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti ngasohlangothini lwama-akisi aluhlaza amasha. Aluhlaza yenziwa ilingane nabomvu, nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka bume ilingane kukho kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-akisi adwetshwa endaweni yawo entsha. Unxande odwetshwa manje emhlabathini, noma othayiphwe njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, uhamba ngokubomvu nokuluhlaza okujikisiwe; okhiye bombono bayakhiya kuwo; futhi i-origin snap isendaweni yesi-origin esisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lingana-ama-akisi-nobuso\"\u003ELingana ama-akisi nobuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ubuso obubodwa, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlign axes to face\u003C/span\u003E. Obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka bese bubheka kuphuma kubuso, obubomvu buhamba ngomphetho wabo omude kakhulu, futhi i-origin isekuqaleni kwalowo mphetho. Sebenzisa lokhu ukudweba phezu kophahla olunamathele njengokudwetshwa emhlabathini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-kabusha-ama-akisi\"\u003ESetha kabusha ama-akisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset axes\u003C/span\u003E ibabuyisela lapho imodeli yaqala khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okunye-okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkunye okufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphakathi kweqembu noma ikhompoment elivulekile, ama-akisi ayo ayasetshenziswa (ajikisa nayo); ama-akisi emodeli asebenza ezingeni eliphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-akisi agcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft, futhi ukushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthumela nokubuka okujwayelekile (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E…) kusasebenzisa iziqondiso zemodeli uqobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ama-akisi abomvu, aluhlaza nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka aqondisa konke okudwebayo: izinhlangothi zamanxande ziyalingana nawo, imigqa iyakhiya kuwo, futhi umhlaba uyindiza ebomvu-eluhlaza. Uma isakhiwo sihlezi ngesihloko (isakhiwo sesayithi esingeqondile kwenyakatho, ingxenye ejikelwe nge-30°), hambisa ama-akisi kuso, ukuze ukudweba kulandele izindonga zaso. Imodeli ngokwayo ayinyakazi. Yonke imiyalo emithathu itholakala ku-Edit › More. Beka ama-akisi Edit › More › Place axes. Chofoza lapho i-origin iyohlala khona, njengekhona lesakhiwo. Chofoza iphoyinti elisemgqeni wama-akisi abomvu amasha, njengokuya phambili kodonga. Chofoza iphoyinti ngasohlangothini lwama-akisi aluhlaza amasha. Aluhlaza yenziwa ilingane nabomvu, nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka bume ilingane kukho kokubili. Ama-akisi adwetshwa endaweni yawo entsha. Unxande odwetshwa manje emhlabathini, noma othayiphwe njengo-4m,3m, uhamba ngokubomvu nokuluhlaza okujikisiwe; okhiye bombono bayakhiya kuwo; futhi i-origin snap isendaweni yesi-origin esisha. Lingana ama-akisi nobuso Khetha ubuso obubodwa, bese Edit › More › Align axes to face. Obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka bese bubheka kuphuma kubuso, obubomvu buhamba ngomphetho wabo omude kakhulu, futhi i-origin isekuqaleni kwalowo mphetho. Sebenzisa lokhu ukudweba phezu kophahla olunamathele njengokudwetshwa emhlabathini. Setha kabusha ama-akisi Edit › More › Reset axes ibabuyisela lapho imodeli yaqala khona. Okunye okufanele ukwazi Ngaphakathi kweqembu noma ikhompoment elivulekile, ama-akisi ayo ayasetshenziswa (ajikisa nayo); ama-akisi emodeli asebenza ezingeni eliphezulu. Ama-akisi agcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft, futhi ukushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukuthumela nokubuka okujwayelekile (Top, Front…) kusasebenzisa iziqondiso zemodeli uqobo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"terrain","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Umhlaba: umhlaba ovela emigqeni yokuphakama, nokuwubumba","summary":"Yenza umhlaba kusuka emigqeni yokuphakama noma njengegridi, bese uwuphakamisa noma uwehlisa ngebhulashi elithambile.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["umhlaba","izwe","ilandiskepu","itopografi","imigqa yokuphakama","isayithi","ukuthambeka","intaba","ithumbu","isandibhokisi","smoove","bumba","ukulinganisa","TIN"],"headings":[{"id":"ukusuka-emigqeni-yokuphakama","text":"Ukusuka emigqeni yokuphakama","level":2},{"id":"igridi-yokubumba","text":"Igridi yokubumba","level":2},{"id":"bumba-phakamisa-futhi-wehlise-umhlaba","text":"Bumba: phakamisa futhi wehlise umhlaba","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmhlaba wenziwe ngezinxantathu, ngakho ungalandela noma yisiphi isimo. Ungeqembu: chofoza kabili kuwo ukuze uwuhlele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusuka-emigqeni-yokuphakama\"\u003EUkusuka emigqeni yokuphakama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola imigqa yokuphakama ngamazinga ayo: yidwebe, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003Engenisa upulani wesayithi\u003C/a\u003E bese uphakamisa ngayinye ibe yizinga layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYikhethe (zonke imiphetho yazo zonke izigqa zokuphakama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlaba kusuka kumigqa yokuphakama ekhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ixhuma amaphoyinti wokuphakama ngezinxantathu (i-TIN), bese ithambisa wonke amaphethelo angaphakathi ukuze umhlaba ubonakale ugudile. Imigqa ngokwayo ihlala; yisule noma uyifihle uma ungasadingi. Imigqa yokuphakama esondelene kakhulu inciphisiwe ibe ngamaphoyinti angu-8 000.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igridi-yokubumba\"\u003EIgridi yokubumba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgridi yomhlaba…\u003C/span\u003E icela ububanzi, ukujula nosayizi weseli, bese ibeka igridi eyisicaba yezinxantathu lapho uchofoza khona ikhona yayo. Amaseli amancane abumba ngokugudile kodwa adala ubuso obuningi (ngokuphezulu ama-seli angu-200 × 200).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bumba-phakamisa-futhi-wehlise-umhlaba\"\u003EBumba: phakamisa futhi wehlise umhlaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili kumhlaba ukuze uwuvule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBumba umhlaba\u003C/span\u003E. Isiyingi sibonisa ibhulashi emhlabeni ngaphansi kwesikhombisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula phezulu ukuze uphakamise umhlaba ngaphansi kwebhulashi, noma phansi ukuze wehlise. Isikhungo sihamba kakhulu, bese umhlaba unciphela ube ngu-zero emaphethelweni esiyingi, ngakho izintaba ezincane nemigodi kuvela kuhle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wenze isigaxa sibe ubude obuqondile, chofoza kanye, bese uthayipha ubude, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E1.5m\u003C/code\u003E (ukuphambanisa kuyehlisa), bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukuze ushintshe ibhulashi, thayipha ubude ngaphambi kokuchofoza: \u003Ccode\u003E5m\u003C/code\u003E inikeza ibhulashi elinomsakazo ongu-5 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubumba ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubumba kuhambisa izinxantathu kuphela, ngakho zonke izinhlangothi zihlala zisicaba. Ubuso obudwetshwe ngesandla (unxande, amapholigoni) akusikho umhlaba: ithuluzi liyakutshela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubumba kuhambisa amaphoyinti ngqo phezulu nasezansi; akungezi amaphoyinti. Ukuze uthole imininingwane emihle, yenza igridi enamaseli amancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmhlaba uphuma njenganoma iqembu elinye. Ku-IFC uba yi-building element proxy, njengakho konke okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Umhlaba wenziwe ngezinxantathu, ngakho ungalandela noma yisiphi isimo. Ungeqembu: chofoza kabili kuwo ukuze uwuhlele. Ukusuka emigqeni yokuphakama Thola imigqa yokuphakama ngamazinga ayo: yidwebe, noma ngenisa upulani wesayithi bese uphakamisa ngayinye ibe yizinga layo. Yikhethe (zonke imiphetho yazo zonke izigqa zokuphakama). Hlela › Okwengeziwe › Umhlaba kusuka kumigqa yokuphakama ekhethiwe. I-ModelCraft ixhuma amaphoyinti wokuphakama ngezinxantathu (i-TIN), bese ithambisa wonke amaphethelo angaphakathi ukuze umhlaba ubonakale ugudile. Imigqa ngokwayo ihlala; yisule noma uyifihle uma ungasadingi. Imigqa yokuphakama esondelene kakhulu inciphisiwe ibe ngamaphoyinti angu-8 000. Igridi yokubumba Hlela › Okwengeziwe › Igridi yomhlaba… icela ububanzi, ukujula nosayizi weseli, bese ibeka igridi eyisicaba yezinxantathu lapho uchofoza khona ikhona yayo. Amaseli amancane abumba ngokugudile kodwa adala ubuso obuningi (ngokuphezulu ama-seli angu-200 × 200). Bumba: phakamisa futhi wehlise umhlaba Chofoza kabili kumhlaba ukuze uwuvule. Hlela › Okwengeziwe › Bumba umhlaba. Isiyingi sibonisa ibhulashi emhlabeni ngaphansi kwesikhombisi. Hudula phezulu ukuze uphakamise umhlaba ngaphansi kwebhulashi, noma phansi ukuze wehlise. Isikhungo sihamba kakhulu, bese umhlaba unciphela ube ngu-zero emaphethelweni esiyingi, ngakho izintaba ezincane nemigodi kuvela kuhle. Ukuze wenze isigaxa sibe ubude obuqondile, chofoza kanye, bese uthayipha ubude, njengo 1.5m (ukuphambanisa kuyehlisa), bese ucindezela Enter. Ukuze ushintshe ibhulashi, thayipha ubude ngaphambi kokuchofoza: 5m inikeza ibhulashi elinomsakazo ongu-5 m. Ukubumba ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Okufanele ukwazi Ukubumba kuhambisa izinxantathu kuphela, ngakho zonke izinhlangothi zihlala zisicaba. Ubuso obudwetshwe ngesandla (unxande, amapholigoni) akusikho umhlaba: ithuluzi liyakutshela. Ukubumba kuhambisa amaphoyinti ngqo phezulu nasezansi; akungezi amaphoyinti. Ukuze uthole imininingwane emihle, yenza igridi enamaseli amancane. Umhlaba uphuma njenganoma iqembu elinye. Ku-IFC uba yi-building element proxy, njengakho konke okunye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"meshes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ama-mesh","summary":"Guqula iqembu noma ingxenye ibe yimesh — uhlobo lwento izinhlelo zokuqukethwe kwe-3D ezimodela ngalo — futhi ibuyele kujiyometri ye-push/pull.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["mesh","ama-mesh","polygon","ama-polygon","n-gon","quad","quads","amaphoyinti","half-edge","uv","uvs","guqula","guqula ibe yimesh","guqula ibe yijiyometri","subdivision","sculpt","ukumodela","okuqukethwe kwe-3D"],"headings":[{"id":"guqula-iqembu-noma-ingxenye-ibe-yimesh","text":"Guqula iqembu noma ingxenye ibe yimesh","level":2},{"id":"okubonakala-ku-entity-info","text":"Okubonakala ku-Entity info","level":2},{"id":"guqula-imesh-ibe-ijiyometri-ye-push-pull","text":"Guqula imesh ibe ijiyometri ye-push/pull","level":2},{"id":"izinto-okufanele-uzazi","text":"Izinto okufanele uzazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft inezinhlobo ezimbili zejiyometri. \u003Cstrong\u003EIjiyometri ye-push/pull\u003C/strong\u003E yilokho oyidwebayo: izinhlangothi eziqinile ezibambelelana, ezisikana bese ziyaphola. \u003Cstrong\u003EImesh\u003C/strong\u003E iwuhlobo lwento izinhlelo zokuqukethwe kwe-3D ezimodela ngalo: izinhlangothi ezinamakhona noma yinani elingaka, ikhona ngalinye lingaphatha izixhumanisi zalo zokuthungwa (UVs), ama-normal kanye nemibala, namaphoyinti anemisindo njengamanani. Imesh ibekwa njengeqembu noma ingxenye, futhi ihlala ecaleni kwejiyometri ye-push/pull emodelini efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guqula-iqembu-noma-ingxenye-ibe-yimesh\"\u003EGuqula iqembu noma ingxenye ibe yimesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu noma ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConvert to mesh\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlangothi zayo ziba yizinhlangothi zemesh (isinhlangothi esinezimbobo siza njengamatrianguli), imiphetho eqinile ihlala ibukhali, imiphetho ethambile ishaywa ibushelelezi, nopende, izinto nezithombe ezilethiwe zihlala ezinhlangothini zazo. Amaqembu nezingxenye ezingaphakathi kuyo ziyahlanganiswa zibe yimesh eyodwa. Imiphetho edidekile iyashiywa: imesh igcina izinhlangothi. Yonke indawo lapho ingxenye ibekwe ibonisa imesh. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakala-ku-entity-info\"\u003EOkubonakala ku-Entity info\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha imesh ukuze ubone izinhlangothi, amaphoyinti nemiphetho yayo, ukuthi iyisolidi evaliwe yini (nevolumu yayo), nosayizi wayo njengoba ibekiwe. Imesh enemiphetho evulekile ithi zingaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guqula-imesh-ibe-ijiyometri-ye-push-pull\"\u003EGuqula imesh ibe ijiyometri ye-push/pull\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha imesh bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConvert to geometry\u003C/span\u003E. Izinhlangothi ezilingene ziphinde zibe njengoba zazinjalo; isinhlangothi amakhona ayo angasebhuqini eyodwa siphinde sibe ngama-triangle. Imiphetho ebukhali iqinile, eminye ithambile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E ibeka izinhlangothi zemesh ngqo eqenjini eyizungezile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-okufanele-uzazi\"\u003EIzinto okufanele uzazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili imesh ukuze \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003Euhlele amaphoyinti, imiphetho nezinhlangothi\u003C/a\u003E endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Yiguqule ibe yijiyometri ukuze uyihlele nge-push/pull; hambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi, kopisha, penda, fihla nokuyithegila njengeqembu nanoma yiliphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhipha, ukuphrinta nge-3D, izithombe ezirenderiwe kanye ne-VR kubona imesh njengezinhlangothi zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela elinemesh lilondolozwa njengenguqulo entsha yefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho ModelCraft 0.6 nezindala azikwazi ukulivula; amafayela angenayo imesh avulwa kuzo njengakuqala. Guqula amamesh abe yijiyometri kuqala ukuze wabelane ngefayela nomuntu onenguqulo endala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlehlisa ku-mesh kugcina kuphela okushintshwa yisinyathelo ngasinye, ngakho ngisho nemesh enkulu kakhulu ihlehla ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EAmaqembu nezingxenye\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003Enasentshe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft inezinhlobo ezimbili zejiyometri. Ijiyometri ye-push/pull yilokho oyidwebayo: izinhlangothi eziqinile ezibambelelana, ezisikana bese ziyaphola. Imesh iwuhlobo lwento izinhlelo zokuqukethwe kwe-3D ezimodela ngalo: izinhlangothi ezinamakhona noma yinani elingaka, ikhona ngalinye lingaphatha izixhumanisi zalo zokuthungwa (UVs), ama-normal kanye nemibala, namaphoyinti anemisindo njengamanani. Imesh ibekwa njengeqembu noma ingxenye, futhi ihlala ecaleni kwejiyometri ye-push/pull emodelini efanayo. Guqula iqembu noma ingxenye ibe yimesh Khetha iqembu noma ingxenye. Ku-Entity info, chofoza Convert to mesh. Izinhlangothi zayo ziba yizinhlangothi zemesh (isinhlangothi esinezimbobo siza njengamatrianguli), imiphetho eqinile ihlala ibukhali, imiphetho ethambile ishaywa ibushelelezi, nopende, izinto nezithombe ezilethiwe zihlala ezinhlangothini zazo. Amaqembu nezingxenye ezingaphakathi kuyo ziyahlanganiswa zibe yimesh eyodwa. Imiphetho edidekile iyashiywa: imesh igcina izinhlangothi. Yonke indawo lapho ingxenye ibekwe ibonisa imesh. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Okubonakala ku-Entity info Khetha imesh ukuze ubone izinhlangothi, amaphoyinti nemiphetho yayo, ukuthi iyisolidi evaliwe yini (nevolumu yayo), nosayizi wayo njengoba ibekiwe. Imesh enemiphetho evulekile ithi zingaki. Guqula imesh ibe ijiyometri ye-push/pull Khetha imesh bese uchofoza Convert to geometry. Izinhlangothi ezilingene ziphinde zibe njengoba zazinjalo; isinhlangothi amakhona ayo angasebhuqini eyodwa siphinde sibe ngama-triangle. Imiphetho ebukhali iqinile, eminye ithambile. Explode ibeka izinhlangothi zemesh ngqo eqenjini eyizungezile. Izinto okufanele uzazi Chofoza kabili imesh ukuze uhlele amaphoyinti, imiphetho nezinhlangothi endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Yiguqule ibe yijiyometri ukuze uyihlele nge-push/pull; hambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi, kopisha, penda, fihla nokuyithegila njengeqembu nanoma yiliphi. Ukukhipha, ukuphrinta nge-3D, izithombe ezirenderiwe kanye ne-VR kubona imesh njengezinhlangothi zayo. Ifayela elinemesh lilondolozwa njengenguqulo entsha yefayela le-.modelcraft, ngakho ModelCraft 0.6 nezindala azikwazi ukulivula; amafayela angenayo imesh avulwa kuzo njengakuqala. Guqula amamesh abe yijiyometri kuqala ukuze wabelane ngefayela nomuntu onenguqulo endala. Ukuhlehlisa ku-mesh kugcina kuphela okushintshwa yisinyathelo ngasinye, ngakho ngisho nemesh enkulu kakhulu ihlehla ngokushesha. Bona futhi Amaqembu nezingxenye kanye nasentshe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"mesh-edit","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlela imesh endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh","summary":"Khetha amaphoyinti, imiphetho nezinhlangothi zemesh, uzihambise, bese uzikhipha, uzifaka phakathi, uzigoqa, uzisike, uzihlanganise, uzigcwalise nokuzibhuluza, nganoma yisitayela sokhiye.","section":"tasks","order":59,"keywords":["mesh","imodi yokuhlela","indawo yokusebenza ye-mesh","iphoyinti","amaphoyinti","umphetho","imiphetho","uhlangothi","izinhlangothi","khipha","faka phakathi","goqa","sika ilophu","ummese","sika ngomugqa","phendulisa","hlanganisa","nyibilikisa","gcwalisa","gcwalisa igridi","bhuluza","hlukanisa","shelelisa","ukuhlela okuhambisanayo","ukwehla","indawo yokusebenza"],"headings":[{"id":"vula","text":"Vula","level":2},{"id":"khetha","text":"Khetha","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-jikisa-shintsha-usayizi","text":"Hambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-isimo","text":"Shintsha isimo","level":2},{"id":"yakha-kabusha-imesh","text":"Yakha kabusha imesh","level":2},{"id":"hlela-kabusha-ukwakheka","text":"Hlela kabusha ukwakheka","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-okokugcina-okwenziwe","text":"Lungisa okokugcina okwenziwe","level":2},{"id":"okhiye","text":"Okhiye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh\u003C/strong\u003E ihlela \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Eimesh\u003C/a\u003E iphoyinti ngephoyinti: amaphoyinti, imiphetho kanye nezinhlangothi zayo. Ijiyometri ye-push/pull ihlala endaweni yokusebenza ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula\"\u003EVula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele kwethuluzi. Imesh ekhethiwe iyavulwa ukuze ihlelwe; iqembu noma ingxenye ekhethiwe iguqulwa ibe yimesh kuqala (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma chofoza kabili imesh, noma, ngezikhiye zomodeler, khetha yona bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungakhethiwe lutho, iphaneli linikeza amamesh okungezwa: plane, grid, cube, circle, cylinder, cone, sphere, ico sphere kanye ne-torus. Ilanga elisha lingena lapho ukubuka kubheka khona bese livuleka ukuze lihleleke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to Model\u003C/span\u003E (noma uhlu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngezikhiye zomodeler, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma kungakhethiwe lutho ngezikhiye ze-push/pull) ibuyela ku-Model nemesh ikhethiwe. Uma i-Mesh workspace ivuliwe, enye imodeli iyafiphala futhi amathuluzi okudweba ye-Model ayabekwa eceleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"1\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"2\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha amaphoyinti, imiphetho noma izinhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha okukodwa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza yengeza noma isuse\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ibhokisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha okungaphakathi nokubonakalayo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yengeza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza umphetho, noma uchofoze kabili kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlophu yawo yomphetho (ilophu yesinhlangothi kumodi yezinhlangothi; umngcele wonke ku-open edge)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza umphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsongo lawo lomphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kathathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke okuxhunyiwe kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E linayo futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinked\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELess\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-jikisa-shintsha-usayizi\"\u003EHambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E kuqala ngophawu: hambisa, bese uchofoza noma ucindezele \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubeka okukhethiwe phansi, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukukhansela. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo) ziyakhiya i-axis. Thayipha ibanga, i-angle noma isilinganiso ukuze uthole ukunemba: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box#calculations\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\" data-hash=\"calculations\"\u003Eizibalo\u003C/a\u003E nazo ziyasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlela okuhambisanayo\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProportional\u003C/span\u003E, noma iphaneli): amaphoyinti aseduze nokukhethwa alandela ukuhamba, ancipha ngokuya kude, kuze kufike ububanzi obusethiwe, ngokwehla okukhethiwe. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly along the mesh\u003C/span\u003E ukuze kulinganiswe ngemiphetho hhayi ngqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlide\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa ilophu yomphetho ekhethiwe ngemiphetho eseceleni kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-isimo\"\u003EShintsha isimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtrude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhipha izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe ngokuqondile kwazo, ngezinhlangothi ezintsha zeceleni (noma yenza izinhlangothi kumingcele evulekile). Thayipha ibanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInset\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhendi ngaphakathi komzila wezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe; cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi kuyo yonke inhlangothi ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBevel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsika imiphetho ekhethiwe (noma, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, amaphoyinti) ngobubanzi; insimbi noma izinkinobho zesilinganiso zengeza izingxenye zomphetho ogobile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoop cut\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChopha emphethweni: izilophu ezintsha ngokuhambisana nesongo lezinhlangothi ezine; insimbi isetha ukuthi zingaki; chofoza ukuze usike\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKnife\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti emiphetheni noma emakhoneni; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isika ngqo phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezikhona, njengoba ziboniswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBisect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba umugqa esikrinini: izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe (noma zonke) ziyasikwa ngawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjikisa izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe noma imiphetho evulekile ngokuzungeza i-axis eluhlaza ngezinyathelo (insimbi isetha) ; ukujikeleza okugcwele kuyavala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubdivide\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsika imiphetho ekhethiwe ibe mibili; izinhlangothi ezigcwele ziba igridi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMerge\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti akhethiwe aba munye, ephakathi kwawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDissolve\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsusa ukukhethwa kodwa igcina umphezulu: izinhlangothi ziyahlanganyela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlangothi olusuka kumngcele ovulekile okhethiwe (noma phakathi kwemiphetho emibili evulekile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid fill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcwalisa umngcele ovulekile onamaphethelo alinganayo ngegridi yamaquad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBridge\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanganisa izilophu ezimbili ezivulekile ezikhethiwe ngezinhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi imiphetho ekhethiwe ihlala ibukhali kangakanani lapho imesh igudiswa indawo ehlukaniswe: hambisa kude nesikhungo, sebenzisa insimbi (izinyathelo ze-0.1) noma thayipha 0 kuya ku-1. Iphaneli likhombisa i-crease yemiphetho ekhethiwe futhi lamukela nenani elithayipiwe. Imiphetho edidekile idwetshwa ngomagenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikisa izinhlangothi; gudisa amaphoyinti ngokuya kubamakhelwane bawo; susa ngemodi yokukhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izixhumanisi zokuthungwa, imibala nezisindo zilandela kwizinhlangothi nakumaphoyinti amasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yakha-kabusha-imesh\"\u003EYakha kabusha imesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E yenza imesh yonke futhi ibe ngonxantathu alinganayo wosayizi oyedwa, icelwa lapho ucindezela (okuncane kuba kuhle kakhulu futhi kuhamba kancane). Ivala izimbobo, ihlanganise izingxenye ezigqumayo, futhi ilinganise imesh esolwe ukudweba. Imiphetho ebukhali iba mbalwa ibe mihle kancane. I-UV, izithombe nokugoba kuqala kabusha. Inyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-kabusha-ukwakheka\"\u003EHlela kabusha ukwakheka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wakhe imesh entsha, ehlanzekile ngaphezulu kwemesh eningiliziwe (isculpt, noma iscan), khetha leyo eningiliziwe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EBuild on\u003C/strong\u003E kwiphaneli, bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlanganisa amaphoyinti ahanjisiwe nalo:\u003C/strong\u003E amaphoyinti ohamba nawo, nemiphetho oyidonsayo, afike phezu komphumela wawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeka amaphoyinti akhethiwe phezu kwawo\u003C/strong\u003E ahambisa amaphoyinti akhethiwe phezu kwawo manje (inyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa imiphetho yale mesh phambili\u003C/strong\u003E idweba imesh oyakhayo phezu komphezulu, ukuze uyibone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-okokugcina-okwenziwe\"\u003ELungisa okokugcina okwenziwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemuva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInset\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBevel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoop cut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubdivide\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid fill\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpin\u003C/span\u003E, iphaneli libonisa izilungiselelo zakhe (ububanzi, izingxenye, iphrofayili, izinqamu …). Shintsha okukodwa futhi isenzo siyaphinda kusuka lapho saqala khona, sisale siyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye be-push/pull\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye bomodeler\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kabili kuyashelela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha, faka phakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrease\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift E\"\u003E⇧E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke, akukho, phendula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control A\"\u003E⌃A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKokubili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control B\"\u003E⌃B\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+B\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goqa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control R\"\u003E⌃R\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+R\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sika ilophu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ummese\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokufanayo, kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E gcwalisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hlanganisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control X\"\u003E⌃X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nyibilikisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control L\"\u003E⌃L\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+L\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E okuxhunyiwe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option N\"\u003E⌥N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jikisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E okuhambisanayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift V\"\u003E⇧V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shelelisa iphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EImesh\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EIzisiguquli ku-mesh\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003Enasentshe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh ihlela imesh iphoyinti ngephoyinti: amaphoyinti, imiphetho kanye nezinhlangothi zayo. Ijiyometri ye-push/pull ihlala endaweni yokusebenza ye-Imodeli. Vula Khetha Mesh ohlwini lwe-Workspace ngakwesobunxele kwethuluzi. Imesh ekhethiwe iyavulwa ukuze ihlelwe; iqembu noma ingxenye ekhethiwe iguqulwa ibe yimesh kuqala (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa). Noma chofoza kabili imesh, noma, ngezikhiye zomodeler, khetha yona bese ucindezela Tab. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, iphaneli linikeza amamesh okungezwa: plane, grid, cube, circle, cylinder, cone, sphere, ico sphere kanye ne-torus. Ilanga elisha lingena lapho ukubuka kubheka khona bese livuleka ukuze lihleleke. Back to Model (noma uhlu, Tab ngezikhiye zomodeler, Esc uma kungakhethiwe lutho ngezikhiye ze-push/pull) ibuyela ku-Model nemesh ikhethiwe. Uma i-Mesh workspace ivuliwe, enye imodeli iyafiphala futhi amathuluzi okudweba ye-Model ayabekwa eceleni. Khetha Yenza Ukuze 1 2 3 Khetha amaphoyinti, imiphetho noma izinhlangothi Chofoza Khetha okukodwa; Shift+chofoza yengeza noma isuse Donsa ibhokisi Khetha okungaphakathi nokubonakalayo; Shift yengeza, Ctrl isusa Alt+chofoza umphetho, noma uchofoze kabili kuwo Ilophu yawo yomphetho (ilophu yesinhlangothi kumodi yezinhlangothi; umngcele wonke ku-open edge) Ctrl+Alt+chofoza umphetho Isongo lawo lomphetho Chofoza kathathu Konke okuxhunyiwe kuwo Iqembu le-Select linayo futhi All, Linked, Loop, Ring, More no-Less. Hambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi Move, Rotate kanye Scale kuqala ngophawu: hambisa, bese uchofoza noma ucindezele Enter ukubeka okukhethiwe phansi, noma Esc ukukhansela. X, Y noma Z (noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo) ziyakhiya i-axis. Thayipha ibanga, i-angle noma isilinganiso ukuze uthole ukunemba: izibalo nazo ziyasebenza. Ukuhlela okuhambisanayo (Proportional, noma iphaneli): amaphoyinti aseduze nokukhethwa alandela ukuhamba, ancipha ngokuya kude, kuze kufike ububanzi obusethiwe, ngokwehla okukhethiwe. Vula Only along the mesh ukuze kulinganiswe ngemiphetho hhayi ngqo. Slide ihambisa ilophu yomphetho ekhethiwe ngemiphetho eseceleni kwayo. Shintsha isimo Ithuluzi Lenza Extrude Ikhipha izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe ngokuqondile kwazo, ngezinhlangothi ezintsha zeceleni (noma yenza izinhlangothi kumingcele evulekile). Thayipha ibanga Inset Ibhendi ngaphakathi komzila wezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe; cindezela I futhi kuyo yonke inhlangothi ngayinye Bevel Isika imiphetho ekhethiwe (noma, Ctrl+Shift+B, amaphoyinti) ngobubanzi; insimbi noma izinkinobho zesilinganiso zengeza izingxenye zomphetho ogobile Loop cut Chopha emphethweni: izilophu ezintsha ngokuhambisana nesongo lezinhlangothi ezine; insimbi isetha ukuthi zingaki; chofoza ukuze usike Knife Chofoza amaphoyinti emiphetheni noma emakhoneni; Enter isika ngqo phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezikhona, njengoba ziboniswa Bisect Dweba umugqa esikrinini: izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe (noma zonke) ziyasikwa ngawo Spin Ijikisa izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe noma imiphetho evulekile ngokuzungeza i-axis eluhlaza ngezinyathelo (insimbi isetha) ; ukujikeleza okugcwele kuyavala Subdivide Isika imiphetho ekhethiwe ibe mibili; izinhlangothi ezigcwele ziba igridi Merge Amaphoyinti akhethiwe aba munye, ephakathi kwawo Dissolve Isusa ukukhethwa kodwa igcina umphezulu: izinhlangothi ziyahlanganyela Fill Uhlangothi olusuka kumngcele ovulekile okhethiwe (noma phakathi kwemiphetho emibili evulekile) Grid fill Igcwalisa umngcele ovulekile onamaphethelo alinganayo ngegridi yamaquad Bridge Ihlanganisa izilophu ezimbili ezivulekile ezikhethiwe ngezinhlangothi Crease Ukuthi imiphetho ekhethiwe ihlala ibukhali kangakanani lapho imesh igudiswa indawo ehlukaniswe: hambisa kude nesikhungo, sebenzisa insimbi (izinyathelo ze-0.1) noma thayipha 0 kuya ku-1. Iphaneli likhombisa i-crease yemiphetho ekhethiwe futhi lamukela nenani elithayipiwe. Imiphetho edidekile idwetshwa ngomagenta Flip, Smooth, Delete Jikisa izinhlangothi; gudisa amaphoyinti ngokuya kubamakhelwane bawo; susa ngemodi yokukhetha Ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izixhumanisi zokuthungwa, imibala nezisindo zilandela kwizinhlangothi nakumaphoyinti amasha. Yakha kabusha imesh Remesh yenza imesh yonke futhi ibe ngonxantathu alinganayo wosayizi oyedwa, icelwa lapho ucindezela (okuncane kuba kuhle kakhulu futhi kuhamba kancane). Ivala izimbobo, ihlanganise izingxenye ezigqumayo, futhi ilinganise imesh esolwe ukudweba. Imiphetho ebukhali iba mbalwa ibe mihle kancane. I-UV, izithombe nokugoba kuqala kabusha. Inyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Hlela kabusha ukwakheka Ukuze wakhe imesh entsha, ehlanzekile ngaphezulu kwemesh eningiliziwe (isculpt, noma iscan), khetha leyo eningiliziwe ngaphansi kwe-Retopology › Build on kwiphaneli, bese: Hlanganisa amaphoyinti ahanjisiwe nalo: amaphoyinti ohamba nawo, nemiphetho oyidonsayo, afike phezu komphumela wawo. Beka amaphoyinti akhethiwe phezu kwawo ahambisa amaphoyinti akhethiwe phezu kwawo manje (inyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa). Bonisa imiphetho yale mesh phambili idweba imesh oyakhayo phezu komphezulu, ukuze uyibone. Lungisa okokugcina okwenziwe Ngemuva kwe-Inset, Bevel, Loop cut, Subdivide, Smooth, Grid fill noma Spin, iphaneli libonisa izilungiselelo zakhe (ububanzi, izingxenye, iphrofayili, izinqamu …). Shintsha okukodwa futhi isenzo siyaphinda kusuka lapho saqala khona, sisale siyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Okhiye Okhiye be-push/pull Okhiye bomodeler Hambisa, jikisa, shintsha usayizi M Q S G R S (G kabili kuyashelela) Khipha, faka phakathi P, F E, I Susa E noma Delete X noma Delete Crease Shift+C Shift+E Khetha konke, akukho, phendula Ctrl+A, Esc, Ctrl+I A, Alt+A, Ctrl+I Kokubili Ctrl+B goqa, Ctrl+R sika ilophu, K ummese okufanayo, kanye F gcwalisa, M hlanganisa, Ctrl+X nyibilikisa, L / Ctrl+L okuxhunyiwe, Alt+N jikisa, O okuhambisanayo, Shift+V shelelisa iphoyinti Bona futhi Imesh, Izisiguquli ku-mesh kanye nasentshe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"modifiers","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izisiguquli ku-mesh, iqembu noma ingxenye","summary":"Shintsha usayizi, buyisa, hlela ngohlu, bushelelezisa, goqa, sika nagoba imesh ngaphandle kokuyishintsha; phinda noma shintsha usayizi weqembu noma ingxenye ngesitaki esifanayo; yenze isihlala uma usulungele.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["isiguquli","izisiguquli","isitaki","iqembu","ingxenye","shintsha usayizi","bhaka","hlela umthombo","ukungaguquki","buyisa","array","array ejikelezayo","indawo ehlukaniswe","bushelelezisa","goqa","qinisa","ukuqina","boolean","sika","fuduka","fakela","nciphisa","lattice","ikheji","goba ngevolo","goba","ncishisa","sebenzisa"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-isiguquli","text":"Engeza isiguquli","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-kwisiguquli-ngasinye","text":"Izinkinobho kwisiguquli ngasinye","level":2},{"id":"izisiguquli","text":"Izisiguquli","level":2},{"id":"kweqembu-noma-ingxenye","text":"Kweqembu noma ingxenye","level":2},{"id":"indawo-ehlukaniswe","text":"Indawo ehlukaniswe","level":2},{"id":"goba-ngekheji","text":"Goba ngekheji","level":2},{"id":"ama-mesh-amakhulu","text":"Ama-mesh amakhulu","level":2},{"id":"okungakenziwa-yizisiguquli-okwamanje","text":"Okungakenziwa yizisiguquli okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsiguquli\u003C/strong\u003E (modifier) siguqula okubonakala njengemesh ngaphandle kokuguqula imesh ngokwayo. Buyisela uhhafu wephathi bese umodela kuphela leyo ngxenye; goqa ibhokisi nge-subdivision surface futhi uqhubeke uhlela ibhokisi. Izisiguquli zihlala ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eisitaki\u003C/strong\u003E zisebenza ngokulandelana, phezulu kuya phansi. Okubonwa, okukhishwa, okuphrintwa nokurenderwa yimesh enazo zonke izisiguquli ezisebenzayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-isiguquli\"\u003EEngeza isiguquli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha imesh. Endaweni yokusebenza ye-Model ingxenye yayo ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzisiguquli\u003C/strong\u003E itholakala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E; endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh itholakala ephanelini langakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha esinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a modifier…\u003C/span\u003E. Sengezwa ekugcineni kwesitaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha izilungiselelo zaso ngaphansi kwegama lalo. Amalunga athatha amanani afanayo nebhokisi lenani, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E600mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E kanye no-\u003Ccode\u003E(6m)/4\u003C/code\u003E konke kuyasebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaluhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-kwisiguquli-ngasinye\"\u003EIzinkinobho kwisiguquli ngasinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi elikhethwayo liyasivula noma livale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yesikrini ikhombisa noma ifihle esibukweni (isahlala esitakini).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yekhamera ikhombisa noma ifihle ezithombeni ezirenderiwe nasevidiyweni, ngakho isiguquli singaba sezithombe kuphela (noma sokubuka kuphela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImicibisholo ihambisa ukuya phezulu noma phansi kwesitaki. Ukulandelana kuyabaluleka: buyisela bese ubushelelezisa kunikeza umphetho obushelelezi; bushelelezisa bese ubuyisela akunikezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E yenza umumo ube yingxenye yemesh: izisiguquli ezingaphezulu kwalo nalo zenziwa kumesh ngokwayo futhi zishiya isitaki. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphambana kuyasusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izisiguquli\"\u003EIzisiguquli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiguquli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza imvelaphi yento, isilinganiso sebomvu, oluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Nakweqembu noma engxenyeni futhi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror (Buyisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza ikhophi ebuyisiwe ngokudlula ebomvwini, oluhlazeni noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka kumvelaphi yemesh, futhi ihlanganise izingxenye lapho zihlangana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArray\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha ngomugqa (isinyathelo sosayizi wayo ngamanani onawanikeza, kanye nesinyathelo esisungulwe), ngokuzungeza i-axis, noma ngevolo emodelini. Iqembu noma ingxenye ithatha umugqa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESubdivision surface (Indawo ehlukaniswe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgudisa imesh ngokuhlukaniswa kwe-Catmull-Clark. Imiphetho ebukhali ihlala ibukhali. Ukurenderwa kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunokubuka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBevel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgoba yonke imiphetho ebukhali kunangelo onawunikezayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESolidify (Qinisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInika umphezulu ukuqina futhi ivale umphetho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoolean\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsusa, ihlanganise noma igcine ukuphambana nento enye emodelini. Zombili kumele ibe yisolidi evaliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDisplace (Fuduka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfudusa umphezulu ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle ngomsindo ogudile. Imbewu efanayo inikeza izintambo ezifanayo njalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeld (Fakela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanganisa amaphoyinti aseduze kunebanga elinikeziwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDecimate (Nciphisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina ingxenye yamatrianguli, isuse leyo eshintsha ukwakheka kancane kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhulula amaphoyinti ngokuya kubamakhelwane bawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELattice\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgoba imesh ngekheji: hambisa amaphoyinti ekheji, nemesh iyalandela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECurve deform (Goba ngevolo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgoba imesh eduze kwevolo emodelini, ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShrinkwrap (Ncishisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfudusa wonke amaphoyinti ephoyinteni elisondele kakhulu kwenye into.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kweqembu-noma-ingxenye\"\u003EKweqembu noma ingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu noma ingxenye nayo ingagcina iresiphi, ngakho umthunzi wesibane ungaba \u003Cstrong\u003EScale\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EArray\u003C/strong\u003E yomthunzi owodwa, futhi ukushintsha inombolo kushintsha isibane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu noma ingxenye. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ingxenye yayo ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzisiguquli\u003C/strong\u003E ibala isitaki (ingasekuqaleni ingenalutho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArray\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a modifier…\u003C/span\u003E. Iqembu liba yingxenye \u003Cstrong\u003Eyokuqala, ebekwe yisitaki\u003C/strong\u003E. Okokuqala kuyagcinwa: uyihlele futhi zonke izikhopi zilandele ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScale ithatha isilinganiso sebomvu, oluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (\u003Ccode\u003E1, 1, 2\u003C/code\u003E iphindaphindeka ukuphakama). Array ithatha inani lezikhopi, isinyathelo njengengxenye yosayizi womphumela sakuleso sikhathi, kanye nesinyathelo esengeziwe ngamalunga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitaki sisebenza phezulu kuya phansi ezimpangeni zokuqala zokuqala zalo, ngakho ukulandelana kuyabaluleka: i-Array yezikhopi ezintathu ezinama-3 m ngokuhlukana, bese Scale 2 kubomvu, ibeka izikhopi ngama-6 m ngokuhlukana; uma Scale iqala bese i-Array ilandela, zihlala zingu-3 m ngokuhlukana. Ibhokisi, izinkinobho nekhasi kusebenza njengasemeshini; izinkinobho zombono nekhamera ne-Apply kwisiguquli esisodwa azisebenzi, ngoba isitaki kweqembu siyinto eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit source\u003C/span\u003E ivula okokuqala endaweni yakho. Izinguquko zibonakala kuzo zonke izikhopi; ukuvala kubuyisela lapho ubekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBake modifiers\u003C/span\u003E yenza umphumela ube yimiphetho nezinhlangothi ezilula futhi isuse isitaki, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izikhopi ezihlanganayo zihlala njengejiyometri ehlukene: Bake akuyona indibano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhopi zengxenye zabelana ngayo iresiphi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E iyihlukanisa (okokuqala kuhlala kwabelwana).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitaki silondolozwa efayeleni, sihamba nokukopisha nokunamathisela nokuhlehlisa, futhi i-Susa okungasetshenziswa igcina okokuqala. Uhlelo olungazi izisiguquli lusabonisa izikhopi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuze kube yi-Bake, umphumela awukwazi ukungeniswa, ukuchithwa, ukushintshwa usayizi noma ukwelulwa: uzakhiwa kabusha ngoshintsho olulandelayo. Konke kuyakutshela lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImikhawulo ingu-32 wezisiguquli ne-1,000 wezikhopi. Ingxenye eyenziwe ukuze yelulwe (Stretch) nesitaki akukwazi ukwabelana ngencazelo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo-ehlukaniswe\"\u003EIndawo ehlukaniswe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESubdivision igudisa imesh nge-Catmull-Clark: yonke inhlangothi iba yizinhlangothi ezine, futhi ileveli ngayinye yenza amanani amane kabili. Ibhokisi elinamazinga amabili noma amathathu sekuvele lifane nesimo esigudile, futhi uqhubeka uhlela ibhokisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga esibukweni\u003C/strong\u003E ayo abeka ukuthi igudile kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga ezithombeni\u003C/strong\u003E ayo abeka ukuthi izithombe ezirenderiwe nevidiyo zigudile kangakanani; ukurenderwa kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunokubuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkurenderwa ngomumo wangempela ogudile\u003C/strong\u003E kubeka amaphoyinti emesh erenderiwe emkhawulweni womumo amazinga angena kuwo, ngakho ngisho namazinga amabili enza ukurenderwa okugudile njengamaningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugoba\u003C/strong\u003E kugcina imiphetho ibukhali: ku-Mesh workspace khetha imiphetho usebenzise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E (1 ihlala ibukhali, 0.5 igoba kancane, 0 igudile). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EHlela imesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENciphisa ileveli yokubuka emeshini enkulu:\u003C/strong\u003E uma amazinga ocela ezonikeza izinhlangothi eziningi kunalezi isibukeli somshini sizokwazi ngokuhle, ukubuka kukhombisa ileveli ephansi futhi kuyashoyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa wonke amazinga njalo. Inani lezinhlangothi lilungiswa yiklasi lomshini wakho ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › Rendering › Your machine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho evulekile igcina amakhona ayo futhi ihlala emgqeni wemiphetho yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goba-ngekheji\"\u003EGoba ngekheji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza isiguquli se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELattice\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a lattice cage round the mesh\u003C/span\u003E. Ikheji elinamaphoyinti ama-3 × 3 × 3 livela lizungeze imesh, lidwetshwe ngamawaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ikheji ku-Mesh workspace (chofoza kabili kuyo) uhambise amaphoyinti ayo. Imesh iyalandela ngobunono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkheji iyimesh njanoma iyiphi enye: yifihle ngethegi yayo uma usuqedile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-mesh-amakhulu\"\u003EAma-mesh amakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzitaki ezincane zisetshenziswa ngokushesha. Okukhulu kwenziwa ngemuva kuwo wonke ama-core ekhompyutha yakho: ukubuka kugcina kukhombisa umphumela wokugcina kuze kube yilapho olusha selulungile. Ama-Boolean alayisha isimodeli solid okokuqala; ukubuka kuyakutshela lokho isikhashana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungakenziwa-yizisiguquli-okwamanje\"\u003EOkungakenziwa yizisiguquli okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzisindo ngephoyinti ngalinye (ukwehla okupeyintwe emesheni) ku-Displace, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E noma ku-Shrinkwrap.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzinye izisiguquli ngaphandle kwe-Scale ne-Array elula kujiyometri ye-push/pull (amaqembu nezingxenye): yiguqule ibe yimesh kuqala (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConvert to mesh\u003C/span\u003E). I-Mirror, i-Array ejikelezayo noma evolweni, i-Bend kanye ne-Taper emaqenjini kuzofika kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isiguquli (modifier) siguqula okubonakala njengemesh ngaphandle kokuguqula imesh ngokwayo. Buyisela uhhafu wephathi bese umodela kuphela leyo ngxenye; goqa ibhokisi nge-subdivision surface futhi uqhubeke uhlela ibhokisi. Izisiguquli zihlala ku-isitaki zisebenza ngokulandelana, phezulu kuya phansi. Okubonwa, okukhishwa, okuphrintwa nokurenderwa yimesh enazo zonke izisiguquli ezisebenzayo. Engeza isiguquli Khetha imesh. Endaweni yokusebenza ye-Model ingxenye yayo ethi Izisiguquli itholakala ku-Entity info; endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh itholakala ephanelini langakwesokudla. Khetha esinye ku-Add a modifier…. Sengezwa ekugcineni kwesitaki. Shintsha izilungiselelo zaso ngaphansi kwegama lalo. Amalunga athatha amanani afanayo nebhokisi lenani, ngakho 600mm, 2'6\" kanye no-(6m)/4 konke kuyasebenza. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: Ctrl+Z iyaluhlehlisa. Izinkinobho kwisiguquli ngasinye Ibhokisi elikhethwayo liyasivula noma livale. Inkinobho yesikrini ikhombisa noma ifihle esibukweni (isahlala esitakini). Inkinobho yekhamera ikhombisa noma ifihle ezithombeni ezirenderiwe nasevidiyweni, ngakho isiguquli singaba sezithombe kuphela (noma sokubuka kuphela). Imicibisholo ihambisa ukuya phezulu noma phansi kwesitaki. Ukulandelana kuyabaluleka: buyisela bese ubushelelezisa kunikeza umphetho obushelelezi; bushelelezisa bese ubuyisela akunikezi. Apply yenza umumo ube yingxenye yemesh: izisiguquli ezingaphezulu kwalo nalo zenziwa kumesh ngokwayo futhi zishiya isitaki. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Ukuphambana kuyasusa. Izisiguquli Isiguquli Okwenzayo Scale Ishintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza imvelaphi yento, isilinganiso sebomvu, oluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Nakweqembu noma engxenyeni futhi. Mirror (Buyisa) Yengeza ikhophi ebuyisiwe ngokudlula ebomvwini, oluhlazeni noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka kumvelaphi yemesh, futhi ihlanganise izingxenye lapho zihlangana. Array Kopisha ngomugqa (isinyathelo sosayizi wayo ngamanani onawanikeza, kanye nesinyathelo esisungulwe), ngokuzungeza i-axis, noma ngevolo emodelini. Iqembu noma ingxenye ithatha umugqa. Subdivision surface (Indawo ehlukaniswe) Igudisa imesh ngokuhlukaniswa kwe-Catmull-Clark. Imiphetho ebukhali ihlala ibukhali. Ukurenderwa kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunokubuka. Bevel Igoba yonke imiphetho ebukhali kunangelo onawunikezayo. Solidify (Qinisa) Inika umphezulu ukuqina futhi ivale umphetho. Boolean Isusa, ihlanganise noma igcine ukuphambana nento enye emodelini. Zombili kumele ibe yisolidi evaliwe. Displace (Fuduka) Ifudusa umphezulu ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle ngomsindo ogudile. Imbewu efanayo inikeza izintambo ezifanayo njalo. Weld (Fakela) Ihlanganisa amaphoyinti aseduze kunebanga elinikeziwe. Decimate (Nciphisa) Igcina ingxenye yamatrianguli, isuse leyo eshintsha ukwakheka kancane kakhulu. Smooth Ikhulula amaphoyinti ngokuya kubamakhelwane bawo. Lattice Igoba imesh ngekheji: hambisa amaphoyinti ekheji, nemesh iyalandela. Curve deform (Goba ngevolo) Igoba imesh eduze kwevolo emodelini, ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza noma okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Shrinkwrap (Ncishisa) Ifudusa wonke amaphoyinti ephoyinteni elisondele kakhulu kwenye into. Kweqembu noma ingxenye Iqembu noma ingxenye nayo ingagcina iresiphi, ngakho umthunzi wesibane ungaba Scale kanye ne-Array yomthunzi owodwa, futhi ukushintsha inombolo kushintsha isibane. Khetha iqembu noma ingxenye. Ku-Entity info ingxenye yayo ethi Izisiguquli ibala isitaki (ingasekuqaleni ingenalutho). Khetha Scale noma Array ku-Add a modifier…. Iqembu liba yingxenye yokuqala, ebekwe yisitaki. Okokuqala kuyagcinwa: uyihlele futhi zonke izikhopi zilandele ngokushesha. Scale ithatha isilinganiso sebomvu, oluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka (1, 1, 2 iphindaphindeka ukuphakama). Array ithatha inani lezikhopi, isinyathelo njengengxenye yosayizi womphumela sakuleso sikhathi, kanye nesinyathelo esengeziwe ngamalunga. Isitaki sisebenza phezulu kuya phansi ezimpangeni zokuqala zokuqala zalo, ngakho ukulandelana kuyabaluleka: i-Array yezikhopi ezintathu ezinama-3 m ngokuhlukana, bese Scale 2 kubomvu, ibeka izikhopi ngama-6 m ngokuhlukana; uma Scale iqala bese i-Array ilandela, zihlala zingu-3 m ngokuhlukana. Ibhokisi, izinkinobho nekhasi kusebenza njengasemeshini; izinkinobho zombono nekhamera ne-Apply kwisiguquli esisodwa azisebenzi, ngoba isitaki kweqembu siyinto eyodwa. Edit source ivula okokuqala endaweni yakho. Izinguquko zibonakala kuzo zonke izikhopi; ukuvala kubuyisela lapho ubekhona. Bake modifiers yenza umphumela ube yimiphetho nezinhlangothi ezilula futhi isuse isitaki, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izikhopi ezihlanganayo zihlala njengejiyometri ehlukene: Bake akuyona indibano. Izikhopi zengxenye zabelana ngayo iresiphi; Make unique iyihlukanisa (okokuqala kuhlala kwabelwana). Isitaki silondolozwa efayeleni, sihamba nokukopisha nokunamathisela nokuhlehlisa, futhi i-Susa okungasetshenziswa igcina okokuqala. Uhlelo olungazi izisiguquli lusabonisa izikhopi. Kuze kube yi-Bake, umphumela awukwazi ukungeniswa, ukuchithwa, ukushintshwa usayizi noma ukwelulwa: uzakhiwa kabusha ngoshintsho olulandelayo. Konke kuyakutshela lokho. Imikhawulo ingu-32 wezisiguquli ne-1,000 wezikhopi. Ingxenye eyenziwe ukuze yelulwe (Stretch) nesitaki akukwazi ukwabelana ngencazelo okwamanje. Indawo ehlukaniswe Subdivision igudisa imesh nge-Catmull-Clark: yonke inhlangothi iba yizinhlangothi ezine, futhi ileveli ngayinye yenza amanani amane kabili. Ibhokisi elinamazinga amabili noma amathathu sekuvele lifane nesimo esigudile, futhi uqhubeka uhlela ibhokisi. Amazinga esibukweni ayo abeka ukuthi igudile kangakanani. Amazinga ezithombeni ayo abeka ukuthi izithombe ezirenderiwe nevidiyo zigudile kangakanani; ukurenderwa kungasebenzisa amazinga amaningi kunokubuka. Ukurenderwa ngomumo wangempela ogudile kubeka amaphoyinti emesh erenderiwe emkhawulweni womumo amazinga angena kuwo, ngakho ngisho namazinga amabili enza ukurenderwa okugudile njengamaningi. Ukugoba kugcina imiphetho ibukhali: ku-Mesh workspace khetha imiphetho usebenzise Crease (1 ihlala ibukhali, 0.5 igoba kancane, 0 igudile). Bona Hlela imesh. Nciphisa ileveli yokubuka emeshini enkulu: uma amazinga ocela ezonikeza izinhlangothi eziningi kunalezi isibukeli somshini sizokwazi ngokuhle, ukubuka kukhombisa ileveli ephansi futhi kuyashoyo. Apply isebenzisa wonke amazinga njalo. Inani lezinhlangothi lilungiswa yiklasi lomshini wakho ku-Settings › Rendering › Your machine. Imiphetho evulekile igcina amakhona ayo futhi ihlala emgqeni wemiphetho yayo. Goba ngekheji Engeza isiguquli se-Lattice bese ucindezela Add a lattice cage round the mesh. Ikheji elinamaphoyinti ama-3 × 3 × 3 livela lizungeze imesh, lidwetshwe ngamawaya. Vula ikheji ku-Mesh workspace (chofoza kabili kuyo) uhambise amaphoyinti ayo. Imesh iyalandela ngobunono. Ikheji iyimesh njanoma iyiphi enye: yifihle ngethegi yayo uma usuqedile. Ama-mesh amakhulu Izitaki ezincane zisetshenziswa ngokushesha. Okukhulu kwenziwa ngemuva kuwo wonke ama-core ekhompyutha yakho: ukubuka kugcina kukhombisa umphumela wokugcina kuze kube yilapho olusha selulungile. Ama-Boolean alayisha isimodeli solid okokuqala; ukubuka kuyakutshela lokho isikhashana. Okungakenziwa yizisiguquli okwamanje Izisindo ngephoyinti ngalinye (ukwehla okupeyintwe emesheni) ku-Displace, ku-Smooth noma ku-Shrinkwrap. Ezinye izisiguquli ngaphandle kwe-Scale ne-Array elula kujiyometri ye-push/pull (amaqembu nezingxenye): yiguqule ibe yimesh kuqala (Convert to mesh). I-Mirror, i-Array ejikelezayo noma evolweni, i-Bend kanye ne-Taper emaqenjini kuzofika kamuva.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rotate-scale","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Jikisa nokushintsha usayizi","summary":"Jikisa izinto ngokuzungeza indawo ngokuchofoza noma ngokuthayipha amadigri, bese ushintsha usayizi wazo ngokulinganayo ngesilinganiso.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["izibambi zokushintsha usayizi","elula","ngokungalingani","ngakwi-axis ngayinye","phendula","ikhophi elibonisiwe","isibukiso","phendula ngomugqa","jikisa","phenduka","i-engeli","amadigri","iphrothrakthari","shintsha usayizi","linganisa","khulisa","nciphisa","isilinganiso","ukushintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo"],"headings":[{"id":"jikisa","text":"Jikisa","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi","text":"Shintsha usayizi","level":2},{"id":"elula-noma-shintsha-usayizi-ngezibambi","text":"Elula noma shintsha usayizi ngezibambi","level":3},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi-ngokuzungeza-noma-yiliphi-iphoyinti","text":"Shintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza noma yiliphi iphoyinti","level":3},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi-kusayizi-oqondile","text":"Shintsha usayizi kusayizi oqondile","level":3},{"id":"lungisa-ukungeniswa-okufike-ngosayizi-ongalungile","text":"Lungisa ukungeniswa okufike ngosayizi ongalungile","level":3},{"id":"izinto-okufanele-uzazi","text":"Izinto okufanele uzazi","level":2},{"id":"phendula","text":"Phendula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"jikisa\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ijikisa okukhethiwe ngokuzungeza indawo ephakathi. Idinga ukuchofoza kathathu: indawo ephakathi, isiqondiso sokuqala, nesiqondiso sokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lokho ofuna ukukujikisa. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Jikisa uthatha okuchofozwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Indandatho ilandela isikhombi, ikhombisa indiza ozojikisa kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza indawo ephakathi yokujikisa.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmhlabathini noma endaweni engenalutho, indandatho ilele phansi (eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka): ukujikisa kuzungeza i-axis eqondile, njengokujikisa isakhiwo ngesayithi yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbusweni, indandatho ilele endizeni yalobo buso: ukujikisa kuzungeza isiqondiso salobo buso. Chofoza odongeni ukuze ujikise okuthile ngokuzungeza i-axis evundlile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza indawo ebeka lapho i-engeli iqala khona, isibonelo ngasemphethweni wento ojikisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi uzungeze indawo ephakathi. I-engeli iboniswa kwi-tip nasebhokisini lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E). Ibamba ezinyathelweni ezingu-15° uma useduze kwenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuqeda, noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-30\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-engeli amahle ajikisa ngokuphambene nokuthambekela kwewashi, ebukwa ohlangothini indandatho ebheke kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ngesikhathi ujikisa ukuze ujikise \u003Cstrong\u003Eikhophi\u003C/strong\u003E bese ushiya okokuqala lapho kunjalo, njengo-Hambisa; i-tip ikhombisa ukuthi ikhophi livuliwe yini, nokucindezela ukhiye futhi kuyalivala. Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E ngemva kwekhophi elijikisiwe ukuze uthole amakhophi amaningi ezungeze indawo efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjengo-Hambisa, ukujikisa ingxenye yejiyometri exhunyiwe kuphendula nobuso obuxhunyiwe kuyo. Hlanganisa izinto kuqala ukuze uzijikise ngokuphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-tip ithi izinkinobho zomcibisholo zikhetha i-axis yokujikisa, kodwa kule build zizungeza umbono ngaphambi kochofoza wokuqala. Ukuze ukhethe i-axis, chofoza indawo ephakathi ebusweni obubheke ngendlela ofuna. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-usayizi\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ishintsha usayizi wokukhethiwe. Khetha lokho ofuna ukushintsha usayizi wakho kuqala, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: amasikwele amancane (izibambi) avela emakhoneni, emiphetheni nasemaphakathini ezinhlangothi zebhokisi yawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"elula-noma-shintsha-usayizi-ngezibambi\"\u003EElula noma shintsha usayizi ngezibambi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsibambi se-\u003Cstrong\u003Ekhona\u003C/strong\u003E sishintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo kuyo yonke indlela, ngaphezu kwekhona elibhekene nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsibambi esiphakathi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Engohlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E solulwa ngalona lodwa, ngaphezu kohlangothi olubhekene nalo: yenza ibhokisi lide ngaphandle kokuyenza iphakame.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsibambi esiphakathi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Emphetho webhokisi\u003C/strong\u003E solulwa ngokuqondile kokubili okuphambene nakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma uchofoza isibambi ukuze ushintshe usayizi ngasemaphakathini webhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza isibambi, hambisa isikhombi, bese uchofoza futhi; noma chofoza isibambi bese uthayipha isilinganiso (\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E iphindaphinda kabili, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E ihlukanisa ngamabili) bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukuze unike ngayinye yezinqondiso isilinganiso sayo, thayipha okuthathu, okubomvu, okuluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka: \u003Ccode\u003E2,1,0.5\u003C/code\u003E. Ngaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, izinqondiso ziyi-axis yeqembu lalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"shintsha-usayizi-ngokuzungeza-noma-yiliphi-iphoyinti\"\u003EShintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza noma yiliphi iphoyinti\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza noma yiphi indawo ngaphandle kwesibambi ukushintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza iphoyinti lakho. Idinga ukuchofoza kathathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lokho ofuna ukushintsha usayizi wakho. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Shintsha usayizi uthatha okuchofozwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti elihlala lilapho (hhayi esibambini), isibonelo ikhona elingezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lesithombe. Ibanga layo kusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala libalwa njenge-1×.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi usondele noma ukhashele iphoyinti lokuqala. Isilinganiso sibonakala kwi-tip nasebhokisini lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuqeda, noma thayipha isilinganiso bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E iphindaphinda usayizi kabili, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E uwuhlukanisa ngamabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"shintsha-usayizi-kusayizi-oqondile\"\u003EShintsha usayizi kusayizi oqondile\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wenze into ibe nobude oqondile, thola isilinganiso: ubude obusha kuhlukaniswe ubude bamanje. Kumodi yamaphoyinti amathathu ibhokisi lenani liyasebenza, ngakho thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E4.2/3.6\u003C/code\u003E ukwenza udonga olunamamitha angu-3.6 libe ude ngamamitha angu-4.2. Ibhokisi lenani lesibambi lamukela izinombolo ezilula kuphela: sebenzisa isilinganiso kuqala (4.2 ahlukaniswe ngo-3.6 cishe ngu-1.1667). Khetha umphetho kuqala ukuze ufunde ubude bawo bamanje ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lungisa-ukungeniswa-okufike-ngosayizi-ongalungile\"\u003ELungisa ukungeniswa okufike ngosayizi ongalungile\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela e-OBJ awanayo iyunithi, ngakho imodeli edwetshwe ngamamillimitha ifika ingu-1000 kabili inkulu. Khetha iqembu elingeniswe, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza isibambi sekhona, bese uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ngemodeli edwetshwe ngamainchi, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E0.0254\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-okufanele-uzazi\"\u003EIzinto okufanele uzazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza iphoyinti ngamachofozo amathathu kulinganayo. Ukuze unwebe ngokuqondile ngohlangothi lunye kuphela, sebenzisa isibambi sohlangothi noma somphetho (bona ngenhla).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha usayizi weqembu noma isingxenye kushintsha ikhophi oyishintshile kuphela; amanye amakhophi esingxenye agcina usayizi wawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphambi kochofo wokugcina ukuze ukhansele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phendula\"\u003EPhendula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ngomugqa obomvu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ngoluhlaza\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa okukhethiwe endaweni yakho, ngasemaphakathini ebhokisi lawo: isitebhisi sesandla sokhohlo siba sesandla sokudla. Ubuso bugcina buhlangana ngaphandle, futhi iqembu noma isingxenye ibonisiwe ngokuphelele (izingaphakathi zayo azibhalwa kabusha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhophi ephenduliwe ngomugqa obomvu\u003C/span\u003E (nangokuthi ngoluhlaza, ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) ishiya okokuqala lapho kunjalo bese ibeka ikhophi elibonisiwe eduze kwawo, ngaphesheya kohlangothi olude lwebhokisi lokukhethiwe: omunye umnyango wepheya, enye ingalo yesakhiwo. Ijiyometri engabotshiwe ethinta lapho ijoyina okokuqala, njengoba ijiyometri ethintanayo njalo ikwenza; yenza okokuqala kuqala kube iqembu ukuze zihlukane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, i-red, i-green ne-blue ngama-axis aleqembu lalo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jikisa Jikisa (Q) ijikisa okukhethiwe ngokuzungeza indawo ephakathi. Idinga ukuchofoza kathathu: indawo ephakathi, isiqondiso sokuqala, nesiqondiso sokugcina. Khetha lokho ofuna ukukujikisa. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Jikisa uthatha okuchofozwa kuqala. Cindezela Q. Indandatho ilandela isikhombi, ikhombisa indiza ozojikisa kuyo. Chofoza indawo ephakathi yokujikisa. Emhlabathini noma endaweni engenalutho, indandatho ilele phansi (eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka): ukujikisa kuzungeza i-axis eqondile, njengokujikisa isakhiwo ngesayithi yaso. Ebusweni, indandatho ilele endizeni yalobo buso: ukujikisa kuzungeza isiqondiso salobo buso. Chofoza odongeni ukuze ujikise okuthile ngokuzungeza i-axis evundlile. Chofoza indawo ebeka lapho i-engeli iqala khona, isibonelo ngasemphethweni wento ojikisayo. Hambisa isikhombi uzungeze indawo ephakathi. I-engeli iboniswa kwi-tip nasebhokisini lenani (I-engeli). Ibamba ezinyathelweni ezingu-15° uma useduze kwenye. Chofoza ukuqeda, noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri bese ucindezela Enter: 90, 45, -30. Ama-engeli amahle ajikisa ngokuphambene nokuthambekela kwewashi, ebukwa ohlangothini indandatho ebheke kulo. Cindezela Ctrl (noma Alt) ngesikhathi ujikisa ukuze ujikise ikhophi bese ushiya okokuqala lapho kunjalo, njengo-Hambisa; i-tip ikhombisa ukuthi ikhophi livuliwe yini, nokucindezela ukhiye futhi kuyalivala. Thayipha 3x ngemva kwekhophi elijikisiwe ukuze uthole amakhophi amaningi ezungeze indawo efanayo. Njengo-Hambisa, ukujikisa ingxenye yejiyometri exhunyiwe kuphendula nobuso obuxhunyiwe kuyo. Hlanganisa izinto kuqala ukuze uzijikise ngokuphelele. I-tip ithi izinkinobho zomcibisholo zikhetha i-axis yokujikisa, kodwa kule build zizungeza umbono ngaphambi kochofoza wokuqala. Ukuze ukhethe i-axis, chofoza indawo ephakathi ebusweni obubheke ngendlela ofuna. Bona Akukakwakhiwa. Shintsha usayizi Shintsha usayizi (S) ishintsha usayizi wokukhethiwe. Khetha lokho ofuna ukushintsha usayizi wakho kuqala, bese ucindezela S: amasikwele amancane (izibambi) avela emakhoneni, emiphetheni nasemaphakathini ezinhlangothi zebhokisi yawo. Elula noma shintsha usayizi ngezibambi Isibambi se-khona sishintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo kuyo yonke indlela, ngaphezu kwekhona elibhekene nalo. Isibambi esiphakathi kwe-ngohlangothi solulwa ngalona lodwa, ngaphezu kohlangothi olubhekene nalo: yenza ibhokisi lide ngaphandle kokuyenza iphakame. Isibambi esiphakathi kwe-mphetho webhokisi solulwa ngokuqondile kokubili okuphambene nakho. Bamba Ctrl uma uchofoza isibambi ukuze ushintshe usayizi ngasemaphakathini webhokisi. Chofoza isibambi, hambisa isikhombi, bese uchofoza futhi; noma chofoza isibambi bese uthayipha isilinganiso (2 iphindaphinda kabili, 0.5 ihlukanisa ngamabili) bese ucindezela Enter. Ukuze unike ngayinye yezinqondiso isilinganiso sayo, thayipha okuthathu, okubomvu, okuluhlaza nokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka: 2,1,0.5. Ngaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, izinqondiso ziyi-axis yeqembu lalo. Shintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza noma yiliphi iphoyinti Chofoza noma yiphi indawo ngaphandle kwesibambi ukushintsha usayizi ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza iphoyinti lakho. Idinga ukuchofoza kathathu: Khetha lokho ofuna ukushintsha usayizi wakho. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Shintsha usayizi uthatha okuchofozwa kuqala. Cindezela S. Chofoza iphoyinti elihlala lilapho (hhayi esibambini), isibonelo ikhona elingezansi. Chofoza iphoyinti lesithombe. Ibanga layo kusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala libalwa njenge-1×. Hambisa isikhombi usondele noma ukhashele iphoyinti lokuqala. Isilinganiso sibonakala kwi-tip nasebhokisini lenani (Shintsha usayizi). Chofoza ukuqeda, noma thayipha isilinganiso bese ucindezela Enter: 2 iphindaphinda usayizi kabili, 0.5 uwuhlukanisa ngamabili. Shintsha usayizi kusayizi oqondile Ukuze wenze into ibe nobude oqondile, thola isilinganiso: ubude obusha kuhlukaniswe ubude bamanje. Kumodi yamaphoyinti amathathu ibhokisi lenani liyasebenza, ngakho thayipha 4.2/3.6 ukwenza udonga olunamamitha angu-3.6 libe ude ngamamitha angu-4.2. Ibhokisi lenani lesibambi lamukela izinombolo ezilula kuphela: sebenzisa isilinganiso kuqala (4.2 ahlukaniswe ngo-3.6 cishe ngu-1.1667). Khetha umphetho kuqala ukuze ufunde ubude bawo bamanje ku-Ulwazi lwento. Lungisa ukungeniswa okufike ngosayizi ongalungile Amafayela e-OBJ awanayo iyunithi, ngakho imodeli edwetshwe ngamamillimitha ifika ingu-1000 kabili inkulu. Khetha iqembu elingeniswe, cindezela S, chofoza isibambi sekhona, bese uthayipha 0.001 bese ucindezela Enter. Ngemodeli edwetshwe ngamainchi, thayipha 0.0254. Izinto okufanele uzazi Ukushintsha usayizi ngokuzungeza iphoyinti ngamachofozo amathathu kulinganayo. Ukuze unwebe ngokuqondile ngohlangothi lunye kuphela, sebenzisa isibambi sohlangothi noma somphetho (bona ngenhla). Ukushintsha usayizi weqembu noma isingxenye kushintsha ikhophi oyishintshile kuphela; amanye amakhophi esingxenye agcina usayizi wawo. Cindezela Esc ngaphambi kochofo wokugcina ukuze ukhansele. Phendula Hlela › Okwengeziwe › Phendula ngomugqa obomvu, Phendula ngoluhlaza noma Phendula ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ibonisa okukhethiwe endaweni yakho, ngasemaphakathini ebhokisi lawo: isitebhisi sesandla sokhohlo siba sesandla sokudla. Ubuso bugcina buhlangana ngaphandle, futhi iqembu noma isingxenye ibonisiwe ngokuphelele (izingaphakathi zayo azibhalwa kabusha). Ikhophi ephenduliwe ngomugqa obomvu (nangokuthi ngoluhlaza, ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) ishiya okokuqala lapho kunjalo bese ibeka ikhophi elibonisiwe eduze kwawo, ngaphesheya kohlangothi olude lwebhokisi lokukhethiwe: omunye umnyango wepheya, enye ingalo yesakhiwo. Ijiyometri engabotshiwe ethinta lapho ijoyina okokuqala, njengoba ijiyometri ethintanayo njalo ikwenza; yenza okokuqala kuqala kube iqembu ukuze zihlukane. Ngaphakathi kweqembu elivulekile, i-red, i-green ne-blue ngama-axis aleqembu lalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"uv","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Lungisa ama-UV e-mesh","summary":"Maka imiphetho, vula isikhumba, phrojekthela futhi pakisha ama-texture coordinates e-mesh kwi-UV workspace, bese uwahlola ngechekha nemibala yokwelula.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["uv","uvs","vula isikhumba","unwrap","umphetho","imiphetho","ukuthungwa","ama-texture coordinates","atlas","pakisha","ukupakisha","isiqhingi","iziqhingi","ichekha","elula","ukuphambuka","projection yebhokisi","projection yesilinda","projection yebhola","conformal","angle based","lscm","abf"],"headings":[{"id":"yivule","text":"Yivule","level":2},{"id":"maka-imiphetho","text":"Maka imiphetho","level":2},{"id":"vula-isikhumba","text":"Vula isikhumba","level":2},{"id":"phrojekthela","text":"Phrojekthela","level":2},{"id":"hlela-izindawo","text":"Hlela izindawo","level":2},{"id":"hlola","text":"Hlola","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkuthungwa kuyisithombe esilingene; i-mesh ayilingene. Ama-\u003Cstrong\u003EUV\u003C/strong\u003E wayo athi ikhona kuphi ikhona ngayinye yamakhona wanoma yiyiphi inhlangothi esithombeni. I-UV workspace iwenza: usika i-mesh uyivula ngaseceleni \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwemiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003Eimiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E), ulinganise izingcezu (\u003Cstrong\u003Evula isikhumba\u003C/strong\u003E), bese uzifaka esikwareni (\u003Cstrong\u003Epakisha\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yivule\"\u003EYivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha i-mesh bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUV\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E. Iqembu noma ingxenye iba yi-mesh kuqala, njengoba kwenziwa ku-Mesh workspace. I-3D view ihamba iye engxenyeni yesobunxele; i-\u003Cstrong\u003EUV editor\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla ibonisa izinhlangothi ze-mesh zihlelwe esikwareni sokuthungwa. Ukukhetha kusebenza njengasku-Mesh workspace, futhi okukhethwe kolunye olubonweni kukhethwa nakolunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maka-imiphetho\"\u003EMaka imiphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphetho yindawo i-mesh okungasikwa kuyo ivulwe; ibonakala ibomvu kokubili imibono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha imiphetho (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmphetho\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"2\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka umphetho\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control E\"\u003E⌃E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula umphetho\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift E\"\u003E⌃⇧E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyawususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho ebukhali\u003C/span\u003E imaka yonke imiphetho ebukhali nayo yonke imiphetho lapho izinhlangothi zihlangana ngaphezu kuka-60°: ibhokisi liwela ezinhlangothini zalo eziyisithupha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho yokuhlanganisa kusuka ku-UV\u003C/span\u003E imaka imiphetho lapho ama-UV sewaphuke khona, isibonelo ngemva kwe-projection.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo esivaliwe sidinga imiphetho ukuze silale phansi: ibhola lidinga okungenani ukusika okukodwa, nethubhu idinga ukusika ngobude bayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-isikhumba\"\u003EVula isikhumba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi ozolinganisa (noma azikho, ukuze kube yi-mesh yonke) bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula isikhumba\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"U\"\u003EU\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EU\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Isiqhingi ngasinye phakathi kwemiphetho silinganiswa phansi, sigcine izingodo zaso zinembile kangangoba kungenzeka (ukulinganisa okusekelwe ezingodweni), bese izingcezu zipakishwa esikwareni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConformal\u003C/span\u003E ivula isikhumba ngamamephu conformal angama-least-squares: iyashesha, ibe incane kancane inembile ezingxenyeni ezigoba kakhulu. Umumo owenziwa ushidi olulingene, njengohlangothi lwesilinda olusikwe kanye, uvuleka ngaphandle kokwelula nakancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phrojekthela\"\u003EPhrojekthela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEmumweni olula, ukuphrojekthela okuvamile kuyanele:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProjection\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlangothi ngayinye ibheka eceleni lebhokisi elibheke kakhulu kuyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzungeza i-axis eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka: ngokuthwala kuyi-engeli ezungezayo, phezulu kuyubude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhola\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusukela esikhungweni: ngokuthwala kuyi-engeli ezungezayo, phezulu kuyububanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusukela embonweni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengoba izinhlangothi zibonakala ku-3D view manje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhlangothi ehlangana ngaphezulu kwesilinda noma kwebhola ihlala iyisiqeshana esisodwa, ngakho ama-UV ayo angadlula kancane umphetho wesokudla wesikwele; izithungo ziphindaphinda lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-izindawo\"\u003EHlela izindawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPakisha\u003C/span\u003E ifaka izingcezu (izihlephu) esikwareni ngosayizi weteksela munye, ngayinye iphendulwa ukuze ithathe indawo encane. I-panel imisa isikhala esisele phakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ngama-90°\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E zijikisa noma zibonise ama-UV wezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-UV editor, donsa inhlangothi ekhethiwe ukuze uhambise ama-UV wokukhethiwe, noma uyinikeze i-editor bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhambisa ukuze uwajikise noma uwashintshe usayizi (ukuchofoza kuwagcina, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayekisa). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhambisa ngaphandle kokudonsa. Chofoza kabili inhlangothi (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ukukhetha isiqhingi sayo sonke. Iwheel isondeza; donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla ukushelelisa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela isikwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELonke ushintsho luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola\"\u003EHlola\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIchekha\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ichekha elibhalwe kumaUV ayo: amachekha alinganayo asikwele avumela ukuthi ukuthungwa kulale ngokulinganayo; amalebula akhombisa ukuthi kuhamba kuphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElula\u003C/span\u003E ikhalaza ngemibala ngayinye ngokuthi ama-UV ayo ayiyelula kangakanani: okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka akukho ukwelula, kuye kuluhlaza, kuye kubomvu kakhulu. I-panel ikhetha ukuthi ukulinganisa kukhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-engeli agobile\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eusayizi oshintshile\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ibonisa isilinganiso sendlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EHlela i-mesh\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EIzinguquli ku-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukuthungwa kuyisithombe esilingene; i-mesh ayilingene. Ama-UV wayo athi ikhona kuphi ikhona ngayinye yamakhona wanoma yiyiphi inhlangothi esithombeni. I-UV workspace iwenza: usika i-mesh uyivula ngaseceleni kwemiphetho (imiphetho), ulinganise izingcezu (vula isikhumba), bese uzifaka esikwareni (pakisha). Yivule Khetha i-mesh bese ukhetha UV ohlwini lwe-Indawo yokusebenza. Iqembu noma ingxenye iba yi-mesh kuqala, njengoba kwenziwa ku-Mesh workspace. I-3D view ihamba iye engxenyeni yesobunxele; i-UV editor ngakwesokudla ibonisa izinhlangothi ze-mesh zihlelwe esikwareni sokuthungwa. Ukukhetha kusebenza njengasku-Mesh workspace, futhi okukhethwe kolunye olubonweni kukhethwa nakolunye. Maka imiphetho Imiphetho yindawo i-mesh okungasikwa kuyo ivulwe; ibonakala ibomvu kokubili imibono. Khetha imiphetho (Umphetho, noma 2) bese ucindezela Maka umphetho (Ctrl+E). Sula umphetho (Ctrl+Shift+E) iyawususa. Imiphetho ebukhali imaka yonke imiphetho ebukhali nayo yonke imiphetho lapho izinhlangothi zihlangana ngaphezu kuka-60°: ibhokisi liwela ezinhlangothini zalo eziyisithupha. Imiphetho yokuhlanganisa kusuka ku-UV imaka imiphetho lapho ama-UV sewaphuke khona, isibonelo ngemva kwe-projection. Isakhiwo esivaliwe sidinga imiphetho ukuze silale phansi: ibhola lidinga okungenani ukusika okukodwa, nethubhu idinga ukusika ngobude bayo. Vula isikhumba Khetha izinhlangothi ozolinganisa (noma azikho, ukuze kube yi-mesh yonke) bese ucindezela Vula isikhumba (U). Isiqhingi ngasinye phakathi kwemiphetho silinganiswa phansi, sigcine izingodo zaso zinembile kangangoba kungenzeka (ukulinganisa okusekelwe ezingodweni), bese izingcezu zipakishwa esikwareni. Conformal ivula isikhumba ngamamephu conformal angama-least-squares: iyashesha, ibe incane kancane inembile ezingxenyeni ezigoba kakhulu. Umumo owenziwa ushidi olulingene, njengohlangothi lwesilinda olusikwe kanye, uvuleka ngaphandle kokwelula nakancane. Phrojekthela Emumweni olula, ukuphrojekthela okuvamile kuyanele: Projection Okwenzayo Ibhokisi Inhlangothi ngayinye ibheka eceleni lebhokisi elibheke kakhulu kuyo Isilinda Izungeza i-axis eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka: ngokuthwala kuyi-engeli ezungezayo, phezulu kuyubude Ibhola Kusukela esikhungweni: ngokuthwala kuyi-engeli ezungezayo, phezulu kuyububanzi Kusukela embonweni Njengoba izinhlangothi zibonakala ku-3D view manje Inhlangothi ehlangana ngaphezulu kwesilinda noma kwebhola ihlala iyisiqeshana esisodwa, ngakho ama-UV ayo angadlula kancane umphetho wesokudla wesikwele; izithungo ziphindaphinda lapho. Hlela izindawo Pakisha ifaka izingcezu (izihlephu) esikwareni ngosayizi weteksela munye, ngayinye iphendulwa ukuze ithathe indawo encane. I-panel imisa isikhala esisele phakathi kwazo. Phendula ngama-90° ne-Bonisa zijikisa noma zibonise ama-UV wezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe. Ku-UV editor, donsa inhlangothi ekhethiwe ukuze uhambise ama-UV wokukhethiwe, noma uyinikeze i-editor bese ucindezela R noma S bese uhambisa ukuze uwajikise noma uwashintshe usayizi (ukuchofoza kuwagcina, Esc iyayekisa). G uhambisa ngaphandle kokudonsa. Chofoza kabili inhlangothi (noma L) ukukhetha isiqhingi sayo sonke. Iwheel isondeza; donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla ukushelelisa; F ibuyisela isikwele. Lonke ushintsho luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Hlola Ichekha ibonisa ichekha elibhalwe kumaUV ayo: amachekha alinganayo asikwele avumela ukuthi ukuthungwa kulale ngokulinganayo; amalebula akhombisa ukuthi kuhamba kuphi. Elula ikhalaza ngemibala ngayinye ngokuthi ama-UV ayo ayiyelula kangakanani: okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka akukho ukwelula, kuye kuluhlaza, kuye kubomvu kakhulu. I-panel ikhetha ukuthi ukulinganisa kukhombisa ama-engeli agobile noma usayizi oshintshile, futhi ibonisa isilinganiso sendlela. Bheka futhi Hlela i-mesh, Ama-mesh no Izinguquli ku-mesh.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"curves","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izinto zamajika","summary":"Dweba amajika e-Bézier, e-NURBS namajika ayisigatshana esiqondile, unikeze ukujula, ububanzi noma ukuncipha, gcwalisa amajika athe tshe, bhala umbhalo njengejika, bese uwaguqula abe ama-mesh.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ijika","amajika","bezier","nurbs","spline","splines","indlela","ithubhu","ipayipi","ikhebuli","udwangu","bevel","extrude","taper","tilt","radius","gcwalisa","iphrofayili","umbhalo","izinhlamvu","ilogo","ijika libe yi-mesh"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-ijika","text":"Engeza ijika","level":2},{"id":"hlela-amaphoyinti","text":"Hlela amaphoyinti","level":2},{"id":"isimo","text":"Isimo","level":2},{"id":"yiguqule-ibe-yi-mesh","text":"Yiguqule ibe yi-mesh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto yejika\u003C/strong\u003E iyijika elenza isimo: ithubhu elicaleni lalo (bevel), ibhendi (extrude), inhlanga ebhantayo (taper), noma, uma lithe tshe futhi livaliwe, ipuleti eligcwele noma izinhlamvu. Isimo silandela ijika: hambisa iphoyinti nethubhu liyahamba nalo. Lapho isimo silungile, lishintshe libe yi-mesh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ijika\"\u003EEngeza ijika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwendawo yokusebenza bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKuyini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjika le-Bézier, indilinga ye-Bézier\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdlula emaphoyinteni ayo; iphoyinti ngalinye linama-handle amabili asetha ukuqondiswa kwejika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjika le-NURBS, indilinga ye-NURBS, Indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbushelelezile, idwetshwe ngokuya kumaphoyinti ayo (iqala futhi iphele kumaphoyinti okuphela); iphoyinti ngalinye linesisindo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo wakho njengemiphetho yezinhlamvu ethe tshe, egcwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIjika elisha linethubhu elincane ukuze libonakale futhi likhethwe; setha ukujula kwe-bevel kube ku-0 ukuze kube ijika elibukhali elingenalutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaqala futhi kokudwetshiwe: khetha i-arc, indilinga, ipholigoni noma ijika elidwetshiwe endaweni yokusebenza yemodeli, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a curve object\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E. Imigqa edwetshiwe ihlala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-amaphoyinti\"\u003EHlela amaphoyinti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza kabili ijika lento (noma khetha bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze uyihlele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti noma i-handle (i-Shift yengeza noma isuse); donsa ukuze uhambise. Donsa endaweni engenalutho ukukhetha ngebhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtend\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza) yengeza iphoyinti ngemva kwesiphetho esikhethiwe, endaweni yesikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubdivide\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ibeka iphoyinti phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili aseduze akhethiwe; i-Bézier igcina isimo sayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E zihambisa amaphoyinti akhethiwe ngesikhombi (izinkinobho ze-modeler \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, izinkinobho ze-push/pull \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); chofoza ukugcina, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukukhansela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ivala i-spline evulekile noma ivule evaliwe; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift R\"\u003E⇧R\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+R\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyisebenzisa ngendlela ephambene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzibambi ze-Bézier: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) zibeka zona ukuze kube nejika elibushelelezile, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorner\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift V\"\u003E⇧V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) zizibheke kumakhelwane, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFree\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option V\"\u003E⌥V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) zishiya lapho ozibeka khona. Ukudonsa isibambi kusenza sikhululeke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBézier\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENURBS\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoly\u003C/span\u003E zishintsha uhlobo lwama-spline akhethiwe, zigcina amaphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isimo\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zisephaneli (nakuLwazi lwento endaweni yokusebenza yemodeli):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo:\u003C/strong\u003E amajika e-3D ahamba noma iyiphi indlela; ijika elithe tshe lihlala endizeni yalo futhi lingagcwaliswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGcwalisa ama-spline avaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E (athe tshe): izinhlangothi ziba ipuleti; ijika elingaphakathi kwelinye libe yimbobo, ngakho izinhlamvu zigcina izimbobo zazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude:\u003C/strong\u003E isigamu sobubanzi bebhendi (amajika avulekile noma e-3D), noma isigamu sokujula kwepuleti (eligcwele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula kwe-bevel\u003C/strong\u003E nobuningi bokujikeleza (\u003Cstrong\u003Eroundness\u003C/strong\u003E): ithubhu elijikile elicaleni lejika (nge-extrude: ibhendi elijikile); esimweni esigcwele, umphetho ojikile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVala iziphetho:\u003C/strong\u003E izigqoko ethubhwini elivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENcipha ngaphansi kwalo:\u003C/strong\u003E kulinganisa ngokulinganayo kuso sonke i-spline, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E1, 0.2\u003C/code\u003E ngenhlanga ebhantayo, \u003Ccode\u003E0, 1, 0\u003C/code\u003E ngesipindle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubushelelezisa\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003Eorder\u003C/strong\u003E kwe-NURBS: ukuthi idwetshwa kanjani kahle, nokuthi ibushelelezile kangakanani (2 eqondile … 6 ebushelelezile kakhulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kukhethwe amaphoyinti: \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius\u003C/strong\u003E (ububanzi bethubhu lapho, kaphindaphindwe nge-bevel), \u003Cstrong\u003Etilt\u003C/strong\u003E (ijikisa ibhendi ngokuzungeza ijika) kanye, ye-NURBS, \u003Cstrong\u003Eweight\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinguquli zisebenza phezu kwento yejika njengakwe-mesh: i-Array ngaphansi kwalo, i-Mirror, i-Subdivision surface. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EIzinguquli kwe-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yiguqule-ibe-yi-mesh\"\u003EYiguqule ibe yi-mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETo mesh\u003C/span\u003E (endaweni yokusebenza yeJika noma kuLwazi lwento, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve to mesh\u003C/span\u003E) yenza into yejika ibe yi-mesh elibonisa manje; izinguquli zayo zihlala phezulu. Bese uhlela endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EHlela i-mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Into yejika iyijika elenza isimo: ithubhu elicaleni lalo (bevel), ibhendi (extrude), inhlanga ebhantayo (taper), noma, uma lithe tshe futhi livaliwe, ipuleti eligcwele noma izinhlamvu. Isimo silandela ijika: hambisa iphoyinti nethubhu liyahamba nalo. Lapho isimo silungile, lishintshe libe yi-mesh. Engeza ijika Khetha Curve ohlwini lwendawo yokusebenza bese ucindezela Add: Uhlobo Kuyini Ijika le-Bézier, indilinga ye-Bézier Idlula emaphoyinteni ayo; iphoyinti ngalinye linama-handle amabili asetha ukuqondiswa kwejika Ijika le-NURBS, indilinga ye-NURBS, Indlela Ibushelelezile, idwetshwe ngokuya kumaphoyinti ayo (iqala futhi iphele kumaphoyinti okuphela); iphoyinti ngalinye linesisindo Umbhalo Umbhalo wakho njengemiphetho yezinhlamvu ethe tshe, egcwele Ijika elisha linethubhu elincane ukuze libonakale futhi likhethwe; setha ukujula kwe-bevel kube ku-0 ukuze kube ijika elibukhali elingenalutho. Ungaqala futhi kokudwetshiwe: khetha i-arc, indilinga, ipholigoni noma ijika elidwetshiwe endaweni yokusebenza yemodeli, bese uchofoza Make a curve object ku-Entity info. Imigqa edwetshiwe ihlala. Hlela amaphoyinti Chofoza kabili ijika lento (noma khetha bese ukhetha Curve) ukuze uyihlele. Chofoza iphoyinti noma i-handle (i-Shift yengeza noma isuse); donsa ukuze uhambise. Donsa endaweni engenalutho ukukhetha ngebhokisi. Extend (E, noma Ctrl+chofoza) yengeza iphoyinti ngemva kwesiphetho esikhethiwe, endaweni yesikhombi. Subdivide (W) ibeka iphoyinti phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili aseduze akhethiwe; i-Bézier igcina isimo sayo. Move, Turn, Scale zihambisa amaphoyinti akhethiwe ngesikhombi (izinkinobho ze-modeler G R S, izinkinobho ze-push/pull M Q S); chofoza ukugcina, Esc ukukhansela. Close (C) ivala i-spline evulekile noma ivule evaliwe; Reverse (Shift+R) iyisebenzisa ngendlela ephambene. Izibambi ze-Bézier: Smooth (V) zibeka zona ukuze kube nejika elibushelelezile, Corner (Shift+V) zizibheke kumakhelwane, Free (Alt+V) zishiya lapho ozibeka khona. Ukudonsa isibambi kusenza sikhululeke. Bézier, NURBS kanye Poly zishintsha uhlobo lwama-spline akhethiwe, zigcina amaphoyinti. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Isimo Izilungiselelo zisephaneli (nakuLwazi lwento endaweni yokusebenza yemodeli): Isimo: amajika e-3D ahamba noma iyiphi indlela; ijika elithe tshe lihlala endizeni yalo futhi lingagcwaliswa. Gcwalisa ama-spline avaliwe (athe tshe): izinhlangothi ziba ipuleti; ijika elingaphakathi kwelinye libe yimbobo, ngakho izinhlamvu zigcina izimbobo zazo. Extrude: isigamu sobubanzi bebhendi (amajika avulekile noma e-3D), noma isigamu sokujula kwepuleti (eligcwele). Ukujula kwe-bevel nobuningi bokujikeleza (roundness): ithubhu elijikile elicaleni lejika (nge-extrude: ibhendi elijikile); esimweni esigcwele, umphetho ojikile. Vala iziphetho: izigqoko ethubhwini elivulekile. Ncipha ngaphansi kwalo: kulinganisa ngokulinganayo kuso sonke i-spline, isibonelo 1, 0.2 ngenhlanga ebhantayo, 0, 1, 0 ngesipindle. Ukubushelelezisa no-order kwe-NURBS: ukuthi idwetshwa kanjani kahle, nokuthi ibushelelezile kangakanani (2 eqondile … 6 ebushelelezile kakhulu). Uma kukhethwe amaphoyinti: radius (ububanzi bethubhu lapho, kaphindaphindwe nge-bevel), tilt (ijikisa ibhendi ngokuzungeza ijika) kanye, ye-NURBS, weight. Izinguquli zisebenza phezu kwento yejika njengakwe-mesh: i-Array ngaphansi kwalo, i-Mirror, i-Subdivision surface. Bheka Izinguquli kwe-mesh. Yiguqule ibe yi-mesh To mesh (endaweni yokusebenza yeJika noma kuLwazi lwento, Curve to mesh) yenza into yejika ibe yi-mesh elibonisa manje; izinguquli zayo zihlala phezulu. Bese uhlela endaweni yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela kuyo. Bheka futhi Ama-mesh kanye Hlela i-mesh.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"shading","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Yenza izinto ezinama-nodi","summary":"Yakha impahla kusuka ku-texture, izithombe nezibalo ku-workspace ethi Ukushadisa, ubone kumbono njengoba uqhubeka, bese upenda ubuso ngayo.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ukushadisa","bhaka","ukubhaka","ukubhaka kwe-texture","ukuvinjelwa okuzungezile","ao","ukugoba","ukubhaka okujwayelekile","phezu kwesiqukathi","ukuphezulu okuphansi","imephu yokukhanya","idekali","idekali","isitika","logo","ilebhuli","ukupenda kwe-texture","ukupenda i-texture","ibhulashi","impahla","izimpahla","materialx","mtlx","openpbr","standard surface","umtapo wezimpahla","librarycraft","isethi ye-texture","pbr","ngenisa ama-texture","zip","cc0","hudula","inodi","amanodi","umhleli wenodi","shader","texture","procedural","umsindo","ichekhi","voronoi","amaseli","amagagasi","izitini","amathayili","ukhuni","imabula","ukuguquka kombala","ukungcola","ukuguga kwemiphetho","ibhendi lombala","xuba","ukuvuvuka","imephu ejwayelekile","ukuqina","ubungcwebe","ukungaboni","ukusika","ukukhipha","ukukhanya","ukuqhathaniswa","ukuhlelwa kwebhokisi","triplanar","uv","isithombe","i-texture yesithombe","openpbr"],"headings":[{"id":"vula","text":"Vula","level":2},{"id":"izimpahla-zomtapo","text":"Izimpahla zomtapo","level":2},{"id":"ngenisa-isethi-ye-texture","text":"Ngenisa isethi ye-texture","level":2},{"id":"materialx","text":"MaterialX","level":2},{"id":"amadekali","text":"Amadekali","level":2},{"id":"penda-ku-texture","text":"Penda ku-texture","level":2},{"id":"bhaka-ama-texture","text":"Bhaka ama-texture","level":2},{"id":"yakha-igrafu","text":"Yakha igrafu","level":2},{"id":"okuphumayo-kwempahla","text":"Okuphumayo kwempahla","level":2},{"id":"ezithombeni-ezinekhwalithi-ephezulu","text":"Ezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImpahla eyenziwe ku-workspace ethi \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkushadisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E ingeyefayela. Iyigrafu encane: \u003Cstrong\u003Eamanodi\u003C/strong\u003E adala ama-texture, izithombe nezinombolo, axhunyiwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuphumayo kwempahla\u003C/strong\u003E, okungenayo kuyisimo sobuso — umbala oyisisekelo, ukuqina, ubungcwebe, normal, ukungaboni, ukukhipha nezinye izingxenye zemodeli ye-OpenPBR. Upenda ubuso ngayo njengalowo nalowo mpahla yomtapo, futhi lonke ushintsho buvela kumbono ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula\"\u003EVula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkushadisa\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwe-workspace. Ibhodi lokubuka le-3D lihlala phezulu kwiscreen, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eumhleli wenodi\u003C/strong\u003E uthatha ingxenye engezansi. Iphaneli ngakwesokudla ibhala izimpahla zefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla entsha\u003C/span\u003E yenza eyemnyama-mhlophe enoKuphumayo kwempahla kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYenza ikhophi ehlelekayo yempahla yomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E iguqula i-brick, igatsha, ithayili nezinye zibe yigrafu ongayishintsha: i-texture yayo ifika ngenodi ye-Library texture, nezintaba zayo ngenodi ye-Bump.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhenda ngayo\u003C/span\u003E upenda ubuso noma amaqembu akhethiwe, noma ikhetha impahla yethuluzi lokupenda. Izimpahla zethuluzi lokupenda zibhale nezefayela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EKulo fayela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E zisebenza empahleni oyihlelayo. Ukususa akukwazi ukuhlehliswa; ubuso obupenteke ngayo bubonisa umbala ozenzakalelayo kuze kube usubuphenta futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimpahla-zomtapo\"\u003EIzimpahla zomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEphaneli, \u003Cstrong\u003Eumtapo wezimpahla (Library)\u003C/strong\u003E ubhala izimpahla zomtapo, ngayinye inokubuka okwenziwe yi-path tracer ye-CadCraft. Zisethi ze-texture ezikhishwe ngaphansi kwe-CC0, ezinikezwa kubantu ezenzile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza eyodwa ukuze uyiletha efayelweni (izithombe zayo ziza nayo) futhi, uma ubuso noma amaqembu akhethiwe, uwapenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula eyodwa phezu kobuso noma iqembu kumbono ukuze upende kuphela lowo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIba yenye yezimpahla zefayela: shintsha amanodi ayo njengoba unjalo nanoma iyiphi enye. Ukubongwa kwayo kuveza ephaneli futhi kuhlala efayelweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa-isethi-ye-texture\"\u003ENgenisa isethi ye-texture\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithombe noma i-zip…\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfolda…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa isethi ye-texture\u003C/strong\u003E zenza impahla kusuka kusethi yamamephu. Amamephu atholwa ngamagama asemagameni amafayela awo: color, albedo, diffuse noma basecolor; roughness (noma gloss, eguqulwa ibe roughness); metalness noma metallic; normal (OpenGL noma DirectX, kusuka ku-\u003Ccode\u003Egl\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Edx\u003C/code\u003E egameni); height noma displacement; ambient occlusion; opacity; emission. Amamephu apakishiwe (ARM, ORM) ayashiywa ngaphandle. Ithayili liqala ku-1 × 1 m: setha usayizi wangempela kuKuphumayo kwempahla. I-height iya ku-displacement nesikali sayo ku-0 — khulisa isikali ukuze uyisebenzise kuma-mesh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-MaterialX ifomethi evulekile ezinye izinhlelo ze-3D nezokurenda ezisebenzisa ukudlulisa izimpahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela njenge-MaterialX…\u003C/span\u003E igcina impahla oyihlelayo: amanani ayo, nayo yonke i-texture njengesithombe se-PNG ngaseceleni kwefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtlx\u003C/code\u003E (ku-zip). Khetha i-shader ibhalwe ngayo: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpenPBR Surface\u003C/strong\u003E (MaterialX 1.39, imodeli efanayo ne-ModelCraft isebenzisa) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EStandard Surface\u003C/strong\u003E (MaterialX 1.38, ezinye izinhlelo eziyifunda manje). Ama-texture ayabekwa ngokuhlelwa kwe-UV ngamamitha; ukuhlelwa kwebhokisi nokwe-triplanar kubhalwa njenge-UV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa i-MaterialX…\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusukela kufolda…\u003C/span\u003E) ifunda amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.mtlx\u003C/code\u003E anama-shader e-OpenPBR, Standard Surface, UsdPreviewSurface noma glTF PBR. Nika izithombe futhi, noma i-zip yakho yonke into: isithombe sitholakala ngendlela yaso, ngegama layo, noma ngegama layo nohlobo olunye lwesithombe (i-\u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E amafayela asho ingafika njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.jpg\u003C/code\u003E eduze kwayo). Ama-texture, amamephu ajwayelekile, izibalo, izixube nokuqhathaniswa kufika njengamanodi; okunye konke kugcina inani laso, nomugqa wesimo ubhala okushiyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amadekali\"\u003EAmadekali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdekali isithombe esibekwe phezu kobuso — ilogo, uphawu, ilebhuli, isitheni — nempahla yaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi bedekali elisha\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka idekali…\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdekali\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi), khetha isithombe se-PNG, JPEG noma WebP bese uchofoza ubuso. Isithombe siprojektwa phezu kobuso lapho, sigcina ukulingana kwaso; izingxenye ezibonakala ngaphuma kwe-PNG ziyahlala zibonakala ngaphuma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhona eqenjini noma kwisakhi ochofoze kuso futhi ihamba nalo. Imboza ubuso ngaphakathi kwebhokisi layo obubheke ngendlela efanayo, bese imi emaphethelweni alo lapho ikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdekali ngayinye inempahla yayo, ibizwa ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EDecal: &lt;isithombe&gt;\u003C/strong\u003E, ohlwini lwefayela: yihlele njengoba unjalo nanoma iyiphi enye (roughness, bump, ukukhanya). I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwedekali iyayivula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEduze kwedekali ngayinye: ububanzi bayo (ubude buyalandela isithombe), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E (ukujika ngekota) no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E. Amadekali agcinwa nempahla yefayela, ngaphandle kwe-Undo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbonakala emcabangweni oshadiswe, emirenjini esheshayo nasezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"penda-ku-texture\"\u003EPenda ku-texture\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda ukwakheka\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPenda ku-texture\u003C/strong\u003E) yenza inkomba ibe yibhulashi elizungezile. Hudula ubuso oluthwele enye yezimpahla zalo fayela: ibhulashi lipenda isithombe esingemuva kombala wayo oyisisekelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKukhona i-mesh ipenda ngokulandela ama-UV ayo (yenze ingabe nayo ku-workspace ye-UV kuqala); kwezinye izinhlangothi ipenda ngokuhlangana ubuso, ngakho ukupenda kuphindeka nethayili lempahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpahla okuyimbala oqondile oyisisekelo wayo ithola isithombe esisha se-512 × 512 salowo mbala ukuqala lapho uyipenda. Impahla enombala oyisisekelo ovela kwamanye amanodi idinga inodi yesithombe exhunyiwe ku-Base color.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha umbala webhulashi, usayizi (ngamapikseli esithombe), amandla nobulukhuni ephaneli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa umkwapho\u003C/span\u003E noma Ctrl+Z (ngenkathi upenda) ibuyisa umkwapho, kuze kube ngu-20 okokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsithombe esipentiwe sigcinwa efayelweni. Izimpahla zomtapo azipentwa: yenza ikhophi ehlelekayo kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bhaka-ama-texture\"\u003EBhaka ama-texture\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBhaka ama-texture\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala okwenziwa yisimo nesimo sesiteji ebuso ibe yizithombe ngama-UV ka-mesh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-mesh enama-UV (yenze ingabe nayo ku-workspace ye-UV), thikisha amamephu bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBhaka\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvinjelwa okuzungezile\u003C/strong\u003E — ukuthi iphoyinti ngalinye livulekile kangakanani: amakhoni, izimbobo nezindawo ngaphansi kwezinye izinto ziba mnyama. Konke okubonakala emodelini kuyashadisa, kuze kube sekuguqukeni kokuvinjelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugoba\u003C/strong\u003E — kukhanya emaphethelweni angaphandle, kumnyama emakhoneni angaphakathi, kube mpunga-mnyama ezindaweni ezilinganayo nezigobile kancane, ngaphezu kobubanzi bomphetho owusethile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkujwayelekile kusuka kwento enemininingwane eminingi\u003C/strong\u003E — khetha nekhophi enemininingwane eminingi: inemininingwane yobuso bayo ibhalwa njengemephu ejwayelekile yento elula (into enamatrayangela amancane ibhakwa phezu kwayo). Ibanga lokusesha ngumgama phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezingaba khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhanya\u003C/strong\u003E — ilanga lendawo yemodeli nosuku (Style) namathunzi alo, kanye nesibhakabhaka, njengemephu yokukhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithombe ziyahlanganyela efayelweni futhi zivela kumanodi ezithombe. Uma impahla oyihlelayo inenodi ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EDirt and edge wear\u003C/strong\u003E, ifunda ukuvinjelwa okusha nokugoba ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmarray amaningi nge-texel ayenza ukuvinjelwa nokukhanya kube bushelelezi, kuthathe isikhathi eside. Ukubhaka kusebenza ezinqubeni zomkhuhlane wekhompyutha ngasemuva; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYima ukubhaka\u003C/span\u003E iyayimisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yakha-igrafu\"\u003EYakha igrafu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza inodi…\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift A\"\u003E⇧A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kumhleli wenodi) yengeza inodi phakathi komhleli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula kusuka kuchashaza lokukhiphayo (ngakwesokudla kwenodi) kuya kuchashaza lokungenayo (ngakwesobunxele kwenodi) ukuze uxhumanise. Ukuxhumana okwesibili kokungenayo kuyayishintsha eyokuqala; hudula okungenayo okuxhunyiwe ukuze ukukhulule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkungenayo okungaxhunyiwe kukhombisa inani laso: bhala inombolo noma khetha umbala. Izilungiselelo zisezansi kwenodi ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula inodi ngesihloko sayo ukuze uyinyakazise, hudula indawo engenalutho ukuze ushelelise, bese usebenzisa ivili ukuze usondeze. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa amanodi akhethiwe noma ixhumanisi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaphinda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibonisa wonke amanodi. Yonke into eshintshayo iyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa kumhleli wenodi. Ukuhlehlisa okuyimodeli akushintshi izimpahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanodi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenziwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlelwa kwe-texture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho iphoyinti lisendaweni yethayili: liphindaphinde, liguqule endaweni, liphendule ngekota.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EValue, Color\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo, umbala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPicture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe sefayela (esafika kanye nemodeli eyenganiswe, noma esengeziwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E). Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EColors\u003C/strong\u003E ngesithombe sokuthwebula nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EData\u003C/strong\u003E ngemephu yokuqina noma ejwayelekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELibrary texture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-texture yempahla yomtapo, ukuqina nobude bayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChecker, Noise\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikwele; umsindo oshelelezayo ofrakhali nemininingwane, ukuqina nembewu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVoronoi cells, Waves, Gradient\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaseli (umgama ngokuya kwephoyinti eliseduze, imiphetho phakathi kwamaseli, umbala ngeseli ngayinye); amabhande aphuma phansi, phezulu noma adayisa, njengesine, isaw noma itriyangela, agobile ngomsindo; ukuguquka kwemigqa, kwe-quadratic, okuyisangqa nokwebhola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBricks, Tiles\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa yezitini enokufuduka okuqhubekayo, noma igridi yamathayili: imibala, umbhobo noma ugcwele, igebe nokuqeqeshwa ngamamitha, ubude bokuvuvuka, inombolo engakhethiwe ngayinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWood, Marble\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImisele ecaleni kwegatsha ngezinwele ezincane; imitsha egoqwe ngumsindo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDirt and edge wear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgqoka imiphetho evuthayo futhi ingcolise izikhala ngokugoba nezithombe zokuvinjelwa zemesh (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#bake-textures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"bake-textures\"\u003EBhaka ama-texture\u003C/a\u003E iyazidala; noma setha izilungiselelo zazo ezimbili zezithombe, ku-UV layout yemesh: beka impahla ngokuhlelwa kwe-UV). Ngaphandle kwazo akushintshi lutho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMix colors, Color ramp, Hue/saturation/value, Brightness and contrast, Invert, Gamma, Separate and Combine RGB\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsebenzi wombala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMath, Map range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibalo ezinombolweni (engeza, phindaphinda, amandla, smooth step nokunye).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBump, Normal map\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENormal ngokusuka kukuphakama (Bump) noma ezithombeni zemephu ejwayelekile (Normal map: khetha icala lohlobo oluhlaza).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuphumayo-kwempahla\"\u003EOkuphumayo kwempahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zayo zichaza ukuthi i-texture ihlala kanjani ebusweni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi bethayili\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwethayili\u003C/strong\u003E: amamitha angaki ethayili eyodwa ye-texture imboza. Konke igrafu eyenzayo iphindaphinda ethayilini ngaphandle komphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKubekwe yi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EAma-UV\u003C/strong\u003E alandela ubuso (ukuhudula kwezinhlangothi: ngabunye ubuso; ama-mesh: ama-UV awo, i-UV unit eyodwa = ithayili eyodwa), \u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/strong\u003E liprojekthela kusuka ku-eksisi eseduze kakhulu kwezintathu, \u003Cstrong\u003ETriplanar\u003C/strong\u003E ixuba ukuprojekthela kwezintathu ezindaweni ezithambekile (\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxuba ukubukhali\u003C/strong\u003E: okuphezulu kuyixube elinzima).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmandla ejwayelekile\u003C/strong\u003E ahlahla inani lokungenayo elijwayelekile. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali sokuqhathaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E sisetha ukuthi ukungenayo kokuqhathaniswa kunyakazisa kangakanani amaphoyinti e-mesh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingenayo eziningi\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa okunye kwezingenayo ze-OpenPBR: coat, fuzz, subsurface, thin film, transmission nemibala yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezithombeni-ezinekhwalithi-ephezulu\"\u003EEzithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-path tracer ifunda umbala oyisisekelo, ukuqina, ubungcwebe, ukungaboni, normal nokukhipha kusuka egrafini njengoba zishintsha ebusweni. Noma yikuphi okunye okungenayo okuxhunyiwe (isibonelo i-coat eshintshayo) isetshenziswa ngesilinganiso sayo; umugqa wephaneli ukhombisa lokho. Ukusika kusuka ku-opacity texture kubonisa isimo sakho, nethunzi layo liba nokungaboni okulinganayo. I-texture ekhanyayo ikhanyisa okubhekene nayo, ngaphandle kokuthathwa njengelambu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqhathaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E kuhambisa amaphoyinti e-mesh kuphela, ngakho engeza i-Subdivision modifier ukuze uthole imininingwane (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EAma-modifier\u003C/a\u003E). Ubuso obusunduzwa/hudulwa bugcina ukwakheka kwabo bese buthola ukuvuvuka kusuka ku-normal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKukhompyutha enayo i-WebGPU igrafu yenziwa ekhadini lezithombe; kungekho, enziwa kuprosesa. Umphumela ufana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Impahla eyenziwe ku-workspace ethi Ukushadisa ingeyefayela. Iyigrafu encane: amanodi adala ama-texture, izithombe nezinombolo, axhunyiwe ku-Okuphumayo kwempahla, okungenayo kuyisimo sobuso — umbala oyisisekelo, ukuqina, ubungcwebe, normal, ukungaboni, ukukhipha nezinye izingxenye zemodeli ye-OpenPBR. Upenda ubuso ngayo njengalowo nalowo mpahla yomtapo, futhi lonke ushintsho buvela kumbono ngesikhathi esisodwa. Vula Khetha Ukushadisa ohlwini lwe-workspace. Ibhodi lokubuka le-3D lihlala phezulu kwiscreen, futhi umhleli wenodi uthatha ingxenye engezansi. Iphaneli ngakwesokudla ibhala izimpahla zefayela. Impahla entsha yenza eyemnyama-mhlophe enoKuphumayo kwempahla kuphela. Yenza ikhophi ehlelekayo yempahla yomtapo iguqula i-brick, igatsha, ithayili nezinye zibe yigrafu ongayishintsha: i-texture yayo ifika ngenodi ye-Library texture, nezintaba zayo ngenodi ye-Bump. Phenda ngayo upenda ubuso noma amaqembu akhethiwe, noma ikhetha impahla yethuluzi lokupenda. Izimpahla zethuluzi lokupenda zibhale nezefayela ngaphansi kwe-Kulo fayela. Phinda no-Susa zisebenza empahleni oyihlelayo. Ukususa akukwazi ukuhlehliswa; ubuso obupenteke ngayo bubonisa umbala ozenzakalelayo kuze kube usubuphenta futhi. Izimpahla zomtapo Ephaneli, umtapo wezimpahla (Library) ubhala izimpahla zomtapo, ngayinye inokubuka okwenziwe yi-path tracer ye-CadCraft. Zisethi ze-texture ezikhishwe ngaphansi kwe-CC0, ezinikezwa kubantu ezenzile. Chofoza eyodwa ukuze uyiletha efayelweni (izithombe zayo ziza nayo) futhi, uma ubuso noma amaqembu akhethiwe, uwapenda. Hudula eyodwa phezu kobuso noma iqembu kumbono ukuze upende kuphela lowo. Iba yenye yezimpahla zefayela: shintsha amanodi ayo njengoba unjalo nanoma iyiphi enye. Ukubongwa kwayo kuveza ephaneli futhi kuhlala efayelweni. Ngenisa isethi ye-texture Izithombe noma i-zip… noma Ifolda… ngaphansi kwe-Ngenisa isethi ye-texture zenza impahla kusuka kusethi yamamephu. Amamephu atholwa ngamagama asemagameni amafayela awo: color, albedo, diffuse noma basecolor; roughness (noma gloss, eguqulwa ibe roughness); metalness noma metallic; normal (OpenGL noma DirectX, kusuka ku-gl / dx egameni); height noma displacement; ambient occlusion; opacity; emission. Amamephu apakishiwe (ARM, ORM) ayashiywa ngaphandle. Ithayili liqala ku-1 × 1 m: setha usayizi wangempela kuKuphumayo kwempahla. I-height iya ku-displacement nesikali sayo ku-0 — khulisa isikali ukuze uyisebenzise kuma-mesh. MaterialX I-MaterialX ifomethi evulekile ezinye izinhlelo ze-3D nezokurenda ezisebenzisa ukudlulisa izimpahla. Thumela njenge-MaterialX… igcina impahla oyihlelayo: amanani ayo, nayo yonke i-texture njengesithombe se-PNG ngaseceleni kwefayela le-.mtlx (ku-zip). Khetha i-shader ibhalwe ngayo: OpenPBR Surface (MaterialX 1.39, imodeli efanayo ne-ModelCraft isebenzisa) noma Standard Surface (MaterialX 1.38, ezinye izinhlelo eziyifunda manje). Ama-texture ayabekwa ngokuhlelwa kwe-UV ngamamitha; ukuhlelwa kwebhokisi nokwe-triplanar kubhalwa njenge-UV. Ngenisa i-MaterialX… (noma Kusukela kufolda…) ifunda amafayela .mtlx anama-shader e-OpenPBR, Standard Surface, UsdPreviewSurface noma glTF PBR. Nika izithombe futhi, noma i-zip yakho yonke into: isithombe sitholakala ngendlela yaso, ngegama layo, noma ngegama layo nohlobo olunye lwesithombe (i-.exr amafayela asho ingafika njenge-.jpg eduze kwayo). Ama-texture, amamephu ajwayelekile, izibalo, izixube nokuqhathaniswa kufika njengamanodi; okunye konke kugcina inani laso, nomugqa wesimo ubhala okushiyiwe. Amadekali Idekali isithombe esibekwe phezu kobuso — ilogo, uphawu, ilebhuli, isitheni — nempahla yaso. Setha Ububanzi bedekali elisha, bese Beka idekali… (noma Idekali kwithuluzi), khetha isithombe se-PNG, JPEG noma WebP bese uchofoza ubuso. Isithombe siprojektwa phezu kobuso lapho, sigcina ukulingana kwaso; izingxenye ezibonakala ngaphuma kwe-PNG ziyahlala zibonakala ngaphuma. Ikhona eqenjini noma kwisakhi ochofoze kuso futhi ihamba nalo. Imboza ubuso ngaphakathi kwebhokisi layo obubheke ngendlela efanayo, bese imi emaphethelweni alo lapho ikhona. Idekali ngayinye inempahla yayo, ibizwa ngokuthi Decal: \u003Cisithombe\u003E, ohlwini lwefayela: yihlele njengoba unjalo nanoma iyiphi enye (roughness, bump, ukukhanya). I-Impahla eduze kwedekali iyayivula. Eduze kwedekali ngayinye: ububanzi bayo (ubude buyalandela isithombe), Jikisa (ukujika ngekota) no-Susa. Amadekali agcinwa nempahla yefayela, ngaphandle kwe-Undo. Abonakala emcabangweni oshadiswe, emirenjini esheshayo nasezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu. Penda ku-texture Penda ukwakheka (noma Penda ngaphansi kwe-Penda ku-texture) yenza inkomba ibe yibhulashi elizungezile. Hudula ubuso oluthwele enye yezimpahla zalo fayela: ibhulashi lipenda isithombe esingemuva kombala wayo oyisisekelo. Kukhona i-mesh ipenda ngokulandela ama-UV ayo (yenze ingabe nayo ku-workspace ye-UV kuqala); kwezinye izinhlangothi ipenda ngokuhlangana ubuso, ngakho ukupenda kuphindeka nethayili lempahla. Impahla okuyimbala oqondile oyisisekelo wayo ithola isithombe esisha se-512 × 512 salowo mbala ukuqala lapho uyipenda. Impahla enombala oyisisekelo ovela kwamanye amanodi idinga inodi yesithombe exhunyiwe ku-Base color. Setha umbala webhulashi, usayizi (ngamapikseli esithombe), amandla nobulukhuni ephaneli. Hlehlisa umkwapho noma Ctrl+Z (ngenkathi upenda) ibuyisa umkwapho, kuze kube ngu-20 okokugcina. Isithombe esipentiwe sigcinwa efayelweni. Izimpahla zomtapo azipentwa: yenza ikhophi ehlelekayo kuqala. Bhaka ama-texture Bhaka ama-texture ibhala okwenziwa yisimo nesimo sesiteji ebuso ibe yizithombe ngama-UV ka-mesh. Khetha i-mesh enama-UV (yenze ingabe nayo ku-workspace ye-UV), thikisha amamephu bese ucindezela Bhaka: Ukuvinjelwa okuzungezile — ukuthi iphoyinti ngalinye livulekile kangakanani: amakhoni, izimbobo nezindawo ngaphansi kwezinye izinto ziba mnyama. Konke okubonakala emodelini kuyashadisa, kuze kube sekuguqukeni kokuvinjelwa. Ukugoba — kukhanya emaphethelweni angaphandle, kumnyama emakhoneni angaphakathi, kube mpunga-mnyama ezindaweni ezilinganayo nezigobile kancane, ngaphezu kobubanzi bomphetho owusethile. Okujwayelekile kusuka kwento enemininingwane eminingi — khetha nekhophi enemininingwane eminingi: inemininingwane yobuso bayo ibhalwa njengemephu ejwayelekile yento elula (into enamatrayangela amancane ibhakwa phezu kwayo). Ibanga lokusesha ngumgama phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezingaba khona. Ukukhanya — ilanga lendawo yemodeli nosuku (Style) namathunzi alo, kanye nesibhakabhaka, njengemephu yokukhanya. Izithombe ziyahlanganyela efayelweni futhi zivela kumanodi ezithombe. Uma impahla oyihlelayo inenodi ethi Dirt and edge wear, ifunda ukuvinjelwa okusha nokugoba ngokushesha. Amarray amaningi nge-texel ayenza ukuvinjelwa nokukhanya kube bushelelezi, kuthathe isikhathi eside. Ukubhaka kusebenza ezinqubeni zomkhuhlane wekhompyutha ngasemuva; Yima ukubhaka iyayimisa. Yakha igrafu Engeza inodi… (noma Shift+A kumhleli wenodi) yengeza inodi phakathi komhleli. Hudula kusuka kuchashaza lokukhiphayo (ngakwesokudla kwenodi) kuya kuchashaza lokungenayo (ngakwesobunxele kwenodi) ukuze uxhumanise. Ukuxhumana okwesibili kokungenayo kuyayishintsha eyokuqala; hudula okungenayo okuxhunyiwe ukuze ukukhulule. Okungenayo okungaxhunyiwe kukhombisa inani laso: bhala inombolo noma khetha umbala. Izilungiselelo zisezansi kwenodi ngayinye. Hudula inodi ngesihloko sayo ukuze uyinyakazise, hudula indawo engenalutho ukuze ushelelise, bese usebenzisa ivili ukuze usondeze. Delete isusa amanodi akhethiwe noma ixhumanisi, Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa, Ctrl+D iyaphinda, F ibonisa wonke amanodi. Yonke into eshintshayo iyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa kumhleli wenodi. Ukuhlehlisa okuyimodeli akushintshi izimpahla. Amanodi Okwenziwayo Ukuhlelwa kwe-texture Lapho iphoyinti lisendaweni yethayili: liphindaphinde, liguqule endaweni, liphendule ngekota. Value, Color Inombolo, umbala. Picture Isithombe sefayela (esafika kanye nemodeli eyenganiswe, noma esengeziwe nge-Engeza isithombe…). Khetha Colors ngesithombe sokuthwebula nge-Data ngemephu yokuqina noma ejwayelekile. Library texture I-texture yempahla yomtapo, ukuqina nobude bayo. Checker, Noise Izikwele; umsindo oshelelezayo ofrakhali nemininingwane, ukuqina nembewu. Voronoi cells, Waves, Gradient Amaseli (umgama ngokuya kwephoyinti eliseduze, imiphetho phakathi kwamaseli, umbala ngeseli ngayinye); amabhande aphuma phansi, phezulu noma adayisa, njengesine, isaw noma itriyangela, agobile ngomsindo; ukuguquka kwemigqa, kwe-quadratic, okuyisangqa nokwebhola. Bricks, Tiles Imigqa yezitini enokufuduka okuqhubekayo, noma igridi yamathayili: imibala, umbhobo noma ugcwele, igebe nokuqeqeshwa ngamamitha, ubude bokuvuvuka, inombolo engakhethiwe ngayinye. Wood, Marble Imisele ecaleni kwegatsha ngezinwele ezincane; imitsha egoqwe ngumsindo. Dirt and edge wear Igqoka imiphetho evuthayo futhi ingcolise izikhala ngokugoba nezithombe zokuvinjelwa zemesh (Bhaka ama-texture iyazidala; noma setha izilungiselelo zazo ezimbili zezithombe, ku-UV layout yemesh: beka impahla ngokuhlelwa kwe-UV). Ngaphandle kwazo akushintshi lutho. Mix colors, Color ramp, Hue/saturation/value, Brightness and contrast, Invert, Gamma, Separate and Combine RGB Umsebenzi wombala. Math, Map range Izibalo ezinombolweni (engeza, phindaphinda, amandla, smooth step nokunye). Bump, Normal map Normal ngokusuka kukuphakama (Bump) noma ezithombeni zemephu ejwayelekile (Normal map: khetha icala lohlobo oluhlaza). Okuphumayo kwempahla Izilungiselelo zayo zichaza ukuthi i-texture ihlala kanjani ebusweni: Ububanzi bethayili ne-Ukuphakama kwethayili: amamitha angaki ethayili eyodwa ye-texture imboza. Konke igrafu eyenzayo iphindaphinda ethayilini ngaphandle komphetho. Kubekwe yi: Ama-UV alandela ubuso (ukuhudula kwezinhlangothi: ngabunye ubuso; ama-mesh: ama-UV awo, i-UV unit eyodwa = ithayili eyodwa), Ibhokisi liprojekthela kusuka ku-eksisi eseduze kakhulu kwezintathu, Triplanar ixuba ukuprojekthela kwezintathu ezindaweni ezithambekile (Ukuxuba ukubukhali: okuphezulu kuyixube elinzima). Amandla ejwayelekile ahlahla inani lokungenayo elijwayelekile. Isikali sokuqhathaniswa sisetha ukuthi ukungenayo kokuqhathaniswa kunyakazisa kangakanani amaphoyinti e-mesh. Izingenayo eziningi ibonisa okunye kwezingenayo ze-OpenPBR: coat, fuzz, subsurface, thin film, transmission nemibala yazo. Ezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu I-path tracer ifunda umbala oyisisekelo, ukuqina, ubungcwebe, ukungaboni, normal nokukhipha kusuka egrafini njengoba zishintsha ebusweni. Noma yikuphi okunye okungenayo okuxhunyiwe (isibonelo i-coat eshintshayo) isetshenziswa ngesilinganiso sayo; umugqa wephaneli ukhombisa lokho. Ukusika kusuka ku-opacity texture kubonisa isimo sakho, nethunzi layo liba nokungaboni okulinganayo. I-texture ekhanyayo ikhanyisa okubhekene nayo, ngaphandle kokuthathwa njengelambu. Ukuqhathaniswa kuhambisa amaphoyinti e-mesh kuphela, ngakho engeza i-Subdivision modifier ukuze uthole imininingwane (Ama-modifier). Ubuso obusunduzwa/hudulwa bugcina ukwakheka kwabo bese buthola ukuvuvuka kusuka ku-normal. Kukhompyutha enayo i-WebGPU igrafu yenziwa ekhadini lezithombe; kungekho, enziwa kuprosesa. Umphumela ufana.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sculpt","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Bumba imeshi","summary":"Bumba imeshi njengodaka ngamabhulashi — dweba, ubumba, gudisa, bamba, phefumula, ugoqo, cinezela, lingisa — vikela izingxenye ngemaski, buka ngu-X, bese wengeza imininingwane lapho ubumba khona.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["bumba","ukubumba","ibhulashi","amabhulashi","ubumba","dweba","gudisa","bamba","phefumula","ugoqo","cinezela","lingisa","imaski","ukubuka","imininingwane","ithopholoji eguquguqukayo","ipeni","ingcindezi","ithebulethi","ipeni lokubhala"],"headings":[{"id":"qala","text":"Qala","level":2},{"id":"amabhulashi","text":"Amabhulashi","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-namandla","text":"Usayizi namandla","level":2},{"id":"buka-ngu-x-imaski-nemininingwane","text":"Buka ngu-X, imaski nemininingwane","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza ye-Sculpt ibumba imeshi ngamabhulashi, njengodaka: hudula ngaphezu komphezulu bese uphakama, uyehla, ugudiswe noma ulandele isikhombi ngaphansi kwebhulashi elijikelezayo, elinamandla kakhulu emaphakathini nelicimeka ngaphandle emaphethelweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala\"\u003EQala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha imeshi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/span\u003E kuhlu lwe-Workspace. Iqembu noma ikhomponenti kuqala iba yimeshi, njengakwindawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Amabhulashi asebenza kumaphoyinti emeshi, ngakho imeshi enamaphoyinti amaningi ithatha izimo ezinhle kakhulu: hlukanisa kuqala (ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubdivide\u003C/span\u003E wendawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh, noma i-Subdivision surface modifier oyi-Apply), noma vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDetail\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amabhulashi\"\u003EAmabhulashi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIbhulashi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho okwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphakamisa umphezulu ngaphansi kwebhulashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClay\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYakha izendlalelo ezilinganayo, igcwalise izidikiza kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlinganisa amagobongo; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukugudisa nanoma yibhulashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdonsa umphezulu ngokulandela isikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInflate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhukhumeza umphezulu ngokuqondile kwawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsika umsele obukhali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdonsela umphezulu ngasembindini webhulashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlatten\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIcindezela umphezulu ngasendizeni yawo yesilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMask\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpenda imaski evikela umphezulu kwamanye amabhulashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi ushaya ngebhulashi ukusebenza ngendlela enye (yehlisa esikhundleni sokuphakamisa, ugoqo esikhundleni somsele, susa imaski), noma vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake away\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-namandla\"\u003EUsayizi namandla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi webhulashi ungamapikseli esikrinini, ngakho lizwakala lifana noma ukuthi usuhamba kangakanani: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E liyancipha futhi likhule, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift [\"\u003E⇧[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ]\"\u003E⇧]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yashintsha amandla alo. Ipaneli ibonisa okubili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usebenzisa ipeni kwithebulethi, ukucindezela kanzima kwenza ibhulashi likhule futhi libe namandla; ipaneli iyavala kokubili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buka-ngu-x-imaski-nemininingwane\"\u003EBuka ngu-X, imaski nemininingwane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMirror X\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bumba izinhlangothi zombili ngokubomvu kanye, kwizinkaba nezibalo ezinomzimba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImaski ibonakala imnyama ngesikhathi ubumba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear mask\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option M\"\u003E⌥M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyisusa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvert mask\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) imaska okwakungamaskiwe futhi ikhulule okwakumaskiwe. Imaski igcinwa neMeshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDetail\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ama-triangle lapho ubumba: imiphetho ende kunosayizi obekwe kuphaneli (amapikseli esikrinini) ihlukaniswa ngaphansi kwebhulashi. Idinga imeshi yama-triangle, futhi icela ukuthi yenze eyodwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshayo ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImininingwane yengeza ama-triangle kuphela; ayisusi lawo asebenze abe mancane kakhulu. I-Remesh (indawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh) ilinganisa imeshi yonke futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EHlela imeshi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EImeshi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EIzinguquli ezisemeshini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indawo yokusebenza ye-Sculpt ibumba imeshi ngamabhulashi, njengodaka: hudula ngaphezu komphezulu bese uphakama, uyehla, ugudiswe noma ulandele isikhombi ngaphansi kwebhulashi elijikelezayo, elinamandla kakhulu emaphakathini nelicimeka ngaphandle emaphethelweni. Qala Khetha imeshi bese ukhetha Sculpt kuhlu lwe-Workspace. Iqembu noma ikhomponenti kuqala iba yimeshi, njengakwindawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh. Amabhulashi asebenza kumaphoyinti emeshi, ngakho imeshi enamaphoyinti amaningi ithatha izimo ezinhle kakhulu: hlukanisa kuqala (ngo-Subdivide wendawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh, noma i-Subdivision surface modifier oyi-Apply), noma vula Detail. Amabhulashi Ibhulashi Ukhiye Lokho okwenzayo Draw D Iphakamisa umphezulu ngaphansi kwebhulashi Clay C Yakha izendlalelo ezilinganayo, igcwalise izidikiza kuqala Smooth S Ilinganisa amagobongo; bamba Shift ukugudisa nanoma yibhulashi Grab G Idonsa umphezulu ngokulandela isikhombi Inflate I Ikhukhumeza umphezulu ngokuqondile kwawo Crease Shift+C Isika umsele obukhali Pinch P Idonsela umphezulu ngasembindini webhulashi Flatten T Icindezela umphezulu ngasendizeni yawo yesilinganiso Mask M Ipenda imaski evikela umphezulu kwamanye amabhulashi Bamba Ctrl ngenkathi ushaya ngebhulashi ukusebenza ngendlela enye (yehlisa esikhundleni sokuphakamisa, ugoqo esikhundleni somsele, susa imaski), noma vula Take away. Usayizi namandla Usayizi webhulashi ungamapikseli esikrinini, ngakho lizwakala lifana noma ukuthi usuhamba kangakanani: [ no-] liyancipha futhi likhule, Shift+[ no-Shift+] yashintsha amandla alo. Ipaneli ibonisa okubili. Uma usebenzisa ipeni kwithebulethi, ukucindezela kanzima kwenza ibhulashi likhule futhi libe namandla; ipaneli iyavala kokubili. Buka ngu-X, imaski nemininingwane Mirror X (X) bumba izinhlangothi zombili ngokubomvu kanye, kwizinkaba nezibalo ezinomzimba. Imaski ibonakala imnyama ngesikhathi ubumba. Clear mask (Alt+M) iyisusa, Invert mask (Ctrl+I) imaska okwakungamaskiwe futhi ikhulule okwakumaskiwe. Imaski igcinwa neMeshi. Detail yengeza ama-triangle lapho ubumba: imiphetho ende kunosayizi obekwe kuphaneli (amapikseli esikrinini) ihlukaniswa ngaphansi kwebhulashi. Idinga imeshi yama-triangle, futhi icela ukuthi yenze eyodwa kuqala. Ushayo ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Imininingwane yengeza ama-triangle kuphela; ayisusi lawo asebenze abe mancane kakhulu. I-Remesh (indawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh) ilinganisa imeshi yonke futhi. Bona futhi Hlela imeshi, Imeshi kanye Izinguquli ezisemeshini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"groups-components","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amaqembu nezakhi","summary":"Gcina izinto zingahlanganisi, hlela ikhophi eyodwa ukuze ushintshe zonke, usebenzise iphaneli ye-Outliner nezakhi.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["iqembu","isakhi","yenza iqembu","yenza isakhi","chitha","yenza ibe yodwa","uhlu lwezinto","izimo","amakhophi","ibhulokhi","ohlobene","hlela iqembu","beka"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-iqembu-noma-isakhi","text":"Yenza iqembu noma isakhi","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ngaphakathi-kweqembu-noma-isakhi","text":"Hlela ngaphakathi kweqembu noma isakhi","level":2},{"id":"beka-amakhophi-amaningi-esakhi","text":"Beka amakhophi amaningi esakhi","level":2},{"id":"hlela-kabusha-ku-outliner","text":"Hlela kabusha ku-Outliner","level":2},{"id":"yenza-ikhophi-eyodwa-ihluke","text":"Yenza ikhophi eyodwa ihluke","level":2},{"id":"guqula-iqembu-libe-yisakhi","text":"Guqula iqembu libe yisakhi","level":2},{"id":"chitha","text":"Chitha","level":2},{"id":"eqinile-nevolumu","text":"Eqinile nevolumu","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ikhophi-yokugcina-ihamba","text":"Lapho ikhophi yokugcina ihamba","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIjometri engahlelekile ku-ModelCraft iyahlanganisa: imigqa ethintanayo iyahlukanisana, nezinhlangothi ezabelana ngomphetho ziyahamba ndawonye. Yilokho okenza ukudweba ezinhlangothini kusebenze, kodwa futhi kusho ukuthi ibhokisi odwetshwe ngaphambi kwebhokisi elinye liyahlanganisa nalo. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmaqembu\u003C/strong\u003E nezakhi \u003Cstrong\u003Ezigcina izinto zihlukene.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIqembu\u003C/strong\u003E lifaka ijometri ethile ukuze lisebenze njengento eyodwa. Akukho okuphandle kwalo okungalihlanganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhi\u003C/strong\u003E yiqembu elingabekwa izikhathi eziningi. Yonke ikhophi yabelana ngokuqukethwe okufanayo: hlela eyodwa bonke bayashintsha. Sebenzisa izakhi noma yini ephindaphindwayo: amawindi, izinsika, amadeski, izihlahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-iqembu-noma-isakhi\"\u003EYenza iqembu noma isakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ijometri. Ukuchofoza kathathu ohlangothini kukhetha yonke into exhunyiwe; ukudonsa iwindi kukhetha konke okusebhokisini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole iqembu, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole isakhi. Ungachofoza futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroup\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponent\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrganize\u003C/span\u003E lebha yamathuluzi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake group (Shift+G)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component (G)\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Yenziwe iqembu njenge-Group#1.&quot; noma &quot;Yenziwe isakhi Component#1.&quot;, into entsha iyakhethwa, futhi ivela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uyiqambe, thayipha igama enkundleni ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze endaweni ethile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhetha uhlangothi kuphinde kuthathe imiphetho yalo. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, ibha yesimo ithi: &quot;Khetha ijometri kuqala (donsa iwindi, noma chofoza kathathu ukukhetha konke okuxhunyiwe).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaqembu futhi amaqembu: khetha amaqembu amaningi bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ukuhlanganiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu zezinkinobho zihambisana nezizenzakalelayo ze-SketchUp: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza isakhi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza iqembu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-ngaphakathi-kweqembu-noma-isakhi\"\u003EHlela ngaphakathi kweqembu noma isakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili kuso (esibukweni noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E), noma khetha bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnye yemodeli iyafiphala, ama-axes ayahamba aye kuma-axes aleqembu, futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E ifunda &quot;Editing: Model › Group#1&quot;. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kuhlelwa i-Group#1. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ukuchofoza kabili ngaphandle kuyakuvala.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba, cindezela-hudula, hambisa nesule njengendlela ejwayelekile. Konke okwenzayo kuhlala ngaphakathi kweqembu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala: cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (kabili uma kukhethiwe into), chofoza kabili esikhaleni esingenalutho, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose group\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi isakhi sivuliwe, yonke ikhophi yaso iyashintsha ngoba usebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amakhophi-amaningi-esakhi\"\u003EBeka amakhophi amaningi esakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKopisha ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003EHambisa nekopisha\u003C/a\u003E). Yonke ikhophi iyindawo enye yesakhi esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwayo ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza lapho ifuna khona. Umsuka wayo, ikhona eliphansi kakhulu lebhokisi elizungeze okukhethiwe lapho uyenza, lifika lapho uchofoza khona. Ithuluzi libuya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ukuthi amakhophi angaki abekiwe (&quot;4×&quot;), futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa inani ngemva kwegama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-kabusha-ku-outliner\"\u003EHlela kabusha ku-Outliner\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula umugqa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ushintshe lapho ulapho. Akukho okunyakazayo esibukweni: iqembu ligcina indawo yalo emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphakathi kweqembu:\u003C/strong\u003E liwise phakathi komugqa weqembu (umugqa uzoba nomugqa oqhekeziwe). Lizongena ngaphakathi, ekugcineni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgolunye ulandelo:\u003C/strong\u003E liwise phezulu noma ngaphansi komphetho womugqa (kuzobonakala umugqa). Liyofika ngaphambi noma ngemva kwalowo mugqa, ngaphakathi kweqembu lalowo mugqa, ngakho lokhu nakho kulifaka eqenjini endaweni ekhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhumela phezulu ngqo:\u003C/strong\u003E liwise ekhanda le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E. Liyofika ekugcineni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuwisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyililanda. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi sokudonsa ayiwisi lutho. Iqembu alikwazi ukungena kulo noma kweqembu liwubambile. Ukudonsa kuyavalwa lapho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind by name\u003C/span\u003E inombhalo kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMbambe umunwe emugqeni isikhashana, bese uyawudonsa. Ukushayisa okusheshayo kuskrola uhlu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ikhophi-eyodwa-ihluke\"\u003EYenza ikhophi eyodwa ihluke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ikhophi bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E (ivela uma isakhi sibekwe izikhathi ezingaphezu kweziyodwa). Leyo khophi ithola incazelo yayo, eqanjwe njengoyokuqala kanye nenombolo entsha. Yihlele ingathinti abanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guqula-iqembu-libe-yisakhi\"\u003EGuqula iqembu libe yisakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha iqembu bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E. Lithola igama elisha, njengo-Component#2, nakuba wayeliqambe igama; thayipha futhi igama enkundleni ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chitha\"\u003EChitha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha iqembu noma isakhi bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E (kwibha yamathuluzi noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E). Okuqukethwe kwalo kuba ijometri evulekile endaweni elalikuyo, futhi kunamathele kukho okuthintayo. Amaqembu angaphakathi kwalo ahlala eyizinqembu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eqinile-nevolumu\"\u003EEqinile nevolumu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukhetha iqembu noma isakhi, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsolidi: Yebo\u003C/strong\u003E uma izinhlangothi zalo zivaleka ngaphandle kwezikhala (yonke imiphetho yabelwana ngu-zinhlangothi ezimbili ngqo) futhi kungekho maqembu ahlanganisiwe ngaphakathi kwalo. Bese ibonisa futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eivolumu\u003C/strong\u003E. Ibhokisi, udonga olunewindi elisikwe kulo, nesilinda esidonsiwe kuyizisekelo; ibhokisi elisuswe phezulu kwalo alisona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ikhophi-yokugcina-ihamba\"\u003ELapho ikhophi yokugcina ihamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkususa ikhophi yokugcina yesakhi kususa nesakhi ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyibuyisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhophi eqembu enziwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E ayabelana ngokuqukethwe kule nguqulo, njengamakhophi ezakhi: ukuhlela eyodwa kushintsha abanye. Ukuze wenze eyodwa izimele, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhi azisiki izimbobo odongeni, futhi azinamathisi ezinhlangothini. Akukho ilabhulali yezakhi ezilungiselwe. Wena uzenza zakho, noma uzingenise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafayela angeniswayo afika njengeqembu. Amafayela e-Collada agcina amaqembu nezakhi zawo ngaphakathi kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ijometri engahlelekile ku-ModelCraft iyahlanganisa: imigqa ethintanayo iyahlukanisana, nezinhlangothi ezabelana ngomphetho ziyahamba ndawonye. Yilokho okenza ukudweba ezinhlangothini kusebenze, kodwa futhi kusho ukuthi ibhokisi odwetshwe ngaphambi kwebhokisi elinye liyahlanganisa nalo. Amaqembu nezakhi zigcina izinto zihlukene. Iqembu lifaka ijometri ethile ukuze lisebenze njengento eyodwa. Akukho okuphandle kwalo okungalihlanganisa. Isakhi yiqembu elingabekwa izikhathi eziningi. Yonke ikhophi yabelana ngokuqukethwe okufanayo: hlela eyodwa bonke bayashintsha. Sebenzisa izakhi noma yini ephindaphindwayo: amawindi, izinsika, amadeski, izihlahla. Yenza iqembu noma isakhi Khetha ijometri. Ukuchofoza kathathu ohlangothini kukhetha yonke into exhunyiwe; ukudonsa iwindi kukhetha konke okusebhokisini. Cindezela Shift+G ukuze uthole iqembu, noma G ukuze uthole isakhi. Ungachofoza futhi Group noma Component eqenjini Organize lebha yamathuluzi, noma Make group (Shift+G) noma Make component (G) ku-Entity info. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Yenziwe iqembu njenge-Group#1.\" noma \"Yenziwe isakhi Component#1.\", into entsha iyakhethwa, futhi ivela ku-Outliner. Ukuze uyiqambe, thayipha igama enkundleni ethi Name ku-Entity info bese ucindezela Enter noma uchofoze endaweni ethile. Ukukhetha uhlangothi kuphinde kuthathe imiphetho yalo. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, ibha yesimo ithi: \"Khetha ijometri kuqala (donsa iwindi, noma chofoza kathathu ukukhetha konke okuxhunyiwe).\" Ungaqembu futhi amaqembu: khetha amaqembu amaningi bese ucindezela Shift+G. I-Outliner ibonisa ukuhlanganiswa. Izinhlamvu zezinkinobho zihambisana nezizenzakalelayo ze-SketchUp: G yenza isakhi, Shift+G yenza iqembu. Hlela ngaphakathi kweqembu noma isakhi Chofoza kabili kuso (esibukweni noma ku-Outliner), noma khetha bese uchofoza Edit ku-Entity info. Enye yemodeli iyafiphala, ama-axes ayahamba aye kuma-axes aleqembu, futhi i-Outliner ifunda \"Editing: Model › Group#1\". Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kuhlelwa i-Group#1. Esc noma ukuchofoza kabili ngaphandle kuyakuvala.\" Dweba, cindezela-hudula, hambisa nesule njengendlela ejwayelekile. Konke okwenzayo kuhlala ngaphakathi kweqembu. Vala: cindezela Esc (kabili uma kukhethiwe into), chofoza kabili esikhaleni esingenalutho, noma chofoza Close group ku-Outliner. Ngenkathi isakhi sivuliwe, yonke ikhophi yaso iyashintsha ngoba usebenza. Beka amakhophi amaningi esakhi Kopisha ngo-Move no-Ctrl (bona Hambisa nekopisha). Yonke ikhophi iyindawo enye yesakhi esifanayo. Noma chofoza Place eduze kwayo ephaneli ye-Components, bese uchofoza lapho ifuna khona. Umsuka wayo, ikhona eliphansi kakhulu lebhokisi elizungeze okukhethiwe lapho uyenza, lifika lapho uchofoza khona. Ithuluzi libuya ku-Select. I-Components ibonisa ukuthi amakhophi angaki abekiwe (\"4×\"), futhi i-Outliner ibonisa inani ngemva kwegama. Hlela kabusha ku-Outliner Hudula umugqa ku-Outliner ukuze ushintshe lapho ulapho. Akukho okunyakazayo esibukweni: iqembu ligcina indawo yalo emodelini. Ngaphakathi kweqembu: liwise phakathi komugqa weqembu (umugqa uzoba nomugqa oqhekeziwe). Lizongena ngaphakathi, ekugcineni. Ngolunye ulandelo: liwise phezulu noma ngaphansi komphetho womugqa (kuzobonakala umugqa). Liyofika ngaphambi noma ngemva kwalowo mugqa, ngaphakathi kweqembu lalowo mugqa, ngakho lokhu nakho kulifaka eqenjini endaweni ekhethiwe. Phumela phezulu ngqo: liwise ekhanda le-Outliner. Liyofika ekugcineni. Ukuwisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyililanda. Esc ngesikhathi sokudonsa ayiwisi lutho. Iqembu alikwazi ukungena kulo noma kweqembu liwubambile. Ukudonsa kuyavalwa lapho Find by name inombhalo kuyo. Mbambe umunwe emugqeni isikhashana, bese uyawudonsa. Ukushayisa okusheshayo kuskrola uhlu. Yenza ikhophi eyodwa ihluke Khetha ikhophi bese uchofoza Make unique ku-Entity info (ivela uma isakhi sibekwe izikhathi ezingaphezu kweziyodwa). Leyo khophi ithola incazelo yayo, eqanjwe njengoyokuqala kanye nenombolo entsha. Yihlele ingathinti abanye. Guqula iqembu libe yisakhi Khetha iqembu bese uchofoza Make component ku-Entity info. Lithola igama elisha, njengo-Component#2, nakuba wayeliqambe igama; thayipha futhi igama enkundleni ethi Name. Chitha Khetha iqembu noma isakhi bese uchofoza Explode (kwibha yamathuluzi noma ku-Entity info). Okuqukethwe kwalo kuba ijometri evulekile endaweni elalikuyo, futhi kunamathele kukho okuthintayo. Amaqembu angaphakathi kwalo ahlala eyizinqembu. Eqinile nevolumu Uma ukhetha iqembu noma isakhi, i-Entity info ibonisa Isolidi: Yebo uma izinhlangothi zalo zivaleka ngaphandle kwezikhala (yonke imiphetho yabelwana ngu-zinhlangothi ezimbili ngqo) futhi kungekho maqembu ahlanganisiwe ngaphakathi kwalo. Bese ibonisa futhi ivolumu. Ibhokisi, udonga olunewindi elisikwe kulo, nesilinda esidonsiwe kuyizisekelo; ibhokisi elisuswe phezulu kwalo alisona. Lapho ikhophi yokugcina ihamba Ukususa ikhophi yokugcina yesakhi kususa nesakhi ephaneli ye-Components. Ctrl+Z iyibuyisela. Okufanele ukwazi Amakhophi eqembu enziwe nge-Move ayabelana ngokuqukethwe kule nguqulo, njengamakhophi ezakhi: ukuhlela eyodwa kushintsha abanye. Ukuze wenze eyodwa izimele, chofoza Make component, bese Make unique. Bona Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Izakhi azisiki izimbobo odongeni, futhi azinamathisi ezinhlangothini. Akukho ilabhulali yezakhi ezilungiselwe. Wena uzenza zakho, noma uzingenise. Amafayela angeniswayo afika njengeqembu. Amafayela e-Collada agcina amaqembu nezakhi zawo ngaphakathi kwawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"guides-measure","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Linganisa futhi ubeke izihloko","summary":"Funda ubude nezindawo, linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti ngentambo yokulinganisa, bese ubeka imigqa namaphoyinti esihloko ukuze udwebe ngawo.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["linganisa","intambo yokulinganisa","iprothrakhtha","i-engeli","isihloko se-engeli","isihloko","umugqa wesihloko","umugqa wokwakha","ibanga","isilinganiso","ubude","indawo","ukuthuka","ukuhlelwa","iphoyinti lesihloko"],"headings":[{"id":"funda-usayizi-ngaphandle-kokulinganisa","text":"Funda usayizi ngaphandle kokulinganisa","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-phakathi-kwamaphoyinti-amabili","text":"Linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili","level":2},{"id":"beka-umugqa-wesihloko","text":"Beka umugqa wesihloko","level":2},{"id":"isihloko-e-engeli-iprothrakhtha","text":"Isihloko e-engeli: iProthrakhtha","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ngokumelene-nezihloko","text":"Dweba ngokumelene nezihloko","level":2},{"id":"susa-izihloko","text":"Susa izihloko","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-usayizi-ngaphandle-kokulinganisa\"\u003EFunda usayizi ngaphandle kokulinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha into bese ubheka i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmphetho ukhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eubude\u003C/strong\u003E bawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlangothi lukhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eindawo\u003C/strong\u003E yalo nokuthi lunezimbobo ezingaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlangothi eziningi zikhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eindawo yazo yonke\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIqembu noma isakhi likhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eusayizi\u003C/strong\u003E walo (ububanzi × ukujula × ukuphakama kwebhokisi elilizungezile) futhi, uma kungumthamo ovaliwe oqinile, \u003Cstrong\u003Eivolumu\u003C/strong\u003E yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungakhethiwe lutho, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa usayizi wemodeli yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude nezindawo kusebenzisa iyunithi esikhethini esingezansi kwesokudla. Imodeli yemillimitha ikhombisa izindawo ezingu-0.01 m² nangaphezulu ngamamitha ayisikwele (igumbi elingu-4 × 3 m lifunda &quot;12 m²&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho udweba, ibhokisi lenani likhombisa ubude, usayizi, iradiyasi noma ibanga ngokuphila, ngakho kungadingeki ukulinganisa ngemuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe usayizi emva kokudweba, khetha umphetho noma iqembu bese uthayipha kabusha ubude noma usayizi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E. Noma beka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Eisilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E bese uthayipha ubude obusha kuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-phakathi-kwamaphoyinti-amabili\"\u003ELinganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E lokulinganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti: ikhona, iphoyinti eliphakathi, iphoyinti ohlangothini, noma umhlaba. (Ukuchofoza umphetho kwenza okunye; bona ngezansi.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba uye kweziwumbili iphoyinti. Ithiphu nebhokisi lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E) kukhombisa ibanga. Liyabamba kumaphoyinti nakuzikhombisi ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezizolile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kulinganisiwe 4&#039; 6&quot;.&quot; futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti lesihloko\u003C/strong\u003E lishiywa ephoyinteni lesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushiye iphoyinti lesihloko ebangeni elinembile, thayipha lona emva kokuchofoza kokuqala bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ihamba ngendlela oyibheka ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-umugqa-wesihloko\"\u003EBeka umugqa wesihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesihloko ngumugqa oqhekeziwe ongapheli, ohambisana nomphetho, ebangeni okhetha lona. Sebenzisa izihloko ukuhlela ukubuyela emuva, ukuphakama kwesitezi, noma lapho iwindi liqala khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003Eumphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (hhayi ukugcina kwawo). Ithiphu ithi &quot;On edge&quot; (Emphethweni).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESuka emphethweni, ohlangothini lapho isihloko kufanele siya khona. Umugqa oqhekeziwe uyalandela, uhambisana nomphetho, futhi ibhokisi lenani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E) likhombisa ibanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza, noma thayipha ukuphambanisa bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1.5m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Umugqa wesihloko ngu-1.5 m kusuka emphethweni.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqala emugqeni wesihloko okhona kwenza esinye isihloko sihambisane nawo, ukuze ukwazi ukwenza igridi ngokusuka kwesihloko esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uthayipha ukuphambanisa ngaphandle kokuqala ukusuka emphethweni, i-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukutshela ukuthi uhlangothi oluthile: &quot;Suka emphethweni kuqala ukuze ukhombise uhlangothi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isihloko-e-engeli-iprothrakhtha\"\u003EIsihloko e-engeli: iProthrakhtha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProtractor\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isikhungo: iphoyinti umugqa wesihloko odlula kulo. Ohlangothini, iprothrakhtha ilala phezu kwalo uhlangothi; kwezinye izindawo ilala phansi. Ngemva kwalokhu kuchofoza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilimisa ibheke ebomvu, eluhlaza noma ezolile (cindezela futhi ukuze uyiguqule).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti elibeka i-0°, isibonelo ngomphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba uye ku-engeli ofisa yona bese uchofoza: ibamba ezinyathelweni ze-15°. Noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri, njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; isihloko siya ohlangothini lapho ukhomba khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesihloko udlula esikhungweni ngale ngeli. Dweba phambili kwawo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole ukuthambeka kophahla, i-chamfer noma udonga oluthambekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ngokumelene-nezihloko\"\u003EDweba ngokumelene nezihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba abamba imigqa yezihloko (&quot;On guide&quot;) namaphoyinti ezihloko (&quot;Guide point&quot;), nalapho umugqa wesihloko udlula khona eqondweni lomugqa wesikhombisi. Qala unxande lapho kuhlangana izihloko ezimbili ukuze ulibeke ngokunembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-izihloko\"\u003ESusa izihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsihloko esisodwa: chofoza kuso nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza kuso nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZonke izihloko: lapho kungakhethiwe lutho, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete all guides\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzihloko zigcinwa kwifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Azithunyelwa kwezinye izifomethi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Funda usayizi ngaphandle kokulinganisa Khetha into bese ubheka i-Entity info: Umphetho ukhombisa ubude bawo. Uhlangothi lukhombisa indawo yalo nokuthi lunezimbobo ezingaki. Izinhlangothi eziningi zikhombisa indawo yazo yonke. Iqembu noma isakhi likhombisa usayizi walo (ububanzi × ukujula × ukuphakama kwebhokisi elilizungezile) futhi, uma kungumthamo ovaliwe oqinile, ivolumu yalo. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, i-Entity info ikhombisa usayizi wemodeli yonke. Ubude nezindawo kusebenzisa iyunithi esikhethini esingezansi kwesokudla. Imodeli yemillimitha ikhombisa izindawo ezingu-0.01 m² nangaphezulu ngamamitha ayisikwele (igumbi elingu-4 × 3 m lifunda \"12 m²\"). Lapho udweba, ibhokisi lenani likhombisa ubude, usayizi, iradiyasi noma ibanga ngokuphila, ngakho kungadingeki ukulinganisa ngemuva. Ukuze ushintshe usayizi emva kokudweba, khetha umphetho noma iqembu bese uthayipha kabusha ubude noma usayizi ku-Entity info. Noma beka isilinganiso bese uthayipha ubude obusha kuso. Linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili Cindezela T ukuze uthole ithuluzi le-Tape lokulinganisa. Chofoza iphoyinti: ikhona, iphoyinti eliphakathi, iphoyinti ohlangothini, noma umhlaba. (Ukuchofoza umphetho kwenza okunye; bona ngezansi.) Hamba uye kweziwumbili iphoyinti. Ithiphu nebhokisi lenani (Length) kukhombisa ibanga. Liyabamba kumaphoyinti nakuzikhombisi ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezizolile. Chofoza. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kulinganisiwe 4' 6\".\" futhi iphoyinti lesihloko lishiywa ephoyinteni lesibili. Ukuze ushiye iphoyinti lesihloko ebangeni elinembile, thayipha lona emva kokuchofoza kokuqala bese ucindezela Enter: ihamba ngendlela oyibheka ngayo. Beka umugqa wesihloko Umugqa wesihloko ngumugqa oqhekeziwe ongapheli, ohambisana nomphetho, ebangeni okhetha lona. Sebenzisa izihloko ukuhlela ukubuyela emuva, ukuphakama kwesitezi, noma lapho iwindi liqala khona. Cindezela T. Chofoza umphetho (hhayi ukugcina kwawo). Ithiphu ithi \"On edge\" (Emphethweni). Suka emphethweni, ohlangothini lapho isihloko kufanele siya khona. Umugqa oqhekeziwe uyalandela, uhambisana nomphetho, futhi ibhokisi lenani (Offset) likhombisa ibanga. Chofoza, noma thayipha ukuphambanisa bese ucindezela Enter: 1.5m, 5'. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Umugqa wesihloko ngu-1.5 m kusuka emphethweni.\" Ukuqala emugqeni wesihloko okhona kwenza esinye isihloko sihambisane nawo, ukuze ukwazi ukwenza igridi ngokusuka kwesihloko esisodwa. Uma uthayipha ukuphambanisa ngaphandle kokuqala ukusuka emphethweni, i-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukutshela ukuthi uhlangothi oluthile: \"Suka emphethweni kuqala ukuze ukhombise uhlangothi.\" Isihloko e-engeli: iProthrakhtha Chofoza Protractor eqenjini Modify. Chofoza isikhungo: iphoyinti umugqa wesihloko odlula kulo. Ohlangothini, iprothrakhtha ilala phezu kwalo uhlangothi; kwezinye izindawo ilala phansi. Ngemva kwalokhu kuchofoza, →, ← noma ↑ ilimisa ibheke ebomvu, eluhlaza noma ezolile (cindezela futhi ukuze uyiguqule). Chofoza iphoyinti elibeka i-0°, isibonelo ngomphetho. Hamba uye ku-engeli ofisa yona bese uchofoza: ibamba ezinyathelweni ze-15°. Noma thayipha i-engeli ngamadigri, njengo-22.5, bese ucindezela Enter; isihloko siya ohlangothini lapho ukhomba khona. Umugqa wesihloko udlula esikhungweni ngale ngeli. Dweba phambili kwawo nge-Line ukuze uthole ukuthambeka kophahla, i-chamfer noma udonga oluthambekile. Dweba ngokumelene nezihloko Amathuluzi okudweba abamba imigqa yezihloko (\"On guide\") namaphoyinti ezihloko (\"Guide point\"), nalapho umugqa wesihloko udlula khona eqondweni lomugqa wesikhombisi. Qala unxande lapho kuhlangana izihloko ezimbili ukuze ulibeke ngokunembile. Susa izihloko Isihloko esisodwa: chofoza kuso nge-Select bese ucindezela Delete, noma chofoza kuso nge-Eraser. Zonke izihloko: lapho kungakhethiwe lutho, chofoza Delete all guides ku-Entity info. Izihloko zigcinwa kwifayela le-.modelcraft. Azithunyelwa kwezinye izifomethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dimensions","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Silinganisa futhi ushintse usayizi walokho okudwetshiwe","summary":"Beka izilinganiso phakathi kwamakhona, phezu kwama-arc namasekeli, noma phakathi kwemiphetho emibili; thayipha ubude obusha ukuze ushintse usayizi wemodeli. Phinda uthayiphe ubude bomphetho noma ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kweqembu ku-Entity info.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["isilinganiso","izilinganiso","shintsha usayizi","hlela usayizi","ubude","ububanzi","ukujula","ukuphakama","elula","isilinganiso sokushayela","chaza","linganisa","ngemva kwalokho","umsakazo","ububanzi bendilinga","engeli","i-angular","i-arc","indilinga","R","Ø"],"headings":[{"id":"beka-isilinganiso","text":"Beka isilinganiso","level":2},{"id":"umsakazo-ububanzi-nengeli","text":"Umsakazo, ububanzi nengeli","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi-wemodeli-ngesilinganiso","text":"Shintsha usayizi wemodeli ngesilinganiso","level":2},{"id":"okunyakazayo","text":"Okunyakazayo","level":3},{"id":"lapho-ukushintsha-usayizi-kwenqatshwa","text":"Lapho ukushintsha usayizi kwenqatshwa","level":3},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi-nge-entity-info","text":"Shintsha usayizi nge-Entity info","level":2},{"id":"izilinganiso-zilandela-imodeli","text":"Izilinganiso zilandela imodeli","level":2},{"id":"susa-izilinganiso","text":"Susa izilinganiso","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi kuModelCraft awuhlali ungaguquki uma sekudwetshiwe okuthile. Isilinganiso sibonisa ubude emodelini, futhi uthayipha ubude obusha kuso kushintsha imodeli ifane nalo. Ungaphinda uthayiphe ubude bomphetho, noma ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kweqembu, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isilinganiso\"\u003EBeka isilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona okuzolinganiswa kulo. Iyabamba amakhona, amaphakathi nemiphetho, njengoba ukudweba kwenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona lesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma chofoza kanye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (uphawu luthi &quot;On edge&quot;) ukuze ulinganise lowo mphetho wonke ngokuchofoza kanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi lapho umugqa wesilinganiso okufanele uye khona, bese uchofoza. Ungathayipha futhi ukuphakama, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E0.5m\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesilinganiso uhlala ulingene emphethweni olingene, ngaphandle uma ubheka wona ngohlangothi. Emphethweni omile ohlala emaphethelweni emi, uhlala endizeni emile ebheka wena kangcono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Dimension 4 m.&quot; Izilinganiso zibonisa ubude ngeyunithi yemodeli futhi zivuselelwa uma ushintsha iyunithi kukhethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umsakazo-ububanzi-nengeli\"\u003EUmsakazo, ububanzi nengeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elifanayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E lilinganisa izinto eziyindilinga nezikhona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-arc:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza i-arc. Uphawu luthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E. Hambisa isikhombi lapho umbhalo okufanele uye khona bese uchofoza: isilinganiso sifunda \u003Cstrong\u003ER 1.5 m\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndilinga:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza indilinga. Uthola \u003Cstrong\u003Eububanzi bendilinga\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EØ 3 m\u003C/strong\u003E) nomugqa odlula endilingeni ngesikhungo sayo. Ipholigoni zisebenza ngendlela efanayo, namakhona azo endilingeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeli phakathi kwemiphetho emibili:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza umphetho owodwa, bese uchofoza omunye umphetho ohlangana nawo ekhoneni (lapho usewuphezu kwawo, uphawu luthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle between the edges\u003C/span\u003E). Bese uhamba ngaphakathi kwekhona ofuna, bese uchofoza. Ngaphakathi kwekhona uthola engeli phakathi kwemiphetho; uma uhamba uye ohlangothini oluthile uthola engeli eseduze kwayo (isibonelo 150° esikhundleni se-30°). Ukuthi ukhombe kude kangakanani nekhona kusho lapho i-arc iyakhona; noma thayipha lobo bude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uguqule umsakazo ube ububanzi noma ubuyele emuva, khetha isilinganiso bese uchofoza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow as\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintsha usayizi ngazo:\u003C/strong\u003E thayipha umsakazo omusha noma ububanzi ngemva kokubeka, noma khetha kamuva bese uthayipha. I-arc noma indilinga igcina isikhungo sayo ishintshe usayizi; ubuso obuvalwa yiyo (idiski, isiphetho sesilotho) buyashintsha nayo. Izinto ezimbili zilinganisa kuphela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso sengeli\u003C/strong\u003E asikaze siguqule imodeli. Ukuze ushintse engeli, jikisa imiphetho nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndilinga esekupheleni kwesilinda\u003C/strong\u003E (indilinga oyihudulile nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E) ayikwazi ukushintshwa usayizi kusuka ezilinganisweni zayo, ngoba izinhlangothi zayo nazo kumele zishintshe. Shintsha usayizi wesilinda esikhundleni salokho, ngokuzungeza i-axis yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-usayizi-wemodeli-ngesilinganiso\"\u003EShintsha usayizi wemodeli ngesilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokubeka isilinganiso, thayipha ubude obusha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E6m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3500\u003C/code\u003E kumodeli yamamilimitha. Imodeli iyashintsha ibe lobo bukhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKamuva, nganoma yisiphi isikhathi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza umbhalo wesilinganiso noma umugqa wakho. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EDimension\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ikhombisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ubude obusha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ungathayipha ngqo ebhokisini lenani, noma kubhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okunyakazayo\"\u003EOkunyakazayo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphela lesibili oliliphethe liyanyakaza, nakho konke okungaphezu kwalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWomabili amakhona kwipiyesi eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E (ububanzi bebhokisi, ukuphakama kodonga): uhlangothi oluseceleni kwekhona elinyakazayo luyaphuma noma lungene, nobuso obuhlangene nalo buyelula. Ibhokisi lihlala lingumuthi ovaliwe, nanoma yini ehleli ngokuphelele kuleyo hlangothi, njengekhomponenti yefasitela, iyahamba nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhona ezingxenye ezimbili ezihlukene\u003C/strong\u003E (igebe phakathi kwamabhokisi amabili): ipiyesi yekhona elinyakazayo iyahamba yonke, futhi igebe liyashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhona elinyakazayo ngaphakathi kweqembu noma ikhompoment\u003C/strong\u003E kanti elinye ikhona lingekho kuyo: iqembu lonke liyahamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWomabili amakhona ngaphakathi kweqembu elifanayo noma ikhompoment\u003C/strong\u003E: liyelulwa ngaphakathi. Ikhompoment iyashintsha lapho ibekwe khona, njengoba kwenza ukuyihlela njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha ukuthi yiliphi iphela elinyakazayo, khetha isilinganiso bese ukhetha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzeka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESecond end\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphela ochofoze ngalo wesibili liyanyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFirst end\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphela ochofoze ngalo wokuqala liyanyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoth ends (centered)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphela ngalinye linyakaza ingxenye yesigamu sokushintsha, ngakho isikhungu siyahlala sisendaweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lapho-ukushintsha-usayizi-kwenqatshwa\"\u003ELapho ukushintsha usayizi kwenqatshwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayishintshi lutho futhi itshela isizathu ebhalweni lesimo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;ubuso buzogoba buphume endizeni yabo&quot;: isilinganiso sihamba ngokuthambeka kudwetshwe ngaso isakhiwo. Linganisa ngomphetho, noma ngobomvu, oluhlaza noma obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;ubuso buzoncipha bube yize noma buguquke ngaphakathi&quot;: ubude obusha mfushane kakhulu kwesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;iphela elinyakazayo akusikho ekhoneni lemodeli&quot;: leli phela libekwe endaweni engenalutho noma phakathi komphetho. Khetha iphela elinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves\u003C/span\u003E, noma beka isilinganiso emakhoneni amabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;ubude kumele bube ngaphezu kuka-zero&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-usayizi-nge-entity-info\"\u003EShintsha usayizi nge-Entity info\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkudingeki ngaso sonke isikhathi isilinganiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho:\u003C/strong\u003E wukhethe. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E yawo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E iyibhokisi onganitha kulo. Ukuthayipha ubude ebhokisini lenani nakho kuyasebenza. Iphela elisemuva ngokusho kwe-red, bese green, bese blue lenyakazayo, nalokho okuhlangene nalo kuyelula. Isibonelo, ukushintsha ubude womphetho wangaphambili ongezansi webhokisi kwenza ibhokisi libe banzi ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIqembu noma ikhompoment:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWidth (red)\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth (green)\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight (blue)\u003C/span\u003E ziyizibhokisi. Uhlangothi lwalo olusemuva (kwesokudla, emuva, phezulu) luyanyakaza. Lezi ngama-akisi eqembu ngokwalo, ngaphambi kwanoma yikuphi ukujikiswa onikeze kona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukusebenzisa, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyisela inani elidala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilinganiso-zilandela-imodeli\"\u003EIzilinganiso zilandela imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsilinganiso sinamathiselwe emakhoneni amabili esasibekwe kuwo (ikhona: ekhoneni lalo nasemaphethelweni ende ezimbili; umsakazo noma ububanzi: ku-arc noma indilinga yalo). Hambisa, sunduza noma shintsha usayizi wejometri, bese isilinganiso siyalandela futhi sibonise ubude obusha. Sihlala sinamathisiwe uma wenza ijometri ibe iqembu noma ikhompoment.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma iphela libekwe endaweni engebona ikhona (ebusweni, noma endaweni engenalutho), noma ikhona lalo lisulwe, leli phela lihlala lapho lalikhona. Isilinganiso sisalinganisa, kodwa singashintsha usayizi kusuka kwelinye iphela kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-izilinganiso\"\u003ESusa izilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilinganiso esisodwa: khetha sona bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza ngesisusa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZonke izilinganiso: ngokungakhethiwe lutho, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete all dimensions\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilinganiso zigcinwa kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Azikhishwa ezinye izinhlobo zamafayela, ezithwala imodeli ye-3D kuphela. Ifayela elinezilinganiso livula ku-ModelCraft endala, ngaphandle kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Usayizi kuModelCraft awuhlali ungaguquki uma sekudwetshiwe okuthile. Isilinganiso sibonisa ubude emodelini, futhi uthayipha ubude obusha kuso kushintsha imodeli ifane nalo. Ungaphinda uthayiphe ubude bomphetho, noma ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kweqembu, ku-Entity info. Beka isilinganiso Cindezela D, noma chofoza Dimension ethuluzini. Chofoza ikhona okuzolinganiswa kulo. Iyabamba amakhona, amaphakathi nemiphetho, njengoba ukudweba kwenza. Chofoza ikhona lesibili. Noma chofoza kanye ku-umphetho (uphawu luthi \"On edge\") ukuze ulinganise lowo mphetho wonke ngokuchofoza kanye. Hambisa isikhombi lapho umugqa wesilinganiso okufanele uye khona, bese uchofoza. Ungathayipha futhi ukuphakama, njengo 0.5m, bese ucindezela Enter. Umugqa wesilinganiso uhlala ulingene emphethweni olingene, ngaphandle uma ubheka wona ngohlangothi. Emphethweni omile ohlala emaphethelweni emi, uhlala endizeni emile ebheka wena kangcono. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Dimension 4 m.\" Izilinganiso zibonisa ubude ngeyunithi yemodeli futhi zivuselelwa uma ushintsha iyunithi kukhethi. Umsakazo, ububanzi nengeli Ithuluzi elifanayo Dimension lilinganisa izinto eziyindilinga nezikhona: I-arc: chofoza i-arc. Uphawu luthi Radius. Hambisa isikhombi lapho umbhalo okufanele uye khona bese uchofoza: isilinganiso sifunda R 1.5 m. Indilinga: chofoza indilinga. Uthola ububanzi bendilinga (Ø 3 m) nomugqa odlula endilingeni ngesikhungo sayo. Ipholigoni zisebenza ngendlela efanayo, namakhona azo endilingeni. Engeli phakathi kwemiphetho emibili: chofoza umphetho owodwa, bese uchofoza omunye umphetho ohlangana nawo ekhoneni (lapho usewuphezu kwawo, uphawu luthi Angle between the edges). Bese uhamba ngaphakathi kwekhona ofuna, bese uchofoza. Ngaphakathi kwekhona uthola engeli phakathi kwemiphetho; uma uhamba uye ohlangothini oluthile uthola engeli eseduze kwayo (isibonelo 150° esikhundleni se-30°). Ukuthi ukhombe kude kangakanani nekhona kusho lapho i-arc iyakhona; noma thayipha lobo bude. Ukuze uguqule umsakazo ube ububanzi noma ubuyele emuva, khetha isilinganiso bese uchofoza ku-Show as ku-Entity info. Ukushintsha usayizi ngazo: thayipha umsakazo omusha noma ububanzi ngemva kokubeka, noma khetha kamuva bese uthayipha. I-arc noma indilinga igcina isikhungo sayo ishintshe usayizi; ubuso obuvalwa yiyo (idiski, isiphetho sesilotho) buyashintsha nayo. Izinto ezimbili zilinganisa kuphela: Isilinganiso sengeli asikaze siguqule imodeli. Ukuze ushintse engeli, jikisa imiphetho nge-Rotate. Indilinga esekupheleni kwesilinda (indilinga oyihudulile nge-Push/pull) ayikwazi ukushintshwa usayizi kusuka ezilinganisweni zayo, ngoba izinhlangothi zayo nazo kumele zishintshe. Shintsha usayizi wesilinda esikhundleni salokho, ngokuzungeza i-axis yaso. Shintsha usayizi wemodeli ngesilinganiso Ngemva kokubeka isilinganiso, thayipha ubude obusha bese ucindezela Enter: 6m, 12', 3500 kumodeli yamamilimitha. Imodeli iyashintsha ibe lobo bukhulu. Kamuva, nganoma yisiphi isikhathi: Ngo-Select, chofoza umbhalo wesilinganiso noma umugqa wakho. I-Entity info ithi Dimension futhi ikhombisa i-Length yayo. Thayipha ubude obusha bese ucindezela Enter. Ungathayipha ngqo ebhokisini lenani, noma kubhokisi le-Length ku-Entity info. Okunyakazayo Iphela lesibili oliliphethe liyanyakaza, nakho konke okungaphezu kwalo: Womabili amakhona kwipiyesi eyodwa (ububanzi bebhokisi, ukuphakama kodonga): uhlangothi oluseceleni kwekhona elinyakazayo luyaphuma noma lungene, nobuso obuhlangene nalo buyelula. Ibhokisi lihlala lingumuthi ovaliwe, nanoma yini ehleli ngokuphelele kuleyo hlangothi, njengekhomponenti yefasitela, iyahamba nalo. Amakhona ezingxenye ezimbili ezihlukene (igebe phakathi kwamabhokisi amabili): ipiyesi yekhona elinyakazayo iyahamba yonke, futhi igebe liyashintsha. Ikhona elinyakazayo ngaphakathi kweqembu noma ikhompoment kanti elinye ikhona lingekho kuyo: iqembu lonke liyahamba. Womabili amakhona ngaphakathi kweqembu elifanayo noma ikhompoment: liyelulwa ngaphakathi. Ikhompoment iyashintsha lapho ibekwe khona, njengoba kwenza ukuyihlela njalo. Ukushintsha ukuthi yiliphi iphela elinyakazayo, khetha isilinganiso bese ukhetha ku-Moves ku-Entity info: Ukukhetha Okwenzeka Second end (okuzenzakalelayo) Iphela ochofoze ngalo wesibili liyanyakaza First end Iphela ochofoze ngalo wokuqala liyanyakaza Both ends (centered) Iphela ngalinye linyakaza ingxenye yesigamu sokushintsha, ngakho isikhungu siyahlala sisendaweni Lapho ukushintsha usayizi kwenqatshwa I-ModelCraft ayishintshi lutho futhi itshela isizathu ebhalweni lesimo: \"ubuso buzogoba buphume endizeni yabo\": isilinganiso sihamba ngokuthambeka kudwetshwe ngaso isakhiwo. Linganisa ngomphetho, noma ngobomvu, oluhlaza noma obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. \"ubuso buzoncipha bube yize noma buguquke ngaphakathi\": ubude obusha mfushane kakhulu kwesakhiwo. \"iphela elinyakazayo akusikho ekhoneni lemodeli\": leli phela libekwe endaweni engenalutho noma phakathi komphetho. Khetha iphela elinye ku-Moves, noma beka isilinganiso emakhoneni amabili. \"ubude kumele bube ngaphezu kuka-zero\". Ukushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa. Shintsha usayizi nge-Entity info Akudingeki ngaso sonke isikhathi isilinganiso: Umphetho: wukhethe. I-Length yawo ku-Entity info iyibhokisi onganitha kulo. Ukuthayipha ubude ebhokisini lenani nakho kuyasebenza. Iphela elisemuva ngokusho kwe-red, bese green, bese blue lenyakazayo, nalokho okuhlangene nalo kuyelula. Isibonelo, ukushintsha ubude womphetho wangaphambili ongezansi webhokisi kwenza ibhokisi libe banzi ngakwesokudla. Iqembu noma ikhompoment: khetha. I-Width (red), i-Depth (green) kanye ne-Height (blue) ziyizibhokisi. Uhlangothi lwalo olusemuva (kwesokudla, emuva, phezulu) luyanyakaza. Lezi ngama-akisi eqembu ngokwalo, ngaphambi kwanoma yikuphi ukujikiswa onikeze kona. Cindezela Enter ukusebenzisa, noma Esc ukubuyisela inani elidala. Izilinganiso zilandela imodeli Isilinganiso sinamathiselwe emakhoneni amabili esasibekwe kuwo (ikhona: ekhoneni lalo nasemaphethelweni ende ezimbili; umsakazo noma ububanzi: ku-arc noma indilinga yalo). Hambisa, sunduza noma shintsha usayizi wejometri, bese isilinganiso siyalandela futhi sibonise ubude obusha. Sihlala sinamathisiwe uma wenza ijometri ibe iqembu noma ikhompoment. Uma iphela libekwe endaweni engebona ikhona (ebusweni, noma endaweni engenalutho), noma ikhona lalo lisulwe, leli phela lihlala lapho lalikhona. Isilinganiso sisalinganisa, kodwa singashintsha usayizi kusuka kwelinye iphela kuphela. Susa izilinganiso Isilinganiso esisodwa: khetha sona bese ucindezela Delete, noma chofoza ngesisusa Eraser. Zonke izilinganiso: ngokungakhethiwe lutho, chofoza Delete all dimensions ku-Entity info. Izilinganiso zigcinwa kufayela le-.modelcraft. Azikhishwa ezinye izinhlobo zamafayela, ezithwala imodeli ye-3D kuphela. Ifayela elinezilinganiso livula ku-ModelCraft endala, ngaphandle kwazo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"erase","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sula bese uhlanza","summary":"Sula imiphetho, amaqembu nemihlahlandlela ngesifafazi noma ngokhiye we-Delete, uhlanganise ubuso obuhlukene, bese ulungisa ubuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["sula","isifafazi","susa","hlanganisa","hlanza","ubuso obuhlukene","hlanganisa ubuso","imigqa elahlekile","phendula ubuso","ingemuva lobuso","hlehlisa"],"headings":[{"id":"sula-ngesifafazi","text":"Sula ngesifafazi","level":2},{"id":"yini-eyenzeka-ebusweni","text":"Yini eyenzeka ebusweni","level":2},{"id":"sula-ngokhiye-we-delete","text":"Sula ngokhiye we-Delete","level":2},{"id":"hlanza-imigqa-elahlekile-ebusweni-obusicaba","text":"Hlanza imigqa elahlekile ebusweni obusicaba","level":2},{"id":"ubuso-obubheke-ngendlela-engafanele","text":"Ubuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele","level":2},{"id":"hlehlisa-iphutha","text":"Hlehlisa iphutha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sula-ngesifafazi\"\u003ESula ngesifafazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho, iqembu noma izakhi, noma umhlahlandlela. Uyasulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze usule okuningi, cindezela bese udonsa uwadlule. Konke okudlula kukho kuyakhanyiswa, bese konke kuyanyamalala lapho ukhulula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsifafazi asikhethi ubuso: ubuso buyanyamalala uma usula imiphetho edingekayo. Ubuso yilokho isifafazi esidlula kuko ukuze sithole imiphetho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-eyenzeka-ebusweni\"\u003EYini eyenzeka ebusweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili endizeni efanayo\u003C/strong\u003E (umugqa odwetshwe phesheya kwebhuleki, isibonelo) uyanyamalala bese ubuso obubili \u003Cstrong\u003Ebuhlanganiswa\u003C/strong\u003E bube bubodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho ubuso edinga ukuze uhlale uvaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E (umphetho webhokisi) uthatha naleyo buso kanye nawo. Sula omunye umphetho wangaphezulu webhokisi bese ophezulu nenhlangothi eyodwa kuyanyamalala, kushiye ibhokisi elivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlangothi ezisele\u003C/strong\u003E (amaphoyinti ayekho mphetho esawasebenzisayo) ziyahlanzwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusula ikhophi yokugcina yesakhi nakho kususa isakhi kuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sula-ngokhiye-we-delete\"\u003ESula ngokhiye we-Delete\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okufuna ukususa ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kusula nobuso. Ubuso obusulwe ngale ndlela ushiya imiphetho yabo, ngakho ungasula phezulu webhokisi ugcine umbhalo walo, bese udweba okunye lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanza-imigqa-elahlekile-ebusweni-obusicaba\"\u003EHlanza imigqa elahlekile ebusweni obusicaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma udonga noma ibhuleki likhombisa imigqa ongayifuni (eseleyo kusukela ekudwetsheni), zisule nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E. Imigqa elele ebusweni iyanyamalala; ubuso buhlala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso-obubheke-ngendlela-engafanele\"\u003EUbuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso obubonwa ngemuva bunombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu. Uma ubuso bukhombisa lolo mbala ngaphandle komodeli wakho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ubuso\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela ubuso obubheka ngayo ibaluleke kakhulu lapho uthumela: abenzi bezithombe, izinjini zemidlalo nabaprinta be-3D bangafihla noma bafunde kabi ubuso obubheka ngaphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlehlisa-iphutha\"\u003EHlehlisa iphutha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhlehlisa isinyathelo esisodwa ngesikhathi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uphinda. Ukudonsa ngesifafazi kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi kube nezinto ezingaki. Ibha yesimo ithi okuhlehliswe kukho: &quot;Kuhlehliswe ukususwa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sula ngesifafazi Cindezela E ukuze uthole i-Isifafazi. Chofoza umphetho, iqembu noma izakhi, noma umhlahlandlela. Uyasulwa. Ukuze usule okuningi, cindezela bese udonsa uwadlule. Konke okudlula kukho kuyakhanyiswa, bese konke kuyanyamalala lapho ukhulula. Isifafazi asikhethi ubuso: ubuso buyanyamalala uma usula imiphetho edingekayo. Ubuso yilokho isifafazi esidlula kuko ukuze sithole imiphetho. Yini eyenzeka ebusweni Umphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili endizeni efanayo (umugqa odwetshwe phesheya kwebhuleki, isibonelo) uyanyamalala bese ubuso obubili buhlanganiswa bube bubodwa. Umphetho ubuso edinga ukuze uhlale uvaliwe (umphetho webhokisi) uthatha naleyo buso kanye nawo. Sula omunye umphetho wangaphezulu webhokisi bese ophezulu nenhlangothi eyodwa kuyanyamalala, kushiye ibhokisi elivulekile. Izinhlangothi ezisele (amaphoyinti ayekho mphetho esawasebenzisayo) ziyahlanzwa. Ukusula ikhophi yokugcina yesakhi nakho kususa isakhi kuphaneli Izakhi. Sula ngokhiye we-Delete Khetha okufuna ukususa ngethuluzi Khetha. Cindezela Delete noma Backspace. Lokhu kusula nobuso. Ubuso obusulwe ngale ndlela ushiya imiphetho yabo, ngakho ungasula phezulu webhokisi ugcine umbhalo walo, bese udweba okunye lapho. Hlanza imigqa elahlekile ebusweni obusicaba Uma udonga noma ibhuleki likhombisa imigqa ongayifuni (eseleyo kusukela ekudwetsheni), zisule nge-Isifafazi. Imigqa elele ebusweni iyanyamalala; ubuso buhlala. Ubuso obubheke ngendlela engafanele Ubuso obubonwa ngemuva bunombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu. Uma ubuso bukhombisa lolo mbala ngaphandle komodeli wakho: Khetha ubuso. Chofoza Phendula ubuso ku-Ulwazi lwento. Indlela ubuso obubheka ngayo ibaluleke kakhulu lapho uthumela: abenzi bezithombe, izinjini zemidlalo nabaprinta be-3D bangafihla noma bafunde kabi ubuso obubheka ngaphakathi. Hlehlisa iphutha Ctrl+Z uhlehlisa isinyathelo esisodwa ngesikhathi, Ctrl+Y (noma Ctrl+Shift+Z) uphinda. Ukudonsa ngesifafazi kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi kube nezinto ezingaki. Ibha yesimo ithi okuhlehliswe kukho: \"Kuhlehliswe ukususwa.\"","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"site-plan","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Yenza imodeli esakhiweni sepulani yesayithi kusuka ku-DWG noma ku-DXF","summary":"Ngenisa isayithi ye-CAD noma ipulani yezakhiwo njengemigqa emhlabathini, phendula umbuzo wamayunithi, bese uyilandela ibe ubuso nezinqwaba.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["ipulani yesayithi","dwg","dxf","cad","ngenisa","isikethi","isikethi sesithombe","isikethi sesandla","isithombe","iphepha","imibala yepeni","amablokhi asebenzayo","izimo zokubonakala","umbhalo","hatch","spline","ellipse","3d face","landela","ipulani yegumbi","ilothi","umugqa wempahla","amayunithi","underlay","indawo ezungezile"],"headings":[{"id":"ngenisa-umdwebo","text":"Ngenisa umdwebo","level":2},{"id":"okufika","text":"Okufika","level":2},{"id":"landela-ibe-ubuso","text":"Landela ibe ubuso","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga","text":"Izinkinga","level":2},{"id":"kusuka-esithombeni-sesikethi-sesandla","text":"Kusuka esithombeni sesikethi sesandla","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ingangenisa imigqa yomdwebo we-CAD oyimbili-ngobubanzi, ipulani yesayithi noma ipulani yegumbi, iwabeke emhlabathini ukuze ukwazi ukumodela phezu kwawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa-umdwebo\"\u003ENgenisa umdwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E (noma wehlise ifayela kumbono we-3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-DWG enkulu ithatha isikhashana: ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Ifunda plan.dwg…&quot; kuze kungene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umdwebo ungasho ukuthi amayunithi awo ayini, ingxoxo ebizwa ngokuthi &quot;Amayunithi womdwebo&quot; ibuza: &quot;Yiyiphi iyunithi eyodwa yomdwebo?&quot; Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmainshi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafidi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamilimitha\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamitha\u003C/span\u003E. Amapulani amaningi eMelika adwetshwa ngamafidi, amapulani ezakhiwo ngamainshi, namapulani esilinganiso ngamamilimitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo ufika njengeqembu lemiphetho emhlabathini, likhethiwe, nombono usondela kuwo. Ibha yesimo ibonisa imiphetho emingaki efikile, isibonelo: &quot;Ukungeniswa kwe-site.dwg: imiphetho engu-1697 emhlabathini, ngaphakathi eqenjini. Yiqhekeze ukuze udwebe phezu kwayo ngqo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufika\"\u003EOkufika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa, imigqa emincane (kuhlanganise namajika ayo), imibuthano namajika, namabhlogi nakho konke okungaphakathi kwawo, kusuka kuphela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Emodel space\u003C/strong\u003E. Amajika ahlukaniswa abe imigqa emifushane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa, imigqa emincane, amajika, imibuthano, ama-ellipse nama-spline kufika kuhle emhlabathini njengemiphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yokufiphaza\u003C/strong\u003E iba ubuso emhlabathini, nezihlahla zayo zibe izimbobo, ukuze ukwazi ukusunduza/hudula indawo efiphazwe ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso be-3D\u003C/strong\u003E nemithamo eqinile kuba ubuso; ubuso be-3D bugcina ukuphakama kwabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/strong\u003E (umbhalo womugqa owodwa, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezixabiso zezakhi) udwetshwa njengemiphetho ngohlobo lombhalo olulula lomugqa owodwa, ngobude bombhalo, i-engeli nokuhlelwa kwawo. Ifonti yawo akuyona yomdwebo, ngakho amagama angase ahlale ude noma amfushane kancane. Izinhlamvu ezingenayo isimo kuleli hlobo zidwetshwa njengamabhokisi amancane futhi ziyabalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E zidwetshwa njengoba umdwebo uzikhombisa (imigqa yazo, izinhloko zemicibisho nombhalo, njengemiphetho nobuso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmablokhi asebenzayo\u003C/strong\u003E angena njengoba umdwebo uwakhombisa: ibhlokhi ngayinye ebekiwe esimweni esagcinwa ngaso, nemigqa yalowo mbono kuphela. Ibha yesimo iwahlu, ibonise izimo ezikhonjisiwe nezinye izimo ezikhona kuwo, isibonelo: &quot;Receptacle shown as Duplex ×38, GFI ×7 (states: Duplex, GFI)&quot;. ModelCraft ayishintshi izimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto eziqinile ze-3D, izifunda nemizimba\u003C/strong\u003E (idatha ye-ACIS yomdwebo) ifika njengamaqembu ayo: isolidi evaliwe njengesolidi, isifunda noma umzimba ovulekile njengobuso. Ubuso obuyisicaba buyafika bugcwele; ubuso obugoqekile (amasilinda, ama-cone, izinkundla, amatorasi, izindawo ezilula ze-spline) njengama-triangle amancane nemiphetho ethambile phakathi kwawo, ukuze kubonakale kuphela imiphetho yesolidi. Ubuso ohlobo lwendawo olunye lushiywa ngaphandle futhi luyabhalwa: &quot;Not drawn yet (3D solids): …&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkungeniswa: amaphoyinti, amathebula, ama-multileader, izithombe nezinye izinhlobo zezinto. Ibha yesimo ibhala ngohlobo, isibonelo &quot;Not imported: 12 POINT.&quot; Konke okusesakhiweni lephepha (paper space) nakho kushiywa ngaphandle, ngaphandle kokubhalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalayiyeri awagcinwa: yonke imigqa ifika ifana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma umdwebo ukude nomsuka wawo (isibonelo ama-coordinates wesifunda), uyangeniswa, kodwa ungafika kude nomsuka we-ModelCraft. Imidwebo efinyelela ngaphezu kuka-10,000 km esuka emsukeni wayo iyenqatshwa: sondeza umdwebo ku-0,0 ku-CAD program kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"landela-ibe-ubuso\"\u003ELandela ibe ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa efakiwe kaningi ayivali ibe ubuso ngokwayo. Izindlela ezimbili zokusebenza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGcina ipulani njengengaphansi (kuyancoméwe)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya ipulani njengeqembu layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDwebela isakhiwo sakho phezu kwayo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, ubambelele emakhoneni epulani (&quot;Endpoint&quot;) nasemiphethweni yayo (&quot;On edge&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESunduza/hudula ubuso bakho ukuze baphakame. Ipulani ihlala ingathintwa ngaphansi, futhi ungasula iqembu lonke ngokuchofoza kanye emuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubambelela kusebenza phakathi kwamaqembu: ungabambelela emakhoneni epulani ngaphandle kokuyivula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDwebela phezu komugqa wepulani\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu lepulani bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E. Imigqa yalo iba imiphetho ekhululekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho umugqa ovaliwe kufanele ube ubuso, dweba umugqa phezu kwanoma yimuphi umphetho walo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, usuka ekhoneni uye kwelinye. Uma umugqa ovaliwe ulingana futhi uyisicaba, ubuso buvame ukugcwala. Uma kungenjalo, bheka isikhala noma ukudlanga kwemigqa bese udweba phezu kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESunduza/hudula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kusebenza kahle kakhulu epulanini elihlanzekile. Ekuhloleni okuyinkimbinkimbi, ukulandela phezulu kuyashesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;This is a binary DXF. Save it as ASCII DXF and try again.&quot; — Lena yi-DXF ye-binary. Yigcine kabusha njenge-DXF ye-ASCII kusuka ku-CAD program bese uzama futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;…has no lines, arcs or circles in model space to bring in.&quot; — …akunamigqa, amajika noma imibuthano ku-model space okufanele ingeniswe. Umdwebo mhlawumbe wonke usesakhiweni sephepha, noma wonke ungumbhalo namahatch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;This drawing could not be read (…). It may be damaged, or saved in a DWG version the reader does not handle…&quot; — Lo mdwebo awukwazanga ukufundwa (…). Mhlawumbe wonakele, noma wagcinwa ngenguqulo ye-DWG umfundi angayisekeli… Izibhakabhaka zithi kungani, isibonelo &quot;DWG version AC1009 is not supported&quot;. Gcina njenge-DXF, noma njenge-DWG kusukela ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018, kusuka ku-CAD program.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani inosayizi ongalungile: ukhethe iyunithi engalungile. Hlehlisa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uyangenisa futhi, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003Eshintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E weqembu ngesilinganiso esifanele (12 phakathi kwamafidi namainshi, 25.4 phakathi kwamainshi namamilimitha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uguqule imigqa yamakhonco ibe umhlabathi ongawubumba, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/terrain\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/terrain\"\u003EUmhlabathi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusuka-esithombeni-sesikethi-sesandla\"\u003EKusuka esithombeni sesikethi sesandla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela › Ngenisa isithombe sesikethi…\u003C/strong\u003E uthatha isithombe sesikethi ephepheni (JPEG, PNG noma TIFF, ivela ku-foni kuyalungile) bese yenza izinhlobo ezifanayo zemiphetho emhlabathini. Chaza ukuthi liphepha muni (noma vumela kuthole ishidi, lithathwe njenge-A4) nesikali sesikethi, isibonelo 1 : 100. Umphetho wephepha uyatholakala futhi isithombe siyaqondiswa, uyinki ulandelwa ube imigqa namajika, futhi umbala ngamunye wepeni (black, red, blue, green) uba yiqembu layo nethegi (\u003Cstrong\u003ESketch black\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESketch red\u003C/strong\u003E, …), zonke ngaphakathi kweqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lesithombe. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa, futhi konke kwenzeka kulo kompyutha: akukho okuthunyelwa noma kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungatholakali umphetho wephepha, isithombe sonke sithathwa njengeshidi futhi umugqa wesimo uyakusho: linganisa okuthile okwaziyo bese ushintsha usayizi weqembu uma kukhubazekile. Landela imigqa ibe ubuso njengaphezulu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft ingangenisa imigqa yomdwebo we-CAD oyimbili-ngobubanzi, ipulani yesayithi noma ipulani yegumbi, iwabeke emhlabathini ukuze ukwazi ukumodela phezu kwawo. Ngenisa umdwebo Chofoza Ngenisa eqenjini le-Ifayela (noma wehlise ifayela kumbono we-3D). Khetha ifayela .dwg noma .dxf. I-DWG enkulu ithatha isikhashana: ibha yesimo ithi \"Ifunda plan.dwg…\" kuze kungene. Uma umdwebo ungasho ukuthi amayunithi awo ayini, ingxoxo ebizwa ngokuthi \"Amayunithi womdwebo\" ibuza: \"Yiyiphi iyunithi eyodwa yomdwebo?\" Khetha Amainshi, Amafidi, Amamilimitha noma Amamitha. Amapulani amaningi eMelika adwetshwa ngamafidi, amapulani ezakhiwo ngamainshi, namapulani esilinganiso ngamamilimitha. Umdwebo ufika njengeqembu lemiphetho emhlabathini, likhethiwe, nombono usondela kuwo. Ibha yesimo ibonisa imiphetho emingaki efikile, isibonelo: \"Ukungeniswa kwe-site.dwg: imiphetho engu-1697 emhlabathini, ngaphakathi eqenjini. Yiqhekeze ukuze udwebe phezu kwayo ngqo.\" Okufika Imigqa, imigqa emincane (kuhlanganise namajika ayo), imibuthano namajika, namabhlogi nakho konke okungaphakathi kwawo, kusuka kuphela ku-model space. Amajika ahlukaniswa abe imigqa emifushane. Imigqa, imigqa emincane, amajika, imibuthano, ama-ellipse nama-spline kufika kuhle emhlabathini njengemiphetho. Imigqa yokufiphaza iba ubuso emhlabathini, nezihlahla zayo zibe izimbobo, ukuze ukwazi ukusunduza/hudula indawo efiphazwe ngokushesha. Ubuso be-3D nemithamo eqinile kuba ubuso; ubuso be-3D bugcina ukuphakama kwabo. Umbhalo (umbhalo womugqa owodwa, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezixabiso zezakhi) udwetshwa njengemiphetho ngohlobo lombhalo olulula lomugqa owodwa, ngobude bombhalo, i-engeli nokuhlelwa kwawo. Ifonti yawo akuyona yomdwebo, ngakho amagama angase ahlale ude noma amfushane kancane. Izinhlamvu ezingenayo isimo kuleli hlobo zidwetshwa njengamabhokisi amancane futhi ziyabalwa. Izilinganiso zidwetshwa njengoba umdwebo uzikhombisa (imigqa yazo, izinhloko zemicibisho nombhalo, njengemiphetho nobuso). Amablokhi asebenzayo angena njengoba umdwebo uwakhombisa: ibhlokhi ngayinye ebekiwe esimweni esagcinwa ngaso, nemigqa yalowo mbono kuphela. Ibha yesimo iwahlu, ibonise izimo ezikhonjisiwe nezinye izimo ezikhona kuwo, isibonelo: \"Receptacle shown as Duplex ×38, GFI ×7 (states: Duplex, GFI)\". ModelCraft ayishintshi izimo. Izinto eziqinile ze-3D, izifunda nemizimba (idatha ye-ACIS yomdwebo) ifika njengamaqembu ayo: isolidi evaliwe njengesolidi, isifunda noma umzimba ovulekile njengobuso. Ubuso obuyisicaba buyafika bugcwele; ubuso obugoqekile (amasilinda, ama-cone, izinkundla, amatorasi, izindawo ezilula ze-spline) njengama-triangle amancane nemiphetho ethambile phakathi kwawo, ukuze kubonakale kuphela imiphetho yesolidi. Ubuso ohlobo lwendawo olunye lushiywa ngaphandle futhi luyabhalwa: \"Not drawn yet (3D solids): …\". Akungeniswa: amaphoyinti, amathebula, ama-multileader, izithombe nezinye izinhlobo zezinto. Ibha yesimo ibhala ngohlobo, isibonelo \"Not imported: 12 POINT.\" Konke okusesakhiweni lephepha (paper space) nakho kushiywa ngaphandle, ngaphandle kokubhalwa. Amalayiyeri awagcinwa: yonke imigqa ifika ifana. Uma umdwebo ukude nomsuka wawo (isibonelo ama-coordinates wesifunda), uyangeniswa, kodwa ungafika kude nomsuka we-ModelCraft. Imidwebo efinyelela ngaphezu kuka-10,000 km esuka emsukeni wayo iyenqatshwa: sondeza umdwebo ku-0,0 ku-CAD program kuqala. Landela ibe ubuso Imigqa efakiwe kaningi ayivali ibe ubuso ngokwayo. Izindlela ezimbili zokusebenza: Gcina ipulani njengengaphansi (kuyancoméwe) Shiya ipulani njengeqembu layo. Dwebela isakhiwo sakho phezu kwayo nge-Unxande ne-Umugqa, ubambelele emakhoneni epulani (\"Endpoint\") nasemiphethweni yayo (\"On edge\"). Sunduza/hudula ubuso bakho ukuze baphakame. Ipulani ihlala ingathintwa ngaphansi, futhi ungasula iqembu lonke ngokuchofoza kanye emuva. Ukubambelela kusebenza phakathi kwamaqembu: ungabambelela emakhoneni epulani ngaphandle kokuyivula. Dwebela phezu komugqa wepulani Khetha iqembu lepulani bese uchofoza Chitha. Imigqa yalo iba imiphetho ekhululekile. Lapho umugqa ovaliwe kufanele ube ubuso, dweba umugqa phezu kwanoma yimuphi umphetho walo nge-Umugqa, usuka ekhoneni uye kwelinye. Uma umugqa ovaliwe ulingana futhi uyisicaba, ubuso buvame ukugcwala. Uma kungenjalo, bheka isikhala noma ukudlanga kwemigqa bese udweba phezu kwakho. Sunduza/hudula. Lokhu kusebenza kahle kakhulu epulanini elihlanzekile. Ekuhloleni okuyinkimbinkimbi, ukulandela phezulu kuyashesha. Izinkinga \"This is a binary DXF. Save it as ASCII DXF and try again.\" — Lena yi-DXF ye-binary. Yigcine kabusha njenge-DXF ye-ASCII kusuka ku-CAD program bese uzama futhi. \"…has no lines, arcs or circles in model space to bring in.\" — …akunamigqa, amajika noma imibuthano ku-model space okufanele ingeniswe. Umdwebo mhlawumbe wonke usesakhiweni sephepha, noma wonke ungumbhalo namahatch. \"This drawing could not be read (…). It may be damaged, or saved in a DWG version the reader does not handle…\" — Lo mdwebo awukwazanga ukufundwa (…). Mhlawumbe wonakele, noma wagcinwa ngenguqulo ye-DWG umfundi angayisekeli… Izibhakabhaka zithi kungani, isibonelo \"DWG version AC1009 is not supported\". Gcina njenge-DXF, noma njenge-DWG kusukela ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018, kusuka ku-CAD program. Ipulani inosayizi ongalungile: ukhethe iyunithi engalungile. Hlehlisa (Ctrl+Z) bese uyangenisa futhi, noma shintsha usayizi weqembu ngesilinganiso esifanele (12 phakathi kwamafidi namainshi, 25.4 phakathi kwamainshi namamilimitha). Ukuze uguqule imigqa yamakhonco ibe umhlabathi ongawubumba, bona Umhlabathi. Kusuka esithombeni sesikethi sesandla Ifayela › Ngenisa isithombe sesikethi… uthatha isithombe sesikethi ephepheni (JPEG, PNG noma TIFF, ivela ku-foni kuyalungile) bese yenza izinhlobo ezifanayo zemiphetho emhlabathini. Chaza ukuthi liphepha muni (noma vumela kuthole ishidi, lithathwe njenge-A4) nesikali sesikethi, isibonelo 1 : 100. Umphetho wephepha uyatholakala futhi isithombe siyaqondiswa, uyinki ulandelwa ube imigqa namajika, futhi umbala ngamunye wepeni (black, red, blue, green) uba yiqembu layo nethegi (Sketch black, Sketch red, …), zonke ngaphakathi kweqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lesithombe. Kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa, futhi konke kwenzeka kulo kompyutha: akukho okuthunyelwa noma kuphi. Uma kungatholakali umphetho wephepha, isithombe sonke sithathwa njengeshidi futhi umugqa wesimo uyakusho: linganisa okuthile okwaziyo bese ushintsha usayizi weqembu uma kukhubazekile. Landela imigqa ibe ubuso njengaphezulu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"import-sketchup-files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ngenisa imodeli ye-SKP","summary":"Ngenisa ifayela le-.skp ngamaqembu, izakhi, imibala, izimo, amathegi nezindawo ezithambile, bona okufikile nokungafikanga, bese uqhubeka nokumodela.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["skp","ngenisa","vula i-skp","izakhi","amaqembu","amathegi","izingqimba","izinto zokwakha","imibala","izimo","ezifihliwe","imiphetho ethambile","i-3d warehouse","dlulisa","ukushintsha"],"headings":[{"id":"ngenisa-ifayela","text":"Ngenisa ifayela","level":2},{"id":"okufika","text":"Okufika","level":2},{"id":"okungafiki","text":"Okungafiki","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga","text":"Izinkinga","level":2},{"id":"thatha-imodeli","text":"Thatha imodeli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E) ngomfundi wayo, ekhasini. Ayikho into elayishwa, futhi isebenza ngaphandle kuxhumo uma i-ModelCraft isebenza. Amafayela kusukela ku-SketchUp 3 kuya ku-2026 ahlolwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa-ifayela\"\u003ENgenisa ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E (noma ushiye ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E ku-3D view).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Ifunda house.skp…&quot; ngenkathi lifunda, bese kuthi okufike, isibonelo &quot;Ingenisiwe house.skp (SketchUp 25.0.575): izinhlangothi ezingu-1240, izakhi ezingu-6, eqenjini elilodwa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela, likhethiwe, futhi umbono uyasondela kulo. Ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyakususa konke futhi, kubandakanya namathegi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlukanisa iqembu lokungenisa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E) uma ufuna okuqukethwe kwalo kube kukhululekile emodelini yakho kunokuba kube esikhwameni esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufika\"\u003EOkufika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E nezimbobo zazo, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enemiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E engeyona ingxenye yehlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaqembu\u003C/strong\u003E afika njengamaqembu, nezakhi njengezakhi: yonke ikhophi yesakhi iyindawo yencazelo eyodwa, ngakho ukuhlela ikhophi eyodwa kushintsha zonke, njengakuSketchUp. Amagama ayafika nawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibala.\u003C/strong\u003E Impahla yehlangothi ngayinye inika umbala wayo. Impahla ependwe eqenjini noma esakhini ibe yipende lalowo mkhiqizo, ngakho izinhlangothi ezingaphakathi kwawo ezingenambala wazo ziyithatha, njengakuSketchUp. Isakhi ephendwe obomvu endaweni eyodwa nobuluhlaza endaweni enye sihlala siyisakhi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithungo (textures).\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlangothi oluphendwe ngempahla enesithungo lufika nesithungo sawo, sibekwe ehlangothini njengakufayela, futhi isimo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaded\u003C/span\u003E siyasibonisa. Isithombe sigcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft lapho uligcina, futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eisithombe esirendiwe\u003C/a\u003E sibonisa naso. Impahla yethuluzi yethuluzi eqenjini noma esakhini yesonke inika leyokhophi umbala wempahla kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathegi.\u003C/strong\u003E Iqembu noma isakhi esikuthegi le-SketchUp sithola ithegi le-ModelCraft egama elifanayo, ngakho ulibona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETags\u003C/span\u003E, libonakale noma lifihlwe njengoba lenjenjalo ku-SketchUp. Uma imodeli yakho isinalo ithegi elinegama elifanayo, leyo thegi iyasetshenziswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe zifika zifihliwe:\u003C/strong\u003E izinhlangothi, imiphetho, amaqembu nezakhi, nezinhlangothi nemiphetho ethegini elifihliwe. Ubona okubonisiwe yi-SketchUp, futhi akukho okulahlekayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E iyazibonisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi veza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho ethambile nebushelelezi\u003C/strong\u003E igcina ukuthamba, ngakho izindawo ezigobile zisabonakala zibushelelezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E ufika ulungile kunoma iyiphi iyunithi: amafayela e-SketchUp angaphakathi ayingishi, futhi i-ModelCraft iyaguqula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungafiki\"\u003EOkungafiki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi yini ebiphuphe, kanye nezinani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEzinye izithungo\u003C/strong\u003E zigcina umbala wempahla yazo kuphela: isithungo esingekho efayelini, isithombe esingumumo ongawubonisi izingxenye zewebhu (njengefayela le-Photoshop), noma isithungo esingenaso usayizi. Izinhlangothi ezinesithungo esiprojected zifika nesithungo sibekwe cishe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathegi ezinhlangothi nemiphetho ekhululekile.\u003C/strong\u003E I-ModelCraft ithegisa amaqembu nezakhi kuphela, ngakho uhlangothi noma umphetho onethegi yawo ufika ungenathegi, futhi ibha yesimo iyawabala. Yenza izinhlangothi ezinjalo ibe iqembu (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uthegisa iqembu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithombe ezibekwe emodelini\u003C/strong\u003E, umbhalo, izilinganiso, izihloko, izindiza zezigaba, izigcawu nezitayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Lokhu akulona ifayela le-SketchUp.&quot; noma &quot;Leli fayela le-SketchUp lonakele: …&quot;: ifayela liqunjiwe noma kuyinto enye enegama elithi \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E. Lilondoloze futhi kusukela ku-SketchUp, noma cela ikhophi entsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela lenguqulo ye-SketchUp esha kuneyeModelCraft kwaziwa ligashwa ngenguqulo elitholakale ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli eyizithombe, umbhalo noma izilinganiso kuphela ithi ayinalutho olukhombisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thatha-imodeli\"\u003EThatha imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukugcina amafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E. Thumela ngaphandle njenge-Collada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E) bese uyingenisa ku-SketchUp: amaqembu, izakhi nemibala ziyadlulela; izithungo zidlulela njengombala wempahla yazo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003EThumela imodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp (.skp) ngomfundi wayo, ekhasini. Ayikho into elayishwa, futhi isebenza ngaphandle kuxhumo uma i-ModelCraft isebenza. Amafayela kusukela ku-SketchUp 3 kuya ku-2026 ahlolwe. Ngenisa ifayela Chofoza Import eqenjini File (noma ushiye ifayela le-.skp ku-3D view). Khetha ifayela. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ifunda house.skp…\" ngenkathi lifunda, bese kuthi okufike, isibonelo \"Ingenisiwe house.skp (SketchUp 25.0.575): izinhlangothi ezingu-1240, izakhi ezingu-6, eqenjini elilodwa.\" Imodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela, likhethiwe, futhi umbono uyasondela kulo. Ukucindezela Ctrl+Z kuyakususa konke futhi, kubandakanya namathegi. Hlukanisa iqembu lokungenisa (Entity info › Explode) uma ufuna okuqukethwe kwalo kube kukhululekile emodelini yakho kunokuba kube esikhwameni esisodwa. Okufika Izinhlangothi nezimbobo zazo, kanye nemiphetho engeyona ingxenye yehlangothi. Amaqembu afika njengamaqembu, nezakhi njengezakhi: yonke ikhophi yesakhi iyindawo yencazelo eyodwa, ngakho ukuhlela ikhophi eyodwa kushintsha zonke, njengakuSketchUp. Amagama ayafika nawo. Imibala. Impahla yehlangothi ngayinye inika umbala wayo. Impahla ependwe eqenjini noma esakhini ibe yipende lalowo mkhiqizo, ngakho izinhlangothi ezingaphakathi kwawo ezingenambala wazo ziyithatha, njengakuSketchUp. Isakhi ephendwe obomvu endaweni eyodwa nobuluhlaza endaweni enye sihlala siyisakhi esisodwa. Izithungo (textures). Uhlangothi oluphendwe ngempahla enesithungo lufika nesithungo sawo, sibekwe ehlangothini njengakufayela, futhi isimo se-Shaded siyasibonisa. Isithombe sigcinwa kufayela le-ModelCraft lapho uligcina, futhi isithombe esirendiwe sibonisa naso. Impahla yethuluzi yethuluzi eqenjini noma esakhini yesonke inika leyokhophi umbala wempahla kuphela. Amathegi. Iqembu noma isakhi esikuthegi le-SketchUp sithola ithegi le-ModelCraft egama elifanayo, ngakho ulibona ku-Tags, libonakale noma lifihlwe njengoba lenjenjalo ku-SketchUp. Uma imodeli yakho isinalo ithegi elinegama elifanayo, leyo thegi iyasetshenziswa. Izinto ezifihliwe zifika zifihliwe: izinhlangothi, imiphetho, amaqembu nezakhi, nezinhlangothi nemiphetho ethegini elifihliwe. Ubona okubonisiwe yi-SketchUp, futhi akukho okulahlekayo: Edit › More › Unhide all iyazibonisa. Bona Fihla, hlukanisa futhi veza. Imiphetho ethambile nebushelelezi igcina ukuthamba, ngakho izindawo ezigobile zisabonakala zibushelelezi. Usayizi ufika ulungile kunoma iyiphi iyunithi: amafayela e-SketchUp angaphakathi ayingishi, futhi i-ModelCraft iyaguqula. Okungafiki Ibha yesimo ithi yini ebiphuphe, kanye nezinani. Ezinye izithungo zigcina umbala wempahla yazo kuphela: isithungo esingekho efayelini, isithombe esingumumo ongawubonisi izingxenye zewebhu (njengefayela le-Photoshop), noma isithungo esingenaso usayizi. Izinhlangothi ezinesithungo esiprojected zifika nesithungo sibekwe cishe. Amathegi ezinhlangothi nemiphetho ekhululekile. I-ModelCraft ithegisa amaqembu nezakhi kuphela, ngakho uhlangothi noma umphetho onethegi yawo ufika ungenathegi, futhi ibha yesimo iyawabala. Yenza izinhlangothi ezinjalo ibe iqembu (Shift+G) bese uthegisa iqembu. Izithombe ezibekwe emodelini, umbhalo, izilinganiso, izihloko, izindiza zezigaba, izigcawu nezitayela. Izinkinga \"Lokhu akulona ifayela le-SketchUp.\" noma \"Leli fayela le-SketchUp lonakele: …\": ifayela liqunjiwe noma kuyinto enye enegama elithi .skp. Lilondoloze futhi kusukela ku-SketchUp, noma cela ikhophi entsha. Ifayela lenguqulo ye-SketchUp esha kuneyeModelCraft kwaziwa ligashwa ngenguqulo elitholakale ngayo. Imodeli eyizithombe, umbhalo noma izilinganiso kuphela ithi ayinalutho olukhombisayo. Thatha imodeli I-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukugcina amafayela e-.skp. Thumela ngaphandle njenge-Collada (Export › .dae) bese uyingenisa ku-SketchUp: amaqembu, izakhi nemibala ziyadlulela; izithungo zidlulela njengombala wempahla yazo. Bona Thumela imodeli yakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"site-from-civilcraft","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thatha isayithi ku-CivilCraft","summary":"Vula ifayela lekheli-kuya-esayithini elenziwe yi-CivilCraft bese ungeza izakhiwo nendawo eyizungezile njengezinqwaba nomugqa wesayithi, ezo kuphela ozikhethile.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["isayithi","civilcraft","ikheli","iphashela","izakhiwo ezingomakhelwane","izinqwaba","indawo ezungezile","ccsite","idatha evulekile","openstreetmap"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuletha-ifayela","text":"Ukuletha ifayela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft ingasesha ikheli futhi igcine lokho imithombo yedatha evulekile iyaziyo ngalo ozungezile: izakhiwo ezingomakhelwane, iphashela, nemigqa yezindawo ezikhukhulekayo, zokuhlelwa nomhlabathi. ModelCraft ithatha leli fayela njengezincomo. Akukho okwengezwayo uze usho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuletha-ifayela\"\u003EUkuletha ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-CivilCraft, thumela isayithi ku-ModelCraft, noma gcina ifayela (liphela nge-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccsite.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-ModelCraft, vula noma wehlise ifayela. Kuvuleka uhlu oluneboksi lokukhetha lesakhiwo ngasinye nephashela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ukuphakama kwezakhiwo umthombo ongazinikanga. Umugqa eceleni kwalo ubonisa ukuthi ukuphakama kuvela kuphi: inani lamazinga walo ngamamitha ayi-3 ngalinye, noma ukuphakama obukubhalile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ezikhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzakhiwo ezikhethiwe ziba yizinqwaba ezikhishiwe ngaphakathi kwesakhi esisodwa, nephashela libe umugqa ozungeze isayithi. Konke kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Iphoyinti lekheli libekwe ku-origin, ngamamitha empumalanga nasenyakatho kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yezindawo ezikhukhulekayo, zokuhlelwa nomhlabathi ibhalwe kuphela ukuze uyazi; ayidwetshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdatha ivela emithonjeni evulekile futhi iphethe ukuvuma kwayo ngaphansi kohlu. Ukuphakama okungakanikezwa kuyizimo, ngakho zihlole ngaphambi kokuthembela kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft ingasesha ikheli futhi igcine lokho imithombo yedatha evulekile iyaziyo ngalo ozungezile: izakhiwo ezingomakhelwane, iphashela, nemigqa yezindawo ezikhukhulekayo, zokuhlelwa nomhlabathi. ModelCraft ithatha leli fayela njengezincomo. Akukho okwengezwayo uze usho. Ukuletha ifayela Ku-CivilCraft, thumela isayithi ku-ModelCraft, noma gcina ifayela (liphela nge-.ccsite.json). Ku-ModelCraft, vula noma wehlise ifayela. Kuvuleka uhlu oluneboksi lokukhetha lesakhiwo ngasinye nephashela. Bhala ukuphakama kwezakhiwo umthombo ongazinikanga. Umugqa eceleni kwalo ubonisa ukuthi ukuphakama kuvela kuphi: inani lamazinga walo ngamamitha ayi-3 ngalinye, noma ukuphakama obukubhalile. Cindezela Engeza ezikhethiwe. Izakhiwo ezikhethiwe ziba yizinqwaba ezikhishiwe ngaphakathi kwesakhi esisodwa, nephashela libe umugqa ozungeze isayithi. Konke kuyinyathelo elilodwa lokuhlehlisa. Iphoyinti lekheli libekwe ku-origin, ngamamitha empumalanga nasenyakatho kwalo. Imigqa yezindawo ezikhukhulekayo, zokuhlelwa nomhlabathi ibhalwe kuphela ukuze uyazi; ayidwetshwa. Idatha ivela emithonjeni evulekile futhi iphethe ukuvuma kwayo ngaphansi kohlu. Ukuphakama okungakanikezwa kuyizimo, ngakho zihlole ngaphambi kokuthembela kuzo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-3d","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Lungiselela imodeli yokuprinta nge-3D","summary":"Hlola ukuthi imodeli ivaliwe futhi ibheka ngendlela efanele, bona usayizi wayo, isisekelo nokuthambekela, lungisa okungalungile, bese uyilanda njenge-STL noma 3MF ukuze isilayisi sakho sikwazi ukuyisebenzisa.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["ukuprinta nge-3d","umshini wokuprinta","ukuprinta","isilayisi","stl","3mf","ukuvalwa","manifold","solid","izimbobo","phakathi phandle","okuphambekayo","izisekelo","isisekelo","ibhedi","usayizi webhedi","millimeters","ukuthumela","ukulungisa","ukugobhoza","usayizi webhedi","oqalayo","ukujula kodonga","amathuluzi okuprinta"],"headings":[{"id":"hlola-bese-ulanda","text":"Hlola bese ulanda","level":2},{"id":"yini-ehlolwayo","text":"Yini ehlolwayo","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-izinkinga","text":"Lungisa izinkinga","level":2},{"id":"ingxenye-egobile","text":"Ingxenye egobile","level":2},{"id":"ibhedi-lomshini-wakho","text":"Ibhedi lomshini wakho","level":2},{"id":"amathuluzi-okuprinta","text":"Amathuluzi okuprinta","level":2},{"id":"akuhlolwanga","text":"Akuhlolwanga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsilayisi somshini wokuprinta sidinga isimo esivaliwe: akukho zimbobo, zonke izinhlangothi zibheke ngaphandle, akukho okudlula kuso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E ikhangela lokho ngaphambi kokuthi uyilande ifayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-bese-ulanda\"\u003EHlola bese ulanda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lokho ofuna ukukuprinta: iqembu elilodwa noma amaningi, noma amakhomponenti, noma ezinye izinhlangothi. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, konke okubonakalayo kuyaprintwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxoxo iqala ngomugqa owodwa: &quot;Ready to print&quot;, inani lezinto okufanele zilungiswe ngaphambi kokuprinta, noma inani okufanele ulibheke kuqala. Inkinga ngayinye inezingxenye ezintathu: okungalungile, kungani kubalulekile, nokufanele wenze. Kulandela usayizi ngamamilimitha, ivolumu, inani lezinxantathu nebhedi lakho lomshini wokuprinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ingxoxo idweba izinto okufanele zilungiswe, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFix what can be fixed\u003C/span\u003E (bona ngezansi). Ukuhlola kuyaphinda ngokuzenzakalela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload 3MF\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload STL\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuprintwayo yikho okubonakalayo: izinhlangothi ezifihliwe, amaqembu namakhomponenti afihliwe, nanoma yini esesihlokweni esifihliwe akufakiwe. Usayizi ukhona ngamamilimitha, iyunithi elilindelwe yizilayisi, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi imodeli ibonisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha i-3MF uma isilayisi sakho siyayifunda: igcina imibala nezinyunithi. I-STL ayinazo zombili, futhi izilayisi zicabanga ukuthi ngamamilimitha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-ehlolwayo\"\u003EYini ehlolwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zimisa ukuprinta noma zikonakalise, futhi zenze ingxoxo ithi &quot;Not ready to print&quot; (Ayilungele ukuprinta):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufanele wenze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlangothi olulodwa kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImbobo: umphetho unohlangothi ohlangothini olulodwa kanti kwelinye akukho lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba uhlangothi olusilelayo (umugqa ogqumela igebe uvame ukulivala), noma sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFix\u003C/span\u003E (ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZabelwana yizinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi zihlangana emphethweni noma udonga ngaphakathi kwe-solid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa uhlangothi wangaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi zibheka ngezindlela ezingafani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye zibheke phakathi, ezinye zibheke phandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi ezibheka phakathi bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse face\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhakathi phandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke ingxenye evaliwe ibheka ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi zayo bese uzibuyisela emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdlula kuyo yona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye eyodwa igoba idlule kuyo yona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntersect with model\u003C/span\u003E, bese ususa okungaphakathi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EIntersect faces\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi ziwumlayezo wokusengaphambili: imodeli iyaprinta, kodwa buka kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye ezihlukene ziyahlangana\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Ezihlangana ngobuso\u003C/strong\u003E: izilayisi zivame ukuzihlanganisa zibe eyodwa. Ukuze uthole ifayela elicocekile, zihlanganise nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolids\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnion\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EAmathuluzi e-solid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho okulala phansi ngokulingana\u003C/strong\u003E: phendula imodeli ukuze uhlangothi lulale ebhedini, noma isilayisi sizofaka izisekelo noma i-raft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthambekela ngaphezu kuka-45° kusukela ekumeni\u003C/strong\u003E: lezo zinhlangothi zidinga ukusekelwa. Ingxoxo ithi yiluphi uhlangothi oludingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphansi kwe-1 mm ububanzi\u003C/strong\u003E: mhlawumbe yenziwe ngeyunithi engafanele. Hlola iyunithi kubha yesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye egobile (igobolondo elivaliwe ngaphakathi kwelinye) ilungile: izinhlangothi zayo zibheke ekugobeni, nevolumu yayo iyasuswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-izinkinga\"\u003ELungisa izinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ELapho izinkinga zikhona\u003C/strong\u003E, ingxoxo ibiza iqembu ngalinye noma ikhomponenti enenkinga, ngalokho okungalungile kuyo (izinhlangothi ezikhululekile ezingekho eqenjini zilethwa njengo &quot;Faces not in a group&quot;). Ikhomponenti efakwe izikhathi eziningi ilethwa kanye: ukulungisa kuyo kulungisa wonke amakhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E ivula leliqembu bese ikhetha imiphetho nezinhlangothi ezingalungile, ukuze zibonakale zigqanyisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFix what can be fixed\u003C/span\u003E ilungisa zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa: ivala izimbobo ezinemiphetho elalayo, isusa izinhlangothi ezingaphakathi kwesimo nemiphetho edukayo, futhi iphendulela izinhlangothi ukuze zibheke ngaphandle. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakuhlehlisa. Ukuhlola kuphinda bese kubonisa okusele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungakwazi ukulungisa (imbobo enemiphetho engalali, ingxenye edlula kuyo yona) kuhlala ohlwini nalokho okufanele wenze ngesandla. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepair\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPrint tools\u003C/strong\u003E iyaqhubeka ngaphezulu: ivala izimbobo ezingalali, isusa izingcezu ezidukile nezinhlangothi eziphindwe kabili, futhi ibala konke okulungisiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003EIzisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E. Ungalungisa iqembu elilodwa ngesikhathi: likhethe, bese usebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow problems\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFix\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EAmathuluzi e-solid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ingxenye-egobile\"\u003EIngxenye egobile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHollow\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPrint tools\u003C/strong\u003E igobhoza ingxenye ngokujula kodonga okunikezayo, namabhobho okukhipha lapho uchofoza khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#hollow\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"hollow\"\u003EHollow\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngadweba ugobhoza ngokwakho: iqembu elivaliwe ngaphakathi engxenyeni, lingathintani nayo, zonke izinhlangothi zalo zibuyiselwe emuva ukuze zibheke ekugobeni. Ukuhlola kubala njengokugobhoza futhi kususa ivolumu yalo; ayilethwa njengento okufanele ilungiswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibhedi-lomshini-wakho\"\u003EIbhedi lomshini wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha usayizi webhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D printer bed\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuhlola kuyoxwayisa uma imodeli inkulu kunebhedi, noma ijikeleza noma iyiphi indlela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#3d-printer-bed\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"3d-printer-bed\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-okuprinta\"\u003EAmathuluzi okuprinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwemiphumela yengxoxo, \u003Cstrong\u003EPrint tools\u003C/strong\u003E ivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupports preview\u003C/span\u003E (lapho kuzofakwa khona izisekelo nokuthi zingaki), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall thickness\u003C/span\u003E (izindonga ezincane kakhulu zokuprinta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHollow\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepair\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003EIzisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit for printing\u003C/span\u003E inquma imodeli enkulu kakhulu ebhedini ibe izingcezu ngokuxhuma namajoyinti anamanani: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-split\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-split\"\u003EHlukanisa imodeli enkulu ukuze uyiprinte\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akuhlolwanga\"\u003EAkuhlolwanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlola akuhlukanisi: imininingwane encane embobo yakho yokuprinta engakwazi ukuyidweba nezisekelo zangempela zesilayisi sakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet#3d-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-hash=\"3d-printing\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isilayisi somshini wokuprinta sidinga isimo esivaliwe: akukho zimbobo, zonke izinhlangothi zibheke ngaphandle, akukho okudlula kuso. Export › Check for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)… ikhangela lokho ngaphambi kokuthi uyilande ifayela. Hlola bese ulanda Khetha lokho ofuna ukukuprinta: iqembu elilodwa noma amaningi, noma amakhomponenti, noma ezinye izinhlangothi. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, konke okubonakalayo kuyaprintwa. Chofoza Export eqenjini le-File, bese Check for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)…. Ingxoxo iqala ngomugqa owodwa: \"Ready to print\", inani lezinto okufanele zilungiswe ngaphambi kokuprinta, noma inani okufanele ulibheke kuqala. Inkinga ngayinye inezingxenye ezintathu: okungalungile, kungani kubalulekile, nokufanele wenze. Kulandela usayizi ngamamilimitha, ivolumu, inani lezinxantathu nebhedi lakho lomshini wokuprinta. Uma ingxoxo idweba izinto okufanele zilungiswe, chofoza Fix what can be fixed (bona ngezansi). Ukuhlola kuyaphinda ngokuzenzakalela. Chofoza Download 3MF noma Download STL. Okuprintwayo yikho okubonakalayo: izinhlangothi ezifihliwe, amaqembu namakhomponenti afihliwe, nanoma yini esesihlokweni esifihliwe akufakiwe. Usayizi ukhona ngamamilimitha, iyunithi elilindelwe yizilayisi, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi imodeli ibonisa. Khetha i-3MF uma isilayisi sakho siyayifunda: igcina imibala nezinyunithi. I-STL ayinazo zombili, futhi izilayisi zicabanga ukuthi ngamamilimitha. Yini ehlolwayo Lezi zimisa ukuprinta noma zikonakalise, futhi zenze ingxoxo ithi \"Not ready to print\" (Ayilungele ukuprinta): Inkinga Okusho Okufanele wenze Uhlangothi olulodwa kuphela Imbobo: umphetho unohlangothi ohlangothini olulodwa kanti kwelinye akukho lutho Dweba uhlangothi olusilelayo (umugqa ogqumela igebe uvame ukulivala), noma sebenzisa Fix (ngezansi) Zabelwana yizinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu Izinhlangothi zihlangana emphethweni noma udonga ngaphakathi kwe-solid Susa uhlangothi wangaphakathi Izinhlangothi zibheka ngezindlela ezingafani Ezinye zibheke phakathi, ezinye zibheke phandle Khetha izinhlangothi ezibheka phakathi bese uchofoza Reverse face ku-Entity info Phakathi phandle Yonke ingxenye evaliwe ibheka ngaphakathi Khetha izinhlangothi zayo bese uzibuyisela emuva Idlula kuyo yona Ingxenye eyodwa igoba idlule kuyo yona Edit › More › Intersect with model, bese ususa okungaphakathi. Bona Intersect faces Lezi ziwumlayezo wokusengaphambili: imodeli iyaprinta, kodwa buka kuqala. Izingxenye ezihlukene ziyahlangana, noma zihlangana ngobuso: izilayisi zivame ukuzihlanganisa zibe eyodwa. Ukuze uthole ifayela elicocekile, zihlanganise nge-Solids › Union. Bona Amathuluzi e-solid. Akukho okulala phansi ngokulingana: phendula imodeli ukuze uhlangothi lulale ebhedini, noma isilayisi sizofaka izisekelo noma i-raft. Ithambekela ngaphezu kuka-45° kusukela ekumeni: lezo zinhlangothi zidinga ukusekelwa. Ingxoxo ithi yiluphi uhlangothi oludingayo. Ngaphansi kwe-1 mm ububanzi: mhlawumbe yenziwe ngeyunithi engafanele. Hlola iyunithi kubha yesimo. Ingxenye egobile (igobolondo elivaliwe ngaphakathi kwelinye) ilungile: izinhlangothi zayo zibheke ekugobeni, nevolumu yayo iyasuswa. Lungisa izinkinga Ngaphansi kwe-Lapho izinkinga zikhona, ingxoxo ibiza iqembu ngalinye noma ikhomponenti enenkinga, ngalokho okungalungile kuyo (izinhlangothi ezikhululekile ezingekho eqenjini zilethwa njengo \"Faces not in a group\"). Ikhomponenti efakwe izikhathi eziningi ilethwa kanye: ukulungisa kuyo kulungisa wonke amakhophi. Show ivula leliqembu bese ikhetha imiphetho nezinhlangothi ezingalungile, ukuze zibonakale zigqanyisiwe. Fix what can be fixed ilungisa zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa: ivala izimbobo ezinemiphetho elalayo, isusa izinhlangothi ezingaphakathi kwesimo nemiphetho edukayo, futhi iphendulela izinhlangothi ukuze zibheke ngaphandle. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyakuhlehlisa. Ukuhlola kuphinda bese kubonisa okusele. Okungakwazi ukulungisa (imbobo enemiphetho engalali, ingxenye edlula kuyo yona) kuhlala ohlwini nalokho okufanele wenze ngesandla. Repair ngaphansi kwe-Print tools iyaqhubeka ngaphezulu: ivala izimbobo ezingalali, isusa izingcezu ezidukile nezinhlangothi eziphindwe kabili, futhi ibala konke okulungisiwe. Bona Izisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa. Ungalungisa iqembu elilodwa ngesikhathi: likhethe, bese usebenzisa Show problems no-Fix ku-Entity info. Bona Amathuluzi e-solid. Ingxenye egobile Hollow ngaphansi kwe-Print tools igobhoza ingxenye ngokujula kodonga okunikezayo, namabhobho okukhipha lapho uchofoza khona. Bona Hollow. Ungadweba ugobhoza ngokwakho: iqembu elivaliwe ngaphakathi engxenyeni, lingathintani nayo, zonke izinhlangothi zalo zibuyiselwe emuva ukuze zibheke ekugobeni. Ukuhlola kubala njengokugobhoza futhi kususa ivolumu yalo; ayilethwa njengento okufanele ilungiswe. Ibhedi lomshini wakho Khetha usayizi webhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta ku-Settings › ModelCraft › 3D printer bed. Ukuhlola kuyoxwayisa uma imodeli inkulu kunebhedi, noma ijikeleza noma iyiphi indlela. Bona Izilungiselelo. Amathuluzi okuprinta Ngaphansi kwemiphumela yengxoxo, Print tools ivula Supports preview (lapho kuzofakwa khona izisekelo nokuthi zingaki), Wall thickness (izindonga ezincane kakhulu zokuprinta), Hollow no-Repair. Bona Izisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa. Split for printing inquma imodeli enkulu kakhulu ebhedini ibe izingcezu ngokuxhuma namajoyinti anamanani: bona Hlukanisa imodeli enkulu ukuze uyiprinte. Akuhlolwanga Ukuhlola akuhlukanisi: imininingwane encane embobo yakho yokuprinta engakwazi ukuyidweba nezisekelo zangempela zesilayisi sakho. Bona Akukakwakhiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"import-3dm-files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ngenisa imodeli ye-.3dm","summary":"Ngenisa ifayela le-.3dm ngama-mesh, izindawo, amajika, amablokhi, izingqimba nemibala; ama-triangle avela kuphi, nalokho okushiywayo.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["3dm","ngenisa","nurbs","polysurface","brep","izindawo","render mesh","extrusion","amajika","amablokhi","izingqimba","amathegi","imibala","amayunithi","ukushintsha","dlulisa"],"headings":[{"id":"ngenisa-ifayela","text":"Ngenisa ifayela","level":2},{"id":"ama-triangle-avela-kuphi","text":"Ama-triangle avela kuphi","level":2},{"id":"okufika","text":"Okufika","level":2},{"id":"okushiywayo-nokutshelwa","text":"Okushiywayo (nokutshelwa)","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ifunda amafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ngomfundi wayo, ekhasini. Ayikho into elayishwa, futhi isebenza ngaphandle kuxhumo uma i-ModelCraft isebenza. Amafayela alondolozwe ngezakhiwo zenguqulo 5, 6, 7 kanye 8 ahlolwe; amadala (enguqulo 2 kuya ku-4) kufanele avule, kodwa awazanywanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa-ifayela\"\u003ENgenisa ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E (noma ushiye ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ku-3D view).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Ifunda chair.3dm…&quot; ngenkathi lifunda, bese kuthi okufike, isibonelo &quot;Ingenisiwe chair.3dm: ama-mesh angu-14 (izinhlangothi ezingu-8330), amajika angu-8, ukubekwa kwamablokhi angu-5, izingqimba ezingu-3 njengamathegi. Izindawo: izinhlangothi ezingu-7 kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe efayelini, ezingu-29 ezihlelwe yi-CadCraft.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela, likhethiwe, futhi umbono uyasondela kulo. Ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyakususa konke futhi, kubandakanya namathegi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-triangle-avela-kuphi\"\u003EAma-triangle avela kuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft imodela ngezinhlangothi nama-mesh, ngakho yonke indawo efayelini ifika njengo-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E wama-triangle amancane aphansi. Ngakho uhlangothi ngalunye lwe-polysurface (nanoma yiyiphi i-extrusion) i-ModelCraft ithatha, ngalolu hlelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-render mesh egcinwe efayelini.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo eziningi zokumodela zigcina i-mesh ebonakale esikrinini nendawo ngayinye; uma ikhona, i-ModelCraft iyisebenzisa njengoba iyunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlelwa kwayo\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ifayela lingenayo i-mesh egciniwe: amapulani, izindawo ze-NURBS, izindawo zokuzungeza (amasfiya, amakhoni, amatorasi, izimo zokutshiza), amajika e-extrusion namaextrusion (nezimbobo nezigqoko zawo), eqoshwe ngemiphetho yawo. Izinhlangothi ze-polysurface eyodwa zabelana ngamaphoyinti emiphetho yazo, ngakho i-polysurface evaliwe ifika njengo-mesh ovaliwe. Izindawo ezigobile zihlukaniswa kuze kufike ama-triangle asemkhakheni ongaba ngu-0.15 % wosayizi wento kumsebenzi weqiniso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELutho\u003C/strong\u003E, kuhlangothi lohlobo lwendawo ModelCraft ingakafundi. Ibha yesimo ithi izinhlangothi ezingakanani, nezinhlobo zazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ethi &quot;Izindawo:&quot; yebha yesimo ithi izinhlangothi ezingakanani zifike kusuka kuma-mesh agciniwe, nezingakanani i-ModelCraft ezihlelile. Imiphetho ephakathi kwehlangothi elilodwa lefayela iyathamba, nemiphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ibukhali, ngakho uhlangothi oluyizigoba lubonakala lubushelelezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthole izimo ezithembekile kakhulu, londoloza ifayela ngama-render mesh ohlelweni olwenze ifayela (ngokuvamile kuyisimo esizenzakalelayo; inketho ethi &quot;save small&quot; iyawakhipha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufika\"\u003EOkufika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/strong\u003E namavertex colors kanye nokuhlelwa kokuthungo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-polysurface, izindawo nama-extrusion\u003C/strong\u003E, njengoba kuchaziwe ngenhla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E (imigqa, ama-polyline, amasiyeliki, izindilinga, amajika e-NURBS namajika ahlanganisiwe kuwo) njengo-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Emphetho\u003C/a\u003E, iqembu lemiphetho ngalinye lengqimba ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmablokhi\u003C/strong\u003E aba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Eizakhi\u003C/a\u003E: yonke indawo yokubekwa kwebhlokhi ibekwa kwesakhi esisodwa, ngakho ukuhlela ikhophi eyodwa kushintsha zonke. Amablokhi angaphakathi kwamablokhi ayagcinwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/strong\u003E zaba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Eamathegi\u003C/a\u003E egama lonke elingqimba (&quot;Furniture::Chairs&quot;), zifihliwe uma ingqimba yayivaliwe. Ukubekwa kwento ngayinye kuthwele ithegi lengqimba yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibala.\u003C/strong\u003E Umbala wento uvela lapho ifayela litshela khona: umbala wayo siqu, owengqimba yayo, noma umbala oyisisekelo wombala wayo. Uba upende wezinhlangothi zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe zifika zifihliwe\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E iyazibonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi:\u003C/strong\u003E ifayela litshela iyunithi yalo; imodeli ifika ngosayizi wayo wangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okushiywayo-nokutshelwa\"\u003EOkushiywayo (nokutshelwa)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ethi &quot;Izaziso:&quot; yebha yesimo iqamba konke okungafikanga, ngenani lalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamaphoyinti namafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, amachashazi wombhalo, izilinganiso, abahlinzeki, amahatch, izibane, izindiza zokusika nemininingwane yesakhiwo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinto ze-SubD: zishintshe zibe ama-mesh noma ama-polysurface ohlelweni olwenze ifayela kuqala;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinhlangothi zezindawo ezishintshiwe nezinye izinhlobo zezindawo ModelCraft ingakafundi, lapho ifayela lingagcinanga i-mesh yazo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamablokhi axhunywe kumafayela amanye (kufundwa ifayela olungenisa kuphela);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eama-extrusion aneziphetho ezithambekile (ezimitered) afika neziphetho ezisikwe ngesikwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto zomumo zokuhlobisa (materials) azifundwa, nezilungiselelo zokurenda, imibono egatshiwe, amaqembu nombhalo womsebenzisi azifundwa; impahla inikeza umbala wayo oyisisekelo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela angafika ku-300 MB. Ifayela elonakele lisho ukuthi kuyini okungalungile futhi alungezi lutho; into eyodwa engafundeki iyashiywa futhi ibalwe, abanye bafike.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft ifunda amafayela e-.3dm ngomfundi wayo, ekhasini. Ayikho into elayishwa, futhi isebenza ngaphandle kuxhumo uma i-ModelCraft isebenza. Amafayela alondolozwe ngezakhiwo zenguqulo 5, 6, 7 kanye 8 ahlolwe; amadala (enguqulo 2 kuya ku-4) kufanele avule, kodwa awazanywanga. Ngenisa ifayela Chofoza Import eqenjini File (noma ushiye ifayela le-.3dm ku-3D view). Khetha ifayela. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ifunda chair.3dm…\" ngenkathi lifunda, bese kuthi okufike, isibonelo \"Ingenisiwe chair.3dm: ama-mesh angu-14 (izinhlangothi ezingu-8330), amajika angu-8, ukubekwa kwamablokhi angu-5, izingqimba ezingu-3 njengamathegi. Izindawo: izinhlangothi ezingu-7 kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe efayelini, ezingu-29 ezihlelwe yi-CadCraft.\" Imodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela, likhethiwe, futhi umbono uyasondela kulo. Ukucindezela Ctrl+Z kuyakususa konke futhi, kubandakanya namathegi. Ama-triangle avela kuphi I-ModelCraft imodela ngezinhlangothi nama-mesh, ngakho yonke indawo efayelini ifika njengo-mesh wama-triangle amancane aphansi. Ngakho uhlangothi ngalunye lwe-polysurface (nanoma yiyiphi i-extrusion) i-ModelCraft ithatha, ngalolu hlelo: I-render mesh egcinwe efayelini. Izinhlelo eziningi zokumodela zigcina i-mesh ebonakale esikrinini nendawo ngayinye; uma ikhona, i-ModelCraft iyisebenzisa njengoba iyunjalo. Ukuhlelwa kwayo, uma ifayela lingenayo i-mesh egciniwe: amapulani, izindawo ze-NURBS, izindawo zokuzungeza (amasfiya, amakhoni, amatorasi, izimo zokutshiza), amajika e-extrusion namaextrusion (nezimbobo nezigqoko zawo), eqoshwe ngemiphetho yawo. Izinhlangothi ze-polysurface eyodwa zabelana ngamaphoyinti emiphetho yazo, ngakho i-polysurface evaliwe ifika njengo-mesh ovaliwe. Izindawo ezigobile zihlukaniswa kuze kufike ama-triangle asemkhakheni ongaba ngu-0.15 % wosayizi wento kumsebenzi weqiniso. Lutho, kuhlangothi lohlobo lwendawo ModelCraft ingakafundi. Ibha yesimo ithi izinhlangothi ezingakanani, nezinhlobo zazo. Ingxenye ethi \"Izindawo:\" yebha yesimo ithi izinhlangothi ezingakanani zifike kusuka kuma-mesh agciniwe, nezingakanani i-ModelCraft ezihlelile. Imiphetho ephakathi kwehlangothi elilodwa lefayela iyathamba, nemiphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ibukhali, ngakho uhlangothi oluyizigoba lubonakala lubushelelezi. Ukuze uthole izimo ezithembekile kakhulu, londoloza ifayela ngama-render mesh ohlelweni olwenze ifayela (ngokuvamile kuyisimo esizenzakalelayo; inketho ethi \"save small\" iyawakhipha). Okufika Ama-mesh namavertex colors kanye nokuhlelwa kokuthungo. Ama-polysurface, izindawo nama-extrusion, njengoba kuchaziwe ngenhla. Amajika (imigqa, ama-polyline, amasiyeliki, izindilinga, amajika e-NURBS namajika ahlanganisiwe kuwo) njengo-mphetho, iqembu lemiphetho ngalinye lengqimba ngayinye. Amablokhi aba izakhi: yonke indawo yokubekwa kwebhlokhi ibekwa kwesakhi esisodwa, ngakho ukuhlela ikhophi eyodwa kushintsha zonke. Amablokhi angaphakathi kwamablokhi ayagcinwa. Izingqimba zaba amathegi egama lonke elingqimba (\"Furniture::Chairs\"), zifihliwe uma ingqimba yayivaliwe. Ukubekwa kwento ngayinye kuthwele ithegi lengqimba yayo. Imibala. Umbala wento uvela lapho ifayela litshela khona: umbala wayo siqu, owengqimba yayo, noma umbala oyisisekelo wombala wayo. Uba upende wezinhlangothi zayo. Izinto ezifihliwe zifika zifihliwe; Unhide all iyazibonisa. Amayunithi: ifayela litshela iyunithi yalo; imodeli ifika ngosayizi wayo wangempela. Okushiywayo (nokutshelwa) Ingxenye ethi \"Izaziso:\" yebha yesimo iqamba konke okungafikanga, ngenani lalo: amaphoyinti namafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, amachashazi wombhalo, izilinganiso, abahlinzeki, amahatch, izibane, izindiza zokusika nemininingwane yesakhiwo; izinto ze-SubD: zishintshe zibe ama-mesh noma ama-polysurface ohlelweni olwenze ifayela kuqala; izinhlangothi zezindawo ezishintshiwe nezinye izinhlobo zezindawo ModelCraft ingakafundi, lapho ifayela lingagcinanga i-mesh yazo; amablokhi axhunywe kumafayela amanye (kufundwa ifayela olungenisa kuphela); ama-extrusion aneziphetho ezithambekile (ezimitered) afika neziphetho ezisikwe ngesikwele. Izinto zomumo zokuhlobisa (materials) azifundwa, nezilungiselelo zokurenda, imibono egatshiwe, amaqembu nombhalo womsebenzisi azifundwa; impahla inikeza umbala wayo oyisisekelo kuphela. Imikhawulo Amafayela angafika ku-300 MB. Ifayela elonakele lisho ukuthi kuyini okungalungile futhi alungezi lutho; into eyodwa engafundeki iyashiywa futhi ibalwe, abanye bafike.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"live-3dm-link","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Gcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila","summary":"Shintsha imodeli ohlelweni olwayenza futhi ubone ukuthi iyashintsha lapha, kusuka ku-Rhino 8 noma kusuka ku-Grasshopper definition, ngaphandle kokulondoloza nokungenisa futhi.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["rhino","grasshopper","uxhumano oluphilayo","uxhumano oluphilayo","3dm","nurbs","ipharamitha","uxhumano","sync","iskripthi","imodeli yesethenjwa","push"],"headings":[{"id":"ukusetha","text":"Ukusetha","level":2},{"id":"kusuka-ku-rhino","text":"Kusuka ku-Rhino","level":2},{"id":"kusuka-ku-grasshopper","text":"Kusuka ku-Grasshopper","level":2},{"id":"okungenziwa-ngeqembu","text":"Okungenziwa ngeqembu","level":2},{"id":"okufika","text":"Okufika","level":2},{"id":"uma-kukhona-okungahambi-kahle","text":"Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQhubeka wenza lapho owenza khona imodeli, usebenzise umphumela lapha: ukuwurenda, ukuwukhanyisa, noma ukuhlela isigcawu ngawo. Yonke inguquko kolunye uhlelo ibuyekeza iqembu elilodwa ku-ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUxhumano ludinga \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kulo mshini ofanayo. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuthatha uxhumano. Akukho okudluliselwa ku-inthanethi: iskripthi sixoxa ne-Studio ekheleni lalo mshini, ngethokheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELolu xhumano luhlolwe nomlobi wefayela weskripthi kanye nesiyisimeleli sesinye uhlelo, hhayi ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper ngokwazo. Uma kukhona okungasebenzi lapho, sitshele okutshilo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusetha\"\u003EUkusetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Studio, vula ModelCraft. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI namaskripthi basebenzise ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Studio, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect an assistant\u003C/span\u003E. Ibonisa ikheli nethokheni ozoyinamathisela ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanda iskripthi: \u003Ca href=\"https://getcadcraft.com/assets/link3dm/cadcraft_link.py\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusuka-ku-rhino\"\u003EKusuka ku-Rhino\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalisa \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E kumhleli weskripthi we-Rhino (Python 3 ku-Rhino 8).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkokuqala, namathisela ikheli nethokheni. Zigcinwa ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-link.json\u003C/code\u003E efolda yakho yasekhaya, hhayi emodelini. Studio yenza ithokheni elisha lapho iqala ngalinye, ngakho iskripthi sizobuza futhi ngalesosikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lombhalo, njengesibonelo &quot;chair (linked)&quot;. Emva kwalokho, ushintsho ngalunye luyafika uma uyama isikhashana, futhi kuthunyelwa izinto ezishintshile kuphela. Qalisa iskripthi futhi ukuze umise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusuka-ku-grasshopper\"\u003EKusuka ku-Grasshopper\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalisa iskripthi kanye ku-Rhino kuqala, ukuze ikheli nethokheni zigcinwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza ingxenye ye-Script (Python 3) bese unamathisela \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E yonke kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInikeze lezi zokufaka: \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E (ijiyometri, ngokufinyelela kohlu), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (igama, elingadingekile), \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E (i-boolean toggle), kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003ETarget\u003C/code\u003E (engadingekile: \u003Ccode\u003Emodel\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, uma zombili izinhlelo zivuliwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E ibe true.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsixazululo ngasinye sithumela \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E bese sishintsha okuthunyelwe yingxenye ngesikhathi esedlule, ngakho ukudonsa isilayidi kubuyekeza leli qembu lapha. Okuphumayo kwayo \u003Ccode\u003Ea\u003C/code\u003E kuveza okwenzekile. Ingxenye ngayinye ineqembu layo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungenziwa-ngeqembu\"\u003EOkungenziwa ngeqembu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELisuse, lithegile, wakhe ngalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Lapho ubeka khona iqembu nethegi yalo kuhlala kuyo yonke imibuyekezo, njalo nakho konke okuseceleni kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUngahleli phakathi kwalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Imibuyekezo ngayinye ithatha indawo yakho konke okuphakathi kwalo qembu. Izinto zalo zingezalolunye uhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlehlisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Imibuyekezo engaphakathi kwamasekhondi amabili kwenye yenye yabelana ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha lonke ukudonsa. Imibuyekezo elandelayo ibuyisa imodeli ukuthi ifane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela elilondoloziwe ligcina uxhumano. Qalisa iskripthi futhi uma uvula kabusha, leli qembu elifanayo liyabuyekezeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufika\"\u003EOkufika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-mesh, ama-polysurface, ama-surface kanye nama-extrusion njengemesh oyibonayo esikrinini, i-SubD njengemesh yayo, amagophe njengemiphetho, amabhlokhi njengezinto ezihlukene lapho ezimi khona (hhayi njengezingxenye), amalayini njengamathegi, imibala nemiqondo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole ukuthi lezo zinto zivela kanjani lapha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkushiyiwe, nenani kolunye uhlelo: amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso nokufana nalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuhlangothi olulodwa kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Ushintsho lapha aluyi kolunye uhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kukhona-okungahambi-kahle\"\u003EUma kukhona okungahambi kahle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;No ModelCraft or PartCraft window allows it&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E yenza isinyathelo 1 sokusetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Studio refused the token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E i-Studio iqalisiwe kabusha. Kopisha ithokheni elisha bese uqalisa iskripthi futhi. Ku-Grasshopper, qalisa kuqala ku-Rhino.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Cannot reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E i-Studio ayisebenzi, noma ikheli lishintshile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qhubeka wenza lapho owenza khona imodeli, usebenzise umphumela lapha: ukuwurenda, ukuwukhanyisa, noma ukuhlela isigcawu ngawo. Yonke inguquko kolunye uhlelo ibuyekeza iqembu elilodwa ku-ModelCraft. Uxhumano ludinga CadCraft Studio kulo mshini ofanayo. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuthatha uxhumano. Akukho okudluliselwa ku-inthanethi: iskripthi sixoxa ne-Studio ekheleni lalo mshini, ngethokheni. Lolu xhumano luhlolwe nomlobi wefayela weskripthi kanye nesiyisimeleli sesinye uhlelo, hhayi ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper ngokwazo. Uma kukhona okungasebenzi lapho, sitshele okutshilo. Ukusetha Ku-Studio, vula ModelCraft. Ku-Settings › ModelCraft › Assistants, thikha Vumela abasizi be-AI namaskripthi basebenzise ModelCraft, bese Hlela. Ku-Studio, khetha Connect an assistant. Ibonisa ikheli nethokheni ozoyinamathisela ngezansi. Landa iskripthi: cadcraft_link.py. Kusuka ku-Rhino Qalisa cadcraft_link.py kumhleli weskripthi we-Rhino (Python 3 ku-Rhino 8). Okokuqala, namathisela ikheli nethokheni. Zigcinwa ku-.cadcraft-link.json efolda yakho yasekhaya, hhayi emodelini. Studio yenza ithokheni elisha lapho iqala ngalinye, ngakho iskripthi sizobuza futhi ngalesosikhathi. Imodeli yonke ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lombhalo, njengesibonelo \"chair (linked)\". Emva kwalokho, ushintsho ngalunye luyafika uma uyama isikhashana, futhi kuthunyelwa izinto ezishintshile kuphela. Qalisa iskripthi futhi ukuze umise. Kusuka ku-Grasshopper Qalisa iskripthi kanye ku-Rhino kuqala, ukuze ikheli nethokheni zigcinwe. Engeza ingxenye ye-Script (Python 3) bese unamathisela cadcraft_link.py yonke kuyo. Inikeze lezi zokufaka: G (ijiyometri, ngokufinyelela kohlu), N (igama, elingadingekile), On (i-boolean toggle), kanye ne-Target (engadingekile: model noma part, uma zombili izinhlelo zivuliwe). Shintsha On ibe true. Isixazululo ngasinye sithumela G bese sishintsha okuthunyelwe yingxenye ngesikhathi esedlule, ngakho ukudonsa isilayidi kubuyekeza leli qembu lapha. Okuphumayo kwayo a kuveza okwenzekile. Ingxenye ngayinye ineqembu layo. Okungenziwa ngeqembu Lisuse, lithegile, wakhe ngalo. Lapho ubeka khona iqembu nethegi yalo kuhlala kuyo yonke imibuyekezo, njalo nakho konke okuseceleni kwalo. Ungahleli phakathi kwalo. Imibuyekezo ngayinye ithatha indawo yakho konke okuphakathi kwalo qembu. Izinto zalo zingezalolunye uhlelo. Hlehlisa. Imibuyekezo engaphakathi kwamasekhondi amabili kwenye yenye yabelana ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, ngakho Ctrl+Z ithatha lonke ukudonsa. Imibuyekezo elandelayo ibuyisa imodeli ukuthi ifane. Londoloza. Ifayela elilondoloziwe ligcina uxhumano. Qalisa iskripthi futhi uma uvula kabusha, leli qembu elifanayo liyabuyekezeka. Okufika Ama-mesh, ama-polysurface, ama-surface kanye nama-extrusion njengemesh oyibonayo esikrinini, i-SubD njengemesh yayo, amagophe njengemiphetho, amabhlokhi njengezinto ezihlukene lapho ezimi khona (hhayi njengezingxenye), amalayini njengamathegi, imibala nemiqondo. Bona Ngenisa imodeli ye-.3dm ukuze uthole ukuthi lezo zinto zivela kanjani lapha. Okushiyiwe, nenani kolunye uhlelo: amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso nokufana nalokho. Kuhlangothi olulodwa kuphela. Ushintsho lapha aluyi kolunye uhlelo. Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle \"No ModelCraft or PartCraft window allows it\": yenza isinyathelo 1 sokusetha. \"Studio refused the token\": i-Studio iqalisiwe kabusha. Kopisha ithokheni elisha bese uqalisa iskripthi futhi. Ku-Grasshopper, qalisa kuqala ku-Rhino. \"Cannot reach CadCraft Studio\": i-Studio ayisebenzi, noma ikheli lishintshile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-tools","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa","summary":"Bona lapho ukuprinta kudinga izisekelo nokuthi zingaki cishe, thola izindonga ezincane kakhulu ukuze ziprintwe, gobhoza ingxenye ngobukhulu bodonga namabhodlela okukhipha, bese ulungisa imeshi ngazo zonke izinguquko ezidwetshiwe.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["ukuprinta nge-3d","izisekelo","ukubuka kuqala kwezisekelo","ukuthambeka","izisekelo zekholomu","izisekelo zomuthi","ukujula kodonga","izindonga ezincane","kuncane kakhulu","inozzle","gobhoza","ukugobhoza","igobolondo","imbobo yokukhipha","resin","lungisa","lungisa imeshi","non-manifold","izinhlangothi ezigujiwe","izimbobo","izigaxa ezincane","ukuzihlanganisa","ukugcwala","hlanganisa"],"headings":[{"id":"ukubuka-kuqala-kwezisekelo","text":"Ukubuka kuqala kwezisekelo","level":2},{"id":"ukujula-kodonga","text":"Ukujula kodonga","level":2},{"id":"gobhoza","text":"Gobhoza","level":2},{"id":"lungisa","text":"Lungisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi amane okulungisa imodeli ukuze ilungele umprinta we-3D. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E; umugqa \u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi okuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E wengxoxo unawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kuqala kwezisekelo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula kodonga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E. Ngalinye livulwa njengekhadi phezu kombono; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E (isiphambano) iyalithatha kanye nezimaka zalo. Ikhadi elilodwa liyavela ngesikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgalinye lamathuluzi lisebenza kokuzoprintwa: ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonakalayo uma kungekho okukhethiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E zidinga iqembu elilodwa, ingxenye noma imeshi ekhethiwe, ngoba ziyayishintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kuqala-kwezisekelo\"\u003EUkubuka kuqala kwezisekelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlangothi ezihlehla ngaphezu kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Eingeli yesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E ukusuka ezansi zishadiwe zibomvu, futhi izisekelo ezilula zidwetshwa kuzo (ziorenji) zisehla zifike ebhedini, noma engxenyeni yemodeli ephansi kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngeli yesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E: u-45° yilokho abaprinta abaningi abakwazi ngaphandle kwesisekelo. Ikhuphule kumprinta ohlanganisa kahle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakholomu\u003C/strong\u003E: ikholomu eliqondile njalo ngama-3 mm ngaphansi kwalo lonke ukuhlehla. Isilinganiso sibala kuzo njengephethini yesisekelo esingu-15%.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmuthi\u003C/strong\u003E: amaphuzu aseduze ahlangana ngesiqu esisodwa ngaphansi kwesikhungo sawo; akukho ihlahla elithambekela ngaphezu kuka-45°. Imithi ivame ukuthatha impahla encane, futhi ithinte ibhedi ngezindawo ezimbalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhadi liyasho ukuthi yingakanani indawo edinga isisekelo, amaphuzu esisekelo angaki kanye nencazelo yempahla athathayo cishe. Izisekelo ezimi emodelini (hhayi ebhedini) ziyabalwa: zishiya izimpawu lapho. Uma ibhedi yomprinta ikhethiwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, ibhedi idwetshwa ngaphansi kwemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuwukubuka kuqala, hhayi isilayisi: isilayisi sakho sinquma izisekelo zangempela. Ku-overhang enkulu kakhulu amaphuzu esisekelo ahlakazwa kabanzi ukuze ukubuka kuqala kuhlale kusheshile; ikhadi liyasho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukujula-kodonga\"\u003EUkujula kodonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye indawo ilinganiswa ngomugqa oqondile ngaphakathi kwesolid uye ohlangothini olunye. Izindonga ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Eudonga oluncane kakhulu olwavunyelwe\u003C/strong\u003E zibomvu, nezindonga ngaphansi kwesigamu esingu-1.5 esiyikho zithi ziorenji: ziyaprintwa, kodwa zingaphuma ziwuncane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo ezincane zohlu, eziphansi kakhulu kuqala, nokuthi zincane kangakanani nokuthi zikhulu kangakanani ngayinye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E iphendulela ikhamera kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmprinta akakwazi ukwenza udonga lube lincane kakhulu kunamabili amabili ububanzi enozzle yakhe: i-0.8 mm yenozzle evamile engu-0.4 mm (ukuqala). Abaprinta be-resin bakwazi okuncane; hlola incwadi yomprinta wakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKumodeli enkulu kakhulu kuphela ezinye izinhlangothi ziyakhipha umsebenzi womkhondo wokukala, nezinye zithatha ukujula kwomakhelwane bazo; ikhadi liyasho ukuthi bangaki ebalinganiswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gobhoza\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugobhoza kugcina ingaphandle njengalo, kususe ingaphakathi, kushiye izindonga zibe ngokujula ofisa kona. Iziprinto ze-resin zisebenzisa i-resin encane futhi zikhwezisa kancane ipuleti lokwakha; iziprinto zefilamenti zisebenzisa iplastiki encane kunokuthi i-infill ingakwenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu, ingxenye noma imeshi, bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eudonga\u003C/strong\u003E (2 mm ukuqala) nokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eizimbobo zokukhipha\u003C/strong\u003E zibanzi kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uprinte nge-resin, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka imbobo yokukhipha\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza ingaphandle kwemodeli lapho kufanele khona: phansi, eduze nepuleti lokwakha, ukuze i-resin ehlanzekile iphume. Beka izimbobo eziningi njengoba udinga; ngayinye iboniswa njengesekhethe elibhlowu futhi iyafakwa ohlwini ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kuqala\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa ukuthi ukugobhoza kukhipha kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhumula kona\u003C/span\u003E yenza ushintsho: isinyathelo esisodwa esinqanyulwa yi-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyisisombululo esisodwa esivaliwe ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D kuyavuma: i-ModelCraft iyahlola kuqala futhi ayishintshi lutho uma ingadlula. Lapho imodeli incane kunezindonga ezimbili, ihlala iqinile. Umphumela uyiqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezicwebile zibe yizinhlangothi ezisodwa, ngakho ungayiqhubeka ngayo ngokumodela nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E; ingxenye ecijile egobhozwe ku-grid enhle ngokuvamile inezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu kulokho futhi iba imeshi, nomugqa wesimo ukhombisa lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzimweni eziningi ingaphakathi kuwukuthi ingaphandle ihanjiswe ngaphakathi ngobukhulu bodonga kanye. Lapho amakhona noma izingxenye ezincane zenza lokho kungenzeki, i-ModelCraft ilandela ingaphandle ebugcaweni bodonga kugridi enhle; ikhadi bese liyasho ukuthi iseduze kangakanani (kuya ngengxenye yemilimitha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E ibheka ingxenye ekhethiwe ngendlela isilayisi somprinta esiyibheka ngayo, ilungise lokho okungalungiswa ngokuphepha, futhi ibhale yonke into elungisiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho kusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanxantathu angenayo indawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eayashiywa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnxantathu odwetshwe kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekugcinwa ikhophi eyodwa; izinhlangothi ezihlanganisiwe ngemuva nangaphambili zigcinwa ngeqembu ngaphandle kobukhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingcezu ezikhululekile ezingaphansi kuka-0.5 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eziyasuswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnxantathu obheke kabi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Euyaphendulwa ukuze ulingane nomakhelwane wawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimbobo, ezicwebile noma cha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eziyavalwa ngomuthi wonxantathu abasha ngasenkabeni yembobo ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngcezu ephenduke ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphenduke ngaphandle (imbobo esesingaphakathi kwenye ingcezu iyashiywa njengoba kunjalo: ihloselwe ukubheka ngaphakathi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa ezephephile\u003C/span\u003E yenza konke kwesinyathelo esisodwa esinqanyulwa yi-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, futhi umugqa wesimo uhlu lwakho lonke ngalunye. Ingxenye elungisiwe iba yiqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezicwebile zibe yizinhlangothi ezisodwa. Uma ingakavaleki (okuthile ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkushiyelwe wena\u003C/strong\u003E kuseyiko), noma ingaba nezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu zeqembu, iba yimeshi: izinhlangothi zayo zihlala zinxantathu, nezinhlangothi ezicwebile zisabonakala zicwebile. Umugqa wesimo uyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa izingxenye ezihlanganayo\u003C/span\u003E isebenza ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungalungiswa ngokuphepha kudwetshwe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkushiyelwe wena\u003C/strong\u003E futhi kumakwe ngempunga embonweni, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana\u003C/strong\u003E: nquma ukuthi iyiphi inhlangothi yalo, bese ususa ezinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngcezu edlula kuyo yona\u003C/strong\u003E: hambisa noma dweba kabusha leyo ngxenye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EHlanganisa izinhlangothi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimbobo ezinkulu kakhulu noma ezixakile ukuvala\u003C/strong\u003E: dweba izinhlangothi kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingcezu ezihlukene ezihlanganayo\u003C/strong\u003E: izilayisi ziyazihlanganisa noma kunjalo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa izingxenye ezihlanganayo\u003C/span\u003E iyenza umzimba owodwa ovaliwe (ikha kabusha izinhlangothi lapho zihlangana, ngakho iyinkinobho ehlukile, ingenzeki wena ngaphandle kokuthi wena uyicindezele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgamaqembu okusunduza/hudula ungalungisa okunye ngesikhathi kuku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa izinkinga\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E, okugcina izinhlangothi owazidweba. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EAmathuluzi asezingeni eliqinile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungisa imodeli ukuze ilungele ukuprinta nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EIsitayela sabaqalayo\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet#3d-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-hash=\"3d-printing\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amathuluzi amane okulungisa imodeli ukuze ilungele umprinta we-3D. Vula Khipha › Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…; umugqa Amathuluzi okuprinta wengxoxo unawo Ukubuka kuqala kwezisekelo, Ukujula kodonga, Gobhoza kanye Lungisa. Ngalinye livulwa njengekhadi phezu kombono; Vala (isiphambano) iyalithatha kanye nezimaka zalo. Ikhadi elilodwa liyavela ngesikhathi. Ngalinye lamathuluzi lisebenza kokuzoprintwa: ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonakalayo uma kungekho okukhethiwe. Gobhoza kanye Lungisa zidinga iqembu elilodwa, ingxenye noma imeshi ekhethiwe, ngoba ziyayishintsha. Ukubuka kuqala kwezisekelo Izinhlangothi ezihlehla ngaphezu kwe-ingeli yesisekelo ukusuka ezansi zishadiwe zibomvu, futhi izisekelo ezilula zidwetshwa kuzo (ziorenji) zisehla zifike ebhedini, noma engxenyeni yemodeli ephansi kwazo. Ingeli yesisekelo: u-45° yilokho abaprinta abaningi abakwazi ngaphandle kwesisekelo. Ikhuphule kumprinta ohlanganisa kahle. Amakholomu: ikholomu eliqondile njalo ngama-3 mm ngaphansi kwalo lonke ukuhlehla. Isilinganiso sibala kuzo njengephethini yesisekelo esingu-15%. Umuthi: amaphuzu aseduze ahlangana ngesiqu esisodwa ngaphansi kwesikhungo sawo; akukho ihlahla elithambekela ngaphezu kuka-45°. Imithi ivame ukuthatha impahla encane, futhi ithinte ibhedi ngezindawo ezimbalwa. Ikhadi liyasho ukuthi yingakanani indawo edinga isisekelo, amaphuzu esisekelo angaki kanye nencazelo yempahla athathayo cishe. Izisekelo ezimi emodelini (hhayi ebhedini) ziyabalwa: zishiya izimpawu lapho. Uma ibhedi yomprinta ikhethiwe ku-Izilungiselelo, ibhedi idwetshwa ngaphansi kwemodeli. Lokhu kuwukubuka kuqala, hhayi isilayisi: isilayisi sakho sinquma izisekelo zangempela. Ku-overhang enkulu kakhulu amaphuzu esisekelo ahlakazwa kabanzi ukuze ukubuka kuqala kuhlale kusheshile; ikhadi liyasho lokho. Ukujula kodonga Ngayinye indawo ilinganiswa ngomugqa oqondile ngaphakathi kwesolid uye ohlangothini olunye. Izindonga ngaphansi kwe-udonga oluncane kakhulu olwavunyelwe zibomvu, nezindonga ngaphansi kwesigamu esingu-1.5 esiyikho zithi ziorenji: ziyaprintwa, kodwa zingaphuma ziwuncane. Izindawo ezincane zohlu, eziphansi kakhulu kuqala, nokuthi zincane kangakanani nokuthi zikhulu kangakanani ngayinye. Bonisa iphendulela ikhamera kuzo. Umprinta akakwazi ukwenza udonga lube lincane kakhulu kunamabili amabili ububanzi enozzle yakhe: i-0.8 mm yenozzle evamile engu-0.4 mm (ukuqala). Abaprinta be-resin bakwazi okuncane; hlola incwadi yomprinta wakho. Kumodeli enkulu kakhulu kuphela ezinye izinhlangothi ziyakhipha umsebenzi womkhondo wokukala, nezinye zithatha ukujula kwomakhelwane bazo; ikhadi liyasho ukuthi bangaki ebalinganiswe. Gobhoza Ukugobhoza kugcina ingaphandle njengalo, kususe ingaphakathi, kushiye izindonga zibe ngokujula ofisa kona. Iziprinto ze-resin zisebenzisa i-resin encane futhi zikhwezisa kancane ipuleti lokwakha; iziprinto zefilamenti zisebenzisa iplastiki encane kunokuthi i-infill ingakwenza. Khetha iqembu, ingxenye noma imeshi, bese uvula Gobhoza. Setha udonga (2 mm ukuqala) nokuthi izimbobo zokukhipha zibanzi kangakanani. Ukuze uprinte nge-resin, chofoza Beka imbobo yokukhipha, bese uchofoza ingaphandle kwemodeli lapho kufanele khona: phansi, eduze nepuleti lokwakha, ukuze i-resin ehlanzekile iphume. Beka izimbobo eziningi njengoba udinga; ngayinye iboniswa njengesekhethe elibhlowu futhi iyafakwa ohlwini ne-Susa. Ukubuka kuqala ikhombisa ukuthi ukugobhoza kukhipha kangakanani. Khumula kona yenza ushintsho: isinyathelo esisodwa esinqanyulwa yi-Ctrl+Z. Umphumela uyisisombululo esisodwa esivaliwe ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D kuyavuma: i-ModelCraft iyahlola kuqala futhi ayishintshi lutho uma ingadlula. Lapho imodeli incane kunezindonga ezimbili, ihlala iqinile. Umphumela uyiqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezicwebile zibe yizinhlangothi ezisodwa, ngakho ungayiqhubeka ngayo ngokumodela nge-Sunduza/hudula; ingxenye ecijile egobhozwe ku-grid enhle ngokuvamile inezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu kulokho futhi iba imeshi, nomugqa wesimo ukhombisa lokho. Ezimweni eziningi ingaphakathi kuwukuthi ingaphandle ihanjiswe ngaphakathi ngobukhulu bodonga kanye. Lapho amakhona noma izingxenye ezincane zenza lokho kungenzeki, i-ModelCraft ilandela ingaphandle ebugcaweni bodonga kugridi enhle; ikhadi bese liyasho ukuthi iseduze kangakanani (kuya ngengxenye yemilimitha). Lungisa Lungisa ibheka ingxenye ekhethiwe ngendlela isilayisi somprinta esiyibheka ngayo, ilungise lokho okungalungiswa ngokuphepha, futhi ibhale yonke into elungisiwe: Ilungisa Lokho kusho Amanxantathu angenayo indawo ayashiywa Unxantathu odwetshwe kabili kugcinwa ikhophi eyodwa; izinhlangothi ezihlanganisiwe ngemuva nangaphambili zigcinwa ngeqembu ngaphandle kobukhulu Izingcezu ezikhululekile ezingaphansi kuka-0.5 mm ziyasuswa Unxantathu obheke kabi uyaphendulwa ukuze ulingane nomakhelwane wawo Izimbobo, ezicwebile noma cha ziyavalwa ngomuthi wonxantathu abasha ngasenkabeni yembobo ngayinye Ingcezu ephenduke ngaphakathi iphenduke ngaphandle (imbobo esesingaphakathi kwenye ingcezu iyashiywa njengoba kunjalo: ihloselwe ukubheka ngaphakathi) Lungisa ezephephile yenza konke kwesinyathelo esisodwa esinqanyulwa yi-Ctrl+Z, futhi umugqa wesimo uhlu lwakho lonke ngalunye. Ingxenye elungisiwe iba yiqembu lapho izinhlangothi ezicwebile zibe yizinhlangothi ezisodwa. Uma ingakavaleki (okuthile ngaphansi kwe-Okushiyelwe wena kuseyiko), noma ingaba nezinhlangothi eziningi kakhulu zeqembu, iba yimeshi: izinhlangothi zayo zihlala zinxantathu, nezinhlangothi ezicwebile zisabonakala zicwebile. Umugqa wesimo uyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Hlanganisa izingxenye ezihlanganayo isebenza ngendlela efanayo. Okungalungiswa ngokuphepha kudwetshwe ngaphansi kwe-Okushiyelwe wena futhi kumakwe ngempunga embonweni, nge-Bonisa: Imiphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana: nquma ukuthi iyiphi inhlangothi yalo, bese ususa ezinye. Ingcezu edlula kuyo yona: hambisa noma dweba kabusha leyo ngxenye. Bona Hlanganisa izinhlangothi. Izimbobo ezinkulu kakhulu noma ezixakile ukuvala: dweba izinhlangothi kuzo. Izingcezu ezihlukene ezihlanganayo: izilayisi ziyazihlanganisa noma kunjalo. Hlanganisa izingxenye ezihlanganayo iyenza umzimba owodwa ovaliwe (ikha kabusha izinhlangothi lapho zihlangana, ngakho iyinkinobho ehlukile, ingenzeki wena ngaphandle kokuthi wena uyicindezele). Ngamaqembu okusunduza/hudula ungalungisa okunye ngesikhathi kuku-Ulwazi lwento › Bonisa izinkinga / Lungisa, okugcina izinhlangothi owazidweba. Bona Amathuluzi asezingeni eliqinile. Okuhlobene: Lungisa imodeli ukuze ilungele ukuprinta nge-3D · Isitayela sabaqalayo · Akukakhiwa","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-split","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlukanisa imodeli enkulu ukuze kuprintwe","summary":"Sika imodeli ebanzi kakhulu kubhedi lomprinta wakho ibe izingcezu ezilingana nebhedi, ngamapegi, okhiye, ama-dovetail, izimbobo zamadawela noma zamagineti, futhi ulande zonke izingcezu kanye nephepha lokuhlanganisa ngesisodwa se-zip.","section":"tasks","order":104,"keywords":["ukuprinta nge-3d","hlukanisa","thambeka","ukusika okuthambekile","ukusika okunyekethile","okuthambekile","isihlukanisi","sika","kukhulu kakhulu","usayizi webhedi","ivolumu yokwakha","izingcezu","izingxenye","izixhumi","amapegi","okhiye","dovetail","idawela","imagnethi","isikhala","ukubekezelela","izinombolo zezingxenye","ukuhlanganisa","ukubuka okuhlukaniswe","zip","stl","3mf","ilayisense","license","ukhiye we-usb","dongle"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-yokusika","text":"Indlela yokusika","level":2},{"id":"izixhumi","text":"Izixhumi","level":2},{"id":"izinombolo-zezingxenye","text":"Izinombolo zezingxenye","level":2},{"id":"ui-ukubuka-kuqala-ukulanda-ukuhlukanisa-imodeli","text":"{{ui:Ukubuka kuqala}}, ukulanda, ukuhlukanisa imodeli","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-izixhumi-ngokwakho","text":"Hambisa izixhumi ngokwakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma imodeli ibanzi kunebhedi lomprinta wakho, \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E iyisika ibe izingcezu ezilingana, yengeze izixhumi ukuze izingcezu zihlangane lapho uzihlanganisa, futhi ibhale inombolo efanayo ezinhlangothini zombili zalo lonke uxhumano. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E; umugqa \u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi okuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E wengxoxo unawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe\u003C/span\u003E. Ivula njengekhadi phezu kombono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsebenza ngalokho okuzoprintwa: ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonakalayo uma kungekho okukhethiwe. Okuzoprintwa kufanele kube yi-solid evaliwe; uma ukuhlola kuthola izimbobo, sebenzisa kuqala \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsebenza ku-ModelCraft, kukhompyutha yakho: akudingeki iseva yelayisense, akudingeki ukhiye we-USB, akukho okulayishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-yokusika\"\u003EIndlela yokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELingana nebhedi, izingcezu ezimbalwa kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: nikeza ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kwebhedi (zithathwa kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › ModelCraft › 3D printer). Ikhadi litshela ukuthi zingaki izingcezu nokuthi ngayinye inkulu kangakanani; lisika imodeli ibe izingcezu ezilinganayo, ezimbalwa kangangoba kulingana. Ingcezu ingalala ecaleni kumafayela uma lokho kuyenza ilingane. Izixhumi eziphuma engcezwini ziyabalwa ekusayizini yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEzindaweni engizinikezayo\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha i-axis okuzosikwa kuyo bese uthayipha lapho, ngama-millimitha kusukela ekugcineni okuphansi kwemodeli, nokhefana phakathi (\u003Ccode\u003E100, 200\u003C/code\u003E yenza izingcezu ezintathu). \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthambeka\u003C/strong\u003E kuguqula izinsika kuya ku-60° ezungeze enye yezinye ezimbili ama-axis (isibonelo, ukusika okuqondene no-Z kuthambeke ngokuzungeze X): isinqamuleli ngasinye esithambekile sidlula emgqeni ophakathi wemodeli endaweni yaso, sinikeze izingcezu indawo eningi yokunamathisela futhi sifihle uxhumano kangcono endaweni ethambekile. Izixhumi zimi ngqo kokusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindiza zokusika zidwetshwa zizungeze imodeli njengemigqa eqhekekile ikhadi selivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumi\"\u003EIzixhumi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho izingcezu ezimbili zithintana khona, kukhona izixhumi, ziyabekwa ngokwazo lapho kukhona indawo eningi kakhulu: okungenani \u003Cstrong\u003Eudonga oluncane kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enesikhala\u003C/strong\u003E kanye nosayizi wazo, kude nangaphandle, futhi kude namanye amasinqamuleli ukuze izimbobo ezimbili zingahlangani. Ohlangothini olude zimbili izixhumi ziyasatshalaliswa, ukuze izingcezu zingajikeleki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapegi ayindilinga\u003C/strong\u003E: ipegi engxenyeni eyodwa (eshanyelwe ngaphezulu), imbobo kwenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkhiye abayisikwele\u003C/strong\u003E: okufanayo, kodwa besikwele, ingcezu ingangena ngendlela eyodwa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-dovetail\u003C/strong\u003E: ithanga elingena esikhaleni ngasohlangothini. Lapho esinye sekhala sesikhala sihlangana nesinye isinqamuleli, i-dovetail iyama ngaphambi kwalo ingene isuka ekugcineni okuvulekile. Ama-dovetail alingana nokusika okuqondile okuqondile (ucwecwe oluningi olulandelanayo); kugridi, sebenzisa amapegi noma amadawela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimbobo zamadawela\u003C/strong\u003E: imbobo ohlangothini ngalunye; izinduku nazo ziyaprintwa (ku-zip).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhwama zamagineti\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhwama ohlangothini ngalunye sigineti eyindilinga ngobubanzi nobukhulu owunikezayo. Hlola izinhlangothi ngaphambi kokuzinamathisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELutho (ukunamathisela)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhala\u003C/strong\u003E siyigebe ohlangothini ngalunye phakathi kwepegi nembobo yalo (0.2 mm ukuqala). Silingana nenombolo oyinikezayo: izimbobo ezindilinga zenziwa zibe kancane zikhulu ukuze izinhlangothi zazo ezithe tshe, hhayi amakhona azo, zigcine lesi sikhala. Khuphula uma izingxenye zomprinta wakho zingena zinqinile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho uxhumano lungenalo indawo yexhumi (udonga oluncane, indawo encane ethintanayo), ikhadi liyasho lokho: namathisa lowo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinombolo-zezingxenye\"\u003EIzinombolo zezingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma \u003Cstrong\u003EBhala izinombolo zokuhlanganisa ezinhlangothini zombili\u003C/strong\u003E ivuliwe, uxhumano ngalunye luthola inombolo yezingcezu zalo ezimbili, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E3-4\u003C/code\u003E, ibhalwe ngokujula okungu-0.6 mm ezinhlangothini zombili, ifundeka ngendlela efanele ngayinye. Izinombolo ziqala zingu-5 mm ukuphakama bese zincipha ukuze zilingane, zize zibe ngu-2.5 mm; uxhumano olungenalo indawo yenombolo yalo luyafakwa ohlwini. Izingcezu zinombolwa kusuka ongqimbeni olusezansi kuya phezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ui-ukubuka-kuqala-ukulanda-ukuhlukanisa-imodeli\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kuqala\u003C/span\u003E, ukulanda, ukuhlukanisa imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kuqala\u003C/span\u003E usika imodeli futhi ukhombise ukuthi zingaki izingcezu, uxhumano kanye nezixhumi, ukuthi yonke ingcezu iyadlula yini ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D futhi ilingana ebhedini, bese ibala usayizi wengcezu ngayinye. Indilinga ibonisa ngalinye ixhumi nenombolo embonweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda izingcezu (.zip)\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza i-zip eyodwa: ifayela ngengcezu ngayinye (STL noma 3MF, njengoba ukhetha ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela\u003C/strong\u003E), ngayinye imi ebhedini; izinduku zamadawela; kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enephepha lokuhlanganisa\u003C/strong\u003E — isithombe sezingcezu ezihlukaniswe nezinombolo zazo (\u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.svg\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.png\u003C/code\u003E) nohlu lwezingcezu nezixhumi (\u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.txt\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa imodeli\u003C/span\u003E ibeka izingcezu emodelini esikhundleni samaqembu noma izingxenye ezikhethiwe, zinikezwe amagama njengasephepheni lokuhlanganisa, ngesinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela okwangempela. Idinga amaqembu noma izingxenye ezizohlukaniswa ukuthi zikhethwe; ukulanda kusebenza kulokho okuzoprintwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-izixhumi-ngokwakho\"\u003EHambisa izixhumi ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokubuka kuqala, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumi ngesandla\u003C/strong\u003E ikuvumela ukulungisa lapho izixhumi ziya khona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa eyodwa\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza indilinga ebomvu embonweni (iyaphenduka iluhlaza), bese uchofoza lapho kufanele kuye khona ekusikeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza eyodwa\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza embonweni lapho ixhumi kufanele libe khona. Liya endizeni yokusika ukuchofoza kwakho kufinyelela khona, phakathi kwezingcezu ezimbili lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa eyodwa\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza indilinga ebomvu ukuze uyisuse leli xhumi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshintsho ngalunye luyahlolwa futhi njengezinzondo ezizenzakalelayo: indawo esondele kakhulu encazelweni, esinye isinqamuleli noma enye ixhumi ayenziwa, futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokuzenzakalelayo futhi\u003C/span\u003E ikhohlwa izindawo zakho. Ziyagcinwa uma imodeli, ukukhethwa nokusika kuhlala kanjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kuqala kuhlala kuze kushintshe imodeli, ukukhethwa noma isilungiselelo; bese ikhadi liyakucela ukuthi ubuke kuqala futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingcezu ihlolwa njengoba ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D kungahlola kuqala ngaphambi kokulanda. Isilayisi sakho sisathatha isinqumo sokuthi iyiphi ingcezu ezoprintwa kanjani: yibheka lapho, bese uprinta uxhumano olulodwa kuqala ukuze ubone ukuthi umprinta wakho uphatha kanjani isikhala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Uma imodeli ibanzi kunebhedi lomprinta wakho, Hlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe iyisika ibe izingcezu ezilingana, yengeze izixhumi ukuze izingcezu zihlangane lapho uzihlanganisa, futhi ibhale inombolo efanayo ezinhlangothini zombili zalo lonke uxhumano. Vula Khipha › Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…; umugqa Amathuluzi okuprinta wengxoxo unawo Hlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe. Ivula njengekhadi phezu kombono. Isebenza ngalokho okuzoprintwa: ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonakalayo uma kungekho okukhethiwe. Okuzoprintwa kufanele kube yi-solid evaliwe; uma ukuhlola kuthola izimbobo, sebenzisa kuqala . Isebenza ku-ModelCraft, kukhompyutha yakho: akudingeki iseva yelayisense, akudingeki ukhiye we-USB, akukho okulayishwa. Indlela yokusika Lingana nebhedi, izingcezu ezimbalwa kakhulu: nikeza ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kwebhedi (zithathwa kusuka ku-Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › 3D printer). Ikhadi litshela ukuthi zingaki izingcezu nokuthi ngayinye inkulu kangakanani; lisika imodeli ibe izingcezu ezilinganayo, ezimbalwa kangangoba kulingana. Ingcezu ingalala ecaleni kumafayela uma lokho kuyenza ilingane. Izixhumi eziphuma engcezwini ziyabalwa ekusayizini yayo. Ezindaweni engizinikezayo: khetha i-axis okuzosikwa kuyo bese uthayipha lapho, ngama-millimitha kusukela ekugcineni okuphansi kwemodeli, nokhefana phakathi (100, 200 yenza izingcezu ezintathu). Ukuthambeka kuguqula izinsika kuya ku-60° ezungeze enye yezinye ezimbili ama-axis (isibonelo, ukusika okuqondene no-Z kuthambeke ngokuzungeze X): isinqamuleli ngasinye esithambekile sidlula emgqeni ophakathi wemodeli endaweni yaso, sinikeze izingcezu indawo eningi yokunamathisela futhi sifihle uxhumano kangcono endaweni ethambekile. Izixhumi zimi ngqo kokusika. Izindiza zokusika zidwetshwa zizungeze imodeli njengemigqa eqhekekile ikhadi selivulekile. Izixhumi Lapho izingcezu ezimbili zithintana khona, kukhona izixhumi, ziyabekwa ngokwazo lapho kukhona indawo eningi kakhulu: okungenani udonga oluncane kakhulu kanye nesikhala kanye nosayizi wazo, kude nangaphandle, futhi kude namanye amasinqamuleli ukuze izimbobo ezimbili zingahlangani. Ohlangothini olude zimbili izixhumi ziyasatshalaliswa, ukuze izingcezu zingajikeleki. Amapegi ayindilinga: ipegi engxenyeni eyodwa (eshanyelwe ngaphezulu), imbobo kwenye. Okhiye abayisikwele: okufanayo, kodwa besikwele, ingcezu ingangena ngendlela eyodwa kuphela. Ama-dovetail: ithanga elingena esikhaleni ngasohlangothini. Lapho esinye sekhala sesikhala sihlangana nesinye isinqamuleli, i-dovetail iyama ngaphambi kwalo ingene isuka ekugcineni okuvulekile. Ama-dovetail alingana nokusika okuqondile okuqondile (ucwecwe oluningi olulandelanayo); kugridi, sebenzisa amapegi noma amadawela. Izimbobo zamadawela: imbobo ohlangothini ngalunye; izinduku nazo ziyaprintwa (ku-zip). Izikhwama zamagineti: isikhwama ohlangothini ngalunye sigineti eyindilinga ngobubanzi nobukhulu owunikezayo. Hlola izinhlangothi ngaphambi kokuzinamathisela. Lutho (ukunamathisela). Isikhala siyigebe ohlangothini ngalunye phakathi kwepegi nembobo yalo (0.2 mm ukuqala). Silingana nenombolo oyinikezayo: izimbobo ezindilinga zenziwa zibe kancane zikhulu ukuze izinhlangothi zazo ezithe tshe, hhayi amakhona azo, zigcine lesi sikhala. Khuphula uma izingxenye zomprinta wakho zingena zinqinile. Lapho uxhumano lungenalo indawo yexhumi (udonga oluncane, indawo encane ethintanayo), ikhadi liyasho lokho: namathisa lowo kuphela. Izinombolo zezingxenye Uma Bhala izinombolo zokuhlanganisa ezinhlangothini zombili ivuliwe, uxhumano ngalunye luthola inombolo yezingcezu zalo ezimbili, njengo 3-4, ibhalwe ngokujula okungu-0.6 mm ezinhlangothini zombili, ifundeka ngendlela efanele ngayinye. Izinombolo ziqala zingu-5 mm ukuphakama bese zincipha ukuze zilingane, zize zibe ngu-2.5 mm; uxhumano olungenalo indawo yenombolo yalo luyafakwa ohlwini. Izingcezu zinombolwa kusuka ongqimbeni olusezansi kuya phezulu. Ukubuka kuqala, ukulanda, ukuhlukanisa imodeli Ukubuka kuqala usika imodeli futhi ukhombise ukuthi zingaki izingcezu, uxhumano kanye nezixhumi, ukuthi yonke ingcezu iyadlula yini ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D futhi ilingana ebhedini, bese ibala usayizi wengcezu ngayinye. Indilinga ibonisa ngalinye ixhumi nenombolo embonweni. Landa izingcezu (.zip) ilondoloza i-zip eyodwa: ifayela ngengcezu ngayinye (STL noma 3MF, njengoba ukhetha ngaphansi kwe-Amafayela), ngayinye imi ebhedini; izinduku zamadawela; kanye nephepha lokuhlanganisa — isithombe sezingcezu ezihlukaniswe nezinombolo zazo (assembly.svg ne-assembly.png) nohlu lwezingcezu nezixhumi (assembly.txt). Hlukanisa imodeli ibeka izingcezu emodelini esikhundleni samaqembu noma izingxenye ezikhethiwe, zinikezwe amagama njengasephepheni lokuhlanganisa, ngesinyathelo esisodwa: Hlehlisa ibuyisela okwangempela. Idinga amaqembu noma izingxenye ezizohlukaniswa ukuthi zikhethwe; ukulanda kusebenza kulokho okuzoprintwa. Hambisa izixhumi ngokwakho Ngemva kokubuka kuqala, Izixhumi ngesandla ikuvumela ukulungisa lapho izixhumi ziya khona: Hambisa eyodwa: chofoza indilinga ebomvu embonweni (iyaphenduka iluhlaza), bese uchofoza lapho kufanele kuye khona ekusikeni. Engeza eyodwa: chofoza embonweni lapho ixhumi kufanele libe khona. Liya endizeni yokusika ukuchofoza kwakho kufinyelela khona, phakathi kwezingcezu ezimbili lapho. Susa eyodwa: chofoza indilinga ebomvu ukuze uyisuse leli xhumi. Ushintsho ngalunye luyahlolwa futhi njengezinzondo ezizenzakalelayo: indawo esondele kakhulu encazelweni, esinye isinqamuleli noma enye ixhumi ayenziwa, futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho. Ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi ikhohlwa izindawo zakho. Ziyagcinwa uma imodeli, ukukhethwa nokusika kuhlala kanjalo. Ukubuka kuqala kuhlala kuze kushintshe imodeli, ukukhethwa noma isilungiselelo; bese ikhadi liyakucela ukuthi ubuke kuqala futhi. Yonke ingcezu ihlolwa njengoba ukuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D kungahlola kuqala ngaphambi kokulanda. Isilayisi sakho sisathatha isinqumo sokuthi iyiphi ingcezu ezoprintwa kanjani: yibheka lapho, bese uprinta uxhumano olulodwa kuqala ukuze ubone ukuthi umprinta wakho uphatha kanjani isikhala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-stage","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Faka izinto ebhedini lokuprinta uzithumele kumprinta","summary":"Engeza izinto zoMtapo noma imodeli yakho ebhedini lomprinta wakho, uzihlele, bheka izingqimba ezisikiwe, bese uthumela ukuprinta nge-USB noma ngenethiwekhi, noma ulondoloze i-G-code, ngaphandle kokuthumela i-STL kuqala.","section":"tasks","order":105,"keywords":["isigaba sokuprinta","ukuprinta nge-3d","umprinta","ibhedi","thumela kumprinta nge-3d","isilayisi","gcode","g-code","usb","klipper","moonraker","octoprint","prusalink","umtapo","hlela","lingana konke","ukubuka izingqimba","infill","izisekelo","ifilamenti","pla","petg","i-add-on","i-add-on yokuprinta nge-3d"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba sokuprinta\u003C/span\u003E sibeka izinto ebhedini lomprinta wakho, zisikwe bese zithunyelwa kumprinta. Akudingeki uthumele ifayela kuqala. Yeyokwengeza ye-3D Print, evulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukaprintwa lutho kumprinta wangempela ngalokhu. Isilayisi sisha: bheka izingqimba zokuqala zokuprinta kokuqala kwakho, usebenzise ukubuka kwezingqimba ngaphambi kokuthumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka imodeli ebhedini, uhlole ukuthi iyalingana, bheka izingqimba ezisikiwe, bese uyithumela kumprinta noma ulondoloze i-G-code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba sokuprinta\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini. Ikhadi liyavuleka phezu kombono futhi umugqa omile ukhombisa ibhedi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza kusuka ku-Umtapo\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha igama endaweni yokusesha, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESesha\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E emphumeleni. Into ifika ebhedini ngosayizi ogcwele, noma incishiswe ukuze ilingane. Konke oye wakudweba noma wakungenisa futhi okubonakalayo embonweni kukhona ebhedini nakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEbhedini\u003C/strong\u003E, hlola usayizi wento ngayinye. Into emaka ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIngaphandle kwebhedi\u003C/strong\u003E idinga ukuthuthwa. Hambisa, phendula nelinganisa izinto embonweni ngamathuluzi ajwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ebhedini\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhlukanise izinto, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana konke ebhedini\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uzinciphise kuze kulingane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmprinta wakho\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha usayizi we-\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhedi\u003C/strong\u003E noma enye yamaprofayili omprinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo zokuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhwalithi\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EInfill %\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uthikiza \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza izisekelo ngaphansi kwezindawo ezelula\u003C/strong\u003E uma ukwakheka kukudinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBukela izingqimba\u003C/span\u003E bese uhambisa isilayidi \u003Cstrong\u003EUngqimba\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubuke izingqimba ezisikiwe. Uma ushintsha isigaba noma izilungiselelo kamuva, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBukela izingqimba\u003C/span\u003E futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxhuma\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhebuli ye-USB\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKlipper (Moonraker)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOctoPrint\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrusaLink\u003C/span\u003E. Ye-USB cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma\u003C/span\u003E. Omprinta wenethiwekhi uthayipha \u003Cstrong\u003E Ikheli\u003C/strong\u003E lakhe (kanye nokhiye we-API uma eyicela), bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola uxhumano\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela kumprinta ye-3D\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhadi libuza ukuthi ibhedi icacile nokuthi impahla efanele ifakiwe, futhi likhombise isikhathi, impahla nokushisa. Qinisekisa ukuze uthumele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthola umlayezo wokuthi umprinta uyaqala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa ukuprinta\u003C/span\u003E ivala izishisi, ifeni nezinjini. Uma ufuna ifayela kuphela, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-G-code esikhundleni salokho\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-USB idinga i-Chrome noma i-Edge kukhompyutha, futhi ikhasi kumele libe livulekile kuze kuphele ukuprinta. Ukulivala kumisa umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmprinta wenethiwekhi kumele avumele le sayithi (ku-Moonraker yengeze kuyo \u003Ccode\u003Ecors_domains\u003C/code\u003E; ku-OctoPrint vula i-CORS bese ukopisha ukhiye we-API). Isiphequluli sakho singacela ukufinyelela amadivayisi asenethiwekhini lakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuxhumayo noma okuthumelwayo ngaphandle kokuchofoza kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezilayisi lusethwe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilayisi\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft basic (ifakiwe, esheshayo kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E ifakiwe ngaphakathi. I-Kiri:Moto, i-PrusaSlicer, i-OrcaSlicer ne-Bambu Lab P2S ziyi-add-on zazo ozivulayo kusuka ekhadini noma ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E. I-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer zisebenzisa ikopi yakho futhi zisebenza nge-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingcezu ezingasizo izinsimbi eziqinile ziyashiywa, futhi ikhadi liyakutshela ukuthi yingakanani ingxenye yesimo leyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgabaprinta be-resin, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/resin-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/resin-printing\"\u003ESika ukuze uprinte nge-resin\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuhlola noma ukulungisa imodeli kuqala, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003EIzisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isigaba sokuprinta sibeka izinto ebhedini lomprinta wakho, zisikwe bese zithunyelwa kumprinta. Akudingeki uthumele ifayela kuqala. Yeyokwengeza ye-3D Print, evulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo. Akukaprintwa lutho kumprinta wangempela ngalokhu. Isilayisi sisha: bheka izingqimba zokuqala zokuprinta kokuqala kwakho, usebenzise ukubuka kwezingqimba ngaphambi kokuthumela. Okuzokwenza Beka imodeli ebhedini, uhlole ukuthi iyalingana, bheka izingqimba ezisikiwe, bese uyithumela kumprinta noma ulondoloze i-G-code. Izinyathelo Chofoza Isigaba sokuprinta ethuluzini. Ikhadi liyavuleka phezu kombono futhi umugqa omile ukhombisa ibhedi yakho. Ngaphansi kwe-Engeza kusuka ku-Umtapo, thayipha igama endaweni yokusesha, cindezela Sesha bese ucindezela Engeza emphumeleni. Into ifika ebhedini ngosayizi ogcwele, noma incishiswe ukuze ilingane. Konke oye wakudweba noma wakungenisa futhi okubonakalayo embonweni kukhona ebhedini nakho. Ngaphansi kwe-Ebhedini, hlola usayizi wento ngayinye. Into emaka ngokuthi Ingaphandle kwebhedi idinga ukuthuthwa. Hambisa, phendula nelinganisa izinto embonweni ngamathuluzi ajwayelekile. Cindezela Hlela ebhedini ukuze uhlukanise izinto, noma Lingana konke ebhedini ukuze uzinciphise kuze kulingane. Ngaphansi kwe-Umprinta wakho, khetha usayizi we-Ibhedi noma enye yamaprofayili omprinta. Ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo zokuprinta, khetha i-Impahla, i-Ikhwalithi kanye ne-Infill %, bese uthikiza Engeza izisekelo ngaphansi kwezindawo ezelula uma ukwakheka kukudinga. Cindezela Bukela izingqimba bese uhambisa isilayidi Ungqimba ukuze ubuke izingqimba ezisikiwe. Uma ushintsha isigaba noma izilungiselelo kamuva, cindezela Bukela izingqimba futhi. Ngaphansi kwe-Ukuxhuma, khetha Ikhebuli ye-USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint noma PrusaLink. Ye-USB cindezela Xhuma. Omprinta wenethiwekhi uthayipha Ikheli lakhe (kanye nokhiye we-API uma eyicela), bese ucindezela Hlola uxhumano. Cindezela Thumela kumprinta ye-3D. Ikhadi libuza ukuthi ibhedi icacile nokuthi impahla efanele ifakiwe, futhi likhombise isikhathi, impahla nokushisa. Qinisekisa ukuze uthumele. Uthola umlayezo wokuthi umprinta uyaqala. Misa ukuprinta ivala izishisi, ifeni nezinjini. Uma ufuna ifayela kuphela, cindezela Londoloza i-G-code esikhundleni salokho. Amanothi I-USB idinga i-Chrome noma i-Edge kukhompyutha, futhi ikhasi kumele libe livulekile kuze kuphele ukuprinta. Ukulivala kumisa umugqa. Umprinta wenethiwekhi kumele avumele le sayithi (ku-Moonraker yengeze kuyo cors_domains; ku-OctoPrint vula i-CORS bese ukopisha ukhiye we-API). Isiphequluli sakho singacela ukufinyelela amadivayisi asenethiwekhini lakho. Akukho okuxhumayo noma okuthumelwayo ngaphandle kokuchofoza kwakho. Uhlu lwezilayisi lusethwe ngaphansi kwe-Isilayisi. CadCraft basic (ifakiwe, esheshayo kakhulu) ifakiwe ngaphakathi. I-Kiri:Moto, i-PrusaSlicer, i-OrcaSlicer ne-Bambu Lab P2S ziyi-add-on zazo ozivulayo kusuka ekhadini noma ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. I-PrusaSlicer ne-OrcaSlicer zisebenzisa ikopi yakho futhi zisebenza nge-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha. Izingcezu ezingasizo izinsimbi eziqinile ziyashiywa, futhi ikhadi liyakutshela ukuthi yingakanani ingxenye yesimo leyo. Ngabaprinta be-resin, bheka Sika ukuze uprinte nge-resin. Ukuhlola noma ukulungisa imodeli kuqala, bheka Izisekelo, ukujula kodonga, ukugobhoza nokulungisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nurbs-surfaces","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izindawo ezikhululekile (NURBS)","summary":"Amajika nezindawo ezibushelelezi zamashelu omkhiqizo, izimoto nezingaphansi kwemikhumbi — loft, sweep, amanethiwekhi amajika, amaphedi ezinhlangothi ezine, ama-blend, ama-trim — nokuqhubeka kwe-G0, G1 ne-G2 kulinganiswa ezindaweni ezinembile, ama-solid anokuhlanganisa, ukusika nokuhlukanisa, imibono ye-zebra nokugoba, izindawo ezilingana nesikeni nephutha lazo elilinganisiwe, kanye namafayela e-STEP noma e-IGES.","section":"tasks","order":106,"keywords":["nurbs","scan","reverse engineering","fit","mesh to surface","point cloud","stl","trim","trimmed","hole","cut","solid","solids","boolean","union","subtract","intersect","difference","sew","closed","freeform","free-form","surface","surfaces","b-spline","bspline","curve","spline","loft","sweep","rail","network","coons","patch","blend","match","continuity","g0","g1","g2","tangent","curvature","zebra","control points","knots","degree","step","iges","ikhwalithi A"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-umyalo-osebenza-ngayo","text":"Indlela umyalo osebenza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"amajika","text":"Amajika","level":2},{"id":"izindawo","text":"Izindawo","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlola-ikhwalithi","text":"Ukuhlola ikhwalithi","level":2},{"id":"sika-indawo","text":"Sika indawo","level":2},{"id":"ama-solid-nama-boolean","text":"Ama-solid nama-Boolean","level":2},{"id":"ama-fillet-nokujiya","text":"Ama-fillet nokujiya","level":2},{"id":"undo-ifayela-step-ne-iges","text":"Undo, ifayela, STEP ne-IGES","level":2},{"id":"izindawo-ezivela-kuscan-reverse-engineering","text":"Izindawo ezivela kuscan (reverse engineering)","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwe","text":"Akukakwakhiwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli ye-\u003Cstrong\u003ESurfaces\u003C/strong\u003E yenza amajika nezindawo ezibushelelezi zohlobo olusetshenziswa ekwakheni amashelu omkhiqizo, izimoto nezingaphansi kwemikhumbi: NURBS, izibalo ezifanayo nalezo ezisetshenziswa abanye abenza amamodeli ezindawo. Konke kulinganiswa ezindaweni ezinembile, hhayi ezinxantathwini ozibonayo. Usayizi kule paneli uku-\u003Cstrong\u003Emillimetres\u003C/strong\u003E, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi imodeli ibonisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYivule kusuka ephaneleni lesokudla: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the Surfaces panel\u003C/span\u003E. Imodeli esinezindawo ivula kuyo lodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-umyalo-osebenza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela umyalo osebenza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela umyalo (isibonelo \u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E). Ipaneli ikutshela okudingayo: amaphoyinti, amajika, umphetho wendawo noma isiphetho sejika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYikhethe: chofoza kuzo ku-3D view, noma cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EPick\u003C/strong\u003E (noma izinkinobho zomphetho nesiphetho) eduze kwengxenye ngayinye kuhlu. Ukuze uthole umphetho, chofoza eduze kwalowo mphetho wendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola izinketho (degree, tolerance, continuity, …) bese ucindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EMake\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmajika avela kumaphoyinti athathwa njengamaphoyinti athayiphwe eyodwa emugqeni ngamunye (\u003Ccode\u003Ex, y, z\u003C/code\u003E ngo-mm), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EPick points in the view\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuchofoza ngakunye kusebenzisa ukubamba okufanayo njengamathuluzi okudweba; cindezela &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; noma chofoza kabili ukuqeda, &lt;kbd&gt;Esc&lt;/kbd&gt; ukuyeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amajika\"\u003EAmajika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurve through points\u003C/strong\u003E idlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti. \u003Cstrong\u003ECurve by control points\u003C/strong\u003E ilandela ikheji lamaphoyinti kunalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsert knot\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERaise degree\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ELower degree\u003C/strong\u003E zishintsha indlela ijika elichazwa ngayo ngaphandle kokulinyanisa (ukwehlisa kuyenqaba uma ijika lingahamba ngaphezu kwe-tolerance). \u003Cstrong\u003ERebuild curve\u003C/strong\u003E iliphatha inani elisha lamaphoyinti okulawula bese isho ukuthi lihambe kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch curve\u003C/strong\u003E yenza isiphetho sijika sihlangane nesesinye nge-G0 (ukuthintana), G1 (indlela efanayo) noma G2 (nokugoba okufanayo). \u003Cstrong\u003EBlend curve\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza ijika elisha phakathi kweziphetho ezimbili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoin curves\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ESplit curve\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindawo\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwamajika amabili noma ngaphezulu, \u003Cstrong\u003ERuled surface\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwamabili, \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude curve\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERevolve curve\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESweep along one rail\u003C/strong\u003E ihambisa iphrofayili ngomzila ingayikhotheli, \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep along two rails\u003C/strong\u003E igcina iziphetho zephrofayili kuzo zombili izindikwa. Ama-sweep ayalinganiswa: umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi uhambe kanjani eduze nesweep yangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESurface from a curve network\u003C/strong\u003E idlula kukhiye wamajika (okokuqala okukhethiwe yiziphrofayili, okunye yimiyalelo). \u003Cstrong\u003EPatch from four edges\u003C/strong\u003E igcwalisa amajika amane ahlangana ezikhoneni zawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch surface\u003C/strong\u003E yenza umphetho wendawo uhlangane nomakhelwane nge-G0, G1 noma G2; \u003Cstrong\u003EBlend surface\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza indawo phakathi kwemiphetho emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOffset surface\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EExtend surface\u003C/strong\u003E (indawo iqhubeka njengoba yayihamba), \u003Cstrong\u003ERebuild surface\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye nama-knot nama-degree wezindawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlola-ikhwalithi\"\u003EUkuhlola ikhwalithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula \u003Cstrong\u003EShared edges\u003C/strong\u003E lidweba yonke imiphetho okwabelana ngayo izindawo ezimbili, ngesikhala (mm), i-engeli phakathi kwazo (°), ukuqhuma kokugoba (1/mm), kanye nokuthi lokho kuyenza i-G0, G1 noma G2. Umphetho ongaphansi kwalokho ocelile uphinde ube ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProblems\u003C/strong\u003E (inkinobho ye-⚠ kubha yohlelo) ne-fix ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EMatch\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShow as\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EZebra stripes\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ECurvature (Gaussian)\u003C/strong\u003E zivela endaweni eyiyo: izinkanyezi ezigijima zingaphuli uma uwela umphetho zisho G1; izinkanyezi ezigcina nobubanzi bazo zisho G2. Ukugoba kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka lapho indawo iyisixhobo se-saddle, kuluhlaza lapho iyisigaxa, kumhlophe lapho iyisicaba. \u003Cstrong\u003EControl points\u003C/strong\u003E idweba amanethiwekhi okulawula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-G0–G2 alinganiswa emaphointini angu-33 ngomphetho ngamunye. \u003Cstrong\u003EG3 nekhwalithi &quot;class A&quot; azilinganiswa\u003C/strong\u003E futhi aziphakanyiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-indawo\"\u003ESika indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003ETrim\u003C/strong\u003E lisika indawo ingashintshi ukwakheka kwayo: indawo igcina zonke amaphoyinti ayo okulawula, futhi kubonakala, kubalwe futhi kubhalwe kuphela ingxenye ngaphakathi kwesimo. \u003Cstrong\u003ETrim to a rectangle\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ETrim with a circle\u003C/strong\u003E zisebenza ngesabelo (0 kuya ku-1) sendawo ngayinye ngayinye, ngakho azidingi ukukhethwa embonweni; \u003Cstrong\u003ETrim by a curve\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha ijika elivaliwe elisendaweni (liprojectwa ngaphakathi kwendawo, futhi limelwa ngamagama uma livuliwe noma likude ngaphezu kwe-tolerance). Ukhethe \u003Cstrong\u003ECut a hole\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ususe ingaphakathi kwesimo; uyishiye ingakhethwanga ukuze ugcine ingaphakathi kuphela. Indawo ingaba nesimo esisodwa esigcinwayo nanoma yiziphi izimbobo; isimo esidlula esinye singenqatshwa. \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove the trim\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa indawo yonke futhi. Imiphetho esikiwe ilandela isimo ngokunembile; i-Undo yepaneli ibuyisela i-trim njengesinye isinyathelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-STEP ithwala i-trim njengemingcele yobuso be-IGES njengendawo esikiwe (entity 144); bobabili bayayifunda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-solid-nama-boolean\"\u003EAma-solid nama-Boolean\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003ESolids\u003C/strong\u003E lishintsha izindawo zibe imizimba evaliwe futhi liyihlanganise. I-solid lapha yisethi yezindawo zephaneli ezivala ivolumu ndawonye; ubuso bayo bugcina kuyi-NURBS enembile ngama-trim abo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E zenza eyodwa kusuka kusayizi obhalwe (ngo-mm): ibhokisi lobuso obucaba eziyisithupha, isilinda sohlangothi oluzungezile kanye nezinhlangothi ezimbili ezicaba ezisikwe isiyingi, insimbi eyodwa evuselelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolid from surfaces\u003C/strong\u003E ihlanganisa izindawo owezenzele wena. Zikhethe, noma ungakhethi lutho ukusebenzisa zonke izindawo ezibonisiwe ezingekho ku-solid. Zishelelwa ndawonye ngaphakathi kwe-tolerance: uma zingavaleki, akukho okushintsha futhi iphaneli ithi imiphetho emingaki ivulekile nokuthi kufanele zihlangane kanjani eduze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnion\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtract\u003C/strong\u003E (i-solid yesibili ithathwa ku-solid yokuqala) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIntersect\u003C/strong\u003E (kuphela okwabelwana ngakho kokubili) zithatha ama-solid amabili: chofoza ubuso ngabunye embonweni, noma cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EPick\u003C/strong\u003E kuhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESolids\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep the two solids\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uwagcine eceleni komphumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Boolean igcina zonke izinhlangothi endaweni yazo enembile futhi iyisike ngemiphetho emisha ye-trim endaweni yokuhlangana. Umugqa womphumela unikeza izibalo ezilinganisiwe: ukuthi amaphoyinti e-solid engine adinge ukuhamba kangakanani ukuze ahlale ezindaweni ezinembile (akulokhu ngaphezu kwe-tolerance), ukuthi amaphoyinti okuhlangana aseduze kangakanani nazo zombili izindawo (ngokuvamile amamicron ambalwa), ivolumu, nokuthi izinhlangothi ezintsha ziyavala yini uma zihlanganiswa kabusha ngezindawo zazo ezinembile. Ivolumu ilinganiswa ezinxantathwini ngaphakathi kwe-tolerance (0.05 mm uma ungasethi enye), ngakho ivolumu ye-sphere noma isilinda ifunda kancane kunaleyo enembile: i-tolerance encane isondela kakhulu. I-Boolean engenzeki ngokucacile (ama-solid awanalutho ahlanganyelwe, umugqa wesimo uzozibhoka) iyenqatshwa ngamagama futhi ayishintshi lutho. I-Boolean eyodwa ingumyalo owodwa we-\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo\u003C/strong\u003E yepaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOhlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESolids\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUngroup\u003C/strong\u003E igcina izinhlangothi njengezindawo ezijwayelekile; i-bin isusa i-solid nezinhlangothi zayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to the model\u003C/strong\u003E (ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESolids\u003C/strong\u003E) ifaka ikhophi ye-solid emodelini njengeqembu elilodwa elivaliwe, izinhlangothi zalo zibe amanxantathu ngaphakathi kwe-0.05 mm, ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo yemodeli. Khona-ke isebenza no-\u003Cstrong\u003EUnion\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtract\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIntersect\u003C/strong\u003E zemodeli, nokusunduzwa/ukuhudulwa, nokuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D; i-solid enembile ihlala kuphaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-fillet-nokujiya\"\u003EAma-fillet nokujiya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E igoqa umphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili zesolid eyodwa zihlangana: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili (embonweni, noma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EPick\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini), uthayipha \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi, uma irediyasi ishintsha ngomphetho, \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius at the end\u003C/strong\u003E (0 igcina irediyasi eyodwa). Ibhola lale rediyasi liqhutshwa ngomphetho lithinta zombili izinhlangothi; i-fillet iyi-arc yesekethe enembile etholakala kuyo yonke indawo, ihlanganiswe ibe indawo eyodwa, futhi izinhlangothi zombili zisikwa lapho ibhola lithinta khona. Umphetho wangaphandle ulahlekelwa izinto, ikhona langaphakathi liyazuza. Umugqa womphumela unikeza okulinganisiwe: ukuthi indawo ye-fillet ikude kangakanani nebhola eligingqayo phakathi kwamaphoyinti ayakhelwe kuwo (amaphoyinti engezwa kuze kube ngaphakathi kwekota ye-tolerance), i-engeli enkulu phakathi kwe-fillet nakuyo yonke inhlangothi ngomugqa wokuthinta, nezinombolo ezifanayo nezeUnion. Irediyasi engalingani (ibhola lingashiya inhlangothi, noma inhlangothi igoba ngokuqinile kunerediyasi) iyenqatshwa, ikhomba inhlangothi, futhi akukho okushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet several edges\u003C/strong\u003E igoqa imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho wokuqala, bese ezimbili zomphetho olandelayo, njalo njalo (inhlangothi ingaba kwamaphayiri amaningi, isibonelo uhlangothi oluphezulu bhokisi kwamane kuwo); yonke imiphetho ithola irediyasi oyithayipha. Ukugoqwa ngakunye kusebenza ku-solid njengoba ibisekhona, bese ziyasikwa ngolandelana, ngakho i-oda aliphazamisi. Lapho imiphetho emibili egotshiwe ihlangana ekhoneni elinemiphetho ehlala ibukhali, ama-fillet amabili ayahlangana ngejika lokuhlangana (i-crease). Lapho imiphetho yangaphandle emithathu egotshiwe yezinhlangothi ezintathu ezicaba ihlangana ngerediyasi eyodwa, ikhona liyiyo i-\u003Cstrong\u003Esphere patch\u003C/strong\u003E ethinta zonke ezintathu i-fillet (khipha \u003Cstrong\u003ECorners\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole ikhona elinecreasi); umphetho kumele ube muhle kabili kunerediyasi uma ekugcineni kwawo kokubili kuyiziKhoni ezinjalo. Umugqa womphumela ulandisa ukuthi imiphetho emingaki igotshiwe nokuthi amakhona aphumelele kanjani. Imiphetho yangaphakathi nayo ingagotshwa ndawonye, kodwa umphumela ongavali kabusha uyabikwa kuphela (umugqa uyasho), ngakho hlola.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThicken into a solid\u003C/strong\u003E inikeza indawo ukuqina: yikhethe, uthayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003Ethickness\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EOther side\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukhulise ngolunye uhlangothi. Ubuso obusukiwe bulingana nendawo futhi bulinganiswa kuyo (umugqa womphumela unikeza umehluko omkhulu kakhulu ngobukhulu); izindonga zilandela yonke imiphetho nemigqa yesimo. Uma indawo igoba ngokuqinile kunobukhulu ngalolo hlangothi, noma enye ingxenye yayo ilele iseduze kunobukhulu, iyenqatshwa, ibize indawo nendawo, futhi akukho okushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-ifayela-step-ne-iges\"\u003EUndo, ifayela, STEP ne-IGES\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli inayo \u003Cstrong\u003EUndo\u003C/strong\u003E neyayo \u003Cstrong\u003ERedo\u003C/strong\u003E (isinyathelo esisodwa ngomyalo ngamunye). Izindawo zigcinwa kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E kanye nemodeli; azisiyo ingxenye ye-undo yemodeli, njengezinto zokwakha zefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP…\u003C/strong\u003E (AP242) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIGES…\u003C/strong\u003E zigcina amajika nezindawo ngendlela ezinjalo ngokunembile (amajika nezindawo ze-B-spline, akukho okuguqulwe kube amanxantathu). Ngayinye indawo iyiyo ubuso bayo, nesikhala sayo; i-solid ibhalwa njengegobolondo elilodwa elivaliwe, umphetho ngamunye wabelwa izinhlangothi zawo ezimbili njengoba ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD zilindele (umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi ma-solid angaki aphumile ngalendlela). Ku-IGES i-solid efanayo ibe yi-manifold solid B-rep eyodwa (entity 186 ngegobolondo elivaliwe 514, izinhlangothi 510, amaloop 508, uhlu lwemiphetho 504 kanye nohlu lwamaphoyinti 502); i-solid enezinhlangothi ezingaxhumani emphethweni ngomphetho ngamunye ibhalwa njengezinhlangothi ezihlukene, nomugqa uyasho lokho. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EImport…\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda i-solid efana nalena ibuyele njengesolid, kusuka ku-STEP nasku-IGES. Ifunda amajika nezindawo ezibhalwe ngale ndlela, namasethi amaphathi \u003Ccode\u003E.ccnurbs\u003C/code\u003E; ama-solid e-STEP avela ezinhlelweni zabanye avulwa nge-File › Import njengama-mesh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindawo-ezivela-kuscan-reverse-engineering\"\u003EIzindawo ezivela kuscan (reverse engineering)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha i-mesh eskenwe emodelini (akukho okukhethiwe kusho ukuthi konke okubonisiwe), vula \u003Cstrong\u003ESurfaces\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFit surfaces to the scan\u003C/strong\u003E. Lo thuluzi lifuna \u003Cstrong\u003Eamapuleni\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamasilinda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamasphere\u003C/strong\u003E nama-\u003Cstrong\u003Econe\u003C/strong\u003E (izindawo ezingangempela ezakhiwe ngazo ingxenye eyenziwe ngomshini; umugqa ngamunye ukhombisa irediyasi noma i-half-angle eyitholile), lithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet\u003C/strong\u003E (imiphetho nezikhona ezigotshiwe: isilinda esincane noma i-sphere ehamba ithinte izinhlangothi ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, ibonisa irediyasi yayo nezinhlangothi ezihlangana nazo), \u003Cstrong\u003Erim fillets\u003C/strong\u003E (i-torus: umphetho ogotshiwe lapho inhlangothi ecaba ihlangana nesilinda noma ne-cone, ibonisa irediyasi yayo nerediyasi yesiyingi), kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Evariable fillets\u003C/strong\u003E (umphetho ogotshiwe onerediyasi eshintsha ngawo, ibonisa irediyasi kuwo wonke omabili), ifake \u003Cstrong\u003Eindawo eyodwa ekhululekile\u003C/strong\u003E kuyo ibushelelezi, ihlakazekile kancane, bese isika yonke inhlangothi ibe umphetho wengxenye yesikeni okuvela kuyo, ngakho izimbobo nezikhona ziyahlala. Izinketho: i-\u003Cstrong\u003Etolerance\u003C/strong\u003E (kude kangakanani, ngo-mm, isikeni ingaba kuyo ipuleni noma kusilinda futhi isaba yalo, nenjongo yendawo ekhululekile), \u003Cstrong\u003Esmallest piece\u003C/strong\u003E (isabelo sendawo) kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Emost faces\u003C/strong\u003E. Ikeni efanayo nezinketho ezifanayo zinikeza izinhlangothi ezifanayo nsukuzonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyithebula, umugqa owodwa ngensizakalo: uhlobo lwayo, inani lamanxantathu ayivela kuwo, nephutha \u003Cstrong\u003Eelilinganiswe kusuka esikeni kuya kuhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E (i-rms, enkulu kakhulu, nesabelo samaphoyinti angaphakathi kwe-tolerance). Amaphoyinti alinganiswayo ngamaphoyinti esikeni nasemaphakathi ngamanxantathu ngamanye. Iphutha alilinganiswa ngendlela enye (kusuka kuhlangothi kuya kuskeni), ngakho indawo engaphuma ngaphaya kwesikeni ngeke ibonakale. Inothi ngaphansi kwethebula liphinda litshele ukuthi yingakanani indawo engafakeki ngoba incane kakhulu. Embonweni, amaphoyinti eskeni ayakhethwa ngombala ngemapu yawo wokuphambuka: luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka endaweni, luhlaza phakathi kuya ku-tolerance, bomvu ku-tolerance noma ngaphezulu (khipha \u003Cstrong\u003EShow the deviation map\u003C/strong\u003E ukuyifihla). Izingcezu ezigoqeka ziyazibheka (njengethyubhu evaliwe efakwe ngezindawo ezikhululekile, isibonelo) ziyadwetshwa njengezingafakiwe, ngaphandle kokuphoqwa zibe indawo eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStitch the surfaces to a solid\u003C/strong\u003E ihlanganisa zonke izindawo ezibonisiwe ezingekho ku-solid zibe i-solid eyodwa evaliwe. Izinhlangothi zeskeni zihlangana kuphela ngaphakathi kephutha lesikeni ngokwalo, ngakho ilinga ibanga elincane kakhulu lokuhlangana elivalayo (lingaphezu kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Estitch distance\u003C/strong\u003E oyisethayo) futhi inqaba ngamagama uma izinhlangothi zingavali. Ayikaze ilungise igebe. Ibhokisi elinemiphetho egotshiwe liyahlanganiswa uma ama-fillet alo atholakala njengezinhlangothi zalo, futhi ibanga lokuhlangana eliyivale liku-umphumela. I-solid bese isebenza no-Union, Subtract, Intersect nakwi-\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to the model\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungayenzi: i-\u003Cstrong\u003Erim fillet\u003C/strong\u003E (i-torus) ifunwa kuphela ezungeze i-axis yesilinda noma i-cone esele itholakele, ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Evariable fillet\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela ngomphetho ocaba kancane (imigqa yawo isikwa isikwele kuyinye indlela); kwezinye izindawo ziphuma njengama-patch ekhululekile uma ebushelelezi ngokwanele futhi zishiywe uma kungenjalo; izindawo ezinhle, ama-cone nama-fillet atholakala ngokukhetha ngokungahleliwe, ngakho ezincane kakhulu (ezimbalwa zamanxantathu) zingaphuthelwa; imephu yokuphambuka ibonisa ibanga kusuka eskeni kuya ezindaweni, hhayi kwelinye uhlangothi; amaskeni amakhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwamanxantathu angu-300,000) enqatshwa lapha. Izinhlangothi zesilinda esigcwele ukugoqa zisikwa ngokuzungeze izimbobo, nomshini wokuhlanganisa ubekwe lapho kungekho mbobo. Hlola yonke inhlangothi ngeskeni lakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwe\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugoqa imiphetho ehlangana ekhoneni lezindawo ezigobile noma ngamarediyasi ahlukene (i-vertex blend), i-fillet phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezingahlanganiyo, i-fillet yangaphakathi ephela esicabeni esithambekile noma esigobile, nama-Boolean kanye nama-fillet ebalwa ezindaweni ngaphandle kwamanxantathu (lapha injini ye-solid isebenza ngamanxantathu angaphakathi kwe-tolerance, bese kulandela ukubuyiselwa kwamaphoyinti ezindaweni ezinembile).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ipaneli ye-Surfaces yenza amajika nezindawo ezibushelelezi zohlobo olusetshenziswa ekwakheni amashelu omkhiqizo, izimoto nezingaphansi kwemikhumbi: NURBS, izibalo ezifanayo nalezo ezisetshenziswa abanye abenza amamodeli ezindawo. Konke kulinganiswa ezindaweni ezinembile, hhayi ezinxantathwini ozibonayo. Usayizi kule paneli uku-millimetres, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi imodeli ibonisa. Yivule kusuka ephaneleni lesokudla: Surfaces › Open the Surfaces panel. Imodeli esinezindawo ivula kuyo lodwa. Indlela umyalo osebenza ngayo Cindezela umyalo (isibonelo Loft). Ipaneli ikutshela okudingayo: amaphoyinti, amajika, umphetho wendawo noma isiphetho sejika. Yikhethe: chofoza kuzo ku-3D view, noma cindezela Pick (noma izinkinobho zomphetho nesiphetho) eduze kwengxenye ngayinye kuhlu. Ukuze uthole umphetho, chofoza eduze kwalowo mphetho wendawo. Hlola izinketho (degree, tolerance, continuity, …) bese ucindezela Make. Amajika avela kumaphoyinti athathwa njengamaphoyinti athayiphwe eyodwa emugqeni ngamunye (x, y, z ngo-mm), noma Pick points in the view: ukuchofoza ngakunye kusebenzisa ukubamba okufanayo njengamathuluzi okudweba; cindezela \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza kabili ukuqeda, \u003Ckbd\u003EEsc\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyeka. Amajika Curve through points idlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti. Curve by control points ilandela ikheji lamaphoyinti kunalokho. Insert knot, Raise degree no Lower degree zishintsha indlela ijika elichazwa ngayo ngaphandle kokulinyanisa (ukwehlisa kuyenqaba uma ijika lingahamba ngaphezu kwe-tolerance). Rebuild curve iliphatha inani elisha lamaphoyinti okulawula bese isho ukuthi lihambe kangakanani. Match curve yenza isiphetho sijika sihlangane nesesinye nge-G0 (ukuthintana), G1 (indlela efanayo) noma G2 (nokugoba okufanayo). Blend curve yengeza ijika elisha phakathi kweziphetho ezimbili. Join curves no Split curve. Izindawo Loft phakathi kwamajika amabili noma ngaphezulu, Ruled surface phakathi kwamabili, Extrude curve, Revolve curve. Sweep along one rail ihambisa iphrofayili ngomzila ingayikhotheli, Sweep along two rails igcina iziphetho zephrofayili kuzo zombili izindikwa. Ama-sweep ayalinganiswa: umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi uhambe kanjani eduze nesweep yangempela. Surface from a curve network idlula kukhiye wamajika (okokuqala okukhethiwe yiziphrofayili, okunye yimiyalelo). Patch from four edges igcwalisa amajika amane ahlangana ezikhoneni zawo. Match surface yenza umphetho wendawo uhlangane nomakhelwane nge-G0, G1 noma G2; Blend surface yengeza indawo phakathi kwemiphetho emibili. Offset surface, Extend surface (indawo iqhubeka njengoba yayihamba), Rebuild surface, kanye nama-knot nama-degree wezindawo. Ukuhlola ikhwalithi Ithebula Shared edges lidweba yonke imiphetho okwabelana ngayo izindawo ezimbili, ngesikhala (mm), i-engeli phakathi kwazo (°), ukuqhuma kokugoba (1/mm), kanye nokuthi lokho kuyenza i-G0, G1 noma G2. Umphetho ongaphansi kwalokho ocelile uphinde ube ku-Problems (inkinobho ye-⚠ kubha yohlelo) ne-fix ethi Match. Show as › Zebra stripes no Curvature (Gaussian) zivela endaweni eyiyo: izinkanyezi ezigijima zingaphuli uma uwela umphetho zisho G1; izinkanyezi ezigcina nobubanzi bazo zisho G2. Ukugoba kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka lapho indawo iyisixhobo se-saddle, kuluhlaza lapho iyisigaxa, kumhlophe lapho iyisicaba. Control points idweba amanethiwekhi okulawula. Ama-G0–G2 alinganiswa emaphointini angu-33 ngomphetho ngamunye. G3 nekhwalithi \"class A\" azilinganiswa futhi aziphakanyiswa. Sika indawo Iqembu le-Trim lisika indawo ingashintshi ukwakheka kwayo: indawo igcina zonke amaphoyinti ayo okulawula, futhi kubonakala, kubalwe futhi kubhalwe kuphela ingxenye ngaphakathi kwesimo. Trim to a rectangle no Trim with a circle zisebenza ngesabelo (0 kuya ku-1) sendawo ngayinye ngayinye, ngakho azidingi ukukhethwa embonweni; Trim by a curve ithatha ijika elivaliwe elisendaweni (liprojectwa ngaphakathi kwendawo, futhi limelwa ngamagama uma livuliwe noma likude ngaphezu kwe-tolerance). Ukhethe Cut a hole ukuze ususe ingaphakathi kwesimo; uyishiye ingakhethwanga ukuze ugcine ingaphakathi kuphela. Indawo ingaba nesimo esisodwa esigcinwayo nanoma yiziphi izimbobo; isimo esidlula esinye singenqatshwa. Remove the trim ibonisa indawo yonke futhi. Imiphetho esikiwe ilandela isimo ngokunembile; i-Undo yepaneli ibuyisela i-trim njengesinye isinyathelo. I-STEP ithwala i-trim njengemingcele yobuso be-IGES njengendawo esikiwe (entity 144); bobabili bayayifunda. Ama-solid nama-Boolean Iqembu le-Solids lishintsha izindawo zibe imizimba evaliwe futhi liyihlanganise. I-solid lapha yisethi yezindawo zephaneli ezivala ivolumu ndawonye; ubuso bayo bugcina kuyi-NURBS enembile ngama-trim abo. Box solid, Cylinder solid ne-Sphere solid zenza eyodwa kusuka kusayizi obhalwe (ngo-mm): ibhokisi lobuso obucaba eziyisithupha, isilinda sohlangothi oluzungezile kanye nezinhlangothi ezimbili ezicaba ezisikwe isiyingi, insimbi eyodwa evuselelwe. Solid from surfaces ihlanganisa izindawo owezenzele wena. Zikhethe, noma ungakhethi lutho ukusebenzisa zonke izindawo ezibonisiwe ezingekho ku-solid. Zishelelwa ndawonye ngaphakathi kwe-tolerance: uma zingavaleki, akukho okushintsha futhi iphaneli ithi imiphetho emingaki ivulekile nokuthi kufanele zihlangane kanjani eduze. Union, Subtract (i-solid yesibili ithathwa ku-solid yokuqala) ne-Intersect (kuphela okwabelwana ngakho kokubili) zithatha ama-solid amabili: chofoza ubuso ngabunye embonweni, noma cindezela Pick kuhlu lwe-Solids. Khetha Keep the two solids ukuze uwagcine eceleni komphumela. I-Boolean igcina zonke izinhlangothi endaweni yazo enembile futhi iyisike ngemiphetho emisha ye-trim endaweni yokuhlangana. Umugqa womphumela unikeza izibalo ezilinganisiwe: ukuthi amaphoyinti e-solid engine adinge ukuhamba kangakanani ukuze ahlale ezindaweni ezinembile (akulokhu ngaphezu kwe-tolerance), ukuthi amaphoyinti okuhlangana aseduze kangakanani nazo zombili izindawo (ngokuvamile amamicron ambalwa), ivolumu, nokuthi izinhlangothi ezintsha ziyavala yini uma zihlanganiswa kabusha ngezindawo zazo ezinembile. Ivolumu ilinganiswa ezinxantathwini ngaphakathi kwe-tolerance (0.05 mm uma ungasethi enye), ngakho ivolumu ye-sphere noma isilinda ifunda kancane kunaleyo enembile: i-tolerance encane isondela kakhulu. I-Boolean engenzeki ngokucacile (ama-solid awanalutho ahlanganyelwe, umugqa wesimo uzozibhoka) iyenqatshwa ngamagama futhi ayishintshi lutho. I-Boolean eyodwa ingumyalo owodwa we-Undo yepaneli. Ohlwini lwe-Solids, Ungroup igcina izinhlangothi njengezindawo ezijwayelekile; i-bin isusa i-solid nezinhlangothi zayo. Add to the model (ohlwini lwe-Solids) ifaka ikhophi ye-solid emodelini njengeqembu elilodwa elivaliwe, izinhlangothi zalo zibe amanxantathu ngaphakathi kwe-0.05 mm, ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo yemodeli. Khona-ke isebenza no-Union, Subtract ne-Intersect zemodeli, nokusunduzwa/ukuhudulwa, nokuhlola kokuprinta nge-3D; i-solid enembile ihlala kuphaneli. Ama-fillet nokujiya Fillet between faces igoqa umphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili zesolid eyodwa zihlangana: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili (embonweni, noma nge-Pick ohlwini), uthayipha radius nokuthi, uma irediyasi ishintsha ngomphetho, radius at the end (0 igcina irediyasi eyodwa). Ibhola lale rediyasi liqhutshwa ngomphetho lithinta zombili izinhlangothi; i-fillet iyi-arc yesekethe enembile etholakala kuyo yonke indawo, ihlanganiswe ibe indawo eyodwa, futhi izinhlangothi zombili zisikwa lapho ibhola lithinta khona. Umphetho wangaphandle ulahlekelwa izinto, ikhona langaphakathi liyazuza. Umugqa womphumela unikeza okulinganisiwe: ukuthi indawo ye-fillet ikude kangakanani nebhola eligingqayo phakathi kwamaphoyinti ayakhelwe kuwo (amaphoyinti engezwa kuze kube ngaphakathi kwekota ye-tolerance), i-engeli enkulu phakathi kwe-fillet nakuyo yonke inhlangothi ngomugqa wokuthinta, nezinombolo ezifanayo nezeUnion. Irediyasi engalingani (ibhola lingashiya inhlangothi, noma inhlangothi igoba ngokuqinile kunerediyasi) iyenqatshwa, ikhomba inhlangothi, futhi akukho okushintsha. Fillet several edges igoqa imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho wokuqala, bese ezimbili zomphetho olandelayo, njalo njalo (inhlangothi ingaba kwamaphayiri amaningi, isibonelo uhlangothi oluphezulu bhokisi kwamane kuwo); yonke imiphetho ithola irediyasi oyithayipha. Ukugoqwa ngakunye kusebenza ku-solid njengoba ibisekhona, bese ziyasikwa ngolandelana, ngakho i-oda aliphazamisi. Lapho imiphetho emibili egotshiwe ihlangana ekhoneni elinemiphetho ehlala ibukhali, ama-fillet amabili ayahlangana ngejika lokuhlangana (i-crease). Lapho imiphetho yangaphandle emithathu egotshiwe yezinhlangothi ezintathu ezicaba ihlangana ngerediyasi eyodwa, ikhona liyiyo i-sphere patch ethinta zonke ezintathu i-fillet (khipha Corners ukuze uthole ikhona elinecreasi); umphetho kumele ube muhle kabili kunerediyasi uma ekugcineni kwawo kokubili kuyiziKhoni ezinjalo. Umugqa womphumela ulandisa ukuthi imiphetho emingaki igotshiwe nokuthi amakhona aphumelele kanjani. Imiphetho yangaphakathi nayo ingagotshwa ndawonye, kodwa umphumela ongavali kabusha uyabikwa kuphela (umugqa uyasho), ngakho hlola. Thicken into a solid inikeza indawo ukuqina: yikhethe, uthayipha i-thickness, bese ukhetha Other side ukuze ukhulise ngolunye uhlangothi. Ubuso obusukiwe bulingana nendawo futhi bulinganiswa kuyo (umugqa womphumela unikeza umehluko omkhulu kakhulu ngobukhulu); izindonga zilandela yonke imiphetho nemigqa yesimo. Uma indawo igoba ngokuqinile kunobukhulu ngalolo hlangothi, noma enye ingxenye yayo ilele iseduze kunobukhulu, iyenqatshwa, ibize indawo nendawo, futhi akukho okushintsha. Undo, ifayela, STEP ne-IGES Iphaneli inayo Undo neyayo Redo (isinyathelo esisodwa ngomyalo ngamunye). Izindawo zigcinwa kufayela le-.modelcraft kanye nemodeli; azisiyo ingxenye ye-undo yemodeli, njengezinto zokwakha zefayela. STEP… (AP242) ne-IGES… zigcina amajika nezindawo ngendlela ezinjalo ngokunembile (amajika nezindawo ze-B-spline, akukho okuguqulwe kube amanxantathu). Ngayinye indawo iyiyo ubuso bayo, nesikhala sayo; i-solid ibhalwa njengegobolondo elilodwa elivaliwe, umphetho ngamunye wabelwa izinhlangothi zawo ezimbili njengoba ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD zilindele (umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi ma-solid angaki aphumile ngalendlela). Ku-IGES i-solid efanayo ibe yi-manifold solid B-rep eyodwa (entity 186 ngegobolondo elivaliwe 514, izinhlangothi 510, amaloop 508, uhlu lwemiphetho 504 kanye nohlu lwamaphoyinti 502); i-solid enezinhlangothi ezingaxhumani emphethweni ngomphetho ngamunye ibhalwa njengezinhlangothi ezihlukene, nomugqa uyasho lokho. I-Import… ifunda i-solid efana nalena ibuyele njengesolid, kusuka ku-STEP nasku-IGES. Ifunda amajika nezindawo ezibhalwe ngale ndlela, namasethi amaphathi .ccnurbs; ama-solid e-STEP avela ezinhlelweni zabanye avulwa nge-File › Import njengama-mesh. Izindawo ezivela kuscan (reverse engineering) Khetha i-mesh eskenwe emodelini (akukho okukhethiwe kusho ukuthi konke okubonisiwe), vula Surfaces, bese ku-Scan ukhetha Fit surfaces to the scan. Lo thuluzi lifuna amapuleni, amasilinda, amasphere nama-cone (izindawo ezingangempela ezakhiwe ngazo ingxenye eyenziwe ngomshini; umugqa ngamunye ukhombisa irediyasi noma i-half-angle eyitholile), lithola ama-fillet (imiphetho nezikhona ezigotshiwe: isilinda esincane noma i-sphere ehamba ithinte izinhlangothi ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, ibonisa irediyasi yayo nezinhlangothi ezihlangana nazo), rim fillets (i-torus: umphetho ogotshiwe lapho inhlangothi ecaba ihlangana nesilinda noma ne-cone, ibonisa irediyasi yayo nerediyasi yesiyingi), kanye ne-variable fillets (umphetho ogotshiwe onerediyasi eshintsha ngawo, ibonisa irediyasi kuwo wonke omabili), ifake indawo eyodwa ekhululekile kuyo ibushelelezi, ihlakazekile kancane, bese isika yonke inhlangothi ibe umphetho wengxenye yesikeni okuvela kuyo, ngakho izimbobo nezikhona ziyahlala. Izinketho: i-tolerance (kude kangakanani, ngo-mm, isikeni ingaba kuyo ipuleni noma kusilinda futhi isaba yalo, nenjongo yendawo ekhululekile), smallest piece (isabelo sendawo) kanye ne-most faces. Ikeni efanayo nezinketho ezifanayo zinikeza izinhlangothi ezifanayo nsukuzonke. Umphumela uyithebula, umugqa owodwa ngensizakalo: uhlobo lwayo, inani lamanxantathu ayivela kuwo, nephutha elilinganiswe kusuka esikeni kuya kuhlangothi (i-rms, enkulu kakhulu, nesabelo samaphoyinti angaphakathi kwe-tolerance). Amaphoyinti alinganiswayo ngamaphoyinti esikeni nasemaphakathi ngamanxantathu ngamanye. Iphutha alilinganiswa ngendlela enye (kusuka kuhlangothi kuya kuskeni), ngakho indawo engaphuma ngaphaya kwesikeni ngeke ibonakale. Inothi ngaphansi kwethebula liphinda litshele ukuthi yingakanani indawo engafakeki ngoba incane kakhulu. Embonweni, amaphoyinti eskeni ayakhethwa ngombala ngemapu yawo wokuphambuka: luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka endaweni, luhlaza phakathi kuya ku-tolerance, bomvu ku-tolerance noma ngaphezulu (khipha Show the deviation map ukuyifihla). Izingcezu ezigoqeka ziyazibheka (njengethyubhu evaliwe efakwe ngezindawo ezikhululekile, isibonelo) ziyadwetshwa njengezingafakiwe, ngaphandle kokuphoqwa zibe indawo eyodwa. Stitch the surfaces to a solid ihlanganisa zonke izindawo ezibonisiwe ezingekho ku-solid zibe i-solid eyodwa evaliwe. Izinhlangothi zeskeni zihlangana kuphela ngaphakathi kephutha lesikeni ngokwalo, ngakho ilinga ibanga elincane kakhulu lokuhlangana elivalayo (lingaphezu kwe-stitch distance oyisethayo) futhi inqaba ngamagama uma izinhlangothi zingavali. Ayikaze ilungise igebe. Ibhokisi elinemiphetho egotshiwe liyahlanganiswa uma ama-fillet alo atholakala njengezinhlangothi zalo, futhi ibanga lokuhlangana eliyivale liku-umphumela. I-solid bese isebenza no-Union, Subtract, Intersect nakwi-Add to the model. Okungayenzi: i-rim fillet (i-torus) ifunwa kuphela ezungeze i-axis yesilinda noma i-cone esele itholakele, ne-variable fillet kuphela ngomphetho ocaba kancane (imigqa yawo isikwa isikwele kuyinye indlela); kwezinye izindawo ziphuma njengama-patch ekhululekile uma ebushelelezi ngokwanele futhi zishiywe uma kungenjalo; izindawo ezinhle, ama-cone nama-fillet atholakala ngokukhetha ngokungahleliwe, ngakho ezincane kakhulu (ezimbalwa zamanxantathu) zingaphuthelwa; imephu yokuphambuka ibonisa ibanga kusuka eskeni kuya ezindaweni, hhayi kwelinye uhlangothi; amaskeni amakhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwamanxantathu angu-300,000) enqatshwa lapha. Izinhlangothi zesilinda esigcwele ukugoqa zisikwa ngokuzungeze izimbobo, nomshini wokuhlanganisa ubekwe lapho kungekho mbobo. Hlola yonke inhlangothi ngeskeni lakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kuyo. Akukakwakhiwe Ukugoqa imiphetho ehlangana ekhoneni lezindawo ezigobile noma ngamarediyasi ahlukene (i-vertex blend), i-fillet phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezingahlanganiyo, i-fillet yangaphakathi ephela esicabeni esithambekile noma esigobile, nama-Boolean kanye nama-fillet ebalwa ezindaweni ngaphandle kwamanxantathu (lapha injini ye-solid isebenza ngamanxantathu angaphakathi kwe-tolerance, bese kulandela ukubuyiselwa kwamaphoyinti ezindaweni ezinembile).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nodes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amanodi: yakha imodeli ngokuxhuma","summary":"Xhuma izinombolo zibe amaphoyinti, amaphoyinti abe amajika, namajika abe izindawo. Shintsha inombolo bese konke okulandelayo kwakhiwa kabusha. Yonke i-node nayo iwumugqa we-CraftScript, futhi igrafu igcinwa kufayela.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["amanodi","umhleli wamanodi","visual scripting","parametric","igrafu","izintambo","amaport","okukhululekile","freeform","nurbs","loft","extrude","revolve","isiyingi","ijika","indawo","uchungechunge","uhlu","isikripthi","craftscript","grasshopper"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuxhuma","text":"Ukuxhuma","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-nezinyunithi","text":"Izinhlobo nezinyunithi","level":2},{"id":"ama-solid-namabhulu-njengama-node","text":"Ama-solid namabhulu njengama-node","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha","text":"Amaphutha","level":2},{"id":"yonke-i-node-ingumugqa-wescript","text":"Yonke i-node ingumugqa wescript","level":2},{"id":"igcinwe-nefayela","text":"Igcinwe nefayela","level":2},{"id":"guqula-ibe-imodeli","text":"Guqula ibe imodeli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmhleli we-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanodi\u003C/strong\u003E wakha ijiyomethri ngokuxhuma amabhokisi ndawonye. Ibhokisi ngalinye (i-node) lenza umsebenzi omncane: lenza inombolo, iphoyinti, isiyingi, i-loft. Uxhuma umphumela wesinye kokufakwayo kwesilandelayo, bese imodeli iyalandela uma ushintsha inombolo eqalayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUyivule kusuka ephaneleni lesokudla: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENodes\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENodes…\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela elinegrafu esevele liyivula lodwa. Iwindi eliphezu kombono we-3D: hudula isihloko sayo ukuze uyihambise, hudula ikhona layo ukuze ushintshe usayizi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuxhuma\"\u003EUkuxhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-node kuhlu oluseceleni kwesokunxele (thayipha esibhokisini sokusesha ukuze unciphise, &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; ingeza okokuqala okufanayo). Ivela phakathi kwe-canvas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula kusuka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eoutput\u003C/strong\u003E yesiyingi esincane eseceleni lesokudla le-node eyodwa iye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Einput\u003C/strong\u003E yesiyingi esincane eseceleni lesokunxele lenye. Ichashazi liba luhlaza uma lifaneleka, libe bomvu uma lingafaneleki; liphathe ngesikhombi ukuze uthole isizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-input engenalutho ibonisa ibhokisi lenani elithayiphiwe. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela &lt;kbd&gt;Tab&lt;/kbd&gt;: umphumela uyakhiwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiyingi esincane esisesihlokweni se-node yiso i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eeye\u003C/strong\u003E. I-node enesiyingi ivuliwe iyadwetshwa embonweni we-3D, njengemigqa yamajika, ukukhanya kwezindawo, amachashazi wamaphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula i-node ngesihloko sayo. Hudula ingemuva ukuze uhambe, phendula isondo ukuze usondele. &lt;kbd&gt;Delete&lt;/kbd&gt; isusa i-node ekhethiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETidy\u003C/span\u003E ihlela ama-node ngamakholomu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E iwalethela wonke embonweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E zihamba phakathi kokuhlela kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-nezinyunithi\"\u003EIzinhlobo nezinyunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-port anohlobo: inombolo, yebo/cha, iphoyinti, i-vector, ijika, indawo, imesh, i-solid, noma &quot;geometry&quot; kunoma yimuphi kwalezo. Iphoyinti lingadlulisela i-vector input nokubuyela emuva. Izinombolo zithwala iyunithi: i-\u003Cstrong\u003Elength\u003C/strong\u003E isemamilimitha futhi i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eangle\u003C/strong\u003E iseziqeshini. I-length ayikwazi ukudlulisela ku-angle, futhi i-length ephindwe ngayo yona (indawo) iyenqatshwa, ngakho umugqa ongalungile uyamiswa lapho wenziwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhla oluyisikwele yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Elist\u003C/strong\u003E. Uma uhla lufinyelela okokufakwayo okunenani elilodwa, i-node isebenza kanye ngechaza ngalinye, bese umphumela wayo uba uhla. Uhla olufushane luphinda okokugcina kwalo. Isibonelo, i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESeries\u003C/strong\u003E yobude efakwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EMove\u003C/strong\u003E yenza isitaki samakhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-solid-namabhulu-njengama-node\"\u003EAma-solid namabhulu njengama-node\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu \u003Cstrong\u003ESolids\u003C/strong\u003E lenza imizimba evaliwe kusuka kuzindawo ezifanayo nasephaneli Yezinkalo: \u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E (usayizi ngamamilimitha), \u003Cstrong\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/strong\u003E (Union), \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E (Subtract) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlanganisa\u003C/strong\u003E (Intersect) (i-solid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala; ukubekezelela yibanga lapho izinxantathu zenjini ye-solid zingaba khona kude nezindawo ezinembile), \u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E (izinhlangothi ngenombolo yazo ku-solid, 1 kowokuqala; irediyasi, nerediyasi ekugcineni uma ingaphezu kuka-0), \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid volume\u003C/strong\u003E (mm³) no \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid to mesh\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuze ubone noma uyibhake).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-solid inohlobo lwayo lwe-port: iphoyinti noma inombolo akukwazi ukuxhunywa kokufakwayo kwe-solid, futhi ichashazi lihlala libomvu. Ama-node e-Boolean ne-Fillet asebenzisa injini ye-solid yohlelo ngokwalo, elayishwa ngokuqala lapho umhleli uvulwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha\"\u003EAmaphutha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-node engakwazi ukwenza umsebenzi wayo ichaza ngani ngaphansi kwegama layo, ngombala obomvu (&quot;Irediyasi kufanele ibe ngaphezu kwe-zero.&quot;), namanodi alandelayo ayalinda. Lo mlayezo ufana ne-Problem kwiphaneli ye-Problems, ngakho ungawuthola khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yonke-i-node-ingumugqa-wescript\"\u003EYonke i-node ingumugqa wescript\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E ukubona igrafu njengoba iri-CraftScript: umugqa owodwa ngayinye ye-node, njengo \u003Ccode\u003En3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);\u003C/code\u003E. Hlela umbhalo bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the graph from this script\u003C/span\u003E ukuyibuyisa ibe yigrafu. Imisebenzi ye-\u003Ccode\u003End_\u003C/code\u003E ifanayo kuCraftScript ku-PartCraft, ngakho igrafu ingasebenza, iphindwe noma ihlolwe khona. Izinombolo ezingahleliwe zihlala zithatha i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eseed\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho igrafu efanayo inikeza umphumela ofanayo kuzo zonke izikhompyutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igcinwe-nefayela\"\u003EIgcinwe nefayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgrafu igcinwa kufayela lemodeli. Ama-node akha amajika, izindawo nama-mesh ngokwawo: awashintshi izinhlangothi zemodeli kuze kucelwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guqula-ibe-imodeli\"\u003EGuqula ibe imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula isiyingi se-node eyenza indawo noma i-mesh, bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBake to model\u003C/span\u003E ewindini le-Nodes. Ingxenye ngayinye evezwayo iba iqembu lezinhlangothi emodelini, ngamamitha, oyikwazi ukuhlela njengakunoma yini enye. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa se-undo. Igrafu iyahlala, kodwa ikhophi ayisalandeli: shintsha inombolo bese uyi-bhake futhi ukuthola enye entsha. Amaphoyinti namajika akayona ama-solid, ngakho ayakhishwa, nombhalo uyasho ukuthi yangaki.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Umhleli we-Amanodi wakha ijiyomethri ngokuxhuma amabhokisi ndawonye. Ibhokisi ngalinye (i-node) lenza umsebenzi omncane: lenza inombolo, iphoyinti, isiyingi, i-loft. Uxhuma umphumela wesinye kokufakwayo kwesilandelayo, bese imodeli iyalandela uma ushintsha inombolo eqalayo. Uyivule kusuka ephaneleni lesokudla: Nodes › Nodes…. Ifayela elinegrafu esevele liyivula lodwa. Iwindi eliphezu kombono we-3D: hudula isihloko sayo ukuze uyihambise, hudula ikhona layo ukuze ushintshe usayizi. Ukuxhuma Khetha i-node kuhlu oluseceleni kwesokunxele (thayipha esibhokisini sokusesha ukuze unciphise, \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E ingeza okokuqala okufanayo). Ivela phakathi kwe-canvas. Hudula kusuka ku-output yesiyingi esincane eseceleni lesokudla le-node eyodwa iye ku-input yesiyingi esincane eseceleni lesokunxele lenye. Ichashazi liba luhlaza uma lifaneleka, libe bomvu uma lingafaneleki; liphathe ngesikhombi ukuze uthole isizathu. I-input engenalutho ibonisa ibhokisi lenani elithayiphiwe. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd\u003ETab\u003C/kbd\u003E: umphumela uyakhiwa kabusha. Isiyingi esincane esisesihlokweni se-node yiso i-eye. I-node enesiyingi ivuliwe iyadwetshwa embonweni we-3D, njengemigqa yamajika, ukukhanya kwezindawo, amachashazi wamaphoyinti. Hudula i-node ngesihloko sayo. Hudula ingemuva ukuze uhambe, phendula isondo ukuze usondele. \u003Ckbd\u003EDelete\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa i-node ekhethiwe. Tidy ihlela ama-node ngamakholomu, Fit iwalethela wonke embonweni, Undo no Redo zihamba phakathi kokuhlela kwakho. Izinhlobo nezinyunithi Ama-port anohlobo: inombolo, yebo/cha, iphoyinti, i-vector, ijika, indawo, imesh, i-solid, noma \"geometry\" kunoma yimuphi kwalezo. Iphoyinti lingadlulisela i-vector input nokubuyela emuva. Izinombolo zithwala iyunithi: i-length isemamilimitha futhi i-angle iseziqeshini. I-length ayikwazi ukudlulisela ku-angle, futhi i-length ephindwe ngayo yona (indawo) iyenqatshwa, ngakho umugqa ongalungile uyamiswa lapho wenziwa. Uhla oluyisikwele yi-list. Uma uhla lufinyelela okokufakwayo okunenani elilodwa, i-node isebenza kanye ngechaza ngalinye, bese umphumela wayo uba uhla. Uhla olufushane luphinda okokugcina kwalo. Isibonelo, i-Series yobude efakwa ku-Move yenza isitaki samakhophi. Ama-solid namabhulu njengama-node Iqembu Solids lenza imizimba evaliwe kusuka kuzindawo ezifanayo nasephaneli Yezinkalo: Box solid, Cylinder solid no Sphere solid (usayizi ngamamilimitha), Hlanganisa (Union), Susa (Subtract) ne-Ukuhlanganisa (Intersect) (i-solid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala; ukubekezelela yibanga lapho izinxantathu zenjini ye-solid zingaba khona kude nezindawo ezinembile), Fillet between faces (izinhlangothi ngenombolo yazo ku-solid, 1 kowokuqala; irediyasi, nerediyasi ekugcineni uma ingaphezu kuka-0), Solid volume (mm³) no Solid to mesh (ukuze ubone noma uyibhake). I-solid inohlobo lwayo lwe-port: iphoyinti noma inombolo akukwazi ukuxhunywa kokufakwayo kwe-solid, futhi ichashazi lihlala libomvu. Ama-node e-Boolean ne-Fillet asebenzisa injini ye-solid yohlelo ngokwalo, elayishwa ngokuqala lapho umhleli uvulwa. Amaphutha I-node engakwazi ukwenza umsebenzi wayo ichaza ngani ngaphansi kwegama layo, ngombala obomvu (\"Irediyasi kufanele ibe ngaphezu kwe-zero.\"), namanodi alandelayo ayalinda. Lo mlayezo ufana ne-Problem kwiphaneli ye-Problems, ngakho ungawuthola khona. Yonke i-node ingumugqa wescript Cindezela Script ukubona igrafu njengoba iri-CraftScript: umugqa owodwa ngayinye ye-node, njengo n3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);. Hlela umbhalo bese ucindezela Make the graph from this script ukuyibuyisa ibe yigrafu. Imisebenzi ye-nd_ ifanayo kuCraftScript ku-PartCraft, ngakho igrafu ingasebenza, iphindwe noma ihlolwe khona. Izinombolo ezingahleliwe zihlala zithatha i-seed, ngakho igrafu efanayo inikeza umphumela ofanayo kuzo zonke izikhompyutha. Igcinwe nefayela Igrafu igcinwa kufayela lemodeli. Ama-node akha amajika, izindawo nama-mesh ngokwawo: awashintshi izinhlangothi zemodeli kuze kucelwe. Guqula ibe imodeli Vula isiyingi se-node eyenza indawo noma i-mesh, bese ucindezela Bake to model ewindini le-Nodes. Ingxenye ngayinye evezwayo iba iqembu lezinhlangothi emodelini, ngamamitha, oyikwazi ukuhlela njengakunoma yini enye. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa se-undo. Igrafu iyahlala, kodwa ikhophi ayisalandeli: shintsha inombolo bese uyi-bhake futhi ukuthola enye entsha. Amaphoyinti namajika akayona ama-solid, ngakho ayakhishwa, nombhalo uyasho ukuthi yangaki.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"resin-printing","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlukanisa ngomshini wokuphrinta we-resin","summary":"Hlukanisa ibhedi lokuphrinta lesiteji ngomshini wokuphrinta we-resin, gqoka futhi ulekelele ingxenye, bheka ngezendlalelo, londoloza ifayela lomshini, bese uthola ukuvezwa kwakho ngovivinyo lokuvezwa.","section":"tasks","order":108,"keywords":["i-resin","ukuphrinta nge-resin","sla","msla","dlp","isihlukanisi","goo","sl1","ctb","cbddlp","chitubox","anycubic","pwmx","pws","elegoo","ukugoqa","umgodi wokuphefumula","irafu","izisekelo zokusekela","ovivinyo lokuvezwa","indlela yokuvezwa","izendlalelo","i-add-on"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"thola-ukuvezwa-kwakho","text":"Thola ukuvezwa kwakho","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAma-add-on e-resin ahlukanisa okusebhedini lokuphrinta abe izithombe zezendlalelo zesikrini somshini wakho, bese elondoloza ifayela umshini wakho ulifundayo. Ahhala, awakho okuvalekile, futhi avalwe kuze kuvulwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakayiswa ifayela kumshini wangempela wokuphrinta. Amafayela afundwe yizifundi zabafundi bakwa-CadCraft kuphela, nezisekelo zintsha. Hlola izendlalelo, bese wenza ukuphrinta kokuqala ngesandla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlukanisa ingxenye ye-resin, hlola izendlalelo, londoloza ifayela bese uliphehlela emshinini wakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula i-add-on yesihlukanisi se-resin ne-add-on yefomethi yefayela lomshini wakho (Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox, noma Anycubic). Ungacindezela futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukuphrinta nge-resin\u003C/span\u003E ekhadini lesiteji sokuphrinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka ingxenye yakho ebhedini njengoba kuchazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-stage\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-stage\"\u003EBeka izinto ebhedini lokuphrinta\u003C/a\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-resin\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphrinta nge\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EResin print settings\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPrinter\u003C/strong\u003E yakho ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EResin\u003C/strong\u003E yakho. Ikhadi libonisa usayizi wesikrini ngamaphikseli. Lawa ngosayizi abashicileli ababhalile, ngakho ahlole ngokwakho; ungawahlela ngaphansi kwe-Custom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer height (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EExposure (s)\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EBottom exposure (s)\u003C/strong\u003E. Izinombolo zento ngayinye ye-resin zisuke nje kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETika \u003Cstrong\u003EHollow it, with a vent hole\u003C/strong\u003E uma ufuna ingxenye eyimbobo, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EWall (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EHole width (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETika \u003Cstrong\u003ESupports and a raft\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESupport density\u003C/strong\u003E: Light, Medium noma Heavy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFile format\u003C/strong\u003E. Uma ikhadi lisho ukuthi akukakhiwa lutho, cindezela inkinobho ethi Add negama lefomethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa izendlalelo\u003C/span\u003E bese uhambisa isilayidi se-\u003Cstrong\u003ELayer\u003C/strong\u003E. Izinto ezintantayo zibhalwe ngomjikelezo. Umugqa ongaphansi kwayo unikeza izendlalelo, isikhathi, ne-resin ngo-mL, amagremu nezindleko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ifayela lokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E, hlola isifinyezo bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E. Kopisha ifayela emshinini wakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-ukuvezwa-kwakho\"\u003EThola ukuvezwa kwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-add-on yovivinyo lokuvezwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka ingxenye yovivinyo ebhedini\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza indlela yokuvezwa\u003C/span\u003E. Uthola ifayela elilodwa ngokuvezwa ngakunye, ku-zip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhrinta ngalinye lamafayela nge-resin efanayo, bese ugcina ukuvezwa okucacile kakhulu ngezinsika ezincane nezimbobo ezivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlukanisa kusebenza ngemuva, ngakho ikhasi liyasebenza ngisho nasebhedini elikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye ezingewona amavolumu avaliwe ziyasuswa, futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umshini wakho ungamukeli ifayela, ikhadi lefomethi linezinketho zalokho lefomethi eyishiyile ivulekile. Shintsha okukodwa, londoloza futhi, bese usitshela ukuthi yiphi eyasebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinguqulo ze-Anycubic 517 nezi-518 aziloghwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ama-add-on e-resin ahlukanisa okusebhedini lokuphrinta abe izithombe zezendlalelo zesikrini somshini wakho, bese elondoloza ifayela umshini wakho ulifundayo. Ahhala, awakho okuvalekile, futhi avalwe kuze kuvulwe. Akukakayiswa ifayela kumshini wangempela wokuphrinta. Amafayela afundwe yizifundi zabafundi bakwa-CadCraft kuphela, nezisekelo zintsha. Hlola izendlalelo, bese wenza ukuphrinta kokuqala ngesandla. Okuzokwenza Hlukanisa ingxenye ye-resin, hlola izendlalelo, londoloza ifayela bese uliphehlela emshinini wakho. Izinyathelo Vula Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe bese uvula i-add-on yesihlukanisi se-resin ne-add-on yefomethi yefayela lomshini wakho (Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox, noma Anycubic). Ungacindezela futhi Engeza ukuphrinta nge-resin ekhadini lesiteji sokuphrinta. Beka ingxenye yakho ebhedini njengoba kuchazwe ku-Beka izinto ebhedini lokuphrinta, bese ukhetha I-resin eduze kwe-Ukuphrinta nge. Ngaphansi kwe-Resin print settings, khetha i-Printer yakho ne-Resin yakho. Ikhadi libonisa usayizi wesikrini ngamaphikseli. Lawa ngosayizi abashicileli ababhalile, ngakho ahlole ngokwakho; ungawahlela ngaphansi kwe-Custom. Setha Layer height (mm), Exposure (s) and Bottom exposure (s). Izinombolo zento ngayinye ye-resin zisuke nje kuqala. Tika Hollow it, with a vent hole uma ufuna ingxenye eyimbobo, bese usetha Wall (mm) ne-Hole width (mm). Tika Supports and a raft, bese ukhetha Support density: Light, Medium noma Heavy. Khetha File format. Uma ikhadi lisho ukuthi akukakhiwa lutho, cindezela inkinobho ethi Add negama lefomethi. Cindezela Bonisa izendlalelo bese uhambisa isilayidi se-Layer. Izinto ezintantayo zibhalwe ngomjikelezo. Umugqa ongaphansi kwayo unikeza izendlalelo, isikhathi, ne-resin ngo-mL, amagremu nezindleko. Cindezela Londoloza ifayela lokuphrinta, hlola isifinyezo bese ucindezela Londoloza. Kopisha ifayela emshinini wakho. Thola ukuvezwa kwakho Vula i-add-on yovivinyo lokuvezwa ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. Cindezela Beka ingxenye yovivinyo ebhedini. Cindezela Londoloza indlela yokuvezwa. Uthola ifayela elilodwa ngokuvezwa ngakunye, ku-zip. Phrinta ngalinye lamafayela nge-resin efanayo, bese ugcina ukuvezwa okucacile kakhulu ngezinsika ezincane nezimbobo ezivulekile. Amanothi Ukuhlukanisa kusebenza ngemuva, ngakho ikhasi liyasebenza ngisho nasebhedini elikhulu. Izingxenye ezingewona amavolumu avaliwe ziyasuswa, futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho. Uma umshini wakho ungamukeli ifayela, ikhadi lefomethi linezinketho zalokho lefomethi eyishiyile ivulekile. Shintsha okukodwa, londoloza futhi, bese usitshela ukuthi yiphi eyasebenza. Izinguqulo ze-Anycubic 517 nezi-518 aziloghwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"styles-shadows","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izitayela nezithunzi zelanga","summary":"Bonisa imodeli inemibala, njengemigqa efihliwe, njengohlaka lwewaya noma ebonakala ngaphakathi, bese ufunda izithunzi eyikhipha noma nini, noma kusuphi nasiphi isikhathi nendawo.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["ukubuka kokwethula","ukubuka okuhlanzekile","fihla imihlahlandlela","fihla ama-akisi","isitayela","inemibala","umugqa ofihliwe","uhlaka lwewaya","x-ray","imiphetho","izithunzi","ilanga","ukutadisha ilanga","idethi","isikhathi","ububanzi bezwe","ubude bezwe","indawo yesikhathi","inyakatho"],"headings":[{"id":"ubuso","text":"Ubuso","level":2},{"id":"vula-izithunzi-zelanga","text":"Vula izithunzi zelanga","level":2},{"id":"bheka-imodeli-enyakatho","text":"Bheka imodeli enyakatho","level":2},{"id":"ukutadisha-ilanga","text":"Ukutadisha ilanga","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-kokwethula","text":"Ukubuka kokwethula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla iguqula indlela imodeli edwetshwa ngayo. Akukho okushintsha imodeli ngokwayo, futhi ayisiyona ingxenye yokuhlehlisa. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EUmboniso\u003C/a\u003E ngamunye ukhumbula isitayela sawo, nefayela likhumbula isitayela obeneso ngesikhathi ulondoloza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha esisodwa ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKubukeka kanjani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaded\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi eziqinile, zikhanyiswa kancane. Izinhlangothi ezibukwa emuva ziluhlaza-okhamba. Imibala etholakele iyabonakala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa ofihliwe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso ngombala wangemuva nemiphetho ngenki: umdwebo wemigqa ohlanzekile, imigqa efihliwe isusiwe. Mhlophe kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphepha\u003C/span\u003E, mnyama kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho kuphela. Ubuso aludwetshwa, kodwa buyabalwa lapho uchofoza futhi ubambelela: awukwazi ukukhetha ngaphesheya kwabo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso obubonakala ngaphakathi, ukuze ubone okungemuva noma okungaphakathi. Njengohlaka lwewaya, ukuchofoza nokubambelela kusamisa kuhlangothi oluseduze kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E ivula noma ivale imiphetho kuzo zonke izitayela ngaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kuvaliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa ofihliwe\u003C/span\u003E ubonisa cishe lutho, ngoba ubuso bayo bufana nangemuva. Imiphetho ethambile, njengezinhlangothi zesiyingi esihudulwe, ayikaze idwetshwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-izithunzi-zelanga\"\u003EVula izithunzi zelanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithunzi zelanga\u003C/span\u003E. Izilungiselelo zelanga ezingaphansi kwayo ziyasebenza, imodeli ikhipha izithunzi kuyo ngokwayo nasemhlabeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha indawo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi bezwe\u003C/span\u003E: inyakatho iyinani elihle, eseningizimu liyinani elibi (i-New York cishe 40.7, i-Sydney cishe -33.9).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude bezwe\u003C/span\u003E: empumalanga iyinani elihle, entshonalanga elibi (i-New York cishe -74.0).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphambuka kwe-UTC\u003C/span\u003E: ukuphambuka kwesayithi kusuka ku-UTC ngamahora, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E-5\u003C/code\u003E ye-New York ebusika. I-ModelCraft ayisebenzisi isikhathi sokonga emini; sebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003E-4\u003C/code\u003E ye-New York ehlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdethi\u003C/span\u003E (inyanga nosuku) bese uhudula i-slider \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/span\u003E. Isikhathi sihamba ngezinyathelo ze-15 eminithi futhi sibonakala eduze kwe-slider, njengo &quot;3:00 pm&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwezilungiselelo utshela ukuthi ilanga likuphi, njengo &quot;Ilanga lingu-52° phezulu, ku-250° kusuka enyakatho. Inyakatho iyi-akisi eluhlaza.&quot; Ebusuku uthi &quot;Ilanga lishonile ngalesi sikhathi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli entsha iqala nelanga ngomhlaka-21 kaJuni ngo-3:00 pm, ububanzi bezwe 40, ubude bezwe -105, ukuphambuka kwe-UTC -7.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-imodeli-enyakatho\"\u003EBheka imodeli enyakatho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInyakatho ye-ModelCraft iyihlale i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eakisi eluhlaza\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuze ufunde isayithi langempela, jikisa imodeli ukuze uhlangothi lwayo lwenyakatho lubheke ngokuya ngaseluhlaza: khetha konke (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza isikhungo emhlabathini, bese uyijikisa nge-engeli yesayithi ukusuka enyakatho (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003EJikisa nokushintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukutadisha-ilanga\"\u003EUkutadisha ilanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha indawo nedethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza umboniso (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza umboniso\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula i-slider yesikhathi, bese wengeza elinye umboniso. Phinda ngehora ngalinye ofuna lo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDlala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhambe kuwo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003ELondoloza ukubuka njengemiboniso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithunzi zingabonakala zinamazinyo emodelini emkhulu kakhulu, ngoba umephu wesithunzi oyodwa umboza yonke imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithunzi azidwetshwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhundla selanga silandela ukubalwa kwelanga kwe-NOAA futhi sinembile ngengxenye yedigri, okwanele izifundo zomumo wesakhiwo. Ukugoqeka kokukhanya emoyeni akucatshangelwa, ngakho izinkombe zelanga eziphansi eduze kokuphuma nokushona kwelanga zingaba zingalungile kancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kokwethula\"\u003EUkubuka kokwethula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokwethula\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ibonisa imodeli kuphela: ama-akisi, imigqa yesiqondisi namaphoyinti esiqondisi, imikhawulo yeplani yokusika (ukusika kuhlala), amarambu amalambu, ibhokisi lequmbi elivulekile, izimpawu zokubambelela namathiphu, nokukhethwa okugqamisiwe konke kuyanyamalala. Sebenzisa lokhu ukuze ubuke imodeli ngokucacile, noma ngaphambi kwesithombe-skrini. Amathuluzi asasebenza, futhi asabamba; izimpawu zona azisabonakali. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi ukuze ubuyisele. Izilinganiso zihlala, njengoba zingxenye yomdwebo. Uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, enye imodeli ayisafiphali: ibonakala njengoba iyunjalo, kanye nezindwangu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iphaneli Isitayela ngakwesokudla iguqula indlela imodeli edwetshwa ngayo. Akukho okushintsha imodeli ngokwayo, futhi ayisiyona ingxenye yokuhlehlisa. Umboniso ngamunye ukhumbula isitayela sawo, nefayela likhumbula isitayela obeneso ngesikhathi ulondoloza. Ubuso Khetha esisodwa ohlwini Ubuso: Isitayela Kubukeka kanjani Shaded Izinhlangothi eziqinile, zikhanyiswa kancane. Izinhlangothi ezibukwa emuva ziluhlaza-okhamba. Imibala etholakele iyabonakala. Umugqa ofihliwe Ubuso ngombala wangemuva nemiphetho ngenki: umdwebo wemigqa ohlanzekile, imigqa efihliwe isusiwe. Mhlophe kuthi Iphepha, mnyama kuthi Imodeli. Uhlaka lwewaya Imiphetho kuphela. Ubuso aludwetshwa, kodwa buyabalwa lapho uchofoza futhi ubambelela: awukwazi ukukhetha ngaphesheya kwabo. X-ray Ubuso obubonakala ngaphakathi, ukuze ubone okungemuva noma okungaphakathi. Njengohlaka lwewaya, ukuchofoza nokubambelela kusamisa kuhlangothi oluseduze kakhulu. Bonisa imiphetho ivula noma ivale imiphetho kuzo zonke izitayela ngaphandle kwe-Uhlaka lwewaya. Uma kuvaliwe, Umugqa ofihliwe ubonisa cishe lutho, ngoba ubuso bayo bufana nangemuva. Imiphetho ethambile, njengezinhlangothi zesiyingi esihudulwe, ayikaze idwetshwe. Vula izithunzi zelanga Thikha Izithunzi zelanga. Izilungiselelo zelanga ezingaphansi kwayo ziyasebenza, imodeli ikhipha izithunzi kuyo ngokwayo nasemhlabeni. Setha indawo: Ububanzi bezwe: inyakatho iyinani elihle, eseningizimu liyinani elibi (i-New York cishe 40.7, i-Sydney cishe -33.9). Ubude bezwe: empumalanga iyinani elihle, entshonalanga elibi (i-New York cishe -74.0). Ukuphambuka kwe-UTC: ukuphambuka kwesayithi kusuka ku-UTC ngamahora, njengo -5 ye-New York ebusika. I-ModelCraft ayisebenzisi isikhathi sokonga emini; sebenzisa -4 ye-New York ehlobo. Setha Idethi (inyanga nosuku) bese uhudula i-slider Isikhathi. Isikhathi sihamba ngezinyathelo ze-15 eminithi futhi sibonakala eduze kwe-slider, njengo \"3:00 pm\". Umugqa ongaphansi kwezilungiselelo utshela ukuthi ilanga likuphi, njengo \"Ilanga lingu-52° phezulu, ku-250° kusuka enyakatho. Inyakatho iyi-akisi eluhlaza.\" Ebusuku uthi \"Ilanga lishonile ngalesi sikhathi.\" Imodeli entsha iqala nelanga ngomhlaka-21 kaJuni ngo-3:00 pm, ububanzi bezwe 40, ubude bezwe -105, ukuphambuka kwe-UTC -7. Bheka imodeli enyakatho Inyakatho ye-ModelCraft iyihlale i-akisi eluhlaza. Ukuze ufunde isayithi langempela, jikisa imodeli ukuze uhlangothi lwayo lwenyakatho lubheke ngokuya ngaseluhlaza: khetha konke (Ctrl+A), cindezela Q, chofoza isikhungo emhlabathini, bese uyijikisa nge-engeli yesayithi ukusuka enyakatho (bheka Jikisa nokushintsha usayizi). Ukutadisha ilanga Setha indawo nedethi. Engeza umboniso (Engeza umboniso ohlwini Imiboniso). Hudula i-slider yesikhathi, bese wengeza elinye umboniso. Phinda ngehora ngalinye ofuna lo. Chofoza Dlala ukuze uhambe kuwo. Bheka Londoloza ukubuka njengemiboniso. Okufanele ukwazi Izithunzi zingabonakala zinamazinyo emodelini emkhulu kakhulu, ngoba umephu wesithunzi oyodwa umboza yonke imodeli. Izithunzi azidwetshwa ku-Uhlaka lwewaya. Isikhundla selanga silandela ukubalwa kwelanga kwe-NOAA futhi sinembile ngengxenye yedigri, okwanele izifundo zomumo wesakhiwo. Ukugoqeka kokukhanya emoyeni akucatshangelwa, ngakho izinkombe zelanga eziphansi eduze kokuphuma nokushona kwelanga zingaba zingalungile kancane. Ukubuka kokwethula Ukubuka › Ukubuka kokwethula (noma Shift+P) ibonisa imodeli kuphela: ama-akisi, imigqa yesiqondisi namaphoyinti esiqondisi, imikhawulo yeplani yokusika (ukusika kuhlala), amarambu amalambu, ibhokisi lequmbi elivulekile, izimpawu zokubambelela namathiphu, nokukhethwa okugqamisiwe konke kuyanyamalala. Sebenzisa lokhu ukuze ubuke imodeli ngokucacile, noma ngaphambi kwesithombe-skrini. Amathuluzi asasebenza, futhi asabamba; izimpawu zona azisabonakali. Cindezela Shift+P futhi ukuze ubuyisele. Izilinganiso zihlala, njengoba zingxenye yomdwebo. Uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu, enye imodeli ayisafiphali: ibonakala njengoba iyunjalo, kanye nezindwangu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Renda isithombe semodeli","summary":"Yenza isithombe esifana nokukhanya kwemini: isibhakabhaka, ilanga elisuka endaweni nasuku lwemodeli yakho, izithunzi ezithambile, ukubukeka kwengilazi nensimbi, bese ulondoloza njenge-PNG.","section":"tasks","order":112,"keywords":["renda","isethingi","izethingi zembonini","ngaphakathi","ngaphandle","ukubuka isigaba","ubusuku","inkinobho eyodwa","ukurenda","ukulandelela indlela","ukulandelela imisebe","ukukhanya kwemini","izithunzi","izithunzi ezithambile","ingilazi","insimbi","okukhazimulayo","izinto zokwakha","ukuvezwa","ukukhanya","ukuguqula","umusi","intuthu","ifu","imisebe yokukhanya","ukukhanya kwesibani","ukusampula okuzivumelanisayo","umsindo","isithombe","i-PNG"],"headings":[{"id":"renda-umbono","text":"Renda umbono","level":2},{"id":"izethingi-zembonini-isithombe-esihle-ngokuchofoza-kanye","text":"Izethingi zembonini: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"yenza-imibala-ibukeke-njengengilazi-noma-insimbi","text":"Yenza imibala ibukeke njengengilazi noma insimbi","level":2},{"id":"ikhwalithi-ephezulu","text":"Ikhwalithi ephezulu","level":2},{"id":"renda-emoweni","text":"Renda emoweni","level":2},{"id":"izinkabi-nezinhlobo-zokukhanya-ezisebenza-ekhadini-legrafikhi","text":"Izinkabi nezinhlobo zokukhanya ezisebenza ekhadini legrafikhi","level":2},{"id":"ikhamera","text":"Ikhamera","level":2},{"id":"qeda-isithombe","text":"Qeda isithombe","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isithombe","text":"Londoloza isithombe","level":2},{"id":"xuba-amalambu-ngemva-kokurenda","text":"Xuba amalambu ngemva kokurenda","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lokurenda","text":"Uhlu lokurenda","level":2},{"id":"ukhohlo-intuthu-umsindo-nokukhanya-okugoqekile","text":"Ukhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile","level":2},{"id":"isikhathi-esithathayo","text":"Isikhathi esithathayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E yenza isithombe sombono esifana nokukhanya kwemini kunokuba kube umdwebo: isibhakabhaka, ilanga endaweni nasuku lwemodeli yakho, izithunzi ezithambile, ukukhanya okuvela esibhakabhakeni sonke okufiphaza amakhona namagebe, nemibala engabonakala njengengilazi, insimbi noma upende okukhazimulayo. Imodeli ayishintshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"renda-umbono\"\u003ERenda umbono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungisa umbono ngendlela ofuna ngayo isithombe: zungeza, sondeza, khetha \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Eimbonini\u003C/a\u003E, fihla okungafanele kubonakale. Isithombe sisebenzisa ikhamera yombono ngokwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbonini\u003C/span\u003E uma eyeyekhethwe ingeyiyo leyo ofuna (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\"\u003EIzethingi zembonini\u003C/a\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe siyagcwala ngesikhathi sirenderwa futhi siba bushelelezi ngayo yonke i-pass. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) siyiphelisa ngokushesha futhi siyigcine isithombe sesikhathi esesidlule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ukusilanda (i-PNG ngaphandle uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E isho okunye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQala nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E ngosayizi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wombono\u003C/span\u003E ukuhlola ikhamera nokubukeka, bese urenda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E ngosayizi omkhulu ukuze uthole isithombe sokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izethingi-zembonini-isithombe-esihle-ngokuchofoza-kanye\"\u003EIzethingi zembonini: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhezulu kwengxoxo kukhona izinkinobho ezine ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbonini\u003C/span\u003E. Ngayinye iseta isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya, umhlabathi, imigqa yemiphetho, ikhwalithi nelanga ngokuchofoza kanye, ngakho akukho okudingeka ukufunde ngaphambi kwesithombe sokuqala. Chofoza eyodwa, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbonini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho ekuseta kona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusetshenziselwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgaphandle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibhakabhaka esicacile, ilanga lemodeli ngokwayo, umhlabathi uvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibhakabhaka esimpunga (ukukhanya okulinganayo, akukho amabala elanga anzima), ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu ngesitobhi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono ngaphakathi kwegumbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka isigaba\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIstudiyo esimhlophe, akukho mhlabathi, imigqa yemiphetho ekurenderweni okusheshayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli esikwe yisigaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbusuku\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlanga lishonile (phakathi kobusika kuhhafu womhlaba wendawo), likhanya kakhulu ngesitobhi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmalambu akhanyisa imodeli. Ngaphandle kwamalambu isithombe sizoba mnyama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ngalo mbono\u003C/span\u003E ikukhethela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka isigaba\u003C/span\u003E lapho kuvulwe ukusika kwesigaba, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E lapho ikhamera isemodelini, kungenjalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgaphandle\u003C/span\u003E. Ngokuvula kokuqala kwengxoxo iqala ngale ndlela yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZonke izilungiselelo ezisezansi zisala futhi zingashintshwa. Uma ushintsha olunye lapho imbonini isetha khona, inkinobho yembonini ayisacindezelwa futhi umugqa ongaphansi kwezinkinobho uthi izilungiselelo ziwezakho. Chofoza imbonini futhi ukuze ubuyisele amanani ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImbonini ayithinti injini, imodi, usayizi, izinto zokwakha, ikhamera noma amalambu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbonini zinika amanani afanayo ku-ModelCraft nakwi-BimCraft. Isithombe esiqediwe sibukeka kanjani kuncike emodelini yakho nasekhadini lakho legrafikhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho esikwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi wombono, kabili wombono, Full HD, 4K noma isikwele. Usayizi ophelele ugcina ikhamera yombono futhi ubonise okuningi noma okuncane ezinhlangothini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E (ngezansi) nesikhathi sayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmkhawulo wesikhathi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-pass angaki (noma, ekhwalithini ephezulu, amasampula) ahlanganiswa ngokulinganisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E 16, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle\u003C/span\u003E 64, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E 256. Ama-pass amaningi enza izithunzi nemiphetho ibe bushelelezi, kodwa athatha isikhathi eside\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka esicacile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzulu elimpunga\u003C/span\u003E (ukukhanya okuthambile, izithunzi ezibuthakathaka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntambama\u003C/span\u003E (ukukhanya okuphansi, okufudumele) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIstudiyo esimhlophe\u003C/span\u003E (ingemuva elimhlophe elilula)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlanga livela kusuku, ngesikhathi nendawo kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E › ilanga. Tika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa enye insuku nesikhathi salesi sithombe\u003C/span\u003E ukuzama esinye isikhathi ngaphandle kokushintsha isitayela semodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhanya noma kufiphale, ngezinyathelo (izitobhi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlabathi ngaphansi kwemodeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmhlabathi othamba izithunzi futhi unyibilika uye ekuphaleni. Yivale ngemodeli eyintantayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdweba imiphetho yemodeli ngokuncane phezu kwesithombe, ukuze ibukeke njengomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ilanga lingaphansi komugqa wesikhathi esikhethiwe kuba busuku: isibhakabhaka sifiphala futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Eamalambu\u003C/a\u003E emodeli ayikhanyisa. Ingxoxo iyasho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zigcinwa kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho isithombe esilandelayo semodeli efanayo siqala lapho uyeke khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-imibala-ibukeke-njengengilazi-noma-insimbi\"\u003EYenza imibala ibukeke njengengilazi noma insimbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto zokwakha\u003C/span\u003E, umbala ngamunye esikrinini unokubukeka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngakhazimuli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya okuthambile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkukhazimulayo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsimbi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsimbi ecwebezelayo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi eqhwabile\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlangothi ezingapendiwe\u003C/span\u003E zinobuso obungenambala wabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwenza amawindi abe ingilazi, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003Ependela\u003C/a\u003E amaphaneli amawindi ngombala owodwa, bese ubeka lowo mbala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi\u003C/span\u003E. Ingilazi ivumela isibhakabhaka nokungemuva kwayo ukubonakala, icwathwe ngombala wayo, futhi ibonise isibhakabhaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwimodi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E, ingilazi nensimbi zibonisa isibhakabhaka, hhayi enye imodeli, futhi ukukhanya akugobeli ngengilazi. Imodi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E ngezansi yenza kokubili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhwalithi-ephezulu\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole isithombe esilandela ukukhanya njengoba ikhamera iyibona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukukhanya kugxumeka phakathi kwezindawo, ngakho igumbi elikhanyiswa yiwindi noma ilambu likhanyiswa zonke izinhlangothi nemibala ichichima kumakhelwane wayo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eingilazi iyingilazi yangempela: ukukhanya kuyigoba futhi iyibonisa imodeli;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einsimbi nezindawo ezicwebezelayo zibonisa enye imodeli;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamaphaneli okukhanya akhanya njengamaphaneli, enezithunzi ezithambile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyahamba kancane kakhulu kunoku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E: i-pass ngayinye ilandelela ukukhanya kwawo wonke ama-pixel futhi. Isithombe siqala sinamabala bese siyacaca njengoba amasampula engeza, ngakho qala ngosayizi omncane (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wombono\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E) bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmkhawulo wesikhathi\u003C/span\u003E: uma usuphelile, isithombe sesikhathi esesidlule siyagcinwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E nayo iyagcina. I-pass yokuqala ilinda kuze kulungiselelwe i-path tracer yesiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho isiphequluli sinayo i-WebGPU, i-path tracer ingeyethu ye-CadCraft futhi isebenza ngekhadi legrafikhi; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlandelelwa indlela ekhadini legrafikhi (WebGPU)\u003C/span\u003E. Ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E noma isikhathi sesiphelile, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka\u003C/span\u003E iqhubeka nesithombe esifanayo kuze kuphele amasampula ayo; ukushintsha isilungiselelo noma ukucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E futhi kuqala kusha. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe silandelelwa nge-WebGL (umugqa uyasho lokho) futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka\u003C/span\u003E ayinikezwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Firefox nezinhlelo eziningi ze-Chrome ku-Linux azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje, ngakho ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa i-WebGL lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule modi imiphetho ayidwetshwa, izindwangu zelabhulali zibonisa umbala nokungabi bushelelezi kwazo kodwa hhayi ama-bump (into \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#in-high-quality-pictures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"in-high-quality-pictures\"\u003Eeyenziwe ngamanodi\u003C/a\u003E ibonisa i-normal nama-bump ayo), futhi ukusika kwesigaba kwenziwa emodelini ngaphambi kokuqala kwesithombe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkunciphisa umsindo (kususa okusele ngemva kwamasampula)\u003C/span\u003E isebenza ngokuzenzakalelayo: lapho isithombe siqedile, noma simisiwe, umsindo oseleyo uyasuswa unethiwekhi ye-neural eyenzelwe lokhu (i-Intel Open Image Denoise, isebenza kukhompyutha yakho: ekhadini legrafikhi, uma kungenjalo kuprosesa). Isithombe esinamasampula ambalwa siphuma sihlanzekile; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe ngaphambi kokususa umsindo\u003C/span\u003E sikubonisa njengoba senziwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"renda-emoweni\"\u003ERenda emoweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa i-path tracer embonweni ngokwawo: zungeza, hlela imodeli noma shintsha ilambu bese iqala kusha ngokushesha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E: hudula isikwele bese kuphela okuyorenderwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbonwe lonke\u003C/span\u003E liyabuyisela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGxilisa\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza okufanele kube bukhali, bese ukujula kokugxila kugxilisa khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E isetha ukuthi amaphikseli embonweni angaki ayorenderwa (okuncane kuyashesha). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyima iqhubeke. Idinga i-WebGPU: ngaphandle kwayo indawo yokusebenza iyakutshela lokho, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E isasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkabi-nezinhlobo-zokukhanya-ezisebenza-ekhadini-legrafikhi\"\u003EIzinkabi nezinhlobo zokukhanya ezisebenza ekhadini legrafikhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENe-WebGPU, ikhwalithi ephezulu inezinkabi ezimbili ezengeziwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka sefiziksi\u003C/span\u003E sibala ukukhanya kwemini kusukela ebude belanga: ukuluhlaza okujulile phezulu, ibhendi elibhamayo esibhakabhakeni, nelanga elishisa kakhulu futhi libe mpofu uma lisesikhathini esiphansi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmusi\u003C/span\u003E uhamba kusuka emini ecacile (2) kuya kwemini enomusi (10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E sikhanyisa imodeli ngesithombe sepanorama sendawo yangempela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E ithatha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.hdr\u003C/code\u003E noma le-\u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E le-equirectangular; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E ilijikelezisa lizungeze imodeli futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya kwesithombe\u003C/span\u003E kulenza likhanye noma lifiphale. Isithombe sinelanga layso, ngakho ilanga lemodeli alengezwa. Iyagcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe: ngemva kokuvula kabusha, khetha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlambu ngalinye ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmalambu\u003C/span\u003E lingathatha iphrofayili yokukhanya yomenzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphrofayili ye-IES…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ifayela le-IES (LM-63) bese ilambu likhipha ukukhanya kwalo njengalokho ukulungiswa okunjalo kukwenza (ilambu elimweleko elincane, noma elikhanyisa udonga). Wonke amalambu anegama elifanayo asebenzisa leyo, futhi ilambu ligcina ukukhanya kwalo. Chofoza igama leprofayili ukuyeka ukuyisebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmawindi eyingilazi ecacile asiza ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka kuthole indlela ingene egumbini, ngakho izithombe zangaphakathi ngaphansi kwesibhakabhaka ziba lula ngokushesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E nenhlelo ye-WebGL ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka sefiziksi\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E njengesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi ziyawanaka amaphrofayili wokukhanya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhamera\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/span\u003E isetha isithombe njengesithombe sokuthwebula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvezwa\u003C/span\u003E: gcina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilayidi sokukhanya\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zekhamera\u003C/span\u003E bese usetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvulwa kwembobo (f-stop)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsivinini sesibambi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EISO\u003C/span\u003E njengakukhamera; i-EV eseduze kwazo iyinani lokuvezwa elijwayelekile. I-f/16 ku-1/100 s ne-ISO 100 ihambisana nosuku oluyilanga; isithombe esimnyama sidinga umbobo obanzi, isibambi esiphuza kakhulu noma i-ISO ephezulu. Lokhu kusebenza kuyo yonke imodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula kokugxila\u003C/span\u003E kubhlurisa okusondele noma okude kakhulu kune-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga lokugxila (m)\u003C/span\u003E njengoba ilensi enale f-stop izokwenza (shiya ingenalutho ukugxila kulokho okusemaphakathi kombono); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka kwembobo\u003C/span\u003E kunika okukhanya okungagxilile isimo esijikazayo noma esinezimpaphe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili (imigqa emile ihlala imile)\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa ikhamera futhi ihambise isithombe, njengelensi ye-tilt-shift yokwakha, ukuze izindonga zingaphenduki lapho ubheka phezulu noma phansi ngakwesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhalansi yombala\u003C/span\u003E isetha umbala wokukhanya okubonakala njengemhlophe: phansi (njengo-3000 K) ngokukhanya okufudumele kwamalambu, phezulu ngezinsuku zethunzi nezimpunga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuprojekta\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpanorama ye-360°\u003C/span\u003E yenza isithombe esi-2:1 sakho konke okuzungeze ikhamera sababukeli bepanorama; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpanorama yesterio ye-360°\u003C/span\u003E imisa ipanorama yeso lesokunxele neleso lokudla ngaphezulu kwenye ukuze kusetshenziswe ama-headset; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImephu yekyubhu (izinhlangothi eziyi-6)\u003C/span\u003E yenza imibono eyisikwele eyi-6 ngegridi engu-3 × 2. Ububanzi buvela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuprojekta, ukujula kokugxila, ukubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili nebhalansi yombala kudinga i-path tracer ekhadini legrafikhi (WebGPU), ngakho zibonakala kuphela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qeda-isithombe\"\u003EQeda isithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe\u003C/span\u003E silinganisa isithombe sekhwalithi ephezulu njengesithombe sokuthwebula, futhi yonke inkinobho iguqula isithombe esiqediwe ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda kusha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubukeka (ukuguqulwa kokubuka)\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E (isithombe njengakuqala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E (ithambile, igcina umbala ekukhanyeni okukhanya kakhulu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E (ijika lefilimu elithambile) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEjwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E (kulula, ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu kuba mhlophe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphambana\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkucindezelwa kokukhanya okukhulu\u003C/span\u003E (ibuyisela imininingwane ezindaweni ezikhanya kakhulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBloom\u003C/span\u003E (ukukhanya okuthambile okuzungeze ukukhanya okukhanyayo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlare\u003C/span\u003E nemigqa yayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa ye-glare\u003C/span\u003E (imisebe yezinkanyezi emaphuyinteni akhanya kakhulu) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVignette\u003C/span\u003E (amakhona amnyama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthebula lemibala (.cube)…\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa ukwenza umbala ngefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmandla ethebula lemibala\u003C/span\u003E yalo; njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka igcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isithombe\"\u003ELondoloza isithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha ifayela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJPEG\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebP\u003C/span\u003E ukwabelana (i-JPEG ne-WebP kuphela lapho isiphequluli sizibhala khona), futhi ngemva kokurenda kwekhwalithi ephezulu ekhadini legrafikhi futhi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG, amabhithi 16\u003C/span\u003E: isithombe esilungisiwe nezinyathelo ezincane phakathi kwezithunzi, sokuphrinta noma ukuhlela okuqhubekayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEXR, zonke izendlalelo (float ye-32-bit)\u003C/span\u003E: isithombe njengoba sirenderwe (ukukhanya okungqondile, akukho ukulungiswa) nakho konke okuyinkomba ngayinye yokurenda njengengqimba yayo, kumaphrogramu okuhlanganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela lokurenda (.ccrender, ukuze ulungise futhi kamuva)\u003C/span\u003E: konke okudingwa yingxoxo ukuze ixube futhi ilungise isithombe futhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifayela lokurenda…\u003C/span\u003E iyabuyisa lona, nemixube nokulungiswa kwalo, ngaphandle kokurenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xuba-amalambu-ngemva-kokurenda\"\u003EXuba amalambu ngemva kokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuxuba ukukhanya (shintsha umbala nokukhanya kwelambu ngalinye ngemva kokurenda)\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Lapho isithombe siqedile (noma simisiwe), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuba isithombe\u003C/span\u003E ilethe amaqembu ezinhlobo zokukhanya: isibhakabhaka, ilanga namalambu ngegama (wonke amalambu anegama elifanayo ayiqembu elilodwa). Vala iqembu, linike umbala, noma yenze likhanye noma lifiphale, isithombe sishintsha ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda kusha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ukuxuba\u003C/span\u003E igcina ukuxuba ngegama ozolikhetha kamuva; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengoba kurenderiwe\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela esithombeni njengoba senziwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E igcina isithombe esixubile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi zokurenda (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs)\u003C/span\u003E igcina izingxenye zesithombe nazo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha umbono ibe enye yazo: imibala yobuso (albedo), ama-normal, ukujula, ukukhanya okusabalele, okuqondile nokudluliswayo (ngakunye ngqo nangokungaqondile), okukhanyayo nesibhakabhaka, nombala ngento noma ngempahla ngayinye ukwenza amaskhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili zigcina izendlalelo ezengeziwe ekhadini legrafikhi. Ngosayizi omkhulu ikhadi legrafikhi lingase lingabi nendawo; ingxoxo iyasho lokho, futhi usayizi omncane uyasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lokurenda\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokusetha kwekhwalithi ephezulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza lesi sithombe kuhlu\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/span\u003E igcina isithombe njengoba sisethwe khona manje; ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza le-animation kuhlu\u003C/span\u003E ewindini levidiyo yenza okufanayo ku-animation yonke, ilandelelwe ngohlaka ngohlaka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala uhlu\u003C/span\u003E irenderisa ngayinye ngokulandelana kule kompyutha, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwayo ngayinye eseqediwe iyilanda. Ukuvala ikhasi kugcina uhlu: vula imodeli efanayo bese liqhubeka lapho limise khona. Uhlu udinga i-WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukhohlo-intuthu-umsindo-nokukhanya-okugoqekile\"\u003EUkhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zikhona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkhohlo, intuthu nomsindo\u003C/span\u003E futhi zisebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/span\u003E ekhadini legrafikhi; ezinye izinjini zizishiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkhohlo nomhwamuko\u003C/span\u003E ugcwalisa umoya kuze kufike ebude ngomhwamuko okhanyiswa yilanga, isibhakabhaka namalambu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubona kukude kangakanani, ngamamitha\u003C/span\u003E kusetha ukuthi ukhulu kangakanani (cishe amamitha ayi-100 ngumhwamuko okhanyayo, amamitha angama-20 ngukhohlo olukhulu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama kokhohlo ngaphezu komhlaba, ngamamitha\u003C/span\u003E kuwukuthi luphela kuphi, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImisebe yokukhanya\u003C/span\u003E kuwukuthi umhwamuko ukhanya kangakanani uya ekukhanyeni. Ukukhanya kwelanga kushiya ukhohlo engxenyeni yawo ephezulu, ngakho lapho ilanga lingena ewindini noma phakathi kwezakhiwo ulibona njengemisebe yokukhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntuthu noma ifu\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ivolumu eyodwa yentuthu noma yefu ekhanyiswa njengokhohlo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/span\u003E kungu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkholomu yentuthu\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kufayela levolumu (.ccvol)\u003C/span\u003E, ifomethi yegridi ye-CadCraft. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukahluka\u003C/span\u003E kushintsha ifu noma ikholomu eyenziwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude obude kakhulu ohlangothini olulodwa, ngamamitha (0 = usayizi wemodeli)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa X (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa Y (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa Z (m)\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E kuyilungiselela (iqala emaphakathi emodeli), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujiya\u003C/span\u003E kwenza lijiye kakhulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya phambili\u003C/span\u003E kwenza likhanye kakhulu ngasekukhanyeni, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E wenza umbala walo. Ifayela levolumu liyagcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe, njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYima ngokushesha lapho isithombe sihlanzekile (ukusampula okuzivumelanisayo)\u003C/span\u003E akunikezi amasampula amaningi amaphikseli asezinzile, ngakho enye yesithombe iqedwa ngokushesha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsindo okwamukelekayo\u003C/span\u003E ukuthi umsindo oseleyo kangakanani lapho ipikseli limisa. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi amasampula angakanani ipikseli ngalinye lithole ngesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-caustics (ukukhanya okugoqwa ngeglasi noma okubuyiselwa yizibuko)\u003C/span\u003E ilandelela ukukhanya okuvela emalanjeni nelangeni, ngakho indawo ekhanyayo ngaphansi kwebhola leglasi noma ukukhanya kwesibuko odongeni iphuma icacile kunokuba inamabala. Icimeka lapho ukhohlo, intuthu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuxuba ukukhanya ngemva kokurenda\u003C/span\u003E noma izakhi zokurenda zivuliwe, futhi yenzelwe izithombe, hhayi izithombe ze-360°, ama-animation noma indawo yokusebenza ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhathi-esithathayo\"\u003EIsikhathi esithathayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe senziwa ekhompyutheni yakho, yikhadi layo legrafikhi; akukho okulayishwa. Isikhathi sincike kuleyo khadi. Sikhula ngama-pass nama-pixel: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E inama-pass ayi-16 kuna-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E, nesithombe se-4K sinama-pixel acishe abe ka-4 kuna-Full HD. Ikhompyutha engenalo ikhadi legrafikhi isarenda, kodwa kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ingxoxo ithi isiphequluli asikwazi ukurenda izithombe, isiphequluli asinayo i-WebGL 2. Buyekeza noma vula ukusheshisa ngehadiwe ezilungiselelweni zaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Renda isithombe… yenza isithombe sombono esifana nokukhanya kwemini kunokuba kube umdwebo: isibhakabhaka, ilanga endaweni nasuku lwemodeli yakho, izithunzi ezithambile, ukukhanya okuvela esibhakabhakeni sonke okufiphaza amakhona namagebe, nemibala engabonakala njengengilazi, insimbi noma upende okukhazimulayo. Imodeli ayishintshwa. Renda umbono Lungisa umbono ngendlela ofuna ngayo isithombe: zungeza, sondeza, khetha imbonini, fihla okungafanele kubonakale. Isithombe sisebenzisa ikhamera yombono ngokwawo. Chofoza Khipha eqenjini Ifayela, bese Renda isithombe…. Khetha Imbonini uma eyeyekhethwe ingeyiyo leyo ofuna (bona Izethingi zembonini), khetha Usayizi, bese uchofoza Renda. Isithombe siyagcwala ngesikhathi sirenderwa futhi siba bushelelezi ngayo yonke i-pass. Misa (noma Esc) siyiphelisa ngokushesha futhi siyigcine isithombe sesikhathi esesidlule. Chofoza Londoloza ukusilanda (i-PNG ngaphandle uma Londoloza njenge isho okunye). Qala nge-Uhlaka ngosayizi Usayizi wombono ukuhlola ikhamera nokubukeka, bese urenda Kuhle noma Kuhle kakhulu ngosayizi omkhulu ukuze uthole isithombe sokugcina. Izethingi zembonini: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye Phezulu kwengxoxo kukhona izinkinobho ezine ze-Imbonini. Ngayinye iseta isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya, umhlabathi, imigqa yemiphetho, ikhwalithi nelanga ngokuchofoza kanye, ngakho akukho okudingeka ukufunde ngaphambi kwesithombe sokuqala. Chofoza eyodwa, bese Renda. Imbonini Lokho ekuseta kona Kusetshenziselwa Ngaphandle Isibhakabhaka esicacile, ilanga lemodeli ngokwayo, umhlabathi uvuliwe Isakhiwo ngaphandle Ngaphakathi Isibhakabhaka esimpunga (ukukhanya okulinganayo, akukho amabala elanga anzima), ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu ngesitobhi esisodwa Umbono ngaphakathi kwegumbi Ukubuka isigaba Istudiyo esimhlophe, akukho mhlabathi, imigqa yemiphetho ekurenderweni okusheshayo Imodeli esikwe yisigaba Ubusuku Ilanga lishonile (phakathi kobusika kuhhafu womhlaba wendawo), likhanya kakhulu ngesitobhi esisodwa Amalambu akhanyisa imodeli. Ngaphandle kwamalambu isithombe sizoba mnyama Khetha ngalo mbono ikukhethela: Ukubuka isigaba lapho kuvulwe ukusika kwesigaba, Ngaphakathi lapho ikhamera isemodelini, kungenjalo Ngaphandle. Ngokuvula kokuqala kwengxoxo iqala ngale ndlela yayo. Zonke izilungiselelo ezisezansi zisala futhi zingashintshwa. Uma ushintsha olunye lapho imbonini isetha khona, inkinobho yembonini ayisacindezelwa futhi umugqa ongaphansi kwezinkinobho uthi izilungiselelo ziwezakho. Chofoza imbonini futhi ukuze ubuyisele amanani ayo. Imbonini ayithinti injini, imodi, usayizi, izinto zokwakha, ikhamera noma amalambu. Izimbonini zinika amanani afanayo ku-ModelCraft nakwi-BimCraft. Isithombe esiqediwe sibukeka kanjani kuncike emodelini yakho nasekhadini lakho legrafikhi. Izilungiselelo Isilungiselelo Lokho esikwenzayo Usayizi Usayizi wombono, kabili wombono, Full HD, 4K noma isikwele. Usayizi ophelele ugcina ikhamera yombono futhi ubonise okuningi noma okuncane ezinhlangothini Imodi Ngokushesha, noma Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) (ngezansi) nesikhathi sayo Umkhawulo wesikhathi Ikhwalithi Ama-pass angaki (noma, ekhwalithini ephezulu, amasampula) ahlanganiswa ngokulinganisa: Uhlaka 16, Kuhle 64, Kuhle kakhulu 256. Ama-pass amaningi enza izithunzi nemiphetho ibe bushelelezi, kodwa athatha isikhathi eside Isibhakabhaka Isibhakabhaka esicacile, Izulu elimpunga (ukukhanya okuthambile, izithunzi ezibuthakathaka), Intambama (ukukhanya okuphansi, okufudumele) noma Istudiyo esimhlophe (ingemuva elimhlophe elilula) Ilanga Ilanga livela kusuku, ngesikhathi nendawo kusuka ku-Isitayela › ilanga. Tika Sebenzisa enye insuku nesikhathi salesi sithombe ukuzama esinye isikhathi ngaphandle kokushintsha isitayela semodeli Ukukhanya Kukhanya noma kufiphale, ngezinyathelo (izitobhi) Umhlabathi ngaphansi kwemodeli Umhlabathi othamba izithunzi futhi unyibilika uye ekuphaleni. Yivale ngemodeli eyintantayo Dweba imiphetho Idweba imiphetho yemodeli ngokuncane phezu kwesithombe, ukuze ibukeke njengomdwebo Uma ilanga lingaphansi komugqa wesikhathi esikhethiwe kuba busuku: isibhakabhaka sifiphala futhi amalambu emodeli ayikhanyisa. Ingxoxo iyasho lokho. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa kufayela le-.modelcraft, ngakho isithombe esilandelayo semodeli efanayo siqala lapho uyeke khona. Yenza imibala ibukeke njengengilazi noma insimbi Ngaphansi kwe-Izinto zokwakha, umbala ngamunye esikrinini unokubukeka: Engakhazimuli, Ukukhanya okuthambile, Okukhazimulayo, Insimbi, Insimbi ecwebezelayo, Ingilazi noma Ingilazi eqhwabile. Izinhlangothi ezingapendiwe zinobuso obungenambala wabo. Ukwenza amawindi abe ingilazi, pendela amaphaneli amawindi ngombala owodwa, bese ubeka lowo mbala ku-Ingilazi. Ingilazi ivumela isibhakabhaka nokungemuva kwayo ukubonakala, icwathwe ngombala wayo, futhi ibonise isibhakabhaka. Kwimodi ye-Ngokushesha, ingilazi nensimbi zibonisa isibhakabhaka, hhayi enye imodeli, futhi ukukhanya akugobeli ngengilazi. Imodi ye-Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) ngezansi yenza kokubili. Ikhwalithi ephezulu Khetha Imodi › Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) ukuze uthole isithombe esilandela ukukhanya njengoba ikhamera iyibona: ukukhanya kugxumeka phakathi kwezindawo, ngakho igumbi elikhanyiswa yiwindi noma ilambu likhanyiswa zonke izinhlangothi nemibala ichichima kumakhelwane wayo; ingilazi iyingilazi yangempela: ukukhanya kuyigoba futhi iyibonisa imodeli; insimbi nezindawo ezicwebezelayo zibonisa enye imodeli; amaphaneli okukhanya akhanya njengamaphaneli, enezithunzi ezithambile. Iyahamba kancane kakhulu kunoku-Ngokushesha: i-pass ngayinye ilandelela ukukhanya kwawo wonke ama-pixel futhi. Isithombe siqala sinamabala bese siyacaca njengoba amasampula engeza, ngakho qala ngosayizi omncane (Usayizi wombono, Uhlaka) bese ukhetha Umkhawulo wesikhathi: uma usuphelile, isithombe sesikhathi esesidlule siyagcinwa. Misa nayo iyagcina. I-pass yokuqala ilinda kuze kulungiselelwe i-path tracer yesiphequluli. Lapho isiphequluli sinayo i-WebGPU, i-path tracer ingeyethu ye-CadCraft futhi isebenza ngekhadi legrafikhi; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi Ilandelelwa indlela ekhadini legrafikhi (WebGPU). Ngemva kwe-Misa noma isikhathi sesiphelile, i-Qhubeka iqhubeka nesithombe esifanayo kuze kuphele amasampula ayo; ukushintsha isilungiselelo noma ukucindezela Renda futhi kuqala kusha. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe silandelelwa nge-WebGL (umugqa uyasho lokho) futhi Qhubeka ayinikezwa. I-Firefox nezinhlelo eziningi ze-Chrome ku-Linux azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje, ngakho ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa i-WebGL lapho. Kule modi imiphetho ayidwetshwa, izindwangu zelabhulali zibonisa umbala nokungabi bushelelezi kwazo kodwa hhayi ama-bump (into eyenziwe ngamanodi ibonisa i-normal nama-bump ayo), futhi ukusika kwesigaba kwenziwa emodelini ngaphambi kokuqala kwesithombe. Ukunciphisa umsindo (kususa okusele ngemva kwamasampula) isebenza ngokuzenzakalelayo: lapho isithombe siqedile, noma simisiwe, umsindo oseleyo uyasuswa unethiwekhi ye-neural eyenzelwe lokhu (i-Intel Open Image Denoise, isebenza kukhompyutha yakho: ekhadini legrafikhi, uma kungenjalo kuprosesa). Isithombe esinamasampula ambalwa siphuma sihlanzekile; Bonisa › Isithombe ngaphambi kokususa umsindo sikubonisa njengoba senziwe. Renda emoweni Indawo yokusebenza ye-Renda isebenzisa i-path tracer embonweni ngokwawo: zungeza, hlela imodeli noma shintsha ilambu bese iqala kusha ngokushesha. Indawo: hudula isikwele bese kuphela okuyorenderwa; Ibonwe lonke liyabuyisela. Gxilisa: chofoza okufanele kube bukhali, bese ukujula kokugxila kugxilisa khona. Imininingwane isetha ukuthi amaphikseli embonweni angaki ayorenderwa (okuncane kuyashesha). Misa iyima iqhubeke. Idinga i-WebGPU: ngaphandle kwayo indawo yokusebenza iyakutshela lokho, futhi Khipha › Renda isithombe… isasebenza. Izinkabi nezinhlobo zokukhanya ezisebenza ekhadini legrafikhi Ne-WebGPU, ikhwalithi ephezulu inezinkabi ezimbili ezengeziwe: Isibhakabhaka sefiziksi sibala ukukhanya kwemini kusukela ebude belanga: ukuluhlaza okujulile phezulu, ibhendi elibhamayo esibhakabhakeni, nelanga elishisa kakhulu futhi libe mpofu uma lisesikhathini esiphansi. Umusi uhamba kusuka emini ecacile (2) kuya kwemini enomusi (10). Isithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI) sikhanyisa imodeli ngesithombe sepanorama sendawo yangempela. Khetha isithombe… ithatha ifayela le-.hdr noma le-.exr le-equirectangular; Jikisa ilijikelezisa lizungeze imodeli futhi Ukukhanya kwesithombe kulenza likhanye noma lifiphale. Isithombe sinelanga layso, ngakho ilanga lemodeli alengezwa. Iyagcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe: ngemva kokuvula kabusha, khetha kabusha. Ilambu ngalinye ohlwini lwe-Amalambu lingathatha iphrofayili yokukhanya yomenzi: Iphrofayili ye-IES… ifunda ifayela le-IES (LM-63) bese ilambu likhipha ukukhanya kwalo njengalokho ukulungiswa okunjalo kukwenza (ilambu elimweleko elincane, noma elikhanyisa udonga). Wonke amalambu anegama elifanayo asebenzisa leyo, futhi ilambu ligcina ukukhanya kwalo. Chofoza igama leprofayili ukuyeka ukuyisebenzisa. Amawindi eyingilazi ecacile asiza ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka kuthole indlela ingene egumbini, ngakho izithombe zangaphakathi ngaphansi kwesibhakabhaka ziba lula ngokushesha. Imodi ye-Ngokushesha nenhlelo ye-WebGL ibonisa Isibhakabhaka sefiziksi kanye Isithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI) njengesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi ziyawanaka amaphrofayili wokukhanya. Ikhamera Ikhamera isetha isithombe njengesithombe sokuthwebula: Ukuvezwa: gcina Isilayidi sokukhanya, noma khetha Izilungiselelo zekhamera bese usetha Ukuvulwa kwembobo (f-stop), Isivinini sesibambi ne-ISO njengakukhamera; i-EV eseduze kwazo iyinani lokuvezwa elijwayelekile. I-f/16 ku-1/100 s ne-ISO 100 ihambisana nosuku oluyilanga; isithombe esimnyama sidinga umbobo obanzi, isibambi esiphuza kakhulu noma i-ISO ephezulu. Lokhu kusebenza kuyo yonke imodi. Ukujula kokugxila kubhlurisa okusondele noma okude kakhulu kune-Ibanga lokugxila (m) njengoba ilensi enale f-stop izokwenza (shiya ingenalutho ukugxila kulokho okusemaphakathi kombono); Ukwakheka kwembobo kunika okukhanya okungagxilile isimo esijikazayo noma esinezimpaphe. Ukubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili (imigqa emile ihlala imile) ilinganisa ikhamera futhi ihambise isithombe, njengelensi ye-tilt-shift yokwakha, ukuze izindonga zingaphenduki lapho ubheka phezulu noma phansi ngakwesakhiwo. Ibhalansi yombala isetha umbala wokukhanya okubonakala njengemhlophe: phansi (njengo-3000 K) ngokukhanya okufudumele kwamalambu, phezulu ngezinsuku zethunzi nezimpunga. Ukuprojekta: Ipanorama ye-360° yenza isithombe esi-2:1 sakho konke okuzungeze ikhamera sababukeli bepanorama; Ipanorama yesterio ye-360° imisa ipanorama yeso lesokunxele neleso lokudla ngaphezulu kwenye ukuze kusetshenziswe ama-headset; Imephu yekyubhu (izinhlangothi eziyi-6) yenza imibono eyisikwele eyi-6 ngegridi engu-3 × 2. Ububanzi buvela ku-Usayizi. Ukuprojekta, ukujula kokugxila, ukubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili nebhalansi yombala kudinga i-path tracer ekhadini legrafikhi (WebGPU), ngakho zibonakala kuphela ku-Ikhwalithi ephezulu. Qeda isithombe Isithombe silinganisa isithombe sekhwalithi ephezulu njengesithombe sokuthwebula, futhi yonke inkinobho iguqula isithombe esiqediwe ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda kusha: Ukubukeka (ukuguqulwa kokubuka): ACES filmic (isithombe njengakuqala), AgX (ithambile, igcina umbala ekukhanyeni okukhanya kakhulu), Filmic (ijika lefilimu elithambile) noma Ejwayelekile (kulula, ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu kuba mhlophe). Ukuphambana kanye Ukucindezelwa kokukhanya okukhulu (ibuyisela imininingwane ezindaweni ezikhanya kakhulu). Bloom (ukukhanya okuthambile okuzungeze ukukhanya okukhanyayo), Glare nemigqa yayo Imigqa ye-glare (imisebe yezinkanyezi emaphuyinteni akhanya kakhulu) kanye ne-Vignette (amakhona amnyama). Ithebula lemibala (.cube)… isebenzisa ukwenza umbala ngefayela le-.cube, nge-Amandla ethebula lemibala yalo; njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka igcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe. Londoloza isithombe Londoloza njenge eduze kwe-Londoloza ikhetha ifayela: PNG, JPEG noma WebP ukwabelana (i-JPEG ne-WebP kuphela lapho isiphequluli sizibhala khona), futhi ngemva kokurenda kwekhwalithi ephezulu ekhadini legrafikhi futhi: PNG, amabhithi 16: isithombe esilungisiwe nezinyathelo ezincane phakathi kwezithunzi, sokuphrinta noma ukuhlela okuqhubekayo. EXR, zonke izendlalelo (float ye-32-bit): isithombe njengoba sirenderwe (ukukhanya okungqondile, akukho ukulungiswa) nakho konke okuyinkomba ngayinye yokurenda njengengqimba yayo, kumaphrogramu okuhlanganisa. Ifayela lokurenda (.ccrender, ukuze ulungise futhi kamuva): konke okudingwa yingxoxo ukuze ixube futhi ilungise isithombe futhi. Vula ifayela lokurenda… iyabuyisa lona, nemixube nokulungiswa kwalo, ngaphandle kokurenda. Xuba amalambu ngemva kokurenda Vula Ukuxuba ukukhanya (shintsha umbala nokukhanya kwelambu ngalinye ngemva kokurenda) ngaphambi kokucindezela Renda. Lapho isithombe siqedile (noma simisiwe), Xuba isithombe ilethe amaqembu ezinhlobo zokukhanya: isibhakabhaka, ilanga namalambu ngegama (wonke amalambu anegama elifanayo ayiqembu elilodwa). Vala iqembu, linike umbala, noma yenze likhanye noma lifiphale, isithombe sishintsha ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda kusha. Londoloza ukuxuba igcina ukuxuba ngegama ozolikhetha kamuva; Njengoba kurenderiwe ibuyela esithombeni njengoba senziwa. Londoloza igcina isithombe esixubile. Izakhi zokurenda (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs) igcina izingxenye zesithombe nazo. Bonisa ishintsha umbono ibe enye yazo: imibala yobuso (albedo), ama-normal, ukujula, ukukhanya okusabalele, okuqondile nokudluliswayo (ngakunye ngqo nangokungaqondile), okukhanyayo nesibhakabhaka, nombala ngento noma ngempahla ngayinye ukwenza amaskhi. Zombili zigcina izendlalelo ezengeziwe ekhadini legrafikhi. Ngosayizi omkhulu ikhadi legrafikhi lingase lingabi nendawo; ingxoxo iyasho lokho, futhi usayizi omncane uyasebenza. Uhlu lokurenda Ngemva kokusetha kwekhwalithi ephezulu, Engeza lesi sithombe kuhlu ngaphansi kwe-Uhlu lokurenda igcina isithombe njengoba sisethwe khona manje; ithi Engeza le-animation kuhlu ewindini levidiyo yenza okufanayo ku-animation yonke, ilandelelwe ngohlaka ngohlaka. Qala uhlu irenderisa ngayinye ngokulandelana kule kompyutha, futhi Londoloza eduze kwayo ngayinye eseqediwe iyilanda. Ukuvala ikhasi kugcina uhlu: vula imodeli efanayo bese liqhubeka lapho limise khona. Uhlu udinga i-WebGPU. Ukhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile Lezi zikhona ku-Ukhohlo, intuthu nomsindo futhi zisebenza ku-Ikhwalithi ephezulu ekhadini legrafikhi; ezinye izinjini zizishiya. Ukhohlo nomhwamuko ugcwalisa umoya kuze kufike ebude ngomhwamuko okhanyiswa yilanga, isibhakabhaka namalambu. Ukubona kukude kangakanani, ngamamitha kusetha ukuthi ukhulu kangakanani (cishe amamitha ayi-100 ngumhwamuko okhanyayo, amamitha angama-20 ngukhohlo olukhulu), Ukuphakama kokhohlo ngaphezu komhlaba, ngamamitha kuwukuthi luphela kuphi, futhi Imisebe yokukhanya kuwukuthi umhwamuko ukhanya kangakanani uya ekukhanyeni. Ukukhanya kwelanga kushiya ukhohlo engxenyeni yawo ephezulu, ngakho lapho ilanga lingena ewindini noma phakathi kwezakhiwo ulibona njengemisebe yokukhanya. Intuthu noma ifu yengeza ivolumu eyodwa yentuthu noma yefu ekhanyiswa njengokhohlo. Uhlobo kungu-Ifu, Ikholomu yentuthu noma Kusuka kufayela levolumu (.ccvol), ifomethi yegridi ye-CadCraft. Imininingwane kanye no-Ukuhlukahluka kushintsha ifu noma ikholomu eyenziwe, Ubude obude kakhulu ohlangothini olulodwa, ngamamitha (0 = usayizi wemodeli), Hambisa X (m), Hambisa Y (m), Hambisa Z (m) kanye Jikisa kuyilungiselela (iqala emaphakathi emodeli), Ukujiya kwenza lijiye kakhulu, Ukukhanya phambili kwenza likhanye kakhulu ngasekukhanyeni, futhi Umbala wenza umbala walo. Ifayela levolumu liyagcinwa kuphela ngenkathi ikhasi livuliwe, njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka. Yima ngokushesha lapho isithombe sihlanzekile (ukusampula okuzivumelanisayo) akunikezi amasampula amaningi amaphikseli asezinzile, ngakho enye yesithombe iqedwa ngokushesha. Umsindo okwamukelekayo ukuthi umsindo oseleyo kangakanani lapho ipikseli limisa. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uthi amasampula angakanani ipikseli ngalinye lithole ngesilinganiso. I-caustics (ukukhanya okugoqwa ngeglasi noma okubuyiselwa yizibuko) ilandelela ukukhanya okuvela emalanjeni nelangeni, ngakho indawo ekhanyayo ngaphansi kwebhola leglasi noma ukukhanya kwesibuko odongeni iphuma icacile kunokuba inamabala. Icimeka lapho ukhohlo, intuthu, Ukuxuba ukukhanya ngemva kokurenda noma izakhi zokurenda zivuliwe, futhi yenzelwe izithombe, hhayi izithombe ze-360°, ama-animation noma indawo yokusebenza ethi Renda. Isikhathi esithathayo Isithombe senziwa ekhompyutheni yakho, yikhadi layo legrafikhi; akukho okulayishwa. Isikhathi sincike kuleyo khadi. Sikhula ngama-pass nama-pixel: Kuhle kakhulu inama-pass ayi-16 kuna-Uhlaka, nesithombe se-4K sinama-pixel acishe abe ka-4 kuna-Full HD. Ikhompyutha engenalo ikhadi legrafikhi isarenda, kodwa kancane. Uma ingxoxo ithi isiphequluli asikwazi ukurenda izithombe, isiphequluli asinayo i-WebGL 2. Buyekeza noma vula ukusheshisa ngehadiwe ezilungiselelweni zaso.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"lights","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Khanyisa imodeli ngezibane","summary":"Faka izibane, izibane ezigxilile namaphaneli okukhanya emodelini ukuze izithombe ezirenderiwe zibonise amakamelo ebusuku nezakhiwo ezikhanyisiwe, nezithunzi ezithambile.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["ukukhanya","izibane","isibane","izibane","ukukhanyisa","ibhalbhu","isibane selingi","isibane esigxilile","isibane esiphansi","iphaneli lokukhanya","indawo yokukhanya","lumens","ukukhanya","izinga lombala","ofudumele","ebusuku","ngaphakathi","renda"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-isibane","text":"Engeza isibane","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-isibane","text":"Shintsha isibane","level":2},{"id":"izithombe-ebusuku","text":"Izithombe ebusuku","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzibane zikhanyisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eizithombe ezirenderiwe\u003C/a\u003E. Azishintshi ukubuka kwe-3D, lapho isibane ngasinye sibonakala njengophawu oluncane ngombala waso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-isibane\"\u003EEngeza isibane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni esithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELights\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELamp\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpotlight\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight panel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho okuzofakwa khona. Ukubamba kusebenza njengakuhlanganiswe ekudweni.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsilingeni noma eludongeni \u003Cstrong\u003Eisibane\u003C/strong\u003E silenga ngama-25 cm ngaphandle kwendawo, ohlangothini olubukwa kulo; \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphaneli lokukhanya\u003C/strong\u003E lilele endaweni futhi likhanyela kude nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsibane esigxilile\u003C/strong\u003E sithatha ukuchofoza kabili: kuqala lapho sikhona, bese kuthi lapho sibheka khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibane esisha sikhethwa esigabeni esithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELights\u003C/span\u003E, silungele ukushintshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-isibane\"\u003EShintsha isibane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza igama lesibane esigabeni esithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELights\u003C/span\u003E, noma indawo yaso ekubukeni ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E. Bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrightness (lumens)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya okunikezayo. Ibhalbhu yasekhaya cishe ingu-800 lumens; iphaneli elikhanyayo lesilingi lingu-3000\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarm\u003C/span\u003E (ibhalbhu yasekhaya), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENeutral\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight\u003C/span\u003E, noma noma yimuphi umbala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeam (degrees)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhonkolo lwesibane esigxilile, kusuka emaphethelweni kuya emaphethelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBulb size\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWidth\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmabhalbhu namaphaneli amakhulu anikeza izithunzi ezithambe kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERed (x)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGreen (y)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho isibane sikhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthikhi oseceleni kwegama lesibane luvula noma luvala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete the light\u003C/span\u003E liyasisusa. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E silihlehlisa. Izibane zilondolozwa efayeleni \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izithombe-ebusuku\"\u003EIzithombe ebusuku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E, thikha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse another date and time for this picture\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ihora lakusihlwa. Uma ilanga selishonile, isibhakabhaka siba mnyama, futhi izibane kuphela zikhanyisa imodeli. Phakamisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrightness\u003C/span\u003E kulolu xoxo uma isithombe simnyama kakhulu, noma engeza izibane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEkamelweni elibonwa ngaphakathi, beka ikhamera ngaphakathi ekamelweni (zungeza futhi usondeze, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Eisigcawu\u003C/a\u003E), engeza isibane esilingeni bese urenda ebusuku. Kumodi ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFast\u003C/span\u003E izindawo ezikude nesibane ziba mnyama kunasesithombeni; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003Eimodi yekhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/a\u003E ivumela ukukhanya ukuthi kugxume udonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Izibane zikhanyisa izithombe ezirenderiwe. Azishintshi ukubuka kwe-3D, lapho isibane ngasinye sibonakala njengophawu oluncane ngombala waso. Engeza isibane Esigabeni esithi Lights ngakwesokudla, chofoza Lamp, Spotlight noma Light panel. Chofoza lapho okuzofakwa khona. Ukubamba kusebenza njengakuhlanganiswe ekudweni. Esilingeni noma eludongeni isibane silenga ngama-25 cm ngaphandle kwendawo, ohlangothini olubukwa kulo; iphaneli lokukhanya lilele endaweni futhi likhanyela kude nayo. Isibane esigxilile sithatha ukuchofoza kabili: kuqala lapho sikhona, bese kuthi lapho sibheka khona. Isibane esisha sikhethwa esigabeni esithi Lights, silungele ukushintshwa. Shintsha isibane Chofoza igama lesibane esigabeni esithi Lights, noma indawo yaso ekubukeni ngo-Select. Bese: Izilungiselelo Okwenzayo Brightness (lumens) Ukukhanya okunikezayo. Ibhalbhu yasekhaya cishe ingu-800 lumens; iphaneli elikhanyayo lesilingi lingu-3000 Color Warm (ibhalbhu yasekhaya), Neutral noma Daylight, noma noma yimuphi umbala Beam (degrees) Ukhonkolo lwesibane esigxilile, kusuka emaphethelweni kuya emaphethelweni Bulb size, Width, Depth Amabhalbhu namaphaneli amakhulu anikeza izithunzi ezithambe kakhulu Red (x), Green (y), Height Lapho isibane sikhona Uthikhi oseceleni kwegama lesibane luvula noma luvala. Delete the light liyasisusa. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z silihlehlisa. Izibane zilondolozwa efayeleni .modelcraft. Izithombe ebusuku Ku-Render a picture…, thikha Use another date and time for this picture bese ukhetha ihora lakusihlwa. Uma ilanga selishonile, isibhakabhaka siba mnyama, futhi izibane kuphela zikhanyisa imodeli. Phakamisa Brightness kulolu xoxo uma isithombe simnyama kakhulu, noma engeza izibane. Ekamelweni elibonwa ngaphakathi, beka ikhamera ngaphakathi ekamelweni (zungeza futhi usondeze, noma isigcawu), engeza isibane esilingeni bese urenda ebusuku. Kumodi ethi Fast izindawo ezikude nesibane ziba mnyama kunasesithombeni; imodi yekhwalithi ephezulu ivumela ukukhanya ukuthi kugxume udonga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-engines","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Khetha uhlelo oludweba isithombe","summary":"Ukukhetha kwe-Injini engxoxweni ye-Renda: izinjini zethu ezimbili, ezinye izinhlelo ku-CadCraft Studio, nokuthi iwebhu yenza ini esikhundleni salokho.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["renda","injini","renderer","injini yokurenda","plug-in","plugin","studio","uhlelo langaphandle","kudwetshwe ngu","umugqa","injini ye-add-on"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuthi-ukukhetha-kuziphatha-kanjani","text":"Ukuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani","level":2},{"id":"okunikezwa-yonke-injini","text":"Okunikezwa yonke injini","level":2},{"id":"umugqa-wokurenda","text":"Umugqa wokurenda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E inokukhetha ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EInjini\u003C/strong\u003E phezulu kwe-Imodi. Izinjini zethu ezimbili zihlala khona zisebenza noma yiphi indawo; ama-add-on angangeza ezinye, futhi ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu luphinde lube nezinhlelo ezithatha isigcawu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkuphi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphakathi: Ngokushesha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe esisheshayo: usuku, izithunzi ezithambile, izinkombandla zengilazi nensimbi, ngemizuzwana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphequluli ne-Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphakathi: Umlandeli wendlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya okugqashuka phakathi kwezindawo, ngekhadi lakho legrafikhi noma iprosesa, umugqa wokurenda nezinye izikhompyutha ezisenethiwekhini lakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphequluli ne-Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInjini ye-add-on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyadweba bese ibuyisela isithombe: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphequluli (injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript) noma i-Studio (injini eqhuba uhlelo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo oluthatha isigcawu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-Studio ibeka isigcawu efolda yayo bese iyigcina ilingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ku…\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlondoloza isigcawu bese iyivula kuhlelo; akukho okubuyayo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwebhu ilondoloza ifayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-ukukhetha-kuziphatha-kanjani\"\u003EUkuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha u-Fast noma i-Path tracer kushintsha imodi nakho, nangokuphambene. Okunye engxoxweni akushintshi kubantu abangakaze basebenzise enye injini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjini engatholakali ihlala ohlwini ngesizathu sayo (&quot;not found&quot;, &quot;needs a newer version&quot;); awukwazi ukuyikhetha. Kusiphequluli injini esebenza kuphela ku-Studio ibonisa &quot;saves a file&quot;: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E bese silondolozela isigcawu nezilungiselelo zaso kufayela oliyisa kuleso sihlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha kugcinwa nezilungiselelo zokurenda zefayela, futhi injini oyikhethe ekugcineni iyinjini yokuqala yamafayela angenayo ukukhetha kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo sithi yiluphi uhlelo oluyidwebile nenguqulo yalo, engxoxweni nasemugqeni wokurenda. Izithembiso zekhasi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda\u003C/a\u003E zimboza \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinjini zethu\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela: olunye uhlelo lukhanyisa, lunciphise kanye nokukhetha ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe ezimbili zesigcawu esifanayo zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, amalambu nokuchayeka, kodwa hhayi ipikseli ngepikseli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okunikezwa-yonke-injini\"\u003EOkunikezwa yonke injini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigcawu siya kolunye uhlelo njengephakheji: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (lelo efanayo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E elibhala), nefayela lezilungiselelo elibamba okungathenjwa kuwo umlethi we-USD: amanani empahla angokoqobo, amalambu avulekile ngamandla nemiyalo yokukhanya, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuchayeka nekhamera njengoba ingxoxo izodweba. Akukho okulayishwa noma yikuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umugqa-wokurenda\"\u003EUmugqa wokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe noma i-animation yolunye uhlelo ingalinda kumugqa wokurenda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Enjengezinye zethu\u003C/a\u003E; umsebenzi wayo ukhumbula ukuthi yenjini yini. I-animation iya kuhlelo ngokuqhubeka kanye.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Renda isithombe… inokukhetha ngo-Injini phezulu kwe-Imodi. Izinjini zethu ezimbili zihlala khona zisebenza noma yiphi indawo; ama-add-on angangeza ezinye, futhi ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu luphinde lube nezinhlelo ezithatha isigcawu. Injini Yenzani Ikuphi Ngaphakathi: Ngokushesha Isithombe esisheshayo: usuku, izithunzi ezithambile, izinkombandla zengilazi nensimbi, ngemizuzwana Isiphequluli ne-Studio Ngaphakathi: Umlandeli wendlela Ukukhanya okugqashuka phakathi kwezindawo, ngekhadi lakho legrafikhi noma iprosesa, umugqa wokurenda nezinye izikhompyutha ezisenethiwekhini lakho Isiphequluli ne-Studio Injini ye-add-on Iyadweba bese ibuyisela isithombe: bona Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo Isiphequluli (injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript) noma i-Studio (injini eqhuba uhlelo) Uhlelo oluthatha isigcawu I-Studio ibeka isigcawu efolda yayo bese iyigcina ilingana Studio Vula ku… Ilondoloza isigcawu bese iyivula kuhlelo; akukho okubuyayo: bona Vula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo Iwebhu ilondoloza ifayela Ukuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani Ukukhetha u-Fast noma i-Path tracer kushintsha imodi nakho, nangokuphambene. Okunye engxoxweni akushintshi kubantu abangakaze basebenzise enye injini. Injini engatholakali ihlala ohlwini ngesizathu sayo (\"not found\", \"needs a newer version\"); awukwazi ukuyikhetha. Kusiphequluli injini esebenza kuphela ku-Studio ibonisa \"saves a file\": Renda isithombe… bese silondolozela isigcawu nezilungiselelo zaso kufayela oliyisa kuleso sihlelo. Ukukhetha kugcinwa nezilungiselelo zokurenda zefayela, futhi injini oyikhethe ekugcineni iyinjini yokuqala yamafayela angenayo ukukhetha kwawo. Isithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo sithi yiluphi uhlelo oluyidwebile nenguqulo yalo, engxoxweni nasemugqeni wokurenda. Izithembiso zekhasi Renda zimboza izinjini zethu kuphela: olunye uhlelo lukhanyisa, lunciphise kanye nokukhetha ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe ezimbili zesigcawu esifanayo zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, amalambu nokuchayeka, kodwa hhayi ipikseli ngepikseli. Okunikezwa yonke injini Isigcawu siya kolunye uhlelo njengephakheji: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (lelo efanayo Londoloza njenge-USD elibhala), nefayela lezilungiselelo elibamba okungathenjwa kuwo umlethi we-USD: amanani empahla angokoqobo, amalambu avulekile ngamandla nemiyalo yokukhanya, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuchayeka nekhamera njengoba ingxoxo izodweba. Akukho okulayishwa noma yikuphi. Umugqa wokurenda Isithombe noma i-animation yolunye uhlelo ingalinda kumugqa wokurenda njengezinye zethu; umsebenzi wayo ukhumbula ukuthi yenjini yini. I-animation iya kuhlelo ngokuqhubeka kanye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"live-view","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ukubuka okuphilayo","summary":"Iwindi eliseceleni kwemodeli elibonisa ngesimo sesikhathi sangempela, ngelanga nezithunzi, futhi lilandela yonke inguquko oyenzayo; hamba kulo, futhi usethe isikhathi sosuku nenyanga.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["yabelana","ipanorama","360","uhambo","uhambo oluyisiqondiso","isibukeli esizimele","isibukeli esingaxhunyiwe","thumela kumakhasimende","ividiyo","ividiyo yokuhamba","hlakaza","ukuhlakazeka","utshani","idlelo","ihlathi","amatshe","izitshalo","izihlahla","isixuku","pendela izitshalo","ukubuka okuphilayo","isikhathi sangempela","renda yesikhathi sangempela","ukuhamba","hamba","hamba ngaphakathi","umuntu wokuqala","ukwethulwa","ikhasimende","isikrini sesibili","iwindi lesibili","imonitha","isikhathi sosuku","ilanga","isizini","inyanga","izithunzi","ukuvinjwa kwesithunzi","izibonakaliso","ukukhanya okubuyayo","ukukhanya kwejometri yonke","webgpu","webgl"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-kona","text":"Vula kona","level":2},{"id":"izilawuli","text":"Izilawuli","level":2},{"id":"hamba-ngemodeli","text":"Hamba ngemodeli","level":2},{"id":"hlakaza-izitshalo-amatshe-nabantu","text":"Hlakaza izitshalo, amatshe nabantu","level":2},{"id":"yabelana-ipanorama-uhambo-isibukeli-ividiyo","text":"Yabelana: ipanorama, uhambo, isibukeli, ividiyo","level":2},{"id":"ikhwalithi","text":"Ikhwalithi","level":2},{"id":"ukukhanya-okubuyayo","text":"Ukukhanya okubuyayo","level":2},{"id":"ukukhanya-nemibala","text":"Ukukhanya nemibala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view\u003C/span\u003E ivula iphaneli phezu kohlelo elibonisa imodeli ngesimo sesikhathi sangempela: isibhakabhaka nelanga kusuka endaweni nosuku lwemodeli yakho, izithunzi zelanga, izimo nezinto ozinikeze izindawo ezingaphezulu, izibane, nokukhanya okubuyiswa ezindongeni nasemgqeni. Ilandela okwenzayo: uma uphendula ukubuka, kuyaphenduka nalo; uma ushintsha imodeli, iyabonisa ushintsho ngemuva kwesikhashana. Akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-kona\"\u003EVula kona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view\u003C/span\u003E. Iphaneli livuleka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa ibha yesihloko sayo ukuze uyinyakazise, udonse ikhona layo ukuze uyenze ibe mkhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew window\u003C/span\u003E iyithuthela kuwindi layo, lesikrini sesibili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view in a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyivula khona ngokushesha. Uma isiphequluli sakho sivimba amawindi avelayo, ivula njengephaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E iyavala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilawuli\"\u003EIzilawuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlawuli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow the view\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma kuvuliwe: ukubuka okuphilayo kubheka lapho kubheka khona ukubuka kwe-ModelCraft. Ukuhamba kuyasivala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHamba ngemodeli (ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGravity\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma uhamba: ume phezu kwamafulowa futhi ukhwele izitebhisi. Uma kuvaliwe: ndiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETime\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhora losuku, kusuka ku-05:00 kuya ku-21:00. Ilanga liyanyakaza uma udonsa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMonth\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInyanga (usuku lwama-21 lwayo), ukuze ubone ilanga ebusika nasehlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor this computer\u003C/span\u003E (okutholwa yi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003Eumshini wakho\u003C/a\u003E), noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELow\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHigh\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa osezansi uthi yini edweba ukubuka (WebGPU noma WebGL 2), ikhwalithi, nokukhanya okubuyayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba-ngemodeli\"\u003EHamba ngemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhendula ukubuka okuyinhloko endaweni ofuna ukuma kuyo bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E. Umi phansi ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokubuka, lingu-1.6 m ukuphakama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukubuka okuphilayo, bese usebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukugijima. Donsa ukuze ubheke ozungezile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinyathelo ezikhwela kuya ku-40 cm ziyakhwelwa (izitebhisi); noma yini ephakeme kakhulu ibhekwa njengodonga. Izindonga zikumisa, futhi uyashelela eceleni kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGravity\u003C/span\u003E ivaliwe uyandiza: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iya phezulu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iya phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayeka ukuhamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlakaza-izitshalo-amatshe-nabantu\"\u003EHlakaza izitshalo, amatshe nabantu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScatter\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yokubuka okuphilayo ivula iphaneli lokuhlakaza eceleni kwesithombe. Isethi yokuhlakaza isakaza izinto ezivela kulabhulali ye-entourage (izihlahla, izihlahla ezincane, utshani, izimbali, amatshe, abantu, izimoto) ezingxenyeni ezithile zemodeli. Izinto zidwetshwa ekubukeni okuphilayo kuphela: azikho njengejometri emodelini, futhi ukubuka okuyinhloko akuzibonisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGcwalisa izinhlangothi:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha izinhlangothi (noma iqembu, njengendawo eyinhlabathi) ku-ModelCraft, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFill selection\u003C/span\u003E. Isethi iyazimboza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPenda:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E, bese udonsa phezu kokubuka okuphilayo. Uma kukhethiwe izinhlangothi, ukupenda kufika kuzo kuphela; uma kungakhethiwe lutho, kufika kunoma yini esengaphansi kwebhulashi, kubandakanya nomhlaba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrush size\u003C/span\u003E isetha ibhulashi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E isusa izindawo ezipeyintiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha okuzohlakazwa. Inombolo eseceleni kwalokho ingesisindo sakho: 3 no-1 kwenza izinto ezintathu zokuqala ngayo yonke eyodwa yesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlawuli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPer m²\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto ezingaki kusikwele ngasinye semitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep away (m)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho zinto ezisondele kakhulu kulokhu kwezinye izinto, nokungekho ngaphansi kophahla noma itafula. 0 iyayivala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn (°)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi ngakanani ngamunye uzinto ujikiswa ngokungahleliwe ngokuzungeza ngokuqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteepest (°)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho zinto lapho umphezulu usuntekile kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi omncane nomkhulu, njengesilinganiso sosayizi wento ngokwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight from, to (m)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela phakathi kwalezi zimo (blank = noma yimuphi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELean with the surface\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0 igcina izinto zimi ngqo; 1 ziyimisa zilingane nendawo ethambekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShuffle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImbewu efanayo inikeza ukuhlakaza okufanayo njalo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShuffle\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha enye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzethi zilondolozwa efayeleni \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E futhi zilandela izinhlangothi zazo uma uzishintsha. Inani lezinto ezingaphezulu okwazi ukuzidweba ekubukeni okuphilayo lilawulwa yileveli \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003Eyomshini wakho\u003C/a\u003E: 20 000 ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor only\u003C/span\u003E, 100 000 ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, basic\u003C/span\u003E, isigidi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E. Iphaneli likhombisa ukuthi zingaki ezibekiwe kwezingaki ukuminyana okuzicelayo: ezincane zibekwa uma kufinyelelwe ukulinganisa, noma lapho izinto zizigwema. Izinto eziseduze nekhamera zidwetshwa njengazo; ezikude njengezimo ezilula ngemibala yazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto ezihlakazwe zisekubukeni okuphilayo (nasekuhambeni kwalo, nasepanoramini nasekubukeni okuzimele). Isithombe esirenderiwe asikadwetshi lezo zinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yabelana-ipanorama-uhambo-isibukeli-ividiyo\"\u003EYabelana: ipanorama, uhambo, isibukeli, ividiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yokubuka okuphilayo yenza amafayela avela ekubukeni okuphilayo. Konke kwenziwa kulo mshini; akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzokutholela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E360° panorama\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe esingu-360° kusuka lapho ukubuka kuma khona (noma lapho uhamba khona), njenge-PNG ye-equirectangular evulwa ngababukeli bepanorama nezindawo eziningi zezithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd this spot to the tour\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the tour\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhasi elilodwa lewebhu elinepanorama endaweni ngayinye nemicibisholo eya ezindaweni ngazinye ezibonakalayo (udonga oluphakathi luvimba umcibisholo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave a viewer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhasi elilodwa lewebhu elinemodeli kulesi simo sesikhathi sangempela: uyiphendule, uhambe kuyo, ufinyelele izindawo zayo ezigciniwe. Livula lingaxhunyiwe kusiphequluli esine-WebGPU noma WebGL 2, kusuka kufolda, kusitiki se-USB noma ku-imeyili, ngaphandle kokufaka nakukhawunti, futhi alilayishi lutho ku-inthanethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVideo of the path\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmzila wekhamera wethayimlayini (noma izindawo ezigciniwe ngokulandelana) njengevidiyo kulesi simo sesikhathi sangempela, ngosayizi wokubuka okuphilayo: WebM noma MP4 lapho isiphequluli singazenza khona, uma kungenjalo izithombe ezinombolo ezingaphakathi kwe-ZIP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi wepanorama ulandela ikhwalithi: 1024, 2048 noma 4096 amapikseli ububanzi ku-Phansi, Phakathi noma Phezulu. Ifayela lesibukeli cishe lingu-5 MB kanye nemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhambo nesibukeli kwenzelwe ukubonisa, hhayi ukuhlela: zigcina imodeli njengoba ikhona lapho uzilondoloza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhwalithi\"\u003EIkhwalithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPhakathi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithunzi zelanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eimephu eyodwa yesithunzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizigaba ezintathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizigaba ezine\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvinjwa kwesithunzi (izithunzi zokuthintana)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓, ngokucacile kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibonakaliso ensimbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubhabha (lapho Renda isithombe ikusetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ebushelelezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFXAA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eemafremini amaningi (TAA)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eemafremini amaningi (TAA)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya okubuyayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuhlanganisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuncane\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuncane kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor this computer\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha Phansi kukhompyutha engenaye ikhadi lezithombe elisebenzayo, Phakathi ngetshipha yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi, Phezulu ngekhadi lezithombe elihlukile. Phansi ihloselwe ilaptop enama-8 GB engenalo ikhadi lezithombe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhanya-okubuyayo\"\u003EUkukhanya okubuyayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhanya okubuyela kudonga oluthola ilanga, nengaphakathi elimnyama legumbi, kuqanjwa ngomzila ofanayo owenza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eizithombe ezirenderiwe\u003C/a\u003E: wenza ipanorama encane emaphuyinteni ahamba emodelini, ngasemuva kuwo wonke ama-processor core. Lapho isasebenza, umugqa osezansi uthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBounce light: 40 %\u003C/span\u003E; uma selulungile, ukubuka kuyawuthatha. Ngemuva kokushintsha, iyaqala kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu ukulinganisa kokubuka okuphilayo, hhayi isithombe esirenderiwe: imininingwane emincane phakathi kwamaphuyinti ithola ukukhanya okubuyayo kwamaphuyinti aseduze. Ngesithombe esiqedile sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhanya-nemibala\"\u003EUkukhanya nemibala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo kusebenzisa ukukhanya, ukulinganisa umbala omhlophe, ukuqhathanisa nokuguqulwa kokubuka (ACES, AgX, filmic noma okujwayelekile) okufanayo nakwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E: sethe lapho futhi ukubuka okuphilayo kuyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOsiphequluli bayahlukana. Lapho isiphequluli sine-WebGPU (Chrome ne-Edge kuWindows, macOS naseChromeOS, Safari 26) ukubuka okuphilayo kuyasisebenzisa; kwezinye (iningi lesiphequluli se-Linux, izinhlelo ze-Apple ezindala) kusebenzisa WebGL 2 futhi kubukeka kanjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Export › Live view ivula iphaneli phezu kohlelo elibonisa imodeli ngesimo sesikhathi sangempela: isibhakabhaka nelanga kusuka endaweni nosuku lwemodeli yakho, izithunzi zelanga, izimo nezinto ozinikeze izindawo ezingaphezulu, izibane, nokukhanya okubuyiswa ezindongeni nasemgqeni. Ilandela okwenzayo: uma uphendula ukubuka, kuyaphenduka nalo; uma ushintsha imodeli, iyabonisa ushintsho ngemuva kwesikhashana. Akukho okulayishwayo. Vula kona Khetha Export › Live view. Iphaneli livuleka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla. Donsa ibha yesihloko sayo ukuze uyinyakazise, udonse ikhona layo ukuze uyenze ibe mkhulu. New window iyithuthela kuwindi layo, lesikrini sesibili. Export › Live view in a new window iyivula khona ngokushesha. Uma isiphequluli sakho sivimba amawindi avelayo, ivula njengephaneli. Close iyavala. Izilawuli Ilawuli Okwenzayo Follow the view Uma kuvuliwe: ukubuka okuphilayo kubheka lapho kubheka khona ukubuka kwe-ModelCraft. Ukuhamba kuyasivala Walk Hamba ngemodeli (ngezansi) Gravity Uma uhamba: ume phezu kwamafulowa futhi ukhwele izitebhisi. Uma kuvaliwe: ndiza Time Ihora losuku, kusuka ku-05:00 kuya ku-21:00. Ilanga liyanyakaza uma udonsa Month Inyanga (usuku lwama-21 lwayo), ukuze ubone ilanga ebusika nasehlobo Quality For this computer (okutholwa yi-umshini wakho), noma Low, Medium noma High Umugqa osezansi uthi yini edweba ukubuka (WebGPU noma WebGL 2), ikhwalithi, nokukhanya okubuyayo. Hamba ngemodeli Phendula ukubuka okuyinhloko endaweni ofuna ukuma kuyo bese ukhetha Walk. Umi phansi ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokubuka, lingu-1.6 m ukuphakama. Chofoza ukubuka okuphilayo, bese usebenzisa W A S D noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bamba Shift ukugijima. Donsa ukuze ubheke ozungezile. Izinyathelo ezikhwela kuya ku-40 cm ziyakhwelwa (izitebhisi); noma yini ephakeme kakhulu ibhekwa njengodonga. Izindonga zikumisa, futhi uyashelela eceleni kwazo. Uma Gravity ivaliwe uyandiza: E iya phezulu, Q iya phansi. Esc iyayeka ukuhamba. Hlakaza izitshalo, amatshe nabantu Scatter ebhalini yokubuka okuphilayo ivula iphaneli lokuhlakaza eceleni kwesithombe. Isethi yokuhlakaza isakaza izinto ezivela kulabhulali ye-entourage (izihlahla, izihlahla ezincane, utshani, izimbali, amatshe, abantu, izimoto) ezingxenyeni ezithile zemodeli. Izinto zidwetshwa ekubukeni okuphilayo kuphela: azikho njengejometri emodelini, futhi ukubuka okuyinhloko akuzibonisi. Gcwalisa izinhlangothi: khetha izinhlangothi (noma iqembu, njengendawo eyinhlabathi) ku-ModelCraft, bese ukhetha Fill selection. Isethi iyazimboza. Penda: khetha Paint, bese udonsa phezu kokubuka okuphilayo. Uma kukhethiwe izinhlangothi, ukupenda kufika kuzo kuphela; uma kungakhethiwe lutho, kufika kunoma yini esengaphansi kwebhulashi, kubandakanya nomhlaba. Brush size isetha ibhulashi; Eraser isusa izindawo ezipeyintiwe. Thikha okuzohlakazwa. Inombolo eseceleni kwalokho ingesisindo sakho: 3 no-1 kwenza izinto ezintathu zokuqala ngayo yonke eyodwa yesibili. Ilawuli Okwenzayo Per m² Izinto ezingaki kusikwele ngasinye semitha Keep away (m) Akukho zinto ezisondele kakhulu kulokhu kwezinye izinto, nokungekho ngaphansi kophahla noma itafula. 0 iyayivala Turn (°) Ukuthi ngakanani ngamunye uzinto ujikiswa ngokungahleliwe ngokuzungeza ngokuqondile Steepest (°) Akukho zinto lapho umphezulu usuntekile kakhulu Size Usayizi omncane nomkhulu, njengesilinganiso sosayizi wento ngokwayo Height from, to (m) Kuphela phakathi kwalezi zimo (blank = noma yimuphi) Lean with the surface 0 igcina izinto zimi ngqo; 1 ziyimisa zilingane nendawo ethambekile Seed, Shuffle Imbewu efanayo inikeza ukuhlakaza okufanayo njalo; Shuffle ikhetha enye Izethi zilondolozwa efayeleni .modelcraft futhi zilandela izinhlangothi zazo uma uzishintsha. Inani lezinto ezingaphezulu okwazi ukuzidweba ekubukeni okuphilayo lilawulwa yileveli yomshini wakho: 20 000 ku-Processor only, 100 000 ku-Graphics card, basic, isigidi ku-Graphics card, high. Iphaneli likhombisa ukuthi zingaki ezibekiwe kwezingaki ukuminyana okuzicelayo: ezincane zibekwa uma kufinyelelwe ukulinganisa, noma lapho izinto zizigwema. Izinto eziseduze nekhamera zidwetshwa njengazo; ezikude njengezimo ezilula ngemibala yazo. Izinto ezihlakazwe zisekubukeni okuphilayo (nasekuhambeni kwalo, nasepanoramini nasekubukeni okuzimele). Isithombe esirenderiwe asikadwetshi lezo zinto. Yabelana: ipanorama, uhambo, isibukeli, ividiyo Share ebhalini yokubuka okuphilayo yenza amafayela avela ekubukeni okuphilayo. Konke kwenziwa kulo mshini; akukho okulayishwayo. Ukukhetha Okuzokutholela 360° panorama Isithombe esingu-360° kusuka lapho ukubuka kuma khona (noma lapho uhamba khona), njenge-PNG ye-equirectangular evulwa ngababukeli bepanorama nezindawo eziningi zezithombe Add this spot to the tour, bese Save the tour Ikhasi elilodwa lewebhu elinepanorama endaweni ngayinye nemicibisholo eya ezindaweni ngazinye ezibonakalayo (udonga oluphakathi luvimba umcibisholo) Save a viewer Ikhasi elilodwa lewebhu elinemodeli kulesi simo sesikhathi sangempela: uyiphendule, uhambe kuyo, ufinyelele izindawo zayo ezigciniwe. Livula lingaxhunyiwe kusiphequluli esine-WebGPU noma WebGL 2, kusuka kufolda, kusitiki se-USB noma ku-imeyili, ngaphandle kokufaka nakukhawunti, futhi alilayishi lutho ku-inthanethi Video of the path Umzila wekhamera wethayimlayini (noma izindawo ezigciniwe ngokulandelana) njengevidiyo kulesi simo sesikhathi sangempela, ngosayizi wokubuka okuphilayo: WebM noma MP4 lapho isiphequluli singazenza khona, uma kungenjalo izithombe ezinombolo ezingaphakathi kwe-ZIP Usayizi wepanorama ulandela ikhwalithi: 1024, 2048 noma 4096 amapikseli ububanzi ku-Phansi, Phakathi noma Phezulu. Ifayela lesibukeli cishe lingu-5 MB kanye nemodeli. Uhambo nesibukeli kwenzelwe ukubonisa, hhayi ukuhlela: zigcina imodeli njengoba ikhona lapho uzilondoloza. Ikhwalithi Phansi Phakathi Phezulu Izithunzi zelanga imephu eyodwa yesithunzi izigaba ezintathu izigaba ezine Ukuvinjwa kwesithunzi (izithunzi zokuthintana) ✓ ✓, ngokucacile kakhulu Izibonakaliso ensimbi ✓ Ukubhabha (lapho Renda isithombe ikusetha) ✓ ✓ Imiphetho ebushelelezi FXAA emafremini amaningi (TAA) emafremini amaningi (TAA) Ukukhanya okubuyayo okuhlanganisiwe okuncane okuncane kakhulu For this computer ikhetha Phansi kukhompyutha engenaye ikhadi lezithombe elisebenzayo, Phakathi ngetshipha yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi, Phezulu ngekhadi lezithombe elihlukile. Phansi ihloselwe ilaptop enama-8 GB engenalo ikhadi lezithombe. Ukukhanya okubuyayo Ukukhanya okubuyela kudonga oluthola ilanga, nengaphakathi elimnyama legumbi, kuqanjwa ngomzila ofanayo owenza izithombe ezirenderiwe: wenza ipanorama encane emaphuyinteni ahamba emodelini, ngasemuva kuwo wonke ama-processor core. Lapho isasebenza, umugqa osezansi uthi Bounce light: 40 %; uma selulungile, ukubuka kuyawuthatha. Ngemuva kokushintsha, iyaqala kabusha. Lokhu ukulinganisa kokubuka okuphilayo, hhayi isithombe esirenderiwe: imininingwane emincane phakathi kwamaphuyinti ithola ukukhanya okubuyayo kwamaphuyinti aseduze. Ngesithombe esiqedile sebenzisa Renda isithombe. Ukukhanya nemibala Ukubuka okuphilayo kusebenzisa ukukhanya, ukulinganisa umbala omhlophe, ukuqhathanisa nokuguqulwa kokubuka (ACES, AgX, filmic noma okujwayelekile) okufanayo nakwi-Renda isithombe: sethe lapho futhi ukubuka okuphilayo kuyalandela. Osiphequluli bayahlukana. Lapho isiphequluli sine-WebGPU (Chrome ne-Edge kuWindows, macOS naseChromeOS, Safari 26) ukubuka okuphilayo kuyasisebenzisa; kwezinye (iningi lesiphequluli se-Linux, izinhlelo ze-Apple ezindala) kusebenzisa WebGL 2 futhi kubukeka kanjalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-other-program","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo","summary":"Umlandeli wethu wendlela udweba isithombe se-Render; olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela ngesengezo se-render-engine ku-CadCraft Studio. Yini ethuthelwa kwenye indawo, nokuthi kungani ezinye izinhlelo zingakaze zinikezwe.","section":"tasks","order":114,"keywords":["render","injini","uhlelo langaphandle","injini ye-add-on","studio","ingemuva","umugqa","usd","gltf","kudwetshwe ngu","blender","gpl"],"headings":[{"id":"dweba-isithombe-ngenjini-ye-add-on","text":"Dweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on","level":2},{"id":"okuthuthelwayo","text":"Okuthuthelwayo","level":2},{"id":"izinhlelo-i-cadcraft-engakaze-iziqhube","text":"Izinhlelo i-CadCraft engakaze iziqhube","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E sidwetshwa \u003Cstrong\u003Eyizinjini zethu\u003C/strong\u003E: Ngokushesha ne-Path tracer, kusiphequluli nasku-CadCraft Studio. Olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela uma i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eadd-on yenjini yokurenda\u003C/strong\u003E ilethe kuyo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EEngeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuthatha isigcawu kolunye uhlelo ukuze uqhubeke usebenza khona, sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EThumela isigcawu kwinjini yemidlalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isithombe-ngenjini-ye-add-on\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-add-on ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. Injini yayo ivela ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYikhethe. Izilungiselelo zayo zomqondo ziboniswa ngaphansi kohlu lweNjini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Studio, ngokuqala i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio iyakubuza ngengxoxo yayo. Inqubekela phambili ibonisa ngesikhathi edweba; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyayiphelisa. Isithombe siyavela sibhalwe ngenjini eyidwebile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript isebenza nakusiphequluli. Injini eqhuba uhlelo kule khompyutha isebenza kuphela ku-Studio; kusiphequluli iboniswa njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuthuthelwayo\"\u003EOkuthuthelwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini ithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphakheji\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (nefayela le-glTF uma icela lona), nefayela lezilungiselelo elinamanani empahla eqondile, ilanga nesibhakabhaka, wonke amalambu avulekile ngamandla nemiyalo yokukhanya, ikhamera nokuchayeka. Olunye uhlelo ngalunye lukhanyisa, lunciphise futhi lukhethe ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, amalambu nokuchayeka, kodwa hhayi ipikseli ngepikseli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlelo-i-cadcraft-engakaze-iziqhube\"\u003EIzinhlelo i-CadCraft engakaze iziqhube\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft ayiqali uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL, futhi ayikaze iyibeke njengenjini ohlwini lwe-Injini noma njengesihloso se-Vula ku. I-Blender ingenye yazo, ngakho ayikho ohlwini lwe-Injini. Ifayela le-USD noma le-glTF elilondolozwe kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E lisavulwa kuyo njengakunoma iyiphi enye inhlelo efunda lawo mafayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhamera asemaphanoramu nasezimbili kanye nesithombe sesibhakabhaka (imibala yesibhakabhaka isetshenziswa esikhundleni) akudlulisi kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okwenziwe kwenye inhlelo okubuyela emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Isithombe se-Renda isithombe… sidwetshwa yizinjini zethu: Ngokushesha ne-Path tracer, kusiphequluli nasku-CadCraft Studio. Olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela uma i-add-on yenjini yokurenda ilethe kuyo: bona Engeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on. Ukuthatha isigcawu kolunye uhlelo ukuze uqhubeke usebenza khona, sebenzisa Vula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo noma Thumela isigcawu kwinjini yemidlalo. Dweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on Vula i-add-on ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. Injini yayo ivela ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-Renda isithombe…. Yikhethe. Izilungiselelo zayo zomqondo ziboniswa ngaphansi kohlu lweNjini. Chofoza Renda. Ku-Studio, ngokuqala i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio iyakubuza ngengxoxo yayo. Inqubekela phambili ibonisa ngesikhathi edweba; Misa iyayiphelisa. Isithombe siyavela sibhalwe ngenjini eyidwebile. Injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript isebenza nakusiphequluli. Injini eqhuba uhlelo kule khompyutha isebenza kuphela ku-Studio; kusiphequluli iboniswa njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe. Okuthuthelwayo Injini ithola iphakheji: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (nefayela le-glTF uma icela lona), nefayela lezilungiselelo elinamanani empahla eqondile, ilanga nesibhakabhaka, wonke amalambu avulekile ngamandla nemiyalo yokukhanya, ikhamera nokuchayeka. Olunye uhlelo ngalunye lukhanyisa, lunciphise futhi lukhethe ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, amalambu nokuchayeka, kodwa hhayi ipikseli ngepikseli. Izinhlelo i-CadCraft engakaze iziqhube I-CadCraft ayiqali uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL, futhi ayikaze iyibeke njengenjini ohlwini lwe-Injini noma njengesihloso se-Vula ku. I-Blender ingenye yazo, ngakho ayikho ohlwini lwe-Injini. Ifayela le-USD noma le-glTF elilondolozwe kusuka ku-Renda isithombe… lisavulwa kuyo njengakunoma iyiphi enye inhlelo efunda lawo mafayela. Amakhamera asemaphanoramu nasezimbili kanye nesithombe sesibhakabhaka (imibala yesibhakabhaka isetshenziswa esikhundleni) akudlulisi kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okwenziwe kwenye inhlelo okubuyela emodelini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"animation","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Yenza i-animation yekhamera nezinto, bese uqopha ividiyo","summary":"Setha izikhiye zekhamera namaqembu namakhompoment ethalini lesikhathi, uwadlale ku-view, bese uqopha i-animation ibe yividiyo ye-WebM ngesibhakabhaka, ilanga, izinto nezinto zokuqopha ezifanayo.","section":"tasks","order":114,"keywords":["i-animation","animate","ithala lesikhathi","ukhiye","izikhiye","ifreyimu yokhiye","indlela yekhamera","ukundiza","ukuhamba","ividiyo","ifilimu","webm","qopha ividiyo","izinhlaka","izinga lezinhlaka","i-playhead","ukhiye ozenzakalelayo","ukuthamba","ukubushelelezisa","ukubamba","izigcawu","izithombe ze-png","ukunyakaza"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ithala-lesikhathi","text":"Vula ithala lesikhathi","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ikhamera","text":"Hambisa ikhamera","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-iqembu-noma-ikhompoment","text":"Hambisa iqembu noma ikhompoment","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-izikhiye","text":"Shintsha izikhiye","level":2},{"id":"qopha-ividiyo","text":"Qopha ividiyo","level":2},{"id":"okunye-okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okunye okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthala lesikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E linyakazisa ikhamera namaqembu noma amakhompoment noma yiliphi phakathi nesikhathi. Usetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eizikhiye\u003C/strong\u003E (lapho okuthile kukhona ngesikhathi esithile); i-ModelCraft iyinyakazisa ngokushelelayo ukusuka kukhiye kuye kwelandelayo. Yidlale ku-view, bese uyiqopha ibe yividiyo ngesibhakabhaka, ilanga, izinto namalambu afanayo nakwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Eisithombe esiqoshiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ithala-lesikhathi\"\u003EVula ithala lesikhathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECamera\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimation timeline\u003C/span\u003E. Ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view: izilawuli eziphezulu, bese umugqa we-\u003Cstrong\u003ECamera\u003C/strong\u003E kanye nomugqa ngamunye weqembu noma ikhompoment elinyakazayo. Amadayimane ngezikhiye; umugqa obomvu ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003Eplayhead\u003C/strong\u003E, isikhathi esibonakala ku-view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKufoni ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view nalo. Izilawuli zalo ziyumugqa owodwa: swayiphela ngokuhlangothi ukuze ufinyelele ezinye; inkinobho evala ithala ihlala ekugcineni kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa isilayida (noma chofoza emgqeni) ukuze uhambise i-playhead. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E idlala kusuka ku-playhead iphenduke ibe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPause\u003C/span\u003E njengoba idlala; chofoza futhi ukuze umise lapho ikhona. I-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza okufanayo lapho ithala livuliwe (ngethala elingavuliwe, i-Space isaba yi-Select). I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrevious key\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext key\u003C/span\u003E zigxuma phakathi kwezikhiye. Isitayela sakho singanikeza ukudlala nokumisa ukhiye omusha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, bese imenyu, izinkinobho ne-mouse, umyalo \u003Cem\u003EDlala noma misa i-animation\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ikhamera\"\u003EHambisa ikhamera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa i-playhead uye lapho ukudubula kuqala khona (0 s), lungisa i-view, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa i-playhead ngokuya kwesikhathi (ake sithi 4 s), zungeza, pan noma hamba i-view uye endaweni elandelayo, bese uchofoza futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza izikhiye ozithandayo, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhamera idlula ngokushelelayo kukho konke ukhiye futhi iqala iphele ekuphumuleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESewunezigcawu? I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom scenes\u003C/span\u003E yenza indlela yekhamera kuzo: imisa kuyo ngayinye, bese iya kolandelayo. Uma ithala lesikhathi lingenazo izikhiye, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video…\u003C/span\u003E yenza lokhu yodwa, ngakho izigcawu ezimbili noma ngaphezulu zanele ividiyo yokuhamba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-iqembu-noma-ikhompoment\"\u003EHambisa iqembu noma ikhompoment\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu noma ikhompoment (amaqembu aphelele nezikhompoment kuphela ayanyakaza; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Eyenza iqembu\u003C/a\u003E kuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-0 s, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa i-playhead ngokuya kwesikhathi, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003Ehambisa, jikisa noma shintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E weqembu liye lapho kufanele khona, bese uchofoza futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELishelela, lijike futhi likhule phakathi kwezikhiye zalo. Ukugoqa kuthatha indlela emfushane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003EAuto key\u003C/strong\u003E isindisa ukuchofoza kwesinyathelo sesi-3: uma i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto key\u003C/span\u003E ivulekile, iqembu elikhethiwe oliyihambisayo, oliphendulayo noma oliyishintshayo lithola ukhiye ku-playhead ngokwalo (nokhiye ku-0 s lapho lalikhona, okokuqala).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkunyakaza kweqembu elinezikhiye ngaphandle kokhiye kuhlala kuze kuhambe i-playhead: ngakulandelayo lapho udlala noma uhambisa, ibuyela lapho izikhiye zalo zalibeka khona. Ibha yesimo iyasho lokhu. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyigcine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-izikhiye\"\u003EShintsha izikhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha ukhiye\u003C/strong\u003E ngokuchofoza idayimane lawo: i-playhead iyaya kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ukhiye\u003C/strong\u003E ngokudonsa idayimane lawo emugqeni walo, noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ifreyimu eyodwa; nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, eyishumi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete key\u003C/span\u003E (ukhiye okhethiwe, noma zonke izikhiye ku-playhead) noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kudayimane okhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthi uhamba kanjani kulandelayo\u003C/strong\u003E, ukhiye okhethiwe: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E (ijika elidlula ezikhiyeni eziseduze), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteady\u003C/span\u003E (umugqa oqondile ngejubane elilodwa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlow in and out\u003C/span\u003E (ufika ekuphumuleni kulo khiye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E (ihlala ize kufike ukhiye olandelayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude (s)\u003C/strong\u003E isetha ukuthi i-animation inde kangakanani; ukhiye osethwe ngemva kwesiphetho wenza ibeide. Ukuze uyifinyeze, hambisa noma susa izikhiye ezidlula isiphetho esisha kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lweqembu iyayiyeka ukuyianimeyita.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthala lesikhathi linalo lalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E: i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yemodeli ishintsha imodeli, hhayi izikhiye. I-animation igcinwa ku-fayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Ukuvala ithala kubuyisela amaqembu anyakazayo ekumeni kwawo kokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qopha-ividiyo\"\u003EQopha ividiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E ethalini lesikhathi (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video…\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame rate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality of each frame\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E. Ifreyimu ngayinye iyabonakala njengoba yenziwa, nesikhathi esisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho isiqedile, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyayiphelisa ngaphambi kwesikhathi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E bese igcina izinhlaka ezisele njengevidiyo emfushane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibhakabhaka, ilanga, izinto, amalambu nokukhanya kuyizinto ezisethwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E: zisethe lapho kuqala, uhlole isithombe esimi. Ifreyimu ngayinye iqoshwa kulolu komputha; akukho lutho oluthunyelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E480p, 720p HD, 1080p Full HD, noma isimo se-view siqu (kuze kufike kumapikseli angu-1920 ububanzi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame rate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24, 25, 30 noma 60 izinhlaka ngomzuzwana. Izinhlaka eziphindwe kabili zithatha isikhathi esiphindwe kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality of each frame\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuick\u003C/span\u003E (ukudlula okungu-4), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E (16) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E (64): ukudlula okuningi kwenza izithunzi nemiphetho ibushelelezile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebM video\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMP4 video (H.264)\u003C/span\u003E lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP)\u003C/span\u003E kubahleli bevidiyo (nakuma-browser angenawo umshini wamavidiyo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIvidiyo yemizuzwana engu-10 ngama-30 izinhlaka ngomzuzwana inezinhlaka ezingu-301. Zama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuick\u003C/span\u003E ku-480p kuqala ukuhlola ukunyakaza, bese uqopha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E ngosayizi omkhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-WebM ivula ezisiphequluli ne-VLC, nabahleli bevidiyo bayiguqula. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMP4 video (H.264)\u003C/span\u003E iyatholakala lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa umqoshi osheshayo; ukuze ifreyimu ngayinye iqoshwe ngokugcwele ngokukhanya, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd this animation to the queue\u003C/span\u003E kuleyo nkulumo: izinhlaka ziqoshwa ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Euhlu lokuqopha\u003C/a\u003E, okudinga i-WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqopha ividiyo kudinga isiphequluli esenza ividiyo ngaso (WebCodecs): i-Chrome yakamuva, i-Edge, i-Firefox kanye ne-Safari 17. Ngaphandle kwalokho, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okunye-okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkunye okufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphela amaqembu aphelele nezikhompoment ayanyakaza. Ubuso, imiphetho, isikhathi selanga nesitayela azikashintshi ngesikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport animation\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/a\u003E isabhala i-view njengoba ikhona esikrinini, ngesikhathi sangempela; i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E iqopha ifreyimu ngayinye ngesibhakabhaka, nezithunzi nezinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ithala lesikhathi linyakazisa ikhamera namaqembu noma amakhompoment noma yiliphi phakathi nesikhathi. Usetha izikhiye (lapho okuthile kukhona ngesikhathi esithile); i-ModelCraft iyinyakazisa ngokushelelayo ukusuka kukhiye kuye kwelandelayo. Yidlale ku-view, bese uyiqopha ibe yividiyo ngesibhakabhaka, ilanga, izinto namalambu afanayo nakwe-isithombe esiqoshiwe. Vula ithala lesikhathi Chofoza Views eqenjini le-Camera, bese Animation timeline. Ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view: izilawuli eziphezulu, bese umugqa we-Camera kanye nomugqa ngamunye weqembu noma ikhompoment elinyakazayo. Amadayimane ngezikhiye; umugqa obomvu ngu-playhead, isikhathi esibonakala ku-view. Kufoni ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view nalo. Izilawuli zalo ziyumugqa owodwa: swayiphela ngokuhlangothi ukuze ufinyelele ezinye; inkinobho evala ithala ihlala ekugcineni kwalo. Donsa isilayida (noma chofoza emgqeni) ukuze uhambise i-playhead. I-Play idlala kusuka ku-playhead iphenduke ibe Pause njengoba idlala; chofoza futhi ukuze umise lapho ikhona. I-Space yenza okufanayo lapho ithala livuliwe (ngethala elingavuliwe, i-Space isaba yi-Select). I-Previous key ne-Next key zigxuma phakathi kwezikhiye. Isitayela sakho singanikeza ukudlala nokumisa ukhiye omusha: Settings, bese imenyu, izinkinobho ne-mouse, umyalo Dlala noma misa i-animation. Hambisa ikhamera Hambisa i-playhead uye lapho ukudubula kuqala khona (0 s), lungisa i-view, bese uchofoza Key camera. Hambisa i-playhead ngokuya kwesikhathi (ake sithi 4 s), zungeza, pan noma hamba i-view uye endaweni elandelayo, bese uchofoza futhi Key camera. Engeza izikhiye ozithandayo, bese Play. Ikhamera idlula ngokushelelayo kukho konke ukhiye futhi iqala iphele ekuphumuleni. Sewunezigcawu? I-From scenes yenza indlela yekhamera kuzo: imisa kuyo ngayinye, bese iya kolandelayo. Uma ithala lesikhathi lingenazo izikhiye, i-Render video… yenza lokhu yodwa, ngakho izigcawu ezimbili noma ngaphezulu zanele ividiyo yokuhamba. Hambisa iqembu noma ikhompoment Khetha iqembu noma ikhompoment (amaqembu aphelele nezikhompoment kuphela ayanyakaza; yenza iqembu kuqala). Ku-0 s, chofoza Key selected. Hambisa i-playhead ngokuya kwesikhathi, hambisa, jikisa noma shintsha usayizi weqembu liye lapho kufanele khona, bese uchofoza futhi Key selected. Lishelela, lijike futhi likhule phakathi kwezikhiye zalo. Ukugoqa kuthatha indlela emfushane. I-Auto key isindisa ukuchofoza kwesinyathelo sesi-3: uma i-Auto key ivulekile, iqembu elikhethiwe oliyihambisayo, oliphendulayo noma oliyishintshayo lithola ukhiye ku-playhead ngokwalo (nokhiye ku-0 s lapho lalikhona, okokuqala). Ukunyakaza kweqembu elinezikhiye ngaphandle kokhiye kuhlala kuze kuhambe i-playhead: ngakulandelayo lapho udlala noma uhambisa, ibuyela lapho izikhiye zalo zalibeka khona. Ibha yesimo iyasho lokhu. Cindezela Key selected ukuze uyigcine. Shintsha izikhiye Khetha ukhiye ngokuchofoza idayimane lawo: i-playhead iyaya kuwo. Hambisa ukhiye ngokudonsa idayimane lawo emugqeni walo, noma nge-← ne-→ (ifreyimu eyodwa; nge-Shift, eyishumi). Susa nge-Delete key (ukhiye okhethiwe, noma zonke izikhiye ku-playhead) noma Delete kudayimane okhethiwe. Ukuthi uhamba kanjani kulandelayo, ukhiye okhethiwe: Smooth (ijika elidlula ezikhiyeni eziseduze), Steady (umugqa oqondile ngejubane elilodwa), Slow in and out (ufika ekuphumuleni kulo khiye) noma Hold (ihlala ize kufike ukhiye olandelayo). I-Ubude (s) isetha ukuthi i-animation inde kangakanani; ukhiye osethwe ngemva kwesiphetho wenza ibeide. Ukuze uyifinyeze, hambisa noma susa izikhiye ezidlula isiphetho esisha kuqala. I-× ohlwini lweqembu iyayiyeka ukuyianimeyita. Ithala lesikhathi linalo lalo Undo ne-Redo: i-Ctrl+Z yemodeli ishintsha imodeli, hhayi izikhiye. I-animation igcinwa ku-fayela le-.modelcraft. Ukuvala ithala kubuyisela amaqembu anyakazayo ekumeni kwawo kokuqala. Qopha ividiyo Chofoza Render video ethalini lesikhathi (noma Export › Render video…). Khetha Size, Frame rate, Quality of each frame kanye File. Chofoza Render video. Ifreyimu ngayinye iyabonakala njengoba yenziwa, nesikhathi esisele. Lapho isiqedile, chofoza Save video. Stop (noma Esc) iyayiphelisa ngaphambi kwesikhathi; Save video bese igcina izinhlaka ezisele njengevidiyo emfushane. Isibhakabhaka, ilanga, izinto, amalambu nokukhanya kuyizinto ezisethwe ku-Render a picture…: zisethe lapho kuqala, uhlole isithombe esimi. Ifreyimu ngayinye iqoshwa kulolu komputha; akukho lutho oluthunyelwa. Isilungiselelo Okwenzayo Size 480p, 720p HD, 1080p Full HD, noma isimo se-view siqu (kuze kufike kumapikseli angu-1920 ububanzi) Frame rate 24, 25, 30 noma 60 izinhlaka ngomzuzwana. Izinhlaka eziphindwe kabili zithatha isikhathi esiphindwe kabili Quality of each frame Quick (ukudlula okungu-4), Draft (16) noma Good (64): ukudlula okuningi kwenza izithunzi nemiphetho ibushelelezile File WebM video, MP4 video (H.264) lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona, noma PNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP) kubahleli bevidiyo (nakuma-browser angenawo umshini wamavidiyo) Ividiyo yemizuzwana engu-10 ngama-30 izinhlaka ngomzuzwana inezinhlaka ezingu-301. Zama Quick ku-480p kuqala ukuhlola ukunyakaza, bese uqopha Draft noma Good ngosayizi omkhulu. I-WebM ivula ezisiphequluli ne-VLC, nabahleli bevidiyo bayiguqula. I-MP4 video (H.264) iyatholakala lapho isiphequluli singayibhala khona. I-Render video isebenzisa umqoshi osheshayo; ukuze ifreyimu ngayinye iqoshwe ngokugcwele ngokukhanya, khetha Add this animation to the queue kuleyo nkulumo: izinhlaka ziqoshwa ku-uhlu lokuqopha, okudinga i-WebGPU. Ukuqopha ividiyo kudinga isiphequluli esenza ividiyo ngaso (WebCodecs): i-Chrome yakamuva, i-Edge, i-Firefox kanye ne-Safari 17. Ngaphandle kwalokho, khetha PNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP). Okunye okufanele ukwazi Kuphela amaqembu aphelele nezikhompoment ayanyakaza. Ubuso, imiphetho, isikhathi selanga nesitayela azikashintshi ngesikhathi. I-Export animation ngaphansi kwe-Imiboniso isabhala i-view njengoba ikhona esikrinini, ngesikhathi sangempela; i-Render video iqopha ifreyimu ngayinye ngesibhakabhaka, nezithunzi nezinto.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-open-in","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Vula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo","summary":"Londoloza isigcawu njengefayela le-USD noma le-glTF kunoma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda lezi, noma uvule kusuka ku-Studio kuhlelo oluselwini lalesi sikhompyutha.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["vula ku","usd","gltf","glb","khipha","uhlelo lokurenda","archviz","studio","usdview","thumela","hand-off","iphakheji","folda ye-unreal"],"headings":[{"id":"ifayela-kunoma-yiluphi-uhlelo","text":"Ifayela kunoma yiluphi uhlelo","level":2},{"id":"ku-studio-vula-kuhlelo","text":"Ku-Studio: vula kuhlelo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKhetha inkinobho ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EVula ku…\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E ukuthatha isigcawu kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okubuyela emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela-kunoma-yiluphi-uhlelo\"\u003EIfayela kunoma yiluphi uhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-USD\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza isigcawu njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E uma imodeli inezithombe): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003Elelo fayela elifanayo njenge-Londoloza njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E, nezinto zempahla, amalambu namakhamera. Igcina ukuphindwa kwezinto nezinani eliqondile lezinto zempahla. Imiklamo eminingi, izinjini zemidlalo nababoni bafunda i-USD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-glTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza ifayela elilula le-glTF 2.0 nempahla, izinhlobo nezibani; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003EKhipha imodeli yezinye izinhlelo\u003C/a\u003E ngamafomethi aseqinisweni ModelCraft ayabhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E ilondoloza ifolda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EThumela isigcawu kwinjini yemidlalo\u003C/a\u003E eyibhalayo, yephrojekthi noma yikuphi okuyikhompyutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKokuthathu kusebenza kusiphequluli nasku-Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-studio-vula-kuhlelo\"\u003EKu-Studio: vula kuhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Studio ibala izinhlelo ezitholakala kule khompyutha ezingavula isigcawu: i-usdview uma isendleleni yakho yokusesha, nohlelo lwekhompyutha ngohlobo lwefayela. Khetha olunye, khetha i-USD noma i-glTF lapho olufunda kokubili, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. I-Studio ibhala iphakheji efolda entsha ngaphansi kwe-Documents (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft hand-off\u003C/code\u003E; akukho okubhalwa phezu, ukuthumela ngakunye kunefolda yakho) bese iqala uhlelo kuyo, ibe isitshela lapho amafayela akhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELufunda kangcono\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eusdview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo lwekhompyutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma yini ikhompyutha enayo ngohlobo lwefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Studio iqala izinhlelo ohlwini oluthile kuphela; ayiqhubezi lutho okucelwe ikhasi ngegama, futhi ayiqali uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program#programs-cadcraft-never-runs\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-hash=\"programs-cadcraft-never-runs\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E). Noma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda i-USD noma i-glTF luvula ifayela elisuka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela kunoma yiluphi uhlelo\u003C/strong\u003E lapha ngenhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Twinmotion, i-Enscape nezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa azikho ohlwini: i-CadCraft ayikahlolwa nazo futhi ayikhulumi ngazo. Ifayela le-glTF noma le-USD elivela lapha yindlela yokungena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Khetha inkinobho ethi Vula ku… ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-Renda isithombe… ukuthatha isigcawu kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okubuyela emodelini. Ifayela kunoma yiluphi uhlelo Ifayela le-USD lilondoloza isigcawu njenge-.usdc (noma .usdz uma imodeli inezithombe): lelo fayela elifanayo njenge-Londoloza njenge-USD, nezinto zempahla, amalambu namakhamera. Igcina ukuphindwa kwezinto nezinani eliqondile lezinto zempahla. Imiklamo eminingi, izinjini zemidlalo nababoni bafunda i-USD. Ifayela le-glTF (.glb) lilondoloza ifayela elilula le-glTF 2.0 nempahla, izinhlobo nezibani; bona Khipha imodeli yezinye izinhlelo ngamafomethi aseqinisweni ModelCraft ayabhala. Ifolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip) ilondoloza ifolda Thumela isigcawu kwinjini yemidlalo eyibhalayo, yephrojekthi noma yikuphi okuyikhompyutha. Kokuthathu kusebenza kusiphequluli nasku-Studio. Ku-Studio: vula kuhlelo I-Studio ibala izinhlelo ezitholakala kule khompyutha ezingavula isigcawu: i-usdview uma isendleleni yakho yokusesha, nohlelo lwekhompyutha ngohlobo lwefayela. Khetha olunye, khetha i-USD noma i-glTF lapho olufunda kokubili, bese uchofoza Renda. I-Studio ibhala iphakheji efolda entsha ngaphansi kwe-Documents (CadCraft hand-off; akukho okubhalwa phezu, ukuthumela ngakunye kunefolda yakho) bese iqala uhlelo kuyo, ibe isitshela lapho amafayela akhona. Uhlelo Lufunda kangcono usdview USD Uhlelo lwekhompyutha Noma yini ikhompyutha enayo ngohlobo lwefayela I-Studio iqala izinhlelo ohlwini oluthile kuphela; ayiqhubezi lutho okucelwe ikhasi ngegama, futhi ayiqali uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL (bona Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo). Noma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda i-USD noma i-glTF luvula ifayela elisuka ku-Ifayela kunoma yiluphi uhlelo lapha ngenhla. I-Twinmotion, i-Enscape nezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa azikho ohlwini: i-CadCraft ayikahlolwa nazo futhi ayikhulumi ngazo. Ifayela le-glTF noma le-USD elivela lapha yindlela yokungena.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"animate","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Yenza i-animation yanoma iyiphi impahla, uyibumbe njengamajika, uxube amaklipu","summary":"Indawo yokusebenza ye-Animate igcina izikhiye endaweni, ukugoqa nobukhulu kwento, ukukhanya, ukusabalala nombala kwamalambu, ilensi kanye namakhiye wesimo e-mesh; ama-armature agoqa i-mesh ngamathambo nezisindo ezipendiwe; i-IK nemibandela yenza amathambo nezinto zifinyelele, zibheke, zikopishe, zihlale phakathi kwemikhawulo, zihlale ngemva kwezinye noma zilandele ezinye; amazimba aqinile ayawa, ayagcwala futhi ayashayisana, bese ayabhakwa abe izikhiye; abashayeli bamisa inani ngezinye izinto; ukubuka kwamajika kwethala lesikhathi kubumba ushintsho ngalunye ngezibambi ze-Bézier nokuphindaphinda, ukubuka kwamaklipu kulondoloza ama-animation njengezenzo oziphinda uzibeke futhi uzixube.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["ifiziksi","izimbiza eziqinile","umzimba oqinile","ukulingisa","ukuwa","ukudonsa","ukushayisana","ukugcwala","ukugxuma","ukubambezela","ukubhaka","i-ik","ukufinyelela","umbandela","imibandela","bheka","ukubheka","kopisha ukuguquka","kopisha indawo","kopisha ukugoqa","imikhawulo","ingane","umzali","landela indlela","indlela","ipole","i-fabrik","ketango","i-armature","ama-armature","irigi","ukwenza irigi","amathambo","ithambo","isikhumba","izisindo","ukupenda izisindo","amaqembu amaphoyinti","izisindo ezizenzakalelayo","i-bone heat","ipose","imodi yepose","i-dual quaternion","i-linear blend","amakhiye wesimo","ukhiye wesimo","morph","ama-morph","izinjongo ze-morph","ama-blendshape","ubuso","isimo sobuso","umshayeli","abashayeli","izincazelo","indawo yokusebenza ye-animate","animate","animation","ukhiye","izikhiye","impahla","izinto","ukuguqulwa","indawo","ukugoqa","usayizi","ilambu","ukukhanya","ukusabalala","umbala","ilensi","i-field of view","i-fov","umhleli wegrafu","amajika","ijika","bezier","izibambi","i-tangent","ukuxhumanisa","umjikelezo","imijikelezo","ukuphindaphinda","i-loop","ping pong","ukushintshwa","ishidi lezikhathi","khetha izikhiye","ukukhetha ibhokisi","kopisha izikhiye","namathisela izikhiye","elula izikhiye","scale keys","amaklipu","izenzo","i-nla","xuba","ukuxuba","ithonya","gcina"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuyivula","text":"Ukuyivula","level":2},{"id":"faka-ukhiye-empahleni","text":"Faka ukhiye empahleni","level":2},{"id":"amakhiye-wesimo-ama-morph","text":"Amakhiye wesimo (ama-morph)","level":2},{"id":"ama-armature-amathambo-agoqa-i-mesh","text":"Ama-armature: amathambo agoqa i-mesh","level":2},{"id":"i-ik-nemibandela","text":"I-IK nemibandela","level":2},{"id":"ifiziksi-ukuwa-ukugcwala-nokushayisana","text":"Ifiziksi: ukuwa, ukugcwala nokushayisana","level":2},{"id":"abashayeli","text":"Abashayeli","level":2},{"id":"khetha-futhi-ushintse-izikhiye-ukubuka-kwezikhiye","text":"Khetha futhi ushintse izikhiye (ukubuka kwezikhiye)","level":2},{"id":"bumba-amajika-ukubuka-kwamajika","text":"Bumba amajika (ukubuka kwamajika)","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-kabusha-ama-animation-ukubuka-kwamaklipu","text":"Sebenzisa kabusha ama-animation (ukubuka kwamaklipu)","level":2},{"id":"okudlalwa-kuphi","text":"Okudlalwa kuphi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthala lesikhathi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Elinyakazisa\u003C/a\u003E ikhamera namaqembu namakhompoment wonke. Indawo yokusebenza ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EAnimate\u003C/strong\u003E igcina izinto eziningi kakhulu kunalezo, nethala lesikhathi linemibono emibili eyengeziwe yokubumba nokusebenzisa kabusha okugciniwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuyivula\"\u003EUkuyivula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwendawo yokusebenza etulini lamathuluzi. Ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view, amathuluzi aphezulu abonisa amaqembu e-Animate (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETimeline\u003C/span\u003E) nephaneli ngakwesokudla ibhala okungakhiywa ku-playhead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-ukhiye-empahleni\"\u003EFaka ukhiye empahleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ibhala, ku-playhead:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn (°)\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E yayo, izinombolo ezintathu ngayinye. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ifakwa ukhiye ku-playhead futhi into iyafika khona. Idayimane eseceleni komugqa likhiya inani njengoba likunjalo manje; idayimane eligcwele liveza ukuthi sekukhona ukhiye ku-playhead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmalambu\u003C/strong\u003E: i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrightness (lm)\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpread (°)\u003C/span\u003E (amalambu okukhanyisa) kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColour\u003C/span\u003E yawo ngamunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhamera\u003C/strong\u003E: i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELens angle (°)\u003C/span\u003E, ukuze usondeze ngesikhathi ikhamera inyakazayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey transform\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ikhiya indawo, ukugoqa nosayizi wayo wonke iqembu noma ikhompoment ekhethiwe ngesikhathi sinye; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ikhiya ikhamera. Uma i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto key\u003C/span\u003E ivulekile, iqembu elikhiywe indawo, ukugoqa nosayizi walo ngale ndlela lithola ukhiye omusha uma uliyisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugoqa kuyizinkomba ezintathu, ngokuzungeza i-X, bese Y, bese Z. Ukugoqa okukhiywe ngaphezu kuka-180° kuqhubeka ngendlela efanayo (190° ihlala ingu-190°, hhayi −170°), ngakho ivili lingaphenduka izikhathi eziningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu elikhiywe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E ethalini lesikhathi linezikhiye zendawo yonke. Inkinobho yejika esemgqeni walo iyaziguqula zibe ngamajika endawo, ukugoqa nosayizi (indawo efanayo kukho konke ukhiye) ukuze uwabumbe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurves\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhiye-wesimo-ama-morph\"\u003EAmakhiye wesimo (ama-morph)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkhiye wesimo\u003C/strong\u003E wesinye isimo se-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E esifanayo: ubuso obumomotheka, ukuvuvuka komnyango, igqabi eligobile. Isilayida sawo sixuba kusuka ku-mesh njengoba ikanjalo (0) kuya kulesi simo (1); izikhiye eziningi ziyangezelelana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-mesh endaweni yokusebenza ye-Animate: iphaneli ibonisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShape keys\u003C/span\u003E yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd shape key\u003C/span\u003E. I-ModelCraft iya ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003Eindawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh\u003C/a\u003E nokhiye omusha uhleliwe: hambisa amaphoyinti, phuma, bumba. Guqula i-mesh ibe isimo ofuna sona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/span\u003E uchofoze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E. I-mesh ibuyela njengoba yayinjalo, bese ukhiye ugcina ushintsho lwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBese udonsa isilayida sokhiye (noma uthayiphe inani) ukuze uxube. Idayimane lifaka inani ku-playhead, ngakho ukhiye ungakhula futhi unyamalale ngokuhamba kwesikhathi; uma sekunomzila, inani elisha lifakwa ku-playhead. Ipensela ihlela kabusha isimo sukhiye (i-mesh iyasikhombisa ngokugcwele kuze kufike \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E ishiya ukhiye njengoba wayenjalo), iso livala ukhiye, igoqo liyisusa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphoyinti oliengeza ngesikhathi uhlela ukhiye ngelakho i-mesh uqobo: lihlala lapho olibeka khona, kuyo yonke imo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhiye wesimo ahambisa i-mesh ngaphambi kwezinguquli zayo: i-Subdivision modifier ibushelelezisa isimo esixubile. Izithombe namavidiyo aqoshwayo akhombisa amakhiye ngohlaka ngalunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-armature-amathambo-agoqa-i-mesh\"\u003EAma-armature: amathambo agoqa i-mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Earmature\u003C/strong\u003E iyisethi yamathambo angaphakathi kwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E. Yenza amathambo abe ngamapose, i-mesh iyawalandela, iphoyinti ngalinye njengoba \u003Cstrong\u003Eizisindo\u003C/strong\u003E zalo zisho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-mesh endaweni yokusebenza ye-Animate bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd an armature\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd bone\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERig\u003C/span\u003E): ithambo lokuqala lihamba phakathi kwe-mesh kusukela esisekelweni sayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgethambo elikhethiwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a child bone\u003C/span\u003E yengeza elilandelayo kusuka esiphethweni salo. Setha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHead\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETip\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoll (°)\u003C/span\u003E nokuthi ithambo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHangs from\u003C/span\u003E kuphi ephaneli; ithambo elixhunywe kwelinye linyakaza nalo. Susa ukukhetha kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves the mesh\u003C/span\u003E ethanjeni elisiqondisa ezinye kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic weights\u003C/span\u003E: ithambo ngalinye libamba amaphoyinti aseduze kalo, futhi ukubamba kusabalala kahle kuyo yonke i-mesh, ngakho amaphoyinti aphakathi kwamathambo amabili ayabelana ngakho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENearest bones only\u003C/span\u003E iyisihlukanisi esisheshayo nesiqinile kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYenza ipose\u003C/strong\u003E wamathambo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPose\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): chofoza ithambo ukuze ulikhethe, donsa ukuze uljikise ngokuzungeza i-axis yombono, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-donsa ukuze uliyisele. Noma uthayiphe i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn (°)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E yalo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPose\u003C/span\u003E; izinguquko zisemaeksini wethambo ngokwalo, kusukela lapho liphumula khona. Idayimane ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the whole pose\u003C/span\u003E zikhiya ipose ku-playhead; uma ithambo sele linezikhiye, ukulipozisa kulifaka khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this bone\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the pose\u003C/span\u003E zibuyisela amathambo ekuphumuleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPenda izisindo\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ethanjeni elikhethiwe: i-mesh iboniswa ekuphumuleni, uhlangothi ngalunye lubalwe ngokuthi leli thambo liyilibambe kangakanani: obomvu konke, obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka akukho. Penda ukwengeza ukubamba (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakususa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyabushelelezisa); i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize (px)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStrength\u003C/span\u003E zisetha ibhulashi. Ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep each point&#039;s weights adding up to 1\u003C/span\u003E, ukunika ithambo elilodwa okwengeziwe kuthatha okufanayo kwezinye. Ukushaya ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa kwemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkin\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha ukuthi iphoyinti phakathi kwamathambo linyakazela kanjani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (fast)\u003C/span\u003E ixuba ukunyakaza kwamathambo, futhi incinza kancane ilunga elijikile; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDual quaternion (keeps volume at joints)\u003C/span\u003E ijikisa iphoyinti ngokuzungeza ilunga, ngakho i-elbow noma idolo ligcina ukuthi likhuluma (ukuthi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E yethambo ayelula isikhumba).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhiye wesimo aqala, bese i-armature, bese izinguquli. Ukubuka, izithombe namavidiyo konke kukhombisa i-mesh enemo; izisindo zemesh zigcinwa nayo, namathambo nesimo sawo ngama-animation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-ik-nemibandela\"\u003EI-IK nemibandela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbandela\u003C/strong\u003E unyakazisa ithambo noma into ngemva kwezikhiye zayo, ngomthetho. Khetha into (noma, kwi-armature, ithambo) bese wengeza elilodwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConstraints of …\u003C/span\u003E; amaningi asebenza ngalolu hlelo olubhalwe phansi (imicibisholo iyalushintsha), futhi ngalinye linayo i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E (0 kuya ku-1, ifakwa ngedayimane layo njengoba kwenza noma yiliphi iphrophathi) nokhiye wokuvula/ukuvala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmbandela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENgokwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReach (IK)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathambo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthambo nalawo ahlala kulo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBones in the chain\u003C/span\u003E) agoba ukuze isiphetho salo sifinyelele ihloso. Ngamathambo amabili ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPole (the bend points to it)\u003C/span\u003E, i-elbow noma idolo libheka kuyo i-pole; amaketango amade agoba kahle. Uma kungafinyeleleki, ketango libheka ihloso ngqo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELook at\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKokubili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjikisa ukuze i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis that points\u003C/span\u003E ibheke ihloso, igcine i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis kept up\u003C/span\u003E iseduze kangangoba kungenzeka kuphezulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy transforms\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKokubili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthatha indawo, ukugoqa noma usayizi wehloso: okuboniswe ngamabhokisi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELimits\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKokubili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina indawo yayo, ukugoqa (ngamadigri) noma usayizi phakathi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emin\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emax\u003C/span\u003E ngayo yonke i-axis; shiya ipheya ingenalutho ukuze leyo axis ikhululeke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChild of\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKokubili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInyakazela nehloso njengoba ibhoxekile kuyo, kusukela lapho zombili zazikhona lapho ukhetha ihloso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow path\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlala ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Einto yejika\u003C/a\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the curve\u003C/span\u003E (0 isiqalo sayo, 1 isiphetho sayo; yikhiye ukuze ihambe), futhi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn along the curve\u003C/span\u003E ibheka ngasemgqeni wayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIhloso ingento enye evulekile eqenjini, ithambo le-armature efanayo, noma i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA point\u003C/span\u003E oyithayphayo (iphoyinti lento lisemigqeni yemodeli, elethambo lisemigqeni ye-mesh yalo). Ye-IK yomlenze, beka ihloso lapho unyawo kufanele khona bese ukhiya ihloso, noma khiya i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E ukuze unikeze umlenze phakathi kwezikhiye nale IK.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto ebheka eyodwa elandela indlela iyayibona endleleni: i-ModelCraft ibala amahloso kuqala, nganoma yiluphi uhlelo lwezinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifiziksi-ukuwa-ukugcwala-nokushayisana\"\u003EIfiziksi: ukuwa, ukugcwala nokushayisana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVumela izinto ziwele futhi zishayane, bese ugcina umphumela njengezikhiye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iqembu, ikhompoment noma i-mesh bese usetha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERigid body\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysics\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalls and collides\u003C/span\u003E (iyanyakaza) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStays put, gets in the way\u003C/span\u003E (itafula, udonga, indlela ehlamile). Nika into ewayo i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShape\u003C/span\u003E yayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBox (its bounds)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBall (round its bounds)\u003C/span\u003E, ubunzima bayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMass (kg)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFriction\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBounce\u003C/span\u003E (0 ayigxumi, 1 igxuma ibuyele phezulu njengoba kwakunjalo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe whole model\u003C/span\u003E, setha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom (s)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETo (s)\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGravity (m/s², down)\u003C/span\u003E nokuthi kukhona yini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA ground to land on\u003C/span\u003E (nokuphakama kwayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBake physics\u003C/span\u003E (ephaneli noma eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysics\u003C/span\u003E). Yonke into ewayo ithola ukhiye wendawo, wokugoqa nosayizi ohlakeni ngalunye phakathi kwezikhathi ezimbili; yidlale njengoba udlala noma iyiphi i-animation.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubhaka kabusha kushintsha lezo zikhiye; i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove baked keys\u003C/span\u003E iyazisusa. Izinto ziqala zikhuphumule, lapho izikhiye, amajika nemibandela zazibeka khona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom (s)\u003C/span\u003E (ukunyakaza okukhiywe ngaphambi kwalokho akuqhubeki ekuweni). Ukukhetha okuningi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteps a frame\u003C/span\u003E kugcina izitaki ezinde zizinzile; ibha yesimo itshela uma okuthile sekusahamba ekugcineni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimo ziyizibhokisi namabhola ezungeze imingcele yento ngayinye; ibhokisi lithinta ngamakona, ngamaphakathi emiphetho nangamaphakathi ezinhlangothi, ngakho amabhokisi ayagcwala futhi ayagxuma njengoba ulindele. Indwangu, uketshezi, izixhumanisi phakathi kwezinto nezimo ezinembile akukakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abashayeli\"\u003EAbashayeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmshayeli\u003C/strong\u003E usetha ukhiye wesimo ngezinye izinto esikhundleni sesandla: vula umshayeli wokhiye (inkinobho yekhalkhulethara), bhala i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eexpression\u003C/strong\u003E, bese unikeza igama ngalinye kuyo okufunda kulo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReads\u003C/span\u003E): isikhathi ngamasekhondi, ifreyimu, indawo, ukugoqa noma usayizi wento ngeX, Y noma Z, ukukhanya kwelambu, noma enye ikhiye yesimo. Isibonelo, ngo-\u003Ccode\u003Ev\u003C/code\u003E ofunda ukugoqa komnyango ozungeza Z, \u003Ccode\u003Eclamp(v / 90, 0, 1)\u003C/code\u003E ivula isimo njengoba umnyango uvuleka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-expression asebenzisa izinombolo, amagama, \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / % ^\u003C/code\u003E nemabhulaketi, nemisebenzi \u003Ccode\u003Esin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 abs sqrt exp log floor ceil round sign pow min max clamp lerp smoothstep rad deg\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E ne \u003Ccode\u003Ee\u003C/code\u003E. Iphutha liyakhonjiswa futhi alishintshi lutho. Isilayida sokhiye oshayelwayo sibonisa inani lomshayeli; umshayeli unqoba umugqa wokhiye uze umsuse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-futhi-ushintse-izikhiye-ukubuka-kwezikhiye\"\u003EKhetha futhi ushintse izikhiye (ukubuka kwezikhiye)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa umugqa ngamunye wendlela: ikhamera, iqembu ngalinye elinyakazayo, nendawo ngayinye (\\&quot;Lamp 2 · Brightness (lm)\\&quot;; izikhiye zempahla zizungezile).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukhiye ukuze uwukhethe; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-chofoza ukwengeza noma ukususa izikhiye kokukhethiwe. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-donsa phezu kwemigqa kudweba ibhokisi elengeza zonke izikhiye kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa ukhiye okhethiwe ukuze uhambise zonke; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zihambisa ifreyimu eyodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: eyishumi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikopisha izikhiye ezikhethiwe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwunamathisela ku-playhead ezindleleni ezifanayo (ithebhu enye ye-ModelCraft nayo ingawanamathisela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStretch\u003C/span\u003E isabalalisa izikhiye ezikhethiwe iphume ku-playhead ngenombolo eseduze kwayo (2 = kabili kude; 0.5 iyazihlanganisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwe-ease lusetha ukuthi zonke izikhiye ezikhethiwe zinyakaza kanjani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bumba-amajika-ukubuka-kwamajika\"\u003EBumba amajika (ukubuka kwamajika)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurves\u003C/span\u003E iyigrafu yenombolo ngayinye ngokuhamba kwesikhathi: isikhathi siya ecaleni, inani likhuphuka. Hlola amajika okuzowabonisa ohlwini olungakwesokunxele (X, Y noma Z zibomvu, eziluhlaza, eziluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukhiye (isikwele) ukuze uwukhethe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-chofoza ukuze ukhethe okwengeziwe, noma donsa ibhokisi. Donsa ukhiye okhethiwe ukuze ushintse isikhathi nenani lawo; uma kukhethiwe okuningi, ukudonsa kuwahambisa ngesikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkhiye okhethiwe ubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eizibambi\u003C/strong\u003E zawo ezimbili. Donsa enye ukuze ubumbe ijika ngalolo hlangothi. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHandles\u003C/span\u003E ichaza ukuthi ziziphatha kanjani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic\u003C/span\u003E (ijika elibushelelezile elidlula ezikhiyeni eziseduze), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPointing at the next key\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAligned\u003C/span\u003E (zombili zihlala emgqeni oqondile, ngakho ijika alinakhona ikhona) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFree\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the chosen keys\u003C/span\u003E ichaza ukuthi ukhiye ngamunye okhethiwe uhamba kanjani uya kolandelayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve (handles)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteady\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlow in and out\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBefore\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfter\u003C/span\u003E zichaza ukuthi ijika lenzani ngaphandle kwezikhiye zalo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E (ihlala ngenani lokuqala noma lokugcina), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack and forth\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat and carry on\u003C/span\u003E (ukuphindaphinda ngakunye kuqala lapho okwedlule kuphele khona: isondo liyaqhubeka liqhuba, umhambi uyaqhubeka ehamba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwili liyasondeza (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: amanani kuphela; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: isikhathi kuphela); donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukushelelisa; i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilungisa onke amajika abonisiwe. Chofoza endaweni engenalutho ukuhambisa i-playhead khona. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa izikhiye ezikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzibambi zigcinwa zingadluli kwezinye ngesikhathi, ngakho ijika alihambi emuva ngesikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-kabusha-ama-animation-ukubuka-kwamaklipu\"\u003ESebenzisa kabusha ama-animation (ukubuka kwamaklipu)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIklipu\u003C/strong\u003E lidlala i-animation egciniwe (\u003Cstrong\u003Eisenzo\u003C/strong\u003E) ethalini lesikhathi. Amaklipu axutshwa ngolandelano, imigqa esezansi ingaphezu kwemigqa esezulwini; amathrekhi ethala lesikhathi uqobo aphezu kwawo wonke amaklipu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhiya amaqembu namalambu njengoba ujwayelekile, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a clip\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClips\u003C/span\u003E unikeze isenzo igama. Amathrekhi aba yisenzo, iklipu liyidlale lapho ayekhona (ikhamera ihlala ethalini lesikhathi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uyisebenzise futhi, khetha isenzo bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd clip\u003C/span\u003E: iklipu elisha liqala ku-playhead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iklipu ngomugqa walo ukuze uliyisele; chofoza ukuze usethe i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart (s)\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E (2 = kabili ngokushesha), i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeats\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E (0 kuya ku-1), i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMix\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReplace\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd on top\u003C/span\u003E kwamaklipu angaphambili), i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutside the clip\u003C/span\u003E (akukho, bamba isiphetho sawo, noma bamba zombili iziphetho) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMute\u003C/span\u003E. Imicibisholo ishintsha ulandelano; igoqo liyisusa (nesenzo esingasasetshenziswa yiklipu siyasuswa nalo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIklipu elingaphansi kokugcwele kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E lixubana nalokho okungaphansi kwalo: iklipu elingaphambili, noma ilambu noma indawo njengoba ikanjalo ngaphandle kwe-animation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudlalwa-kuphi\"\u003EOkudlalwa kuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEbukweni\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEvidiyweni eqoshiwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhiye zekhamera, i-lens angle nezikhiye zekhamera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo, ukugoqa nosayizi (izikhiye, amajika, amaklipu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya, ukusabalala nombala kwamalambu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakwenzeki: ividiyo isebenzisa amalambu njengoba enjalo lapho iqala (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003Eokungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-lens angle ngaphandle kwezikhiye zekhamera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakwenzeki: khiya nekhamera\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhiye wesimo nabashayeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-armature (ama-mesh anamapose)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-IK nemibandela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfiziksi ebhakiwe (izikhiye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kugcinwa ku-fayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E kanye nakho konke okunye kwe-animation, futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E yethala lesikhathi ibuyisela noma yiziphi zalezo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ithala lesikhathi linyakazisa ikhamera namaqembu namakhompoment wonke. Indawo yokusebenza ye-Animate igcina izinto eziningi kakhulu kunalezo, nethala lesikhathi linemibono emibili eyengeziwe yokubumba nokusebenzisa kabusha okugciniwe. Ukuyivula Khetha Animate ohlwini lwendawo yokusebenza etulini lamathuluzi. Ithala lesikhathi livula ngaphansi kwe-view, amathuluzi aphezulu abonisa amaqembu e-Animate (Keys, Play, Timeline) nephaneli ngakwesokudla ibhala okungakhiywa ku-playhead. Faka ukhiye empahleni Iphaneli ibhala, ku-playhead: Into ekhethiwe: Place, Turn (°) kanye Size yayo, izinombolo ezintathu ngayinye. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela Enter: ifakwa ukhiye ku-playhead futhi into iyafika khona. Idayimane eseceleni komugqa likhiya inani njengoba likunjalo manje; idayimane eligcwele liveza ukuthi sekukhona ukhiye ku-playhead. Amalambu: i-Brightness (lm), i-Spread (°) (amalambu okukhanyisa) kanye Colour yawo ngamunye. Ikhamera: i-Lens angle (°), ukuze usondeze ngesikhathi ikhamera inyakazayo. Key transform (noma I) ikhiya indawo, ukugoqa nosayizi wayo wonke iqembu noma ikhompoment ekhethiwe ngesikhathi sinye; Key camera (noma K) ikhiya ikhamera. Uma i-Auto key ivulekile, iqembu elikhiywe indawo, ukugoqa nosayizi walo ngale ndlela lithola ukhiye omusha uma uliyisa. Ukugoqa kuyizinkomba ezintathu, ngokuzungeza i-X, bese Y, bese Z. Ukugoqa okukhiywe ngaphezu kuka-180° kuqhubeka ngendlela efanayo (190° ihlala ingu-190°, hhayi −170°), ngakho ivili lingaphenduka izikhathi eziningi. Iqembu elikhiywe nge-Key selected ethalini lesikhathi linezikhiye zendawo yonke. Inkinobho yejika esemgqeni walo iyaziguqula zibe ngamajika endawo, ukugoqa nosayizi (indawo efanayo kukho konke ukhiye) ukuze uwabumbe ku-Curves. Amakhiye wesimo (ama-morph) Ukhiye wesimo wesinye isimo se-mesh esifanayo: ubuso obumomotheka, ukuvuvuka komnyango, igqabi eligobile. Isilayida sawo sixuba kusuka ku-mesh njengoba ikanjalo (0) kuya kulesi simo (1); izikhiye eziningi ziyangezelelana. Khetha i-mesh endaweni yokusebenza ye-Animate: iphaneli ibonisa i-Shape keys yayo. Chofoza Add shape key. I-ModelCraft iya ku-indawo yokusebenza ye-Mesh nokhiye omusha uhleliwe: hambisa amaphoyinti, phuma, bumba. Guqula i-mesh ibe isimo ofuna sona. Buyela ku-Animate uchofoze Done. I-mesh ibuyela njengoba yayinjalo, bese ukhiye ugcina ushintsho lwakho. Bese udonsa isilayida sokhiye (noma uthayiphe inani) ukuze uxube. Idayimane lifaka inani ku-playhead, ngakho ukhiye ungakhula futhi unyamalale ngokuhamba kwesikhathi; uma sekunomzila, inani elisha lifakwa ku-playhead. Ipensela ihlela kabusha isimo sukhiye (i-mesh iyasikhombisa ngokugcwele kuze kufike Done; Cancel ishiya ukhiye njengoba wayenjalo), iso livala ukhiye, igoqo liyisusa. Iphoyinti oliengeza ngesikhathi uhlela ukhiye ngelakho i-mesh uqobo: lihlala lapho olibeka khona, kuyo yonke imo. Amakhiye wesimo ahambisa i-mesh ngaphambi kwezinguquli zayo: i-Subdivision modifier ibushelelezisa isimo esixubile. Izithombe namavidiyo aqoshwayo akhombisa amakhiye ngohlaka ngalunye. Ama-armature: amathambo agoqa i-mesh I-armature iyisethi yamathambo angaphakathi kwe-mesh. Yenza amathambo abe ngamapose, i-mesh iyawalandela, iphoyinti ngalinye njengoba izisindo zalo zisho. Khetha i-mesh endaweni yokusebenza ye-Animate bese uchofoza Add an armature ephaneli (noma Add bone eqenjini le-Rig): ithambo lokuqala lihamba phakathi kwe-mesh kusukela esisekelweni sayo. Ngethambo elikhethiwe, Add a child bone yengeza elilandelayo kusuka esiphethweni salo. Setha i-Head, i-Tip, i-Roll (°) nokuthi ithambo Hangs from kuphi ephaneli; ithambo elixhunywe kwelinye linyakaza nalo. Susa ukukhetha kwe-Moves the mesh ethanjeni elisiqondisa ezinye kuphela. Chofoza Automatic weights: ithambo ngalinye libamba amaphoyinti aseduze kalo, futhi ukubamba kusabalala kahle kuyo yonke i-mesh, ngakho amaphoyinti aphakathi kwamathambo amabili ayabelana ngakho. Nearest bones only iyisihlukanisi esisheshayo nesiqinile kakhulu. Yenza ipose wamathambo nge-Pose (P): chofoza ithambo ukuze ulikhethe, donsa ukuze uljikise ngokuzungeza i-axis yombono, Shift-donsa ukuze uliyisele. Noma uthayiphe i-Place, i-Turn (°) ne-Size yalo ngaphansi kwe-Pose; izinguquko zisemaeksini wethambo ngokwalo, kusukela lapho liphumula khona. Idayimane ne-Key the whole pose zikhiya ipose ku-playhead; uma ithambo sele linezikhiye, ukulipozisa kulifaka khona. Reset this bone ne-Reset the pose zibuyisela amathambo ekuphumuleni. Penda izisindo (W) ethanjeni elikhethiwe: i-mesh iboniswa ekuphumuleni, uhlangothi ngalunye lubalwe ngokuthi leli thambo liyilibambe kangakanani: obomvu konke, obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka akukho. Penda ukwengeza ukubamba (Ctrl iyakususa, Shift iyabushelelezisa); i-Size (px) ne-Strength zisetha ibhulashi. Ngo-Keep each point's weights adding up to 1, ukunika ithambo elilodwa okwengeziwe kuthatha okufanayo kwezinye. Ukushaya ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa kwemodeli. Skin ikhetha ukuthi iphoyinti phakathi kwamathambo linyakazela kanjani: Linear (fast) ixuba ukunyakaza kwamathambo, futhi incinza kancane ilunga elijikile; Dual quaternion (keeps volume at joints) ijikisa iphoyinti ngokuzungeza ilunga, ngakho i-elbow noma idolo ligcina ukuthi likhuluma (ukuthi i-Size yethambo ayelula isikhumba). Amakhiye wesimo aqala, bese i-armature, bese izinguquli. Ukubuka, izithombe namavidiyo konke kukhombisa i-mesh enemo; izisindo zemesh zigcinwa nayo, namathambo nesimo sawo ngama-animation. I-IK nemibandela Umbandela unyakazisa ithambo noma into ngemva kwezikhiye zayo, ngomthetho. Khetha into (noma, kwi-armature, ithambo) bese wengeza elilodwa ngaphansi kwe-Constraints of …; amaningi asebenza ngalolu hlelo olubhalwe phansi (imicibisholo iyalushintsha), futhi ngalinye linayo i-How much (0 kuya ku-1, ifakwa ngedayimane layo njengoba kwenza noma yiliphi iphrophathi) nokhiye wokuvula/ukuvala. Umbandela Ngokwe Okwenzayo Reach (IK) Amathambo Ithambo nalawo ahlala kulo (Bones in the chain) agoba ukuze isiphetho salo sifinyelele ihloso. Ngamathambo amabili ne-Pole (the bend points to it), i-elbow noma idolo libheka kuyo i-pole; amaketango amade agoba kahle. Uma kungafinyeleleki, ketango libheka ihloso ngqo. Look at Kokubili Ijikisa ukuze i-Axis that points ibheke ihloso, igcine i-Axis kept up iseduze kangangoba kungenzeka kuphezulu. Copy transforms Kokubili Ithatha indawo, ukugoqa noma usayizi wehloso: okuboniswe ngamabhokisi. Limits Kokubili Igcina indawo yayo, ukugoqa (ngamadigri) noma usayizi phakathi kwe-min ne-max ngayo yonke i-axis; shiya ipheya ingenalutho ukuze leyo axis ikhululeke. Child of Kokubili Inyakazela nehloso njengoba ibhoxekile kuyo, kusukela lapho zombili zazikhona lapho ukhetha ihloso. Follow path Izinto Ihlala ku-into yejika ku-Along the curve (0 isiqalo sayo, 1 isiphetho sayo; yikhiye ukuze ihambe), futhi nge-Turn along the curve ibheka ngasemgqeni wayo. Ihloso ingento enye evulekile eqenjini, ithambo le-armature efanayo, noma i-A point oyithayphayo (iphoyinti lento lisemigqeni yemodeli, elethambo lisemigqeni ye-mesh yalo). Ye-IK yomlenze, beka ihloso lapho unyawo kufanele khona bese ukhiya ihloso, noma khiya i-How much ukuze unikeze umlenze phakathi kwezikhiye nale IK. Into ebheka eyodwa elandela indlela iyayibona endleleni: i-ModelCraft ibala amahloso kuqala, nganoma yiluphi uhlelo lwezinto. Ifiziksi: ukuwa, ukugcwala nokushayisana Vumela izinto ziwele futhi zishayane, bese ugcina umphumela njengezikhiye. Khetha iqembu, ikhompoment noma i-mesh bese usetha i-Rigid body ngaphansi kwe-Physics: Falls and collides (iyanyakaza) noma Stays put, gets in the way (itafula, udonga, indlela ehlamile). Nika into ewayo i-Shape yayo: Box (its bounds) noma Ball (round its bounds), ubunzima bayo Mass (kg), Friction kanye Bounce (0 ayigxumi, 1 igxuma ibuyele phezulu njengoba kwakunjalo). Ngaphansi kwe-The whole model, setha i-From (s) ne-To (s), i-Gravity (m/s², down) nokuthi kukhona yini A ground to land on (nokuphakama kwayo). Chofoza Bake physics (ephaneli noma eqenjini le-Physics). Yonke into ewayo ithola ukhiye wendawo, wokugoqa nosayizi ohlakeni ngalunye phakathi kwezikhathi ezimbili; yidlale njengoba udlala noma iyiphi i-animation. Ukubhaka kabusha kushintsha lezo zikhiye; i-Remove baked keys iyazisusa. Izinto ziqala zikhuphumule, lapho izikhiye, amajika nemibandela zazibeka khona ku-From (s) (ukunyakaza okukhiywe ngaphambi kwalokho akuqhubeki ekuweni). Ukukhetha okuningi kwe-Steps a frame kugcina izitaki ezinde zizinzile; ibha yesimo itshela uma okuthile sekusahamba ekugcineni. Izimo ziyizibhokisi namabhola ezungeze imingcele yento ngayinye; ibhokisi lithinta ngamakona, ngamaphakathi emiphetho nangamaphakathi ezinhlangothi, ngakho amabhokisi ayagcwala futhi ayagxuma njengoba ulindele. Indwangu, uketshezi, izixhumanisi phakathi kwezinto nezimo ezinembile akukakhiwa. Abashayeli Umshayeli usetha ukhiye wesimo ngezinye izinto esikhundleni sesandla: vula umshayeli wokhiye (inkinobho yekhalkhulethara), bhala i-expression, bese unikeza igama ngalinye kuyo okufunda kulo (Reads): isikhathi ngamasekhondi, ifreyimu, indawo, ukugoqa noma usayizi wento ngeX, Y noma Z, ukukhanya kwelambu, noma enye ikhiye yesimo. Isibonelo, ngo-v ofunda ukugoqa komnyango ozungeza Z, clamp(v / 90, 0, 1) ivula isimo njengoba umnyango uvuleka. Ama-expression asebenzisa izinombolo, amagama, + - * / % ^ nemabhulaketi, nemisebenzi sin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 abs sqrt exp log floor ceil round sign pow min max clamp lerp smoothstep rad deg kanye pi ne e. Iphutha liyakhonjiswa futhi alishintshi lutho. Isilayida sokhiye oshayelwayo sibonisa inani lomshayeli; umshayeli unqoba umugqa wokhiye uze umsuse. Khetha futhi ushintse izikhiye (ukubuka kwezikhiye) Keys ibonisa umugqa ngamunye wendlela: ikhamera, iqembu ngalinye elinyakazayo, nendawo ngayinye (\\\"Lamp 2 · Brightness (lm)\\\"; izikhiye zempahla zizungezile). Chofoza ukhiye ukuze uwukhethe; Shift-chofoza noma Ctrl-chofoza ukwengeza noma ukususa izikhiye kokukhethiwe. Shift-donsa phezu kwemigqa kudweba ibhokisi elengeza zonke izikhiye kuyo. Donsa ukhiye okhethiwe ukuze uhambise zonke; ← / → zihambisa ifreyimu eyodwa (Shift: eyishumi). Ctrl+C ikopisha izikhiye ezikhethiwe, Ctrl+V iwunamathisela ku-playhead ezindleleni ezifanayo (ithebhu enye ye-ModelCraft nayo ingawanamathisela). I-Stretch isabalalisa izikhiye ezikhethiwe iphume ku-playhead ngenombolo eseduze kwayo (2 = kabili kude; 0.5 iyazihlanganisa). Uhlu lwe-ease lusetha ukuthi zonke izikhiye ezikhethiwe zinyakaza kanjani. Bumba amajika (ukubuka kwamajika) Curves iyigrafu yenombolo ngayinye ngokuhamba kwesikhathi: isikhathi siya ecaleni, inani likhuphuka. Hlola amajika okuzowabonisa ohlwini olungakwesokunxele (X, Y noma Z zibomvu, eziluhlaza, eziluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka). Chofoza ukhiye (isikwele) ukuze uwukhethe, Shift-chofoza ukuze ukhethe okwengeziwe, noma donsa ibhokisi. Donsa ukhiye okhethiwe ukuze ushintse isikhathi nenani lawo; uma kukhethiwe okuningi, ukudonsa kuwahambisa ngesikhathi. Ukhiye okhethiwe ubonisa izibambi zawo ezimbili. Donsa enye ukuze ubumbe ijika ngalolo hlangothi. I-Handles ichaza ukuthi ziziphatha kanjani: Automatic (ijika elibushelelezile elidlula ezikhiyeni eziseduze), Pointing at the next key, Aligned (zombili zihlala emgqeni oqondile, ngakho ijika alinakhona ikhona) noma Free. I-From the chosen keys ichaza ukuthi ukhiye ngamunye okhethiwe uhamba kanjani uya kolandelayo: Curve (handles), Smooth, Steady, Slow in and out noma Hold. Before ne-After zichaza ukuthi ijika lenzani ngaphandle kwezikhiye zalo: Hold (ihlala ngenani lokuqala noma lokugcina), Repeat, Back and forth, noma Repeat and carry on (ukuphindaphinda ngakunye kuqala lapho okwedlule kuphele khona: isondo liyaqhubeka liqhuba, umhambi uyaqhubeka ehamba). Iwili liyasondeza (Ctrl: amanani kuphela; Shift: isikhathi kuphela); donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma nge-Alt ukushelelisa; i-Show all noma Home ilungisa onke amajika abonisiwe. Chofoza endaweni engenalutho ukuhambisa i-playhead khona. Delete isusa izikhiye ezikhethiwe. Izibambi zigcinwa zingadluli kwezinye ngesikhathi, ngakho ijika alihambi emuva ngesikhathi. Sebenzisa kabusha ama-animation (ukubuka kwamaklipu) Iklipu lidlala i-animation egciniwe (isenzo) ethalini lesikhathi. Amaklipu axutshwa ngolandelano, imigqa esezansi ingaphezu kwemigqa esezulwini; amathrekhi ethala lesikhathi uqobo aphezu kwawo wonke amaklipu. Khiya amaqembu namalambu njengoba ujwayelekile, bese uchofoza Make a clip ku-Clips unikeze isenzo igama. Amathrekhi aba yisenzo, iklipu liyidlale lapho ayekhona (ikhamera ihlala ethalini lesikhathi). Ukuze uyisebenzise futhi, khetha isenzo bese uchofoza Add clip: iklipu elisha liqala ku-playhead. Donsa iklipu ngomugqa walo ukuze uliyisele; chofoza ukuze usethe i-Start (s), i-Speed (2 = kabili ngokushesha), i-Repeats, i-How much (0 kuya ku-1), i-Mix (Replace, noma Add on top kwamaklipu angaphambili), i-Outside the clip (akukho, bamba isiphetho sawo, noma bamba zombili iziphetho) kanye ne-Mute. Imicibisholo ishintsha ulandelano; igoqo liyisusa (nesenzo esingasasetshenziswa yiklipu siyasuswa nalo). Iklipu elingaphansi kokugcwele kwe-How much lixubana nalokho okungaphansi kwalo: iklipu elingaphambili, noma ilambu noma indawo njengoba ikanjalo ngaphandle kwe-animation. Okudlalwa kuphi Yini Ebukweni Evidiyweni eqoshiwe Izikhiye zekhamera, i-lens angle nezikhiye zekhamera Yebo Yebo Indawo, ukugoqa nosayizi (izikhiye, amajika, amaklipu) Yebo Yebo Ukukhanya, ukusabalala nombala kwamalambu Yebo Akukakwenzeki: ividiyo isebenzisa amalambu njengoba enjalo lapho iqala (bheka okungakakwakhiwa) I-lens angle ngaphandle kwezikhiye zekhamera Yebo Akukakwenzeki: khiya nekhamera Amakhiye wesimo nabashayeli Yebo Yebo Ama-armature (ama-mesh anamapose) Yebo Yebo I-IK nemibandela Yebo Yebo Ifiziksi ebhakiwe (izikhiye) Yebo Yebo Konke kugcinwa ku-fayela le-.modelcraft kanye nakho konke okunye kwe-animation, futhi i-Undo ne-Redo yethala lesikhathi ibuyisela noma yiziphi zalezo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"vr-review","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Hlola imodeli ku-VR headset","summary":"Hamba imodeli ngosayizi ophelele ku-VR headset: gxuma, phendukela, linganisa, vula ngokusika, faka izinkinga ngesithombe, bona njengemodeli yetafula, bese uhlangana nabanye besikhathi esiphilayo.","section":"tasks","order":116,"keywords":["vr","virtual reality","i-headset","webxr","xr","okuzwisisayo","quest","oculus","vive","index","pico","hamba ngaphakathi","walkthrough","teleport","ukubuyekeza kwedizayini","buyekeza","linganisa","isigaba","sika","inkinga","izinkinga","bcf","table top","imodeli yesikali","ukuba khona","ama-avatar","ukuphila","ndawonye"],"headings":[{"id":"okudingekayo","text":"Okudingekayo","level":2},{"id":"qala","text":"Qala","level":2},{"id":"kubukeka-kanjani","text":"Kubukeka kanjani","level":2},{"id":"hamba","text":"Hamba","level":2},{"id":"linganisa","text":"Linganisa","level":2},{"id":"vula-ngokusika","text":"Vula ngokusika","level":2},{"id":"faka-inkinga","text":"Faka inkinga","level":2},{"id":"bona-njengemodeli-yetafula","text":"Bona njengemodeli yetafula","level":2},{"id":"nabanye-besikhathi-esiphilayo","text":"Nabanye, besikhathi esiphilayo","level":2},{"id":"phuma","text":"Phuma","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ku-VR\u003C/span\u003E ikubeka ngaphakathi kwemodeli nge-VR headset, ngosayizi ophelele. Umi lapho kukhona ikhamera yombono, phansi kwayo, ubheke ngendlela efanayo. Akukho okuthunyelwayo: i-headset ibonisa lokho isiphequluli salo siboniselayo kulo khompyutha (noma kwisiphequluli se-headset yalo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingekayo\"\u003EOkudingekayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-headset isiphequluli singayilawula (WebXR): i-headset emi yodwa nesiphequluli sayo, noma i-Chrome noma i-Edge kukhompyutha enokuxhunywa kwe-headset.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-ModelCraft ivulwe ekhasini eliphephile (https), njengoba kunjalo kule site.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungekho i-headset, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ku-VR\u003C/span\u003E iyagreyiwe futhi ichaza isizathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala\"\u003EQala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha ukubuka lapho ofuna ukuqala khona: ekamelweni, noma ngaphandle ubheka isakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ku-VR\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGqoka i-headset.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu isemuva lesandla sakho sokunxele. Yibheke ngesilawuli sakho sokudla bese udonsa i-trigger ukuze ukhethe inkinobho. (Ngesandla esisodwa kuphela, imenyu ibhoyana phambi kwendawo owaqala kuyo.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kubukeka-kanjani\"\u003EKubukeka kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-headset ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yokubuka okuphilayo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Eukubuka okuphilayo\u003C/a\u003E): izinto nezinkomba ozinikeze izinhlangothi, isibhakabhaka nelanga kusuka endaweni nosuku lwemodeli yakho nezithunzi zayo, izibani, izitshalo nezitshalo ezisakazekile namatshe, nokukhanya okubuyela emadongeni nasephansi (kuhlolwa kule khompyutha ngenkathi ubheka, futhi kulandela uma uhamba). Ukukhanya kanye nokuguqulwa kombono (ACES noma AgX) kungakwa-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E. Okudwetshwayo kuncike kokusesiphequluli se-headset, njengakudeskithophu; ukuvinjelwa kokukhanya okuzungezile (ambient occlusion), izibonakaliso nokuvuthwa kuhlala kudeskithophu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba\"\u003EHamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGxuma:\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, khomba phansi bese udonsa i-trigger; uyafika lapho. Noma sunduza induku phambili ukuze uqondise, bese uyikhulula ukuze ugxume. Ungafika kuphela ezindaweni nasemhlabathini (izindawo ezibheke phezulu), hhayi odongeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendukela:\u003C/strong\u003E sunduza induku ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla: uyaphendukela ngama-30° ngesikhathi ngasinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHamba:\u003C/strong\u003E endaweni yakho yokudlala, hamba nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, bese udonsa i-trigger kumaphuzu amabili. Ibanga libonakala phakathi kwawo, ngamayunithi emodeli. Iphoyinti eliseduze nekhona libamba ekhoneni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ngokusika\"\u003EVula ngokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E bese udonsa i-trigger ebusweni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eodongeni (noma nokuthile okungebona umhlabathi): konke okusemaphakathi kwakho nalobo bubuso kuyasikwa, ukuze ubone ngaphakathi. Lokhu kusebenza kangcono ngaphandle, noma ngaphesheya kwegumbi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ephansi, uma ubheka phansi: ipulani esikwe ngama-1.2 m ngaphezu kwalowo mhlabathi, ukuze izindonga zibonise ingxenye yazo ephansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E ususa ukusika nokulinganisa. Uma indiza yesigaba isika imodeli ekubukeni lapho uqala, i-headset iqala nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-inkinga\"\u003EFaka inkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInkinga\u003C/span\u003E bese udonsa i-trigger lapho kukhona inkinga. Iphinikhodi enenombolo iyayimaka, futhi i-ModelCraft igcina inkinga ngesithombe sakho sokuthi ubone nokuthi wamiswa kuphi. Uma uphuma ku-VR, izinkinga zisohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einkinobho yeso ibonisa inkinga kusukela lapho yafakwa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-BCF\u003C/span\u003E idawunilodela zonke njengefayela le-BCF, eliviwa izinhlelo zokubuyekeza i-BIM (ikhamera nesithombe zifakiwe);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ezigcinwa nakufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEngeza ikhomenti enkingeni ngemva kokuphuma ku-VR, ohlelweni lwe-BCF: ukubhala ku-headset akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-njengemodeli-yetafula\"\u003EBona njengemodeli yetafula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezu kwetafula\u003C/span\u003E inciphisa imodeli ukuze ilingane netafula phambi kwakho; hamba uyizungeze, noma uyiphendule ngenduku. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi ophelele\u003C/span\u003E ikubuyisela lapho wawukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nabanye-besikhathi-esiphilayo\"\u003ENabanye, besikhathi esiphilayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/work-live\"\u003Eisession ephilayo\u003C/a\u003E, wonke umuntu ku-VR ubona abanye njengekhanda nezandla ezimbili ngombala wabo, negama labo, nedothi lapho ngamunye ebheka khona. Ukuhlela okwenziwa noma ubani kufika ku-headset yakho ngemizuzwana. Abantu edeskini abakabonakali ku-headset okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phuma\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma ku-VR\u003C/span\u003E (noma susa i-headset uyiqede lapho). Ukubuka okusesikrinini kuhamba lapho ikhanda lakho lalikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIhlolwe nge-emulator ye-headset kuphela, akukahlolwa nge-headset yangempela. Imodeli enkulu ingenza i-headset ibe nokugwegwesha: fihla okungakudingekile kuqala (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003Efihla nehlukanise\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Hlola ku-VR ikubeka ngaphakathi kwemodeli nge-VR headset, ngosayizi ophelele. Umi lapho kukhona ikhamera yombono, phansi kwayo, ubheke ngendlela efanayo. Akukho okuthunyelwayo: i-headset ibonisa lokho isiphequluli salo siboniselayo kulo khompyutha (noma kwisiphequluli se-headset yalo). Okudingekayo I-headset isiphequluli singayilawula (WebXR): i-headset emi yodwa nesiphequluli sayo, noma i-Chrome noma i-Edge kukhompyutha enokuxhunywa kwe-headset. I-ModelCraft ivulwe ekhasini eliphephile (https), njengoba kunjalo kule site. Uma kungekho i-headset, i-Hlola ku-VR iyagreyiwe futhi ichaza isizathu. Qala Setha ukubuka lapho ofuna ukuqala khona: ekamelweni, noma ngaphandle ubheka isakhiwo. Chofoza Ukubuka eqenjini le-Ikhamera, bese Hlola ku-VR. Gqoka i-headset. Imenyu isemuva lesandla sakho sokunxele. Yibheke ngesilawuli sakho sokudla bese udonsa i-trigger ukuze ukhethe inkinobho. (Ngesandla esisodwa kuphela, imenyu ibhoyana phambi kwendawo owaqala kuyo.) Kubukeka kanjani I-headset ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yokubuka okuphilayo (ukubuka okuphilayo): izinto nezinkomba ozinikeze izinhlangothi, isibhakabhaka nelanga kusuka endaweni nosuku lwemodeli yakho nezithunzi zayo, izibani, izitshalo nezitshalo ezisakazekile namatshe, nokukhanya okubuyela emadongeni nasephansi (kuhlolwa kule khompyutha ngenkathi ubheka, futhi kulandela uma uhamba). Ukukhanya kanye nokuguqulwa kombono (ACES noma AgX) kungakwa-Renda isithombe. Okudwetshwayo kuncike kokusesiphequluli se-headset, njengakudeskithophu; ukuvinjelwa kokukhanya okuzungezile (ambient occlusion), izibonakaliso nokuvuthwa kuhlala kudeskithophu. Hamba Gxuma: ku-Hambisa, khomba phansi bese udonsa i-trigger; uyafika lapho. Noma sunduza induku phambili ukuze uqondise, bese uyikhulula ukuze ugxume. Ungafika kuphela ezindaweni nasemhlabathini (izindawo ezibheke phezulu), hhayi odongeni. Phendukela: sunduza induku ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla: uyaphendukela ngama-30° ngesikhathi ngasinye. Hamba: endaweni yakho yokudlala, hamba nje. Linganisa Khetha Linganisa, bese udonsa i-trigger kumaphuzu amabili. Ibanga libonakala phakathi kwawo, ngamayunithi emodeli. Iphoyinti eliseduze nekhona libamba ekhoneni. Vula ngokusika Khetha Isigaba bese udonsa i-trigger ebusweni: odongeni (noma nokuthile okungebona umhlabathi): konke okusemaphakathi kwakho nalobo bubuso kuyasikwa, ukuze ubone ngaphakathi. Lokhu kusebenza kangcono ngaphandle, noma ngaphesheya kwegumbi; phansi, uma ubheka phansi: ipulani esikwe ngama-1.2 m ngaphezu kwalowo mhlabathi, ukuze izindonga zibonise ingxenye yazo ephansi. Sula ususa ukusika nokulinganisa. Uma indiza yesigaba isika imodeli ekubukeni lapho uqala, i-headset iqala nayo. Faka inkinga Khetha Inkinga bese udonsa i-trigger lapho kukhona inkinga. Iphinikhodi enenombolo iyayimaka, futhi i-ModelCraft igcina inkinga ngesithombe sakho sokuthi ubone nokuthi wamiswa kuphi. Uma uphuma ku-VR, izinkinga zisohlwini Izinkinga ngakwesokudla: inkinobho yeso ibonisa inkinga kusukela lapho yafakwa; Londoloza njenge-BCF idawunilodela zonke njengefayela le-BCF, eliviwa izinhlelo zokubuyekeza i-BIM (ikhamera nesithombe zifakiwe); zigcinwa nakufayela le-.modelcraft nazo. Engeza ikhomenti enkingeni ngemva kokuphuma ku-VR, ohlelweni lwe-BCF: ukubhala ku-headset akukakwakhiwa. Bona njengemodeli yetafula Phezu kwetafula inciphisa imodeli ukuze ilingane netafula phambi kwakho; hamba uyizungeze, noma uyiphendule ngenduku. Usayizi ophelele ikubuyisela lapho wawukhona khona. Nabanye, besikhathi esiphilayo Ku-isession ephilayo, wonke umuntu ku-VR ubona abanye njengekhanda nezandla ezimbili ngombala wabo, negama labo, nedothi lapho ngamunye ebheka khona. Ukuhlela okwenziwa noma ubani kufika ku-headset yakho ngemizuzwana. Abantu edeskini abakabonakali ku-headset okwamanje. Phuma Khetha Phuma ku-VR (noma susa i-headset uyiqede lapho). Ukubuka okusesikrinini kuhamba lapho ikhanda lakho lalikhona. Ihlolwe nge-emulator ye-headset kuphela, akukahlolwa nge-headset yangempela. Imodeli enkulu ingenza i-headset ibe nokugwegwesha: fihla okungakudingekile kuqala (fihla nehlukanise).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-unreal","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thumela imbonini kwinjini yegemu","summary":"Studio ingabhala imbonini ibe yiphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine futhi iyigcine ihambisana ngakunye lapho uthumela; izinguquko zakho zihlala kungqimba olungabhalwa yi-CadCraft. I-plug-in eyivula ayikakhishwa.","section":"tasks","order":116,"keywords":["unreal","unreal engine","injini yegemu","ixhumanisi","thumela","usd stage","iphrojekthi","live","cine camera","uhlu lokurenda movie"],"headings":[{"id":"thumela-imbonini","text":"Thumela imbonini","level":2},{"id":"izinguquko-zakho-ziphephile","text":"Izinguquko zakho ziphephile","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kwe-studio","text":"Ngaphandle kwe-Studio","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio uhlu lwe-Engine lungabamba \u003Cstrong\u003Eixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E eliya kwiphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine. Indlela eyodwa kuphela: kusuka ku-CadCraft kuya ku-Unreal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-imbonini\"\u003EThumela imbonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkomba ye-Unreal ohlwini lwe-Engine. Okokuqala, i-Studio iyacela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda yephrojekthi yakho (leyo enefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.uproject\u003C/code\u003E); iyayikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E. I-Studio ibhala i-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft/&lt;file name&gt;/\u003C/code\u003E ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi: imbonini njengefayela le-USD, ifayela lezilungiselelo, amaphrofayili wokukhanya, kanye nezingqimba ezimbili ezincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha imodeli, londoloza bese uthumela futhi. Kuphela imbonini nefayela lezilungiselelo ziyabhalwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinguquko-zakho-ziphephile\"\u003EIzinguquko zakho ziphephile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsiteji evulwa yi-Unreal yisigaba esincane esenziwa kanye, sinezingqimba ezimbili ngaphansi kwaso: \u003Cstrong\u003Eeyakho\u003C/strong\u003E phezulu (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.user.usda\u003C/code\u003E, ingenalutho ekuqaleni, ayikaze ibhalwe kabusha yi-CadCraft) kanye nembonini ye-CadCraft ngaphansi. Izinguquko ozigcinela ungqimba lwakho zihlala lapho imbonini ithunyelwa futhi. Okukhanyayo nezinye izinkomba ozibeka kumazinga e-Unreal ngaphandle kwesiteji futhi azithintwa nazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kwe-studio\"\u003ENgaphandle kwe-Studio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-browser, noma kukhompyutha lapho i-Studio ingasithola khona i-Unreal, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-Engine bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Igcina leyo folda njenge-zip: yikhiphe ngaphakathi kwefolda ye-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft\u003C/code\u003E yephrojekthi yakho. Shiya \u003Cstrong\u003EFaka amafayela esiteji\u003C/strong\u003E okokuqala; uyicime lapho ulondoloza kamuva, ukuze i-zip iqukathe imbonini nefayela lezilungiselelo kuphela futhi ungqimba lwakho lungabhalwa kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-plug-in ye-Unreal evula isiteji, isebenzise ilanga, amalambu, amakhamera nokuvezwa, ilandele ukuthunyelwa ngakunye futhi irenderise ikhamera \u003Cstrong\u003Eayikakhishwa\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ayikaze isebenze ku-Unreal. Kuze kube yilapho ikhishwa, Thumela ifaka amafayela ephrojekthini, futhi amathuluzi e-USD e-Unreal angawavula. I-Windows isisetshenziswa sokuqala; i-macOS izolandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu lwe-Engine lungabamba ixhumanisi eliya kwiphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine. Indlela eyodwa kuphela: kusuka ku-CadCraft kuya ku-Unreal. Thumela imbonini Khetha inkomba ye-Unreal ohlwini lwe-Engine. Okokuqala, i-Studio iyacela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda yephrojekthi yakho (leyo enefayela le-.uproject); iyayikhumbula. Chofoza Thumela. I-Studio ibhala i-CadCraft/\u003Cfile name\u003E/ ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi: imbonini njengefayela le-USD, ifayela lezilungiselelo, amaphrofayili wokukhanya, kanye nezingqimba ezimbili ezincane. Shintsha imodeli, londoloza bese uthumela futhi. Kuphela imbonini nefayela lezilungiselelo ziyabhalwa kabusha. Izinguquko zakho ziphephile Isiteji evulwa yi-Unreal yisigaba esincane esenziwa kanye, sinezingqimba ezimbili ngaphansi kwaso: eyakho phezulu (\u003Cname\u003E.user.usda, ingenalutho ekuqaleni, ayikaze ibhalwe kabusha yi-CadCraft) kanye nembonini ye-CadCraft ngaphansi. Izinguquko ozigcinela ungqimba lwakho zihlala lapho imbonini ithunyelwa futhi. Okukhanyayo nezinye izinkomba ozibeka kumazinga e-Unreal ngaphandle kwesiteji futhi azithintwa nazo. Ngaphandle kwe-Studio Ku-browser, noma kukhompyutha lapho i-Studio ingasithola khona i-Unreal, khetha Ifolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip) ohlwini lwe-Engine bese uchofoza Renda. Igcina leyo folda njenge-zip: yikhiphe ngaphakathi kwefolda ye-CadCraft yephrojekthi yakho. Shiya Faka amafayela esiteji okokuqala; uyicime lapho ulondoloza kamuva, ukuze i-zip iqukathe imbonini nefayela lezilungiselelo kuphela futhi ungqimba lwakho lungabhalwa kabusha. I-plug-in ye-Unreal evula isiteji, isebenzise ilanga, amalambu, amakhamera nokuvezwa, ilandele ukuthunyelwa ngakunye futhi irenderise ikhamera ayikakhishwa, futhi ayikaze isebenze ku-Unreal. Kuze kube yilapho ikhishwa, Thumela ifaka amafayela ephrojekthini, futhi amathuluzi e-USD e-Unreal angawavula. I-Windows isisetshenziswa sokuqala; i-macOS izolandela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"ar-on-site","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Bona imodeli endaweni ngefoni ye-Android (AR)","summary":"Phakamisa ifoni ye-Android nge-Chrome ubone imodeli ngosayizi wangempela phezu kwekhamera yefoni, ilingene esakhiweni ngamaphoyinti amabili lapho umi khona, nelensi ye-x-ray nokuhlola ngokushesha ekuvakashelweni okulandelayo. Ukubuka kuphela, hhayi ukukala.","section":"tasks","order":117,"keywords":["ar","ukwandiswa kwangempela","ifoni","android","chrome","webxr","endaweni","isayithi","ikhamera","ubukhulu obugcwele","x-ray","linganisa","ukulingana","hlola futhi","arcore"],"headings":[{"id":"lingana-imodeli","text":"Lingana imodeli","level":2},{"id":"ilensi-ye-x-ray","text":"Ilensi ye-X-ray","level":2},{"id":"ukuvakashelwa-okulandelayo","text":"Ukuvakashelwa okulandelayo","level":2},{"id":"phuma","text":"Phuma","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView on site (AR, phone)\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa imodeli ngosayizi wayo wangempela phezu kwekhamera yefoni. Isebenza ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eifoni ye-Android nge-Chrome\u003C/strong\u003E, ekhasini elivikelekile (https), lapho ifoni isekela i-AR. Ku-iPhone noma i-iPad, ikhompyutha, noma uhlelo lwe-Android oluboniswa ikhasi lewebhu kuphela, into ichaza ukuthi ayikwazi ukuqala; sebenzisa ukubuka kwe-3D lapho, noma vula leli khasi ku-Chrome kwifoni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfoni yokubuka kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Ungalinganisi, ungamaki, noma usike lutho kulokho isikrini esikutshengisayo: ifoni iyahamba uma uhamba, futhi iphutha lokukhomba likhula ngokuya ekugcineni kwamaphoyinti amabili ohlanganise kuwo (amasentimitha ambalwa eduze kwawo, okwengeziwe kude). Akukho lutho lapha olungokuhlolwa okunembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lingana-imodeli\"\u003ELingana imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli kufoni bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView on site (AR, phone)\u003C/span\u003E. Vumela ikhamera.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpaneli esezansi ibiza iphoyinti lokuqala (ikhona lesakhiwo emhlabathini). Ma lapho esakhiweni, khomba isiyingi esiluhlaza emhlabathini, bese uthinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace point\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba uye kwephoyinti lesibili, okungenani ihhafu yemitha kude (kude kakhulu, kungcono ukulingana), bese wenza okufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli iyavela ngosayizi ogcwele, ijikisiwe futhi ihanjiswe ukuze ifake lezo zindawo ezimbili. Ipaneli inikeza ukuthi amaphoyinti amabili avumelana kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart over\u003C/span\u003E ihlanza amaphoyinti. Ukulingana kugcinwa kufayela lemodeli, ngakho ngesikhathi esilandelayo uvula imodeli endaweni iqala ilingene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ilensi-ye-x-ray\"\u003EIlensi ye-X-ray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray lens\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa imodeli yonke ngaphakathi kwebhokisi phambi kwefoni (cishe imitha nohhafu ububanzi namamitha amathathu ukujula) futhi ibonise umbono ofiphele kwezinye izindawo, ukuze ubone okusemuva kodonga ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa udonga lwangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvakashelwa-okulandelayo\"\u003EUkuvakashelwa okulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYima ephoyinteni lokuqala uthinte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERe-check\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace point\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kukhona umehluko ongaphansi kwamasentimitha angu-5, ukulingana kuyagcinwa. Kuya kuhhafu yemitha, imodeli iyanyakaza ngomehluko. Ngaphezulu kwalokho, ipaneli icela ukuthi ukhombe lezo zindawo ezimbili futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phuma\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave AR\u003C/span\u003E iyaphelisa iseshini. Isithombe sekhamera sihlala ku-browser: akukho lutho oluthunyelwa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"View on site (AR, phone) kumenyu ye-Views ibonisa imodeli ngosayizi wayo wangempela phezu kwekhamera yefoni. Isebenza ku-ifoni ye-Android nge-Chrome, ekhasini elivikelekile (https), lapho ifoni isekela i-AR. Ku-iPhone noma i-iPad, ikhompyutha, noma uhlelo lwe-Android oluboniswa ikhasi lewebhu kuphela, into ichaza ukuthi ayikwazi ukuqala; sebenzisa ukubuka kwe-3D lapho, noma vula leli khasi ku-Chrome kwifoni. Ifoni yokubuka kuphela. Ungalinganisi, ungamaki, noma usike lutho kulokho isikrini esikutshengisayo: ifoni iyahamba uma uhamba, futhi iphutha lokukhomba likhula ngokuya ekugcineni kwamaphoyinti amabili ohlanganise kuwo (amasentimitha ambalwa eduze kwawo, okwengeziwe kude). Akukho lutho lapha olungokuhlolwa okunembile. Lingana imodeli Vula imodeli kufoni bese ukhetha View on site (AR, phone). Vumela ikhamera. Ipaneli esezansi ibiza iphoyinti lokuqala (ikhona lesakhiwo emhlabathini). Ma lapho esakhiweni, khomba isiyingi esiluhlaza emhlabathini, bese uthinta Place point. Hamba uye kwephoyinti lesibili, okungenani ihhafu yemitha kude (kude kakhulu, kungcono ukulingana), bese wenza okufanayo. Imodeli iyavela ngosayizi ogcwele, ijikisiwe futhi ihanjiswe ukuze ifake lezo zindawo ezimbili. Ipaneli inikeza ukuthi amaphoyinti amabili avumelana kangakanani. Start over ihlanza amaphoyinti. Ukulingana kugcinwa kufayela lemodeli, ngakho ngesikhathi esilandelayo uvula imodeli endaweni iqala ilingene. Ilensi ye-X-ray X-ray lens ibonisa imodeli yonke ngaphakathi kwebhokisi phambi kwefoni (cishe imitha nohhafu ububanzi namamitha amathathu ukujula) futhi ibonise umbono ofiphele kwezinye izindawo, ukuze ubone okusemuva kodonga ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa udonga lwangempela. Ukuvakashelwa okulandelayo Yima ephoyinteni lokuqala uthinte Re-check, bese Place point. Uma kukhona umehluko ongaphansi kwamasentimitha angu-5, ukulingana kuyagcinwa. Kuya kuhhafu yemitha, imodeli iyanyakaza ngomehluko. Ngaphezulu kwalokho, ipaneli icela ukuthi ukhombe lezo zindawo ezimbili futhi. Phuma Leave AR iyaphelisa iseshini. Isithombe sekhamera sihlala ku-browser: akukho lutho oluthunyelwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"scenes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Londoloza umbono njengezimbonini","summary":"Gcina ikhamera nesitayela njengembonini, buyekeza futhi uyiqambe kabusha, bese uhamba noma udlale phakathi kwezimbonini ukwethula ukuklama.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["imbonini","umbono","umbono olondoloziwe","ikhamera","ukwethula","ukwenza ifilimu","dlala","okulandelayo","okwangaphambili","amathebhu","uhambo"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-imbonini","text":"Engeza imbonini","level":2},{"id":"yanga-embonini","text":"Yanga embonini","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-qamba-kabusha-noma-sula-imbonini","text":"Shintsha, qamba kabusha noma sula imbonini","level":2},{"id":"khiya-ikhamera-yembonini","text":"Khiya ikhamera yembonini","level":2},{"id":"ethula","text":"Ethula","level":2},{"id":"okubonakalayo-embonini","text":"Okubonakalayo embonini","level":2},{"id":"khipha-i-animation","text":"Khipha i-animation","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbonini\u003C/strong\u003E igcina indawo yekhamera, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe: ukuthi ubukela kusuphi, i-perspective noma i-parallel, isitayela sobuso, imiphetho, izilungiselelo zelanga, amaqembu afihliwe, amathegi avaliwe nokusikwa kwesigaba. Izimbonini zigcinwa kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-imbonini\"\u003EEngeza imbonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungisa umbono: zungeza, sondeza, khetha isitayela, setha ilanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza umboniso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbonini iveza ohlwini futhi njengethebhu phezu kombono we-3D, iqanjwe ngokuthi &quot;Imbonini 1&quot;, &quot;Imbonini 2&quot; njalo. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Imbonini 1 ilondoloziwe: le kheshi, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yanga-embonini\"\u003EYanga embonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu yayo phezu kombono we-3D, noma igama layo ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuya embonini elandelayo, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuya kwendulele. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwangaphambili\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kohlu benza okufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhamera iyashelela iye embonini ngaphezu kwesigamu sesekhondi. Uma ikhompyutha yakho isethelwe ukunciphisa ukunyakaza, igxuma kuyo ngokushesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-qamba-kabusha-noma-sula-imbonini\"\u003EShintsha, qamba kabusha noma sula imbonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbonini ngayinye ohlwini inamanku amathathu angemva kwegama layo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/strong\u003E (izingalo eziyindilinga): igcina ikhamera yamanje, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe kuleyo mbonini. &quot;Imbonini 2 ibuyekeziwe.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQamba kabusha\u003C/strong\u003E (ipensela): ivula ingxoxo ethi &quot;Qamba kabusha imbonini&quot;. Thayipha igama elisha bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESula\u003C/strong\u003E (ibhini): isusa imbonini. &quot;Imbonini 2 isusiwe. Ctrl+Z iyibuyisela.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungeza, ukubuyekeza, ukuqamba kabusha nokusula izimbonini kuyizinyathelo zokuhlehlisa, njengezinguquko emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khiya-ikhamera-yembonini\"\u003EKhiya ikhamera yembonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho urenda umbono ofanayo njalo ngenkathi ukuklama kushintsha, khiya ikhamera yembonini ukuze umbono ungahambi ngephutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza inkinobho \u003Cstrong\u003Eyokukhiya\u003C/strong\u003E (ikhiye elivulekile) ngemva kwegama lembonini. Iyavala, bese ithebhu yembonini phezu kombono we-3D ibonisa ikhiye elincane. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Imbonini 2: ikhamera ikhiyiwe.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba embonini lapho ufuna ukurenda: ikhamera ibuyela ngqo embonweni ogcinwe, ngakho izithombe ezenziwe kuwo zihambisana nezangaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ikhamera ikhiyiwe, \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/strong\u003E igcina isitayela nalokho okufihliwe embonini, kodwa ikhamera ihlala lapho ibikhona, nakuba ubuye ujikelezile. Chofoza ikhiye futhi ukuze uyivule; bese Buyekeza igcina umbono wamanje futhi. Ukukhiya nokuvula kuyizinyathelo zokuhlehlisa, nokukhiya kugcinwa kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ethula\"\u003EEthula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza izimbonini ezimbili noma ngaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDlala\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kohlu. I-ModelCraft ithuthela embonini elandelayo njalo emasekhondini ambalwa futhi ibuyele kokuqala ngemva kokuwugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E (inkinobho efanayo) noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwenza ucwaningo lwelanga, engeza imbonini eyodwa ngehora ngalinye, ushintsha kuphela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/span\u003E, bese udlala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#a-sun-study\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"a-sun-study\"\u003EIzitayela nezithunzi zelanga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wethule ngaphandle kwamabha, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kabili: isikrini esigcwele, bese isikrini esigcwele namabha efihliwe. Amathebhu embonini ahlala phezu kombono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakalayo-embonini\"\u003EOkubonakalayo embonini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbonini ikhumbula lokho okwakufihliwe lapho uyigcina: amaqembu namakhomponenti owa-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003Efihla\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Eamathegi\u003C/a\u003E owavala, nokuthi yiziphi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sections\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sections\"\u003Eizinqwaba zesigaba\u003C/a\u003E ezisika. Ukuya embonini kuyawafihla futhi kuwavule kabusha. Ngakho embonini eyodwa ingabonisa indlu yonke, elandelayo indlu nethegi yophahla ivaliwe, elandelayo ukusika ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso nemiphetho ezifihliwe ezingaxhunyiwe akuyona ingxenye yezimbonini. Ukuya embonini akwenzi isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa. Izimbonini ezigcinwe yi-build yangaphambili ye-ModelCraft zishiya okufihliwe njengoba kunjalo; chofoza Buyekeza ukuze ukugcine kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha-i-animation\"\u003EKhipha i-animation\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport animation\u003C/span\u003E, ngaphansi kohlu, idlala izimbonini kusukela kokuqala kuya kokugcina, ihambisa ikhamera ngobunono phakathi kwazo, futhi igcina ifilimu njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EWebM\u003C/strong\u003E ividiyo (ukuhamba kwesekhondi ezimbili nokuma okufushane ngembonini ngayinye). Irekhoda umbono njengoba ubona, ngosayizi wawo esikrinini, ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003Eumbono wokwethula\u003C/a\u003E (akukho ama-axis, imihlahlandlela noma ukukhethwa). Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza inkinobho futhi ukuze umise ngaphandle kokugcina. I-WebM idlala kumasiphequluli nase-VLC, nabahleli bevidiyo bayayiguqula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ufuna uhambo olurenderiwe (isibhakabhaka, ilanga, izithunzi, izinto zokwakha) ngosayizi okhethayo, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda ividiyo…\u003C/span\u003E esikhundleni: ngaphandle kokhiye be-animation ithatha izimbonini, ngokulandelana, njengendlela yekhamera. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003EYenza ikhamera nezinto zibe ne-animation\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha isitayela noma ukuhambisa ikhamera ngemva kokuya embonini akushintshi imbonini kuze kuchofolwe Buyekeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimbonini azithunyelwa ku-Collada, OBJ, glTF, STL noma IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Imbonini igcina indawo yekhamera, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe: ukuthi ubukela kusuphi, i-perspective noma i-parallel, isitayela sobuso, imiphetho, izilungiselelo zelanga, amaqembu afihliwe, amathegi avaliwe nokusikwa kwesigaba. Izimbonini zigcinwa kufayela le-.modelcraft. Engeza imbonini Lungisa umbono: zungeza, sondeza, khetha isitayela, setha ilanga. Ephaneli ye-Imiboniso ngakwesokudla, chofoza Engeza umboniso. Imbonini iveza ohlwini futhi njengethebhu phezu kombono we-3D, iqanjwe ngokuthi \"Imbonini 1\", \"Imbonini 2\" njalo. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Imbonini 1 ilondoloziwe: le kheshi, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe.\" Yanga embonini Chofoza ithebhu yayo phezu kombono we-3D, noma igama layo ohlwini lwe-Imiboniso. Noma cindezela Page Down ukuya embonini elandelayo, no-Page Up ukuya kwendulele. Okulandelayo no-Okwangaphambili ngaphansi kohlu benza okufanayo. Ikhamera iyashelela iye embonini ngaphezu kwesigamu sesekhondi. Uma ikhompyutha yakho isethelwe ukunciphisa ukunyakaza, igxuma kuyo ngokushesha. Shintsha, qamba kabusha noma sula imbonini Imbonini ngayinye ohlwini inamanku amathathu angemva kwegama layo: Buyekeza (izingalo eziyindilinga): igcina ikhamera yamanje, isitayela nalokho okufihliwe kuleyo mbonini. \"Imbonini 2 ibuyekeziwe.\" Qamba kabusha (ipensela): ivula ingxoxo ethi \"Qamba kabusha imbonini\". Thayipha igama elisha bese uchofoza Londoloza. Sula (ibhini): isusa imbonini. \"Imbonini 2 isusiwe. Ctrl+Z iyibuyisela.\" Ukungeza, ukubuyekeza, ukuqamba kabusha nokusula izimbonini kuyizinyathelo zokuhlehlisa, njengezinguquko emodelini. Khiya ikhamera yembonini Lapho urenda umbono ofanayo njalo ngenkathi ukuklama kushintsha, khiya ikhamera yembonini ukuze umbono ungahambi ngephutha. Ohlwini lwe-Imiboniso, chofoza inkinobho yokukhiya (ikhiye elivulekile) ngemva kwegama lembonini. Iyavala, bese ithebhu yembonini phezu kombono we-3D ibonisa ikhiye elincane. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Imbonini 2: ikhamera ikhiyiwe.\" Hamba embonini lapho ufuna ukurenda: ikhamera ibuyela ngqo embonweni ogcinwe, ngakho izithombe ezenziwe kuwo zihambisana nezangaphambili. Lapho ikhamera ikhiyiwe, Buyekeza igcina isitayela nalokho okufihliwe embonini, kodwa ikhamera ihlala lapho ibikhona, nakuba ubuye ujikelezile. Chofoza ikhiye futhi ukuze uyivule; bese Buyekeza igcina umbono wamanje futhi. Ukukhiya nokuvula kuyizinyathelo zokuhlehlisa, nokukhiya kugcinwa kufayela le-.modelcraft. Ethula Engeza izimbonini ezimbili noma ngaphezulu. Chofoza Dlala ngaphansi kohlu. I-ModelCraft ithuthela embonini elandelayo njalo emasekhondini ambalwa futhi ibuyele kokuqala ngemva kokuwugcina. Chofoza Misa (inkinobho efanayo) noma cindezela Esc ukuze umise. Ukwenza ucwaningo lwelanga, engeza imbonini eyodwa ngehora ngalinye, ushintsha kuphela Isikhathi, bese udlala. Bona Izitayela nezithunzi zelanga. Ukuze wethule ngaphandle kwamabha, cindezela Ctrl+Shift+F kabili: isikrini esigcwele, bese isikrini esigcwele namabha efihliwe. Amathebhu embonini ahlala phezu kombono. Okubonakalayo embonini Imbonini ikhumbula lokho okwakufihliwe lapho uyigcina: amaqembu namakhomponenti owa-fihla, amathegi owavala, nokuthi yiziphi izinqwaba zesigaba ezisika. Ukuya embonini kuyawafihla futhi kuwavule kabusha. Ngakho embonini eyodwa ingabonisa indlu yonke, elandelayo indlu nethegi yophahla ivaliwe, elandelayo ukusika ngayo. Ubuso nemiphetho ezifihliwe ezingaxhunyiwe akuyona ingxenye yezimbonini. Ukuya embonini akwenzi isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa. Izimbonini ezigcinwe yi-build yangaphambili ye-ModelCraft zishiya okufihliwe njengoba kunjalo; chofoza Buyekeza ukuze ukugcine kuzo. Khipha i-animation Export animation, ngaphansi kohlu, idlala izimbonini kusukela kokuqala kuya kokugcina, ihambisa ikhamera ngobunono phakathi kwazo, futhi igcina ifilimu njenge-WebM ividiyo (ukuhamba kwesekhondi ezimbili nokuma okufushane ngembonini ngayinye). Irekhoda umbono njengoba ubona, ngosayizi wawo esikrinini, ku-umbono wokwethula (akukho ama-axis, imihlahlandlela noma ukukhethwa). Cindezela Esc noma chofoza inkinobho futhi ukuze umise ngaphandle kokugcina. I-WebM idlala kumasiphequluli nase-VLC, nabahleli bevidiyo bayayiguqula. Uma ufuna uhambo olurenderiwe (isibhakabhaka, ilanga, izithunzi, izinto zokwakha) ngosayizi okhethayo, sebenzisa Renda ividiyo… esikhundleni: ngaphandle kokhiye be-animation ithatha izimbonini, ngokulandelana, njengendlela yekhamera. Bona Yenza ikhamera nezinto zibe ne-animation. Okufanele wazi Ukushintsha isitayela noma ukuhambisa ikhamera ngemva kokuya embonini akushintshi imbonini kuze kuchofolwe Buyekeza. Izimbonini azithunyelwa ku-Collada, OBJ, glTF, STL noma IFC.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sebenzisa i-ModelCraft nomsizi we-AI","summary":"Vumela umsizi wakho we-AI noma isikripthi sakho sibheke imodeli futhi sakhe amasolidi alula: izimvume, ukuxhuma nge-CadCraft Studio, nerekhodi lomsebenzi.","section":"tasks","order":125,"keywords":["ai","umsizi","ejenti","mcp","model context protocol","isikripthi","ukuzenzakalela","ukumodela","ibhokisi","isilinda","renda","uhlu lokurenda","izimvume","nqamula","umsebenzi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"yivule","text":"Yivule","level":2},{"id":"xhuma-umsizi-wakho","text":"Xhuma umsizi wakho","level":2},{"id":"ushiywe-ulawula","text":"Ushiywe ulawula","level":2},{"id":"yini-umsizi-angayicela","text":"Yini umsizi angayicela","level":2},{"id":"uma-into-ingasebenzi","text":"Uma into ingasebenzi","level":2},{"id":"bheka-futhi","text":"Bheka futhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma isikripthi osibhalile) ukuthi asebenze ne-ModelCraft, nendlela yokunquma okungathintwa yiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Eayinayo i-AI yayo\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kanjani. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiliphi uhlelo olukhuluma i-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-ModelCraft inika kuphela amathuluzi, futhi wena unquma ukuthi yimaphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yivule\"\u003EYivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (ugiya esiqeshini se-app bar, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uya kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi ukusebenzisa i-ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Ivaliwe kuze kube yilapho uyivula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okungenza: \u003Cstrong\u003EFunda\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe ekuqaleni; thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela uma uzidinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi angaphandle kwezimvume ozithikile awanikezwa umsizi, futhi uma eyicela noma kanjani, i-ModelCraft iyayenqaba ibhale kurekhodi lomsebenzi. Ukucima iswitshi kuvala wonke amaxhumanisi ngesikhathi esisodwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E nayo iyicima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhuma-umsizi-wakho\"\u003EXhuma umsizi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbasizi baxhuma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kukhompyutha yakho: i-Studio iqalisa iseva encane okufinyelelwa yilo lolu khompyutha kuphela, evikelwe ithokheni eyenza yona ngalinye ngalinye lapho iqala. Ku-Studio, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma umsizi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukopisha ikheli nethokheni ubifake kumsizi wakho (i-Studio ikhombisa izilungiselelo ezichaziwe okufanele uzinamathisele). Ungalabelani ithokheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula ukuxhumeka komsizi: ezinhlelweni zesiphequluli iswitshi alisebenzi size usebenzise i-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ushiywe-ulawula\"\u003EUshiywe ulawula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELonke ushintsho luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E, luphawulwe ngegama lomsizi (isibonelo &quot;Umsizi: ibhokisi&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uthatha ushintsho lokugcina lomsizi njengoba lunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUyazi lapho enye ixhunyiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinobho ku-app bar iqamba umsizi uma exhunyiwe; yiklikele ukuze ubone okungenziwa yiyo, noma ukuze uyi-\u003Cstrong\u003ENqamula\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E ukhombisa wonke amakholi: nini, yiliphi ithuluzi, aliqedwanga noma alinqatshiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina irekhodi\u003C/span\u003E igcina ikhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-umsizi-angayicela\"\u003EYini umsizi angayicela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImvume\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodel_describe\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yemodeli, usayizi, nawo wonke amaqembu nezingxenye, nokuthi zikuphi, ukuthi ingabe isolidi evaliwe nevolumu yayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eview_screenshot\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe se-3D view njengoba sibonakala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebox_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecylinder_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi noma isilinda njengeqembu elisha, endaweni nosayizi onikezwa wena noma yona (&quot;3m&quot;, &quot;10&#039;&quot; noma inani kuyunithi yemodeli)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Einstance_move\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einstances_erase\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisa noma isule amaqembu nezingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efaces_list\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ematerials_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi zeqembu noma zejiyomethri ekhululekile (ngayinye nokuqondisa kwayo, indawo nesikhungo); izinto nemibala engapeyintwa ngayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epush_pull\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsunduza noma ihudula uhlangothi, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E yenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epaint\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpeyinta izinhlangothi noma iqembu lonke ngombala noma impahla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Egroup_make\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza iqembu noma ingxenye yezinhlangothi ezikhululekile namaqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escene_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Escene_show\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlondoloza ukubuka njengemboniso; iya kumboniso olondoloziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emesh_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto ye-mesh yokuqala (ikhyubhu, ibhola, isilinda …), njengoba i-Mesh workspace iyingeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodifiers_list\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_set\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_remove\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda / Hlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsitaki sezinguquli se-mesh: bonisa, i-array, indawo yokuhlukaniswa, i-bevel nezinye; akukho okusetshenziswa ngokuphelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli njenge-OpenUSD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E), njengoba ukulondoloza imodeli njenge-USD kubhala (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E); efolda oyivumele ku-Studio, uma kungenjalo kuba yidawunilodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erender_still\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe esirendiwe sokubuka noma semboniso elondoloziwe, njengenkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E yedayalogi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E yenza, nezilungiselelo zakho zokurenda ngaphandle uma icela ezinye (ukusethwa kwemboniso: ngaphandle, ngaphakathi, isigaba, ebusuku noma ozenzakalelayo; okusheshayo noma ikhwalithi ephezulu, usayizi, izampula, ibhodwe); i-PNG ayikwazi ukuyibheka, noma i-PNG, EXR noma ifayela lokurenda kufolda oyivumele ku-Studio (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erender_queue\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu kuhlu lokurenda ledayalogi ye-Render (ukubuka, noma imiboniso elondoloziwe) bese iqhuba uhlu; izithombe eziqediwe ziya kufolda oyivumele, noma zihlale kuhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/span\u003E ledayalogi ye-Render ngawe. Idinga i-WebGPU\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_push\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbuyekeza imodeli exhunywe kolunye uhlelo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EGcina imodeli ye-.3dm ibukeka\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_status\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthi imodeli exhunywe isekhona yini nokuthi yabuyekezwa nini ngokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eundo\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlehlisa izinyathelo zayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto umsizi azenzayo zifika njengamaqembu, ngakho azihlanganisi nalokho okudwebile. Akukho ithuluzi elilondoloza imodeli: ukulondoloza kusalele kuwe, futhi ukukhipha noma ukurenda kudinga ukuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe. Ukurenda akushintshi lutho emodelini; ukurenda imboniso elondoloziwe kuhambisa ukubuka kuyo, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E yenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-into-ingasebenzi\"\u003EUma into ingasebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsizi awubonanga amathuluzi e-ModelCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E hlola ukuthi iswitshi ivuliwe kule window, nokuthi le window ivulekile ku-Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;kudinga imvume yokuhlela&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, bese ubuza futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphutha &quot;401&quot; noma &quot;token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E ithokheni ishintshile (i-Studio iqalile kabusha, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthokheni entsha\u003C/span\u003E). Kopisha eyintsha ezilungiselelweni zomsizi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-futhi\"\u003EBheka futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIzindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye namathuluzi ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Indlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma isikripthi osibhalile) ukuthi asebenze ne-ModelCraft, nendlela yokunquma okungathintwa yiwo. I-ModelCraft ayinayo i-AI yayo futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kanjani. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiliphi uhlelo olukhuluma i-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-ModelCraft inika kuphela amathuluzi, futhi wena unquma ukuthi yimaphi. Yivule Vula i-Izilungiselelo (ugiya esiqeshini se-app bar, noma Ctrl+,) bese uya kuthebhu ye-ModelCraft. Ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi, thikha Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi ukusebenzisa i-ModelCraft. Ivaliwe kuze kube yilapho uyivula. Khetha okungenza: Funda ithikiwe ekuqaleni; thikha Hlela, Londoloza noma Khipha kuphela uma uzidinga. Amathuluzi angaphandle kwezimvume ozithikile awanikezwa umsizi, futhi uma eyicela noma kanjani, i-ModelCraft iyayenqaba ibhale kurekhodi lomsebenzi. Ukucima iswitshi kuvala wonke amaxhumanisi ngesikhathi esisodwa; Setha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft nayo iyicima. Xhuma umsizi wakho Abasizi baxhuma nge-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha yakho: i-Studio iqalisa iseva encane okufinyelelwa yilo lolu khompyutha kuphela, evikelwe ithokheni eyenza yona ngalinye ngalinye lapho iqala. Ku-Studio, khetha Xhuma umsizi bese ukopisha ikheli nethokheni ubifake kumsizi wakho (i-Studio ikhombisa izilungiselelo ezichaziwe okufanele uzinamathisele). Ungalabelani ithokheni. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula ukuxhumeka komsizi: ezinhlelweni zesiphequluli iswitshi alisebenzi size usebenzise i-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha yakho. Ushiywe ulawula Lonke ushintsho luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, luphawulwe ngegama lomsizi (isibonelo \"Umsizi: ibhokisi\"). Ctrl+Z uthatha ushintsho lokugcina lomsizi njengoba lunjalo. Uyazi lapho enye ixhunyiwe. Inkinobho ku-app bar iqamba umsizi uma exhunyiwe; yiklikele ukuze ubone okungenziwa yiyo, noma ukuze uyi-Nqamula. Umsebenzi. Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Abasizi › Umsebenzi ukhombisa wonke amakholi: nini, yiliphi ithuluzi, aliqedwanga noma alinqatshiwe. Gcina irekhodi igcina ikhophi. Yini umsizi angayicela Ithuluzi Imvume Okwenzayo app_info, model_describe Funda Iyunithi yemodeli, usayizi, nawo wonke amaqembu nezingxenye, nokuthi zikuphi, ukuthi ingabe isolidi evaliwe nevolumu yayo view_screenshot Funda Isithombe se-3D view njengoba sibonakala box_add, cylinder_add Hlela Ibhokisi noma isilinda njengeqembu elisha, endaweni nosayizi onikezwa wena noma yona (\"3m\", \"10'\" noma inani kuyunithi yemodeli) instance_move, instances_erase Hlela Ihambisa noma isule amaqembu nezingxenye faces_list, materials_list Funda Izinhlangothi zeqembu noma zejiyomethri ekhululekile (ngayinye nokuqondisa kwayo, indawo nesikhungo); izinto nemibala engapeyintwa ngayo push_pull Hlela Isunduza noma ihudula uhlangothi, njengoba Sunduza/hudula yenza paint Hlela Upeyinta izinhlangothi noma iqembu lonke ngombala noma impahla group_make Hlela Yenza iqembu noma ingxenye yezinhlangothi ezikhululekile namaqembu scene_add, scene_show Hlela Ilondoloza ukubuka njengemboniso; iya kumboniso olondoloziwe mesh_add Hlela Into ye-mesh yokuqala (ikhyubhu, ibhola, isilinda …), njengoba i-Mesh workspace iyingeza modifiers_list, modifier_add, modifier_set, modifier_remove Funda / Hlela Isitaki sezinguquli se-mesh: bonisa, i-array, indawo yokuhlukaniswa, i-bevel nezinye; akukho okusetshenziswa ngokuphelele usd_export Khipha Imodeli njenge-OpenUSD (.usda, .usdc noma .usdz), njengoba ukulondoloza imodeli njenge-USD kubhala (USD); efolda oyivumele ku-Studio, uma kungenjalo kuba yidawunilodi render_still Khipha Isithombe esirendiwe sokubuka noma semboniso elondoloziwe, njengenkinobho ethi Renda yedayalogi ye-Renda yenza, nezilungiselelo zakho zokurenda ngaphandle uma icela ezinye (ukusethwa kwemboniso: ngaphandle, ngaphakathi, isigaba, ebusuku noma ozenzakalelayo; okusheshayo noma ikhwalithi ephezulu, usayizi, izampula, ibhodwe); i-PNG ayikwazi ukuyibheka, noma i-PNG, EXR noma ifayela lokurenda kufolda oyivumele ku-Studio (Renda isithombe) render_queue Khipha Yengeza izithombe ezikhwalithi ephezulu kuhlu lokurenda ledayalogi ye-Render (ukubuka, noma imiboniso elondoloziwe) bese iqhuba uhlu; izithombe eziqediwe ziya kufolda oyivumele, noma zihlale kuhlu Uhlu lokurenda ledayalogi ye-Render ngawe. Idinga i-WebGPU link_push Hlela Ibuyekeza imodeli exhunywe kolunye uhlelo (bona Gcina imodeli ye-.3dm ibukeka) link_status Funda Ithi imodeli exhunywe isekhona yini nokuthi yabuyekezwa nini ngokugcina undo Hlela Ihlehlisa izinyathelo zayo Izinto umsizi azenzayo zifika njengamaqembu, ngakho azihlanganisi nalokho okudwebile. Akukho ithuluzi elilondoloza imodeli: ukulondoloza kusalele kuwe, futhi ukukhipha noma ukurenda kudinga ukuthi Khipha ithikiwe. Ukurenda akushintshi lutho emodelini; ukurenda imboniso elondoloziwe kuhambisa ukubuka kuyo, njengoba Imiboniso yenza. Uma into ingasebenzi Umsizi awubonanga amathuluzi e-ModelCraft: hlola ukuthi iswitshi ivuliwe kule window, nokuthi le window ivulekile ku-Studio. \"kudinga imvume yokuhlela\": thikha Hlela ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi, bese ubuza futhi. Amaphutha \"401\" noma \"token\": ithokheni ishintshile (i-Studio iqalile kabusha, noma Ithokheni entsha). Kopisha eyintsha ezilungiselelweni zomsizi. Bheka futhi Izindlela zokupheka zabasizi be-AI: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye namathuluzi ayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"export-model","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thumela imodeli ezinhlelweni zezinye","summary":"Khetha ukuthumela okufanele ukwenza, ukubonisa, ukuprinta nge-3D, i-BIM ne-BimCraft, bese uhlola okugcinwa ngokuthumela ngakunye.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["phrinta","3mf","pdf","iphepha","isithombe","isithombe-sikrini","render","gcina ukubuka","khipha","yabelana","renda","ukurenda","gltf","glb","collada","dae","obj","stl","ukuprinta nge-3d","ifc","bim","bimcraft","thumela","ezinye izinhlelo"],"headings":[{"id":"khipha","text":"Khipha","level":2},{"id":"iyiphi-ifomethi","text":"Iyiphi ifomethi","level":2},{"id":"ngaphambi-kokukhipha","text":"Ngaphambi kokukhipha","level":2},{"id":"thumela-imodeli-ku-bimcraft","text":"Thumela imodeli ku-BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"imigqa-engenabuso","text":"Imigqa engenabuso","level":2},{"id":"gcina-ukubuka-njengesithombe","text":"Gcina ukubuka njengesithombe","level":2},{"id":"phrinta-ukubuka-noma-ulondoloze-njenge-pdf","text":"Phrinta ukubuka, noma ulondoloze njenge-PDF","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkukhipha kwenza ikhophi yemodeli ngefomethi ehlukile. Gcina nefayela lakho le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E: yiyo kuphela efaka konke, futhi yiyo kuphela ModelCraft evula ngqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELondoloza kuqala (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ukuze ifayela lakho lokusebenza liphephile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifomethi. Isiphequluli siyasilanda, sibizwe njengemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yonke iyakhishwa. Ukukhipha ingxenye eyodwa, londoloza, sule okunye, khipha, bese uhlehlisa noma uvule kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iyiphi-ifomethi\"\u003EIyiphi ifomethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUfuna ukwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula komunye umhleli we-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina amaqembu, amaqembu angaphakathi kwamanye, izakhi (zabelwana, azikopishelwa), amagama nemibala. Z phezulu, amamitha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkurenda noma ukusebenzisa ohlelweni lokubonisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ (.obj)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-OBJ ifundwa kakhulu; ibhala indawo yeqembu ngalinye njengento ehlukile, kodwa ayinamibala futhi ayinazakhi ezabelwanayo. I-glTF igcina izakhi nemibala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkufaka kuwebhu, kwinjini yemidlalo noma ku-AR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elilodwa elinakho konke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlola ukuthi imodeli ivaliwe futhi ibheke ngendlela efanele, bese ibhala i-STL noma i-3MF ngamamillimitha. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL yokuprinta (.stl, amamillimitha)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala imodeli yonke ngaphandle kokuhlola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula ku-BimCraft noma olunye uhlelo lwe-BIM\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqembu ngalinye elikhulu noma isakhi sibe yisakhiwo esisodwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo iqinisekisa ngokukhishwa ngakunye, isibonelo &quot;Kukhishiwe House.stl (amamillimitha).&quot; noma &quot;Kukhishiwe House.dae (Collada 1.4.1, Z phezulu, amamitha; izakhi zihlala zabelwana).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphambi-kokukhipha\"\u003ENgaphambi kokukhipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlanganisa izinto zakho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Collada, i-glTF ne-IFC zigcina amaqembu nezakhi njengezinto ezihlukile. Ijiyomethri eshiyekile iphuma njengesiqu esisodwa; ku-IFC iba isakhiwo esisodwa esibizwa ngokuthi &quot;Loose geometry&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBheka amagama.\u003C/strong\u003E Amagama amaqembu nezakhi aya ku-Collada ne-IFC, ngakho udonga olubizwa ngokuthi &quot;North wall&quot; lufika lubizwa ngokuthi &quot;North wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola indlela ubuso obubheke ngayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ubuso obukhombisa luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu ngaphandle buzobheka ngaphakathi ekukhipheni. Lungisa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula ubuso\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/erase#a-face-facing-the-wrong-way\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/erase\" data-hash=\"a-face-facing-the-wrong-way\"\u003ESula bese uhlanza\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuprinta,\u003C/strong\u003E yenza izingxenye zibe yizinto eziqinile ezivaliwe: khetha iqembu ngalinye bese uhlola ukuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E lusho &quot;Solid: Yes&quot;. Bese ulinganisa imodeli ngosayizi oprintiwe, noma ulinganise kusofthiwe yomshini oprinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-imodeli-ku-bimcraft\"\u003EThumela imodeli ku-BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza ingxenye ngayinye yesakhiwo ibe iqembu noma isakhi bese uyibiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E elilandiwe ku-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthumele ubuningi bomqondo, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuningi ku-BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E kunalokho: iqembu ngalinye lifika njenganketho yobuningi, ngezitezi, izindawo zezitezi nevolumu. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/massing-to-bimcraft\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/massing-to-bimcraft\"\u003EThumela ubuningi ku-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhishwa kwe-IFC okulula akunaxhumanisi ngqo phakathi kwalezi zinhlelo ezimbili. I-IFC inesitezi esisodwa, futhi yonke into iyiproksi yento yesakhiwo esijwayelekile engenayo uhlobo noma izimpawu: ithwala isimo negama kuphela. Amaqembu avaliwe aba yizimo eziqinile; avulekile aba yizindawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigqa-engenabuso\"\u003EImigqa engenabuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphetho engeyona ingxenye yanoma yiluphi ubuso (imigqa efana nemihlahlandlela, ipulani yesayithi elingeniswe) ifaka ku-OBJ ne-Collada njengemigqa. I-glTF ne-STL azinendawo yazo futhi ziyayikhipha. Imihlahlandlela nemiboniso akukhishwa kunoma iyiphi ifomethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-ukubuka-njengesithombe\"\u003EGcina ukubuka njengesithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe sokubuka (.png)\u003C/span\u003E igcina ngokuqondile lokho okubonisa ukubuka kwe-3D, ngosayizi wakho esikrinini. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe ngobukhulu obabili (.png)\u003C/span\u003E siyigcina kabili ububanzi nobude (ukuze uprinte noma isilayidi esicacile), nezilinganiso namamaki adwetshwe kabusha ngalobo bukhulu hhayi ngokwelulwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthole isithombe esifana nemini (isibhakabhaka, ilanga, izithunzi ezithambile, ingilazi), sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E kunalokho: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthole isithombe esihlanzekile, vula \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003Eukubuka kokwethulwa\u003C/a\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kuqala: amawoka, imihlahlandlela, imigqa yezigaba nokukhethwa kuyakhishwa. Lungisa ikhamera, isitayela nezithunzi ngendlela ofuna ngayo, noma iya ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Eisiboniso\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze ulondoloze ifilimu eyinyakazayo yemiboniso yakho, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-animation\u003C/span\u003E kuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiboniso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phrinta-ukubuka-noma-ulondoloze-njenge-pdf\"\u003EPhrinta ukubuka, noma ulondoloze njenge-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF yokubuka (.pdf)\u003C/span\u003E igcina i-PDF yekhasi elilodwa: ukubuka ngobukhulu obabili besikrini, nezilinganiso zako, ekhasini le-A4 (Letter uma imodeli ingamafidi namayintshi), ngokuthi kube bubanzi, nomugqa ngaphansi unikeza igama lefayela, usuku nesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta ukubuka…\u003C/span\u003E ibeka leli khasi phambi kwebhokisi lokuphrinta lesiphequluli sakho. Khetha iphrinta, noma &quot;Londoloza njenge-PDF&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi libonisa ukubuka njengoba kunjalo: ayikho iskeyli ekubukeni okunokujula. Ukuze uthole umdwebo onesikali, vala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka ngokujula\u003C/span\u003E ubheke ukusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, bese wengeza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Eizilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E zobukhulu obubalulekile. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003EUkubuka kokwethulwa\u003C/a\u003E kususa amawoka, imihlahlandlela nokukhethwa; izilinganiso ziyahlala.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukukhipha kwenza ikhophi yemodeli ngefomethi ehlukile. Gcina nefayela lakho le-.modelcraft: yiyo kuphela efaka konke, futhi yiyo kuphela ModelCraft evula ngqo. Khipha Londoloza kuqala (Ctrl+S), ukuze ifayela lakho lokusebenza liphephile. Chofoza Khipha eqenjini le-Ifayela. Khetha ifomethi. Isiphequluli siyasilanda, sibizwe njengemodeli. Imodeli yonke iyakhishwa. Ukukhipha ingxenye eyodwa, londoloza, sule okunye, khipha, bese uhlehlisa noma uvule kabusha. Iyiphi ifomethi Ufuna ukwenza Khetha Amanothi Ukuvula komunye umhleli we-3D Collada (.dae) Igcina amaqembu, amaqembu angaphakathi kwamanye, izakhi (zabelwana, azikopishelwa), amagama nemibala. Z phezulu, amamitha. Ukurenda noma ukusebenzisa ohlelweni lokubonisa OBJ (.obj) noma glTF binary (.glb) I-OBJ ifundwa kakhulu; ibhala indawo yeqembu ngalinye njengento ehlukile, kodwa ayinamibala futhi ayinazakhi ezabelwanayo. I-glTF igcina izakhi nemibala. Ukufaka kuwebhu, kwinjini yemidlalo noma ku-AR glTF binary (.glb) Ifayela elilodwa elinakho konke. Ukuprinta nge-3D Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)… Ihlola ukuthi imodeli ivaliwe futhi ibheke ngendlela efanele, bese ibhala i-STL noma i-3MF ngamamillimitha. Bheka Lungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D. STL yokuprinta (.stl, amamillimitha) ibhala imodeli yonke ngaphandle kokuhlola. Ukuvula ku-BimCraft noma olunye uhlelo lwe-BIM IFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc) Iqembu ngalinye elikhulu noma isakhi sibe yisakhiwo esisodwa. Ibha yesimo iqinisekisa ngokukhishwa ngakunye, isibonelo \"Kukhishiwe House.stl (amamillimitha).\" noma \"Kukhishiwe House.dae (Collada 1.4.1, Z phezulu, amamitha; izakhi zihlala zabelwana).\" Ngaphambi kokukhipha Hlanganisa izinto zakho. I-Collada, i-glTF ne-IFC zigcina amaqembu nezakhi njengezinto ezihlukile. Ijiyomethri eshiyekile iphuma njengesiqu esisodwa; ku-IFC iba isakhiwo esisodwa esibizwa ngokuthi \"Loose geometry\". Bheka amagama. Amagama amaqembu nezakhi aya ku-Collada ne-IFC, ngakho udonga olubizwa ngokuthi \"North wall\" lufika lubizwa ngokuthi \"North wall\". Hlola indlela ubuso obubheke ngayo. Ubuso obukhombisa luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka olunsundu ngaphandle buzobheka ngaphakathi ekukhipheni. Lungisa nge-Phendula ubuso (bheka Sula bese uhlanza). Ukuprinta, yenza izingxenye zibe yizinto eziqinile ezivaliwe: khetha iqembu ngalinye bese uhlola ukuthi Ulwazi lwento lusho \"Solid: Yes\". Bese ulinganisa imodeli ngosayizi oprintiwe, noma ulinganise kusofthiwe yomshini oprinta. Thumela imodeli ku-BimCraft Yenza ingxenye ngayinye yesakhiwo ibe iqembu noma isakhi bese uyibiza. Khetha Khipha, bese IFC ye-BimCraft (.ifc). Vula ifayela .ifc elilandiwe ku-BimCraft. Ukuze uthumele ubuningi bomqondo, sebenzisa Khipha › Ubuningi ku-BimCraft… kunalokho: iqembu ngalinye lifika njenganketho yobuningi, ngezitezi, izindawo zezitezi nevolumu. Bheka Thumela ubuningi ku-BimCraft. Ukukhishwa kwe-IFC okulula akunaxhumanisi ngqo phakathi kwalezi zinhlelo ezimbili. I-IFC inesitezi esisodwa, futhi yonke into iyiproksi yento yesakhiwo esijwayelekile engenayo uhlobo noma izimpawu: ithwala isimo negama kuphela. Amaqembu avaliwe aba yizimo eziqinile; avulekile aba yizindawo. Imigqa engenabuso Imiphetho engeyona ingxenye yanoma yiluphi ubuso (imigqa efana nemihlahlandlela, ipulani yesayithi elingeniswe) ifaka ku-OBJ ne-Collada njengemigqa. I-glTF ne-STL azinendawo yazo futhi ziyayikhipha. Imihlahlandlela nemiboniso akukhishwa kunoma iyiphi ifomethi. Gcina ukubuka njengesithombe Khipha › Isithombe sokubuka (.png) igcina ngokuqondile lokho okubonisa ukubuka kwe-3D, ngosayizi wakho esikrinini. Isithombe ngobukhulu obabili (.png) siyigcina kabili ububanzi nobude (ukuze uprinte noma isilayidi esicacile), nezilinganiso namamaki adwetshwe kabusha ngalobo bukhulu hhayi ngokwelulwa. Ukuze uthole isithombe esifana nemini (isibhakabhaka, ilanga, izithunzi ezithambile, ingilazi), sebenzisa Khipha › Renda isithombe… kunalokho: bheka Renda isithombe. Ukuze uthole isithombe esihlanzekile, vula ukubuka kokwethulwa (Shift+P) kuqala: amawoka, imihlahlandlela, imigqa yezigaba nokukhethwa kuyakhishwa. Lungisa ikhamera, isitayela nezithunzi ngendlela ofuna ngayo, noma iya ku-isiboniso; ukuze ulondoloze ifilimu eyinyakazayo yemiboniso yakho, sebenzisa Thumela i-animation kuphaneli Imiboniso. Phrinta ukubuka, noma ulondoloze njenge-PDF Khipha › I-PDF yokubuka (.pdf) igcina i-PDF yekhasi elilodwa: ukubuka ngobukhulu obabili besikrini, nezilinganiso zako, ekhasini le-A4 (Letter uma imodeli ingamafidi namayintshi), ngokuthi kube bubanzi, nomugqa ngaphansi unikeza igama lefayela, usuku nesilinganiso. Khipha › Phrinta ukubuka… ibeka leli khasi phambi kwebhokisi lokuphrinta lesiphequluli sakho. Khetha iphrinta, noma \"Londoloza njenge-PDF\". Ikhasi libonisa ukubuka njengoba kunjalo: ayikho iskeyli ekubukeni okunokujula. Ukuze uthole umdwebo onesikali, vala Ukubuka ngokujula ubheke ukusuka ku-Phezulu noma ku-Phambili, bese wengeza izilinganiso zobukhulu obubalulekile. Ukubuka kokwethulwa kususa amawoka, imihlahlandlela nokukhethwa; izilinganiso ziyahlala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"massing-to-bimcraft","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thumela ubuningi ku-BimCraft","summary":"Nikeza ubuningi bokusunduza/ukudonsa njengezinketho zobuningi ku-BimCraft, nezitezi, isisekelo, indawo yonke yezakhiwo nevolumu okubalwe kusolidi ngayinye.","section":"tasks","order":131,"keywords":["ubuningi","ubuningi","umqondo","izinketho","bimcraft","ifc","bim","push pull","izitezi","izitezi","indawo yonke yezakhiwo","isisekelo","ivolumu","thumela","nikeza","ubuningi bakhiwo","isigaba 2"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"ngaphambi-kokuqala","text":"Ngaphambi kokuqala","level":2},{"id":"thumela","text":"Thumela","level":2},{"id":"indlela-isolidi-eba-ubuningi","text":"Indlela isolidi eba ubuningi","level":2},{"id":"izimo-ezilula","text":"Izimo ezilula","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuqula amabhlokhi owamodele nge-push/pull ube yizinketho zobuningi eziqondwa yi-BimCraft, ukuze umqondo uqhubeke njengemodeli yesakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphambi-kokuqala\"\u003ENgaphambi kokuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza ubuningi ngabunye \u003Cstrong\u003Eiqembu\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E bese uyinika igama. Ngayinye iba inketho eyodwa. Ijiyometri engahlelekile ayithunyelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela\"\u003EThumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha amaqembu okuzothunyelwa. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, konke okuyiqembu noma ingxenye yezinga eliphezulu kuyathunyelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMassing to BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName of the option set\u003C/span\u003E kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloor height\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola uhlu: izitezi zenketho ngayinye, isisekelo, indawo yonke yezakhiwo nevolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EThumela ku-BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uvule i-BimCraft ethebhini elisha ngezinketho, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E ukulanda ifayela uvule lapho ngokwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-BimCraft izinketho zibhalwe ngaphansi kwe-&quot;Massing options in the model&quot;, lapho enye ingenziwa inketho yamanje futhi ichazeke ibe ngodonga nezitezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-isolidi-eba-ubuningi\"\u003EIndlela isolidi eba ubuningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitezi\u003C/strong\u003E ziwukuphakama kwesolidi ehlukaniswe ngokuphakama kwesitezi, izungezwe, futhi okungenani ibe eyodwa. Izitezi bese zabelana ngokuphakama kwesolidi ngokulinganayo, ngakho ibhlokhi ye-10 m ngezitezi ezingu-3 m inezitezi ezi-3 ezingu-3.33 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yesitezi\u003C/strong\u003E iyindawo yesigaba esiqondile sesolidi ngokwayo ezingeni lalesi sitezi. Ibhlokhi eyehla emuva inezitezi ezingaphezulu ezincane, futhi indawo yonke yezakhiwo iyisamba salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E yisikhala sesigaba esingaphezulu kwesisekelo sesolidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvolumu\u003C/strong\u003E yisolidi ngokwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-IFC ngayinye inketho iyi-building element proxy (isisekelo esiphakanyiswe ekuphakameni kwesolidi) enesikhala esisodwa ngesitezi ngasinye esiphethe indawo yonke yalesi sitezi. Zonke izinketho zabelana ngesakhiwo esisodwa, nezitezi eziningi njengenketho ephakeme kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimo-ezilula\"\u003EIzimo ezilula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhlokhi elula emile ithunyelwa njengoba imodelwe. Konke okunye kuyathunyelwa nakho, futhi uhlu luchaza ukuthi kungani imo yaso ilula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitezi zayo azilingani konke nesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E (ziyehla emuva noma ziyathambeka): ubuningi ku-BimCraft yisisekelo esiphakanyiswe ekuphakameni okugcwele, kodwa izindawo zezitezi nevolumu kungokwesolidi ngokwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsolidi ayivaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E: izitezi ezingeke zivalwe azilinganiswa futhi zibalwa njengento. Vala isolidi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E ithi &quot;Solid: Yes&quot;) ukuze uthole izibalo ezigcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsisekelo sayo sinemigqa engaphezu kwe-outline eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: eyikhulu isetshenziswa njengesisekelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC for BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E ayiyokukhipha okuhlukile: ithumela izimo namagama kuphela, ngaphandle kwezitezi nezindawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okulayishwayo. Ifayela linikezwa ithebhu ye-BimCraft kulo mshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Guqula amabhlokhi owamodele nge-push/pull ube yizinketho zobuningi eziqondwa yi-BimCraft, ukuze umqondo uqhubeke njengemodeli yesakhiwo. Ngaphambi kokuqala Yenza ubuningi ngabunye iqembu noma ingxenye bese uyinika igama. Ngayinye iba inketho eyodwa. Ijiyometri engahlelekile ayithunyelwa. Thumela Khetha amaqembu okuzothunyelwa. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, konke okuyiqembu noma ingxenye yezinga eliphezulu kuyathunyelwa. Khetha Export, bese Massing to BimCraft…. Thayipha Name of the option set kanye no-Floor height. Hlola uhlu: izitezi zenketho ngayinye, isisekelo, indawo yonke yezakhiwo nevolumu. Khetha Thumela ku-BimCraft ukuze uvule i-BimCraft ethebhini elisha ngezinketho, noma Save as IFC ukulanda ifayela uvule lapho ngokwakho. Ku-BimCraft izinketho zibhalwe ngaphansi kwe-\"Massing options in the model\", lapho enye ingenziwa inketho yamanje futhi ichazeke ibe ngodonga nezitezi. Indlela isolidi eba ubuningi Izitezi ziwukuphakama kwesolidi ehlukaniswe ngokuphakama kwesitezi, izungezwe, futhi okungenani ibe eyodwa. Izitezi bese zabelana ngokuphakama kwesolidi ngokulinganayo, ngakho ibhlokhi ye-10 m ngezitezi ezingu-3 m inezitezi ezi-3 ezingu-3.33 m. Indawo yesitezi iyindawo yesigaba esiqondile sesolidi ngokwayo ezingeni lalesi sitezi. Ibhlokhi eyehla emuva inezitezi ezingaphezulu ezincane, futhi indawo yonke yezakhiwo iyisamba salokho. Isisekelo yisikhala sesigaba esingaphezulu kwesisekelo sesolidi. Ivolumu yisolidi ngokwayo. Ku-IFC ngayinye inketho iyi-building element proxy (isisekelo esiphakanyiswe ekuphakameni kwesolidi) enesikhala esisodwa ngesitezi ngasinye esiphethe indawo yonke yalesi sitezi. Zonke izinketho zabelana ngesakhiwo esisodwa, nezitezi eziningi njengenketho ephakeme kakhulu. Izimo ezilula Ibhlokhi elula emile ithunyelwa njengoba imodelwe. Konke okunye kuyathunyelwa nakho, futhi uhlu luchaza ukuthi kungani imo yaso ilula: Izitezi zayo azilingani konke nesisekelo (ziyehla emuva noma ziyathambeka): ubuningi ku-BimCraft yisisekelo esiphakanyiswe ekuphakameni okugcwele, kodwa izindawo zezitezi nevolumu kungokwesolidi ngokwayo. Isolidi ayivaliwe: izitezi ezingeke zivalwe azilinganiswa futhi zibalwa njengento. Vala isolidi (Entity info ithi \"Solid: Yes\") ukuze uthole izibalo ezigcwele. Isisekelo sayo sinemigqa engaphezu kwe-outline eyodwa: eyikhulu isetshenziswa njengesisekelo. Okuhle ukukwazi IFC for BimCraft (.ifc) ayiyokukhipha okuhlukile: ithumela izimo namagama kuphela, ngaphandle kwezitezi nezindawo. Akukho okulayishwayo. Ifayela linikezwa ithebhu ye-BimCraft kulo mshini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Londoloza, vula futhi khipha i-USD","summary":"Londoloza imodeli yonke njenge-USD (.usda, .usdc noma .usdz) ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa lutho, uyivule futhi, bese wenza ungenise izimo ze-USD kwezinye izinhlelo ze-3D.","section":"tasks","order":135,"keywords":["usd","usda","usdc","usdz","openusd","incazelo yesimo esiphelele","londoloza njenge","khipha","ngenisa","ukuhlanganisa isimo","archviz","openpbr","materialx","iphakheji"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-njenge-usd","text":"Londoloza njenge-USD","level":2},{"id":"akukho-okulahlekayo","text":"Akukho okulahlekayo","level":2},{"id":"vula-noma-ngenisa-i-usd-yomunye-umuntu","text":"Vula noma ngenisa i-USD yomunye umuntu","level":2},{"id":"akikekho-okwamanje","text":"Akikekho okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-USD iwuhlobo lwesimo olwabelwana izinhlelo eziningi ze-3D, zokurenda nezokwakha. I-ModelCraft iyabhala futhi iyafunda. \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E isahlala uhlobo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E alubhalayo; i-USD iyinketho ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-njenge-usd\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-USD\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifomethi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbhalo (.usda)\u003C/span\u003E (uyafundeka, uhle ngokulawula inguqulo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EObhayinari (.usdc)\u003C/span\u003E (uncane futhi usheshe kakhulu) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E (ifayela elilodwa elinezithombe ngaphakathi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyalandwa (ohlelweni lwedeskithophu uyakhetha lapho liya khona).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkukhethwayo okufanayo kukhona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukho-okulahlekayo\"\u003EAkukho okulahlekayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ifayela le-USD eyilondoloze i-ModelCraft uthole imodeli ngokuphelele: ubuso namakhala abo, imiphetho ethambile nefihliwe, amajika, amaqembu nezakhi, amathegi, imiboniso, izilinganiso, imihlahlandlela, amapulani okusika, amalambu, izithombe ezingeniswe nokubuka. Ezinye izinhlelo zibona imodeli efanayo njengama-mesh, amaqembu, izifanekiso zezakhi, impahla yokwakha, amalambu namakhamera.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma olunye uhlelo lushintsha ijiyomethri yeqembu noma yesakhi, i-ModelCraft ivula leyo ngxenye njenge-mesh nezinguquko zigcinwe, futhi itshele ukuthi zingaki izingxenye ezifundwe ngalendlela. Indawo ehanjiswe noma esulwe kwenye inhlelo ihlala ihanjisiwe noma isuliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-noma-ngenisa-i-usd-yomunye-umuntu\"\u003EVula noma ngenisa i-USD yomunye umuntu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.usd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E ukuqala imodeli kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E elilodwa ukulengeza emodelini evulekile. Donsa namafayela alibhekisela kuwo (ezinye izingqimba, izithombe) kanye nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-mesh angena nama-normal, izixhumanisi ze-UV nemibala, ijiyomethri eyabelwanayo njengezakhi, izinto zokwakha njengemibala yokupenda, amalambu njengamalambu namakhamera njengemiboniso, ngamamitha ne-Z iphezulu, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi yefayela nei-akisi yalo ephezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akikekho-okwamanje\"\u003EAkikekho okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkunyakaza (animation), amathambo (skeletons) namagrafu wenodi ye-MaterialX akafundwa noma abhalwe njenge-USD okwamanje. Ukunyakaza nezinto zamanodi ze-ModelCraft kugcinwa efayeleni le-USD eyilondoloze, ukuze i-ModelCraft iyivule futhi, kodwa ezinye izinhlelo aziziboni. Izingqimba ifayela elibhekisela kuzo ezingafundwa yi-ModelCraft (isibonelo idokhumenti ye-MaterialX) ziyashiywa ngesaziso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-USD iwuhlobo lwesimo olwabelwana izinhlelo eziningi ze-3D, zokurenda nezokwakha. I-ModelCraft iyabhala futhi iyafunda. .modelcraft isahlala uhlobo Londoloza alubhalayo; i-USD iyinketho ku-Londoloza njenge. Londoloza njenge-USD Khetha Londoloza njenge eqenjini Ifayela (noma cindezela Ctrl+Shift+S). Khetha ifomethi: Umbhalo (.usda) (uyafundeka, uhle ngokulawula inguqulo), Obhayinari (.usdc) (uncane futhi usheshe kakhulu) noma Iphakheji (.usdz) (ifayela elilodwa elinezithombe ngaphakathi). Ifayela liyalandwa (ohlelweni lwedeskithophu uyakhetha lapho liya khona). Okukhethwayo okufanayo kukhona ku-Khipha › USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…. Akukho okulahlekayo Vula ifayela le-USD eyilondoloze i-ModelCraft uthole imodeli ngokuphelele: ubuso namakhala abo, imiphetho ethambile nefihliwe, amajika, amaqembu nezakhi, amathegi, imiboniso, izilinganiso, imihlahlandlela, amapulani okusika, amalambu, izithombe ezingeniswe nokubuka. Ezinye izinhlelo zibona imodeli efanayo njengama-mesh, amaqembu, izifanekiso zezakhi, impahla yokwakha, amalambu namakhamera. Uma olunye uhlelo lushintsha ijiyomethri yeqembu noma yesakhi, i-ModelCraft ivula leyo ngxenye njenge-mesh nezinguquko zigcinwe, futhi itshele ukuthi zingaki izingxenye ezifundwe ngalendlela. Indawo ehanjiswe noma esulwe kwenye inhlelo ihlala ihanjisiwe noma isuliwe. Vula noma ngenisa i-USD yomunye umuntu Vula ifayela le-.usd, .usda, .usdc noma .usdz ukuqala imodeli kuyo. Ngenisa elilodwa ukulengeza emodelini evulekile. Donsa namafayela alibhekisela kuwo (ezinye izingqimba, izithombe) kanye nalo. Ama-mesh angena nama-normal, izixhumanisi ze-UV nemibala, ijiyomethri eyabelwanayo njengezakhi, izinto zokwakha njengemibala yokupenda, amalambu njengamalambu namakhamera njengemiboniso, ngamamitha ne-Z iphezulu, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi yefayela nei-akisi yalo ephezulu. Akikekho okwamanje Ukunyakaza (animation), amathambo (skeletons) namagrafu wenodi ye-MaterialX akafundwa noma abhalwe njenge-USD okwamanje. Ukunyakaza nezinto zamanodi ze-ModelCraft kugcinwa efayeleni le-USD eyilondoloze, ukuze i-ModelCraft iyivule futhi, kodwa ezinye izinhlelo aziziboni. Izingqimba ifayela elibhekisela kuzo ezingafundwa yi-ModelCraft (isibonelo idokhumenti ye-MaterialX) ziyashiywa ngesaziso.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Yenza imodeli ndawonye ne-Live TeamWork","summary":"Yini eshintsha kumodeli ngesikhathi useseSessionini ye-Live TeamWork ku-CadCraft Studio: amaqembu nezingxenye zabo bonke kumodeli eyodwa, ubani angahlela ukubumba kanye, ukuhlehlisa kwakho, nokujoyina usebenzisa isiphequluli esisenethiwekhini elifanayo.","section":"tasks","order":135,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","ndawonye","sebenzisana","session","yabelana live","joyina","iqembu","ingxenye","sunduza/hudula","isikhombi","pointer","bonana","amabala","ukukhetha","ukuhlehlisa","umphathi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"sebenza-eqenjini-lakho","text":"Sebenza eqenjini lakho","level":2},{"id":"bonana","text":"Bonana","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho","text":"Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho","level":2},{"id":"joyina-usebenzisa-isiphequluli","text":"Joyina usebenzisa isiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"lapho-i-session-iphela","text":"Lapho i-session iphela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYini eyenzeka emodelini lapho abantu abaningana besebenza kuyo ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqalisa futhi ijoyine i-Live TeamWork session (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi lingokwemodeli uqobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenza-eqenjini-lakho\"\u003ESebenza eqenjini lakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu uhlela imodeli efanayo, futhi ushintsho lwakho lubonakala masinyane. Ukuhlanganiswa kushintsha kuya ngokuthi yini oyishintshayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhambisa, ukuqamba, ukukhalazela noma ukufihla amaqembu nezingxenye ezibekiwe\u003C/strong\u003E kuyahlanganiswa: abantu ababili abahambisa amaqembu amabili bonke bagcina ukuhamba kwabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIjiyomethri ngaphakathi kweqembu elilodwa\u003C/strong\u003E (imiphetho nobuso bayo: ukudweba, ukusunduza/ukuhudula, ukusula) iyisinto esisodwa. Uma abantu ababili beshintsha iqembu elifanayo ngesikhathi esifanayo, ushintsho lwesibili luyahlehliswa futhi ibha yesimo iyasho lokho. Amaqembu ahlukene akuphazamisani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIjiyomethri engenayo iqembu\u003C/strong\u003E (engekho kunoma yiliphi iqembu) iyiqembu lemodeli uqobo: ngumuntu owodwa kuphela okwazi ukuyishintsha ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgakho vumelanani ukuthi ubani usebenza kuliphi iqembu, noma yenzele ngalinye iqembu lengxenye yomuntu ngamunye ngaphambi kokuqala. Izimhlahlandlela, izilinganiso nezindiza zesigaba zihlanganiswa ngayinye; imiboniso, amathegi, izitezi nama-axis omdwebo ahamba kumuntu owayishintsha ekugcineni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bonana\"\u003EBonana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu kwi-session unombala wakhe. Ubona i-pointer yomuntu ngamunye njengencibilili ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwayo, ngokujula kombono obheka kuwo, nebhokisi elinamachashaza ngombala wakhe elizungeze lokho akukhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-pointer, amagama nokukhethwa kuphela kwe-session: akugcinwa efayeleni futhi akuyi ku-undo yoyonke. Ziyashelela ziye lapho ngamunye ekhona, ngakho zihlala zishelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho\"\u003EUkuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlehlisa isinyathelo sakho sokugcina ishiye eyabanye. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo kusukela ngaleso sikhathi, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo ithi ngubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joyina-usebenzisa-isiphequluli\"\u003EJoyina usebenzisa isiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlungu lethimba elingenaye i-Studio lingaskena ikhodi yesithombe ngaphansi komphathi ngefoni, ithebulethi noma ikhompyutha esenethiwekhini elifanayo. I-ModelCraft ivulwa esiphequluleni ibe igcwaliswa yimodeli yomphathi uma umphathi evumela ukungena. Isixhumanisi sokumemela singavumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan se-app, bonke abanye bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi siyasebenza kuphela kuze kube yilapho i-session yomphathi ivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-i-session-iphela\"\u003ELapho i-session iphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphathi kuphela ugcina imodeli. Bonke abanye bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yigcine uma ufuna ukuyigcina.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Yini eyenzeka emodelini lapho abantu abaningana besebenza kuyo ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqalisa futhi ijoyine i-Live TeamWork session (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi lingokwemodeli uqobo. Sebenza eqenjini lakho Wonke umuntu uhlela imodeli efanayo, futhi ushintsho lwakho lubonakala masinyane. Ukuhlanganiswa kushintsha kuya ngokuthi yini oyishintshayo: Ukuhambisa, ukuqamba, ukukhalazela noma ukufihla amaqembu nezingxenye ezibekiwe kuyahlanganiswa: abantu ababili abahambisa amaqembu amabili bonke bagcina ukuhamba kwabo. Ijiyomethri ngaphakathi kweqembu elilodwa (imiphetho nobuso bayo: ukudweba, ukusunduza/ukuhudula, ukusula) iyisinto esisodwa. Uma abantu ababili beshintsha iqembu elifanayo ngesikhathi esifanayo, ushintsho lwesibili luyahlehliswa futhi ibha yesimo iyasho lokho. Amaqembu ahlukene akuphazamisani. Ijiyomethri engenayo iqembu (engekho kunoma yiliphi iqembu) iyiqembu lemodeli uqobo: ngumuntu owodwa kuphela okwazi ukuyishintsha ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ngakho vumelanani ukuthi ubani usebenza kuliphi iqembu, noma yenzele ngalinye iqembu lengxenye yomuntu ngamunye ngaphambi kokuqala. Izimhlahlandlela, izilinganiso nezindiza zesigaba zihlanganiswa ngayinye; imiboniso, amathegi, izitezi nama-axis omdwebo ahamba kumuntu owayishintsha ekugcineni. Bonana Wonke umuntu kwi-session unombala wakhe. Ubona i-pointer yomuntu ngamunye njengencibilili ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwayo, ngokujula kombono obheka kuwo, nebhokisi elinamachashaza ngombala wakhe elizungeze lokho akukhethile. Ama-pointer, amagama nokukhethwa kuphela kwe-session: akugcinwa efayeleni futhi akuyi ku-undo yoyonke. Ziyashelela ziye lapho ngamunye ekhona, ngakho zihlala zishelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane. Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa isinyathelo sakho sokugcina ishiye eyabanye. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo kusukela ngaleso sikhathi, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo ithi ngubani. Joyina usebenzisa isiphequluli Ilungu lethimba elingenaye i-Studio lingaskena ikhodi yesithombe ngaphansi komphathi ngefoni, ithebulethi noma ikhompyutha esenethiwekhini elifanayo. I-ModelCraft ivulwa esiphequluleni ibe igcwaliswa yimodeli yomphathi uma umphathi evumela ukungena. Isixhumanisi sokumemela singavumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan se-app, bonke abanye bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi siyasebenza kuphela kuze kube yilapho i-session yomphathi ivulekile. Lapho i-session iphela Umphathi kuphela ugcina imodeli. Bonke abanye bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yigcine uma ufuna ukuyigcina.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kusuka kwabanye abenzi bemodeli","summary":"Ukuthi izinkambiso zokumodela nge-push/pull zihlanganisa kanjani ne-ModelCraft, inkinobho ngenkinobho, kanye nokuhluka okuqamba abantu ngokungazelelwe.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["ukushintsha","ukudlulisela","okujwayelekile","umehluko","push pull modeler","skp","izinkinobho","izinkambiso","qhathanisa","ibhokisi lezilinganiso","outliner","ulwazi lwento"],"headings":[{"id":"izinkambiso-ezidlulelayo","text":"Izinkambiso ezidlulelayo","level":2},{"id":"okuhluka-okuqamba-abantu","text":"Okuhluka okuqamba abantu","level":2},{"id":"ukugcina-kuwukulanda","text":"Ukugcina kuwukulanda","level":3},{"id":"iyangenisa-amafayela-skp-kodwa-ayiwagcini","text":"Iyangenisa amafayela .skp, kodwa ayiwagcini","level":3},{"id":"akukho-imenyu-yokuchofoza-kwesokudla","text":"Akukho imenyu yokuchofoza kwesokudla","level":3},{"id":"amayunithi-ahlala-ebhaleni-lesimo","text":"Amayunithi ahlala ebhaleni lesimo","level":3},{"id":"ipeyinti-linezinto-zalo","text":"Ipeyinti linezinto zalo","level":3},{"id":"isikali-sifana-ngokulinganayo-ngaphandle-kwamabhokisi-okubamba","text":"Isikali sifana ngokulinganayo, ngaphandle kwamabhokisi okubamba","level":3},{"id":"ukujikisa-kukhetha-ipuleni-lakho-kusuka-lapho-ucindezela-khona","text":"Ukujikisa kukhetha ipuleni lakho kusuka lapho ucindezela khona","level":3},{"id":"ukuqagela-kusuka-emaphoyinteni-owadlula-kuwo","text":"Ukuqagela kusuka emaphoyinteni owadlula kuwo","level":3},{"id":"okufanayo-kusebenzisa-umphetho-owadlula-kuwo-ngaphambi-kokuqala","text":"Okufanayo kusebenzisa umphetho owadlula kuwo ngaphambi kokuqala","level":3},{"id":"amakhophi-weqembu-ayaxhunyiwe","text":"Amakhophi weqembu ayaxhunyiwe","level":3},{"id":"i-space-ayihambisi","text":"I-Space ayihambisi","level":3},{"id":"ukuskrola-ngeminwe-emibili-kusondeza","text":"Ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza","level":3},{"id":"izinhlanganisela-ezigoqayo-azihlukani","text":"Izinhlanganisela ezigoqayo azihlukani","level":3},{"id":"okungekho","text":"Okungekho","level":3},{"id":"izinkinobho-ezigcinwa-isiphequluli","text":"Izinkinobho ezigcinwa isiphequluli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma usenze imodeli ku-SketchUp, i-ModelCraft izokuzwakala ojwayelekile: umqondo ofanayo wobuso ne-push/pull, amakhiye amathuluzi afanayo, ibhokisi lenani lapho uthayipha khona ngaphandle kokuchofoza, ukuqagela ngama-akisi abomvu, aluhlaza nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, amaqembu, izinto ezingakhomponentiwe, i-Outliner, ulwazi lwento nezigcawu. Leli khasi libhala lokho okudluliselwa ngqo nokubaluleke kakhulu, okungadluliseki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambiso-ezidlulelayo\"\u003EIzinkambiso ezidlulelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjwayelekile ku-\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-ModelCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela i-Space ukuze ukhethe, L umugqa, R unxande, C indilinga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela P Push/Pull, M Hambisa, Q Jikisa, S Shintsha usayizi, E Isifafazi, T Ithephu yokulinganisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela O Zungeza, H Shelelisa, Z Sondeza, Shift+Z Sondeza ukuze konke kubonakale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela G ukwenza ikhompoment\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza iqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha ebhokisini lezilinganiso ngaphandle kokuchofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo, kwibhokisi lenani elisezansi. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthole unxande, \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E kumacala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E ngemva kokukopisha ngo-Move\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo; \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E nayo iyasebenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ephoyinteni noma ekuhambeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha inombolo engenalutho kumodeli ye-architectural-inch uthole amainshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuze uzungeze, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuze ushelele, ivili ukusondeza esikhombeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili nge-Push/Pull ukuphinda ibanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkinobho zomcibisholo zokukhiya obomvu, oluhlaza, obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka nokufana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E obomvu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oluhlaza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ofanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba i-Shift ukukhiya ukuqagela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl (Option ku-Mac) ukukopisha ngesikhathi uhamba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift ukushintsha, Ctrl ukwengeza, Shift+Ctrl ukususa ekukhetheni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo; ku-Mac sebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lapho kuthi Ctrl\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfasitela elisuka kwesokunxele kuya kwesokudla, ukuwela ukusuka kwesokudla kuya kwesokunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthuluzi le-Dimension ukubhala amabanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, nokunye: thayipha ubude obusha kwisilinganiso bese imodeli iyashintsha ibe lobo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003EIsilinganiso nokushintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili ubuso ukuze uthole ubuso namaphethelo; chofoza kathathu ukuze uthole konke okuxhunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uliguqule; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuvala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba umugqa kubuso ukuze wehlukanise; sula umphetho phakathi kobuso obulingana ukuze ubuhlanganise\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESunduza unxande wefasitela udonse udonge ukuze uyinqume\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso bangemuva obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka okumnyama; Reverse Faces\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbala ofanayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse face\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzigcawu njengamathebhu phezu kwe-view, Page Up ne-Page Down\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScenes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithunzi zisuka kusuku, isikhathi, ububanzi bendawo nobude bendawo, nenyakatho eluhlaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo, kwiphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStyle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhluka-okuqamba-abantu\"\u003EOkuhluka okuqamba abantu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukugcina-kuwukulanda\"\u003EUkugcina kuwukulanda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho Save ebhala phezu kwefayela owayivulile, akukho ingxoxo ye-Save As ngegama, akukho ukugcina okuzenzakalelayo, nofayela lokusekela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ilanda ifayela elisha le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E njalo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho yokulanda. Gcina kaningi, bese uqamba noma uhambise amafayela ngokwakho. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\"\u003EVula, gcina, ngenisa nokukhipha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"iyangenisa-amafayela-skp-kodwa-ayiwagcini\"\u003EIyangenisa amafayela .skp, kodwa ayiwagcini\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp ngomfundi waye we-ModelCraft, ekhasini: amaqembu, amakhompoment, imibala, izakhiwo kubuso, amathegi namaphethelo athambile ayangena. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#skp-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"skp-files\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe\u003C/a\u003E. I-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukugcina i-\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E: ukubuyela emuva, khipha i-Collada kwi-ModelCraft bese uyingenisa ku-SketchUp.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akukho-imenyu-yokuchofoza-kwesokudla\"\u003EAkukho imenyu yokuchofoza kwesokudla\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ngesokudla kuhambisa; ukuchofoza ngesokudla akwenzi lutho. Imiyalo ongayithola emenyu yomongo itholakala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse face\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component\u003C/span\u003E) nasqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrganize\u003C/span\u003E ethulusini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amayunithi-ahlala-ebhaleni-lesimo\"\u003EAmayunithi ahlala ebhaleni lesimo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho Model Info noma ukukhetha isifanekiso. Ikhethi yamayunithi isezansi ngakwesokudla. Imodeli entsha iqala ngamafidi namainshi e-US nasezindaweni ezinye ngamamilimitha, ngokusuka ezilungiselelweni zolimi lwesiphequluli sakho. Amadesimali asebenzisa njalo ichashazi: \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m\u003C/code\u003E, hhayi \u003Ccode\u003E2,5m\u003C/code\u003E, ngoba ikhoma ihlukanisa amanani njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ipeyinti-linezinto-zalo\"\u003EIpeyinti linezinto zalo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) idaya imibala eqinile nezinto ezisemkhakheni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterials\u003C/span\u003E: ibhricks, ungqimba wezindonga, ushingles wophahla, ukhuni, ilitshe nokunye, eyadwetshwa yi-ModelCraft. Awukwazi ukulayisha isithombe sakho njengempahla okwamanje; izindwangu ezifika ngamafayela angeniswe ziyagcinwa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003EPenda ngemibala nempahla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isikali-sifana-ngokulinganayo-ngaphandle-kwamabhokisi-okubamba\"\u003EIsikali sifana ngokulinganayo, ngaphandle kwamabhokisi okubamba\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha usayizi akuboniswa ibhokisi elinezinsimbi zokubamba. Chofoza indawo ehlala ingaguquki, indawo yesikhombo, bese kuba usayizi omusha noma isici esithayiphiwe. Lokho kwenza ngokulinganayo ezindleleni zonke. Ukuze unwebe ngohlangothi olulodwa, sunduza noma hambisa ubuso, noma thayipha kabusha ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kweqembu ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Eshintsha usayizi ngesilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukujikisa-kukhetha-ipuleni-lakho-kusuka-lapho-ucindezela-khona\"\u003EUkujikisa kukhetha ipuleni lakho kusuka lapho ucindezela khona\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho protractor ehlala ebusweni njengoba uhambisa izinkinobho zomcibisholo ukukhetha ipuleni. Chofoza isikhungo ebusweni ukuze ujikise kuleyo puleni, noma emhlabathini ukujikisa ngokuthi kuqonde phezulu. Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zizungeza ukubuka ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuqagela-kusuka-emaphoyinteni-owadlula-kuwo\"\u003EUkuqagela kusuka emaphoyinteni owadlula kuwo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ibambelela kuziqondiso zama-akisi kusuka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuphoyinti lakho lokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E, nakumaphoyinti, emigqeni nasezindaweni ngaphansi kwesikhombi. Ayilandeli iqondiso kusuka kuphoyinti owalidlule nje (ukuqagela okuqhubekayo &quot;from point&quot;). Ukuze uhambisane nekhona elikude, khiya i-akisi ngenkinobho yomcibisholo bese uhlola leliphoyinti: iphoyinti elikhiyiwe liyashelela lihambisane nalo. Noma beka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Eisiqondisi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okufanayo-kusebenzisa-umphetho-owadlula-kuwo-ngaphambi-kokuqala\"\u003EOkufanayo kusebenzisa umphetho owadlula kuwo ngaphambi kokuqala\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqagela okufanayo nokuthwele kusebenzisa umphetho wokugcina okwadlula kuwo isikhombi \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E, hhayi imiphetho oyihlola ngesikhathi udweba. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference#parallel-and-perpendicular\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\" data-hash=\"parallel-and-perpendicular\"\u003EUkuqagela nokubambelela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amakhophi-weqembu-ayaxhunyiwe\"\u003EAmakhophi weqembu ayaxhunyiwe\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukopisha iqembu nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E kwenza indawo yesibili yeqembu elifanayo, ngakho ukuhlela okukodwa kushintsha kokubili, njengakukhompoment. I-SketchUp yenza amaqembu azimele. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"i-space-ayihambisi\"\u003EI-Space ayihambisi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, njengakwi-SketchUp. Ezinye izinhlelo zewebhu ukubamba i-Space kuhambisa; lapha akwenzi lokho. Donsa ngesokudla kuhambisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuskrola-ngeminwe-emibili-kusondeza\"\u003EUkuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad, setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Scrolling kube yi-Trackpad: iminwe emibili ijikisa ukubuka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E neminwe emibili ihambisa, ukukhama kusondeza. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#on-a-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"on-a-trackpad\"\u003EUkujikisa, ukushelelisa nokusondeza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma izandla zakho zazi izinkinobho ze-Blender kunaseSketchUp, khetha isitayela semenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisebenza ekukhethweni kanyekanye, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhipha (push/pull), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaphinda, nebha yemenyu yekhanda (File, Edit, View, Select, Add, Object, Mesh) ithatha indawo yethuluzi. Uma usuvela ku-SketchUp, isitayela se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush-pull\u003C/span\u003E sinika ibha yemenyu efana nayo phezu kwamathuluzi afanayo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, izinkinobho ne-mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izinhlanganisela-ezigoqayo-azihlukani\"\u003EIzinhlanganisela ezigoqayo azihlukani\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPush/pull ihlukanisa ubuso obungemuva kwento efanayo, kodwa izinto ezimbili ezihlukene ezisunduzwa zingene kwezinye azihlangani. Azikho i-Intersect Faces nezithuluzi zesisekelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okungekho\"\u003EOkungekho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkudweba mahhala, i-Trim, i-Split kanye ne-Outer Shell, izinto zakho zesithombe, izandiso, nethuluzi lokwakha amashidi awakho kulokhu okwakhiwe. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kutshela okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-ezigcinwa-isiphequluli\"\u003EIzinkinobho ezigcinwa isiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft isebenza kusiphequluli, ngakho izinkinobho ezimbalwa zesiphequluli, hhayi zohlelo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivula iwindi lesiphequluli (sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E), futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ithebhu. Uma unezinguquko ezingakagciniwe, isiphequluli siyabuza ngaphambi kokuvala. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#shortcuts-the-browser-keeps\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"shortcuts-the-browser-keeps\"\u003EIzinkinobho, izinkinamba kanye ne-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma usenze imodeli ku-SketchUp, i-ModelCraft izokuzwakala ojwayelekile: umqondo ofanayo wobuso ne-push/pull, amakhiye amathuluzi afanayo, ibhokisi lenani lapho uthayipha khona ngaphandle kokuchofoza, ukuqagela ngama-akisi abomvu, aluhlaza nabuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, amaqembu, izinto ezingakhomponentiwe, i-Outliner, ulwazi lwento nezigcawu. Leli khasi libhala lokho okudluliselwa ngqo nokubaluleke kakhulu, okungadluliseki. Izinkambiso ezidlulelayo Ujwayelekile ku- Ku-ModelCraft Cindezela i-Space ukuze ukhethe, L umugqa, R unxande, C indilinga Okufanayo: Space, L, R, C Cindezela P Push/Pull, M Hambisa, Q Jikisa, S Shintsha usayizi, E Isifafazi, T Ithephu yokulinganisa Okufanayo: P, M, Q, S, E, T Cindezela O Zungeza, H Shelelisa, Z Sondeza, Shift+Z Sondeza ukuze konke kubonakale Okufanayo: O, H, Z, Shift+Z Cindezela G ukwenza ikhompoment Okufanayo: G. Shift+G yenza iqembu Thayipha ebhokisini lezilinganiso ngaphandle kokuchofoza Okufanayo, kwibhokisi lenani elisezansi. Cindezela Enter Thayipha 4m,3m ukuze uthole unxande, 12s kumacala Okufanayo Thayipha 3x noma /3 ngemva kokukopisha ngo-Move Okufanayo; *3 nayo iyasebenza Thayipha [x,y,z] noma \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ephoyinteni noma ekuhambeni Okufanayo Thayipha inombolo engenalutho kumodeli ye-architectural-inch uthole amainshi Okufanayo Donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuze uzungeze, Shift+donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuze ushelele, ivili ukusondeza esikhombeni Okufanayo Chofoza kabili nge-Push/Pull ukuphinda ibanga Okufanayo Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zokukhiya obomvu, oluhlaza, obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka nokufana Okufanayo: → obomvu, ← oluhlaza, ↑ obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, ↓ ofanayo Bamba i-Shift ukukhiya ukuqagela Okufanayo Ctrl (Option ku-Mac) ukukopisha ngesikhathi uhamba Ctrl, Ctrl noma Alt, kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha Shift ukushintsha, Ctrl ukwengeza, Shift+Ctrl ukususa ekukhetheni Okufanayo; ku-Mac sebenzisa Ctrl lapho kuthi Ctrl Ifasitela elisuka kwesokunxele kuya kwesokudla, ukuwela ukusuka kwesokudla kuya kwesokunxele Okufanayo Ithuluzi le-Dimension ukubhala amabanga D, nokunye: thayipha ubude obusha kwisilinganiso bese imodeli iyashintsha ibe lobo. Bheka Isilinganiso nokushintsha usayizi Chofoza kabili ubuso ukuze uthole ubuso namaphethelo; chofoza kathathu ukuze uthole konke okuxhunyiwe Okufanayo Chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uliguqule; Esc ukuvala Okufanayo Dweba umugqa kubuso ukuze wehlukanise; sula umphetho phakathi kobuso obulingana ukuze ubuhlanganise Okufanayo Sunduza unxande wefasitela udonse udonge ukuze uyinqume Okufanayo Ubuso bangemuva obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka okumnyama; Reverse Faces Umbala ofanayo; Reverse face ku-Entity info Izigcawu njengamathebhu phezu kwe-view, Page Up ne-Page Down Okufanayo, nge-Play ephaneli ye-Scenes Izithunzi zisuka kusuku, isikhathi, ububanzi bendawo nobude bendawo, nenyakatho eluhlaza Okufanayo, kwiphaneli ye-Style Okuhluka okuqamba abantu Ukugcina kuwukulanda Akukho Save ebhala phezu kwefayela owayivulile, akukho ingxoxo ye-Save As ngegama, akukho ukugcina okuzenzakalelayo, nofayela lokusekela. Save (Ctrl+S) ilanda ifayela elisha le-.modelcraft njalo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho yokulanda. Gcina kaningi, bese uqamba noma uhambise amafayela ngokwakho. Bheka Vula, gcina, ngenisa nokukhipha. Iyangenisa amafayela .skp, kodwa ayiwagcini Import ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp ngomfundi waye we-ModelCraft, ekhasini: amaqembu, amakhompoment, imibala, izakhiwo kubuso, amathegi namaphethelo athambile ayangena. Bheka Amafomethi amafayela ngokuningiliziwe. I-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukugcina i-.skp: ukubuyela emuva, khipha i-Collada kwi-ModelCraft bese uyingenisa ku-SketchUp. Akukho imenyu yokuchofoza kwesokudla Donsa ngesokudla kuhambisa; ukuchofoza ngesokudla akwenzi lutho. Imiyalo ongayithola emenyu yomongo itholakala ku-Entity info (Reverse face, Edit, Explode, Make unique, Make component) nasqenjini le-Organize ethulusini. Amayunithi ahlala ebhaleni lesimo Akukho Model Info noma ukukhetha isifanekiso. Ikhethi yamayunithi isezansi ngakwesokudla. Imodeli entsha iqala ngamafidi namainshi e-US nasezindaweni ezinye ngamamilimitha, ngokusuka ezilungiselelweni zolimi lwesiphequluli sakho. Amadesimali asebenzisa njalo ichashazi: 2.5m, hhayi 2,5m, ngoba ikhoma ihlukanisa amanani njalo. Ipeyinti linezinto zalo Paint (B) idaya imibala eqinile nezinto ezisemkhakheni Materials: ibhricks, ungqimba wezindonga, ushingles wophahla, ukhuni, ilitshe nokunye, eyadwetshwa yi-ModelCraft. Awukwazi ukulayisha isithombe sakho njengempahla okwamanje; izindwangu ezifika ngamafayela angeniswe ziyagcinwa. Bheka Penda ngemibala nempahla. Isikali sifana ngokulinganayo, ngaphandle kwamabhokisi okubamba Ukushintsha usayizi akuboniswa ibhokisi elinezinsimbi zokubamba. Chofoza indawo ehlala ingaguquki, indawo yesikhombo, bese kuba usayizi omusha noma isici esithayiphiwe. Lokho kwenza ngokulinganayo ezindleleni zonke. Ukuze unwebe ngohlangothi olulodwa, sunduza noma hambisa ubuso, noma thayipha kabusha ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama kweqembu ku-Entity info, noma shintsha usayizi ngesilinganiso. Ukujikisa kukhetha ipuleni lakho kusuka lapho ucindezela khona Akukho protractor ehlala ebusweni njengoba uhambisa izinkinobho zomcibisholo ukukhetha ipuleni. Chofoza isikhungo ebusweni ukuze ujikise kuleyo puleni, noma emhlabathini ukujikisa ngokuthi kuqonde phezulu. Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zizungeza ukubuka ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala. Ukuqagela kusuka emaphoyinteni owadlula kuwo I-ModelCraft ibambelela kuziqondiso zama-akisi kusuka kuphoyinti lakho lokuqala, nakumaphoyinti, emigqeni nasezindaweni ngaphansi kwesikhombi. Ayilandeli iqondiso kusuka kuphoyinti owalidlule nje (ukuqagela okuqhubekayo \"from point\"). Ukuze uhambisane nekhona elikude, khiya i-akisi ngenkinobho yomcibisholo bese uhlola leliphoyinti: iphoyinti elikhiyiwe liyashelela lihambisane nalo. Noma beka isiqondisi. Okufanayo kusebenzisa umphetho owadlula kuwo ngaphambi kokuqala Ukuqagela okufanayo nokuthwele kusebenzisa umphetho wokugcina okwadlula kuwo isikhombi ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala, hhayi imiphetho oyihlola ngesikhathi udweba. Bheka Ukuqagela nokubambelela. Amakhophi weqembu ayaxhunyiwe Ukukopisha iqembu nge-Move kwenza indawo yesibili yeqembu elifanayo, ngakho ukuhlela okukodwa kushintsha kokubili, njengakukhompoment. I-SketchUp yenza amaqembu azimele. Bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga. I-Space ayihambisi Space ikhetha Select, njengakwi-SketchUp. Ezinye izinhlelo zewebhu ukubamba i-Space kuhambisa; lapha akwenzi lokho. Donsa ngesokudla kuhambisa. Ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza Ku-trackpad, setha Settings › ModelCraft › Scrolling kube yi-Trackpad: iminwe emibili ijikisa ukubuka, Shift neminwe emibili ihambisa, ukukhama kusondeza. Bheka Ukujikisa, ukushelelisa nokusondeza. Uma izandla zakho zazi izinkinobho ze-Blender kunaseSketchUp, khetha isitayela semenyu ye-Modeler: G, R kanye S zisebenza ekukhethweni kanyekanye, E iyakhipha (push/pull), Shift+D iyaphinda, nebha yemenyu yekhanda (File, Edit, View, Select, Add, Object, Mesh) ithatha indawo yethuluzi. Uma usuvela ku-SketchUp, isitayela se-Push-pull sinika ibha yemenyu efana nayo phezu kwamathuluzi afanayo. Bheka Imenyu, izinkinobho ne-mouse. Izinhlanganisela ezigoqayo azihlukani Push/pull ihlukanisa ubuso obungemuva kwento efanayo, kodwa izinto ezimbili ezihlukene ezisunduzwa zingene kwezinye azihlangani. Azikho i-Intersect Faces nezithuluzi zesisekelo. Okungekho Ukudweba mahhala, i-Trim, i-Split kanye ne-Outer Shell, izinto zakho zesithombe, izandiso, nethuluzi lokwakha amashidi awakho kulokhu okwakhiwe. Okungakakwakhiwa kutshela okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Izinkinobho ezigcinwa isiphequluli I-ModelCraft isebenza kusiphequluli, ngakho izinkinobho ezimbalwa zesiphequluli, hhayi zohlelo. Ctrl+N ivula iwindi lesiphequluli (sebenzisa New), futhi Ctrl+W ivala ithebhu. Uma unezinguquko ezingakagciniwe, isiphequluli siyabuza ngaphambi kokuvala. Bheka Izinkinobho, izinkinamba kanye ne-trackpad.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft","summary":"Khetha isitayela sokhiye oyaziyo, yenza i-trackpad izungeze futhi ishelelise ngaphandle kwezinkinobho zekhamera, bese uvula noma uvale ukubambelela nokushayisana kwezinto eziqinile.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["izilungiselelo","izintandokazo","izilawuli","isitayela sokhiye","imephu yokhiye","izinkinobho ezisheshayo","blender","trackpad","touchpad","scroll","zungeza","pinch","bambelela","snap","snapping","collide","shayisana","ukushayisana","ukuvuleka","dlula"],"headings":[{"id":"izilawuli-yiziphi-izinkinobho-zekhibhodi-nezinkinobho-zembewu","text":"Izilawuli: yiziphi izinkinobho zekhibhodi nezinkinobho zembewu","level":2},{"id":"ukuskrola-ivili-lembewu-noma-i-trackpad","text":"Ukuskrola: ivili lembewu noma i-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukubambelela","text":"Ukubambelela","level":2},{"id":"izinto-eziqinile-zima-lapho-zithinta","text":"Izinto eziqinile zima lapho zithinta","level":2},{"id":"ibhedi-yomshicileli-ye-3d","text":"Ibhedi yomshicileli ye-3D","level":2},{"id":"ukuzungeza-nokushelelisa","text":"Ukuzungeza nokushelelisa","level":2},{"id":"isikhombisi-sekhona","text":"Isikhombisi sekhona","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E ngegiya elisebhawini le-app noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ithebhu yokuqala, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, ibamba izilungiselelo ezingezale le-app; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E ibamba ezabelwana ngazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amaphaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft zikhona kuphela kule-app: uzishintsha lapha, futhi leli bhrawuza liyazikhumbula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilawuli-yiziphi-izinkinobho-zekhibhodi-nezinkinobho-zembewu\"\u003EIzilawuli: yiziphi izinkinobho zekhibhodi nezinkinobho zembewu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzitayela ezimbili zokhiye. Zishintshe lapha, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinobho: Sunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinobho: Modeler\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla esiphansi kombono, noma ekugcineni kwemenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E yethuluzi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela sokusunduza-hudula\u003C/strong\u003E (esokuqala; izinhlamvu zabamodeli besunduza-hudula abafana ne-SketchUp): inhlamvu ikhetha ithuluzi — \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umugqa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unxande, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sunduza/hudula, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hambisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jikisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shintsha usayizi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza isakhi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIzinkinobho nezenzo zembewu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela se-Modeler\u003C/strong\u003E (izinkinobho zabamodeli bemesh abafana ne-Blender): khetha kuqala, bese wenza isenzo ngokushesha esikhethweni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasihambisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasijikisa futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasishintsha usayizi kusuka lapho inkomba ikhona — akudingeki ukuchofoza kuqala. Ngenkathi sihamba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhiya i-eksisi ebomvu, eluhlaza noma eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, inombolo oyibhalayo isetha ibanga (noma amadigri, noma isilinganiso), bese ukuchofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyasibeka phansi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ukuchofoza ngesokudla kuyasibuyisela. Bese ubuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitayela sokhiye sifanana nesinqumo semenyu: isitayela se-Modeler yisitayela semenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ukukhetha okukodwa kukhetha okunye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, izinkinobho nembewu\u003C/a\u003E. Uhlu olugcwele lwe-Modeler lusechazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard#modeler-keys\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"modeler-keys\"\u003EIzinkinobho nezenzo zembewu\u003C/a\u003E. Amathiphu ethuluzi nekhadi lokuqala alandela isitayela osikhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuskrola-ivili-lembewu-noma-i-trackpad\"\u003EUkuskrola: ivili lembewu noma i-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYibheke wena\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala): ModelCraft iyakubona ukuskrola. Ukuskrola okuya ngasohlangothini noma okuncane, njengoba i-trackpad iyithumela, kuzungeza; izinotshi eziphelele zevili zisondeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvili lembewu\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuskrola njalo kusondeza ngasenkombeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E: swayipha ngeminwe emibili ukuze uzungeze, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uswayipha ukuze ushelelise, cindezela ukuze usondeze. Awudingi izinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZungeza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShelelisa\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza\u003C/span\u003E ngalutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkucindezela kusondeza kuzo zonke izinketho. Uma &quot;Yibheke wena&quot; ingabhula ngembewu noma i-trackpad yakho, khetha leyo onayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsitayelweni se-Modeler ungazungeza futhi ngokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhudule, futhi ushelelise nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option Shift\"\u003E⌥⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+Shift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokuhudula — kuhle kulaphu elingenayo inkinobho ephakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubambelela\"\u003EUkubambelela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBambelela emaphoyintini, emiphethweni nasemahlakaleni\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni) iyawudonsela umkhombi kuma-endpoint, kumaphakathi, emiphethweni, kumahlahlandlela nasezinxeleni ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezokwesibhakabhaka — bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003EUkuhlola\u003C/a\u003E. Yicima uma ufuna ukubeka okuthile ngokukhululeka eduze kwezinye izinto ngaphandle kokuthi kugxume. Ubuso, umhlabathi nokukhiya kwe-eksisi kusasebenza nalapho ukubambelela kucishiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla esiphansi kombono yenza okufanayo kulo msebenzi wale seshini (iyagcinwa nayo). Esitayelweni se-Modeler, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayishintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-eziqinile-zima-lapho-zithinta\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile zima lapho zithinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMisa izinto eziqinile lapho zithinta\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni) igcina udonga lungakhukhulwa ludlule kwelinye udonga. Nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E (nange-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, nokunamathisela bese uhambisa nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ukukhethwa kuyashelela kuze kufike esolidini elinye bese kuyama kuthinta lona; nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E ubuso buyema lapho buhlangabezana nesolidi elinye. Ukuphumula phezu kwento nokushelela ngayo kuyavumelekile — kumiswa kuphela ukungena ngaphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto ezivele zivezelana lapho uqala zingakhipha zihlukaniswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uphushe into ngamabomu, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShayisana\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla esiphansi (noma sula lesi silungiselelo), yenza ukuhambisa, bese uchofoza futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushayisana kuhlolwa ngokuhambisa nokusunduza/hudula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E awakahlolwa okwamanje, futhi ijiyomethri eyindilinga ethintayo ihlangana njengakuso njalo: gcina izinto ezihlukene ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Eamaqembu\u003C/a\u003E ukuze zihlale zihlukene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibhedi-yomshicileli-ye-3d\"\u003EIbhedi yomshicileli ye-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi webhedi yomshicileli wakho: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukasethwa\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala), 180 × 180 × 180, 220 × 220 × 250, 256 × 256 × 256 noma 300 × 300 × 400 mm. Khetha usayizi oseduze kakhulu kwevolumu yokwakha yomshicileli wakho. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EHlola ukushicilela nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E bese isho ukuthi imodeli inkulu kunebhedi; nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukasethwa\u003C/span\u003E, usayizi awuhlolwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuzungeza-nokushelelisa\"\u003EUkuzungeza nokushelelisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZungeza ngokuzungeze lokho okungaphansi kwekhesa\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni): ukuzungeza kujikeleza engxenyeni yemodeli engaphansi kwenkomba, nokushelelisa kugcina leliphoyinti ngaphansi kwenkomba; endaweni engenalutho kokubili kusebenzisa indawo ephakathi kombono. Vala ukuze uzungeze njalo indawo ephakathi kombono. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsivinini sokuzungeza\u003C/strong\u003E nesokushelelisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsivinini sokushelelisa\u003C/strong\u003E siyahamba kusuka ku-0.25× kuya ku-3× (1× iyisimo sokuqala) futhi sisebenza embewini, ku-trackpad, ekuthinteni nakumicibisho yekhibhodi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EUkuzungeza, ukushelelisa nokusondeza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhombisi-sekhona\"\u003EIsikhombisi sekhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkubonakala ekhoneni le-3D view: \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhyubu yombono\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala; phezulu ngakwesokudla — chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, hudula ukuze uzungeze, hudula indilinga yekhampasi ukuze ujikise imodeli), \u003Cstrong\u003EIsithonjana se-eksisi\u003C/strong\u003E (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngakwesobunxele esiphansi oluguquka ngombono: X kubomvu, Y kuluhlaza, Z kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho\u003C/strong\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/view-cube\"\u003EIkhyubu yombono\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula Izilungiselelo ngegiya elisebhawini le-app noma nge-Ctrl+,. Ithebhu yokuqala, ModelCraft, ibamba izilungiselelo ezingezale le-app; General ibamba ezabelwana ngazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amaphaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft zikhona kuphela kule-app: uzishintsha lapha, futhi leli bhrawuza liyazikhumbula. Izilawuli: yiziphi izinkinobho zekhibhodi nezinkinobho zembewu Izitayela ezimbili zokhiye. Zishintshe lapha, nge-Izinkinobho: Sunduza/hudula / Izinkinobho: Modeler ngakwesokudla esiphansi kombono, noma ekugcineni kwemenyu ethi Okwengeziwe yethuluzi: Isitayela sokusunduza-hudula (esokuqala; izinhlamvu zabamodeli besunduza-hudula abafana ne-SketchUp): inhlamvu ikhetha ithuluzi — L umugqa, R unxande, P sunduza/hudula, M hambisa, Q jikisa, S shintsha usayizi, G yenza isakhi. Bona Izinkinobho nezenzo zembewu. Isitayela se-Modeler (izinkinobho zabamodeli bemesh abafana ne-Blender): khetha kuqala, bese wenza isenzo ngokushesha esikhethweni. G iyasihambisa, R iyasijikisa futhi S iyasishintsha usayizi kusuka lapho inkomba ikhona — akudingeki ukuchofoza kuqala. Ngenkathi sihamba, X, Y noma Z ikhiya i-eksisi ebomvu, eluhlaza noma eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, inombolo oyibhalayo isetha ibanga (noma amadigri, noma isilinganiso), bese ukuchofoza noma Enter kuyasibeka phansi; Esc noma ukuchofoza ngesokudla kuyasibuyisela. Bese ubuyela ku-Khetha. Isitayela sokhiye sifanana nesinqumo semenyu: isitayela se-Modeler yisitayela semenyu ethi Modeler, futhi ukukhetha okukodwa kukhetha okunye. Bona Imenyu, izinkinobho nembewu. Uhlu olugcwele lwe-Modeler lusechazwe ku-Izinkinobho nezenzo zembewu. Amathiphu ethuluzi nekhadi lokuqala alandela isitayela osikhethile. Ukuskrola: ivili lembewu noma i-trackpad Yibheke wena (okokuqala): ModelCraft iyakubona ukuskrola. Ukuskrola okuya ngasohlangothini noma okuncane, njengoba i-trackpad iyithumela, kuzungeza; izinotshi eziphelele zevili zisondeza. Ivili lembewu: ukuskrola njalo kusondeza ngasenkombeni. Trackpad: swayipha ngeminwe emibili ukuze uzungeze, bamba Shift uswayipha ukuze ushelelise, cindezela ukuze usondeze. Awudingi izinkinobho ze-Zungeza, Shelelisa noma Sondeza ngalutho. Ukucindezela kusondeza kuzo zonke izinketho. Uma \"Yibheke wena\" ingabhula ngembewu noma i-trackpad yakho, khetha leyo onayo. Esitayelweni se-Modeler ungazungeza futhi ngokubamba Alt uhudule, futhi ushelelise nge-Alt+Shift nokuhudula — kuhle kulaphu elingenayo inkinobho ephakathi. Ukubambelela Bambelela emaphoyintini, emiphethweni nasemahlakaleni (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni) iyawudonsela umkhombi kuma-endpoint, kumaphakathi, emiphethweni, kumahlahlandlela nasezinxeleni ezibomvu, eziluhlaza nezokwesibhakabhaka — bona Ukuhlola. Yicima uma ufuna ukubeka okuthile ngokukhululeka eduze kwezinye izinto ngaphandle kokuthi kugxume. Ubuso, umhlabathi nokukhiya kwe-eksisi kusasebenza nalapho ukubambelela kucishiwe. Inkinobho ethi Bambelela ngakwesokudla esiphansi kombono yenza okufanayo kulo msebenzi wale seshini (iyagcinwa nayo). Esitayelweni se-Modeler, Shift+Tab iyayishintsha. Izinto eziqinile zima lapho zithinta Misa izinto eziqinile lapho zithinta (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni) igcina udonga lungakhukhulwa ludlule kwelinye udonga. Nge-Hambisa (nange-G, nokunamathisela bese uhambisa nge-Ctrl+D) ukukhethwa kuyashelela kuze kufike esolidini elinye bese kuyama kuthinta lona; nge-Sunduza/hudula ubuso buyema lapho buhlangabezana nesolidi elinye. Ukuphumula phezu kwento nokushelela ngayo kuyavumelekile — kumiswa kuphela ukungena ngaphakathi. Izinto ezivele zivezelana lapho uqala zingakhipha zihlukaniswe. Ukuze uphushe into ngamabomu, chofoza Shayisana ngakwesokudla esiphansi (noma sula lesi silungiselelo), yenza ukuhambisa, bese uchofoza futhi. Ukushayisana kuhlolwa ngokuhambisa nokusunduza/hudula. Jikisa no-Shintsha usayizi awakahlolwa okwamanje, futhi ijiyomethri eyindilinga ethintayo ihlangana njengakuso njalo: gcina izinto ezihlukene ku-amaqembu ukuze zihlale zihlukene. Ibhedi yomshicileli ye-3D Usayizi webhedi yomshicileli wakho: Akukasethwa (okokuqala), 180 × 180 × 180, 220 × 220 × 250, 256 × 256 × 256 noma 300 × 300 × 400 mm. Khetha usayizi oseduze kakhulu kwevolumu yokwakha yomshicileli wakho. Hlola ukushicilela nge-3D bese isho ukuthi imodeli inkulu kunebhedi; nge-Akukasethwa, usayizi awuhlolwa. Ukuzungeza nokushelelisa Zungeza ngokuzungeze lokho okungaphansi kwekhesa (kuvuliwe ekuqaleni): ukuzungeza kujikeleza engxenyeni yemodeli engaphansi kwenkomba, nokushelelisa kugcina leliphoyinti ngaphansi kwenkomba; endaweni engenalutho kokubili kusebenzisa indawo ephakathi kombono. Vala ukuze uzungeze njalo indawo ephakathi kombono. Isivinini sokuzungeza nesokushelelisa Isivinini sokushelelisa siyahamba kusuka ku-0.25× kuya ku-3× (1× iyisimo sokuqala) futhi sisebenza embewini, ku-trackpad, ekuthinteni nakumicibisho yekhibhodi. Bona Ukuzungeza, ukushelelisa nokusondeza. Isikhombisi sekhona Okubonakala ekhoneni le-3D view: Ikhyubu yombono (okokuqala; phezulu ngakwesokudla — chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, hudula ukuze uzungeze, hudula indilinga yekhampasi ukuze ujikise imodeli), Isithonjana se-eksisi (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngakwesobunxele esiphansi oluguquka ngombono: X kubomvu, Y kuluhlaza, Z kuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma Akukho. Bona Ikhyubu yombono.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Imenyu, okhiye nemouse","summary":"Khetha isitayela semenyu esihambisana nomklami owaziyo, nikeza noma yiliphi iyelelo ukhiye wakho, uhambise iziyelelo phakathi kwemenyu, futhi usethe ukuthi isikhala nezinkinobho zemouse eziphakathi nezesokudla zenzani.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["isitayela semenyu","imenyu","ibha yemenyu","ithuluzi","izinqamuleli zekhibhodi","okhiye abashisayo","okhiye","isitayela sokhiye","imephu yokhiye","yenza ngokwakho","buyisela","buyisela ukhiye","mouse","isikhulu","ukuqondisa kwesikhulu","inkinobho ephakathi","inkinobho yesokudla","zungeza","hambisa","khipha","ngenisa","ukushintsha","ejwayelekile","push-pull","modeler"],"headings":[{"id":"izitayela","text":"Izitayela","level":2},{"id":"yenza-eyakho","text":"Yenza eyakho","level":2},{"id":"imouse","text":"Imouse","level":2},{"id":"yithathe-nawe","text":"Yithathe nawe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi e-ModelCraft afinyeleleka ngendlela efanayo noma yimuphi umzila. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela semenyu\u003C/strong\u003E sinquma lapho akhona esikrinini, igama lawo lapho, nokhiye abawasebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyakukhumbula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitayela\"\u003EIzitayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzokutholela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yamathuluzi ye-ModelCraft (Ifayela, Dweba, Shintsha, Hlela, Hlela, Ikhamera) nokhiye bohlamvu olulodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umugqa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unxande, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E push/pull, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hambisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jikisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shintsha usayizi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isifafazi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zungeza. Okuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush-pull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yemenyu (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Ikhamera, Dweba, Amathuluzi, Iwindi) phezu komugqa wamathuluzi amakhulu, nokhiye bohlamvu olulodwa abafanayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yemenyu ekhanda (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Khetha, Engeza, Into, Imesh) nokhiye bemodeli yemesh: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khetha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bamba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jikisa kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shintsha usayizi wokukhethwa ngesikhathi sinye (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhiya i-axis lapho kuhanjiswa), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E push/pull, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unxande, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E susa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khetha konke, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E akukho, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E phinda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command G\"\u003E⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqembu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E fihla. Inkinobho ephakathi izungeza; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nenkinobho ephakathi ihambisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nenkinobho ephakathi isondeza; inkinobho yesokudla ikhansela okwenziwa yithuluzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeginner\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIribhoni enethebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake\u003C/span\u003E enezinkinobho ezimbalwa ezinkulu: izimo zokuthi zidonswe, izimbobo, hambisa, jikisa nushintshe usayizi, lingana, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroup\u003C/span\u003E (izimbobo ezisikwa ezimumweni) kanye nokuhlola ukuphrinta nge-3D; amanye amathuluzi wonke ethebhini ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore tools\u003C/span\u003E. Inkinobho yesokudla izungeza, inkinobho ephakathi ihambisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EIsitayela sesiqalayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitayela sokhiye osenzeka ukuthi usazi kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesokudla sokubuka nase-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E yisinqumo esifanayo: ukukhetha okhiye bomodeler kukhetha isitayela se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E, nokukhetha okhiye push-pull kushiya kusitayela se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ukhethe okhiye bomodeler kuweminye inguqulo endala, i-ModelCraft ivula ngesitayela se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E kanye kanye, ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkhiye ongowe-push-pull kodwa isitayela sakho sinika elinye iyelelo asenzi lutho, nomugqa wesimo utshela lapho iyelelo lalo lihamba khona (&quot;In Modeler, Push/pull is E&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezimpiko zigcina incazelo yazo njalo, izinombolo zihamba njalo ebhokisini lenani, futhi uma ithuluzi lihambisa into, izinkomba zalo zona zinqoba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-eyakho\"\u003EYenza eyakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isitayela esiseduze nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECustomize…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys and menus\u003C/span\u003E, thola iyelelo (ibhokisi losesho liyasiza). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a key\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela ukhiye. Chofoza ukhiye ukuwususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgebha yemenyu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhere it sits\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa iyelelo kwenye imenyu, noma kwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys only\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, setha isikhulu nokuthi izinkinobho zenzani ku-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYinike igama bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza isitayela sangaphakathi kwenza ikhophi yakho (&quot;My Modeler&quot;); isitayela sangaphakathi asishintshi. Ikhophi yakho ifunda okhiye ngendlela isitayela esaqala ngayo: eyenziwe kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E igcina okhiye bokubamba, ukujikisa nokushintsha usayizi besebenza ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imouse\"\u003EImouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhulu semouse\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms in\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms out\u003C/span\u003E, nesivinini sakho. Ukucindezela kwe-trackpad kusondeza ngendlela eminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa ku-3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwakho kokubuka ngakunye\u003C/span\u003E igcina izinkinobho zeModelCraft (inkinobho ephakathi izungeza, inkinobho yesokudla noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ephakathi zihambisa). Noma usethe izinkinobho eziphakathi nezesokudla zibe zungeza, hambisa, sondeza noma azenzi lutho; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ishintsha ukuzungeza nokuhambisa. Inkinobho yesobunxele ihlala ithuluzini elisetshenziswayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-trackpad\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScrolling\u003C/span\u003E usaqhubeka unquma ukuthi iminwe emibili izungeza (trackpad) noma isondeze (imouse). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EZungeza, hambisa nesondeze\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yithathe-nawe\"\u003EYithathe nawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E lengeza elilodwa, elivela kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumsebenzi wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingakhomba kumyalo we-ModelCraft kuphela: okunye kukho kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe emugqeni wesimo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete this style\u003C/span\u003E isusa esakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi siphequluli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this style in every app\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza yonke i-app ivule ngesitayela esihambisanayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush-pull\u003C/span\u003E ihambisana nezitayela zemenyu-yebha zezinye izinhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E anayo ifanekiso kwezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ihlala njengokukhethwa kwe-ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIzinqamuleli zekhibhodi nezenzo zemouse\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkusuka kwabanye bemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amathuluzi e-ModelCraft afinyeleleka ngendlela efanayo noma yimuphi umzila. Isitayela semenyu sinquma lapho akhona esikrinini, igama lawo lapho, nokhiye abawasebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-Settings (Ctrl+,) › ModelCraft › Menus, keys and mouse; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyakukhumbula. Izitayela Isitayela Okuzokutholela ModelCraft Ibha yamathuluzi ye-ModelCraft (Ifayela, Dweba, Shintsha, Hlela, Hlela, Ikhamera) nokhiye bohlamvu olulodwa: L umugqa, R unxande, P push/pull, M hambisa, Q jikisa, S shintsha usayizi, E isifafazi, O zungeza. Okuzenzakalelayo. Push-pull Ibha yemenyu (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Ikhamera, Dweba, Amathuluzi, Iwindi) phezu komugqa wamathuluzi amakhulu, nokhiye bohlamvu olulodwa abafanayo. Modeler Ibha yemenyu ekhanda (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Khetha, Engeza, Into, Imesh) nokhiye bemodeli yemesh: W khetha, G bamba, R jikisa kanye S shintsha usayizi wokukhethwa ngesikhathi sinye (X, Y noma Z ikhiya i-axis lapho kuhanjiswa), E push/pull, B unxande, X susa, A khetha konke, Alt+A akukho, Shift+D phinda, Ctrl+G iqembu, H fihla. Inkinobho ephakathi izungeza; Shift kanye nenkinobho ephakathi ihambisa, Ctrl kanye nenkinobho ephakathi isondeza; inkinobho yesokudla ikhansela okwenziwa yithuluzi. Beginner Iribhoni enethebhu ethi Make enezinkinobho ezimbalwa ezinkulu: izimo zokuthi zidonswe, izimbobo, hambisa, jikisa nushintshe usayizi, lingana, Group (izimbobo ezisikwa ezimumweni) kanye nokuhlola ukuphrinta nge-3D; amanye amathuluzi wonke ethebhini ethi More tools. Inkinobho yesokudla izungeza, inkinobho ephakathi ihambisa. Bona Isitayela sesiqalayo. Isitayela sokhiye osenzeka ukuthi usazi kusuka ku-Keys ngaphansi kwesokudla sokubuka nase-Edit › More yisinqumo esifanayo: ukukhetha okhiye bomodeler kukhetha isitayela se-Modeler, nokukhetha okhiye push-pull kushiya kusitayela se-ModelCraft. Uma ukhethe okhiye bomodeler kuweminye inguqulo endala, i-ModelCraft ivula ngesitayela se-Modeler kanye kanye, ngokwayo. Ukhiye ongowe-push-pull kodwa isitayela sakho sinika elinye iyelelo asenzi lutho, nomugqa wesimo utshela lapho iyelelo lalo lihamba khona (\"In Modeler, Push/pull is E\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space nezimpiko zigcina incazelo yazo njalo, izinombolo zihamba njalo ebhokisini lenani, futhi uma ithuluzi lihambisa into, izinkomba zalo zona zinqoba. Yenza eyakho Khetha isitayela esiseduze nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza Customize…. Ku-Keys and menus, thola iyelelo (ibhokisi losesho liyasiza). Add a key bese ucindezela ukhiye. Chofoza ukhiye ukuwususa. Ngebha yemenyu, Where it sits ihambisa iyelelo kwenye imenyu, noma kwi-Keys only. Ku-Mouse, setha isikhulu nokuthi izinkinobho zenzani ku-3D. Yinike igama bese uchofoza Save. Ukulondoloza isitayela sangaphakathi kwenza ikhophi yakho (\"My Modeler\"); isitayela sangaphakathi asishintshi. Ikhophi yakho ifunda okhiye ngendlela isitayela esaqala ngayo: eyenziwe kusuka ku-Modeler igcina okhiye bokubamba, ukujikisa nokushintsha usayizi besebenza ngesikhathi esisodwa. Imouse Isikhulu semouse: Scroll up zooms in (okuzenzakalelayo) noma Scroll up zooms out, nesivinini sakho. Ukucindezela kwe-trackpad kusondeza ngendlela eminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo. Donsa ku-3D: Okwakho kokubuka ngakunye igcina izinkinobho zeModelCraft (inkinobho ephakathi izungeza, inkinobho yesokudla noma Shift nenkinobho ephakathi zihambisa). Noma usethe izinkinobho eziphakathi nezesokudla zibe zungeza, hambisa, sondeza noma azenzi lutho; Shift nenkinobho ishintsha ukuzungeza nokuhambisa. Inkinobho yesobunxele ihlala ithuluzini elisetshenziswayo. Ama-trackpad: Settings › ModelCraft › Scrolling usaqhubeka unquma ukuthi iminwe emibili izungeza (trackpad) noma isondeze (imouse). Bona Zungeza, hambisa nesondeze. Yithathe nawe Export ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-.ccinput.json; Import… lengeza elilodwa, elivela kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumsebenzi wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingakhomba kumyalo we-ModelCraft kuphela: okunye kukho kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe emugqeni wesimo. Delete this style isusa esakho. Lezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi siphequluli. Use this style in every app ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza yonke i-app ivule ngesitayela esihambisanayo: Push-pull ihambisana nezitayela zemenyu-yebha zezinye izinhlelo. Modeler anayo ifanekiso kwezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ihlala njengokukhethwa kwe-ModelCraft. Okuhlobene: Izinqamuleli zekhibhodi nezenzo zemouse · Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft · Ukusuka kwabanye bemodeli","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Izinkinobho nezenzo zembewu","summary":"Zonke izinkinobho zesikhashana, izenzo zembewu, izenzo zepaneli yokuthinta nezokuthinta ku-ModelCraft, zihlelwe ngokwenzayo.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["inkinobho","izinkinobho zesikhashana","izinkinobho","imbewu","ithaphu","izenzo zokuthinta","ishidi lesikhashana","ctrl","umyalo","izinkinobho zomcibisholo"],"headings":[{"id":"amathuluzi","text":"Amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"imodeli-nefayela","text":"Imodeli nefayela","level":2},{"id":"esc","text":"Esc","level":2},{"id":"ithuluzi-lisasebenza","text":"Ithuluzi lisasebenza","level":2},{"id":"amakhiye-omcibisholo-ngezikhathi-ezinye","text":"Amakhiye omcibisholo ngezikhathi ezinye","level":2},{"id":"imbewu","text":"Imbewu","level":2},{"id":"ipaneli-yokuthinta","text":"Ipaneli yokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-zemodeler","text":"Izinkinobho zeModeler","level":2},{"id":"isikrini-sokuthinta","text":"Isikrini sokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kuhlala-khona-i-move","text":"Lapho kuhlala khona i-Move","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinkinobho zokusunduza-hudula, eziqala ngazo i-ModelCraft. Ngesitayela esihlukile, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard#modeler-keys\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"modeler-keys\"\u003EIzinkinobho zeModeler\u003C/a\u003E ngezansi nokuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho zisebenza uma i-3D view noma inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi igxilile. Uma ubhale egunjini lephaneli noma ushintshe uhlu ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStyle\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza ku-3D view kuqala, noma izinkinobho zizoya kulowo gunjana. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EIzinkinobho, izinkinobho zembewu nopendi\u003C/a\u003E ukuthi izinkinobho zibhalwa kanjani kwikhompyutha ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu zamathuluzi zisebenza ngaphandle kwezinkinobho zokuguqula kuphela: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nohlamvu akwenzi lutho, ngaphandle kwezimbili ezingezansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-nefayela\"\u003EImodeli nefayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza isakhi esikhethwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza iqembu kokukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza kuzo zonke izinkomba (imodeli yonke)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza (ilanda ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula imodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke (eqenjini elivulekile, uma likhona)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela: ikhophi ilandela isikhombi, chofoza lapho ifuna khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela endaweni efanayo (lapho kwakhoshelwa khona)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda: ikhophi ihamba nesikhombi, chofoza ukuze uyibeke phansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigcawu esilandelayo / esedlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula noma vala lo mbhalo wosizo (futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yohlelo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphakathi kosizo uyawuvala)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodi yesikrini: isikrini esigcwele, bese izinkambu zifihlwa, bese kubuya okujwayelekile (Control nakuMac)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyela emuva inqubo eyodwa ngalo lonke ukucindezela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza ukuphela kwalokho ithuluzi eliphakathi kwakho (umugqa oqhubeka wedwetshwa, ukusunduza-hudula, ukuhambisa). Konke kuyabuya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKushintsha ube \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKususa ukukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuvala iqembu oyihlelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphinde iyeke izigcawu zingadlali. Kubhokisi lenani, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isula lokho okuthayiphile ibuyele kumbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithuluzi-lisasebenza\"\u003EIthuluzi lisasebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo, noma eyodwa yezi \u003Ccode\u003E. , - &#039; &quot; [ &lt; * /\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqala ukuthayipha ebhokisini lenani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsebenzisa okuthayiphile ebhokisini lenani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhiya ku-axis ebomvu (cindezela futhi ukuze uvule)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhiya ku-axis eluhlaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhiya ku-axis ezolile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhiya ihambisana nomphetho wokugcina oshayelwe ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbamba isiqondiso osinqunyiwe, kuze kubanjwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Move)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIguqula phakathi kokuhambisa nokukopisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhiye zomcibisholo zisebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E (lapho ulinganisa kusuka kwiphoyinti), emva kokuchofoza kokuqala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E ihamba njalo ngendlela yohlangothi futhi ayinazikhiye. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E amakhiye omcibisholo akhombisa umlayezo wokuthi &quot;Locked&quot; emva kokuchofoza kokuqala kodwa awashintshi ukuphenduka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhiye-omcibisholo-ngezikhathi-ezinye\"\u003EAmakhiye omcibisholo ngezikhathi ezinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho nengathi akukho thuluzi eliphakathi kokwenza into, amakhiye omcibisholo ahambisa ikhamera:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nomcibisholo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imbewu\"\u003EImbewu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela, hudula, khipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengokuchofoza kabili (kumathuluzi okudweba); ukukhetha ibhokisi (kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E); isula endleleni (kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: uhlangothi nemiphetho yalo, umphetho nezinhlangothi zawo, ivula iqembu; isikhala esingenalutho sivala iqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kathathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: konke okuxhunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: shintshela ngaphandle nangaphakathi kokukhethwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: engeza ekukhethweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: susa ekukhethweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula inkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + hudula inkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula inkinobho yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza eduze nesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho imenyu yokuchofoza kwesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipaneli-yokuthinta\"\u003EIpaneli yokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwenziwa yisiwayi esinemihlwathi emibili kuncike ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Ukuskrola:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIpaneli yokuthinta (noma okuqondwayo)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIwili lembewu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIswayipha ngemihlwathi emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza eduze nesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + iswayipha ngemihlwathi emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucindanisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza eduze nesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza eduze nesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela ngemihlwathi emibili bese udonsa (inkinobho yesibili ibambe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#on-a-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"on-a-trackpad\"\u003EZungeza, shelelisa nesondeza\u003C/a\u003E nokuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-zemodeler\"\u003EIzinkinobho zeModeler\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Izilawuli esethwe ku-isitayela se-Modeler:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E (phakamisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa okukhethiwe ngokushesha, kusukela esikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhenduza okukhethiwe maphakathi (i-axis eziloleko)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha usayizi wokukhethiwe maphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhamba noma uphenduza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhiya i-axis ebomvu / eluhlaza / ezolile (futhi ukuze uvule)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYibeke phansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza kwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbuyisele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda bese uhambisa ikhophi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke / ungakhethi lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula iqembu noma isakhi okhethiwe; futhi ukuze uvale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command G\"\u003E⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command G\"\u003E⇧⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza iqembu / yenza isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo ye-Numpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"1\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"7\"\u003E7\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E7\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono wangaphambili / wesokudla / wophahla (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngemuva / ngesobunxele / ngaphansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENumpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"5\"\u003E5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubona okujulile kuvuliwe noma kuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENumpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\".\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ekukhethiweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza kuzo zonke izinkomba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubamba kuvuliwe noma kuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula inkinobho ephakathi / nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit) / shelelisa (pan) / sondeza (zoom)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + hudula / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option Shift\"\u003E⌥⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+Shift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + hudula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit) / shelelisa (pan) (akudingeki inkinobho ephakathi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukopisha, ukunamathisela, ukuhlehlisa, ukulondoloza nokuvula kugcina izinkinobho ezidwetshwe phezulu. Izinani ezithayiphiwe, ibhokisi lenani kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E kwenza okufanayo kuzo zombili izitayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikrini-sokuthinta\"\u003EIsikrini sokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza nethuluzi lamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela, hudula, phakamisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengokucindezela, ukudonsa, ukukhulula nge-mouse\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emibili: ukuhlanganisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emibili: nyakazisa ndawonye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (Pan) (Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Isikrini sokuthinta kungenza kube yi-Orbit)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emithathu: nyakazisa ndawonye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit) (Shelelisa uma iminwe emibili izungeza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMbamba umunwe owodwa ume ngcwaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqeda ithuluzi, njenge-Enter; uma kungenzeki lutho, bese uyadonsa ukuze uzungeze\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmunwe wesibili phakathi kwesenzo somunwe owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhansela lesenzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit\u003C/span\u003E, bese udonsa umunwe owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (Orbit)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthayiphe inani esikrinini sokuthinta, thinta ibhokisi lenani ngaphansi, thayipha, bese ucindezela inkinobho ye-Enter (noma i-Go) yekhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kuhlala-khona-i-move\"\u003ELapho kuhlala khona i-Move\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Move ihlala kuthuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, inkinobho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: khetha okufanele kuhanjiswe, chofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo, bese uchofoza iphoyinti lesibili noma uthayipha ibanga. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003EHambisa, kopisha wenze ama-array\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lezi yizinkinobho zokusunduza-hudula, eziqala ngazo i-ModelCraft. Ngesitayela esihlukile, bona Izinkinobho zeModeler ngezansi nokuthi Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft. Izinkinobho zisebenza uma i-3D view noma inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi igxilile. Uma ubhale egunjini lephaneli noma ushintshe uhlu ku-Style, chofoza ku-3D view kuqala, noma izinkinobho zizoya kulowo gunjana. Bona Izinkinobho, izinkinobho zembewu nopendi ukuthi izinkinobho zibhalwa kanjani kwikhompyutha ngayinye. Amathuluzi Inkinobho Ithuluzi Space Select L Line R Rectangle C Circle N Polygon A Arc F Offset B Paint P Push/pull M Move Q Rotate S Scale E Eraser T Ukulinganisa nge-Tape D Dimension O Orbit H Pan Z Zoom Izinhlamvu zamathuluzi zisebenza ngaphandle kwezinkinobho zokuguqula kuphela: Shift nohlamvu akwenzi lutho, ngaphandle kwezimbili ezingezansi. Imodeli nefayela Inkinobho Yenza G Yenza isakhi esikhethwe Shift+G Yenza iqembu kokukhethiwe Shift+Z Sondeza kuzo zonke izinkomba (imodeli yonke) Ctrl+Z Hlehlisa Ctrl+Y noma Ctrl+Shift+Z Phinda wenze Ctrl+S Londoloza (ilanda ifayela le-.modelcraft) Ctrl+O Vula imodeli Ctrl+A Khetha konke (eqenjini elivulekile, uma likhona) Ctrl+C Kopisha okukhethiwe Ctrl+X Sika okukhethiwe Ctrl+V Namathisela: ikhophi ilandela isikhombi, chofoza lapho ifuna khona Ctrl+Shift+V Namathisela endaweni efanayo (lapho kwakhoshelwa khona) Ctrl+D Phinda: ikhophi ihamba nesikhombi, chofoza ukuze uyibeke phansi Delete noma Backspace Susa okukhethiwe Page Down / Page Up Isigcawu esilandelayo / esedlule F1 Vula noma vala lo mbhalo wosizo (futhi Help ebhalini yohlelo; Esc ngaphakathi kosizo uyawuvala) Ctrl+Shift+F Imodi yesikrini: isikrini esigcwele, bese izinkambu zifihlwa, bese kubuya okujwayelekile (Control nakuMac) Esc Esc ibuyela emuva inqubo eyodwa ngalo lonke ukucindezela: Yenza ukuphela kwalokho ithuluzi eliphakathi kwakho (umugqa oqhubeka wedwetshwa, ukusunduza-hudula, ukuhambisa). Konke kuyabuya. Kushintsha ube Select. Kususa ukukhethwa. Kuvala iqembu oyihlelayo. Iphinde iyeke izigcawu zingadlali. Kubhokisi lenani, Esc isula lokho okuthayiphile ibuyele kumbono. Ithuluzi lisasebenza Inkinobho Yenza Inombolo, noma eyodwa yezi . , - ' \" [ \u003C * / Iqala ukuthayipha ebhokisini lenani Enter Isebenzisa okuthayiphile ebhokisini lenani → Ikhiya ku-axis ebomvu (cindezela futhi ukuze uvule) ← Ikhiya ku-axis eluhlaza ↑ Ikhiya ku-axis ezolile ↓ Ikhiya ihambisana nomphetho wokugcina oshayelwe ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala Bamba Shift Ibamba isiqondiso osinqunyiwe, kuze kubanjwe Ctrl, Ctrl noma Alt (Move) Iguqula phakathi kokuhambisa nokukopisha Izikhiye zomcibisholo zisebenza ku-Line, Rectangle, Circle, Polygon, Move, Scale kanye ne-Tape (lapho ulinganisa kusuka kwiphoyinti), emva kokuchofoza kokuqala. Push/pull ihamba njalo ngendlela yohlangothi futhi ayinazikhiye. Ku-Rotate amakhiye omcibisholo akhombisa umlayezo wokuthi \"Locked\" emva kokuchofoza kokuqala kodwa awashintshi ukuphenduka. Amakhiye omcibisholo ngezikhathi ezinye Lapho nengathi akukho thuluzi eliphakathi kokwenza into, amakhiye omcibisholo ahambisa ikhamera: Inkinobho Yenza ← → ↑ ↓ Zungeza (Orbit) Shift nomcibisholo Shelelisa (Pan) Imbewu Isenzo Yenza Chofoza Isebenzisa ithuluzi lamanje Cindezela, hudula, khipha Njengokuchofoza kabili (kumathuluzi okudweba); ukukhetha ibhokisi (kwe-Select); isula endleleni (kwe-Eraser) Chofoza kabili Select: uhlangothi nemiphetho yalo, umphetho nezinhlangothi zawo, ivula iqembu; isikhala esingenalutho sivala iqembu Chofoza kathathu Select: konke okuxhunyiwe Shift + chofoza Select: shintshela ngaphandle nangaphakathi kokukhethwa Ctrl + chofoza Select: engeza ekukhethweni Shift + Ctrl + chofoza Select: susa ekukhethweni Hudula inkinobho ephakathi Zungeza (Orbit), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi Shift + hudula inkinobho ephakathi Shelelisa (Pan), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi Hudula inkinobho yesokudla Shelelisa (Pan), nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi Iwili Sondeza eduze nesikhombi Akukho imenyu yokuchofoza kwesokudla. Ipaneli yokuthinta Okwenziwa yisiwayi esinemihlwathi emibili kuncike ku-Settings › ModelCraft › Ukuskrola: Isenzo Ipaneli yokuthinta (noma okuqondwayo) Iwili lembewu Iswayipha ngemihlwathi emibili Zungeza (Orbit) Sondeza eduze nesikhombi Shift + iswayipha ngemihlwathi emibili Shelelisa (Pan) Sondeza Ukucindanisa Sondeza eduze nesikhombi Sondeza eduze nesikhombi Cindezela ngemihlwathi emibili bese udonsa (inkinobho yesibili ibambe) Shelelisa (Pan) Shelelisa (Pan) Bona Zungeza, shelelisa nesondeza nokuthi Izilungiselelo ze-ModelCraft. Izinkinobho zeModeler Ngo-Settings › ModelCraft › Izilawuli esethwe ku-isitayela se-Modeler: Inkinobho Yenza W noma Space Select L / B / C / N Line / Rectangle / Circle / Polygon E Push/pull (phakamisa) T Ukulinganisa nge-Tape D Dimension G Hambisa okukhethiwe ngokushesha, kusukela esikhombi R Phenduza okukhethiwe maphakathi (i-axis eziloleko) S Shintsha usayizi wokukhethiwe maphakathi X / Y / Z uhamba noma uphenduza Khiya i-axis ebomvu / eluhlaza / ezolile (futhi ukuze uvule) Chofoza noma Enter Yibeke phansi Esc noma chofoza kwesokudla Ibuyisele Shift+D Phinda bese uhambisa ikhophi X noma Delete Susa okukhethiwe A / Alt+A Khetha konke / ungakhethi lutho Tab Vula iqembu noma isakhi okhethiwe; futhi ukuze uvale Ctrl+G / Ctrl+Shift+G Yenza iqembu / yenza isakhi Inombolo ye-Numpad 1 / 3 / 7 Umbono wangaphambili / wesokudla / wophahla (Ctrl ngemuva / ngesobunxele / ngaphansi) Numpad 5 Ukubona okujulile kuvuliwe noma kuvaliwe Numpad . Sondeza ekukhethiweni Home noma Shift+C Sondeza kuzo zonke izinkomba Shift+Tab Ukubamba kuvuliwe noma kuvaliwe Hudula inkinobho ephakathi / nge-Shift / nge-Ctrl Zungeza (Orbit) / shelelisa (pan) / sondeza (zoom) Alt + hudula / Alt+Shift + hudula Zungeza (Orbit) / shelelisa (pan) (akudingeki inkinobho ephakathi) Ukukopisha, ukunamathisela, ukuhlehlisa, ukulondoloza nokuvula kugcina izinkinobho ezidwetshwe phezulu. Izinani ezithayiphiwe, ibhokisi lenani kanye ne-Push/pull kwenza okufanayo kuzo zombili izitayela. Isikrini sokuthinta Isenzo Yenza Thinta Ukuchofoza nethuluzi lamanje Thinta kabili Ukuchofoza kabili Cindezela, hudula, phakamisa Njengokucindezela, ukudonsa, ukukhulula nge-mouse Iminwe emibili: ukuhlanganisa Sondeza Iminwe emibili: nyakazisa ndawonye Shelelisa (Pan) (Izilungiselelo › ModelCraft › Isikrini sokuthinta kungenza kube yi-Orbit) Iminwe emithathu: nyakazisa ndawonye Zungeza (Orbit) (Shelelisa uma iminwe emibili izungeza) Mbamba umunwe owodwa ume ngcwaba Iqeda ithuluzi, njenge-Enter; uma kungenzeki lutho, bese uyadonsa ukuze uzungeze Umunwe wesibili phakathi kwesenzo somunwe owodwa Ikhansela lesenzo Ithuluzi le-Orbit, bese udonsa umunwe owodwa Zungeza (Orbit) Ukuze uthayiphe inani esikrinini sokuthinta, thinta ibhokisi lenani ngaphansi, thayipha, bese ucindezela inkinobho ye-Enter (noma i-Go) yekhibhodi. Lapho kuhlala khona i-Move I-Move ihlala kuthuluzi le-Move, inkinobho M: khetha okufanele kuhanjiswe, chofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo, bese uchofoza iphoyinti lesibili noma uthayipha ibanga. Bona Hambisa, kopisha wenze ama-array.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tools","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Uhlu lwamathuluzi","summary":"Wonke amathuluzi we-ModelCraft nokhiye bawo, ukuthi yini ukuchofoza ngakunye okwenzayo, nokuthi yini ongayithayipha ebhokisini lenani lapho usebenza.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["amathuluzi","ibha yamathuluzi","imiyalo","uhlu","umugqa","unxande","indilinga","ipholigoni","phambanisa","umnsalo","ijika","spline","ngilandele","sweep","umnsalo wamaphoyinti amabili","umnsalo osuka embindeni","khetha","sunduza hudula","hambisa","jikisa","shintsha usayizi","isifafazi","ithephu","isilinganiso","zungeza","shelelisa","sondeza","beka isakhi"],"headings":[{"id":"amathuluzi-okudweba","text":"Amathuluzi okudweba","level":2},{"id":"amathuluzi-okuhlela","text":"Amathuluzi okuhlela","level":2},{"id":"amathuluzi-ekhamera","text":"Amathuluzi ekhamera","level":2},{"id":"hlela","text":"Hlela","level":2},{"id":"beka-isakhi","text":"Beka isakhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsiluleko sebha yesimo sihlale sisho ukuthi ithuluzi lamanje lifuna ini okulandelayo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela lokho ithuluzi eliphakathi kokwenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-okudweba\"\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuchofoza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThayipha ebhokisini lenani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkokuqala, bese ichofoza amaphoyinti alandelayo. Iyama lapho ubuso buvala, noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude oluya kusikhombi; \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E iphoyinti; \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ukuguqulwa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhona yokuqala (phansi noma ubuso), ikhona ephambene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi nobujulile: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo (phansi noma ubuso), iphoyinti emaphethelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala: izinhlangothi, \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E). Ngemva kwalokho: umsakazo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo, ikhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengakuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E; iqala ngezinhlangothi ezi-6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkokuqala, okokugcina, bese ugoba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude besitimela ngemva kokuqala (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E); ukugoba ngemva kokugcina (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugoba\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E kumasegmenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIprothrakhtha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo, iphoyinti le-0°, bese i-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-engeli ngamadigri (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgilandele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha indlela, bese uchofoza ubuso (noma chofoza ubuso, bese umphetho wendlela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso, iqembu noma isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E— (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ohlangene, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wonke umbala ofanayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E thatha umbala)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso (noma khetha ubuso noma imiphetho kuqala), bese uhlangothi nebanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E); ngaphakathi kobuso kuyinhlangothi yangaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti ijika edlula kuwo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ukuchofoza kabili kuqeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude oluya ngasekhomponi, \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ephoyintini elilandelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo osuka embindeni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo, okokuqala, bese okokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo ngemva kwesikhungo; i-engeli ngamadigri ngemva kokuqala; \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E kumasegmenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-okuhlela\"\u003EAmathuluzi okuhlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuchofoza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThayipha ebhokisini lenani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza, chofoza kabili, chofoza kathathu, donsa ibhokisi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/select\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/select\"\u003EKhetha izinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENesilinganiso esisodwa noma umphetho okhethiwe: ubude obusha, obushintsha usayizi wemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso, bese ibanga. Chofoza kabili ubuso ukuze uphinde ibanga lokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga; ibanga elibi liya ngakolunye uhlangothi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusuka kuphoyinti, kuya kuphoyinti. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukukopisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga oliya kusikhombi, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E). Ngemva kokukopisha: \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo (kuso ubuso ukuze ujikise endizeni yalo), iqondo lokuqala, iqondo lokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-engeli ngamadigri (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti elihlala, iphoyinti lesethulo, usayizi omusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza noma donsa phezu kwemiphetho, amaqembu, imihlahlandlela nezilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthephu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKumphetho: umugqa wokuhlola ofanayo. Kuphoyinti: ilinganisa bese ishiya iphoyinti lesiqondisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphambanisa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E) noma ibanga (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhona amabili (noma umphetho owodwa), bese kuthi lapho umugqa wesilinganiso uya khona. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003EIsilinganiso nokushintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphambanisa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E). Ngemva nje: ubude obusha, obushintsha usayizi wemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E zisebenza ngokukhethiwe. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, zithatha lokho ochofoza kukho kuqala (ubuso buletha imiphetho yalo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-ekhamera\"\u003EAmathuluzi ekhamera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDonsa ukuze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZungeza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikela ngaphezulu kwengxenye yemodeli ephansi kwesikhombi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shelelisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShelelisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa umbono\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza: phezulu kuyasondela, phansi kuyakude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESondeza konke\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(inkinobho, hhayi ithuluzi) Lwanela imodeli yonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkudingeki kakhulu ukusebenzisa lezi nge-mouse: donsa phakathi ukuzungeza, donsa kwesokudla ukushelelisa, bese isikhombisi sisondeza nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EZungeza, shelelisa nosondeze\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela\"\u003EHlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ukukhethwa kube yisakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ukukhethwa kube liqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakukho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIguqula amaqembu nezakhi ezikhethiwe ibuyele ibe yijiyomethri ekhululekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isakhi\"\u003EBeka isakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho kwibha yamathuluzi: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwesakhi ephaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza kanye lapho kuya khona umsuka wesakhi; ithuluzi bese libuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isiluleko sebha yesimo sihlale sisho ukuthi ithuluzi lamanje lifuna ini okulandelayo. Esc ikhansela lokho ithuluzi eliphakathi kokwenza. Amathuluzi okudweba Ithuluzi Ukhiye Ukuchofoza Thayipha ebhokisini lenani Umugqa L Okokuqala, bese ichofoza amaphoyinti alandelayo. Iyama lapho ubuso buvala, noma nge-Esc Ubude oluya kusikhombi; [x,y,z] iphoyinti; \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ukuguqulwa (Ubude) Unxande R Ikhona yokuqala (phansi noma ubuso), ikhona ephambene Ububanzi nobujulile: 4m,3m (Izilinganiso) Indilinga C Isikhungo (phansi noma ubuso), iphoyinti emaphethelweni Ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala: izinhlangothi, 24s noma 24 (Izinhlangothi). Ngemva kwalokho: umsakazo (Umsakazo) Ipholigoni N Isikhungo, ikhona Njengakuthi Indilinga; iqala ngezinhlangothi ezi-6 Umnsalo A Okokuqala, okokugcina, bese ugoba Ubude besitimela ngemva kokuqala (Ubude); ukugoba ngemva kokugcina (Ukugoba); 12s kumasegmenti Iprothrakhtha — Isikhungo, iphoyinti le-0°, bese i-engeli I-engeli ngamadigri (I-engeli) Ngilandele — Khetha indlela, bese uchofoza ubuso (noma chofoza ubuso, bese umphetho wendlela) — Penda B Ubuso, iqembu noma isakhi — (Ctrl ohlangene, Shift wonke umbala ofanayo, Alt thatha umbala) Phambanisa F Ubuso (noma khetha ubuso noma imiphetho kuqala), bese uhlangothi nebanga Ibanga (Ibanga); ngaphakathi kobuso kuyinhlangothi yangaphakathi Ijika — Amaphoyinti ijika edlula kuwo; Enter noma ukuchofoza kabili kuqeda Ubude oluya ngasekhomponi, [x,y,z] noma \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ephoyintini elilandelayo Umnsalo osuka embindeni — Isikhungo, okokuqala, bese okokugcina Umsakazo ngemva kwesikhungo; i-engeli ngamadigri ngemva kokuqala; 12s kumasegmenti Amathuluzi okuhlela Ithuluzi Ukhiye Ukuchofoza Thayipha ebhokisini lenani Khetha Space Chofoza, chofoza kabili, chofoza kathathu, donsa ibhokisi. Bheka Khetha izinto Nesilinganiso esisodwa noma umphetho okhethiwe: ubude obusha, obushintsha usayizi wemodeli Sunduza/hudula P Ubuso, bese ibanga. Chofoza kabili ubuso ukuze uphinde ibanga lokugcina Ibanga; ibanga elibi liya ngakolunye uhlangothi (Ibanga) Hambisa M Kusuka kuphoyinti, kuya kuphoyinti. Bamba Ctrl noma Alt ukukopisha Ibanga oliya kusikhombi, \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E noma [x,y,z] (Ibanga). Ngemva kokukopisha: 3x noma /3 Jikisa Q Isikhungo (kuso ubuso ukuze ujikise endizeni yalo), iqondo lokuqala, iqondo lokugcina I-engeli ngamadigri (I-engeli) Shintsha usayizi S Iphoyinti elihlala, iphoyinti lesethulo, usayizi omusha Isici: 2, 0.5 (Shintsha usayizi) Isifafazi E Chofoza noma donsa phezu kwemiphetho, amaqembu, imihlahlandlela nezilinganiso Lutho Ithephu T Kumphetho: umugqa wokuhlola ofanayo. Kuphoyinti: ilinganisa bese ishiya iphoyinti lesiqondisi Ukuphambanisa (Phambanisa) noma ibanga (Ubude) Isilinganiso D Amakhona amabili (noma umphetho owodwa), bese kuthi lapho umugqa wesilinganiso uya khona. Bheka Isilinganiso nokushintsha usayizi Ukuphambanisa (Phambanisa). Ngemva nje: ubude obusha, obushintsha usayizi wemodeli Hambisa, Jikisa kanye Shintsha usayizi zisebenza ngokukhethiwe. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, zithatha lokho ochofoza kukho kuqala (ubuso buletha imiphetho yalo). Amathuluzi ekhamera Ithuluzi Ukhiye Donsa ukuze Zungeza O Jikela ngaphezulu kwengxenye yemodeli ephansi kwesikhombi (Shift shelelisa) Shelelisa H Shelelisa umbono Sondeza Z Sondeza: phezulu kuyasondela, phansi kuyakude Sondeza konke Shift+Z (inkinobho, hhayi ithuluzi) Lwanela imodeli yonke Akudingeki kakhulu ukusebenzisa lezi nge-mouse: donsa phakathi ukuzungeza, donsa kwesokudla ukushelelisa, bese isikhombisi sisondeza nganoma yiliphi ithuluzi. Bheka Zungeza, shelelisa nosondeze. Hlela Inkinobho Ukhiye Yenza Isakhi G Yenza ukukhethwa kube yisakhi Iqembu Shift+G Yenza ukukhethwa kube liqembu Chitha akukho Iguqula amaqembu nezakhi ezikhethiwe ibuyele ibe yijiyomethri ekhululekile Beka isakhi Akukho kwibha yamathuluzi: chofoza Beka eduze kwesakhi ephaneli Izakhi. Chofoza kanye lapho kuya khona umsuka wesakhi; ithuluzi bese libuyela ku-Khetha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"inference","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ukuphonsa nokubamba","summary":"Okusho izimaki ezinemibala, ukubamba okunqoba, nokuthi ungakhiya kanjani inkomba ngamakhiye okhomba noma i-Shift.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["ukuphonsa","bamba","ukubamba","iphoyinti lokuphela","iphakathi","isikhungo sohlangothi","ohlangothini lomphetho","ohlangothini lohlangothi","i-axis","i-axis ebomvu","i-axis eluhlaza","i-axis ezolile","ihambisana","ibheke","khiya","shift","osnap"],"headings":[{"id":"izimaki-nezisiqondiso","text":"Izimaki nezisiqondiso","level":2},{"id":"ukubamba-okunqoba","text":"Ukubamba okunqoba","level":2},{"id":"ukudweba-ohlangothini-ukusuka-kwiphoyinti","text":"Ukudweba ohlangothini ukusuka kwiphoyinti","level":2},{"id":"ukuhambisana-nokuphambana","text":"Ukuhambisana nokuphambana","level":2},{"id":"khiya-indlela","text":"Khiya indlela","level":2},{"id":"ngaphakathi-kweqembu","text":"Ngaphakathi kweqembu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi ithuluzi lokudweba noma lokuhlela lisebenza, i-ModelCraft ibheka okungaphansi kwesikhombi ibambe into ewusizo kakhulu eseduze. Isimaki sikhombisa okuthole, futhi isiqondiso esingezansi kwesobunxele sichaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimaki-nezisiqondiso\"\u003EIzimaki nezisiqondiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiqondiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimaki\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIbamba\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lokuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiyingi esiluhlaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphela komphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiyingi esiluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphakathi lomphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo sohlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiyingi esizolile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphakathi lohlangothi ngaphansi kwesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhloko esihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lesihloko eshiywe yi-tape\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsuka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkhilimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho ama-axes abomvu, aluhlaza nezolile ahlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-axis ebomvu / Ku-axis eluhlaza / Ku-axis ezolile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa waleyo mbala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala ngale ndlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisana nomphetho / Iphambene nomphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wepinki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala uhambisana noma uphambene nomphetho okhunjuziwe (bona ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhiyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wepinki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqondisa okukhiywe ngekhiye lomcibisholo noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEmphethweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikwele esibomvu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma kuphi emaphethweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOhlangothini lesihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma kuphi emugqeni wesihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOhlangothini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdayamondi eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma kuphi ohlangothini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOhlangothini lendiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndiza oqale kuyo, lapho isikhombi sisesikhaleni esingenalutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEmhlabathini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmhlaba (indiza ebomvu-eluhlaza), lapho kungekho okunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho umugqa we-axis usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala udlula emphethweni noma esihlokweni, i-ModelCraft iyabamba ekuhlanganeni futhi isiqondiso sibiza zombili, njengo &quot;On red axis, on edge&quot; (Ku-axis ebomvu, emphethweni).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubamba-okunqoba\"\u003EUkubamba okunqoba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E cishe angama-pixels ayi-12: kuqala amaphoyinti okuphela, bese amaphoyinti ezihloko, amaphakathi, isikhungo sohlangothi ngaphansi kwesikhombi nomsuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinqondo\u003C/strong\u003E ukusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala: ama-axes abomvu, aluhlaza nezolile, nokuhambisana noma ukuphambana nomphetho okhunjuziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmphethweni\u003C/strong\u003E noma emugqeni wesihloko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOhlangothini.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yokudweba\u003C/strong\u003E, noma umhlaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe ngaphansi kohlangothi azikaze zibanjwe. Zungeza ukuze ubone iphoyinti ofuna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukudweba-ohlangothini-ukusuka-kwiphoyinti\"\u003EUkudweba ohlangothini ukusuka kwiphoyinti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnxande, isiyingi noma ipholigoni eqaliswe ekhonweni, ephakathini, emphethweni noma esikhungweni sohlangothi kudwetshwa \u003Cstrong\u003Eendizeni yohlangothi okhomba kulo\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi iyaluwusa lolo hlangothi. Umphetho ungeyezinhlangothi ezimbili, ngakho uhlangothi womphetho okhomba kuwo uyanquma: ukuze udwebe ekugcineni kwebhokisi elide, qala ephakathini komunye wemiphetho yalo nesikhombi siphakathi kohlangothi lokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhambisana-nokuphambana\"\u003EUkuhambisana nokuphambana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ikhumbula \u003Cstrong\u003Eumphetho wokugcina isikhombi esadlula kuwo ngaphambi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuqala ekhonweni noma emphethweni kubalwa njengokudlula kulowo mphetho. Lapho ithuluzi selisebenza, eminye imiphetho ohamba kuyo ayisishintshi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkudweba umugqa ohambisana nomphetho okhona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese ushayela umphetho ofuna ukuwulingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba uye kwiphoyinti lokuqala, ngaphandle kokudlula kwezinye imiphetho uma kungenzeka, bese uchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba ngendlela ehambisana nalowo mphetho. Umugqa uba mpinki futhi isiqondiso sithi &quot;Parallel to edge&quot; (Ihambisana nomphetho). Ukuphambana kwenziwa ngendlela efanayo, endizeni oyidwebela kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kukhunjulwe umphetho ongalungile, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, shayela umphetho olungile, bese uqala kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khiya-indlela\"\u003EKhiya indlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuchofoza kokuqala kwethuluzi, ungagcina iphoyinti elilandelayo emugqeni owodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhiya ku-\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-axis ebomvu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-axis eluhlaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-axis ezolile (ngqo phezulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisana nomphetho okhunjuziwe (bona ngenhla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela umcibisholo ofanayo futhi ukuze ukhiye. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Ikhiywe ku-axis ebomvu. Cindezela umcibisholo ofanayo ukuze uvule.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ukhiyiwe, iphoyinti liyadonsa lisuka emgqeni lapho sikhomba khona isikhombi, futhi liyahlala lilingana namaphoyinti oshayela kuwo: shayela ikhona lebhokisi elinye ukuze udwebe umugqa ubomvu udlule kuleyo khona ngokuphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E ikhiya noma yiyiphi indlela ozolile kuyo khona manje (i-axis, noma ukuhambisana), kuze kube sesiphezu kwayo. Yiyeke ukuze uvule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkukhiyiwe kusebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E. Ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala, amakhiye omcibisholo ajikeleza umbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphakathi-kweqembu\"\u003ENgaphakathi kweqembu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu noma kwesakhi, ama-axes ayama-axes aleqembu (ayahamba nalo, futhi ayaphenduka nalo uma libekwe ngokuphenduka). Ukubamba kusathola amaphoyinti nemiphetho ngaphandle kweqembu, ukuze ukwazi ukuhlanganisa izinto nakwesinye semodeli.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ngenkathi ithuluzi lokudweba noma lokuhlela lisebenza, i-ModelCraft ibheka okungaphansi kwesikhombi ibambe into ewusizo kakhulu eseduze. Isimaki sikhombisa okuthole, futhi isiqondiso esingezansi kwesobunxele sichaza. Izimaki nezisiqondiso Isiqondiso Isimaki Ibamba Iphoyinti lokuphela Isiyingi esiluhlaza Ukuphela komphetho Iphakathi Isiyingi esiluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka Iphakathi lomphetho Isikhungo sohlangothi Isiyingi esizolile Iphakathi lohlangothi ngaphansi kwesikhombi Ihloko esihloko Ngebo Iphoyinti lesihloko eshiywe yi-tape Umsuka Okhilimu Lapho ama-axes abomvu, aluhlaza nezolile ahlangana Ku-axis ebomvu / Ku-axis eluhlaza / Ku-axis ezolile Umugqa waleyo mbala Umugqa usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala ngale ndlela Ihambisana nomphetho / Iphambene nomphetho Umugqa wepinki Umugqa usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala uhambisana noma uphambene nomphetho okhunjuziwe (bona ngezansi) Ukhiyiwe Umugqa wepinki Ukuqondisa okukhiywe ngekhiye lomcibisholo noma nge-Shift Emphethweni Isikwele esibomvu Noma kuphi emaphethweni Ohlangothini lesihloko Ngebo Noma kuphi emugqeni wesihloko Ohlangothini Idayamondi eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka Noma kuphi ohlangothini Ohlangothini lendiza Akukho Indiza oqale kuyo, lapho isikhombi sisesikhaleni esingenalutho Emhlabathini Akukho Umhlaba (indiza ebomvu-eluhlaza), lapho kungekho okunye Lapho umugqa we-axis usuka kwiphoyinti lakho lokuqala udlula emphethweni noma esihlokweni, i-ModelCraft iyabamba ekuhlanganeni futhi isiqondiso sibiza zombili, njengo \"On red axis, on edge\" (Ku-axis ebomvu, emphethweni). Ukubamba okunqoba Amaphoyinti cishe angama-pixels ayi-12: kuqala amaphoyinti okuphela, bese amaphoyinti ezihloko, amaphakathi, isikhungo sohlangothi ngaphansi kwesikhombi nomsuka. Izinqondo ukusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala: ama-axes abomvu, aluhlaza nezolile, nokuhambisana noma ukuphambana nomphetho okhunjuziwe. Emphethweni noma emugqeni wesihloko. Ohlangothini. Indiza yokudweba, noma umhlaba. Izinto ezifihliwe ngaphansi kohlangothi azikaze zibanjwe. Zungeza ukuze ubone iphoyinti ofuna. Ukudweba ohlangothini ukusuka kwiphoyinti Unxande, isiyingi noma ipholigoni eqaliswe ekhonweni, ephakathini, emphethweni noma esikhungweni sohlangothi kudwetshwa endizeni yohlangothi okhomba kulo, futhi iyaluwusa lolo hlangothi. Umphetho ungeyezinhlangothi ezimbili, ngakho uhlangothi womphetho okhomba kuwo uyanquma: ukuze udwebe ekugcineni kwebhokisi elide, qala ephakathini komunye wemiphetho yalo nesikhombi siphakathi kohlangothi lokugcina. Ukuhambisana nokuphambana I-ModelCraft ikhumbula umphetho wokugcina isikhombi esadlula kuwo ngaphambi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala. Ukuqala ekhonweni noma emphethweni kubalwa njengokudlula kulowo mphetho. Lapho ithuluzi selisebenza, eminye imiphetho ohamba kuyo ayisishintshi. Ukudweba umugqa ohambisana nomphetho okhona: Cindezela L bese ushayela umphetho ofuna ukuwulingana. Hamba uye kwiphoyinti lokuqala, ngaphandle kokudlula kwezinye imiphetho uma kungenzeka, bese uchofoza. Hamba ngendlela ehambisana nalowo mphetho. Umugqa uba mpinki futhi isiqondiso sithi \"Parallel to edge\" (Ihambisana nomphetho). Ukuphambana kwenziwa ngendlela efanayo, endizeni oyidwebela kuyo. Uma kukhunjulwe umphetho ongalungile, cindezela Esc, shayela umphetho olungile, bese uqala kabusha. Khiya indlela Ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala kwethuluzi, ungagcina iphoyinti elilandelayo emugqeni owodwa: Inkinobho Ikhiya ku- → I-axis ebomvu ← I-axis eluhlaza ↑ I-axis ezolile (ngqo phezulu) ↓ Ihambisana nomphetho okhunjuziwe (bona ngenhla) Cindezela umcibisholo ofanayo futhi ukuze ukhiye. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ikhiywe ku-axis ebomvu. Cindezela umcibisholo ofanayo ukuze uvule.\" Lapho ukhiyiwe, iphoyinti liyadonsa lisuka emgqeni lapho sikhomba khona isikhombi, futhi liyahlala lilingana namaphoyinti oshayela kuwo: shayela ikhona lebhokisi elinye ukuze udwebe umugqa ubomvu udlule kuleyo khona ngokuphelele. Shift ikhiya noma yiyiphi indlela ozolile kuyo khona manje (i-axis, noma ukuhambisana), kuze kube sesiphezu kwayo. Yiyeke ukuze uvule. Okukhiyiwe kusebenza ku-Line, Rectangle, Circle, Polygon, Move, Scale kanye ne-Tape. Ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala, amakhiye omcibisholo ajikeleza umbono. Ngaphakathi kweqembu Lapho uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu noma kwesakhi, ama-axes ayama-axes aleqembu (ayahamba nalo, futhi ayaphenduka nalo uma libekwe ngokuphenduka). Ukubamba kusathola amaphoyinti nemiphetho ngaphandle kweqembu, ukuze ukwazi ukuhlanganisa izinto nakwesinye semodeli.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"value-box","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Thayipha usayizi ngokunembile ku-value box","summary":"Zonke izindlela zokuthayipha ubude, usayizi, amaphuzu, ukuhamba, izinhlangothi nokukopisha, nokuthi amayunithi namanani angenaziphawu afundwa kanjani.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["value box","measurements box","vcb","thayipha","ngokunembile","isilinganiso","ubude","amayunithi","amafidi","amamilimitha","izixhumanisi","offset","array","izinhlangothi","i-engeli","ikhoma yedesimali"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuthayipha","text":"Ukuthayipha","level":2},{"id":"ubude","text":"Ubude","level":2},{"id":"okubalwayo","text":"Okubalwayo","level":2},{"id":"ngethuluzi","text":"Ngethuluzi","level":2},{"id":"amaphuzu-nokuphambanisa","text":"Amaphuzu nokuphambanisa","level":2},{"id":"izinkomba-ngemva-kokuhamba","text":"Izinkomba ngemva kokuhamba","level":2},{"id":"amabanga-athayiphwayo-adinga-isiqondiso","text":"Amabanga athayiphwayo adinga isiqondiso","level":2},{"id":"iyunithi-yemodeli","text":"Iyunithi yemodeli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-value box ihlala ku-status bar ngaphansi, nelebula elishintsha ngethuluzi. Uma usebenza ibonisa usayizi ophilayo; noma kunini ungathayipha owodwa ngokunembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthayipha\"\u003EUkuthayipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala isenzo ngokuchofoza (ikhona yokuqala, ubuso, iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha. Awudingi ukuchofoza i-value box: inombolo noma enye yalezi \u003Ccode\u003E. , - &#039; &quot; [ &lt; * /\u003C/code\u003E ithumela ukuthayipha kwakho lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-value box ukuze uyisule ubuyele ku-view. Ku-touch screen, thepha i-value box ukuze uvule ikhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-ModelCraft ingakwazi ukufunda okuthayiphile, i-status bar ithi &quot;Thayipha ubude njengo-3m, 10&#039;6&quot; noma 4m,3m.&quot; Uma ithuluzi lingakwazi ukusisebenzisa, lithi &quot;Akusebenzanga: …&quot; nesizathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubude\"\u003EUbude\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthayiphwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E320cm\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E3200mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamitha, amasentimitha, amamilimitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10ft\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10 feet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6in\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6 inches\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmainshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafidi namainshi, nengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmainshi nengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1.5ft\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.5m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmadesimali nesiyunithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo engenayo iyunithi, kuyunithi yemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInombolo engenayo iyunithi isebenzisa iyunithi yemodeli\u003C/strong\u003E, njengoba kukhonjiswa kukhethi ngaphansi kwesokudla: amainshi kumodeli yamafidi namainshi (ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E ingamafidi ayi-10), amamilimitha kumodeli yamamilimitha, njalo njalo. Ukuthayipha iyunithi kuyanqoba, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi yemodeli. Amawaza ezicabha (’ ” ′ ″) nawo afundwa njengamafidi namainshi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eichashazi\u003C/strong\u003E ngamadesimali: \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m\u003C/code\u003E. Ikhoma yahlukanisa amanani amabili, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E2,5\u003C/code\u003E ingu-2 no-5 (amanani amabili), noma yiziphi izilungiselelo zolimi zakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubalwayo\"\u003EOkubalwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma yisiphi ubude bungaba yisibalo: engeza \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, susa \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, phindaphinda \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, hlukanisa \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E, bese usebenzisa amabhulaketi. Akudingeki ikhalkhuleyitha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthayiphwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye yesithathu ka-2.5 (kuyunithi yemodeli)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;+3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039; 6 3/4&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E900 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 7/16&quot; kumodeli yamafidi namainshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3m-25cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.75 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInombolo engenayo iyunithi iba yiyunithi yemodeli uma iyubude (\u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E kumodeli yamamitha ingu-0.833 m), futhi uma iphindaphinda noma ihlukanisa ubude iba yisibalo esijwayelekile (\u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E). Ama-engeli nezibalo zokuphindaphinda nazo zamukela ukubalwa: \u003Ccode\u003E90/2\u003C/code\u003E ingu-45°. Amabanga amabili aphindaphindwe enza indawo, hhayi ubude, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E2m*3m\u003C/code\u003E iyenqatshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-ModelCraft ingakwazi ukukubala, i-status bar ichaza okungalungile nokuthi kuphi, isibonelo &quot;Ukuhlukanisa ngo-zero (uhlamvu 4).&quot; Ibhulaketi nalo liqala i-value box, ngakho ungaqala ngo-\u003Ccode\u003E(\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zigcina incazelo yazo: \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E ngemva kokukopisha, \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E kwezinhlangothi, nokuthi \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E ngomphetho okhethiwe (iwuhlukanisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003Eumphetho\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngethuluzi\"\u003ENgethuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlebula\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthayiphwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude (ngokuya kwesikhombisi), noma iphoyinti noma i-offset (ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnxande\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude ezimbili: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;,10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E. Isemikholoni nayo iyasebenza: \u003Ccode\u003E4m;3m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala, inani lezinhlangothi: \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E (3 kuya 999). Ngemva kwalokho, umsakazo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude. Olungelona hlangothi kuya ngaphansi kwalokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude (ngokuya kwesikhombisi), noma iphoyinti noma i-offset. Ngemva kokukopisha: \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmadigri: \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-45\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso esingaphezulu kuka-0: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.25\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthephu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingxenye\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezilinganayo ezingaki: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E5s\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E (2 kuya 1000). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003EHlukanisa umphetho noma ijika zibe yizingxenye ezilinganayo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambanisa\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho kuhamba khona umugqa wesilinganiso; ngemva kokuwubeka, ubude obusha buguqula usayizi wemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInani\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma kukhethwe isilinganiso esisodwa noma omphetho owodwa, ubude obusha buguqula usayizi wemodeli. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003ESilinganisa futhi uguqule usayizi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphuzu-nokuphambanisa\"\u003EAmaphuzu nokuphambanisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E iya kuleso siphoyinti esingqondile emodelini (ezinhlelweni zeqembu lalo uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu). Isibonelo: \u003Ccode\u003E[0,0,3m]\u003C/code\u003E ingu-3 m ngaphezulu kwe-origin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E iya kude kangaka kusukela esiphoyintini sokuqala ngasemgqeni obomvu, oluhlaza nowokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Isibonelo: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;0,0,10&#039;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ingu-10 amafidi ngqo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkunye ngakunye kwalezi zinani kungaba neyunithi yalo: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;12&#039;,0,6&quot;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkomba-ngemva-kokuhamba\"\u003EIzinkomba ngemva kokuhamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva nje kokukopisha nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthayiphwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhopi ezi-3 ngomugqa ngesikhala esifanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhopi ezi-3 ezihlukaniswe ngokulinganayo kusukela kokuqala kuya kokukopisha kokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuya kuma-500 izikhopi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy#a-row-of-copies\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\" data-hash=\"a-row-of-copies\"\u003EHambisa, kopisha futhi wenze ama-array\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amabanga-athayiphwayo-adinga-isiqondiso\"\u003EAmabanga athayiphwayo adinga isiqondiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude obuthayiphwe bodwa buya ngendlela ipointer ebheke kuyo kusukela ekuchofozeni kokuqala. Uma uthayipha ngemva kokuchofoza, ngaphambi kokuhamba nakancane, asikho isiqondiso futhi akukho okwenzekayo. Hambisa ipointer kancane ngasendleleni ofuna ukuya kuyo, bese uthayipha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iyunithi-yemodeli\"\u003EIyunithi yemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha iyunithi ekhethini ngaphansi kwesokudla: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eft and in\u003C/span\u003E, in, ft, yd, mi, mil, µm, mm, cm, m noma km, uma zivuliwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E (iyunithi yemodeli uqobo ihlala ikhona). Ubude othayiphwa ngophawu lanoma yiyiphi iyunithi lufundwa ngaleyo yunithi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EAmayunithi, amanani athayiphwayo nezinhlu zamayunithi\u003C/a\u003E. Lushintsha indlela ubude obubonakala ngayo nendlela izinombolo ezingenayo iyunithi ezifundwa ngayo; imodeli ihlala ingosayizi ofanayo. Iyunithi igcinwa efayelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela usayizi obonakala ngayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUbude\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmavolumu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eft and in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E (kuya ku-1/16&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ein\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E126 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E320 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3200 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em² kusukela ku-0.01 m², kungenjalo mm²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em³ kusukela ku-0.01 m³, kungenjalo mm³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli entsha iqala ngamafidi namainshi uma ulimi lwesiphequluli luseyisifunda se-US (nase-Liberia naseMyanmar), futhi ngamamilimitha kwenye indawo yonke. Iyunithi enenkanyezi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E isetshenziswa esikhundleni salokho, uma i-ModelCraft inayo. Noma shintsha ikhethi ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-value box ihlala ku-status bar ngaphansi, nelebula elishintsha ngethuluzi. Uma usebenza ibonisa usayizi ophilayo; noma kunini ungathayipha owodwa ngokunembile. Ukuthayipha Qala isenzo ngokuchofoza (ikhona yokuqala, ubuso, iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo). Thayipha. Awudingi ukuchofoza i-value box: inombolo noma enye yalezi . , - ' \" [ \u003C * / ithumela ukuthayipha kwakho lapho. Cindezela Enter. Cindezela Esc ku-value box ukuze uyisule ubuyele ku-view. Ku-touch screen, thepha i-value box ukuze uvule ikhibhodi. Uma i-ModelCraft ingakwazi ukufunda okuthayiphile, i-status bar ithi \"Thayipha ubude njengo-3m, 10'6\" noma 4m,3m.\" Uma ithuluzi lingakwazi ukusisebenzisa, lithi \"Akusebenzanga: …\" nesizathu. Ubude Okuthayiphwayo Kusho 3m 320cm 3200mm Amamitha, amasentimitha, amamilimitha 10' 10ft 10 feet Amafidi 6\" 6in 6 inches Amainshi 10'6\" 10' 6\" 10'-6 1/2\" Amafidi namainshi, nengxenye 6 1/2\" 6-1/2\" 3/4\" Amainshi nengxenye 1.5ft .5m Amadesimali nesiyunithi 120 Inombolo engenayo iyunithi, kuyunithi yemodeli Inombolo engenayo iyunithi isebenzisa iyunithi yemodeli, njengoba kukhonjiswa kukhethi ngaphansi kwesokudla: amainshi kumodeli yamafidi namainshi (ngakho 120 ingamafidi ayi-10), amamilimitha kumodeli yamamilimitha, njalo njalo. Ukuthayipha iyunithi kuyanqoba, nanoma iyiphi iyunithi yemodeli. Amawaza ezicabha (’ ” ′ ″) nawo afundwa njengamafidi namainshi. Sebenzisa ichashazi ngamadesimali: 2.5m. Ikhoma yahlukanisa amanani amabili, ngakho 2,5 ingu-2 no-5 (amanani amabili), noma yiziphi izilungiselelo zolimi zakho. Okubalwayo Noma yisiphi ubude bungaba yisibalo: engeza +, susa -, phindaphinda *, hlukanisa /, bese usebenzisa amabhulaketi. Akudingeki ikhalkhuleyitha. Okuthayiphwayo Kusho 2.5/3 Ingxenye yesithathu ka-2.5 (kuyunithi yemodeli) 12'6\"+3/4\" 12' 6 3/4\" (24'-0\")/3 8' 2*450mm 900 mm 4+7/16 4 7/16\" kumodeli yamafidi namainshi 3m-25cm 2.75 m Inombolo engenayo iyunithi iba yiyunithi yemodeli uma iyubude (2.5/3 kumodeli yamamitha ingu-0.833 m), futhi uma iphindaphinda noma ihlukanisa ubude iba yisibalo esijwayelekile (2*450mm). Ama-engeli nezibalo zokuphindaphinda nazo zamukela ukubalwa: 90/2 ingu-45°. Amabanga amabili aphindaphindwe enza indawo, hhayi ubude, ngakho 2m*3m iyenqatshwa. Uma i-ModelCraft ingakwazi ukukubala, i-status bar ichaza okungalungile nokuthi kuphi, isibonelo \"Ukuhlukanisa ngo-zero (uhlamvu 4).\" Ibhulaketi nalo liqala i-value box, ngakho ungaqala ngo-(. Lezi zigcina incazelo yazo: /3, 3x no *3 ngemva kokukopisha, 24s kwezinhlangothi, nokuthi /3 ngomphetho okhethiwe (iwuhlukanisa umphetho). Ngethuluzi Ithuluzi Ilebula Okuthayiphwayo Umugqa Ubude Ubude (ngokuya kwesikhombisi), noma iphoyinti noma i-offset (ngezansi) Unxande Izilinganiso Ubude ezimbili: 4m,3m, 12',10'. Isemikholoni nayo iyasebenza: 4m;3m Indilinga, Ipholigoni Izinhlangothi, bese Umsakazo Ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala, inani lezinhlangothi: 12s noma 12 (3 kuya 999). Ngemva kwalokho, umsakazo Sunduza/hudula Ibanga Ubude. Olungelona hlangothi kuya ngaphansi kwalokho Hambisa Ibanga Ubude (ngokuya kwesikhombisi), noma iphoyinti noma i-offset. Ngemva kokukopisha: 3x, *3, /3 Jikisa I-engeli Amadigri: 90, -45, 22.5 Shintsha usayizi Shintsha usayizi Isilinganiso esingaphezulu kuka-0: 2, 0.5, 1.25 Ithephu Phambanisa noma Ubude Ubude Hlukanisa Izingxenye Izingxenye ezilinganayo ezingaki: 5, 5s noma /5 (2 kuya 1000). Bona Hlukanisa umphetho noma ijika zibe yizingxenye ezilinganayo Isilinganiso Phambanisa, bese Ubude Lapho kuhamba khona umugqa wesilinganiso; ngemva kokuwubeka, ubude obusha buguqula usayizi wemodeli Khetha Inani Uma kukhethwe isilinganiso esisodwa noma omphetho owodwa, ubude obusha buguqula usayizi wemodeli. Bona Silinganisa futhi uguqule usayizi Amaphuzu nokuphambanisa Ku-Umugqa ne-Hambisa, ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala: [x,y,z] iya kuleso siphoyinti esingqondile emodelini (ezinhlelweni zeqembu lalo uma uhlela ngaphakathi kweqembu). Isibonelo: [0,0,3m] ingu-3 m ngaphezulu kwe-origin. \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E iya kude kangaka kusukela esiphoyintini sokuqala ngasemgqeni obomvu, oluhlaza nowokuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Isibonelo: \u003C0,0,10'\u003E ingu-10 amafidi ngqo phezulu. Okunye ngakunye kwalezi zinani kungaba neyunithi yalo: \u003C12',0,6\"\u003E. Izinkomba ngemva kokuhamba Ngemva nje kokukopisha nge-Hambisa: Okuthayiphwayo Kwenza 3x noma *3 Izikhopi ezi-3 ngomugqa ngesikhala esifanayo /3 Izikhopi ezi-3 ezihlukaniswe ngokulinganayo kusukela kokuqala kuya kokukopisha kokuqala Kuya kuma-500 izikhopi. Bona Hambisa, kopisha futhi wenze ama-array. Amabanga athayiphwayo adinga isiqondiso Ubude obuthayiphwe bodwa buya ngendlela ipointer ebheke kuyo kusukela ekuchofozeni kokuqala. Uma uthayipha ngemva kokuchofoza, ngaphambi kokuhamba nakancane, asikho isiqondiso futhi akukho okwenzekayo. Hambisa ipointer kancane ngasendleleni ofuna ukuya kuyo, bese uthayipha. Iyunithi yemodeli Shintsha iyunithi ekhethini ngaphansi kwesokudla: ft and in, in, ft, yd, mi, mil, µm, mm, cm, m noma km, uma zivuliwe ku-Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Amayunithi (iyunithi yemodeli uqobo ihlala ikhona). Ubude othayiphwa ngophawu lanoma yiyiphi iyunithi lufundwa ngaleyo yunithi. Bona Amayunithi, amanani athayiphwayo nezinhlu zamayunithi. Lushintsha indlela ubude obubonakala ngayo nendlela izinombolo ezingenayo iyunithi ezifundwa ngayo; imodeli ihlala ingosayizi ofanayo. Iyunithi igcinwa efayelini. Indlela usayizi obonakala ngayo: Iyunithi Ubude Izindawo Amavolumu ft and in 10' 6 1/2\" (kuya ku-1/16\") sq ft cu ft in 126 1/2\" sq in cu in m 3.2 m m² m³ cm 320 cm cm² cm³ mm 3200 mm m² kusukela ku-0.01 m², kungenjalo mm² m³ kusukela ku-0.01 m³, kungenjalo mm³ Imodeli entsha iqala ngamafidi namainshi uma ulimi lwesiphequluli luseyisifunda se-US (nase-Liberia naseMyanmar), futhi ngamamilimitha kwenye indawo yonke. Iyunithi enenkanyezi ku-Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Amayunithi isetshenziswa esikhundleni salokho, uma i-ModelCraft inayo. Noma shintsha ikhethi ngemva kwe-Okusha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"formats","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Amafomethi wefayela ngokuningiliziwe","summary":"Okugcinwa, okuguqulwa nokushiywa yi-ModelCraft kuyo yonke ifomethi evulayo, engenisayo nethumelayo.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["amafomethi","izinhlobo zamafayela","modelcraft","json","3dm","nurbs","skp","collada","dae","obj","mtl","gltf","glb","stl","step","stp","ap214","ap242","ply","alembic","abc","cache","fbx","3mf","ifc","dwg","dxf","amayunithi","ama-axis","y phezulu","z phezulu","amamillimitha","imikhawulo"],"headings":[{"id":"modelcraft-modelcraft","text":"ModelCraft (.modelcraft)","level":2},{"id":"usd-usd-usda-usdc-usdz","text":"USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz)","level":2},{"id":"collada-dae","text":"Collada (.dae)","level":2},{"id":"obj-obj-mtl","text":"OBJ (.obj, .mtl)","level":2},{"id":"gltf-glb-gltf","text":"glTF (.glb, .gltf)","level":2},{"id":"stl-stl","text":"STL (.stl)","level":2},{"id":"step-step-stp","text":"STEP (.step, .stp)","level":2},{"id":"3dm","text":".3dm","level":2},{"id":"ply-ply","text":"PLY (.ply)","level":2},{"id":"fbx-fbx","text":"FBX (.fbx)","level":2},{"id":"alembic-abc","text":"Alembic (.abc)","level":2},{"id":"3mf-3mf","text":"3MF (.3mf)","level":2},{"id":"ukukhipha-kwe-dwg-ne-dxf-dwg-dxf","text":"Ukukhipha kwe-DWG ne-DXF (.dwg, .dxf)","level":2},{"id":"ifc-ifc","text":"IFC (.ifc)","level":2},{"id":"dwg-dwg-ne-dxf-dxf","text":"DWG (.dwg) ne-DXF (.dxf)","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-e-skp","text":"Amafayela e-SKP","level":2},{"id":"akusekelwe","text":"Akusekelwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ye-ModelCraft ingamamitha, ne-Z (eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) iphezulu. Yonke ifomethi engezansi iguqulwa iye noma ivela kulokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"modelcraft-modelcraft\"\u003EModelCraft (.modelcraft)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) noma wehlise kokubukwayo. Amafayela aphelelayo nge-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E nawo amukelekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), njengokulanda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke: ijiyomethri, ubuso nemibala yabo, impahla yokwakha nezithombe ezingeniswe, amalambu, imiphetho ethambile, amaqembu, izakhi, amagama, imihlahlandlela, imiboniso, amayunithi, nekhamera nesitayela sokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKushiywa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmlando wokuhlehlisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmkhawulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E200 MB\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela elilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft entsha kunaleyo yakho liyenqatshwa: &quot;Le modeli ilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft entsha kunaleyo (inguqulo yefayela …). Buyekeza i-ModelCraft ukuze uyivule.&quot; Ifayela elingesiyo imodeli ye-ModelCraft lithi: &quot;Lolu hlobo lwefayela alusiyo imodeli ye-ModelCraft (alusiyo i-JSON).&quot; noma &quot;Lolu alusiyo ifayela le-ModelCraft esingalivula: …&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usd-usd-usda-usdc-usdz\"\u003EUSD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula, ngenisa, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela le-USD eligcinwe yi-ModelCraft livuleka futhi ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa lutho; amafayela e-USD ezinye izinhlelo avulwa njengemisheshi, amaqembu, izakhi, amalambu namakhamera. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003ELondoloza, vula futhi khipha i-USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"collada-dae\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa nokukhipha. Ifomethi engcono kakhulu yokushintshanisa amamodeli nabanye abenzi be-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha:\u003C/strong\u003E Collada 1.4.1, Z phezulu, amamitha. Ijiyomethri eyodwa ngencazelo yeqembu noma yesakhi ngalinye; izakhi zibhalwa kanye kuphela futhi zibekwa ngesethulo, ngakho zihlala zabelwana. Ubuso enemigodi noma imigqa engaphakathi ihlukaniswa ibe izinxantathu. Imibala iba impahla yokwakha. Imiphetho engaxhunyiwe ibhalwa njengemigqa. Amagama angavumelekile kule fomethi ayalungiswa, futhi igama elingokoqobo ligcinwa eduze kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E izinxantathu, amapholigoni (anemigodi), amafeni nezintambo zezinxantathu zibe ubuso; imigqa ibe imiphetho. Ukuguqulwa kwe-node, i-axis esaphezulu yefayela neyunithi yayo kuyasetshenziswa. I-node ebekwe ezindaweni eziningi, noma ijiyomethri esetshenziswa ama-node amaningi, iza njengesakhi; ama-node avamile aza njengamaqembu. Imibala yempahla (diffuse) iba yimibala yobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkungeniswa:\u003C/strong\u003E izithombe, izikhumba nezinguquko zesimo, amakhamera, amalambu, ezinye izinhlobo zokuguqula (look-at neskew), nezinkomba kwamanye amafayela. Ibha yesimo iyazibala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKulahlekile lapho kukhishwa:\u003C/strong\u003E yimiphi imiphetho ethambile. \u003Cstrong\u003ELapho kungeniswa,\u003C/strong\u003E izindawo ezinxantathu zihlala zinxantathu, nedayagonali ziyathanjiswa ukuze izindawo ezicaba zibonakale njengobuso obubodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"obj-obj-mtl\"\u003EOBJ (.obj, .mtl)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa nokukhipha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E phonsa i-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E yayo nezithombe zokuthungwa (noma ngenise i-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E yodwa: ingena ingenampahla yokwakha, futhi ibha yesimo iqamba i-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E eyayifunwa). Ifundwa njengamamitha nge-Y phezulu. Into ngayinye (\u003Ccode\u003Eo\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003Eg\u003C/code\u003E) iba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Ei-mesh\u003C/a\u003E, ubuso bayo bugcinwa njengoba bunjalo (amakhwadrangili ahlala ekhwadrangili). Izixhumanisi zokuthungwa, izinqondo nemibala ngamaphoyinti ziyagcinwa. Isithombe sombala wempahla (\u003Ccode\u003Emap_Kd\u003C/code\u003E, PNG, JPEG noma WebP) singena njengokuthungwa, nezinketho zaso zesikali nokushintshwa; uma kungenjalo, umbala waso (\u003Ccode\u003EKd\u003C/code\u003E). Imiphetho lapho izinqondo zefayela zephula khona iqinile; uma kungekho zinqondo, amaqembu okubushelezisa efayela ayanquma. Amanye amamephu (bump, normal), amaphoyinti, imigqa namajika ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa. I-OBJ ayinayo iyunithi, ngakho imodeli eyenziwe ngamamillimitha noma amayintshi ifika ngosayizi ongalungile: yilinganise ngemva kokungenisa (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003EPhendula futhi linganisa\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha:\u003C/strong\u003E amamitha, Y phezulu, izixhumanisi zomhlaba. Into eyodwa ngokubekwa kweqembu ngalinye; izakhi zibhalwa ngokugcwele endaweni ngayinye. Ama-mesh agcina ubuso bawo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nezinqondo; ubuso oxhunywe ngemiphetho \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003Eethambile\u003C/a\u003E buthola inqondo ngakunye ekhoneni. Uma imodeli inemibala, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyalandwa eduze kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E. Uma inezithombe zokuthungwa ezingenisiwe, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, i-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E nezithombe ziyalandwa ndawonye njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E amaphoyinti noma ubuso obungu-2 million; 64 MB yombhalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gltf-glb-gltf\"\u003EglTF (.glb, .gltf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa nokukhipha, i-glTF 2.0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E i-\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, noma i-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.bin\u003C/code\u003E namafayela esithombe sokuthungwa: wehlise konke ngesikhathi kokubukwayo (noma khetha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E). I-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E enikezwe yodwa ibiza ifayela eliyidingayo: &quot;Le fayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E lidinga &quot;…&quot;: vula inguqulo ye-\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, noma wehlise i-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E kanye namafayela ayo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/strong\u003E angena njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E, eyodwa ngayinye kufayela, izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti kuyagcinwa. Imiphetho lapho izinqondo zephula khona iqinile; eyengcaphuno ithambile. I-mesh esetshenziswa ezindaweni eziningi ihlala ibelwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-node\u003C/strong\u003E aba ngamaqembu, anesibizo njengasefayeleni. Ama-mesh ayinkomba (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) angena njenge-mesh eyodwa ebekwe izikhathi eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla yokwakha:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuthungwa komumbala oyisisekelo (PNG, JPEG noma WebP) kungena njengokuthungwa, kubekwe ngezixhumanisi zokuthungwa zefayela (nanoma yiluphi ukuguqulwa kokuthungwa), futhi kuyagcinwa lapho ulondoloza; kungenjalo, umbala oyisisekelo. I-metal, ukuqina, amamephu ajwayelekile, ingilazi, i-clear coat, i-sheen nezinye izandiso zempahla ziyafundwa kodwa aziqhubeki zigcinwe: ibha yesimo iyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmalambu\u003C/strong\u003E (KHR_lights_punctual): amalambu aphuthumayo nezindawo aba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Eamalambu\u003C/a\u003E. Amalambu aqondile ayabalwa: ilanga likhanyisa imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhamera\u003C/strong\u003E aba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Eyimiboniso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbalingiswa abanesikhumba\u003C/strong\u003E bangena bemi njengoba efayela libeka kanjalo; amathambo abo nama-animation abo, nezinhloso zokuguquka kwesimo, ayabalwa futhi aziqhubeki zigcinwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela acindezelwe\u003C/strong\u003E (Draco, meshopt) nedatha equantized ayafundwa. Abadekhoda balayisha kuphela ifayela elidinga bona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphoyinti nemigqa ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa (i-mesh ibamba ubuso). Izithombe ze-KTX2 ziyashiywa; ubuso bugcina umbala wabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E): i-glTF 2.0 binary, amamitha, Y phezulu. I-mesh eyodwa ngencazelo ngayinye, ngakho izakhi zihlala zabelwana. Ama-mesh agcina izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti; ubuso oxhunywe \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003Engemiphetho ethambile\u003C/a\u003E bunenqondo ebushelezi. Imibala nempahla kuba yimpahla yokwakha (impahla njengombala wayo); izithombe ezingeniswe zibhalwa njengokuthungwa. Amalambu avulekile aba amalambu aphuthumayo nezindawo (amalambu wendawo awanalingani ku-glTF futhi ashiywa); imiboniso iba amakhamera. Imiphetho engaxhunyiwe iyashiywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela kuya ku-300 MB; cishe izigidi eziyi-130 zamanani ejiyomethri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stl-stl\"\u003ESTL (.stl)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa nokukhipha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E i-binary noma i-ASCII. I-STL ayinayo iyunithi: ifundwa njengamamillimitha, njengoba abaprinta nokukhishwa kwe-ModelCraft kuyibhala ngayo. Amakhona endawo efanayo ayaxhumana, ngakho ingxenye evaliwe ifika njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E evaliwe. Imibala efayeleni (izivumelwano ze-VisCAM / SolidView ne-Materialise) ipenda ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha,\u003C/strong\u003E ukuprinta nge-3D: i-binary STL, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamamillimitha\u003C/strong\u003E, Z phezulu. Izinxantathu kuphela: amaqembu nemiphetho engaxhunyiwe ayashiywa. Ubuso obupeniwe bugcina umbala wabo ngesivumelwano se-VisCAM / SolidView, esinye isofthiwe esingasinaki uma singasifundi. Khipha izinto eziqinile ezivaliwe ukuze uthole ukuprinta okuhlanzekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-step-stp\"\u003ESTEP (.step, .stp)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa kuphela. I-STEP yilokho abenzi bezingxenye nabahlinzeki abakuthumelayo: amafayela e-AP203, AP214 ne-AP242.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E i-ModelCraft ifunda ifayela ngokwayo, ekhasini, futhi iguqule yonke into eqinile ibe \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Ei-mesh\u003C/a\u003E evaliwe yezinxantathu: ubuso obucaba buhlala bucaba, ubuso ogobile (amasilinda, amakhoni, amabhola, ama-torus, ubuso be-B-spline) buba izinto eziningi ezincane ezicaba, nemiphetho ngaphakathi kobuso obugobile ibushelezi, nemiphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ibukhali. Amafayela e-STEP asho iyunithi yawo; imodeli ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela. Umhlangano ufika nazo zonke izingxenye lapho ifayela zibeka khona, ingxenye ngayinye iyi-mesh yayo eqenjini elibizwa ngegama lefayela. Imibala, amagama ezingxenye zomthi womhlangano nokubekezelela (PMI) akufundwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImilayezo:\u003C/strong\u003E okuphuthelwe noma okudwetshwe ngokungaphelele kungezelelwa emugqeni wesimo (&quot;Notes: …&quot;); ifayela elingenalutho oluqinile, ifayela elonakele noma elidlule imikhawulo lisho ngani futhi alengezi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela kuya ku-300 MB; ubuso obungu-400 000 nezinxantathu ezingu-8 million.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3dm\"\u003E.3dm\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa kuphela. Amafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E agcina amamodeli e-NURBS: ubuso bamapholisurfesi, ubuso, ama-mesh, amajika namabhulokhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E i-ModelCraft ifunda ifayela ngokwayo, ekhasini. Ama-mesh angena njengoba enjalo; bonke ubuso bepolisurfesi noma bokwelulwa buvela kusigaxa esigciniwe kanye nefayela, uma kungenjalo i-ModelCraft iyakwakha (amaplanes, ubuso be-NURBS, ubuso bokuguqulwa, amajika akhishiwe, ukukhishwa; kugoqwe ngemiphetho yabo, amapholisurfesi avaliwe njenge-mesh evaliwe). Amajika aba imiphetho, amabhulokhi aba izakhi (amabhulokhi ngaphakathi kwamabhulokhi agcinwa), izendlalelo ziba amathegi (zifihliwe uma zivaliwe), umbala wento (wayo, wesendlalelo sayo noma wempahla yayo) upenda ubuso bayo. Ifayela lisho iyunithi yalo; imodeli ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela. Izinyathelo ngazinye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImilayezo:\u003C/strong\u003E ibha yesimo ithi ubuso bangaki obuvela ezinhlelweni ezigciniwe nobangaki obakhiwe, futhi iqamba okushiyiwe: amaphoyinti, amafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso, ama-hatch, amalambu, izinto ze-SubD, ubuso ezinhlobweni zendawo ezingakafundwa, amabhulokhi axhunyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela kuya ku-300 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ply-ply\"\u003EPLY (.ply)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa nokukhipha, ama-mesh anemibala (ukuskena, ukuprinta nge-3D ngemibala, abenzi abanye).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa:\u003C/strong\u003E ASCII ne-binary. Ubuso buba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Ei-mesh\u003C/a\u003E izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti igcinwa; ubuso ngabunye upenjwa ngombala osondele kakhulu kwemibala engu-4,096 ukuze ubone imibala njengamanje. I-PLY ayinayo iyunithi noma umthetho we-axis: izixhumanisi zingena njengoba zinjalo (amamitha, Z phezulu). I-PLY enamaphoyinti kuphela iyidikhi lamaphoyinti:ivule ku-BimCraft noma ku-CivilCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha:\u003C/strong\u003E i-binary PLY enezindawo, izinqondo nemibala (nezixhumanisi zokuthungwa uma imodeli inazo), ngamamitha, Z phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fbx-fbx\"\u003EFBX (.fbx)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa kuphela. Amafayela e-FBX 7 (kusukela ngo-2011), i-binary noma i-ASCII, afundwa yisifundi se-ModelCraft ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-mesh angena njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E nezinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa (wonke amasethi e-UV) nemibala yamaphoyinti; i-mesh esetshenziswa izinto eziningi ihlala ibelwana. Izinto ziba amaqembu nokuguqulwa kwazo (okuphakathi, okuphambukayo nokuphendulwa kwangaphambili kuhlanganisiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpahla yokwakha: ukuthungwa komumbala (diffuse) — okufakwe kufayela, noma isithombe esiwiswe ndawonye ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E — kungena njengokuthungwa (izithombe ze-TGA ziyagcinwa njenge-PNG); kungenjalo umbala wokusabalala. Ezinye izilungiselelo zempahla zilinda imodeli entsha yempahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-axis esaphezulu yefayela neyunithi yalo iyasetshenziswa: konke kungena nge-Z phezulu, ngamamitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalambu amaphuthumayo nezendawo aba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Eamalambu\u003C/a\u003E (ukukhanya kwe-FBX okungu-100 yilamba elijwayelekile le-ModelCraft, ama-lumens angu-800: ukukhanya kwe-FBX akunayuniti). Amakhamera aba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Eimiboniso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbalingiswa abanesikhumba bangena besimi; amathambo nama-animation ayabalwa futhi aziqhubeki zigcinwe. Amalambu aqondile nendawo, nejiyomethri engeyona ama-mesh (i-NURBS, amajika), ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafayela e-FBX 6 nakadlule ayenqatshwa: wawagcine kabusha njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alembic-abc\"\u003EAlembic (.abc)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungenisa kuphela: ama-cache ejiyomethri avela ezinhlelweni zokwenza ama-animation nemiphumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-mesh (ama-mesh wamapholigoni nokuhlukaniswa) angena njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E, nezixhumanisi zokuthungwa nezinqondo; ukuguqulwa kuba amaqembu. I-Alembic iphezulu nge-Y futhi iguqulwa ibe Z phezulu; amamitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-cache enezampula eziningi (i-animation) ingena ngesampula yayo yokuqala; ibha yesimo ithi ziningi kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphoyinti, amajika, ubuso be-NURBS, amakhamera namalambu ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa. Amafayela esakhiwo esidala se-HDF5 ayenqatshwa: wawagcine kabusha njengefayela le-Ogawa Alembic.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E ihlola isimo kuqala bese ibhala ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonisiwe. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3mf-3mf\"\u003E3MF (.3mf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhipha kuphela, kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E. I-3MF core: i-mesh eyodwa ngamamillimitha, Z phezulu, nemibala yayo njengempahla. Izinhlelo eziningi zokusika ziyayifunda, futhi ngokungafani ne-STL ibiza iyunithi yayo. Izinto ezifihliwe ziyashiywa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhipha-kwe-dwg-ne-dxf-dwg-dxf\"\u003EUkukhipha kwe-DWG ne-DXF (.dwg, .dxf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgezinhlelo ze-CAD. Imodeli ibhalwa ngeyunithi yayo: amayintshi kumodeli yamafidi namayintshi, kungenjalo amamillimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha (ibha yesimo iyiqamba).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E buba ubuso be-3D (izinxantathu). Imigqa engaphakathi kobuso nemiphetho ethambile ibhalwa ingabonakali, ngakho ubuso bubukeka njengobe-ModelCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho engaxhunyiwe\u003C/strong\u003E iba imigqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaqembu nezakhi\u003C/strong\u003E ziba amabhulokhi: isakhi sibhalwa kanye bese sibekwa njengoba sisetshenziswa, kubandakanya nezikhopi ezijikelezwe nezibonakalisiwe. Iqembu elelulwe ngemva kokujikelezwa (ngakho lithambekele) kunalokho libhalwa lapho lisendaweni yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibala:\u003C/strong\u003E i-DWG igcina umbala wobuso ngamunye ngokunembile; i-DXF isebenzisa okusondele kakhulu kwemibala engu-255 ye-CAD evamile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguqulo:\u003C/strong\u003E i-DWG ibhalwa njenge-AutoCAD 2004 (AC1018), ezinhlelweni ze-CAD ezisukela ngo-2004 kuya phezulu ziyayivula. I-DXF iyi-R12 (AC1009), inguqulo yonke inhlelo ye-CAD iyifundayo; i-R12 ayinayo insimu yeyunithi, ngakho tshela uhlelo lwe-CAD ukuthi kufanele lusebenzise iyiphi iyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkubhalwa:\u003C/strong\u003E imihlahlandlela, izilinganiso, imiboniso, nekhamera.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-ifc\"\u003EIFC (.ifc)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhipha kuphela, ku-BimCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM. I-IFC4 enephrojekthi, isayithi, isakhiwo nezitezi zaso. Iqembu noma isakhi ngasinye esiphezulu siba iproksi yento yesakhiwo esinegama layo; ezivaliwe zibhalwa njengezimo eziqinile (ama-faceted breps), ezivulekile njengemodeli yobuso; izimbobo ebusweni ziyagcinwa. Ijiyomethri engaphezulu eshiyekile iba into eyodwa ebizwa ngokuthi &quot;Loose geometry&quot;. Akukho zinhlobo, izimpawu noma impahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitezi:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi ze-IFC…\u003C/span\u003E ziyazibala, ngayinye inegama nokuphakama (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isitezi\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQagela kusuka kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E, okwenza isitezi esisodwa ngakunye ukuphakama okuma kukho amaqembu wakho aphezulu). Lapho kukhishwa, iqembu noma isakhi ngasinye siya esitezini esingaphansi noma esilingana nephoyinti lalo eliphansi kakhulu, futhi sigcina indawo yaso. Uma ungekho izitezi, konke kuya esitezini esisodwa, &quot;Level 1&quot;, ku-0. Izitezi zilondolozwa kufayela le-ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dwg-dwg-ne-dxf-dxf\"\u003EDWG (.dwg) ne-DXF (.dxf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenisa njengemigqa phansi (ama-hatch nobuso be-3D njengobuso); khipha njengoba kuchazwe ngenhla. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EImodeli kwipulani yesayithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFundwa:\u003C/strong\u003E imigqa, ama-polyline (namanmsalo), ama-polyline e-3D, izindilinga, imimsalo, nezinkomba zamabhulokhi kubandakanya nezinhlu, kusuka endaweni yemodeli. Izinto ezingabonakali (njengezimo ezifihliwe zebhulokhi eliguquguqukayo) ziyashiywa. Amajika aba izingxenye ezingu-48 ezigqamile ngokujikeleza ngakunye okugcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFundwa kusukela ku-0.4:\u003C/strong\u003E ama-spline namaellipse (njengemiphetho), umbhalo, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezinani zezici (njengemiphetho ngohlobo lombhalo womugqa oyodwa), ama-hatch (ubuso nezimbobo), ubuso be-3D nokugcwaliswa okuqinile (ubuso), nezilinganiso (zidwetshwe kusuka emabhulokhini ezilinganiso omdwebo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFundwa kusukela ku-0.7:\u003C/strong\u003E izinto eziqinile ze-3D, izifunda namabhodi (idatha yabo ye-ACIS, i-DWG ne-DXF zazo zonke izinguqulo), ngayinye njengeqembu layo, ezivaliwe njengezinto eziqinile. Ubuso obuqhamuka kwezinye izindawo ngaphandle kwezindawo ezicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, amabhola, ama-torus nendawo elula ye-spline ayashiywa futhi ayadwetshwa ohlwini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkufundwa:\u003C/strong\u003E amaphoyinti, amathebula, ama-multileader, izithombe, nanoma yini esikhaleni sephepha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi:\u003C/strong\u003E athathwa emdwebeni uma eshilo. Uma kungenjalo, i-ModelCraft iyabuza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-DXF\u003C/strong\u003E kumele ibe yi-ASCII. I-DXF ye-binary iyenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-DWG\u003C/strong\u003E kusukela ku-AutoCAD R13 kuya kufomethi yamanje (AutoCAD 2018 nangaphezulu; AC1012 kuya ku-AC1032) afundwa yisifundi se-DWG se-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ekhasini; siyingxenye ye-ModelCraft, ngakho sisebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi noma nini lapho i-ModelCraft isebenza. Izinguqulo ezidlule (i-R12 nangaphambili) namafayela alimele kakhulu awakwazi ukufundwa; wagcine njenge-DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImikhawulo:\u003C/strong\u003E izixhumanisi ezingaphezu kwe-10,000 km kusukela emsukeni, noma izingcezu zemigqa ezingaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-2, ziyenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-e-skp\"\u003EAmafayela e-SKP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E (noma wehlise ifayela phezu kokubukwayo) ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp ngesifundi se-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ekhasini: akukho lokho okulayishwayo, futhi kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi noma nini lapho i-ModelCraft isebenza. Ihlolwe ngamafayela avela ku-SketchUp 3, 6, 7, 2014, 2017, 2018, 2020, 2025 nango-2026; ezinye izinguqulo kufanele zivule futhi, kodwa azikaze zizanywe. Imodeli ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela. Ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye kuyisusa futhi. Izinyathelo ngazinye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli ye-SKP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKugcinwe:\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso nezimbobo zabo, amaqembu (njengamaqembu) nezakhi (njengezakhi, ezabelwanayo), amagama nezindawo zazo, imibala, amathegi amaqembu nezakhi, imiphetho engeyona ingxenye yobuso, nemiphetho ethambile nebushelezi, ukuze izindawo ezigobile zihlale zibushelezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibala:\u003C/strong\u003E impahla yobuso ngabunye inikeza umbala wayo. Impahla epeniwe kuqembu noma kwisakhi iba upende walokho okubekwe, ngakho ubuso obungaphakathi obungenambala wabo bawuthatha, njengakwi-SketchUp; isakhi esipeniwe ngemibala emibili sihlala yisakhi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathegi\u003C/strong\u003E emaqembini nasezakhini aba ngamathegi e-ModelCraft, abonakale noma afihlekile njengoba ayenjalo. Amathegi kubuso nasemiphethweni engaxhunyiwe ayagcinwa (i-ModelCraft ithegisa amaqembu nezakhi kuphela); ibha yesimo iyawabala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe zingena zifihliwe\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu, izakhi, nobuso nemiphetho kutegi elifihliwe), ukuze ubone lokho i-SketchUp yayikubonisa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVeza konke\u003C/span\u003E iyazibonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithombe zokuthungwa:\u003C/strong\u003E ubuso openiwe ngempahla enokuthungwa ugcina ukuthungwa kwawo, ubekwe njengoba kunjalo efayeleni, nefayela le-ModelCraft ligcina isithombe. Ukuthungwa okusetshenziswa iqembu lonke noma isakhi, ukuthungwa okungekho efayeleni, noma isithombe amasiphequluli angasibonisa (njengefayela le-Photoshop) kugcina umbala wempahla kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKushiywe, futhi kubalwe ebhayeni yesimo:\u003C/strong\u003E izithombe ezibekwe kumodeli. Umbhalo, izilinganiso, imihlahlandlela, izindiza zezigaba, imiboniso nezitayela akufundwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi:\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela e-SketchUp angamayintshi ngaphakathi; i-ModelCraft iyawaguqula, ngakho usayizi uphuma kahle kunoma iyiphi iyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E akukakwakhiwa. Ukuze ubuyisele imodeli ku-SketchUp, khipha i-Collada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akusekelwe\"\u003EAkusekelwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukuvula amafayela e-3DS noma e-IFC, futhi ayikwazi ukulondoloza amafayela e-3DS, e-FBX, e-STEP, e-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E noma e-SketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imodeli ye-ModelCraft ingamamitha, ne-Z (eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) iphezulu. Yonke ifomethi engezansi iguqulwa iye noma ivela kulokho. ModelCraft (.modelcraft) Okuthi Imininingwane Vula Vula (Ctrl+O) noma wehlise kokubukwayo. Amafayela aphelelayo nge-.json nawo amukelekile Londoloza Londoloza (Ctrl+S), njengokulanda Igcina Konke: ijiyomethri, ubuso nemibala yabo, impahla yokwakha nezithombe ezingeniswe, amalambu, imiphetho ethambile, amaqembu, izakhi, amagama, imihlahlandlela, imiboniso, amayunithi, nekhamera nesitayela sokugcina Kushiywa Umlando wokuhlehlisa Umkhawulo 200 MB Ifayela elilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft entsha kunaleyo yakho liyenqatshwa: \"Le modeli ilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft entsha kunaleyo (inguqulo yefayela …). Buyekeza i-ModelCraft ukuze uyivule.\" Ifayela elingesiyo imodeli ye-ModelCraft lithi: \"Lolu hlobo lwefayela alusiyo imodeli ye-ModelCraft (alusiyo i-JSON).\" noma \"Lolu alusiyo ifayela le-ModelCraft esingalivula: …\". USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz) Vula, ngenisa, bese Londoloza njenge noma Khipha › USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…. Ifayela le-USD eligcinwe yi-ModelCraft livuleka futhi ngaphandle kokulahlekelwa lutho; amafayela e-USD ezinye izinhlelo avulwa njengemisheshi, amaqembu, izakhi, amalambu namakhamera. Bheka Londoloza, vula futhi khipha i-USD. Collada (.dae) Ukungenisa nokukhipha. Ifomethi engcono kakhulu yokushintshanisa amamodeli nabanye abenzi be-3D. Khipha: Collada 1.4.1, Z phezulu, amamitha. Ijiyomethri eyodwa ngencazelo yeqembu noma yesakhi ngalinye; izakhi zibhalwa kanye kuphela futhi zibekwa ngesethulo, ngakho zihlala zabelwana. Ubuso enemigodi noma imigqa engaphakathi ihlukaniswa ibe izinxantathu. Imibala iba impahla yokwakha. Imiphetho engaxhunyiwe ibhalwa njengemigqa. Amagama angavumelekile kule fomethi ayalungiswa, futhi igama elingokoqobo ligcinwa eduze kwawo. Ngenisa: izinxantathu, amapholigoni (anemigodi), amafeni nezintambo zezinxantathu zibe ubuso; imigqa ibe imiphetho. Ukuguqulwa kwe-node, i-axis esaphezulu yefayela neyunithi yayo kuyasetshenziswa. I-node ebekwe ezindaweni eziningi, noma ijiyomethri esetshenziswa ama-node amaningi, iza njengesakhi; ama-node avamile aza njengamaqembu. Imibala yempahla (diffuse) iba yimibala yobuso. Akungeniswa: izithombe, izikhumba nezinguquko zesimo, amakhamera, amalambu, ezinye izinhlobo zokuguqula (look-at neskew), nezinkomba kwamanye amafayela. Ibha yesimo iyazibala. Kulahlekile lapho kukhishwa: yimiphi imiphetho ethambile. Lapho kungeniswa, izindawo ezinxantathu zihlala zinxantathu, nedayagonali ziyathanjiswa ukuze izindawo ezicaba zibonakale njengobuso obubodwa. OBJ (.obj, .mtl) Ukungenisa nokukhipha. Ngenisa: phonsa i-.obj kanye ne-.mtl yayo nezithombe zokuthungwa (noma ngenise i-.obj yodwa: ingena ingenampahla yokwakha, futhi ibha yesimo iqamba i-.mtl eyayifunwa). Ifundwa njengamamitha nge-Y phezulu. Into ngayinye (o, noma g) iba i-mesh, ubuso bayo bugcinwa njengoba bunjalo (amakhwadrangili ahlala ekhwadrangili). Izixhumanisi zokuthungwa, izinqondo nemibala ngamaphoyinti ziyagcinwa. Isithombe sombala wempahla (map_Kd, PNG, JPEG noma WebP) singena njengokuthungwa, nezinketho zaso zesikali nokushintshwa; uma kungenjalo, umbala waso (Kd). Imiphetho lapho izinqondo zefayela zephula khona iqinile; uma kungekho zinqondo, amaqembu okubushelezisa efayela ayanquma. Amanye amamephu (bump, normal), amaphoyinti, imigqa namajika ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa. I-OBJ ayinayo iyunithi, ngakho imodeli eyenziwe ngamamillimitha noma amayintshi ifika ngosayizi ongalungile: yilinganise ngemva kokungenisa (bheka Phendula futhi linganisa). Khipha: amamitha, Y phezulu, izixhumanisi zomhlaba. Into eyodwa ngokubekwa kweqembu ngalinye; izakhi zibhalwa ngokugcwele endaweni ngayinye. Ama-mesh agcina ubuso bawo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nezinqondo; ubuso oxhunywe ngemiphetho ethambile buthola inqondo ngakunye ekhoneni. Uma imodeli inemibala, i-.mtl iyalandwa eduze kwe-.obj. Uma inezithombe zokuthungwa ezingenisiwe, i-.obj, i-.mtl nezithombe ziyalandwa ndawonye njenge-.zip eyodwa. Umkhawulo: amaphoyinti noma ubuso obungu-2 million; 64 MB yombhalo. glTF (.glb, .gltf) Ukungenisa nokukhipha, i-glTF 2.0. Ngenisa: i-.glb, noma i-.gltf kanye ne-.bin namafayela esithombe sokuthungwa: wehlise konke ngesikhathi kokubukwayo (noma khetha i-.glb). I-.gltf enikezwe yodwa ibiza ifayela eliyidingayo: \"Le fayela le-.gltf lidinga \"…\": vula inguqulo ye-.glb, noma wehlise i-.gltf kanye namafayela ayo.\" Ama-mesh angena njenge-mesh, eyodwa ngayinye kufayela, izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti kuyagcinwa. Imiphetho lapho izinqondo zephula khona iqinile; eyengcaphuno ithambile. I-mesh esetshenziswa ezindaweni eziningi ihlala ibelwana. Ama-node aba ngamaqembu, anesibizo njengasefayeleni. Ama-mesh ayinkomba (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) angena njenge-mesh eyodwa ebekwe izikhathi eziningi. Impahla yokwakha: ukuthungwa komumbala oyisisekelo (PNG, JPEG noma WebP) kungena njengokuthungwa, kubekwe ngezixhumanisi zokuthungwa zefayela (nanoma yiluphi ukuguqulwa kokuthungwa), futhi kuyagcinwa lapho ulondoloza; kungenjalo, umbala oyisisekelo. I-metal, ukuqina, amamephu ajwayelekile, ingilazi, i-clear coat, i-sheen nezinye izandiso zempahla ziyafundwa kodwa aziqhubeki zigcinwe: ibha yesimo iyasho lokho. Amalambu (KHR_lights_punctual): amalambu aphuthumayo nezindawo aba amalambu. Amalambu aqondile ayabalwa: ilanga likhanyisa imodeli. Amakhamera aba yimiboniso. Abalingiswa abanesikhumba bangena bemi njengoba efayela libeka kanjalo; amathambo abo nama-animation abo, nezinhloso zokuguquka kwesimo, ayabalwa futhi aziqhubeki zigcinwe. Amafayela acindezelwe (Draco, meshopt) nedatha equantized ayafundwa. Abadekhoda balayisha kuphela ifayela elidinga bona. Amaphoyinti nemigqa ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa (i-mesh ibamba ubuso). Izithombe ze-KTX2 ziyashiywa; ubuso bugcina umbala wabo. Khipha (.glb): i-glTF 2.0 binary, amamitha, Y phezulu. I-mesh eyodwa ngencazelo ngayinye, ngakho izakhi zihlala zabelwana. Ama-mesh agcina izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti; ubuso oxhunywe ngemiphetho ethambile bunenqondo ebushelezi. Imibala nempahla kuba yimpahla yokwakha (impahla njengombala wayo); izithombe ezingeniswe zibhalwa njengokuthungwa. Amalambu avulekile aba amalambu aphuthumayo nezindawo (amalambu wendawo awanalingani ku-glTF futhi ashiywa); imiboniso iba amakhamera. Imiphetho engaxhunyiwe iyashiywa. Umkhawulo: amafayela kuya ku-300 MB; cishe izigidi eziyi-130 zamanani ejiyomethri. STL (.stl) Ukungenisa nokukhipha. Ngenisa: i-binary noma i-ASCII. I-STL ayinayo iyunithi: ifundwa njengamamillimitha, njengoba abaprinta nokukhishwa kwe-ModelCraft kuyibhala ngayo. Amakhona endawo efanayo ayaxhumana, ngakho ingxenye evaliwe ifika njenge-mesh evaliwe. Imibala efayeleni (izivumelwano ze-VisCAM / SolidView ne-Materialise) ipenda ubuso. Khipha, ukuprinta nge-3D: i-binary STL, amamillimitha, Z phezulu. Izinxantathu kuphela: amaqembu nemiphetho engaxhunyiwe ayashiywa. Ubuso obupeniwe bugcina umbala wabo ngesivumelwano se-VisCAM / SolidView, esinye isofthiwe esingasinaki uma singasifundi. Khipha izinto eziqinile ezivaliwe ukuze uthole ukuprinta okuhlanzekile. STEP (.step, .stp) Ukungenisa kuphela. I-STEP yilokho abenzi bezingxenye nabahlinzeki abakuthumelayo: amafayela e-AP203, AP214 ne-AP242. Ngenisa: i-ModelCraft ifunda ifayela ngokwayo, ekhasini, futhi iguqule yonke into eqinile ibe i-mesh evaliwe yezinxantathu: ubuso obucaba buhlala bucaba, ubuso ogobile (amasilinda, amakhoni, amabhola, ama-torus, ubuso be-B-spline) buba izinto eziningi ezincane ezicaba, nemiphetho ngaphakathi kobuso obugobile ibushelezi, nemiphetho phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ibukhali. Amafayela e-STEP asho iyunithi yawo; imodeli ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela. Umhlangano ufika nazo zonke izingxenye lapho ifayela zibeka khona, ingxenye ngayinye iyi-mesh yayo eqenjini elibizwa ngegama lefayela. Imibala, amagama ezingxenye zomthi womhlangano nokubekezelela (PMI) akufundwa. Imilayezo: okuphuthelwe noma okudwetshwe ngokungaphelele kungezelelwa emugqeni wesimo (\"Notes: …\"); ifayela elingenalutho oluqinile, ifayela elonakele noma elidlule imikhawulo lisho ngani futhi alengezi lutho. Umkhawulo: amafayela kuya ku-300 MB; ubuso obungu-400 000 nezinxantathu ezingu-8 million. .3dm Ukungenisa kuphela. Amafayela e-.3dm agcina amamodeli e-NURBS: ubuso bamapholisurfesi, ubuso, ama-mesh, amajika namabhulokhi. Ngenisa: i-ModelCraft ifunda ifayela ngokwayo, ekhasini. Ama-mesh angena njengoba enjalo; bonke ubuso bepolisurfesi noma bokwelulwa buvela kusigaxa esigciniwe kanye nefayela, uma kungenjalo i-ModelCraft iyakwakha (amaplanes, ubuso be-NURBS, ubuso bokuguqulwa, amajika akhishiwe, ukukhishwa; kugoqwe ngemiphetho yabo, amapholisurfesi avaliwe njenge-mesh evaliwe). Amajika aba imiphetho, amabhulokhi aba izakhi (amabhulokhi ngaphakathi kwamabhulokhi agcinwa), izendlalelo ziba amathegi (zifihliwe uma zivaliwe), umbala wento (wayo, wesendlalelo sayo noma wempahla yayo) upenda ubuso bayo. Ifayela lisho iyunithi yalo; imodeli ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela. Izinyathelo ngazinye: Ngenisa imodeli ye-.3dm. Imilayezo: ibha yesimo ithi ubuso bangaki obuvela ezinhlelweni ezigciniwe nobangaki obakhiwe, futhi iqamba okushiyiwe: amaphoyinti, amafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso, ama-hatch, amalambu, izinto ze-SubD, ubuso ezinhlobweni zendawo ezingakafundwa, amabhulokhi axhunyiwe. Umkhawulo: amafayela kuya ku-300 MB. PLY (.ply) Ukungenisa nokukhipha, ama-mesh anemibala (ukuskena, ukuprinta nge-3D ngemibala, abenzi abanye). Ngenisa: ASCII ne-binary. Ubuso buba i-mesh izinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa nemibala yamaphoyinti igcinwa; ubuso ngabunye upenjwa ngombala osondele kakhulu kwemibala engu-4,096 ukuze ubone imibala njengamanje. I-PLY ayinayo iyunithi noma umthetho we-axis: izixhumanisi zingena njengoba zinjalo (amamitha, Z phezulu). I-PLY enamaphoyinti kuphela iyidikhi lamaphoyinti:ivule ku-BimCraft noma ku-CivilCraft. Khipha: i-binary PLY enezindawo, izinqondo nemibala (nezixhumanisi zokuthungwa uma imodeli inazo), ngamamitha, Z phezulu. FBX (.fbx) Ukungenisa kuphela. Amafayela e-FBX 7 (kusukela ngo-2011), i-binary noma i-ASCII, afundwa yisifundi se-ModelCraft ngokwayo. Ama-mesh angena njenge-mesh nezinqondo, izixhumanisi zokuthungwa (wonke amasethi e-UV) nemibala yamaphoyinti; i-mesh esetshenziswa izinto eziningi ihlala ibelwana. Izinto ziba amaqembu nokuguqulwa kwazo (okuphakathi, okuphambukayo nokuphendulwa kwangaphambili kuhlanganisiwe). Impahla yokwakha: ukuthungwa komumbala (diffuse) — okufakwe kufayela, noma isithombe esiwiswe ndawonye ne-.fbx — kungena njengokuthungwa (izithombe ze-TGA ziyagcinwa njenge-PNG); kungenjalo umbala wokusabalala. Ezinye izilungiselelo zempahla zilinda imodeli entsha yempahla. I-axis esaphezulu yefayela neyunithi yalo iyasetshenziswa: konke kungena nge-Z phezulu, ngamamitha. Amalambu amaphuthumayo nezendawo aba amalambu (ukukhanya kwe-FBX okungu-100 yilamba elijwayelekile le-ModelCraft, ama-lumens angu-800: ukukhanya kwe-FBX akunayuniti). Amakhamera aba imiboniso. Abalingiswa abanesikhumba bangena besimi; amathambo nama-animation ayabalwa futhi aziqhubeki zigcinwe. Amalambu aqondile nendawo, nejiyomethri engeyona ama-mesh (i-NURBS, amajika), ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa. Amafayela e-FBX 6 nakadlule ayenqatshwa: wawagcine kabusha njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha. Alembic (.abc) Ukungenisa kuphela: ama-cache ejiyomethri avela ezinhlelweni zokwenza ama-animation nemiphumela. Ama-mesh (ama-mesh wamapholigoni nokuhlukaniswa) angena njenge-mesh, nezixhumanisi zokuthungwa nezinqondo; ukuguqulwa kuba amaqembu. I-Alembic iphezulu nge-Y futhi iguqulwa ibe Z phezulu; amamitha. I-cache enezampula eziningi (i-animation) ingena ngesampula yayo yokuqala; ibha yesimo ithi ziningi kangakanani. Amaphoyinti, amajika, ubuso be-NURBS, amakhamera namalambu ayabalwa futhi ayashiywa. Amafayela esakhiwo esidala se-HDF5 ayenqatshwa: wawagcine kabusha njengefayela le-Ogawa Alembic. Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)… ihlola isimo kuqala bese ibhala ukukhethwa, noma konke okubonisiwe. Bheka Lungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D. 3MF (.3mf) Ukukhipha kuphela, kusuka ku-Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…. I-3MF core: i-mesh eyodwa ngamamillimitha, Z phezulu, nemibala yayo njengempahla. Izinhlelo eziningi zokusika ziyayifunda, futhi ngokungafani ne-STL ibiza iyunithi yayo. Izinto ezifihliwe ziyashiywa. Bheka Lungisa imodeli ukuze iprintwe nge-3D. Ukukhipha kwe-DWG ne-DXF (.dwg, .dxf) Ngezinhlelo ze-CAD. Imodeli ibhalwa ngeyunithi yayo: amayintshi kumodeli yamafidi namayintshi, kungenjalo amamillimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha (ibha yesimo iyiqamba). Ubuso buba ubuso be-3D (izinxantathu). Imigqa engaphakathi kobuso nemiphetho ethambile ibhalwa ingabonakali, ngakho ubuso bubukeka njengobe-ModelCraft. Imiphetho engaxhunyiwe iba imigqa. Amaqembu nezakhi ziba amabhulokhi: isakhi sibhalwa kanye bese sibekwa njengoba sisetshenziswa, kubandakanya nezikhopi ezijikelezwe nezibonakalisiwe. Iqembu elelulwe ngemva kokujikelezwa (ngakho lithambekele) kunalokho libhalwa lapho lisendaweni yalo. Imibala: i-DWG igcina umbala wobuso ngamunye ngokunembile; i-DXF isebenzisa okusondele kakhulu kwemibala engu-255 ye-CAD evamile. Izinguqulo: i-DWG ibhalwa njenge-AutoCAD 2004 (AC1018), ezinhlelweni ze-CAD ezisukela ngo-2004 kuya phezulu ziyayivula. I-DXF iyi-R12 (AC1009), inguqulo yonke inhlelo ye-CAD iyifundayo; i-R12 ayinayo insimu yeyunithi, ngakho tshela uhlelo lwe-CAD ukuthi kufanele lusebenzise iyiphi iyunithi. Akubhalwa: imihlahlandlela, izilinganiso, imiboniso, nekhamera. IFC (.ifc) Ukukhipha kuphela, ku-BimCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM. I-IFC4 enephrojekthi, isayithi, isakhiwo nezitezi zaso. Iqembu noma isakhi ngasinye esiphezulu siba iproksi yento yesakhiwo esinegama layo; ezivaliwe zibhalwa njengezimo eziqinile (ama-faceted breps), ezivulekile njengemodeli yobuso; izimbobo ebusweni ziyagcinwa. Ijiyomethri engaphezulu eshiyekile iba into eyodwa ebizwa ngokuthi \"Loose geometry\". Akukho zinhlobo, izimpawu noma impahla. Izitezi: Khipha › Izitezi ze-IFC… ziyazibala, ngayinye inegama nokuphakama (Engeza isitezi, noma Qagela kusuka kumodeli, okwenza isitezi esisodwa ngakunye ukuphakama okuma kukho amaqembu wakho aphezulu). Lapho kukhishwa, iqembu noma isakhi ngasinye siya esitezini esingaphansi noma esilingana nephoyinti lalo eliphansi kakhulu, futhi sigcina indawo yaso. Uma ungekho izitezi, konke kuya esitezini esisodwa, \"Level 1\", ku-0. Izitezi zilondolozwa kufayela le-ModelCraft. DWG (.dwg) ne-DXF (.dxf) Ngenisa njengemigqa phansi (ama-hatch nobuso be-3D njengobuso); khipha njengoba kuchazwe ngenhla. Bheka Imodeli kwipulani yesayithi. Fundwa: imigqa, ama-polyline (namanmsalo), ama-polyline e-3D, izindilinga, imimsalo, nezinkomba zamabhulokhi kubandakanya nezinhlu, kusuka endaweni yemodeli. Izinto ezingabonakali (njengezimo ezifihliwe zebhulokhi eliguquguqukayo) ziyashiywa. Amajika aba izingxenye ezingu-48 ezigqamile ngokujikeleza ngakunye okugcwele. Fundwa kusukela ku-0.4: ama-spline namaellipse (njengemiphetho), umbhalo, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezinani zezici (njengemiphetho ngohlobo lombhalo womugqa oyodwa), ama-hatch (ubuso nezimbobo), ubuso be-3D nokugcwaliswa okuqinile (ubuso), nezilinganiso (zidwetshwe kusuka emabhulokhini ezilinganiso omdwebo). Fundwa kusukela ku-0.7: izinto eziqinile ze-3D, izifunda namabhodi (idatha yabo ye-ACIS, i-DWG ne-DXF zazo zonke izinguqulo), ngayinye njengeqembu layo, ezivaliwe njengezinto eziqinile. Ubuso obuqhamuka kwezinye izindawo ngaphandle kwezindawo ezicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, amabhola, ama-torus nendawo elula ye-spline ayashiywa futhi ayadwetshwa ohlwini. Akufundwa: amaphoyinti, amathebula, ama-multileader, izithombe, nanoma yini esikhaleni sephepha. Amayunithi: athathwa emdwebeni uma eshilo. Uma kungenjalo, i-ModelCraft iyabuza. I-DXF kumele ibe yi-ASCII. I-DXF ye-binary iyenqatshwa. Amafayela e-DWG kusukela ku-AutoCAD R13 kuya kufomethi yamanje (AutoCAD 2018 nangaphezulu; AC1012 kuya ku-AC1032) afundwa yisifundi se-DWG se-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ekhasini; siyingxenye ye-ModelCraft, ngakho sisebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi noma nini lapho i-ModelCraft isebenza. Izinguqulo ezidlule (i-R12 nangaphambili) namafayela alimele kakhulu awakwazi ukufundwa; wagcine njenge-DXF. Imikhawulo: izixhumanisi ezingaphezu kwe-10,000 km kusukela emsukeni, noma izingcezu zemigqa ezingaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-2, ziyenqatshwa. Amafayela e-SKP Ngenisa (noma wehlise ifayela phezu kokubukwayo) ifunda amafayela e-SketchUp ngesifundi se-ModelCraft ngokwayo, ekhasini: akukho lokho okulayishwayo, futhi kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi noma nini lapho i-ModelCraft isebenza. Ihlolwe ngamafayela avela ku-SketchUp 3, 6, 7, 2014, 2017, 2018, 2020, 2025 nango-2026; ezinye izinguqulo kufanele zivule futhi, kodwa azikaze zizanywe. Imodeli ifika njengeqembu elilodwa elibizwa ngegama lefayela. Ukucindezela Ctrl+Z kanye kuyisusa futhi. Izinyathelo ngazinye: Ngenisa imodeli ye-SKP. Kugcinwe: ubuso nezimbobo zabo, amaqembu (njengamaqembu) nezakhi (njengezakhi, ezabelwanayo), amagama nezindawo zazo, imibala, amathegi amaqembu nezakhi, imiphetho engeyona ingxenye yobuso, nemiphetho ethambile nebushelezi, ukuze izindawo ezigobile zihlale zibushelezi. Imibala: impahla yobuso ngabunye inikeza umbala wayo. Impahla epeniwe kuqembu noma kwisakhi iba upende walokho okubekwe, ngakho ubuso obungaphakathi obungenambala wabo bawuthatha, njengakwi-SketchUp; isakhi esipeniwe ngemibala emibili sihlala yisakhi esisodwa. Amathegi emaqembini nasezakhini aba ngamathegi e-ModelCraft, abonakale noma afihlekile njengoba ayenjalo. Amathegi kubuso nasemiphethweni engaxhunyiwe ayagcinwa (i-ModelCraft ithegisa amaqembu nezakhi kuphela); ibha yesimo iyawabala. Izinto ezifihliwe zingena zifihliwe (ubuso, imiphetho, amaqembu, izakhi, nobuso nemiphetho kutegi elifihliwe), ukuze ubone lokho i-SketchUp yayikubonisa; Veza konke iyazibonisa. Izithombe zokuthungwa: ubuso openiwe ngempahla enokuthungwa ugcina ukuthungwa kwawo, ubekwe njengoba kunjalo efayeleni, nefayela le-ModelCraft ligcina isithombe. Ukuthungwa okusetshenziswa iqembu lonke noma isakhi, ukuthungwa okungekho efayeleni, noma isithombe amasiphequluli angasibonisa (njengefayela le-Photoshop) kugcina umbala wempahla kuphela. Kushiywe, futhi kubalwe ebhayeni yesimo: izithombe ezibekwe kumodeli. Umbhalo, izilinganiso, imihlahlandlela, izindiza zezigaba, imiboniso nezitayela akufundwa. Amayunithi: amafayela e-SketchUp angamayintshi ngaphakathi; i-ModelCraft iyawaguqula, ngakho usayizi uphuma kahle kunoma iyiphi iyunithi. Ukulondoloza .skp akukakwakhiwa. Ukuze ubuyisele imodeli ku-SketchUp, khipha i-Collada (.dae). Akusekelwe I-ModelCraft ayikwazi ukuvula amafayela e-3DS noma e-IFC, futhi ayikwazi ukulondoloza amafayela e-3DS, e-FBX, e-STEP, e-.3dm noma e-SketchUp (.skp).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"your-machine","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Umshini wakho usebenzisa ini ukurenda","summary":"Izilungiselelo › Ukurenda ibonisa imifanekiso, amakhoza eprosesa kanye nenkumbulo isiphequluli esivumela uhlelo ukuyisebenzisa, kanye nezinga elibeka lapho ukurenda kuqala khona.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["umshini wakho","ikhadi lezithombe","gpu","webgpu","webgl","iprosesa","cpu","amakhoza","izintambo","inkumbulo","ram","inkumbulo yokwabelana","ukwahlukaniswa","izinga","isivinini","kancane","isivinini sokurenda","ilaptop"],"headings":[{"id":"izinga","text":"Izinga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), hlala ethebhu yalolu hlelo qobo bese uskrola uze uthole \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendering\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour machine\u003C/span\u003E ibhala lokho isiphequluli sakho esivumela uhlelo ukusisebenzisa ukurenda. Akukho lapho okushiya ikhompyutha yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho kusho ukuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhadi lezithombe esilibikwa isiphequluli. &quot;WebGPU&quot; isho ukuthi lingenza wonke umsebenzi wokurenda; &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; isho ukuthi ukubuka okuphilayo kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E kuyisebenzisa (ikhwalithi ephezulu ngendlela ye-WebGL path tracer), kanti ukurenda ekubukeni nakuhlu lokurenda, okudinga i-WebGPU, akutholakali; isifaki sesofthiwe esisho ukuthi konke kusebenza ngeprosesa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lamakhoza eprosesa esiphequluli esilibikayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMemory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe inkumbulo ikhompyutha enayo, uma isiphequluli sisho. Ezinye iziphequluli azisho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShared memory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi ikhasi lingabelana yini ngenkumbulo phakathi kwabasebenzi balo. Uma kuvuliwe, wonke amakhoza angasebenza ekopini eyodwa yesiteji; uma kuvaliwe, ngayinye idinga ikopi yayo, ngakho isiteji esikhulu singalingana namakhoza ambalwa ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFast processor code\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi isiphequluli sisebenzisa yini ikhodi esheshayo ye-WebAssembly. Ngaphandle kwayo kusetshenziswa indlela yokubuyela engasheshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, basic\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor only\u003C/span\u003E, nesizathu esingaphansi kwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinga\"\u003EIzinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinga libeka lapho \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Eukubuka okuphilayo\u003C/a\u003E iqala khona (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor this computer\u003C/span\u003E), inani lezinto ezihlakazekile ezidwetshwa yona, kanye nenani lobuso bokuhlukanisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers#subdivision-surface\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\" data-hash=\"subdivision-surface\"\u003Esubdivision surface\u003C/a\u003E okungabonakala ekubukeni, ukuze ilaptop enetshipu lezithombe elakhelwe ngaphakathi noma engenayo ikhadi lezithombe ihlale isabela. Itshipu lezithombe elakhelwe ngaphakathi noma eselula, noma inkumbulo engu-4 GB noma ngaphansi, akusoze kuthole \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIziphequluli ziyahlukana. Ikhompyutha efanayo ingabonisa WebGPU kwesinye isiphequluli kanti &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; kwesinye. Ku-Linux iziphequluli eziningi azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Vula Settings (Ctrl+,), hlala ethebhu yalolu hlelo qobo bese uskrola uze uthole Rendering. Your machine ibhala lokho isiphequluli sakho esivumela uhlelo ukusisebenzisa ukurenda. Akukho lapho okushiya ikhompyutha yakho. Umugqa Lokho kusho ukuthi Graphics Ikhadi lezithombe esilibikwa isiphequluli. \"WebGPU\" isho ukuthi lingenza wonke umsebenzi wokurenda; \"WebGL 2 only\" isho ukuthi ukubuka okuphilayo kanye Render a picture… kuyisebenzisa (ikhwalithi ephezulu ngendlela ye-WebGL path tracer), kanti ukurenda ekubukeni nakuhlu lokurenda, okudinga i-WebGPU, akutholakali; isifaki sesofthiwe esisho ukuthi konke kusebenza ngeprosesa Processor Inani lamakhoza eprosesa esiphequluli esilibikayo Memory Cishe inkumbulo ikhompyutha enayo, uma isiphequluli sisho. Ezinye iziphequluli azisho Shared memory Ukuthi ikhasi lingabelana yini ngenkumbulo phakathi kwabasebenzi balo. Uma kuvuliwe, wonke amakhoza angasebenza ekopini eyodwa yesiteji; uma kuvaliwe, ngayinye idinga ikopi yayo, ngakho isiteji esikhulu singalingana namakhoza ambalwa ngesikhathi esisodwa Fast processor code Ukuthi isiphequluli sisebenzisa yini ikhodi esheshayo ye-WebAssembly. Ngaphandle kwayo kusetshenziswa indlela yokubuyela engasheshi Level Graphics card, high, Graphics card, basic noma Processor only, nesizathu esingaphansi kwayo Izinga Izinga libeka lapho ukubuka okuphilayo iqala khona (For this computer), inani lezinto ezihlakazekile ezidwetshwa yona, kanye nenani lobuso bokuhlukanisa subdivision surface okungabonakala ekubukeni, ukuze ilaptop enetshipu lezithombe elakhelwe ngaphakathi noma engenayo ikhadi lezithombe ihlale isabela. Itshipu lezithombe elakhelwe ngaphakathi noma eselula, noma inkumbulo engu-4 GB noma ngaphansi, akusoze kuthole Graphics card, high. Iziphequluli ziyahlukana. Ikhompyutha efanayo ingabonisa WebGPU kwesinye isiphequluli kanti \"WebGL 2 only\" kwesinye. Ku-Linux iziphequluli eziningi azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-engine-addons","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Engeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on","summary":"Yini i-add-on engayengeza ohlwini lwe-Injini yengxoxo ye-Renda, imvume edingekayo ukuze isebenzise uhlelo, nokuthi i-Studio iyahlola ini futhi iyabuza ini.","section":"reference","order":117,"keywords":["add-on","addon","injini","injini yokurenda","umthuthukisi","engine.run","imvume","uhlelo","umbhalo","esayiniwe","studio","api"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-add-on (Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe) ingangeza injini ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E. Umbhalo ogcwele wabalobi be-add-on useqeqeshini 16 lencazelo ye-add-on; ngokufushane:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-add-on ibhalisa injini enesihlonzi esiqala ngesayo, igama, izilungiselelo ezikhethekayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Enoma\u003C/strong\u003E uhlelo oluzoqhuba \u003Cstrong\u003Enoma\u003C/strong\u003E umsebenzi ku-JavaScript odweba isithombe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjini eqhuba uhlelo idinga imvume \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eengine.run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, ebonakala ngaphambi kokufakwa nasezilungiselelweni. Isebenza kuphela ku-Studio; kusiphequluli iboniswa njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-add-on ichaza uhlelo (igama lefayela elilula: hhayi i-shell), umbhalo \u003Cstrong\u003Eosendaweni ye-add-on esayiniwe\u003C/strong\u003E, nezimpikiswano ezakhiwe ngezibambi nemagama alula. I-Studio iyathola uhlelo noma ikucela ukuthi ulikhombise kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgokuqala i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-Studio iyakubuza ngengxoxo yayo\u003C/strong\u003E: iyiphi i-add-on, yiluphi uhlelo, nokuthi umbhalo ungenza noma yini uhlelo olungayenza. Yivumele kuphela i-add-on oyithembayo. Impendulo yakho iyakhunjulwa ye-add-on nohlelo oluthile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphakheji (imbonakalo njenge-USD nefayela lezilungiselelo, nefayela le-glTF uma i-add-on ikucela lona) nombhalo we-add-on kuya kufolda lesikhashana elisha, uhlelo luqhuba lapho, isithombe sibuyela sibhalwe ngegama lenjini ye-add-on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-add-on angangeza izinjini zokurenda kuphela kusuka ku-add-on API 1.4. Isibonelo esisebenzayo somshicilelo we-command-line onomthombo ovulekile sisemthonjeni wawo; asikaqhutshwa kulowo renderer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-add-on (Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe) ingangeza injini ohlwini lwe-Injini lwe-Renda isithombe…. Umbhalo ogcwele wabalobi be-add-on useqeqeshini 16 lencazelo ye-add-on; ngokufushane: I-add-on ibhalisa injini enesihlonzi esiqala ngesayo, igama, izilungiselelo ezikhethekayo, noma uhlelo oluzoqhuba noma umsebenzi ku-JavaScript odweba isithombe. Injini eqhuba uhlelo idinga imvume engine.run, ebonakala ngaphambi kokufakwa nasezilungiselelweni. Isebenza kuphela ku-Studio; kusiphequluli iboniswa njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe. I-add-on ichaza uhlelo (igama lefayela elilula: hhayi i-shell), umbhalo osendaweni ye-add-on esayiniwe, nezimpikiswano ezakhiwe ngezibambi nemagama alula. I-Studio iyathola uhlelo noma ikucela ukuthi ulikhombise kanye. Ngokuqala i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio iyakubuza ngengxoxo yayo: iyiphi i-add-on, yiluphi uhlelo, nokuthi umbhalo ungenza noma yini uhlelo olungayenza. Yivumele kuphela i-add-on oyithembayo. Impendulo yakho iyakhunjulwa ye-add-on nohlelo oluthile. Iphakheji (imbonakalo njenge-USD nefayela lezilungiselelo, nefayela le-glTF uma i-add-on ikucela lona) nombhalo we-add-on kuya kufolda lesikhashana elisha, uhlelo luqhuba lapho, isithombe sibuyela sibhalwe ngegama lenjini ye-add-on. Ama-add-on angangeza izinjini zokurenda kuphela kusuka ku-add-on API 1.4. Isibonelo esisebenzayo somshicilelo we-command-line onomthombo ovulekile sisemthonjeni wawo; asikaqhutshwa kulowo renderer.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","summary":"Izimpawu, izimbangela nezixazululo, kusukela ekubukweni kwe-3D okungenalutho kuya ekungeniseni okungalungile kosayizi, nemiyalezo ebonisa i-ModelCraft.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["inkinga","ukuhlupheka","iphutha","akusebenzi","ingenalutho","webgl","ukusheshisa","kuhamba kancane","umyalezo","ukungenisa kuhlulekile","usayizi ongalungile","akukwazi ukukhetha","ukuthinta","izinkinobho azisebenzi","ukulahlekelwa komsebenzi"],"headings":[{"id":"ukubuka-kwe-3d-kungenalutho","text":"Ukubuka kwe-3D kungenalutho","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-azenzi-lutho-noma-zibhala-ebhokisini","text":"Izinkinobho azenzi lutho, noma zibhala ebhokisini","level":2},{"id":"ukuthayipha-inombolo-akwenzi-lutho","text":"Ukuthayipha inombolo akwenzi lutho","level":2},{"id":"isimo-siqala-endaweni-engalungile-esikrinini-sokuthinta","text":"Isimo siqala endaweni engalungile esikrinini sokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlela-iqembu-elilodwa-kushintshe-elinye","text":"Ukuhlela iqembu elilodwa kushintshe elinye","level":2},{"id":"ui-sunduza-hudula-akwenzi-lokho-engilindele","text":"{{ui:Sunduza/hudula}} akwenzi lokho engilindele","level":2},{"id":"umugqa-noma-isimo-akenzanga-ubuso","text":"Umugqa noma isimo akenzanga ubuso","level":2},{"id":"angikwazi-ukukhetha-noma-ukususa-ubuso","text":"Angikwazi ukukhetha noma ukususa ubuso","level":2},{"id":"khetha-okuthile-ukuze-uhambise-kuqala-noma-uchofoze-kukho","text":"\"Khetha okuthile ukuze uhambise kuqala, noma uchofoze kukho.\"","level":2},{"id":"khetha-ijiyomethri-kuqala-donsa-iwindi-noma-chofoza-kathathu-ukukhetha-konke-okuhlangene","text":"\"Khetha ijiyomethri kuqala (donsa iwindi, noma chofoza kathathu ukukhetha konke okuhlangene).\"","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-zomcibisholo-zijikeleza-esikhundleni-sokukhiya","text":"Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza esikhundleni sokukhiya","level":2},{"id":"key-esc-esikrinini-esigcwele","text":"{{key:Esc}} esikrinini esigcwele","level":2},{"id":"akukho-inkinobho-ephakathi","text":"Akukho inkinobho ephakathi","level":2},{"id":"ukungenisa","text":"Ukungenisa","level":2},{"id":"ukungena-kungenza-ngosayizi-ongalungile-noma-kulele-ecaleni","text":"Ukungena kungenza ngosayizi ongalungile noma kulele ecaleni","level":3},{"id":"ukuvula-amafayela","text":"Ukuvula amafayela","level":2},{"id":"ngilahlekelwe-umsebenzi","text":"Ngilahlekelwe umsebenzi","level":2},{"id":"ifolda-yami-yokulanda-igcwala-ngamakhophi","text":"Ifolda yami yokulanda igcwala ngamakhophi","level":2},{"id":"kuhamba-kancane","text":"Kuhamba kancane","level":2},{"id":"azikho-izithunzi","text":"Azikho izithunzi","level":2},{"id":"lesi-siphequluli-asivumelanga-ukugcwalisa-isikrini","text":"\"Lesi siphequluli asivumelanga ukugcwalisa isikrini.\"","level":2},{"id":"i-modelcraft-ayivuli-ngaphandle-kokuxhumana","text":"I-ModelCraft ayivuli ngaphandle kokuxhumana","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kwe-3d-kungenalutho\"\u003EUkubuka kwe-3D kungenalutho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsimpawu:\u003C/strong\u003E maphakathi nesikrini kuhlala kungenalutho, noma kubonisa umbala wangemuva kuphela, nokuchofoza amathuluzi akwenzi lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E I-ModelCraft idwetsha nge-WebGL 2, ukuzwakala kwe-3D kwesiphequluli. Ayikho uma isiphequluli sidala, uma ukusheshisa kwehadiwe kuvaliwe, noma uma umshayeli wegrafikhi uvinjiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsixazululo:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula izilungiselelo zesiphequluli bese useza &quot;ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula &quot;Sebenzisa ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi uma kutholakala&quot; bese uqalisa kabusha isiphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma sesivulekile, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://gpu\u003C/code\u003E ebhalweni lekheli (\u003Ccode\u003Eedge://gpu\u003C/code\u003E ku-Edge) bese ufuna &quot;WebGL2&quot; ohlwini. Uma ithi ivaliwe, buyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi wakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uskrola ufike ku-&quot;Ukusebenza&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ukukhetha &quot;Sebenzisa izilungiselelo zokusebenza ezincomekayo&quot;, bese ukhetha &quot;Sebenzisa ukusheshisa kwehadiwe uma kutholakala&quot;. Qalisa kabusha i-Firefox.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kuhlulekile, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:support\u003C/code\u003E ebhalweni lekheli bese ubheka isigaba esithi &quot;Graphics&quot; ukuze uthole WebGL 2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVuselela macOS ne-Safari. Izinguqulo ezintsha ze-Safari zihlala zivulile i-WebGL 2. Uma uguqule izici ezizama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESafari\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EOkuthuthukisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EFeature Flags\u003C/strong\u003E), zisete kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEkhompyutheni yomsebenzi, ku-remote desktop noma emshinini obonakalayo, izinto zokubonisa ze-3D zingavinjwa ngomthetho. Zama enye ikhompyutha. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EIziphequluli nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-azenzi-lutho-noma-zibhala-ebhokisini\"\u003EIzinkinobho azenzi lutho, noma zibhala ebhokisini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E ukugxila kwekhibhodi kusensimini yephaneli: uhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E, isilungiselelo selanga, insimu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgama\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, noma isikhethi sezinyunithi. Izinhlamvu nezinkinobho zomcibisholo zibe zisiya kuleyo nsimu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsixazululo:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ebukweni le-3D, bese ucindezela inkinobho futhi. Izinkinobho zingasebenzi nalapho kuvulekile ingxoxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthayipha-inombolo-akwenzi-lutho\"\u003EUkuthayipha inombolo akwenzi lutho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakho qondo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ubude obuthayipha buhamba ngendlela isikhombi esikhomba ngayo kusukela ekuchofozeni kokuqala. Hambisa isikhombi kancane endleleni ofuna ngayo, bese uthayipha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi esingalungile.\u003C/strong\u003E Amathuluzi amaningi amukela inani elithayiphiwe kuphela ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala: chofoza ikhona yokuqala, ubuso noma iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo kuqala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E athatha inani lezinhlangothi ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Thayipha ubude njengo-3m, 10&#039;6&quot; noma 4m,3m.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-ModelCraft ayiyifundanga. Hlola ukuthi kukhona yini ikhoma lamadesimali (\u003Ccode\u003E2,5\u003C/code\u003E): sebenzisa ichashazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isimo-siqala-endaweni-engalungile-esikrinini-sokuthinta\"\u003EIsimo siqala endaweni engalungile esikrinini sokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsimpawu:\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunwe, unxande wokuqala uhle, kodwa unxande, indilinga noma umugqa olandelayo uqala lapho ukuthinta kwakho kwangaphambilini kuphela khona, hhayi lapho uthinte khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E iphutha kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo: esikrinini sokuthinta ithuluzi likhumbula iphoyinti lokubambelela lokugcina kusukela esenzweni sangaphambilini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsixazululo:\u003C/strong\u003E thinta inkinobho yethuluzi ebhalweni lamathuluzi futhi ngaphambi kwesimo ngasinye esisha. Lokho kuqalisa ithuluzi kabusha, futhi iphoyinti lokuqala lifika lapho uthinta khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlela-iqembu-elilodwa-kushintshe-elinye\"\u003EUkuhlela iqembu elilodwa kushintshe elinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsimpawu:\u003C/strong\u003E ukopishe iqembu nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, wavula ikhophi eyodwa wayihlela, bese nenye ikhophi nayo yashintsha. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa zombili ngegama elifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E kulolu hlelo, ukukopisha iqembu kwenza ukubekwa kwesibili kweqembu elifanayo, njengakwesakhi. Inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ibe yodwa\u003C/span\u003E inikezwa izakhi kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsixazululo:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha ikhophi ofuna ukuyishintsha, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi lwento\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ibe yodwa\u003C/span\u003E. Leyo kophi manje inezinto zayo. Noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChitha\u003C/span\u003E yona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ui-sunduza-hudula-akwenzi-lokho-engilindele\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E akwenzi lokho engilindele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E isebenza ebusweni. Chofoza ubuso.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Uchofoze umphetho noma indawo engenalutho. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kuze kugqanyiswe ubuso, bese uchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bungaphakathi eqenjini.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uliviule kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIwindi alisikanga udonga.\u003C/strong\u003E Unxande kufanele udwetshwe ebusweni bodonga, hhayi phambi kwalo, futhi udonga kufanele lube nobuso bangemuva. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/openings#if-it-did-not-cut-through\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/openings\" data-hash=\"if-it-did-not-cut-through\"\u003ESika ukuvuleka udongeni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhokisi amabili aphindana, kodwa awahlanganisi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinto eziqinile ezisunduzelwe ngaphakathi kwenye azisiki noma zingahlanganisi kulolu hlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umugqa-noma-isimo-akenzanga-ubuso\"\u003EUmugqa noma isimo akenzanga ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso ugcwala kuphela uma imiphetho ivala ilupu esicaba. Hlola ukuthi iphoyinti lokugcina libambelele kolokuqala (&quot;Isiphetho&quot;), nokuthi yonke imiphetho ilele endizeni eyodwa. Ilupu elingaphandle kwendiza kancane lihlala lingumugqa. Dweba omunye wemiphetho yalo futhi, ubambelele emakhonweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"angikwazi-ukukhetha-noma-ukususa-ubuso\"\u003EAngikwazi ukukhetha noma ukususa ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E, ukuchofoza eduze komphetho kukhetha umphetho. Chofoza eduze nesiphakathi sobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifafazi\u003C/span\u003E ayikhethi ubuso. Khetha ubuso bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma usule omunye wemiphetho yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma sekuyiqembu noma isakhi, ukuchofoza kukhetha yonke into. Chofoza kabili ukuze uyivule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-okuthile-ukuze-uhambise-kuqala-noma-uchofoze-kukho\"\u003E&quot;Khetha okuthile ukuze uhambise kuqala, noma uchofoze kukho.&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/span\u003E zidinga okuthile okuzosebenza kukho: khetha kuqala, noma uqale ithuluzi ngokuchofoza into ngokwayo (hhayi endaweni engenalutho noma esikhombisini).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-ijiyomethri-kuqala-donsa-iwindi-noma-chofoza-kathathu-ukukhetha-konke-okuhlangene\"\u003E&quot;Khetha ijiyomethri kuqala (donsa iwindi, noma chofoza kathathu ukukhetha konke okuhlangene).&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zidinga ukukhethwa. Imikhombandlela ayikwazi ukuhlanganiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-zomcibisholo-zijikeleza-esikhundleni-sokukhiya\"\u003EIzinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza esikhundleni sokukhiya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhiya kusebenza kuphela ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala kwethuluzi lokudweba noma lokuhlela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESunduza/hudula\u003C/span\u003E alinakho ukukhiya, futhi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E azishintshi ukujika. Ngezikhathi ezinye izinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza umbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"key-esc-esikrinini-esigcwele\"\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E esikrinini esigcwele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikrinini esigcwele, isiphequluli singase sisebenzise \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yokuqala ukuphuma esikrinini esigcwele. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi ukuze ukhansele ithuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukho-inkinobho-ephakathi\"\u003EAkukho inkinobho ephakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZungeza\u003C/span\u003E bese udonsa, noma sebenzisa izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#without-a-middle-button\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"without-a-middle-button\"\u003EZungeza, shelelisa nosondeze\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukungenisa\"\u003EUkungenisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufanele wenze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-ModelCraft ingenisa i-SketchUp (.skp), Collada (.dae), OBJ, glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic (.abc), DWG ne-DXF. … akuyona lutho kwalezi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha imodeli ngaphandle kwenye inhlelo ngesinye salezi zifomethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lelifayelaliyi-300 MB ngaphezulu.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza imodeli ibe lula noma uyihlukanise kwenye inhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;…likhulu kakhulu ukuze limodelwe lapha (ngaphezu kwezigidi ezi-2 zamaphoyinti).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ifayela le-.gltf lidinga &quot;…&quot;…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgenisa i-\u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E kanye nemifayela yayo ye-\u003Ccode\u003E.bin\u003C/code\u003E nezithombe, noma vula inguqulo ye-\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-glTF lidinga isandiso se-…, i-ModelCraft engakafundi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha kabusha kwenye inhlelo ngaphandle kwalesi sandiso (izithombe ze-KTX2, isibonelo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela le-OBJ lingena ngaphandle kwemibala noma izithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgenisa \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E nezithombe zayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-Alembic lisebenzisa isakhiwo se-HDF5 esidala…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza kabusha kwenye inhlelo njengefayela le-Ogawa Alembic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-FBX ingena ingenazo izithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgenisa \u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E kanye nezithombe zayo, noma faka imidiya lapho ukhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-FBX linguqulo …, i-ModelCraft ayiyifundi&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha kabusha njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL noma i-PLY ingena izikhathi ezingu-1 000 zinkulu noma zincane kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL ifundwa njengamamilimitha, i-PLY njengamamitha: shintsha usayizi (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003EJikisa nokushintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lolu akulona ifayela le-Collada (.dae)…&quot; noma &quot;…aliyona i-XML efanele…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonakele noma akulona i-Collada. Khipha kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-Collada alinayo ijiyomethri i-ModelCraft engeniswa.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiqukethe kuphela amakhamera, amalambu noma izinkomba zamanye amafayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lo yi-DXF ebhinari. Yilondoloze njenge-ASCII DXF bese uzama futhi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYilondoloze kabusha njenge-ASCII kusuka ohlelweni lwe-CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lona akulona umdwebo we-DWG…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela alilona i-DWG, noma lonakele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lo mdwebo awufundeki (…). Mhlawumbe unonakele, noma ulondolozwe ngenguqulo ye-DWG umfundi ongayiphathi…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkomba zinikeza isizathu. Londoloza njenge-DXF, noma njenge-DWG ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018, kusuka ohlelweni lwe-CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lo mdwebo ufinyelela ngaphezu kuka-10,000 km kusuka kumsuka wawo…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa umdwebo eduze ne-0,0 ohlelweni lwe-CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukungena-kungenza-ngosayizi-ongalungile-noma-kulele-ecaleni\"\u003EUkungena kungenza ngosayizi ongalungile noma kulele ecaleni\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ:\u003C/strong\u003E i-OBJ ayinayo iyunithi; i-ModelCraft ifunda amamitha. Imodeli yamamilimitha ingena ngokukhulu izikhathi ezingu-1000: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003Eshintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E wayo ngo-\u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E; imodeli yamainshi ngo-\u003Ccode\u003E0.0254\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ ilele ecaleni:\u003C/strong\u003E i-ModelCraft ilindele amafayela e-OBJ anoY uphezulu. Ifayela elibhalwe no-Z uphezulu lingena lilele. Jikisa ngo-90° ngokuya ku-akisi ebomvu: chofoza isikhungo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E ebusweni obubheka ngebomvu, noma vula ifayela ohlelweni lwalo bese ukhipha no-Y uphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG noma DXF:\u003C/strong\u003E ukhethe iyunithi engalungile kwingxoxo ethi &quot;Iyunithi zomdwebo&quot;. Hlehlisa bese ungenisa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula-amafayela\"\u003EUkuvula amafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufanele wenze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lelifayela akuyona imodeli ye-ModelCraft (alisiyo JSON).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E kwezinye izifomethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lona akuyona ifayela le-ModelCraft esingalivula: …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonakele noma lashintshwa ngesandla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Le modeli yalondolozwa yi-ModelCraft entsha…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula kunguqulo entsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lelifayela liyi-200 MB ngaphezulu.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli inkulu kakhulu ukuze ivulwe lapha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngilahlekelwe-umsebenzi\"\u003ENgilahlekelwe umsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ayilondolozi ifayela ngokwayo. Uma uvala noma uvuselela ithebhu enezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyabuza kuqala (ukushiya isayithi noma ukulayisha kabusha); khetha ukuhlala bese ulondoloza. Okuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntsha\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E nakho kubuza ngezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga. Uma isiphequluli noma ikhompyutha iwohloka, vula i-ModelCraft futhi kwisiphequluli esifanayo: iyakunikeza umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga (&quot;Buyisa umsebenzi wakho?&quot;; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EBuyisela umsebenzi wakho\u003C/a\u003E). Londoloza kaningi nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifolda-yami-yokulanda-igcwala-ngamakhophi\"\u003EIfolda yami yokulanda igcwala ngamakhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngakunye kuba ukulanda okusha, kuqanjwe njenge \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (1).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (2).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E njalo njalo. Susa ezindala, noma setha isiphequluli ukuze sibuze ukuthi ufuna ukulondoloza kuphi ngalowo ngamunye futhi ubhale phezu kwefayela elidala ngokwakho. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files#save-a-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\" data-hash=\"save-a-model\"\u003EVula, londoloza, ngenisa nokukhipha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuhamba-kancane\"\u003EKuhamba kancane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsinyathelo ngasinye sokuhlehlisa silondoloza ikhophi yemodeli (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Ei-mesh\u003C/a\u003E ilondoloza okushintshile kuphela), ngakho ekungeniseni okukhulu kwejiyomethri yokusunduza/ukuhudula, ukuhlela ngakunye kuthatha isikhathi eside. Chitha noma susa okungadingeki, londoloza, bese uvula kabusha: ukuvula kabusha kusula nomlando wokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithunzi zelanga zibiza kakhulu. Susa ukukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithunzi zelanga\u003C/span\u003E ngenkathi umisa imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"azikho-izithunzi\"\u003EAzikho izithunzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithunzi zelanga\u003C/span\u003E ivaliwe, ilanga lishonile ngesikhathi osikhethile (&quot;Ilanga lishonile ngalesi sikhathi.&quot;), noma isitayela siyi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwewaya\u003C/span\u003E, olungadwetshi izithunzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lesi-siphequluli-asivumelanga-ukugcwalisa-isikrini\"\u003E&quot;Lesi siphequluli asivumelanga ukugcwalisa isikrini.&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye iziphequluli nezinkombandlela ezifakiwe zenqaba ukugcwalisa isikrini. Sebenzisa isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli kunalokho (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-modelcraft-ayivuli-ngaphandle-kokuxhumana\"\u003EI-ModelCraft ayivuli ngaphandle kokuxhumana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft ivula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kuphela uma yayilondolozelwe ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kulesi siphequluli: inkinobho yebha yohlelo kumele ifunde \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Vula uma ukhona ku-inthanethi bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Uma inkinobho ifunda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/span\u003E, yichofoze futhi ngokuxhumana okungcono; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAyikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E kusho ukuthi lo windi (iwindi eliyimfihlo, noma ikhompyutha elawulwayo) alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukubuka kwe-3D kungenalutho Isimpawu: maphakathi nesikrini kuhlala kungenalutho, noma kubonisa umbala wangemuva kuphela, nokuchofoza amathuluzi akwenzi lutho. Imbangela: I-ModelCraft idwetsha nge-WebGL 2, ukuzwakala kwe-3D kwesiphequluli. Ayikho uma isiphequluli sidala, uma ukusheshisa kwehadiwe kuvaliwe, noma uma umshayeli wegrafikhi uvinjiwe. Isixazululo: Vula izilungiselelo zesiphequluli bese useza \"ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi\". Vula \"Sebenzisa ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi uma kutholakala\" bese uqalisa kabusha isiphequluli. Uma sesivulekile, thayipha chrome://gpu ebhalweni lekheli (edge://gpu ku-Edge) bese ufuna \"WebGL2\" ohlwini. Uma ithi ivaliwe, buyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi wakho. Vula Izilungiselelo, bese Okujwayelekile, bese uskrola ufike ku-\"Ukusebenza\". Susa ukukhetha \"Sebenzisa izilungiselelo zokusebenza ezincomekayo\", bese ukhetha \"Sebenzisa ukusheshisa kwehadiwe uma kutholakala\". Qalisa kabusha i-Firefox. Uma kuhlulekile, thayipha about:support ebhalweni lekheli bese ubheka isigaba esithi \"Graphics\" ukuze uthole WebGL 2. Vuselela macOS ne-Safari. Izinguqulo ezintsha ze-Safari zihlala zivulile i-WebGL 2. Uma uguqule izici ezizama ngaphansi kwe-Safari, bese Izilungiselelo, bese Okuthuthukisiwe (noma Feature Flags), zisete kabusha. Ekhompyutheni yomsebenzi, ku-remote desktop noma emshinini obonakalayo, izinto zokubonisa ze-3D zingavinjwa ngomthetho. Zama enye ikhompyutha. Bheka Iziphequluli nekhompyutha. Izinkinobho azenzi lutho, noma zibhala ebhokisini Imbangela: ukugxila kwekhibhodi kusensimini yephaneli: uhlu Ubuso ku-Isitayela, isilungiselelo selanga, insimu Igama ku-Ulwazi lwento, noma isikhethi sezinyunithi. Izinhlamvu nezinkinobho zomcibisholo zibe zisiya kuleyo nsimu. Isixazululo: chofoza ebukweni le-3D, bese ucindezela inkinobho futhi. Izinkinobho zingasebenzi nalapho kuvulekile ingxoxo. Ukuthayipha inombolo akwenzi lutho Akukakho qondo. Ubude obuthayipha buhamba ngendlela isikhombi esikhomba ngayo kusukela ekuchofozeni kokuqala. Hambisa isikhombi kancane endleleni ofuna ngayo, bese uthayipha. Isikhathi esingalungile. Amathuluzi amaningi amukela inani elithayiphiwe kuphela ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala: chofoza ikhona yokuqala, ubuso noma iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo kuqala. Indilinga ne-Ipholigoni athatha inani lezinhlangothi ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala. \"Thayipha ubude njengo-3m, 10'6\" noma 4m,3m.\" I-ModelCraft ayiyifundanga. Hlola ukuthi kukhona yini ikhoma lamadesimali (2,5): sebenzisa ichashazi. Isimo siqala endaweni engalungile esikrinini sokuthinta Isimpawu: ngomunwe, unxande wokuqala uhle, kodwa unxande, indilinga noma umugqa olandelayo uqala lapho ukuthinta kwakho kwangaphambilini kuphela khona, hhayi lapho uthinte khona. Imbangela: iphutha kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo: esikrinini sokuthinta ithuluzi likhumbula iphoyinti lokubambelela lokugcina kusukela esenzweni sangaphambilini. Isixazululo: thinta inkinobho yethuluzi ebhalweni lamathuluzi futhi ngaphambi kwesimo ngasinye esisha. Lokho kuqalisa ithuluzi kabusha, futhi iphoyinti lokuqala lifika lapho uthinta khona. Ukuhlela iqembu elilodwa kushintshe elinye Isimpawu: ukopishe iqembu nge-Hambisa kanye Ctrl, wavula ikhophi eyodwa wayihlela, bese nenye ikhophi nayo yashintsha. I-Uhlu lwezinto ibonisa zombili ngegama elifanayo. Imbangela: kulolu hlelo, ukukopisha iqembu kwenza ukubekwa kwesibili kweqembu elifanayo, njengakwesakhi. Inkinobho ethi Yenza ibe yodwa inikezwa izakhi kuphela. Isixazululo: khetha ikhophi ofuna ukuyishintsha, chofoza Yenza ingxenye ku-Ulwazi lwento, bese Yenza ibe yodwa. Leyo kophi manje inezinto zayo. Noma Chitha yona. Sunduza/hudula akwenzi lokho engilindele \"Sunduza/hudula isebenza ebusweni. Chofoza ubuso.\" Uchofoze umphetho noma indawo engenalutho. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kuze kugqanyiswe ubuso, bese uchofoza. Ubuso bungaphakathi eqenjini. Chofoza kabili iqembu ukuze uliviule kuqala. Iwindi alisikanga udonga. Unxande kufanele udwetshwe ebusweni bodonga, hhayi phambi kwalo, futhi udonga kufanele lube nobuso bangemuva. Bheka Sika ukuvuleka udongeni. Amabhokisi amabili aphindana, kodwa awahlanganisi. Izinto eziqinile ezisunduzelwe ngaphakathi kwenye azisiki noma zingahlanganisi kulolu hlelo. Umugqa noma isimo akenzanga ubuso Ubuso ugcwala kuphela uma imiphetho ivala ilupu esicaba. Hlola ukuthi iphoyinti lokugcina libambelele kolokuqala (\"Isiphetho\"), nokuthi yonke imiphetho ilele endizeni eyodwa. Ilupu elingaphandle kwendiza kancane lihlala lingumugqa. Dweba omunye wemiphetho yalo futhi, ubambelele emakhonweni. Angikwazi ukukhetha noma ukususa ubuso Nge-Khetha, ukuchofoza eduze komphetho kukhetha umphetho. Chofoza eduze nesiphakathi sobuso. I-Isifafazi ayikhethi ubuso. Khetha ubuso bese ucindezela Delete, noma usule omunye wemiphetho yalo. Uma sekuyiqembu noma isakhi, ukuchofoza kukhetha yonke into. Chofoza kabili ukuze uyivule. \"Khetha okuthile ukuze uhambise kuqala, noma uchofoze kukho.\" Hambisa, Jikisa kanye Shintsha usayizi zidinga okuthile okuzosebenza kukho: khetha kuqala, noma uqale ithuluzi ngokuchofoza into ngokwayo (hhayi endaweni engenalutho noma esikhombisini). \"Khetha ijiyomethri kuqala (donsa iwindi, noma chofoza kathathu ukukhetha konke okuhlangene).\" G kanye Shift+G zidinga ukukhethwa. Imikhombandlela ayikwazi ukuhlanganiswa. Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza esikhundleni sokukhiya Ukukhiya kusebenza kuphela ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala kwethuluzi lokudweba noma lokuhlela. Sunduza/hudula alinakho ukukhiya, futhi ku-Jikisa azishintshi ukujika. Ngezikhathi ezinye izinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza umbono. Esc esikrinini esigcwele Esikrinini esigcwele, isiphequluli singase sisebenzise Esc yokuqala ukuphuma esikrinini esigcwele. Cindezela Esc futhi ukuze ukhansele ithuluzi. Akukho inkinobho ephakathi Cindezela O ukuze Zungeza bese udonsa, noma sebenzisa izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bheka Zungeza, shelelisa nosondeze. Ukungenisa Umyalezo Okufanele wenze \"I-ModelCraft ingenisa i-SketchUp (.skp), Collada (.dae), OBJ, glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic (.abc), DWG ne-DXF. … akuyona lutho kwalezi.\" Khipha imodeli ngaphandle kwenye inhlelo ngesinye salezi zifomethi \"Lelifayelaliyi-300 MB ngaphezulu.\" Yenza imodeli ibe lula noma uyihlukanise kwenye inhlelo \"…likhulu kakhulu ukuze limodelwe lapha (ngaphezu kwezigidi ezi-2 zamaphoyinti).\" Okufanayo \"Ifayela le-.gltf lidinga \"…\"…\" Ngenisa i-.gltf kanye nemifayela yayo ye-.bin nezithombe, noma vula inguqulo ye-.glb \"Leli fayela le-glTF lidinga isandiso se-…, i-ModelCraft engakafundi.\" Khipha kabusha kwenye inhlelo ngaphandle kwalesi sandiso (izithombe ze-KTX2, isibonelo) Ifayela le-OBJ lingena ngaphandle kwemibala noma izithombe Ngenisa .obj kanye ne-.mtl nezithombe zayo \"Leli fayela le-Alembic lisebenzisa isakhiwo se-HDF5 esidala…\" Londoloza kabusha kwenye inhlelo njengefayela le-Ogawa Alembic I-FBX ingena ingenazo izithombe Ngenisa .fbx kanye nezithombe zayo, noma faka imidiya lapho ukhipha \"Leli fayela le-FBX linguqulo …, i-ModelCraft ayiyifundi\" Khipha kabusha njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha I-STL noma i-PLY ingena izikhathi ezingu-1 000 zinkulu noma zincane kakhulu I-STL ifundwa njengamamilimitha, i-PLY njengamamitha: shintsha usayizi (bheka Jikisa nokushintsha usayizi) \"Lolu akulona ifayela le-Collada (.dae)…\" noma \"…aliyona i-XML efanele…\" Ifayela lonakele noma akulona i-Collada. Khipha kabusha \"Leli fayela le-Collada alinayo ijiyomethri i-ModelCraft engeniswa.\" Liqukethe kuphela amakhamera, amalambu noma izinkomba zamanye amafayela \"Lo yi-DXF ebhinari. Yilondoloze njenge-ASCII DXF bese uzama futhi.\" Yilondoloze kabusha njenge-ASCII kusuka ohlelweni lwe-CAD \"Lona akulona umdwebo we-DWG…\" Ifayela alilona i-DWG, noma lonakele \"Lo mdwebo awufundeki (…). Mhlawumbe unonakele, noma ulondolozwe ngenguqulo ye-DWG umfundi ongayiphathi…\" Izinkomba zinikeza isizathu. Londoloza njenge-DXF, noma njenge-DWG ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018, kusuka ohlelweni lwe-CAD \"Lo mdwebo ufinyelela ngaphezu kuka-10,000 km kusuka kumsuka wawo…\" Hambisa umdwebo eduze ne-0,0 ohlelweni lwe-CAD Ukungena kungenza ngosayizi ongalungile noma kulele ecaleni OBJ: i-OBJ ayinayo iyunithi; i-ModelCraft ifunda amamitha. Imodeli yamamilimitha ingena ngokukhulu izikhathi ezingu-1000: shintsha usayizi wayo ngo-0.001; imodeli yamainshi ngo-0.0254. OBJ ilele ecaleni: i-ModelCraft ilindele amafayela e-OBJ anoY uphezulu. Ifayela elibhalwe no-Z uphezulu lingena lilele. Jikisa ngo-90° ngokuya ku-akisi ebomvu: chofoza isikhungo se-Jikisa ebusweni obubheka ngebomvu, noma vula ifayela ohlelweni lwalo bese ukhipha no-Y uphezulu. DWG noma DXF: ukhethe iyunithi engalungile kwingxoxo ethi \"Iyunithi zomdwebo\". Hlehlisa bese ungenisa futhi. Ukuvula amafayela Umyalezo Okufanele wenze \"Lelifayela akuyona imodeli ye-ModelCraft (alisiyo JSON).\" Sebenzisa Ngenisa kwezinye izifomethi \"Lona akuyona ifayela le-ModelCraft esingalivula: …\" Ifayela lonakele noma lashintshwa ngesandla \"Le modeli yalondolozwa yi-ModelCraft entsha…\" Vula kunguqulo entsha \"Lelifayela liyi-200 MB ngaphezulu.\" Imodeli inkulu kakhulu ukuze ivulwe lapha Ngilahlekelwe umsebenzi I-ModelCraft ayilondolozi ifayela ngokwayo. Uma uvala noma uvuselela ithebhu enezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyabuza kuqala (ukushiya isayithi noma ukulayisha kabusha); khetha ukuhlala bese ulondoloza. Okuthi Entsha no-Vula nakho kubuza ngezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga. Uma isiphequluli noma ikhompyutha iwohloka, vula i-ModelCraft futhi kwisiphequluli esifanayo: iyakunikeza umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga (\"Buyisa umsebenzi wakho?\"; bheka Buyisela umsebenzi wakho). Londoloza kaningi nge-Ctrl+S. Ifolda yami yokulanda igcwala ngamakhophi Ukulondoloza ngakunye kuba ukulanda okusha, kuqanjwe njenge Untitled (1).modelcraft, Untitled (2).modelcraft njalo njalo. Susa ezindala, noma setha isiphequluli ukuze sibuze ukuthi ufuna ukulondoloza kuphi ngalowo ngamunye futhi ubhale phezu kwefayela elidala ngokwakho. Bheka Vula, londoloza, ngenisa nokukhipha. Kuhamba kancane Isinyathelo ngasinye sokuhlehlisa silondoloza ikhophi yemodeli (i-mesh ilondoloza okushintshile kuphela), ngakho ekungeniseni okukhulu kwejiyomethri yokusunduza/ukuhudula, ukuhlela ngakunye kuthatha isikhathi eside. Chitha noma susa okungadingeki, londoloza, bese uvula kabusha: ukuvula kabusha kusula nomlando wokuhlehlisa. Izithunzi zelanga zibiza kakhulu. Susa ukukhetha Izithunzi zelanga ngenkathi umisa imodeli. Azikho izithunzi Izithunzi zelanga ivaliwe, ilanga lishonile ngesikhathi osikhethile (\"Ilanga lishonile ngalesi sikhathi.\"), noma isitayela siyi-Uhlaka lwewaya, olungadwetshi izithunzi. \"Lesi siphequluli asivumelanga ukugcwalisa isikrini.\" Ezinye iziphequluli nezinkombandlela ezifakiwe zenqaba ukugcwalisa isikrini. Sebenzisa isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli kunalokho (Control-Command-F / F11). I-ModelCraft ayivuli ngaphandle kokuxhumana I-ModelCraft ivula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kuphela uma yayilondolozelwe ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kulesi siphequluli: inkinobho yebha yohlelo kumele ifunde Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Vula uma ukhona ku-inthanethi bese uchofoza Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uma inkinobho ifunda Akukwazanga ukulondoloza, yichofoze futhi ngokuxhumana okungcono; Ayikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi kusho ukuthi lo windi (iwindi eliyimfihlo, noma ikhompyutha elawulwayo) alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi. Bheka Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Akukakwakhiwe","summary":"Okungenziwa yile bhilidi ye-ModelCraft okungakenziwa okwamanje, nokufanele ukwenze namanje esikhundleni salokho.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["okungekho","akukakwenziwa","imikhawulo","roadmap","izinto zokwakha","ukuthungwa","umbhalo","izingqimba","trim","split","ifu","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"amathuluzi-okudweba","text":"Amathuluzi okudweba","level":2},{"id":"ukunyakazisa","text":"Ukunyakazisa","level":2},{"id":"ama-mesh","text":"Ama-mesh","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlela-nokubuka","text":"Ukuhlela nokubuka","level":2},{"id":"ukwenza","text":"Ukwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinto-zokwakha-nemibala","text":"Izinto zokwakha nemibala","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2},{"id":"ukuprinta-nge-3d","text":"Ukuprinta nge-3D","level":2},{"id":"ukusebenza","text":"Ukusebenza","level":2},{"id":"izinhlelo-nezinkundla","text":"Izinhlelo nezinkundla","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-ModelCraft iyibhilidi yokuqala. Leli khasi lidweba okungakenziwa okwamanje, ukuze ungazifunele, nendlela eseduze yokwenza umsebenzi namanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-okudweba\"\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudweba ngesandla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha inani lezingxenye ze-arc noma isiyingi ngemva kokukudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa bese udweba kabusha ngemva kokuthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha uhlobo lombhalo we-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/text3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/text3d\"\u003E3D text\u003C/a\u003E, noma ukuhlela amagama alo ngemva kokuwubeka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa bese wengeza umbhalo kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha i-engeli ngokuthayipha esilinganisweni se-engeli, noma usayizi wesilinda kusuka esilinganisweni sesiyingi saso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikisa imiphetho nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E; shintsha usayizi wesilinda nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezifakweni zemodeli ezithunyelwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ziyabonakala emifanekisweni, emaphrinteni nasemaPDF ombono; amafayela emodeli athwala ijiyomethri kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrim, Split ne-Outer shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaqembu avaliwe e-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EUnion, Subtract and Intersect\u003C/a\u003E, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003Eintersect faces\u003C/a\u003E bese ususa okungadingeki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha i-axis yokujikeleza ngokhiye bomcibisholo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isikhungo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E ebusweni elibheka ngendlela i-axis okumele ibheke ngayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhiya ngaphezu kokukhomba kunye ngesikhathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhiya inqondo elilodwa ngokhiye bomcibisholo, bese ubamba iphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha usayizi ngokuthambeka, noma kusuka ekugcineni kwesilinganiso okungasikho ekhoneni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka isilinganiso kumakhona amabili, ngomphetho noma ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza noma oluzuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukunyakazisa\"\u003EUkunyakazisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunyakazisa izinhlangothi, imiphetho, isikhathi sosuku selanga, isitayela noma okufihliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ingxenye enyakazayo ibe iqembu noma ikhomponenti; yenza ividiyo ehlukile yesikhathi sosuku esihlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhamera elandela umzila odwetshiwe, noma ebuka into enyakazayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka okhiye bekhamera abaningi ndleleni (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003ENyakazisa\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsindo emavidiyweni, namavidiyo ekhwalithi ephezulu (ahlanganiswa ngomzila) ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza umsindo kwi-video editor; ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU, yenza ividiyo nge-renderer esheshayo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation#render-the-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\" data-hash=\"render-the-video\"\u003EYenza ividiyo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmalambu anyakazayo (ukukhanya, ukusakazeka, umbala) evidiyweni eyenziwe, i-engeli yelensi enyakazisiwe ngaphandle kwokhiye bekhamera evidiyweni, ukunyakazisa izinto zokwakha noma izilungiselelo zokwenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmalambu anyakaza embonweni; ngevidiyo, khiya nekhamera ukuze usondele; yenza amavidiyo ahlukene ngezilungiselelo ezahlukene zelambu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003ENyakazisa noma yimuphi umbono\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucwilisa izisindo noma amathambo kusuka uhlangothi olulodwa kuya kolunye, amaenvelopu amathambo abonakalayo, ukubonisa izisindo ngamaphoyinti ngamaphoyinti, ukubona imodeli eyenziwe ngesikhathi sokupenda izisindo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPenda zombili izinhlangothi, noma yenza uhhafu bese usebenzisa i-Mirror modifier ngaphambi kokungeza i-armature; shintsha phakathi kwe-Penda izisindo ne-Ukuma ukuhlola\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathambo afundwa kumafayela e-glTF, FBX noma USD njenge-armature, namathambo abhalwe kulawo mafayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule ngezisindo zefayela; engeza amathambo ngokulandelana kwamajoyinti efayela, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the file&#039;s weights\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003ENyakazisa\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhambisa injongo ye-IK noma i-pole ngokuyidonsa embonweni, isikhala somkhawulo (lokhu kwendawo noma komhlaba) okukhethwayo, ukwelula amaketanga e-IK, i-IK ngejika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha iphoyinti lenjongo, noma uqondise kwento bese uyihambisa; gcina amaketanga ezinhlobeni zawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndwangu, amanzi, izinto ezithambile, izixhumanisi namahinji phakathi kwezinto eziqinile, ukungqubuzana nesimo esiqondile sento (amabhokisi namabhola kuphela azungezile), isimulation ephilayo uma udlala, isivinini sokuqala noma ukujikeleza (izinto ziqala zimi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBhaka izinto eziqinile bese udlala okhiye; yakha ihinji ngokhiye; hlukanisa isimo esiyinkimbinkimbi sibe amabhokisi (amaqembu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela ukunyakaza kumafayela e-glTF noma amanye amafayela emodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ividiyo; ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, nefayela le-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E elilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft, ligcine kwi-ModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthayipha ukuphawula noma isihloko sesimo ku-VR, amanothi ngezwi, ukuhambisa ipulani lesigaba ngesandla ku-VR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka isimo ku-VR, bese wengeza amagama aso ohlelweni lwe-BCF; setha ipulani lesigaba embonweni ngaphambi kokungena: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/vr-review\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/vr-review\"\u003EBuka imodeli nge-VR headset\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubona abantu ezindaweni zabo ku-VR (abantu be-VR kuphela ndabawubonakalayo), ukurekhoda uhambo lwe-VR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBacele bajoyine ku-VR, noma yenza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Eukunyakazisa\u003C/a\u003E kohambo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-mesh\"\u003EAma-mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubumba ngamazinga (multiresolution), nokuthi i-Detail isuse izinxantathu ezibe zincane kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003EBumba\u003C/a\u003E i-mesh ehlukaniswe; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E ukuyilinganisa futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-remesh ibe izinhlangothi ezine ezilandela isimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E (izinxantathu ezilinganayo), bese uyakha kabusha nge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#retopology\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"retopology\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzisindo ezipendwe kumaphoyinti zama-modifier (Displace, Smooth ne-Shrinkwrap zisebenza kuyo yonke i-mesh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaka i-modifier, bese ubumba noma uhlele izingxenye ezidinga kona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukopisha namathisela amaphoyinti, imiphetho noma izinhlangothi, ukusika ngommese okuphela ngaphakathi kwenhlangothi, imiphetho yocingo engenayo inhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda i-mesh ku-Model; sika ngommese kusukela emphethweni kuya kwomunye; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#change-the-shape\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"change-the-shape\"\u003EPhakamisa\u003C/a\u003E imiphetho evulekile ibe izinhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlela-nokubuka\"\u003EUkuhlela nokubuka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingqimba zamapulani esayithi e-DWG ne-DXF njengamathegi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpulani lesayithi lingena njengeqembu elilodwa: liqhume bese wenza amaqembu ezingxenye ofuna ukuzithegisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsika zesigaba eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, ibhokisi lesigaba, noma umugqa wesigaba othunyelwe njengedrowing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpulani elilodwa lesigaba \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sections\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sections\"\u003Eliyasika\u003C/a\u003E ngesikhathi; thumela ukubuka njengesithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubonisa imiphetho ethambile njengemigqa eyimicu, noma ukuthamba ngesikhathi udonsa i-slider\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003EThamba nge-engeli\u003C/a\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E, bese uyahlehlisa ukuzama enye i-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmtapo wemodeli ku-inthanethi ongasesha, noma izinhlobo zekhomponenti ongazikhetha (umbala, isitayela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/starter\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/starter\"\u003EUmtapo wokuqala\u003C/a\u003E; ngenisa amamodeli we-Collada, OBJ noma glTF; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/stretch\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/stretch\"\u003Eelula\u003C/a\u003E ikhophi libe usayizi ofanele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubeka izitshalo emtapweni wezitshalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\"\u003ESakaza\u003C/a\u003E izitshalo embonweni ophilayo, noma beka isihlahla semtapo wokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhophi azimele eqenjini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ikhomponenti, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwenza\"\u003EUkwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwenza embonweni (indawo yomsebenzi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E), uhlu lokwenza, nezinketho zekhamera, isithombe sesibhakabhaka, ukuba mpunga nokuxuba kwamalambu ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHigh quality\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa i-WebGL path tracer lapho, ngaphandle kwalezo zinketho (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnye inkolo idweba isithombe sokwenza ngaphandle kwe-add-on yenjini yokwenza (i-CadCraft ayikaze isebenzise uhlelo olungaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL); amakhamera wepanorama noma wamastereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inkolo; i-plug-in ye-Unreal Engine (amafayela ayabhalwa, i-plug-in evula wona ayikakhishwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinjini zethu ezimbili ze-Fast ne-Path tracer; injini ye-add-on; ifayela lefolda le-USD, glTF noma Unreal kusuka kuhlu lwe-Engine ukuze uthathe kunoma yiluphi uhlelo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003Edweba isithombe ngenye inkolo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzitshalo nezitshalo ezisakazekile ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibonakala kokubuka okuphilayo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Elive view\u003C/a\u003E), kumapanorama, kwisibukeli nakuvidiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-zokwakha-nemibala\"\u003EIzinto zokwakha nemibala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufakwayo okungeyona umbala oyisisekelo, roughness, metalness, opacity, normal kanye ne-emission okushintsha ngaphezu kwendawo ezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu (zisebenzisa okuphakathi kwazo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003EYenza izinto zokwakha ngama-node\u003C/a\u003E: xhuma noma kunjalo, ukubuka kuyobonisa ukuhlukahluka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlukahluka ezinhlangothini ezisunduzwayo/hudulwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuqula into ibe i-mesh ukuze uhlukahlukise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwabelana ngezinto zakho zokwakha emtapweni ngaphakathi kwe-app, namamephu aphaketheke (ARM/ORM) noma EXR kusethi yokuthungwa engenisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZigcine kufayela; ngenisa amamephu ahlukene njenge-PNG noma i-JPEG\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zokwakha zefayela kumasheshi e-Live TeamWork (zihlala kukhompyutha eyazenza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza ifayela bese uyabelana ngalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-decal agoqeka ezindaweni ezigobile, ama-decal ku-Undo, noma ukupenda izinhlangothi eziningi zokuthungwa ngesikhathi esisodwa ngaphesheya kwesihlanganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka ama-decal amancane kwiningi lezingxenye; penda uhlangothi ngalunye lwesihlanganiso ngokwehlukana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubhaka ezinhlangothini ezisunduzwayo/hudulwayo, ukubhaka izinto eziningi zibe isithombe esisodwa, ikheji oyibumba ngesandla, noma ukukhanya okubhakiwe kumalambu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuqula ibe i-mesh bese uyiqhephula; bhaka into ngayinye; khulisa ibanga lokusesha; yenza isithombe sokukhanya kwelambu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupenda roughness, metalness noma height, ukupenda ngezithombe (stamps) nokupenda ukuthungwa okukhulu kuna-512 × 512\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPenda umbala oyisisekelo lapha; yenza amamephu amanye kwi-picture editor bese uwangenisa njengesethi yokuthungwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthungwa kokuthunyelwa kwe-Collada, STL, PLY, 3MF, IFC, DWG ne-DXF, nezikimu zamagrafu ezinto zokwakha zefayela ezimodelini ezithunyelwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELezi zinhlobo zithola umbala wento yokwakha ngayinye; i-glTF ne-OBJ zithwala ukuthungwa okungeniswe; thumela into yokwakha yodwa njenge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materialx\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/a\u003E; i-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E igcina imodeli yonke ye-ModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthungwa kumafayela e-Collada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZiyabalwa futhi ziyakhishwa lapho zingeniswa; ukuthungwa kumafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E kuyangena\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulondoloza amafayela e-SketchUp, nombhalo nezilinganiso kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/a\u003E igcina izinhlangothi, imibala nokuthungwa; thumela i-Collada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E) ukuze ubuyele ku-SketchUp\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso nemihlahlandlela ekuthunyelweni kwe-DWG ne-DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZengeze kuhlelo lwe-CAD ngemva kokuthumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti, amathebula nama-multileader avela ku-DWG ne-DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyabalwa futhi ayakhishwa; umbhalo ungena njengombhalo wohlobo olulodwa, hhayi ifonti yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo, ama-mesh, amathebula nama-multileader ku-DWG ne-DXF; izinhlangothi zama-solid angu-3D ezindaweni ezigoqwayo, ezinamathelwe noma ezinye izindawo ezikhululekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENabo bayabalwa futhi bayakhishwa (ama-solid angu-3D ngokwawo ayangena). Thumela lezo zingxenye kuhlelo lwe-CAD njenge-OBJ noma i-Collada bese uyangenisa lokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlobo, izakhiwo noma izinto zokwakha ze-IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kunezitezi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#ifc-ifc\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"ifc-ifc\"\u003Estoreys\u003C/a\u003E) nezakhi ezijwayelekile; engeza okunye kuhlelo lwe-BIM\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela imodeli ngqo ku-BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC for BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E bese uyivula ku-BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho engahlanganisiwe ku-glTF ne-STL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa i-OBJ noma i-Collada ngomsebenzi wemigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zokwakha ze-glTF ne-FBX ngaphezu kombala oyisisekelo (insimbi, roughness, amamephu e-normal, ingilazi, i-clear coat, i-sheen…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZiyafundwa futhi ziyadwetshwa; i-ModelCraft igcina umbala oyisisekelo noma ukuthungwa. Yakha kabusha ukubukeka ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003EShading workspace\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathambo, ukunyakaza nezinhloso zokuguqula ze-glTF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule; nyakazisa ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Etimeline\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibala namagama ezingxenye zomhlangano kumafayela e-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye zingena njenge-mesh ngosayizi wazo wangempela; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003Ependa\u003C/a\u003E futhi uzithiyele amagama ngemva kokungenisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto ze-SubD, umbhalo, izilinganiso nezibani kumafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files#what-is-left-out-and-said\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-hash=\"what-is-left-out-and-said\"\u003Eokushiywe\u003C/a\u003E; guqula i-SubD ibe ama-mesh kuhlelo olwenza ifayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthungwa kwe-KTX2 nezinhlobo zezinto zokwakha ku-glTF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela ngokuthungwa kwe-PNG noma i-JPEG; kusetshenziswa uhlobo oluzenzakalelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubhala i-glTF instancing (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhomponenti abhalwa kanye futhi abekwa izikhathi eziningi, okufundwa yi-viewer ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunyakaza kwe-Alembic (sonke isampula lecache), amaphoyinti nemigqa ye-Alembic, nokubhala i-Alembic\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsampula lokuqala liyangena; nyakazisa ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Etimeline\u003C/a\u003E; bhala i-glTF, i-USD noma i-OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamephu e-bump nenormal ezintweni zokwakha ze-OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuyangena isithombe sombala kuphela (\u003Ccode\u003Emap_Kd\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathambo nokunyakaza kwe-FBX, ukuthunyelwa kwe-FBX, amafayela e-FBX 6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule; thumela i-glTF; gcina amafayela amadala njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhumba, ukuguqula, amakhamera, izibani, ukubheka nokuguqula kwe-skew kwe-Collada, nezinkomba zangaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZiyakhishwa lapho zingeniswa futhi ziyabalwa emlayezweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela okusekela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) igcina enye ikhophi. Ngemva kokuphahla, i-ModelCraft iyakunikeza umsebenzi wakho ongalondolozwanga (&quot;Recover your work?&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulondoloza kwefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwamakhompyutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukatholakali okwamanje. Londoloza amafayela kukhompyutha yakho, bese uwakopisha lapho ewadingayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuprinta-nge-3d\"\u003EUkuprinta nge-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzisekelo zangempela zesilayisi (izixhumanisi, i-raft, iphethini yesisekelo echaziwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#supports-preview\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"supports-preview\"\u003EUkubukwa kwezisekelo\u003C/a\u003E kubonisa lapho nokuthi zingaki; ukubuka kwesilayisi sakho kubonisa ezangempela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlukanisa ingxenye edlula kuyo yona, noma imiphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/a\u003E kulandisa lapho zikhona; sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EIntersect faces\u003C/a\u003E bese ususa okungaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphethini wokugcwalisa nelathisi ngaphakathi kwento egobile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#hollow\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"hollow\"\u003EGobhoza\u003C/a\u003E iyishiya ingenalutho; isilayisi sakho sengeza ukugcwaliswa engxenyeni eqinile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImininingwane encane kakhulu kwinozzle yakho (ngaphandle kwezindonga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#wall-thickness\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"wall-thickness\"\u003EUkujula kodonga\u003C/a\u003E kuthola izindonga ezincane; ukubuka kwezendlalelo zesilayisi sakho kubonisa okunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusebenza\"\u003EUkusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlehlisa kugcina ikhophi yemodeli ngesinyathelo ngasinye (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Ei-mesh\u003C/a\u003E igcina kuphela okushintshiwe), ngakho ukungeniswa okukhulu kakhulu kwejiyomethri yokuhudula kwenza ukuhlela ngakunye kube kancane. Gcina ukungenisa kuncane, bese ulondoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukuze uhlanze umlando.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlelo-nezinkundla\"\u003EIzinhlelo nezinkundla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIdeskithophu:\u003C/strong\u003E i-ModelCraft isebenza kusiphequluli se-Mac, Windows ne-Linux, nakwi-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni okukodwa. Ku-Android, i-CadCraft Studio ifakwa nge-APK yayo kuma-getcadcraft.com/download. Akukakho ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthinta:\u003C/strong\u003E bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EZungeza, shelelisa nesondeza\u003C/a\u003E ngezenzo zeminwe. Ingcindezi yepeni isetha ibhulashi ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003EBumba\u003C/a\u003E; kwezinye izindawo ingcindezi nokuthambekela kwepeni akusetshenziswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi:\u003C/strong\u003E i-ModelCraft \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model#print-the-view-or-save-it-as-a-pdf\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\" data-hash=\"print-the-view-or-save-it-as-a-pdf\"\u003Eiprinta ukubuka okukodwa ngekhasi ngalinye\u003C/a\u003E; akukho ukwakheka kwamashidi anemibono eminingi noma i-title block. Thumela ku-DWG/DXF ehambisana ne-CadCraft ukuze uthole imidwebo ngesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-ModelCraft iyibhilidi yokuqala. Leli khasi lidweba okungakenziwa okwamanje, ukuze ungazifunele, nendlela eseduze yokwenza umsebenzi namanje. Amathuluzi okudweba Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Ukudweba ngesandla Chofoza amaphoyinti nge-Curve Ukushintsha inani lezingxenye ze-arc noma isiyingi ngemva kokukudweba Susa bese udweba kabusha ngemva kokuthayipha 24s Ukukhetha uhlobo lombhalo we-3D text, noma ukuhlela amagama alo ngemva kokuwubeka Susa bese wengeza umbhalo kabusha Ukushintsha i-engeli ngokuthayipha esilinganisweni se-engeli, noma usayizi wesilinda kusuka esilinganisweni sesiyingi saso Jikisa imiphetho nge-Rotate; shintsha usayizi wesilinda nge-Scale Izilinganiso ezifakweni zemodeli ezithunyelwayo Izilinganiso ziyabonakala emifanekisweni, emaphrinteni nasemaPDF ombono; amafayela emodeli athwala ijiyomethri kuphela Trim, Split ne-Outer shell Amaqembu avaliwe e-Union, Subtract and Intersect, noma intersect faces bese ususa okungadingeki Ukukhetha i-axis yokujikeleza ngokhiye bomcibisholo Chofoza isikhungo se-Rotate ebusweni elibheka ngendlela i-axis okumele ibheke ngayo Ukukhiya ngaphezu kokukhomba kunye ngesikhathi Khiya inqondo elilodwa ngokhiye bomcibisholo, bese ubamba iphoyinti Ukushintsha usayizi ngokuthambeka, noma kusuka ekugcineni kwesilinganiso okungasikho ekhoneni Beka isilinganiso kumakhona amabili, ngomphetho noma ngomugqa obomvu, oluhlaza noma oluzuri Ukunyakazisa Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Ukunyakazisa izinhlangothi, imiphetho, isikhathi sosuku selanga, isitayela noma okufihliwe Yenza ingxenye enyakazayo ibe iqembu noma ikhomponenti; yenza ividiyo ehlukile yesikhathi sosuku esihlukile Ikhamera elandela umzila odwetshiwe, noma ebuka into enyakazayo Beka okhiye bekhamera abaningi ndleleni (Nyakazisa) Umsindo emavidiyweni, namavidiyo ekhwalithi ephezulu (ahlanganiswa ngomzila) ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU Engeza umsindo kwi-video editor; ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU, yenza ividiyo nge-renderer esheshayo (Yenza ividiyo) Amalambu anyakazayo (ukukhanya, ukusakazeka, umbala) evidiyweni eyenziwe, i-engeli yelensi enyakazisiwe ngaphandle kwokhiye bekhamera evidiyweni, ukunyakazisa izinto zokwakha noma izilungiselelo zokwenza Amalambu anyakaza embonweni; ngevidiyo, khiya nekhamera ukuze usondele; yenza amavidiyo ahlukene ngezilungiselelo ezahlukene zelambu (Nyakazisa noma yimuphi umbono) Ukucwilisa izisindo noma amathambo kusuka uhlangothi olulodwa kuya kolunye, amaenvelopu amathambo abonakalayo, ukubonisa izisindo ngamaphoyinti ngamaphoyinti, ukubona imodeli eyenziwe ngesikhathi sokupenda izisindo Penda zombili izinhlangothi, noma yenza uhhafu bese usebenzisa i-Mirror modifier ngaphambi kokungeza i-armature; shintsha phakathi kwe-Penda izisindo ne-Ukuma ukuhlola Amathambo afundwa kumafayela e-glTF, FBX noma USD njenge-armature, namathambo abhalwe kulawo mafayela Imodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule ngezisindo zefayela; engeza amathambo ngokulandelana kwamajoyinti efayela, bese Use the file's weights (Nyakazisa) Ukuhambisa injongo ye-IK noma i-pole ngokuyidonsa embonweni, isikhala somkhawulo (lokhu kwendawo noma komhlaba) okukhethwayo, ukwelula amaketanga e-IK, i-IK ngejika Thayipha iphoyinti lenjongo, noma uqondise kwento bese uyihambisa; gcina amaketanga ezinhlobeni zawo Indwangu, amanzi, izinto ezithambile, izixhumanisi namahinji phakathi kwezinto eziqinile, ukungqubuzana nesimo esiqondile sento (amabhokisi namabhola kuphela azungezile), isimulation ephilayo uma udlala, isivinini sokuqala noma ukujikeleza (izinto ziqala zimi) Bhaka izinto eziqinile bese udlala okhiye; yakha ihinji ngokhiye; hlukanisa isimo esiyinkimbinkimbi sibe amabhokisi (amaqembu) Ukuthumela ukunyakaza kumafayela e-glTF noma amanye amafayela emodeli Yenza ividiyo; ifayela le-.modelcraft, nefayela le-USD elilondolozwe yi-ModelCraft, ligcine kwi-ModelCraft Ukuthayipha ukuphawula noma isihloko sesimo ku-VR, amanothi ngezwi, ukuhambisa ipulani lesigaba ngesandla ku-VR Beka isimo ku-VR, bese wengeza amagama aso ohlelweni lwe-BCF; setha ipulani lesigaba embonweni ngaphambi kokungena: bona Buka imodeli nge-VR headset Ukubona abantu ezindaweni zabo ku-VR (abantu be-VR kuphela ndabawubonakalayo), ukurekhoda uhambo lwe-VR Bacele bajoyine ku-VR, noma yenza ukunyakazisa kohambo Ama-mesh Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Ukubumba ngamazinga (multiresolution), nokuthi i-Detail isuse izinxantathu ezibe zincane kakhulu Bumba i-mesh ehlukaniswe; Remesh ukuyilinganisa futhi I-remesh ibe izinhlangothi ezine ezilandela isimo Remesh (izinxantathu ezilinganayo), bese uyakha kabusha nge-Retopology Izisindo ezipendwe kumaphoyinti zama-modifier (Displace, Smooth ne-Shrinkwrap zisebenza kuyo yonke i-mesh) Faka i-modifier, bese ubumba noma uhlele izingxenye ezidinga kona Ukukopisha namathisela amaphoyinti, imiphetho noma izinhlangothi, ukusika ngommese okuphela ngaphakathi kwenhlangothi, imiphetho yocingo engenayo inhlangothi Phinda i-mesh ku-Model; sika ngommese kusukela emphethweni kuya kwomunye; Phakamisa imiphetho evulekile ibe izinhlangothi Ukuhlela nokubuka Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Izingqimba zamapulani esayithi e-DWG ne-DXF njengamathegi Ipulani lesayithi lingena njengeqembu elilodwa: liqhume bese wenza amaqembu ezingxenye ofuna ukuzithegisa Izinsika zesigaba eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, ibhokisi lesigaba, noma umugqa wesigaba othunyelwe njengedrowing Ipulani elilodwa lesigaba liyasika ngesikhathi; thumela ukubuka njengesithombe Ukubonisa imiphetho ethambile njengemigqa eyimicu, noma ukuthamba ngesikhathi udonsa i-slider Thamba nge-engeli ku-Entity info, bese uyahlehlisa ukuzama enye i-engeli Umtapo wemodeli ku-inthanethi ongasesha, noma izinhlobo zekhomponenti ongazikhetha (umbala, isitayela) Umtapo wokuqala; ngenisa amamodeli we-Collada, OBJ noma glTF; elula ikhophi libe usayizi ofanele Ukubeka izitshalo emtapweni wezitshalo Sakaza izitshalo embonweni ophilayo, noma beka isihlahla semtapo wokuqala Amakhophi azimele eqenjini Yenza ikhomponenti, bese Make unique (bona Ukuxazulula izinkinga) Ukwenza Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Ukwenza embonweni (indawo yomsebenzi ye-Render), uhlu lokwenza, nezinketho zekhamera, isithombe sesibhakabhaka, ukuba mpunga nokuxuba kwamalambu ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU Render a picture… ku-High quality isebenzisa i-WebGL path tracer lapho, ngaphandle kwalezo zinketho (Renda isithombe) Enye inkolo idweba isithombe sokwenza ngaphandle kwe-add-on yenjini yokwenza (i-CadCraft ayikaze isebenzise uhlelo olungaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL); amakhamera wepanorama noma wamastereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inkolo; i-plug-in ye-Unreal Engine (amafayela ayabhalwa, i-plug-in evula wona ayikakhishwa) Izinjini zethu ezimbili ze-Fast ne-Path tracer; injini ye-add-on; ifayela lefolda le-USD, glTF noma Unreal kusuka kuhlu lwe-Engine ukuze uthathe kunoma yiluphi uhlelo (dweba isithombe ngenye inkolo) Izitshalo nezitshalo ezisakazekile ku-Render a picture… Zibonakala kokubuka okuphilayo (live view), kumapanorama, kwisibukeli nakuvidiyo Izinto zokwakha nemibala Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Okufakwayo okungeyona umbala oyisisekelo, roughness, metalness, opacity, normal kanye ne-emission okushintsha ngaphezu kwendawo ezithombeni ezinekhwalithi ephezulu (zisebenzisa okuphakathi kwazo) Yenza izinto zokwakha ngama-node: xhuma noma kunjalo, ukubuka kuyobonisa ukuhlukahluka Ukuhlukahluka ezinhlangothini ezisunduzwayo/hudulwayo Guqula into ibe i-mesh ukuze uhlukahlukise Ukwabelana ngezinto zakho zokwakha emtapweni ngaphakathi kwe-app, namamephu aphaketheke (ARM/ORM) noma EXR kusethi yokuthungwa engenisiwe Zigcine kufayela; ngenisa amamephu ahlukene njenge-PNG noma i-JPEG Izinto zokwakha zefayela kumasheshi e-Live TeamWork (zihlala kukhompyutha eyazenza) Londoloza ifayela bese uyabelana ngalo Ama-decal agoqeka ezindaweni ezigobile, ama-decal ku-Undo, noma ukupenda izinhlangothi eziningi zokuthungwa ngesikhathi esisodwa ngaphesheya kwesihlanganiso Beka ama-decal amancane kwiningi lezingxenye; penda uhlangothi ngalunye lwesihlanganiso ngokwehlukana Ukubhaka ezinhlangothini ezisunduzwayo/hudulwayo, ukubhaka izinto eziningi zibe isithombe esisodwa, ikheji oyibumba ngesandla, noma ukukhanya okubhakiwe kumalambu Guqula ibe i-mesh bese uyiqhephula; bhaka into ngayinye; khulisa ibanga lokusesha; yenza isithombe sokukhanya kwelambu Ukupenda roughness, metalness noma height, ukupenda ngezithombe (stamps) nokupenda ukuthungwa okukhulu kuna-512 × 512 Penda umbala oyisisekelo lapha; yenza amamephu amanye kwi-picture editor bese uwangenisa njengesethi yokuthungwa Ukuthungwa kokuthunyelwa kwe-Collada, STL, PLY, 3MF, IFC, DWG ne-DXF, nezikimu zamagrafu ezinto zokwakha zefayela ezimodelini ezithunyelwayo Lezi zinhlobo zithola umbala wento yokwakha ngayinye; i-glTF ne-OBJ zithwala ukuthungwa okungeniswe; thumela into yokwakha yodwa njenge-MaterialX; i-USD igcina imodeli yonke ye-ModelCraft Ukuthungwa kumafayela e-Collada Ziyabalwa futhi ziyakhishwa lapho zingeniswa; ukuthungwa kumafayela .skp ne-.glb kuyangena Amafayela Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Ukulondoloza amafayela e-SketchUp, nombhalo nezilinganiso kuwo Ngenisa igcina izinhlangothi, imibala nokuthungwa; thumela i-Collada (.dae) ukuze ubuyele ku-SketchUp Izilinganiso nemihlahlandlela ekuthunyelweni kwe-DWG ne-DXF Zengeze kuhlelo lwe-CAD ngemva kokuthumela Amaphoyinti, amathebula nama-multileader avela ku-DWG ne-DXF Ayabalwa futhi ayakhishwa; umbhalo ungena njengombhalo wohlobo olulodwa, hhayi ifonti yomdwebo Izindawo, ama-mesh, amathebula nama-multileader ku-DWG ne-DXF; izinhlangothi zama-solid angu-3D ezindaweni ezigoqwayo, ezinamathelwe noma ezinye izindawo ezikhululekile Nabo bayabalwa futhi bayakhishwa (ama-solid angu-3D ngokwawo ayangena). Thumela lezo zingxenye kuhlelo lwe-CAD njenge-OBJ noma i-Collada bese uyangenisa lokho Izinhlobo, izakhiwo noma izinto zokwakha ze-IFC Ukuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kunezitezi (storeys) nezakhi ezijwayelekile; engeza okunye kuhlelo lwe-BIM Ukuthumela imodeli ngqo ku-BimCraft Thumela IFC for BimCraft (.ifc) bese uyivula ku-BimCraft Imiphetho engahlanganisiwe ku-glTF ne-STL Sebenzisa i-OBJ noma i-Collada ngomsebenzi wemigqa Izinto zokwakha ze-glTF ne-FBX ngaphezu kombala oyisisekelo (insimbi, roughness, amamephu e-normal, ingilazi, i-clear coat, i-sheen…) Ziyafundwa futhi ziyadwetshwa; i-ModelCraft igcina umbala oyisisekelo noma ukuthungwa. Yakha kabusha ukubukeka ku-Shading workspace Amathambo, ukunyakaza nezinhloso zokuguqula ze-glTF Imodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule; nyakazisa ku-timeline Imibala namagama ezingxenye zomhlangano kumafayela e-STEP Izingxenye zingena njenge-mesh ngosayizi wazo wangempela; penda futhi uzithiyele amagama ngemva kokungenisa Izinto ze-SubD, umbhalo, izilinganiso nezibani kumafayela .3dm Bona okushiywe; guqula i-SubD ibe ama-mesh kuhlelo olwenza ifayela Ukuthungwa kwe-KTX2 nezinhlobo zezinto zokwakha ku-glTF Thumela ngokuthungwa kwe-PNG noma i-JPEG; kusetshenziswa uhlobo oluzenzakalelayo Ukubhala i-glTF instancing (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) Amakhomponenti abhalwa kanye futhi abekwa izikhathi eziningi, okufundwa yi-viewer ngayinye Ukunyakaza kwe-Alembic (sonke isampula lecache), amaphoyinti nemigqa ye-Alembic, nokubhala i-Alembic Isampula lokuqala liyangena; nyakazisa ku-timeline; bhala i-glTF, i-USD noma i-OBJ Amamephu e-bump nenormal ezintweni zokwakha ze-OBJ Kuyangena isithombe sombala kuphela (map_Kd) Amathambo nokunyakaza kwe-FBX, ukuthunyelwa kwe-FBX, amafayela e-FBX 6 Imodeli enesikhumba ingena ime njengoba iphumule; thumela i-glTF; gcina amafayela amadala njenge-FBX 2011 noma entsha Izikhumba, ukuguqula, amakhamera, izibani, ukubheka nokuguqula kwe-skew kwe-Collada, nezinkomba zangaphandle Ziyakhishwa lapho zingeniswa futhi ziyabalwa emlayezweni Amafayela okusekela Save as (Ctrl+Shift+S) igcina enye ikhophi. Ngemva kokuphahla, i-ModelCraft iyakunikeza umsebenzi wakho ongalondolozwanga (\"Recover your work?\") Ukulondoloza kwefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwamakhompyutha Akukatholakali okwamanje. Londoloza amafayela kukhompyutha yakho, bese uwakopisha lapho ewadingayo Ukuprinta nge-3D Akukakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namanje Izisekelo zangempela zesilayisi (izixhumanisi, i-raft, iphethini yesisekelo echaziwe) Ukubukwa kwezisekelo kubonisa lapho nokuthi zingaki; ukubuka kwesilayisi sakho kubonisa ezangempela Ukuhlukanisa ingxenye edlula kuyo yona, noma imiphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana Lungisa kulandisa lapho zikhona; sebenzisa Intersect faces bese ususa okungaphakathi Amaphethini wokugcwalisa nelathisi ngaphakathi kwento egobile Gobhoza iyishiya ingenalutho; isilayisi sakho sengeza ukugcwaliswa engxenyeni eqinile Imininingwane encane kakhulu kwinozzle yakho (ngaphandle kwezindonga) Ukujula kodonga kuthola izindonga ezincane; ukubuka kwezendlalelo zesilayisi sakho kubonisa okunye Ukusebenza Ukuhlehlisa kugcina ikhophi yemodeli ngesinyathelo ngasinye (i-mesh igcina kuphela okushintshiwe), ngakho ukungeniswa okukhulu kakhulu kwejiyomethri yokuhudula kwenza ukuhlela ngakunye kube kancane. Gcina ukungenisa kuncane, bese ulondoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukuze uhlanze umlando. Izinhlelo nezinkundla Ideskithophu: i-ModelCraft isebenza kusiphequluli se-Mac, Windows ne-Linux, nakwi-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni okukodwa. Ku-Android, i-CadCraft Studio ifakwa nge-APK yayo kuma-getcadcraft.com/download. Akukakho ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone. Ukuthinta: bona Zungeza, shelelisa nesondeza ngezenzo zeminwe. Ingcindezi yepeni isetha ibhulashi ku-Bumba; kwezinye izindawo ingcindezi nokuthambekela kwepeni akusetshenziswa. Amashidi: i-ModelCraft iprinta ukubuka okukodwa ngekhasi ngalinye; akukho ukwakheka kwamashidi anemibono eminingi noma i-title block. Thumela ku-DWG/DXF ehambisana ne-CadCraft ukuze uthole imidwebo ngesilinganiso.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenzisa lolu sizo","summary":"Vula usizo, lusesha, bese ubona izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["usizo","f1","sesha","amathuto","incwadi"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-usizo","text":"Vula usizo","level":2},{"id":"thola-isihloko","text":"Thola isihloko","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho","text":"Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi","text":"Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-usizo\"\u003EVula usizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nokhiye \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EOkhiye ku-Mac\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-isihloko\"\u003EThola isihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela lapho wawukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EIzinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo &quot;Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi\"\u003ELolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo. Vula usizo Cindezela F1, noma khetha Usizo ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo. Cindezela Esc noma khetha Vala ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo. Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela F1 kanye nokhiye fn (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho Usizo. Bona Okhiye ku-Mac. Thola isihloko Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele. Izihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga. Izixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. Back ibuyisela lapho wawukhona. Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho Ezinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo \"Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi\". Khetha Shintsha kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini. Khetha Bonisa konke ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo. Izinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: Ctrl+S ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux. Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi Iwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, Vula kuwebhusayithi ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Izisebenzi nekhompyutha","summary":"Izisebenzi izinhlelo ezisebenza kuzo, okwehlukile phakathi kwazo, nokuthi ikhompyutha yakho idinga ini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","isiphequluli","mac","windows","linux","ipad","ithebulethi","webgl","izidingo","inkumbulo"],"headings":[{"id":"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa","text":"Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi","text":"Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-ne-linux","text":"Mac, Windows ne-Linux","level":2},{"id":"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu","text":"Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho","text":"Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa\"\u003EIsiphequluli esingasetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiphequluli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi\"\u003EOkwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha &quot;File download location&quot; ibe &quot;Ask for each download&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-ne-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows ne-Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EAmathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu\"\u003EIsiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu \u003Cem\u003Eeqala\u003C/em\u003E, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EOkudingwa ikhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIchip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona Lapho amafayela akho aya khona). Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa Sebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi: Isiphequluli Injini Amanothi Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Eyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela. Firefox Gecko Iyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese. Safari WebKit Iyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa. Zombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho. Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi Ukuvula ifolda. Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu. Ukulondoloza. Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini. Ku-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha \"Always ask you where to save files\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha \"File download location\" ibe \"Ask for each download\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Mac, Windows ne-Linux Izinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta Ezinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo. Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu Sizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi. Inguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) I-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho. Lena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu eqala, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici. Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho Lezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe: I-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe). Ichip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho. Isikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela. Amafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad","summary":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo, okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac, ukuchofoza ngesokudla nokuhambisa ngaphandle kwe-mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","inqamulelo","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","okhiye bomsebenzi","trackpad","chofoza ngesokudla","inkinobho ephakathi","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac","text":"Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac","level":2},{"id":"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo","text":"Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad","text":"Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo","text":"Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkubhalwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Mac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Windows ne-Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInkinobho ye-Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. &quot;Bese&quot; kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac\"\u003EOkhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebamba \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evula \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uvula &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo\"\u003EIzinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Mac kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad\"\u003EIzinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula &quot;Secondary click&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo\"\u003EUkubhala ebhokisini lombhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala &quot;L&quot; kubhala u-L. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo Usizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo. Ukubhalwa Ku-Mac Ku-Windows ne-Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) kanye S Ctrl kanye S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F Ctrl, Shift kanye F Alt+← Option (⌥) kanye ← Alt kanye ← Backspace Inkinobho ye-Delete Backspace Delete fn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili) Delete Enter Return Enter Uphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. \"Bese\" kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo. Izinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho Ctrl+Z isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (Ctrl+Shift+F), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona. Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12: bamba fn (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma vula System Settings, bese Keyboard, bese Keyboard Shortcuts, bese Function Keys, bese uvula \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Ezinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho. Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo Ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T kanye Ctrl+W njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho. Ctrl+Q ku-Mac kanye Alt+F4 ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza. Isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (Control-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini / F11) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-Ctrl+Shift+F, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo. Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad Izinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu: Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula \"Secondary click\" ku-System Settings, bese Trackpad, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba Ctrl ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela. Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo Lapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala \"L\" kubhala u-L. Cindezela Esc noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Thola ithuluzi noma isilungiselelo","summary":"Cindezela Ctrl+K bese uthayipha izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ukuze usebenzise noma yiliphi ithuluzi, ushintshe noma yisiphi isilungiselelo noma uvule isihloko sosizo.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["thola","sesha","ipaleti yomyalo","vula ngokushesha","sebenzisa umyalo","ctrl k","cmd k","ithuluzi","isilungiselelo","inqamulelo"],"headings":[{"id":"thola-bese-usebenzisa","text":"Thola bese usebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-bese-usebenzisa\"\u003EThola bese usebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi. Thola bese usebenzisa Cindezela Ctrl+K, noma khetha Thola ebhareni ephezulu. Bhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu. Cindezela Enter ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. Esc ivala ibhokisi. Ithuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula Izilungiselelo kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo. Okufanele wazi Okusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye. Amathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama. Amathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela amaphaneli bese usebenzisa isikrini sesibili","summary":"Faka amaphaneli ohlangothini lwesobunxele, lwesokudla noma ngaphansi, uwabeke phezu kwawanye, uwahlanganise njengamathebhu, uwabambe noma uwafihle, uwantante phezu komdwebo, wenze isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu, khetha imigqa yethuluzi osebenzisa, noma uwahambise ewindini lawo esikrinini esinye.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["amaphaneli","faka","ntanta","hambisa iphaneli","donsa","isakhiwo","amathebhu","eqenjini lethebhu","beka phezulu","bopha","fihla ngokuzenzakalela","fihla iphaneli","vala iphaneli","okuhlangene","ubukhulu besakhiwo","okuhlangene kakhulu","imigqa yebha yamathuluzi","phindisela","umugqa owodwa","imigqa emi-2","imigqa yethuluzi","isikrini sesibili","izikrini ezimbili","isikrini esingaphezulu","iwindi","i-pop-up","setha kabusha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini","text":"Hambisa iphaneli ewindini","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu","text":"Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu","level":2},{"id":"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele","text":"Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele","level":2},{"id":"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu","text":"Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa","text":"Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa ikhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili","text":"Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili","level":2},{"id":"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli","text":"Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo","text":"Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ingxoxo","text":"Hambisa ingxoxo","level":2},{"id":"buyisela-amaphaneli","text":"Buyisela amaphaneli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini\"\u003EHambisa iphaneli ewindini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu\"\u003EHlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ashintsha amathebhu, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aya kowokuqala nowokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma eqenjini lethebhu\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu yalo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele\"\u003EBopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe \u003Cstrong\u003Elifihla ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha isikhonkwane\u003C/span\u003E, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yokuvala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu\"\u003EYenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezimbili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulula\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa\"\u003EKhetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezintathu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhindisela emugqeni olandelayo\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa owodwa\u003C/span\u003E ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa ikhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENtanta phezu komdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBopha emphethweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E elinye iphaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala imenyu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ungakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibeke esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli\"\u003EAmawindi amaningi amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2\u003C/span\u003E (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula okulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo\"\u003ENgendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwingxenye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ingxoxo\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta ku-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ngewindi layo\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisela-amaphaneli\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lapha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala. Iphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-⋯, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-⋯ kuphela. Hambisa iphaneli ewindini Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu. Lapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta. Amaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele. Iphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo. Donsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-⋯. Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu Amaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, ← no-→ ashintsha amathebhu, futhi Home no-End aya kowokuqala nowokugcina. Ukuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha Phuma eqenjini lethebhu kumenyu yalo ye-⋯, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa. Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele Isikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe lifihla ngokuzenzakalela: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela Esc) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha Khipha isikhonkwane, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele. Inkinobho yokuvala, noma Fihla lo phaneli emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela Enter. Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo unezinketho ezimbili. Okulula yisimo esizenzakalelayo. Okuhlangene unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. Setha kabusha isakhiwo ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile. Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi unezinketho ezintathu. Phindisela emugqeni olandelayo yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. Imigqa emi-2 igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, Umugqa owodwa ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma Tab ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-Imigqa emi-2, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › CadCraft. Sebenzisa ikhibhodi Inkinobho ye-⋯ yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: Faka ngakwesobunxele, Faka ngakwesokudla, Faka ngaphansi, Ntanta phezu komdwebo, Bopha emphethweni, Fihla lo phaneli, Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne elinye iphaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha nakwe-Yibuyisele. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela Enter, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela Enter futhi. Esc ivala imenyu. Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili Khetha ⋯ kwiphaneli, bese Hambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha. Ungakhetha futhi Hambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha ku-Izilungiselelo. Iwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa. Qhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu. Izinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha Yibeke esikrinini sami sesibili kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo. Donsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli Iphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye. Kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi Hambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2 (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi \"panels 2\". Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona. Iwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa. Ngemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha Vula okulandelayo kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye. Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo Iribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-⋯ kwingxenye bese ukhetha Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha; Yibuyisele (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa. Hambisa ingxoxo Yonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi. Ukusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela Alt+Shift+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza Ctrl ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa. Efonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa. Ku-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-Phrinta ku-PDF ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, Vula ngewindi layo. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo. Buyisela amaphaneli Khetha Buyisela amaphaneli kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona. Ukuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha Vula ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma Gcina lapha. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Setha kabusha isakhiwo ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo. Uma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi. Isakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube seribhoni yamathebhu phezu komdwebo, ne-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngakwesobunxele kanye nethebhu ngayinye yokubuka evuliwe, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sasendulo noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","iribhoni","amathebhu eribhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","isiphequluli","amaphalethi","iphaneli le-properties","amathebhu okubuka","ibha yesimo","ukufinyelela ngokushesha","goqa iribhoni","iwindi leribhoni","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo","efakiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo","text":"Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yesihloko:\u003C/strong\u003E igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha\u003C/span\u003E (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni:\u003C/strong\u003E amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yezinketho:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaneli lesobunxele:\u003C/strong\u003E i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuka nebha yesimo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo &quot;Vula ifayela kuqala&quot;, noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina iribhoni ivulekile\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yesihloko: igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, Okwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, Usizo kanye Izilungiselelo. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo. Iribhoni: amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. Ifayela ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala. Ibha yezinketho: ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe. Iphaneli lesobunxele: i-Properties phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile. Ibha yokubuka nebha yesimo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo \"Vula ifayela kuqala\", noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi Uma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, ← no-→ bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-Home no-End bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo Chofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-Hambisa iribhoni ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-Goqa iribhoni ne-Gcina iribhoni ivulekile. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula. Hambisa iribhoni › Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele iribhoni, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube yikholomu yamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele ezindaweni zakho, ibhokisi lolwazi phezu kwesikrini elilandela ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma okukhethiwe kuwe, inavigeyitha ngakwesokudla, ithebhu ngayinye yokubuka, izinketho ezisheshayo nephaleti lokuhlela, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sakudala noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ikholomu yamathuluzi","ibhokisi lolwazi","ibha yolwazi","inavigeyitha","ishadi lephrojekthi","ibha esheshayo","izinketho ezisheshayo","iphaleti lokuhlela","iphaleti lepeti","amathuluzi ami","amathuluzi angikhethile","amathebhu okubuka","iwindi lebhokisi lamathuluzi","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo","text":"Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lolwazi:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi &quot;Akukhethiwe lutho&quot;. Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ami:\u003C/strong\u003E iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInavigeyitha:\u003C/strong\u003E iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha esheshayo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaleti lokuhlela:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo\"\u003ENika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yamathuluzi: ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo. Ibhokisi lolwazi: ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese Ctrl+Z kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi \"Akukhethiwe lutho\". Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe. Ibhokisi lamathuluzi: ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya. Amathuluzi ami: iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha Engeza kumathuluzi ami; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli. Inavigeyitha: iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-Properties nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo. Ibha esheshayo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi. Iphaleti lokuhlela: chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-Properties. Esc, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo Inkinobho ye-Hambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho bese ulondoloza amasethi akho","summary":"Khetha iphaneli elibonisa isiphequluli sephrojekthi, i-Properties noma okuqukethwe yiphaneli ngalinye, lapho ibhokisi lamathuluzi lihlala khona nokuthi amabha aqukethe ini, ulondoloze njengesakhiwo sakho, futhi ugcine wonke amasethi ngegama ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwawo.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","hlela","yenza ngokwakho","isakhiwo sami","isakhiwo sakho","amaphaneli","abahleli","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","properties","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ibha esheshayo","ibhokisi lolwazi","indawo yokusebenza","isethi","iphrofayili","londoloza isethi","shintsha isethi","thumela isethi","ngenisa isethi","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho","text":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza","text":"Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho\"\u003EHlela isakhiwo sakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ukulungiswa kwakho…\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama, bese ukhetha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu komdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgasohlangothini lomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka:\u003C/strong\u003E usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza:\u003C/strong\u003E bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yami\u003C/span\u003E. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintshela kuyo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYabelana:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa isethi…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E kanye no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ngaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Hlela isakhiwo sakho Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,), khetha Jikelele, bese Isakhiwo. Khetha Hlela ukulungiswa kwakho…. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje. Nikeza igama, bese ukhetha: Phezu komdwebo: ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo. Ngasohlangothini lomdwebo: ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-Amathuluzi ami; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma Properties, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo. Indawo yomdwebo: amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo. Ukubukeka: usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu. Khetha Sebenzisa lolu lungiselelo. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa. Kunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-Kusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini; Thumela lolu lungiselelo silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi Hlela amaphaneli. Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza Indawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-Amathuluzi ami. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo. Londoloza: bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha Londoloza isethi yami. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi. Shintsha: khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha Shintshela kuyo. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha. Yabelana: Thumela ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-.ccenv.json; Ngenisa isethi… yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye. Susa: khetha isethi bese ukhetha Susa. Ungagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili. Ukuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi, isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi kanye no-isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","summary":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, okusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokudinga okuxhumeka.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ayikho i-inthanethi","indiza","ukuvakasha endaweni","ikhashe","service worker","faka","landa","ukuxhumeka"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okudinga-ukuxhumeka","text":"Okudinga ukuxhumeka","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda &quot;Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi&quot;. Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EOkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudinga-ukuxhumeka\"\u003EOkudinga ukuxhumeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala. Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Vula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi. Khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni ephezulu. Linda \"Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\". Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala. Yenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo. Usuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi. Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola. Ukulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho. Lolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha. Okudinga ukuxhumeka Ukuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe. Izixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-Vula kuwebhusayithi nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi. Ukulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje. Okufanele wazi Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa. Amawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza. I-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo. I-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Lapho amafayela akho aya khona","summary":"Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho, indlela ukulondoloza ngayo, nokuthi isiphequluli sikhumbula ini.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["ubumfihlo","ukulayisha phezulu","ifu","londoloza","landa","isitoreji","endaweni","ukuphepha","imfihlo"],"headings":[{"id":"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo","text":"Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli","text":"Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ngefu","text":"Ukulondoloza ngefu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EAmafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela alilayishwa phezulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela ukulondoloza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha \u003Cstrong\u003E(ngokulanda)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EIzisebenzi nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo &quot;(edited)&quot; noma &quot;(marked up)&quot;, ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli\"\u003EOkukhunjulwa yisiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ngefu\"\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho Uma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Ifayela alilayishwa phezulu. Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo Ikhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha (ngokulanda): Ukulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona Izisebenzi nekhompyutha). Izinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo \"(edited)\" noma \"(marked up)\", ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga. Uma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"). Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli Ezinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo. Ukulondoloza ngefu Ukulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"zu","chain":["zu","en"]};
